values
  ('833520631264578057', 'Cornered!', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Daniel Maze, Keith Dunkerley', 'Darrin Grimwood', 'Steve Guttenberg, James Duval, Peter Story, Elizabeth Nicole Abrams, Eduardo Antonio Garcia, Ellia English, David Basila, David Jean Thomas', null, 'During their nightly poker game a group of lowlifes are terrorized in their own convenience store by a masked killer.', 'During their nightly poker game a group of lowlifes are terrorized in their own convenience store by a masked killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5abuNGk5ocEZNN8K7SByhZT1Gt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32285'),
  ('845938526327991748', 'Corniche Kennedy', 2017, 'Drama', 'Isabelle Razavet, Dominique Cabrera', 'Dominique Cabrera', 'Lola Créton, Aïssa Maïga, Moussa Maaskri, Kamel Kadri, Alain Demaria, Miguel Furtado, Mélissa Guilbert, Philippe Géoni', null, 'Corniche Kennedy. In the blue of the Mediterranean, at the foot of luxurious villas, the young kids of Marseille defy the laws of gravity. Marco, Mehdi, Franck, Mélissa, Hamza, Mamaa, Julie : girls and boys dive, take flight, take risks to experience life to the fullest. Suzanne devours them with her eyes from inside her chic villa. Their free bodies, their excess. She wants to be part of them. She will be part of them.', 'Corniche Kennedy. In the blue of the Mediterranean, at the foot of luxurious villas, the young kids of Marseille defy the laws of gravity. Marco, Mehdi, Franck, Mélissa, Hamza, Mamaa, Julie : girls and boys dive, take flight, take risks to experience life to the fullest. Suzanne devours them with her eyes from inside her chic villa. Their free bodies, their excess. She wants to be part of them. She will be part of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IKWCSpCor0eCwJUKbkmEr7sjUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425665'),
  ('782180058562360617', 'Corona Depression', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mr Zerpentin, Linda Sandkvist', 'Linda Sandkvist', 'Hedvig Lagerkvist', null, 'A pandemic strikes the world. What does quarantine do to a lonely woman''s mind? Follow her from sense to insanity. No filters. Just you, her, and her more and more twisted mind.', 'A pandemic strikes the world. What does quarantine do to a lonely woman''s mind? Follow her from sense to insanity. No filters. Just you, her, and her more and more twisted mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21lpJsgxypW77rxbKjjUMWKTmjZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:780525'),
  ('494225816885170268', 'Corona Zombies', 2020, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Howard Wexler, Brooks Davis, Charles Band', 'Kent Roudebush, Silvia St. Croix', 'Cody Renee Cameron, Robin Sydney, Russell Coker, Franco Garofalo, Margit Evelyn Newton, Donald Trump, Gabriel Renom', null, 'Ditsy damsels in distress, toilet paper famine, inept world leaders, mass-media gone wild, a virus from Hell and hordes of ghouls hungry for human flesh combine in Full Moon''s maniacal horror comedy hybrid CORONA ZOMBIES!', 'Ditsy damsels in distress, toilet paper famine, inept world leaders, mass-media gone wild, a virus from Hell and hordes of ghouls hungry for human flesh combine in Full Moon''s maniacal horror comedy hybrid CORONA ZOMBIES!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rajHcEsvDafsQiWstbH4BYXfzQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:684420'),
  ('99388825409228390', 'Coronation', 2000, 'Drama', 'Carlos Necochea, Nelson Fuentes, David Bravo', 'Iván Osnovikoff', 'Julio Jung, Boris Quercia, Jaime Vadell, Pablo Krögh, Adela Secall, María Cánepa, Gabriela Medina, Delfina Guzmán', null, 'The elderly heir of a formerly wealthy and respected Chilean family, Andres, suffers from decadence and solitude. He hires young Estela in order to look after his tiranic and almost crazy grandmother. The differences in class and age don''t stop Andres from courting Estela, whose fiancé Mario tries to make some money with the passions of his well-off rival. The suffocating atmosphere of the run-down mansion in the outskirts of Santiago represents the deterioration of the bourgeoisie, and sets the scene for the total collapse of Andres.', 'The elderly heir of a formerly wealthy and respected Chilean family, Andres, suffers from decadence and solitude. He hires young Estela in order to look after his tiranic and almost crazy grandmother. The differences in class and age don''t stop Andres from courting Estela, whose fiancé Mario tries to make some money with the passions of his well-off rival. The suffocating atmosphere of the run-down mansion in the outskirts of Santiago represents the deterioration of the bourgeoisie, and sets the scene for the total collapse of Andres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zoFvSw10Y0DoTfKKpaZgRZN7xog.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238272'),
  ('99915355851505457', 'Coroner Creek', 1948, 'Western', 'Ray Enright, Aaron Rosenberg, Fred Jackman Jr.', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, Marguerite Chapman, George Macready, Sally Eilers, Edgar Buchanan, Barbara Read, Wallace Ford, Forrest Tucker', 'NR', 'A man is bent on taking revenge on those responsible for his fiancée''s death.', 'A man is bent on taking revenge on those responsible for his fiancée''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vNuIDlaJhF6omwLBvOumasRwZp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60565'),
  ('407185959464500713', 'Corpo Celeste', 2011, 'Drama', 'Alice Rohrwacher, Hélène Louvart', 'Alice Rohrwacher', 'Yle Vianello, Pasqualina Scuncia, Salvatore Cantalupo, Anita Caprioli, Renato Carpentieri, Maria Trunfio, Gianni Federico, Maria Luisa De Crescenzo', 'NR', 'After growing up in Switzerland, 13-year-old Marta returns to a city in southern Italy with her mother and older sister. Independent and inquisitive, she joins a catechism class at a local church. However, the games and religious pop songs she encounters there do not nearly satisfy her interest in faith. Struggling to find her place, Marta pushes the boundaries of the class, the priest, and the church.', 'After growing up in Switzerland, 13-year-old Marta returns to a city in southern Italy with her mother and older sister. Independent and inquisitive, she joins a catechism class at a local church. However, the games and religious pop songs she encounters there do not nearly satisfy her interest in faith. Struggling to find her place, Marta pushes the boundaries of the class, the priest, and the church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6I0bvojngNbc7qGlDcTsfrhWBcb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64835'),
  ('445543271352735528', 'Corporate', 2006, 'Crime', 'Madhur Bhandarkar', 'Madhur Bhandarkar, Manoj Tyagi, Ajay Monga', 'Bipasha Basu, Kay Kay Menon, Minissha Lamba, Navni Parihar, Rajat Kapoor, Sandeep Mehta, Raj Babbar, Hamsa Nandini', null, 'Two corporate giants compete in order to recklessly maximize their respective profits.', 'Two corporate giants compete in order to recklessly maximize their respective profits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwGU00goh5oU2olCF6owqi3cXnf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20092'),
  ('855922596925848792', 'Corporate', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicolas Silhol, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Nicolas Silhol, Nicolas Fleureau', 'Céline Sallette, Lambert Wilson, Stéphane De Groodt, Violaine Fumeau, Alice de Lencquesaing, Camille Japy, Yannick Choirat, Hyam Zaytoun', null, 'Emilie is a bright young workaholic manager in Human Resources, working for a huge French agro-food company. But, one day, one of the employees commits suicide at the company in front of her. While an investigation is underway, stuck between her traumatized colleagues and under pressure of a powerful hierarchy, she will have to get by on her own.', 'Emilie is a bright young workaholic manager in Human Resources, working for a huge French agro-food company. But, one day, one of the employees commits suicide at the company in front of her. While an investigation is underway, stuck between her traumatized colleagues and under pressure of a powerful hierarchy, she will have to get by on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xb2xMfTTLZZibl7gqx29QzFxBYp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:431479'),
  ('67503693389785739', 'Corporate Accountability', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jonathan Perel, Jonathan Perel', 'Jonathan Perel', 'Jonathan Perel', null, 'Images of Argentinian companies and factories in the first light of day, seen from the inside of a car, while the director reads out documents in voiceover that reveals the collusion of the same concerns in the military dictatorship’s terror.', 'Images of Argentinian companies and factories in the first light of day, seen from the inside of a car, while the director reads out documents in voiceover that reveals the collusion of the same concerns in the military dictatorship’s terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY9jv16Z4vnSwGussfQbIY83AIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665465'),
  ('1067375409371949742', 'Corporate Animals', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Patrick Brice, Greg Yagolnitzer, Marc Kelly', 'Sam Bain', 'Demi Moore, Jessica Williams, Ed Helms, Karan Soni, Dan Bakkedahl, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Jennifer Kim, Martha Kelly', 'R', 'Disaster strikes when the egotistical CEO of an edible cutlery company leads her long-suffering staff on a corporate team-building trip in New Mexico. Trapped underground, this mismatched and disgruntled group must pull together to survive.', 'Disaster strikes when the egotistical CEO of an edible cutlery company leads her long-suffering staff on a corporate team-building trip in New Mexico. Trapped underground, this mismatched and disgruntled group must pull together to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajnBS9iakB3R5RIWedq6BHvmxFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530076'),
  ('221098179579559579', 'Corporate Fantasy', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harris Done, Frank Pinnock, Mitch Kelleher', 'Garrett Clancy, Catalina Larranaga', 'Tracy Ryan, Jarod Carey, Catalina Larranaga, John Gallucci, Karl Preston, Brian Nowack, Susan Featherly, Anna Davidoff', 'R', 'Daisy is a beautiful no-nonsense employee in an advertising firm. Her female co-workers want to help her find someone, and her male co-workers want to be that someone - but only as a one night stand. She begins to enjoy this attention.', 'Daisy is a beautiful no-nonsense employee in an advertising firm. Her female co-workers want to help her find someone, and her male co-workers want to be that someone - but only as a one night stand. She begins to enjoy this attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1898v4YWuuSzJ8DbbCPLXnQOKkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381369'),
  ('425666455223775999', 'Corpse Bride', 2005, 'Romance, Fantasy, Animation', 'Mike Johnson, Tim Burton, Pete Kozachik', 'Pamela Pettler, John August, Caroline Thompson', 'Johnny Depp, Helena Bonham Carter, Emily Watson, Tracey Ullman, Paul Whitehouse, Joanna Lumley, Albert Finney, Richard E. Grant', 'PG', 'In a 19th-century European village, a young man about to be married is whisked away to the underworld and wed to a mysterious corpse bride, while his real bride waits bereft in the land of the living.', 'In a 19th-century European village, a young man about to be married is whisked away to the underworld and wed to a mysterious corpse bride, while his real bride waits bereft in the land of the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isb2Qow76GpqYmsSyfdMfsYAjts.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3933'),
  ('80832224703860875', 'Corpse Mania', 1981, 'Horror, Crime, Mystery', 'Kuei Chih-Hung, Lee San-Yip', 'Kuei Chih-Hung, Szeto On', 'Wang Yong, Tanny Tien-Ni, Yau Chui-Ling, Walter Tso Tat-Wah, Tai Kwan-Tak, Eric Chan Ga-Kei, Lau Siu-Kwan, Gam Biu', null, 'A necrophiliac killer is murdering the prostitutes at Madame Lan''s brothel.', 'A necrophiliac killer is murdering the prostitutes at Madame Lan''s brothel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7Ih3lxpsyxk9zFq5sbqivX934D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40038'),
  ('905467659861195604', 'Corpse Prison: Part 1', 2017, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Hideo Jojo, Takehiko Tamiya, Ippei Itou', 'Hideo Jojo, Ryō Kaihara', 'Moemi Katayama, Anna Tachibana, Shinichi Wago, Nagomi, Reimi Fujishiro, Ren Fukusaki, Manzo Shinra, Junichiro Asano', null, 'From the moment she and her fellow students arrive in the mountain village of Yasaka, Mikoto knows that there is something very wrong with this tiny town. Can it really be true that, for 50 years, not a single girl has been born in this isolated community? Despite the fact that Mayor Amano and the other all male residents have enthusiastically welcomed her and the other three coeds attending Professor Ashihara’s overnight seminar, Mikoto can’t shake the sense of increasing dread that consumes her. Something horrible has happened here. Something that is about to happen again. Because the town has been waiting for her. And the other girls. From the pages of the hit online manga published in Web Comic Gamma, the nightmare is about to begin!', 'From the moment she and her fellow students arrive in the mountain village of Yasaka, Mikoto knows that there is something very wrong with this tiny town. Can it really be true that, for 50 years, not a single girl has been born in this isolated community? Despite the fact that Mayor Amano and the other all male residents have enthusiastically welcomed her and the other three coeds attending Professor Ashihara’s overnight seminar, Mikoto can’t shake the sense of increasing dread that consumes her. Something horrible has happened here. Something that is about to happen again. Because the town has been waiting for her. And the other girls. From the pages of the hit online manga published in Web Comic Gamma, the nightmare is about to begin!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pe180kjtIStoeUwmTHhTpdxQSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473353'),
  ('913357174247906979', 'Corpse Prison: Part 2', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Hideo Jojo, Takehiko Tamiya', 'Hideo Jojo, Ryō Kaihara', 'Moemi Katayama, Anna Tachibana, Shinichi Wago, Nagomi, Reimi Fujishiro, Ren Fukusaki, Rio Sugisaki, Junichiro Asano', null, 'They thought they were coming to study a mysterious town hidden in the mountains of Japan. Instead, they’ve discovered that their Professor brought them to Yasaka for a much darker purpose. Now Mikoto and the other girls are trapped in a monstrous nightmare. As the villagers become increasingly more insane, the college students find themselves at the center of arcane rituals focused on blood and rotting flesh. Their only chance is to escape, but their captors are far too numerous and know the lay of the local land far too well.', 'They thought they were coming to study a mysterious town hidden in the mountains of Japan. Instead, they’ve discovered that their Professor brought them to Yasaka for a much darker purpose. Now Mikoto and the other girls are trapped in a monstrous nightmare. As the villagers become increasingly more insane, the college students find themselves at the center of arcane rituals focused on blood and rotting flesh. Their only chance is to escape, but their captors are far too numerous and know the lay of the local land far too well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAUjXSpnizDkSg4qa08PWuesrVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481899'),
  ('601857365237991345', 'Corrections Class', 2014, 'Drama', 'Ivan I. Tverdovsky, Natalia Domeretskaya, Stepan Zhivov', 'Ivan I. Tverdovsky, Maria Borodyanskaya, Dmitriy Lanchikhin', 'Mariya Poezzhaeva, Philipp Avdeev, Nikita Kukushkin, Artyom Markaryan, Natalya Pavlenkova, Irina Vilkova, Olga Lapshina, Elena Nesterova', null, 'Lena is a bright, disabled girl who, after years spent studying at home, is keen to get back to school. She is assigned to a special class for disabled pupils who have to present themselves before a school commission at the end of the year in order to prove that they merit being moved back into a "normal" class. Her enervated teachers, however, show absolutely no desire to motivate the students and help them improve; on the contrary, they try to quash right from the start any interest Lena shows in more complex study material. Nevertheless, Lena soon involves herself in the school routine and gets together with classmate Anton. Yet their transparent happiness is not to everyone''s liking and repercussions soon follow.', 'Lena is a bright, disabled girl who, after years spent studying at home, is keen to get back to school. She is assigned to a special class for disabled pupils who have to present themselves before a school commission at the end of the year in order to prove that they merit being moved back into a "normal" class. Her enervated teachers, however, show absolutely no desire to motivate the students and help them improve; on the contrary, they try to quash right from the start any interest Lena shows in more complex study material. Nevertheless, Lena soon involves herself in the school routine and gets together with classmate Anton. Yet their transparent happiness is not to everyone''s liking and repercussions soon follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qI1UG7ukCqPSRi3BVKE71cJ0zby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285021'),
  ('474757633101512140', 'Corrective Measures', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Sean Patrick O''Reilly, Stirling Bancroft', 'Sean Patrick O''Reilly', 'Brennan Mejia, Dan Payne, Michael Rooker, Bruce Willis, Tom Cavanagh, Hayley Sales, Matthew Kevin Anderson, Kat Ruston', 'R', 'Set in San Tiburon, the world''s most dangerous maximum-security penitentiary and home to the world''s most treacherous superpowered criminals, where tensions among the inmates and staff heighten, leading to anarchy that engulfs the prison and order is turned upside down.', 'Set in San Tiburon, the world''s most dangerous maximum-security penitentiary and home to the world''s most treacherous superpowered criminals, where tensions among the inmates and staff heighten, leading to anarchy that engulfs the prison and order is turned upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHFq9NMhavOL0jtQvmHQ1c5e0ya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872177'),
  ('640508323834847648', 'Correspondence', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Tornatore, Fabio Zamarion, Eugenio Colizza', 'Giuseppe Tornatore', 'Jeremy Irons, Olga Kurylenko, Simon Johns, Shauna Macdonald, Simon Meacock, James Warren, Oscar Sanders, Paolo Calabresi', 'NR', 'The relationship between Ed, a married astronomer and Amy, his lover, who spend their years apart, is based only on phone calls and texts. One day Amy begins noticing something strange in Ed''s messages.', 'The relationship between Ed, a married astronomer and Amy, his lover, who spend their years apart, is based only on phone calls and texts. One day Amy begins noticing something strange in Ed''s messages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/juvp46Hjpz0FksOXvV28pYM11BK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315880'),
  ('380233307793787592', 'Corridor', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Standish Lawder', null, null, null, 'An unknown observer is seen traveling through a bleak corridor. At the end of the corridor they see a naked woman, whom they are unable to reach as their trip seems to become increasingly twisted and looped.', 'An unknown observer is seen traveling through a bleak corridor. At the end of the corridor they see a naked woman, whom they are unable to reach as their trip seems to become increasingly twisted and looped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXJb9ws5acwAzAUc1l87o8ZwCMk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150935'),
  ('576717836883863535', 'Corridor of Mirrors', 1948, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery', 'Terence Young, André Thomas', 'Rudolph Cartier, Edana Romney', 'Eric Portman, Edana Romney, Barbara Mullen, Hugh Sinclair, Bruce Belfrage, Joan Maude, Leslie Weston, Alan Wheatley', null, 'A man falls in love with a beautiful young woman and begins to suspect that he may have also loved her in a previous life.', 'A man falls in love with a beautiful young woman and begins to suspect that he may have also loved her in a previous life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ac6LrluHP7792mOGQ897Od4u80Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27112'),
  ('478110548480651218', 'Corridors of Blood', 1963, 'Drama, Horror, Crime', 'Geoffrey Faithfull, Robert Day, Peter Bolton', 'Jean Scott Rogers', 'Boris Karloff, Betta St. John, Christopher Lee, Finlay Currie, Adrienne Corri, Francis de Wolff, Francis Matthews, Frank Pettingell', null, 'In 1840s London, Dr. Thomas Bolton [Boris Karloff] dares to dream the unthinkable: experimenting with anesthesia gases to make surgery pain-free. While doing so, his demonstration before a panel of his peers ends in a horrific mishap with his patient awakening under the knife; he is forced to leave his position in disgrace. To complicate matters, he becomes addicted to his own chemical experiments and gets involved with a criminal gang led by Black Ben [Francis de Wolff], and a ruthless killer Resurrection Joe [Christopher Lee]. Unfortunately, this shady partnership leads Dr. Bolton to further ruin, culminating in his unwitting participation in murder — for which he becomes the first victim of a blackmail scheme.', 'In 1840s London, Dr. Thomas Bolton [Boris Karloff] dares to dream the unthinkable: experimenting with anesthesia gases to make surgery pain-free. While doing so, his demonstration before a panel of his peers ends in a horrific mishap with his patient awakening under the knife; he is forced to leave his position in disgrace. To complicate matters, he becomes addicted to his own chemical experiments and gets involved with a criminal gang led by Black Ben [Francis de Wolff], and a ruthless killer Resurrection Joe [Christopher Lee]. Unfortunately, this shady partnership leads Dr. Bolton to further ruin, culminating in his unwitting participation in murder — for which he becomes the first victim of a blackmail scheme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kB6oIgGZOKblxwRS7105xdqvVtE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30637'),
  ('377422970345711592', 'Corriedale', 2026, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Duncan Foster, Taransay T.J. Chisholm, Andy Hare, Peter Ioannou, Iain MacLeod, Jordan McHale, Jon Melhenney-Hayward', 'Owen Lloyd-Fox, Kevin Laffan, Tony Warren, Owen Lloyd Fox', 'Oliver Farnworth, Victoria Myers, Danny Miller, Sydney Martin, Amy Cudden', null, 'Lives and storylines collide as an explosive car crash brings the people of Emmerdale Village and Coronation Street together for the first time.', 'Lives and storylines collide as an explosive car crash brings the people of Emmerdale Village and Coronation Street together for the first time.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNjkzMGVjOGItYjlkNC00MjE4LTg2MDQtYzVjZGMyOTM0NzczXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:corriedale'),
  ('915725712909157130', 'Corrina, Corrina', 1994, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Bruce Surtees, Jessie Nelson, David Minkowski', 'Jessie Nelson', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Ray Liotta, Tina Majorino, Joan Cusack, Larry Miller, Jenifer Lewis, Wendy Crewson, Erica Yohn', 'PG', 'When Manny Singer''s wife dies, his young daughter Molly becomes mute and withdrawn. To help cope with looking after Molly, he hires sassy housekeeper Corrina Washington, who coaxes Molly out of her shell and shows father and daughter a whole new way of life. Manny and Corrina''s friendship delights Molly and enrages the other townspeople.', 'When Manny Singer''s wife dies, his young daughter Molly becomes mute and withdrawn. To help cope with looking after Molly, he hires sassy housekeeper Corrina Washington, who coaxes Molly out of her shell and shows father and daughter a whole new way of life. Manny and Corrina''s friendship delights Molly and enrages the other townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuEubxRGut2Yh118RyNa6ruXXCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10464'),
  ('606111641028775407', 'Corruption', 1963, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Paolo Bianchini, Gianfranco Zurlini', 'Ugo Liberatore, Fulvio Gicca Palli', 'Alain Cuny, Rosanna Schiaffino, Jacques Perrin, Isa Miranda, Filippo Scelzo, Ennio Balbo, Anna Glori, Wando Tres', null, 'Stefano is a shy and sensitive teenager who has just completed his studies in Switzerland and is considering becoming a monk. But his father, a rich Milanese publisher, who had the ambition to see his son succeed him, refuses and takes him on a cruise with a young woman to take this idea out of his mind...', 'Stefano is a shy and sensitive teenager who has just completed his studies in Switzerland and is considering becoming a monk. But his father, a rich Milanese publisher, who had the ambition to see his son succeed him, refuses and takes him on a cruise with a young woman to take this idea out of his mind...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kAQPBBi2kIarVxPQKsC7ILvQ4Ga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142982'),
  ('502775936398124330', 'Corruption', 1968, 'Horror', 'Robert Hartford-Davis, Ken Softley, Peter Newbrook', 'Derek Ford, Donald Ford', 'Peter Cushing, Sue Lloyd, Noel Trevarthen, Kate O''Mara, David Lodge, Anthony Booth, Wendy Varnals, Billy Murray', 'R', 'A surgeon discovers that he can restore the beauty to his girlfriend''s scarred face by murdering other women and extracting fluids from their pituitary gland. However, the effects only last for a short time, so he has to kill more and more women. It is ultimately a killing spree which ends with considerable death and disaster.', 'A surgeon discovers that he can restore the beauty to his girlfriend''s scarred face by murdering other women and extracting fluids from their pituitary gland. However, the effects only last for a short time, so he has to kill more and more women. It is ultimately a killing spree which ends with considerable death and disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPDKxaK0GEj62RdY4ONCXVjcezV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39861'),
  ('1081478806537565320', 'Corruption', 2007, 'Crime, Drama', 'João Botelho, Orlando Alegria', 'João Botelho, Leonor Pinhão', 'Nicolau Breyner, Margarida Vila-Nova, António Pedro Cerdeira, Alexandra Lencastre, André Gomes, Carlos Costa, Dinarte Branco, Filipe Vargas', null, 'A crime drama based on the life of a woman who lived for years with a man that was the head of a corruption network in the Portuguese football world.', 'A crime drama based on the life of a woman who lived for years with a man that was the head of a corruption network in the Portuguese football world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zMl8ggrvGVGwTusW0Hmu1kSMlGK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60610'),
  ('644986394033737387', 'Corsage', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Marie Kreutzer, Judith Kaufmann', 'Marie Kreutzer', 'Vicky Krieps, Florian Teichtmeister, Katharina Lorenz, Jeanne Werner, Alma Hasun, Finnegan Oldfield, Manuel Rubey, Aaron Friesz', 'NR', 'A fictional account of one year in the life of Empress Elisabeth of Austria. On Christmas Eve 1877, Elisabeth, once idolized for her beauty, turns 40 and is officially deemed an old woman; she starts trying to maintain her public image.', 'A fictional account of one year in the life of Empress Elisabeth of Austria. On Christmas Eve 1877, Elisabeth, once idolized for her beauty, turns 40 and is officially deemed an old woman; she starts trying to maintain her public image.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bhS9oqoJdMSoejB8keZpg9G5uVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888321'),
  ('151143989702808643', 'Corsair', 1931, 'Adventure', 'Roland West, Ray June', 'Josephine Lovett', 'Chester Morris, Thelma Todd, Fred Kohler, Ned Sparks, Emmett Corrigan, William Austin, Frank McHugh, Frank Rice', 'NR', 'A stock market broker plans to liven up his boring life by taking up piracy on the high seas.', 'A stock market broker plans to liven up his boring life by taking up piracy on the high seas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/stfW6K8qhPeoRTaxMVFwzo2jN80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81677'),
  ('50595793133755607', 'Cortázar y Antín: cartas iluminadas', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Pedro Romero, Cinthia Rajschmir, Santiago Roldán', 'Cinthia Rajschmir, Alejandra Marino', 'Manuel Antín, Ponchi Morpurgo, Ricardo Aronovich, Graciela Borges, Dora Baret, María Marta Antin', null, 'In the 60s and thanks to the epistolary exchange, the young filmmaker Manuel Antín and the famous writer Julio Cortázar devised four films. An ocean away, a fruitful collaboration and genuine friendship are born.', 'In the 60s and thanks to the epistolary exchange, the young filmmaker Manuel Antín and the famous writer Julio Cortázar devised four films. An ocean away, a fruitful collaboration and genuine friendship are born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vsTmSFGcps9GE46sF20ixp5yPCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594333'),
  ('90751769826298160', 'Cortex', 2008, 'Thriller', 'Dominique Colin, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'Frédérique Moreau, Nicolas Boukhrief', 'André Dussollier, Marthe Keller, Julien Boisselier, Pascal Elbé, Chantal Neuwirth, Claire Nebout, Laure Salama, Aurore Clément', null, 'Trapped in an old folks home where people keep going missing, an ex-cop must overcome his Alzheimers to find out who is killing people in this jigsaw thriller.', 'Trapped in an old folks home where people keep going missing, an ex-cop must overcome his Alzheimers to find out who is killing people in this jigsaw thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVxAQmQxPq2yvwhcUjMpPYFj5wD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15827'),
  ('342698934826611616', 'Cortex', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Suse Marquardt, Moritz Bleibtreu, Thomas W. Kiennast', 'Moritz Bleibtreu', 'Jannis Niewöhner, Nadja Uhl, Moritz Bleibtreu, Anna Bederke, Murathan Muslu, Marc Hosemann, Nicholas Ofczarek, Emily Kusche', null, 'Two men, two lives, a fateful encounter: Hagen suffers from irregular phases of sleep in which he cannot decide between dream and reality. When his frustrated wife cheats on him with the small-time criminal Niko a series of disturbing events is set in motion and the lives of both men will never be the same.', 'Two men, two lives, a fateful encounter: Hagen suffers from irregular phases of sleep in which he cannot decide between dream and reality. When his frustrated wife cheats on him with the small-time criminal Niko a series of disturbing events is set in motion and the lives of both men will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0931QeHVFYlsIWUPtem9M6qsLH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730741'),
  ('608067497066015565', 'Cortina Express', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Eros Puglielli, Emanuele Pasquet, Mirko Vigliotti', 'Tommaso Renzoni', 'Christian De Sica, Lillo Petrolo, Isabella Ferrari, Paolo Calabresi, Ernesto D''Argenio, Francesco Bruni, Beatrice Modica, Riccardo Maria Manera', null, 'During Christmas holidays in Cortina d''Ampezzo, confirmed bachelor Lucio tries to dissuade his nephew from marrying; fading rock sensation Dino seeks his daughter''s affection; and record producer Patrizia struggles with bankruptcy and a lazy husband.', 'During Christmas holidays in Cortina d''Ampezzo, confirmed bachelor Lucio tries to dissuade his nephew from marrying; fading rock sensation Dino seeks his daughter''s affection; and record producer Patrizia struggles with bankruptcy and a lazy husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hd7KoRwNoL0dFAJtPzxd7ESx1aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1294483'),
  ('808326805174347426', 'Corto Maltese: The Ballad of the Salt Sea', 2003, 'Animation, TV Movie, Adventure', 'Richard Danto, Liam Saury', 'Jean Pécheux', 'Richard Berry, Patrick Bouchitey, Barbara Schulz, Luca Ward, Ennio Coltorti, Stefano Crescentini, Giorgio Locuratolo, Stefano Mondini', null, 'In 1913, laconic sea captain Corto Maltese, adrift in the Pacific, gets rescued by his bandit friend Rasputin who''s taking two rich shipwrecked teens to an island where his boss the Monk will hold them for ransom. WWI complicates things.', 'In 1913, laconic sea captain Corto Maltese, adrift in the Pacific, gets rescued by his bandit friend Rasputin who''s taking two rich shipwrecked teens to an island where his boss the Monk will hold them for ransom. WWI complicates things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7E48gEnfESqpE1B6R2MyZA5gDbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60213'),
