  ('748650694137850773', 'Corto Maltese: The Guilded House of Samarkand', 2003, 'Animation, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Liam Saury, Richard Danto', 'Henry Colomer', 'Richard Berry, Patrick Bouchitey, Catherine Jacob, Luca Ward, Ennio Coltorti, Sonia Scotti, Massimo Lodolo, Luciano Roffi', null, 'Hugo Pratt''s famous comics adventurer, Corto Maltese while sojourning in Adana, Turkey, discovers a map to the treasure of Cyrus, an ancient king of Persia. To assist him in his quest, he enlists his old friend/nemesis the unbelievable Raspoutine whom he first has to help escape from the prison of Samarkand (aka "La maison dorée de Samarkand", the golden house of Samarkand). On the long and tortured way to the riches, he encounters all kind of interesting characters, soldiers of fortune, lost British actors, and even his doppelgänger.', 'Hugo Pratt''s famous comics adventurer, Corto Maltese while sojourning in Adana, Turkey, discovers a map to the treasure of Cyrus, an ancient king of Persia. To assist him in his quest, he enlists his old friend/nemesis the unbelievable Raspoutine whom he first has to help escape from the prison of Samarkand (aka "La maison dorée de Samarkand", the golden house of Samarkand). On the long and tortured way to the riches, he encounters all kind of interesting characters, soldiers of fortune, lost British actors, and even his doppelgänger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGjkwL6GUIR2A55qTX5ConTmZgz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60221'),
  ('818884652291418386', 'Corto Maltese: The Secret Court of the Arcane', 2002, 'Drama, Animation, History, Adventure', 'Pascal Morelli, Richard Danto, Philippe Traversat', 'Thierry Thomas, Natalia Borodin, Pascal Morelli', 'Richard Berry, Patrick Bouchitey, Barbara Schulz, Marie Trintignant, Marc Chapiteau, Maxime Leroux, Hervé Bellon, Emmanuel Curtil', null, 'At the end of 1918 while civil war is raging on in Russia, antagonism is slowly spreading to the East, between the Oral mountains and Shanghai. Stuck between a desire to save what''s left of the great Imperial Russia, and starting from a clean slate, old generals, secret organizations, and mercenaries attracted by gold, struggle to take advantage of the events. As Corto Maltese returns to Shanghai, he barely gets time to cross paths with his old friend/nemesis Rasputin, and escape a murder attempt before being contacted by members of a Chinese secret organization called "The Red Lanterns". In the heart of violent Manchurian horizons, Corto and Rasputin launch themselves into a fabulous treasure hunt, following the tracks of the mysterious armor-plated train of Kolchak. A steel monster spiked with canons and machine guns, this trains protects the counter-revolutionaries gold...', 'At the end of 1918 while civil war is raging on in Russia, antagonism is slowly spreading to the East, between the Oral mountains and Shanghai. Stuck between a desire to save what''s left of the great Imperial Russia, and starting from a clean slate, old generals, secret organizations, and mercenaries attracted by gold, struggle to take advantage of the events. As Corto Maltese returns to Shanghai, he barely gets time to cross paths with his old friend/nemesis Rasputin, and escape a murder attempt before being contacted by members of a Chinese secret organization called "The Red Lanterns". In the heart of violent Manchurian horizons, Corto and Rasputin launch themselves into a fabulous treasure hunt, following the tracks of the mysterious armor-plated train of Kolchak. A steel monster spiked with canons and machine guns, this trains protects the counter-revolutionaries gold...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSY0FtnDCu40xEQuhOwpbdFXM7p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43071'),
  ('124940033227388925', 'Corto Maltese: Under the Sign of Capricorn', 2003, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, TV Movie', 'Richard Danto, Liam Saury', 'Giorgia Cecere, Jean Pécheux, Nadine Lamari', 'Richard Berry, Patrick Bouchitey, Catherine Jacob, Marie Trintignant, Luca Ward, Ennio Coltorti, Mino Caprio, Alessandra Cassioli', null, 'In 1916, laconic adventurer Corto Maltese is in Paramaribo, Surinam visiting his mystic female friend Java. He helps a young heir haunted by voodoo spirits, delivers some weapons to rebels in Brazil and hunts for treasure with Rasputin.', 'In 1916, laconic adventurer Corto Maltese is in Paramaribo, Surinam visiting his mystic female friend Java. He helps a young heir haunted by voodoo spirits, delivers some weapons to rebels in Brazil and hunts for treasure with Rasputin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzbK2Klids263D81SSraJBP3EKM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60290'),
  ('1037545310859524097', 'Corvette K-225', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Richard Rosson, Tony Gaudio', 'Edward Chodorov, John Rhodes Sturdy', 'Randolph Scott, James Brown, Ella Raines, Barry Fitzgerald, Andy Devine, Fuzzy Knight, Noah Beery Jr., Richard Lane', 'NR', 'The story of a Canadian WWII naval vessel, with a dramatic subplot concerning her first captain.', 'The story of a Canadian WWII naval vessel, with a dramatic subplot concerning her first captain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wh1zsNsElJNKkH5h6dQAXLR0NCV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177751'),
  ('752870140280707682', 'Corvette Summer', 1978, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Matthew Robbins, Frank Stanley, Jim Bloom', 'Hal Barwood, Matthew Robbins', 'Mark Hamill, Annie Potts, Eugene Roche, William Bryant, Richard McKenzie, Kim Milford, Philip Bruns, Danny Bonaduce', 'PG', 'Ken loves to design and build exotic cars. When the High School shop class project car, a fully tricked out dream Corvette, is stolen, he begins searching for it. His search leads him to Las Vegas, where Vanessa, a teenaged prostitute wannabe, helps him try to track it down.', 'Ken loves to design and build exotic cars. When the High School shop class project car, a fully tricked out dream Corvette, is stolen, he begins searching for it. His search leads him to Las Vegas, where Vanessa, a teenaged prostitute wannabe, helps him try to track it down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v51WPMJQR5aZidDlLeyUOJDtICv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27201'),
  ('899814701666462238', 'Cosa fai a Capodanno?', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Filippo Bologna, Maurizio Calvesi', 'Filippo Bologna', 'Luca Argentero, Ilenia Pastorelli, Alessandro Haber, Vittoria Puccini, Isabella Ferrari, Ludovico Succio, Valentina Lodovini, Riccardo Scamarcio', null, 'A group of swingers decide to spend New Year''s Eve in a chalet. Their goal is to welcome the new year in a very original way: having an orgy.', 'A group of swingers decide to spend New Year''s Eve in a chalet. Their goal is to welcome the new year in a very original way: having an orgy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO4H8RG7B1UYdtMVpQEsP761mzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554142'),
  ('677217664768584081', 'Cose da pazzi', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Elisabetta Boni, Arnaldo Catinari', 'Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Maurizio Casagrande, Biagio Izzo, Lidia Vitale, Teresa Del Vecchio, Domenico Aria, Carlo Croccolo, Fanny Cadeo', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uriyxstbJUbRx36R5gTU4RzkrSL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66700'),
  ('834110905684272976', 'Cosh Boy', 1953, 'Drama, Crime', 'Lewis Gilbert, Jack Asher', 'Vernon Harris, Lewis Gilbert', 'James Kenney, Joan Collins, Betty Ann Davies, Robert Ayres, Hermione Baddeley, Hermione Gingold, Nancy Roberts, Laurence Naismith', 'NR', 'Roy Walsh is a brash and enterprising thug who bullies his friends into subservience. He and his gang assault and rob people on the street, but things get increasingly dangerous when their behavior escalates to larger crimes.', 'Roy Walsh is a brash and enterprising thug who bullies his friends into subservience. He and his gang assault and rob people on the street, but things get increasingly dangerous when their behavior escalates to larger crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCBNSAayadWn70wqFxY52LGDRnB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38938'),
  ('359932699112452512', 'Cosi', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mark Joffe, Euan Keddie, Tony Gilbert', 'Louis Nowra', 'Ben Mendelsohn, Barry Otto, Toni Collette, Rachel Griffiths, Aden Young, Colin Friels, Jacki Weaver, Pamela Rabe', 'R', 'Lewis, a young amateur theater director, is offered a job with a governmental program for the rehabilitation of mentally ill patients in a Sydney institution. His project is overrun by one of the patients, who wants to stage the opera Cosi Fan Tutte by Mozart, despite the fact that none of the patients can sing or speak Italian. A comedy of errors ensues, but one which unifies the patients and their director in unexpected ways.', 'Lewis, a young amateur theater director, is offered a job with a governmental program for the rehabilitation of mentally ill patients in a Sydney institution. His project is overrun by one of the patients, who wants to stage the opera Cosi Fan Tutte by Mozart, despite the fact that none of the patients can sing or speak Italian. A comedy of errors ensues, but one which unifies the patients and their director in unexpected ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4b3tEgmPSq7mZ7db1r9i5jHEHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90214'),
  ('489197455851652035', 'Così fan tutte', 2013, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Hannes Rossacher, Michael Haneke', 'Lorenzo da Ponte', 'Sylvain Cambreling, Anett Fritsch, Paola Gardina, Juan Francisco Gatell, Andreas Wolf, Kerstin Avemo, William Shimell, Michael Haneke', null, 'Who loves whom in Così fan tutte, Mozart’s and Da Ponte’s cruelly comic reflection on desire, fidelity and betrayal? Or have the confusions to which the main characters subject one another ensured that in spite of the heartfelt love duets and superficially fleetfooted comedy nothing will work any longer and that a sense of emotional erosion has replaced true feelings? Così fan tutte is a timeless work full of questions that affect us all. The Academy Award-winning director Michael Haneke once said that he was merely being precise and did not want to distort reality. In only his second opera production after Don Giovanni in 2006, he presents what ARTE described as a “disillusioned vision of love in an ice-cold, realistic interpretation”.', 'Who loves whom in Così fan tutte, Mozart’s and Da Ponte’s cruelly comic reflection on desire, fidelity and betrayal? Or have the confusions to which the main characters subject one another ensured that in spite of the heartfelt love duets and superficially fleetfooted comedy nothing will work any longer and that a sense of emotional erosion has replaced true feelings? Così fan tutte is a timeless work full of questions that affect us all. The Academy Award-winning director Michael Haneke once said that he was merely being precise and did not want to distort reality. In only his second opera production after Don Giovanni in 2006, he presents what ARTE described as a “disillusioned vision of love in an ice-cold, realistic interpretation”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ippqaLWr6HOEa9bhlgJcTsvzj6R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267544'),
  ('108663991336522041', 'Cosimo and Nicole', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Federico Annicchiarico, Francesco Amato, Dino Giarrusso', 'Giuliano Miniati, Francesco Amato, Daniela Gambaro', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Clara Ponsot, Paolo Sassanelli, Souleymane Sow, Giorgia Salari, Angela Baraldi, Andrea Bruschi, Jo Prestia', null, 'Cosimo is Italian, Nicole French. They meet in Genoa during the G8 protests and immediately fall in love. Swept off their feet by an overwhelming and uncontrollable passion, they decide never to part. After much wandering they decide to return to Genoa, where they start working for a friend of theirs who organises concerts. Things seem to be going well until a tragic accident almost sours their relationship, as a result of which they’re faced with two options that can change their future. Forever.', 'Cosimo is Italian, Nicole French. They meet in Genoa during the G8 protests and immediately fall in love. Swept off their feet by an overwhelming and uncontrollable passion, they decide never to part. After much wandering they decide to return to Genoa, where they start working for a friend of theirs who organises concerts. Things seem to be going well until a tragic accident almost sours their relationship, as a result of which they’re faced with two options that can change their future. Forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd1rsTGmNMtWQNw2440nkox5nVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146364'),
  ('45371042727367561', 'Cosmic Chaos', 2023, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', null, null, 'Curtis Bechdholt, Caroline Dhavernas, Ken Godmere, Jeananne Goossen, Samantha Neale, Agustin Olcese', null, 'Battles in virtual reality, survival in a post-apocalyptic wasteland, a Soviet spaceship giving a distress signal - Fantastic stories created with advanced special effects and passion.', 'Battles in virtual reality, survival in a post-apocalyptic wasteland, a Soviet spaceship giving a distress signal - Fantastic stories created with advanced special effects and passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mClzWv7gBqgXfjZXp49Enyoex1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1165067'),
  ('521145038872372626', 'Cosmic Dawn', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Jefferson Moneo', 'Jefferson Moneo', 'Camille Rowe, Joshua Burge, Antonia Zegers, Philip Granger, Amy Matysio, Emmanuelle Chriqui, Vickie Papavs, John Boylan', 'NR', 'After witnessing the alien abduction of her mother as a child, Aurora joins the UFO cult "The Cosmic Dawn". At the cult''s remote compound Aurora experiences miraculous revelations, and consciousness-expanding flowers but all isn''t as it seems with the cult''s leader, Elyse. Now moved on from the cult, Aurora is forced to confront her past and pursue the ultimate truth about The Cosmic Dawn.', 'After witnessing the alien abduction of her mother as a child, Aurora joins the UFO cult "The Cosmic Dawn". At the cult''s remote compound Aurora experiences miraculous revelations, and consciousness-expanding flowers but all isn''t as it seems with the cult''s leader, Elyse. Now moved on from the cult, Aurora is forced to confront her past and pursue the ultimate truth about The Cosmic Dawn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuSFeIVBBgCpRI7jTvTiDzETw2J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795652'),
  ('346556416390859139', 'Cosmic Journey', 1936, 'Science Fiction', 'Vasily Zhuravlyov, Aleksandr Galperin, Aleksandr Zapadensky', 'Aleksandr Filimonov', 'Sergei Komarov, Kseniya Moskalenko, Vassili Gaponenko, Nikolay Feoktistov, Vasiliy Kovrigin, Sergey Stolyarov', null, 'Soviet cinematographers created a progressively realistic image of a journey to the moon in these early days of special effects. Scientist Pavel Sedikh grows impatient with the restrictions of the conservative Soviet space institute in Moscow. Sedikh builds his own spacecraft, and accompanied by a female astronaut and a boy, he embarks on a the first human trip to the moon.', 'Soviet cinematographers created a progressively realistic image of a journey to the moon in these early days of special effects. Scientist Pavel Sedikh grows impatient with the restrictions of the conservative Soviet space institute in Moscow. Sedikh builds his own spacecraft, and accompanied by a female astronaut and a boy, he embarks on a the first human trip to the moon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lGzQEg4lSim9Xet9Yz6lzUK7Rh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72809'),
  ('877776804978084838', 'Cosmic Princess Kaguya!', 2026, 'Animation, Fantasy, Music, Science Fiction', 'Shingo Yamashita, Keiichiro Miyoshi, Masaya Machida', 'Saeri Natsuo, Shingo Yamashita', 'Yuko Natsuyoshi, Anna Nagase, Saori Hayami, Miyu Irino, Yuma Uchida, Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Yoshino Aoyama, Konomi Kohara', 'PG', 'Iroha''s life gets knocked off its orbit when Kaguya, a carefree runaway from the Moon, moves in and convinces her to perform in a virtual world together.', 'Iroha''s life gets knocked off its orbit when Kaguya, a carefree runaway from the Moon, moves in and convinces her to perform in a virtual world together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9I9cM38gecZcwJ0C6r0cwfvtPJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1575337'),
  ('182058593259950293', 'Cosmic Ray', 1962, 'Music, History', 'Bruce Conner', null, 'Beth Pewther, Joan Brown', null, 'Experimental short uses Ray Charles'' “What''d I Say” as accompaniment to constantly shifting collage of female nude, cartoons, and newsreels of atomic bomb explosions.', 'Experimental short uses Ray Charles'' “What''d I Say” as accompaniment to constantly shifting collage of female nude, cartoons, and newsreels of atomic bomb explosions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voRjQ5ExJh8TZ5vc9HwBL3d98fK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132364'),
  ('111289583057875359', 'Cosmic Scrat-tastrophe', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Mike Thurmeier, Galen T. Chu', 'Yoni Brenner, Mike Reiss, Ian Southwood', 'Chris Wedge, Ray Romano, John Leguizamo, Denis Leary', 'G', 'Scrat struggles once again to protect his nut.', 'Scrat struggles once again to protect his nut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJPeU4DhVMqHnZ9qcAKW2UkdUUP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367326'),
  ('878240721621588903', 'Cosmic Sin', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Edward Drake, Brandon Cox, Thomas Forbes-Johnson', 'Edward Drake, Corey Large', 'Bruce Willis, Adelaide Kane, Frank Grillo, Lochlyn Munro, Costas Mandylor, Johnny Messner, Brandon Thomas Lee, Eva De Dominici', 'R', 'In the year 2524, four centuries after humans started colonizing the outer planets, retired General James Ford gets called back into service when a hostile alien fleet attacks soldiers on a remote planet. The threat against mankind soon escalates into an interstellar war as Ford and a team of elite soldiers try to stop the imminent attack before it''s too late.', 'In the year 2524, four centuries after humans started colonizing the outer planets, retired General James Ford gets called back into service when a hostile alien fleet attacks soldiers on a remote planet. The threat against mankind soon escalates into an interstellar war as Ford and a team of elite soldiers try to stop the imminent attack before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Wm7P6y22UZA40QuPYHyWyJ6leI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681887'),
  ('489231921630615066', 'Cosmic Voyage', 1996, 'Documentary', 'Bayley Silleck', 'Michael Miner, Bayley Silleck', 'Morgan Freeman', null, 'The Academy Award® nominee Cosmic Voyage combines live action with state-of-the-art computer-generated imagery to pinpoint where humans fit in our ever-expanding universe. Highlighting this journey is a "cosmic zoom" based on the powers of 10, extending from the Earth to the largest observable structures in the universe, and then back to the subnuclear realm.', 'The Academy Award® nominee Cosmic Voyage combines live action with state-of-the-art computer-generated imagery to pinpoint where humans fit in our ever-expanding universe. Highlighting this journey is a "cosmic zoom" based on the powers of 10, extending from the Earth to the largest observable structures in the universe, and then back to the subnuclear realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u93WIPfmAaDRn1TyEBdwE6N7dOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13799'),
  ('291147048363809345', 'Cosmic Zoom', 1968, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Tony Ianzelo, Robert Verrall', null, null, null, 'This short animation transports us from the farthest conceivable point of the universe to the tiniest particle of existence, an atom of a living human cell. The art of animation and animation camera achieve this exhilarating journey with a freshness and clarity. Without words.', 'This short animation transports us from the farthest conceivable point of the universe to the tiniest particle of existence, an atom of a living human cell. The art of animation and animation camera achieve this exhilarating journey with a freshness and clarity. Without words.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6BkY3KgUd4LU7ay19fWo944XcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163355'),
  ('303657136531660700', 'Cosmoball', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Dzhanik Fayziev, Maxim Osadchy-Korytkovsky, Yevgeniya Ratner', 'Dzhanik Fayziev, Twister Murchison, Andrey Rubanov', 'Evgeny Romantsov, Victoria Agalakova, Evgeny Mironov, Ivan Ivanovich, Elizaveta Taychenacheva, Mariya Lisovaya, Elena Yakovleva, Mikhail Efremov', 'PG', 'Cosmoball is a mesmerizing intergalactic game of future played between humans and aliens at the giant extraterrestrial ship hovering in the sky over Earth. A young man with enormous power of an unknown nature joins the team of hot-headed superheroes in exchange for a cure for his mother’s deadly illness. The Four from Earth will fight not only to defend the honor of their home planet in the spectacular game, but to face the unprecedented threat to the Galaxy and embrace their own destiny.', 'Cosmoball is a mesmerizing intergalactic game of future played between humans and aliens at the giant extraterrestrial ship hovering in the sky over Earth. A young man with enormous power of an unknown nature joins the team of hot-headed superheroes in exchange for a cure for his mother’s deadly illness. The Four from Earth will fight not only to defend the honor of their home planet in the spectacular game, but to face the unprecedented threat to the Galaxy and embrace their own destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDJYDXRoWoUzxjd52gtz5ODTSU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517096'),
  ('1042256915861769998', 'Cosmonaut', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Susanna Nicchiarelli, Gherardo Gossi', 'Teresa Ciabatti, Susanna Nicchiarelli', 'Miriana Raschillà, Claudia Pandolfi, Sergio Rubini, Pietro Del Giudice, Susanna Nicchiarelli, Angelo Orlando, Michelangelo Ciminale, Valentino Campitelli', null, 'Against the backdrop of the space race between the Soviets and the US, a 15-year-old girl struggles to affirm her political and gender identity in 1960s Italy.', 'Against the backdrop of the space race between the Soviets and the US, a 15-year-old girl struggles to affirm her political and gender identity in 1960s Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFdLRm7Q05vMGme82oj59cJXlA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58450'),
  ('691635986286221827', 'Cosmopolis', 2012, 'Drama', 'Jack Boem, Walter Gasparovic, Zameret Kleiman', 'David Cronenberg', 'Robert Pattinson, Juliette Binoche, Sarah Gadon, Mathieu Amalric, Jay Baruchel, Kevin Durand, K''Naan, Emily Hampshire', 'R', 'Riding across Manhattan in a stretch limo during a riot in order to get a haircut, a 28-year-old billionaire asset manager''s life begins to crumble.', 'Riding across Manhattan in a stretch limo during a riot in order to get a haircut, a 28-year-old billionaire asset manager''s life begins to crumble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXoaAmh0kkcAqW0ikafWEvqVezJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49014'),
  ('690122168948284549', 'Cosmos', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marie-Julie Dallaire, Arto Paragamian, Jennifer Alleyn', 'Sébastien Joannette, Marie-Julie Dallaire, Denis Villeneuve', 'Igor Ovadis, Sébastien Joannette, Eve Gadouas, André Forcier, Patricia Groleau, Élise Guilbault, Pascal Contamine, Marie-Hélène Montpetit', null, 'Through an immigrant cab driver, our world collides with a nervous filmmaker, a lawyer whose new breasts her ex-boyfriend wants to see, a mystery man, a gay man who might or might not have AIDS, and a birthday girl who got stood up. It is a mixture of laughter and sadness, all floating on a sea of philosophy.', 'Through an immigrant cab driver, our world collides with a nervous filmmaker, a lawyer whose new breasts her ex-boyfriend wants to see, a mystery man, a gay man who might or might not have AIDS, and a birthday girl who got stood up. It is a mixture of laughter and sadness, all floating on a sea of philosophy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9gyKtYfVY0DqQsZ3bzDQ5LScnt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124818'),
  ('476034632413472819', 'Cosmos', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Stéphane Bidault, Andrzej Żuławski, Carlo da Fonseca Parsotam', 'Andrzej Żuławski', 'Jonathan Genet, Johan Libéreau, Sabine Azéma, Jean-François Balmer, Victoria Guerra, Andy Gillet, Clémentine Pons, Ricardo Pereira', null, 'Two young men seek the solitude of the country; their peace is disturbed when a set of random occurrences suggest to their susceptible minds a pattern with sinister meanings.', 'Two young men seek the solitude of the country; their peace is disturbed when a set of random occurrences suggest to their susceptible minds a pattern with sinister meanings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wquuj8Xlum4rUXCahVWbYSHpdzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:315868'),
  ('792443913437989922', 'Cosmos', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Zander Weaver, Elliot Weaver', 'Elliot Weaver, Zander Weaver', 'Arjun Singh Panam, Joshua Ford, Tom England', null, 'Three astronomers accidentally intercept what they believe to be a signal from a distant alien civilization, but the truth is even more incredible than any of them could have imagined.', 'Three astronomers accidentally intercept what they believe to be a signal from a distant alien civilization, but the truth is even more incredible than any of them could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDAr2tO1hfZKeDBunuK6hnBFSPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639771'),
  ('1027575597360258823', 'Cosmos Laundromat', 2015, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Andreas Goralczyk, Manu Järvinen, Pablo Vazquez', 'Esther Wouda', 'Pierre Bokma, Reinout Scholten van Aschat', null, 'On a desolate island, a suicidal sheep named Franck meets his fate…in the form of a quirky salesman named Victor, who offers him the gift of a lifetime. The gift is many lifetimes, actually, in many different worlds – each lasting just a few minutes. In the sequel to the pilot, Franck will find a new reason to live…in the form of a bewitching female adventurer named Tara, who awakens his long-lost lust for life. But can Franck keep up with her?', 'On a desolate island, a suicidal sheep named Franck meets his fate…in the form of a quirky salesman named Victor, who offers him the gift of a lifetime. The gift is many lifetimes, actually, in many different worlds – each lasting just a few minutes. In the sequel to the pilot, Franck will find a new reason to live…in the form of a bewitching female adventurer named Tara, who awakens his long-lost lust for life. But can Franck keep up with her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZXi0oitpEgAdoJglFTc5SZF9nt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:358332'),
  ('947667427378350907', 'Cossacks of the Kuban', 1950, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Valentin Pavlov, Ivan Pyryev, Vyacheslav Leshchyov', 'Nikolay Pogodin', 'Marina Ladynina, Sergei Lukyanov, Vladimir Volodin, Aleksandr Khvylia, Sergei Blinnikov, Klara Luchko, Ekaterina Savinova, Vladlen Davydov', null, 'In the steppes of the Kuban love is born on two collective farms while wheat is (enthusiastically) gathered. Galina, the energetic chairwoman of one of the two kolkhozes, vies with her male counterpart for the best harvest. At the same time Gordey, her rival, a former soldier, is (and has been for ages) in love with her. On her part, Dasha a collective farm worker, has heartbeat for a young technician of the competing kolkhoz...', 'In the steppes of the Kuban love is born on two collective farms while wheat is (enthusiastically) gathered. Galina, the energetic chairwoman of one of the two kolkhozes, vies with her male counterpart for the best harvest. At the same time Gordey, her rival, a former soldier, is (and has been for ages) in love with her. On her part, Dasha a collective farm worker, has heartbeat for a young technician of the competing kolkhoz...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeUKkTx3CdGJRtYEnTaAogfTtKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63306'),
  ('851290031555176712', 'Costa Brava, Lebanon', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mounia Akl, Joe Saade', 'Mounia Akl, Clara Roquet', 'Nadine Labaki, Saleh Bakri, Nadia Charbel, Ceana Restom, Geana Restom, Liliane Chacar Khoury, Yumna Marwan, François Nour', null, 'Members of a family quit the polluted, rubbish-strewn city of Beirut for an idyllic mountain home. However, their dreams of a utopian existence are shattered by the construction of a landfill on the boundary of their land.', 'Members of a family quit the polluted, rubbish-strewn city of Beirut for an idyllic mountain home. However, their dreams of a utopian existence are shattered by the construction of a landfill on the boundary of their land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hr5QMxRIR7BK6k1OeAucXEfjCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796164'),
  ('672146006257019887', 'Costa Concordia: Chronicle of a Disaster', 2022, 'Documentary, History', 'Alex J. Moll, Michael Mueller-Erdorf', 'Mariangela Barbanente, Michael Mueller-Erdorf', 'Antonio Di Mauro, Michele Oliveri, Prashant Chauhan, Anna Caterina Fadda, Maximilian Allgeier, Beniamino Brogi, Max Tuveri, Alessandro Grossi', null, 'A reconstruction of the shipwreck of Costa Concordia, occurred on the night of 13 January 2012 in front of the Island of Giglio. A tragic night, full of emotions, that changed the life of those who were on board and the history of tourist navigation.', 'A reconstruction of the shipwreck of Costa Concordia, occurred on the night of 13 January 2012 in front of the Island of Giglio. A tragic night, full of emotions, that changed the life of those who were on board and the history of tourist navigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/38q6T2TlB4B0HPFjjWhAc79DjDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926929'),
  ('841148664171023408', 'Costa!', 2001, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Johan Nijenhuis, Maarten van Keller, Sylvia Bouts', 'Wijo Koek', 'Georgina Verbaan, Katja Schuurman, Anniek Pheifer, Nadja Hüpscher, Daan Schuurmans, Kürt Rogiers, John Wijdenbosch, Michiel Huisman', null, 'The story about a wild week at the Spanish coast. Romance at the beach, competition on the dance floor. Salty water, sweet kisses...', 'The story about a wild week at the Spanish coast. Romance at the beach, competition on the dance floor. Salty water, sweet kisses...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQJASZFsnzYqMTHmiX4jnQNNWQz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73678'),
  ('903726499635323241', 'Cosy Dens', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jan Hřebejk, Jan Malíř, Ladislav Ondráček', 'Petr Jarchovský', 'Miroslav Donutil, Jiří Kodet, Simona Stašová, Emília Vášáryová, Bolek Polívka, Jaroslav Dušek, Eva Holubová, Stella Zázvorková', null, 'Two families, Sebkovi and Krausovi, are celebrating Christmas, but not everyone is in a good mood. The teenage kids think that their fathers are totally stupid, and the fathers are sure that their children are nothing more than rebels, hating anything they say.', 'Two families, Sebkovi and Krausovi, are celebrating Christmas, but not everyone is in a good mood. The teenage kids think that their fathers are totally stupid, and the fathers are sure that their children are nothing more than rebels, hating anything they say.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcmeM8epUgYWlxSxkzQEzp7PJ4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15387'),
  ('736253794674018608', 'Cotillion', 1969, null, 'Joseph Cornell', null, null, null, '"I have not changed the editing structure. I have made the films printable. They are the first known fully collaged films, i.e., films made from found footage, and were done sometime in the ‘40s. Cornell combines Vaudeville jugglers, animal acts, circus performers, children eating and dancing, science demonstrations, mythical excerpts, and crucial freeze-frames of faces into a timeless structure, totally unconcerned with our usual expectations of “montage” or cinematic progression. He collects images and preserves them in some kind of cinematic suspension that is hard – impossible – to describe. But it’s a delight to anyone whose soul has not been squashed by the heavy dictates of Art." —Larry Jordan', '"I have not changed the editing structure. I have made the films printable. They are the first known fully collaged films, i.e., films made from found footage, and were done sometime in the ‘40s. Cornell combines Vaudeville jugglers, animal acts, circus performers, children eating and dancing, science demonstrations, mythical excerpts, and crucial freeze-frames of faces into a timeless structure, totally unconcerned with our usual expectations of “montage” or cinematic progression. He collects images and preserves them in some kind of cinematic suspension that is hard – impossible – to describe. But it’s a delight to anyone whose soul has not been squashed by the heavy dictates of Art." —Larry Jordan', null, 'tmdb:movie:212097'),
  ('304737971183284859', 'Cottage Country', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Romance, Thriller, Horror', 'Peter Wellington, Luc Montpellier', 'Jeremy Boxen', 'Malin Åkerman, Tyler Labine, Dan Petronijevic, Lucy Punch, Benjamin Ayres, Kenneth Welsh, Nancy Beatty, Sabrina Grdevich', null, 'When Todd takes his girlfriend Cammie up to the family cottage for a reclusive proposal, the last thing he expected to be doing was dealing with was his slacker brother and his hippie girlfriend. But in this comedy of errors, Todd and Cammie, have to deal with his accidentally murdered brother in order to live happily ever after.', 'When Todd takes his girlfriend Cammie up to the family cottage for a reclusive proposal, the last thing he expected to be doing was dealing with was his slacker brother and his hippie girlfriend. But in this comedy of errors, Todd and Cammie, have to deal with his accidentally murdered brother in order to live happily ever after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbUTgFg6zJ1j47irmiivsDEI2rU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141733'),
  ('314748337213643764', 'Cottage to Let', 1941, 'Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 'Anthony Asquith, Jack E. Cox', 'Anatole de Grunwald, J.O.C. Orton', 'Leslie Banks, Jeanne De Casalis, Carla Lehmann, Alastair Sim, John Mills, George Cole, Michael Wilding, Frank Cellier', 'NR', 'Allied spies and Nazi Agents insinuate themselves at a Scottish cottage (converted to a wartime hospital) with interests on an inventor''s nearly perfected bomb sight.', 'Allied spies and Nazi Agents insinuate themselves at a Scottish cottage (converted to a wartime hospital) with interests on an inventor''s nearly perfected bomb sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gxa9sxQAoTv5yOoHENZRa3mJpw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71984'),
  ('65891023907477395', 'Cotto & Frullato Z: The Crystal Gear', 2017, 'Comedy, Action', 'Paolo Cellammare, Paolo Cellammare, Luca Occhi', 'Paolo Cellammare', 'Maurizio Merluzzo, Matteo Arienti, Tommaso Caporali, Gianandrea Muià, Patrizio Ranzani, Paolo Cellammare, Alberto Pagnotta, Alessandro Rossi', null, 'Maurizio Merluzzo is a web chef who believes that there is no better way to enjoy food than blending it. During the last episodes of his web series, a psychopathic hater named Nino 666 kidnaps him. Trapped in an artificial world, our hero will try to free himself and get revenge with the help of bizarre characters.', 'Maurizio Merluzzo is a web chef who believes that there is no better way to enjoy food than blending it. During the last episodes of his web series, a psychopathic hater named Nino 666 kidnaps him. Trapped in an artificial world, our hero will try to free himself and get revenge with the help of bizarre characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVpV3AJNbkN7LXa5oHpmgSRSMXh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516781'),
  ('761886261641671849', 'Cotton Comes to Harlem', 1970, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Ossie Davis, Gerald Hirschfeld', 'Arnold Perl, Ossie Davis', 'Godfrey Cambridge, Raymond St. Jacques, Calvin Lockhart, Judy Pace, Redd Foxx, Emily Yancy, John Anderson, Lou Jacobi', 'R', 'Harlem''s African-American population is being ripped off by the Rev. Deke O''Malley, who dishonestly claims that small donations will secure parcels of land in Africa. When New York City police officers Gravedigger Jones and Coffin Ed Johnson look into O''Malley''s scam, they learn that the cash is being smuggled inside a bale of cotton. However, the police, O''Malley, and lots of others find themselves scrambling when the money goes missing.', 'Harlem''s African-American population is being ripped off by the Rev. Deke O''Malley, who dishonestly claims that small donations will secure parcels of land in Africa. When New York City police officers Gravedigger Jones and Coffin Ed Johnson look into O''Malley''s scam, they learn that the cash is being smuggled inside a bale of cotton. However, the police, O''Malley, and lots of others find themselves scrambling when the money goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW30OfbGhe2uFBw4cr6tKsZwCcl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59917'),
  ('457418339849761198', 'Couch', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Paul Thomas Anderson', 'Adam Sandler', 'NR', 'A short black-and-white comedy starring Adam Sandler, in which a man shops for a new couch at a Levitz furniture store. Filmed on 35mm in Chatsworth, California, it was released online in 2003.', 'A short black-and-white comedy starring Adam Sandler, in which a man shops for a new couch at a Levitz furniture store. Filmed on 35mm in Chatsworth, California, it was released online in 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNJ91ZPm51oIc4kH9rtA8rxEyw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68568'),
  ('777429500911131562', 'Couch Potatoes', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Kika Ungaro, Francesca Archibugi', 'Francesca Archibugi, Francesco Piccolo', 'Claudio Bisio, Gaddo Bacchini, Cochi Ponzoni, Antonia Truppo, Gigio Alberti, Barbara Ronchi, Carla Chiarelli, Federica Fracassi', null, 'Giorgio and Tito, father and son. A successful journalist and a lazy teenager apparently impossible to understand. Giorgio''s dream is to take Tito to the Nasca Hill in Liguria, but Tito prefers to spend his entire day with his group of friends, eating, talking about nothing and playing video games. Until one day when he suddenly informs his father that he would join him in this trip. After a series of accidents and misunderstandings, at the end, somehow father and son will find the way to communicate … or at least they will try.', 'Giorgio and Tito, father and son. A successful journalist and a lazy teenager apparently impossible to understand. Giorgio''s dream is to take Tito to the Nasca Hill in Liguria, but Tito prefers to spend his entire day with his group of friends, eating, talking about nothing and playing video games. Until one day when he suddenly informs his father that he would join him in this trip. After a series of accidents and misunderstandings, at the end, somehow father and son will find the way to communicate … or at least they will try.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TBIlSpDJ0PXgTGuWOMCZYabJQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483528'),
  ('172235188464264807', 'Cougar Club', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Christopher Duddy, Dennis J. Laine', 'Cris Mancuso', 'Jason Jurman, Warren Kole, Joe Mantegna, Izabella Scorupco, Kaley Cuoco, Joan Marie Laurer, Jon Polito, Loretta Devine', 'R', 'When Spence and Hogan graduate from college, life is bleak. They have to work for heinous divorce lawyers that torture them with gruesome jobs. Spence has a girlfriend from hell, and Hogan just wants to start his life. As luck would have it, these two young men are presented with an opportunity, and develop a club of young men devoted to older women, whom they call “Cougars.”', 'When Spence and Hogan graduate from college, life is bleak. They have to work for heinous divorce lawyers that torture them with gruesome jobs. Spence has a girlfriend from hell, and Hogan just wants to start his life. As luck would have it, these two young men are presented with an opportunity, and develop a club of young men devoted to older women, whom they call “Cougars.”', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVgEeVZTbGz2RouAQUYU1URDz4F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14666'),
  ('42871805462311779', 'Cougars, Inc.', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'K. Asher Levin', 'K. Asher Levin', 'Denise Richards, Sarah Hyland, Jim Belushi, Kyle Gallner, Kathryn Morris, Rebecca Mader, Maeve Quinlan, Rebekah Chaney', 'R', 'When Sam learns his mother cannot afford to send him to another school after he is kicked out, he and his friends start their own escort service for mature women to pay for his tuition.', 'When Sam learns his mother cannot afford to send him to another school after he is kicked out, he and his friends start their own escort service for mature women to pay for his tuition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDK4wYJyM3CGQdXbKcnXSb2wbWl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60302'),
  ('219541402882174705', 'Could One Imagine?', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ilya Frez, Gasan Tutunov, Mikhail Pyaderkin', 'Ilya Frez, Galina Shcherbakova', 'Tatyana Aksyuta, Nikita Mikhajlovsky, Yelena Solovey, Irina Miroshnichenko, Lidiya Fedoseyeva-Shukshina, Albert Filozov, Tatyana Pelttser, Rufina Nifontova', null, 'Two high school kids meet in class and fall madly in love with each other. Unfortunately, His father and her mother had a history of their own between them which creates uneasiness in both of them. Also because of that, the boy''s mother is very jealous and tries to separate them. The only person that tries to help them is their teacher who has relationship problems of her own.', 'Two high school kids meet in class and fall madly in love with each other. Unfortunately, His father and her mother had a history of their own between them which creates uneasiness in both of them. Also because of that, the boy''s mother is very jealous and tries to separate them. The only person that tries to help them is their teacher who has relationship problems of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oy1hrn0Ck5jaKD5wpBXIo0UZAjx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64765'),
  ('930841382976303355', 'Could This Be Love?', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Pascal Ridao, Pierre Jolivet', 'Pierre Jolivet, Simon Michaël', 'Sandrine Bonnaire, Vincent Lindon, François Berléand, Liane Foly, Kad Merad, Guilaine Londez, Albert Dray, Pierre Diot', null, 'Lucas, a wealthy, 43 year-old divorced businessman, is irresistibly attracted to Elsa, a 38 year old renowned sculptor from whom he has commissioned a piece to decorate the reception at his office.', 'Lucas, a wealthy, 43 year-old divorced businessman, is irresistibly attracted to Elsa, a 38 year old renowned sculptor from whom he has commissioned a piece to decorate the reception at his office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYyuV50tnSvXNkEAaSvyezI84lx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2065'),
  ('642405110924757540', 'Could We Maybe', 1976, 'Romance, Drama', 'Lasse Nielsen, Morten Arnfred', 'Lasse Nielsen, Carsten Nielsen', 'Karl Wagner, Marianne Groth Svendsen, Ole Ernst, Ole Meyer, Marie-Louise Coninck, Kirsten Søberg, Ib Tardini, Beth Lendorf', null, 'Kim, an ordinary 15-year-old given mostly to himself, is living with an unmarried mother in a small apartment. One day, he falls hostage in a bank robbery along with an unfamiliar girl falls, but after making ​​friends with the leader of the robbers, Kim and his new friend run away from them. Settling for a while in an empty house, teenagers fall in love.', 'Kim, an ordinary 15-year-old given mostly to himself, is living with an unmarried mother in a small apartment. One day, he falls hostage in a bank robbery along with an unfamiliar girl falls, but after making ​​friends with the leader of the robbers, Kim and his new friend run away from them. Settling for a while in an empty house, teenagers fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x41fBKPqMyNhprTQAUU6yTRSUXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33425'),
  ('371698275229346007', 'Couleur locale', 2014, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Samuel Tasinaje, Coline Serreau', null, 'Isabelle Nanty, Christian Bouillette, Philippe Uchan, Marie Piton, Juliette Meyniac, Valentin Bellegarde-Chappe, Diego Bordonaro, Alexandre Medvedev', null, 'Marianne Riblon runs a small construction business in the south of France. Widowed and estranged from a daughter she hasn''t seen in 15 years, she spends her time and working and has a life devoid of affection. An active member of the town council, she has strong conservative and racist convictions. One day, her daughter Charlotte calls her to tell her she''s a grandmother. Her grandson, Nicolas, is 12 and is on his way to come see her. Charlotte wants her to take care of the child while she''s being treated for leukemia. A the station, Marianne discovers the boy is half-black. The two learn to know each other...', 'Marianne Riblon runs a small construction business in the south of France. Widowed and estranged from a daughter she hasn''t seen in 15 years, she spends her time and working and has a life devoid of affection. An active member of the town council, she has strong conservative and racist convictions. One day, her daughter Charlotte calls her to tell her she''s a grandmother. Her grandson, Nicolas, is 12 and is on his way to come see her. Charlotte wants her to take care of the child while she''s being treated for leukemia. A the station, Marianne discovers the boy is half-black. The two learn to know each other...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpOtwQ0B2MwVhmxn7zPyTjN51HR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:294663'),
  ('751633540423242192', 'Counsellor at Law', 1933, 'Drama', 'William Wyler, Norbert Brodine', 'Elmer Rice', 'John Barrymore, Bebe Daniels, Doris Kenyon, Isabel Jewell, Melvyn Douglas, Onslow Stevens, Thelma Todd, Clara Langsner', 'NR', 'A successful lawyer struggles to deal with his wife''s unfaithfulness and his own hidden past.', 'A successful lawyer struggles to deal with his wife''s unfaithfulness and his own hidden past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6mQ9jFo5qpNGptSe5AJMYAcrnSs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53792'),
  ('72755503748640967', 'Counselor at Crime', 1973, 'Crime', 'Alberto De Martino, Rafael Pacheco', 'Vincenzo Mannino, Alberto De Martino, Leonardo Martín', 'Martin Balsam, Tomas Milian, Francisco Rabal, Dagmar Lassander, Nello Pazzafini, Perla Cristal, Carlo Tamberlani, Manuel Zarzo', null, 'When the godson of San Francisco''s crime lord asks permission to leave "the business," Don Antonio agrees, but reluctantly. Such behavior by either one is a violation of the code, and a bloody mob war breaks out. It is only through the strong support of his family connections in Sicily that Don Antonio is able to survive the mêlée and come out on top. Aghast at the situation he has caused, the godson becomes his leader''s "consigliere," or Counselor at Crime.', 'When the godson of San Francisco''s crime lord asks permission to leave "the business," Don Antonio agrees, but reluctantly. Such behavior by either one is a violation of the code, and a bloody mob war breaks out. It is only through the strong support of his family connections in Sicily that Don Antonio is able to survive the mêlée and come out on top. Aghast at the situation he has caused, the godson becomes his leader''s "consigliere," or Counselor at Crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEzL1sklvVaT10PRyAQUfeYDbff.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136576'),
  ('255648549443455166', 'Count Dracula', 1970, 'Horror', 'Jesús Franco, Manuel Merino, John Thompson', 'Augusto Finocchi, Jesús Franco', 'Christopher Lee, Klaus Kinski, Herbert Lom, Maria Rohm, Soledad Miranda, Fred Williams, Paul Müller, Jack Taylor', 'PG', 'A faithful adaptation of the classic tale portrays Dracula as an old man who grows younger whenever he dines on the blood of young maidens.', 'A faithful adaptation of the classic tale portrays Dracula as an old man who grows younger whenever he dines on the blood of young maidens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/229GzEUdXiPuggLjE03RcMAlJCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5620'),
