  ('559398288539984418', 'Counterpoint', 1967, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Ralph Nelson, Russell Metty', 'Joel Oliansky, James Lee', 'Charlton Heston, Maximilian Schell, Kathryn Hays, Leslie Nielsen, Anton Diffring, Linden Chiles, Peter Masterson, Curt Lowens', null, 'In December of 1944, Lionel Evans, an internationally renowned American conductor, is on a USO tour with his 70-piece symphony orchestra in newly-liberated Belgium. While fleeing from a German counterattack, Evans and his orchestra members are captured by a Panzer division and taken to an old chateau in Luxembourg. Despite orders to execute every prisoner, General Schiller, an avid music lover, commands Evans to give a private concert for him.', 'In December of 1944, Lionel Evans, an internationally renowned American conductor, is on a USO tour with his 70-piece symphony orchestra in newly-liberated Belgium. While fleeing from a German counterattack, Evans and his orchestra members are captured by a Panzer division and taken to an old chateau in Luxembourg. Despite orders to execute every prisoner, General Schiller, an avid music lover, commands Evans to give a private concert for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vIcnDcyVDNQP6lOfQcfdW7gvoFF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169962'),
  ('671133459214512987', 'Countess Dracula', 1971, 'Drama, Horror', 'Peter Sasdy, Kenneth Talbot, Ariel Levy', 'Jeremy Paul', 'Ingrid Pitt, Nigel Green, Sandor Elès, Maurice Denham, Lesley-Anne Down, Patience Collier, Peter Jeffrey, Leon Lissek', 'PG', 'Hungary, XVII century. After being widowed, the old countess Elizabeth Nádasdy, of the Báthory lineage, fortunately discovers a way to become young again; but the price to be paid by those around her will be high and bloody.', 'Hungary, XVII century. After being widowed, the old countess Elizabeth Nádasdy, of the Báthory lineage, fortunately discovers a way to become young again; but the price to be paid by those around her will be high and bloody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybYHPH9SywTbFaggQJDhju9KV2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39043'),
