  ('223827650865471357', 'Country Cabaret', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Virginie Saint-Martin, Jean-Pierre Améris, Emmanuel Thomas', 'Jean-Pierre Améris, Jean-Luc Gaget, Marion Michau', 'Alban Ivanov, Sabrina Ouazani, Michèle Bernier, Guy Marchand, Moussa Maaskri, Bérengère Krief, Elsa Godard, Marie Blanche Costa', null, 'David, a young farmer from Cantal, has just had an idea: to save his farm from bankruptcy, he is going to set up a cabaret on the farm. The show will be on stage and on the plate, with good local products. He is sure, it can only work. His relatives, his mother and especially his grandfather, are more skeptical.', 'David, a young farmer from Cantal, has just had an idea: to save his farm from bankruptcy, he is going to set up a cabaret on the farm. The show will be on stage and on the plate, with good local products. He is sure, it can only work. His relatives, his mother and especially his grandfather, are more skeptical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n59B3omT4VnKGeOkBLAGe7wfGXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:892508'),
  ('797830023059816962', 'Country Cuzzins', 1972, 'Comedy', 'Roger Dobek, Bethel Buckalew', 'Bethel Buckalew', 'Rene Bond, John Tull, Pamella Princess, Jack Richesin, George Buck Flower, Debbie Osborne, Zena Foster, Bruce Kimball', null, 'A young woman living in L.A. goes back to her family''s homestead way up in the mountains for a family reunion. At first put off by her relatives'' hillbilly ways, she soon decides to let her hair down and join in the fun. Before she leaves she invites them all to stop by her place in Los Angeles if they''re ever in the area. They soon are, and they do.', 'A young woman living in L.A. goes back to her family''s homestead way up in the mountains for a family reunion. At first put off by her relatives'' hillbilly ways, she soon decides to let her hair down and join in the fun. Before she leaves she invites them all to stop by her place in Los Angeles if they''re ever in the area. They soon are, and they do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2RlPHLRD516rVm5EzWPd3pMPiB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50952'),
