  ('473347660777556843', 'Country of the Deaf', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Valery Todorovsky, Yuriy Shaygardanov, Irina Tretyakova', 'Valery Todorovsky, Yuri Korotkov', 'Chulpan Khamatova, Dina Korzun, Maksim Sukhanov, Nikita Tyunin, Aleksandr Yatsko, Sergey Yushkevich, Oleksiy Horbunov, Pavel Poymalov', null, 'Strana Glukhikh is about an unusual relationship between two women, one of them a deaf-mute dancer and the other on the run from the mafia. Yaya, the deaf girl, offers to hide Rita whose boyfriend, Alyosha owes gambling debts to the mafia, but in return she wants her to leave the young man and run off with her to an imaginary paradise where material values do not exist.', 'Strana Glukhikh is about an unusual relationship between two women, one of them a deaf-mute dancer and the other on the run from the mafia. Yaya, the deaf girl, offers to hide Rita whose boyfriend, Alyosha owes gambling debts to the mafia, but in return she wants her to leave the young man and run off with her to an imaginary paradise where material values do not exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW6KVc3d2KnKPL9I0cZZqkTuRob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54514'),
  ('134344621572696165', 'Country Strong', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Shana Feste, John Bailey', 'Shana Feste', 'Gwyneth Paltrow, Garrett Hedlund, Tim McGraw, Leighton Meester, Marshall Chapman, Lari White, Jeremy Childs, James DeForest Parker', 'PG-13', 'Soon after the rising young singer-songwriter Beau Williams gets involved with a fallen, emotionally unstable country star Kelly Canter, the pair embark on a career resurrection tour helmed by her husband/manager James and featuring a beauty queen-turned-singer Chiles Stanton. Between concerts, romantic entanglements and old demons threaten to derail them all.', 'Soon after the rising young singer-songwriter Beau Williams gets involved with a fallen, emotionally unstable country star Kelly Canter, the pair embark on a career resurrection tour helmed by her husband/manager James and featuring a beauty queen-turned-singer Chiles Stanton. Between concerts, romantic entanglements and old demons threaten to derail them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C95tD92E9xm5poyyzs37bYemM0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45272'),
  ('389605835344536345', 'Countryman', 1982, 'Drama', 'Dickie Jobson, Dominique Chapuis', 'Dickie Jobson, Michael Thomas', 'Countryman, Hiram Keller, Carl Bradshaw, Basil Keane, Freshey Richardson, Kristina St. Clair, Jahman, Papa Threecards', null, 'A young woman crash-lands her plane in Jamaica. A local named Countryman rescues her and leads her away from the authorities, who have fabricated a story about the plane, involving drug and arms smuggling by the CIA, in order to gain popularity in an upcoming election.', 'A young woman crash-lands her plane in Jamaica. A local named Countryman rescues her and leads her away from the authorities, who have fabricated a story about the plane, involving drug and arms smuggling by the CIA, in order to gain popularity in an upcoming election.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F7We6g8ecAKwH2FfCkP4IoWQLZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36431'),
  ('797054901145081579', 'County Hospital', 1932, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Art Lloyd', 'H.M. Walker, Charley Rogers, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Billy Gilbert, May Wallace, William Austin, Estelle Etterre, Lilyan Irene, Dorothy Layton', 'NR', 'Ollie is in the hospital with a broken leg. When Stan comes to visit him, total chaos ensues.', 'Ollie is in the hospital with a broken leg. When Stan comes to visit him, total chaos ensues.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kvESjeEjvVGmWMraLit5aBMS04.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48671'),
  ('770834122658130064', 'County Lines', 2020, 'Drama', 'Aisha Bywaters, Penelope Berkemeier, Sam Waddington', 'Henry Blake', 'Conrad Khan, Ashley Madekwe, Tabitha Milne-Price, Harris Dickinson, Marcus Rutherford, Anthony Adjekum, Chizzy Akudolu, Ebenezer Gyau', null, 'A powerful drama about a mother and her fourteen year old boy who is groomed into a lethal nationwide drug selling enterprise, a ''County Line'', which exploits vulnerable children and traffics them across Britain.', 'A powerful drama about a mother and her fourteen year old boy who is groomed into a lethal nationwide drug selling enterprise, a ''County Line'', which exploits vulnerable children and traffics them across Britain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odYS1rnUj1K60rRmfAl1MJC9nP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623238'),
  ('763254462005359449', 'Coup at Daybreak', 1998, 'Drama, Action, History, Thriller, Crime', 'Carlos Azpúrua, Belén Orsini, Mariella Pérez', 'José Ignacio Cabrujas', 'Manuel Aranguiz, Mirtha Borges, Yanis Chimaras, Víctor Cuica, Gonzalo Cubero, Ruddy Rodriguez, Daniel Lugo, Elba Escobar', null, 'The film follows the events of the night of February 4, 1992 in Caracas, Venezuela. That night a group of military rebels staged a coup d''etat. Venezuelans found themselves as virtual prisoners. As the coup starts and fighting takes place from a military base which is in the center of the city''s most affluent areas, with both luxury high rises and palatial mansions. The area of La Carlota provides a wealth of very interesting, often flamboyant and typical characters of the Latin America upper middle and upper classes. They are among the most affected. Various vignettes in these different characters'' homes are developed. These people''s reactions, lifestyles, vices, and humanity come out in a very honest fashion under duress.', 'The film follows the events of the night of February 4, 1992 in Caracas, Venezuela. That night a group of military rebels staged a coup d''etat. Venezuelans found themselves as virtual prisoners. As the coup starts and fighting takes place from a military base which is in the center of the city''s most affluent areas, with both luxury high rises and palatial mansions. The area of La Carlota provides a wealth of very interesting, often flamboyant and typical characters of the Latin America upper middle and upper classes. They are among the most affected. Various vignettes in these different characters'' homes are developed. These people''s reactions, lifestyles, vices, and humanity come out in a very honest fashion under duress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ibrOtWFAHT2mq682L3s2sVgUoX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91932'),
  ('675579012179713143', 'Coup d''éclat', 2011, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'José Alcala', 'Olivier Gorce', 'Catherine Frot, Tchéky Karyo, Karim Seghair, Marie Raynal, Liliane Rovère, Nicolas Giraud, Diana Rudychenko', null, 'Fabienne is a police officer. She does her job well but is gradually growing tired of the dehumanized nature of her work : arresting undocumented aliens day after day does not fit in with her ideals. That''s why when, one night, Olga, the Kazakh prostitute she apprehends, begs her to free her not to leave her four-year-old son alone, she hesitates... And why, after Olga has run away and is found dead, Fabienne decides to deal with this matter personally...', 'Fabienne is a police officer. She does her job well but is gradually growing tired of the dehumanized nature of her work : arresting undocumented aliens day after day does not fit in with her ideals. That''s why when, one night, Olga, the Kazakh prostitute she apprehends, begs her to free her not to leave her four-year-old son alone, she hesitates... And why, after Olga has run away and is found dead, Fabienne decides to deal with this matter personally...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79LtH49CG9TPYfReCZnQFRQSEGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73568'),
  ('585775316169373087', 'Coup d''Etat', 1973, 'Drama, History', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Motokichi Hasegawa', 'Minoru Betsuyaku', 'Rentaro Mikuni, Yasuyo Matsumura, Yasuo Miyake, Akiko Kurano, Tadahiko Sugano, Kei Iinuma, Taketoshi Naitō, Masao Imafuku', null, 'A freestyle biopic of Ikki Kita, the ultranationalist intellectual whose ideas inspired the failed military coup in 1936.', 'A freestyle biopic of Ikki Kita, the ultranationalist intellectual whose ideas inspired the failed military coup in 1936.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1514CPlucgZjafQF5oEKt2LART4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104282'),
  ('533117223317200999', 'Coup de Chance', 2023, 'Drama', 'Woody Allen, Vittorio Storaro, Faustine Chevrin', 'Woody Allen', 'Lou de Laâge, Valérie Lemercier, Melvil Poupaud, Niels Schneider, Elsa Zylberstein, Grégory Gadebois, Guillaume de Tonquédec, Jeanne Bournaud', 'PG-13', 'Fanny and Jean have everything of an ideal couple: fulfilled in their professional life, they live in a magnificent apartment in the beautiful districts of Paris and seem to be in love as on the first day. But when Fanny crosses, by chance, Alain, a former high school friend, she is immediately capsized. They see each other again very quickly and get closer and closer.', 'Fanny and Jean have everything of an ideal couple: fulfilled in their professional life, they live in a magnificent apartment in the beautiful districts of Paris and seem to be in love as on the first day. But when Fanny crosses, by chance, Alain, a former high school friend, she is immediately capsized. They see each other again very quickly and get closer and closer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvejKWAstLqgUmC4N8P81CyhJdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:859235'),
  ('587262521615157426', 'Coup de foudre à Bangkok', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Romance', 'Chris Briant', 'David Robert, Alice Van den Broek', 'Blandine Bellavoir, Loup-Denis Elion, Frédéric Chau, Gavril Dartevelle, Pierre-Marie Mosconi, Eve Felli, Jérémy Charbonnel, Mathilda May', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKVTGzuoWd6W6SXq6DEVsoma5TQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762389'),
  ('788030176476230724', 'Coup de Grâce', 1976, 'War, Drama', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Igor Luther', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Jutta Brückner, Geneviève Dormann', 'Margarethe von Trotta, Matthias Habich, Rüdiger Kirschstein, Mathieu Carrière, Valeska Gert, Frederik von Zichy, Bruno Thost, Marc Eyraud', 'NR', 'A countess loves her brother''s Prussian-officer friend in the 1919 Baltic area.', 'A countess loves her brother''s Prussian-officer friend in the 1919 Baltic area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXQrL5wvL0DEmJz1ttEiJtiHixt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42226'),
  ('825762632314755883', 'Coup de Torchon', 1981, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Pierre-William Glenn, Jean Achache', 'Jean Aurenche, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Philippe Noiret, Isabelle Huppert, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Stéphane Audran, Eddy Mitchell, Guy Marchand, Michel Beaune, Jean Champion', null, 'A pathetic police chief, humiliated by everyone around him, suddenly wants a clean slate in life, and resorts to drastic means to achieve it.', 'A pathetic police chief, humiliated by everyone around him, suddenly wants a clean slate in life, and resorts to drastic means to achieve it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYlANrZi5vxaHhmPaktuPlsO2Wz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35797'),
  ('666468182206091689', 'Coup!', 2024, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Conor Murphy, Austin Stark, Joseph Schuman', 'Austin Stark, Joseph Schuman', 'Peter Sarsgaard, Billy Magnussen, Sarah Gadon, Skye P. Marshall, Faran Tahir, Kristine Nielsen, Fisher Stevens, Callum Vinson', 'NR', 'A mysterious grifter appears on an isolated seaside estate claiming to be a wealthy family''s new chef. When the Spanish Flu pandemic of 1918 descends on the island, the mischievous cook rouses his fellow staff to rebel and take over the mansion.', 'A mysterious grifter appears on an isolated seaside estate claiming to be a wealthy family''s new chef. When the Spanish Flu pandemic of 1918 descends on the island, the mischievous cook rouses his fellow staff to rebel and take over the mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a9Uo1YtkEeXPgAFvDyEGcMnYCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054221'),
  ('865865779648204408', 'Coupe de Ville', 1990, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Joe Roth, Reynaldo Villalobos', 'Mike Binder', 'Patrick Dempsey, Arye Gross, Daniel Stern, Annabeth Gish, Rita Taggart, Joseph Bologna, Alan Arkin, James Gammon', null, 'Meet the Libner brothers: Marvin, the oldest, is a sergeant in the U.S. Air Force. Buddy, the middle child, is a timid dreamer. Bobby, the youngest, is a handsome rebel in reform school. As kids, they fought a lot and as adults, they barely speak. In the summer of 1963, their tough and eccentric father, Fred, gives them a task: to bring a 1954 Cadillac, bought for their mother, Betty, from Detroit to Miami. As the trip goes on, the three brothers fight and begin to reconnect with each other, while trying to keep the Caddy in mint condition.', 'Meet the Libner brothers: Marvin, the oldest, is a sergeant in the U.S. Air Force. Buddy, the middle child, is a timid dreamer. Bobby, the youngest, is a handsome rebel in reform school. As kids, they fought a lot and as adults, they barely speak. In the summer of 1963, their tough and eccentric father, Fred, gives them a task: to bring a 1954 Cadillac, bought for their mother, Betty, from Detroit to Miami. As the trip goes on, the three brothers fight and begin to reconnect with each other, while trying to keep the Caddy in mint condition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gji7RKz0CuSwjDYQQdZwuzOi25e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39062'),
  ('440899496794472231', 'Couple Friendly', 2026, 'Musical, Romance, Drama', 'Ashwin Chandrasekar, Dinesh Purushothaman', 'Ashwin Chandrasekar', 'Santosh Shoban, Manasa Varanasi, Rajiv Kanakala, Goparaju Ramana, Sriranjini', null, 'A Chennai interior designer''s career struggles take an unexpected turn when bike pooling leads to romance with a fellow rider.', 'A Chennai interior designer''s career struggles take an unexpected turn when bike pooling leads to romance with a fellow rider.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FkiKGBPQC6exxUbIrOMnDtuU4soC.jpg', 'plex:movie:couple-friendly'),
  ('900924196102951702', 'Couple From The Future', 2021, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Alexey Nuzhnyy, Yury Korobeynikov', 'Dmitry Baluev, Alexey Nuzhnyy, Evgeniy Kulik', 'Sergey Burunov, Mariya Aronova, Denis Paramonov, Darya Konyzheva, Sergey Styopin, Pavel Misailov, Irina Gorbacheva, Serafima Krasnikova', null, 'Near future, 2040. Eugene and Alexandra have been married for 20 years, their relationship is like a dried apricot. Divorce from them also does not work, because in the future, divorce is a very expensive service. But fate gives them a chance: Eugene and Alexandra fall into the past, on the very day 20 years ago, when the lover and young Zhenya proposed to the lovely Sasha. Now a couple from the future wants to separate themselves in their youth, but it won''t be easy. The young will fight for their love.', 'Near future, 2040. Eugene and Alexandra have been married for 20 years, their relationship is like a dried apricot. Divorce from them also does not work, because in the future, divorce is a very expensive service. But fate gives them a chance: Eugene and Alexandra fall into the past, on the very day 20 years ago, when the lover and young Zhenya proposed to the lovely Sasha. Now a couple from the future wants to separate themselves in their youth, but it won''t be easy. The young will fight for their love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dDkWnoKYNmANUmTudO8Pvrg807.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732693'),
  ('409302682099059306', 'Couple Therapy for Cheaters', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Antonaroli, Emmanuele Bianco, Laura Greco', 'Alessio Maria Federici', 'Ambra Angiolini, Pietro Sermonti, Sergio Rubini, Franco Branciaroli, Anna Ferzetti, Anita Kravos, Filippo Gilli, Fulvio Falzarano', null, 'Reckless and in love, Viviana and Modesto are bound by an uncontrollable passion. Their secret relationship ends up in front of an incredulous therapist, who''ll anyway help them understanding their feelings and dealing with their desire to follow the true love.', 'Reckless and in love, Viviana and Modesto are bound by an uncontrollable passion. Their secret relationship ends up in front of an incredulous therapist, who''ll anyway help them understanding their feelings and dealing with their desire to follow the true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mMW10FxEWKELuydZYB5dGf92X9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464586'),
  ('294654920623750567', 'Coupled Up for Christmas', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Dylan Pearce, Wes Doyle, J.D. Schroder', 'Katy Breier, Erica Deutschman', 'Sara Canning, Marcus Rosner, Joe Perry, Jocelyn Chugg, Megan Tracz, Stephanie Wolfe, John Hudson, Sue Huff', null, 'This was supposed to be the Christmas Tiffany finally gets reunited with her long-time crush Brett– but when she finds out he has a serious girlfriend, who is just perfect, she is devastated. Tiffany hatches a plan with a recently heartbroken Peter, to win back the affection of their respective soulmates by pretending to be a couple in love, but soon realise that they have more in common than they ever realised… Tiffany might just find love this Christmas after all.', 'This was supposed to be the Christmas Tiffany finally gets reunited with her long-time crush Brett– but when she finds out he has a serious girlfriend, who is just perfect, she is devastated. Tiffany hatches a plan with a recently heartbroken Peter, to win back the affection of their respective soulmates by pretending to be a couple in love, but soon realise that they have more in common than they ever realised… Tiffany might just find love this Christmas after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3uZr6keOKa3P5iRdIHeozactwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1175674'),
  ('376564210358250932', 'Couples', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jeong Yong-ki', 'Jeong Yong-ki, Lee Kae-byeok', 'Kim Joo-hyuk, Lee Si-young, Oh Jung-se, Lee Yoon-ji, Gong Hyung-jin, Bae Seul-ki, Jeon Soo-jin, Joo Ye-rin', null, 'Yoo-Suk looks for a girlfriend who disappeared. Ae-Yeon has a fake diamond which her ex-boyfriend gave to her. Ae-Yeon was dumped by her ex boyfriend. Byung-Chan does not believe in love. Bok-Nam is in love with a friend of a friend.', 'Yoo-Suk looks for a girlfriend who disappeared. Ae-Yeon has a fake diamond which her ex-boyfriend gave to her. Ae-Yeon was dumped by her ex boyfriend. Byung-Chan does not believe in love. Bok-Nam is in love with a friend of a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hu8GUy5Qoq1wOUqSmgJIfsigbLo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91239'),
  ('1122637890347033848', 'Couples Counseling', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Alexandre Reinecke, Jacob Solitrenick', 'Juliana Rosenthal K.', 'Zezé Polessa, Daniel Dantas, Paulo Vilhena, Fernanda Paes Leme, Juliana Mesquita, Sônia Guedes, Antônio Petrin, Carol Mariottini', null, 'A seasoned couples therapist comes to realize she might need help with her own marriage after meeting a new pair of young clients.', 'A seasoned couples therapist comes to realize she might need help with her own marriage after meeting a new pair of young clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KIde3JwZbGrsS506MegsCBc42C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428327'),
  ('286083376327421040', 'Couples Retreat', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rip Murray, Christina Fong, Calla Klessig', 'Vince Vaughn, Jon Favreau, Dana Fox', 'Vince Vaughn, Jason Bateman, Jon Favreau, Faizon Love, Kristin Davis, Malin Åkerman, Kristen Bell, Jean Reno', 'PG-13', 'Four couples, all friends, descend on a tropical island resort. Though one husband and wife are there to work on their marriage, the others just want to enjoy some fun in the sun. They soon find, however, that paradise comes at a price: Participation in couples therapy sessions is mandatory. What started out as a cut-rate vacation turns into an examination of the common problems many face.', 'Four couples, all friends, descend on a tropical island resort. Though one husband and wife are there to work on their marriage, the others just want to enjoy some fun in the sun. They soon find, however, that paradise comes at a price: Participation in couples therapy sessions is mandatory. What started out as a cut-rate vacation turns into an examination of the common problems many face.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igXVSRZsNX3TZsKrQqSyEJvzHRF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19899'),
  ('1090417364280370861', 'Courage for Every Day', 1965, 'Drama', 'Irena Klausová, Miloš Kohout, Boca Abrhámová', 'Antonín Máša', 'Jana Brejchová, Jan Kačer, Josef Abrhám, Vlastimil Brodský, Jiřina Jirásková, Olga Scheinpflugová, Václav Trégl, Jan Libíček', null, 'A passionate communist worker is discouraged by the changing political climate and the failure of his peers to live up to his ideals.', 'A passionate communist worker is discouraged by the changing political climate and the failure of his peers to live up to his ideals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bM4F4dSpPESnCEF5SHDfP90kcHa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173873'),
  ('398749669898883729', 'Courage fuyons', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Yves Robert, Yves Lafaye', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Yves Robert', 'Jean Rochefort, Catherine Deneuve, Philippe Leroy, Michel Beaune, Robert Webber, Christian Charmetant, Christophe Bourseiller, Dominique Lavanant', null, 'At forty years old, Martin Belhomme leads a quiet life with his wife and two children. One day, he falls hopelessly in love with Eva, a cabaret singer. He decides to follow her to Amsterdam. From then on, his life becomes very eventful!', 'At forty years old, Martin Belhomme leads a quiet life with his wife and two children. One day, he falls hopelessly in love with Eva, a cabaret singer. He decides to follow her to Amsterdam. From then on, his life becomes very eventful!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vx4NSNiHzvjA5GYWjZao9WxiWZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256431'),
  ('757160993045914142', 'Courage Mountain', 1990, 'Drama, Family', 'Christopher Leitch, Jacques Steyn', 'Weaver Webb', 'Charlie Sheen, Juliette Caton, Joanna Clarke, Nicola Stapleton, Jade Magri, Kathryn Ludlow, Jan Rubeš, Leslie Caron', 'PG', 'At the beginning of World War I, a young Swiss girl is sent off to boarding school.', 'At the beginning of World War I, a young Swiss girl is sent off to boarding school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzwvJ2zIH5QUG21NH7qyRtb1UVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43912'),
  ('187797470300331035', 'Courage of Lassie', 1946, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Fred M. Wilcox, Leonard Smith', 'Lionel Houser', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Frank Morgan, Tom Drake, Selena Royle, Harry Davenport, George Cleveland, Catherine McLeod, Morris Ankrum', 'G', 'Bill''s separated from his litter, making friends with the wild creatures until he''s found and adopted by young Kathie. An accident separates him from her, and he''s drafted into K-9 duty in the trenches until battle fatigue takes its toll and he turns vicious. And even though he finds his way back home, he may be condemned as a killer.', 'Bill''s separated from his litter, making friends with the wild creatures until he''s found and adopted by young Kathie. An accident separates him from her, and he''s drafted into K-9 duty in the trenches until battle fatigue takes its toll and he turns vicious. And even though he finds his way back home, he may be condemned as a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRff56Vpe3xw9I94k7gFa2NR68s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61856'),
  ('521584653987186537', 'Courage Under Fire', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery, War', 'Edward Zwick, Roger Deakins, Skip Cosper', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Denzel Washington, Meg Ryan, Lou Diamond Phillips, Michael Moriarty, Matt Damon, Bronson Pinchot, Seth Gilliam, Regina Taylor', 'R', 'A US Army officer, who made a "friendly fire" mistake that was covered up, has been reassigned to a desk job. He is tasked to investigate a female chopper commander''s worthiness to be awarded the Medal of Honor. At first all seems in order. But then he begins to notice inconsistencies between the testimonies of the witnesses...', 'A US Army officer, who made a "friendly fire" mistake that was covered up, has been reassigned to a desk job. He is tasked to investigate a female chopper commander''s worthiness to be awarded the Medal of Honor. At first all seems in order. But then he begins to notice inconsistencies between the testimonies of the witnesses...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDJurMJkrx049AiXa3DJx5Zx7a4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10684'),
  ('927163748936275361', 'Courageous', 2011, 'Drama', 'Alex Kendrick, Bob Scott, Stephen Ostrander', 'Stephen Kendrick, Alex Kendrick', 'Ken Bevel, Alex Kendrick, Kevin Downes, Renee Jewell, Rusty Martin, Lauren Etchells, Ben Davies, Robert Amaya', 'PG-13', 'Law enforcement officers Adam Mitchell, Nathan Hayes, and their partners stand up to the worst the streets have to offer with confidence and focus. Yet at the end of the day, they face a challenge that none of them are truly prepared to tackle: fatherhood. They know that God desires to turn the hearts of fathers to their children, but their children are beginning to drift further and further away from them. When tragedy hits home, these men are left wrestling with their hopes, their fears, their faith, and their fathering. Can a newfound urgency help these dads draw closer to God... and to their children?', 'Law enforcement officers Adam Mitchell, Nathan Hayes, and their partners stand up to the worst the streets have to offer with confidence and focus. Yet at the end of the day, they face a challenge that none of them are truly prepared to tackle: fatherhood. They know that God desires to turn the hearts of fathers to their children, but their children are beginning to drift further and further away from them. When tragedy hits home, these men are left wrestling with their hopes, their fears, their faith, and their fathering. Can a newfound urgency help these dads draw closer to God... and to their children?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hVRkbZRCoHtnfi0V9GFZ3uXjCNp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72213'),
  ('1090980957573678858', 'Courier', 1986, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Nikolay Nemolyaev, Arnold Ides', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy', 'Fyodor Dunayevsky, Anastasiya Nemolyaeva, Oleg Basilashvili, Inna Churikova, Aleksandr Pankratov-Chyornyy, Vladimir Menshov, Svetlana Kryuchkova, Alika Smekhova', null, 'Ivan Mirosnikov, a cheeky young man in the Gorbachev era, is trying to figure out what to do with his life (he''s not in college, and the 2-year mandatory military service is looming large ahead of him). Meanwhile, he lives with his divorced mother, and works as a courier at a Russian newspaper. Through his job, he meets patronizing Professor Kuznetzov and his rebellious daughter Katya. To annoy the professor, Ivan claims to have an affair with Katya. To his surprise, Katya backs his story up.', 'Ivan Mirosnikov, a cheeky young man in the Gorbachev era, is trying to figure out what to do with his life (he''s not in college, and the 2-year mandatory military service is looming large ahead of him). Meanwhile, he lives with his divorced mother, and works as a courier at a Russian newspaper. Through his job, he meets patronizing Professor Kuznetzov and his rebellious daughter Katya. To annoy the professor, Ivan claims to have an affair with Katya. To his surprise, Katya backs his story up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xo49kkG6AkIOEckL1hvieUx1eCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70966'),
  ('7517441147049897', 'Court', 2015, 'Drama', 'Chaitanya Tamhane, Mrinal Desai, Somnath Pal', 'Chaitanya Tamhane', 'Vira Sathidar, Vivek Gomber, Geetanjali Kulkarni, Pradeep Joshi, Shirish Pawar, Usha Bane, Arpita Chate, Bipin Maniar', null, 'A sewerage worker''s dead body is found inside a manhole in Mumbai. An ageing folk singer is tried in court on charges of abetment of suicide. He is accused of performing an inflammatory song which might have incited the worker to commit the act. As the trial unfolds, the personal lives of the lawyers and the judge involved in the case are observed outside the court.', 'A sewerage worker''s dead body is found inside a manhole in Mumbai. An ageing folk singer is tried in court on charges of abetment of suicide. He is accused of performing an inflammatory song which might have incited the worker to commit the act. As the trial unfolds, the personal lives of the lawyers and the judge involved in the case are observed outside the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve1UFCZYu8WHmeGRH4ToEcGnj6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290815'),
  ('755939513469131412', 'Court: State vs. A Nobody', 2025, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Dinesh Purushothaman, Ram Jagadeesh, Ramana Madhavaram', 'Vamsidhar Sirigiri, Karthikeya Sreenivass, Ram Jagadeesh', 'Priyadarshi Pullikonda, Harsh Roshan, Sridevi Apalla, Sivaji Sontineni, Sai Kumar, Harsha Vardhan, Rohini, Surabhi Prabhavathi', null, 'A determined lawyer takes on a high-stakes case to defend a 19-year-old boy, challenging a system that has already branded him guilty.', 'A determined lawyer takes on a high-stakes case to defend a 19-year-old boy, challenging a system that has already branded him guilty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pEX67LJd7ZIqYWtksBtOgQEGcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1424217'),
  ('499926907050362495', 'Courted', 2015, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Frédéric Alexandre, Christian Vincent, Laurent Dailland', 'Christian Vincent', 'Fabrice Luchini, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Éva Lallier, Michaël Abiteboul, Claire Assali, Miss Ming, Floriane Potiez, Corinne Masiero', null, 'When a feared judge of the French court, Xavier Racine, encounters a French-Danish juror, Ditte Lorensen-Coteret, at a murder trial, their shared past is slowly uncovered.', 'When a feared judge of the French court, Xavier Racine, encounters a French-Danish juror, Ditte Lorensen-Coteret, at a murder trial, their shared past is slowly uncovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3Z1HeAn9sdCIn9SlFONAMZtmzJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329809'),
  ('831056713596322866', 'Cousin', 1999, 'Animation, Drama', 'Adam Elliot', 'Adam Elliot', 'William McInnes', null, 'Adam reminisces about the time he spent with his older cousin who suffered from cerebral palsy. Revisiting his eighth birthday celebrations, Adam talks about a tragedy that separated them forever.', 'Adam reminisces about the time he spent with his older cousin who suffered from cerebral palsy. Revisiting his eighth birthday celebrations, Adam talks about a tragedy that separated them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OrkjZSSoRDjBl2sLGfCWYuJZTv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48265'),
  ('526396544042201773', 'Cousin Angelica', 1974, 'Drama', 'Carlos Saura, Luis Cuadrado', 'Carlos Saura, Rafael Azcona', 'José Luis López Vázquez, Lina Canalejas, Fernando Delgado, María Clara Fernández de Loaysa, María de la Riva, Pedro Sempson, Antonio Canal, Marisa Porcel', null, 'When the single middle-aged Luis travels from Barcelona to bury the remains of his mother in the vault of his family in Segovia, he is lodged by his aunt Pilar in her old house where he spent his summer of 1936 with her. He meets his cousin Angelica, who was his first love, living on the first floor with her husband and daughter, and he recalls his childhood in times of the Spanish Civil War entwined with the present.', 'When the single middle-aged Luis travels from Barcelona to bury the remains of his mother in the vault of his family in Segovia, he is lodged by his aunt Pilar in her old house where he spent his summer of 1936 with her. He meets his cousin Angelica, who was his first love, living on the first floor with her husband and daughter, and he recalls his childhood in times of the Spanish Civil War entwined with the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68dsrXLsER3QU7n6GTouZV3C9EH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54236'),
  ('144430817015609294', 'Cousin Bette', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Des McAnuff, Andrzej Sekula, Anne Ventura', 'Lynn Siefert, Susan Tarr', 'Jessica Lange, Elisabeth Shue, Bob Hoskins, Hugh Laurie, Kelly Macdonald, Toby Stephens, John Benfield, Geraldine Chaplin', 'R', 'In 19th century Paris, Bette Fischer, a poor and homely spinster, forms an alliance with the seductive courtesan Valerie Marneffe to orchestrate revenge on her handsome and wealthy relatives.', 'In 19th century Paris, Bette Fischer, a poor and homely spinster, forms an alliance with the seductive courtesan Valerie Marneffe to orchestrate revenge on her handsome and wealthy relatives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4TEMm2pyZ6mYBmP2AwoierJHQf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50043'),
  ('989393443881381940', 'Cousin Jules', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Dominique Benicheti, Paul Launay, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Dominique Benicheti', 'Jules Guiteaux, Félicie Guiteaux, Claude Chaudat, Adrienne Chaudat, Paul Rabut, Marie Cordelier', 'NR', 'An ode to rural France and the simple joys of life, Dominique Benicheti''s glorious masterpiece Cousin Jules captures the daily routine and rituals of Jules, a blacksmith, living with his wife, Felice, on a small farm in the French countryside.', 'An ode to rural France and the simple joys of life, Dominique Benicheti''s glorious masterpiece Cousin Jules captures the daily routine and rituals of Jules, a blacksmith, living with his wife, Felice, on a small farm in the French countryside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFR3Ww2N5sguRTjwAeNbDLGzANz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137269'),
  ('96332339341141476', 'Cousin, Cousine', 1975, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Éric Faucherre, Georges Lendi, Jean-Charles Tacchella', 'Danièle Thompson, Jean-Charles Tacchella', 'Marie-Christine Barrault, Victor Lanoux, Marie-France Pisier, Guy Marchand, Ginette Garcin, Sybil Maas, Popeck, Pierre Plessis', null, 'Two distant cousins meet at a wedding banquet for an elderly couple. Over time, a close friendship develops between them, but their spouses begin to think that they are more than just friends.', 'Two distant cousins meet at a wedding banquet for an elderly couple. Over time, a close friendship develops between them, but their spouses begin to think that they are more than just friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffGpsolcNX9oJZvJinQwFhePtAD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5618'),
  ('687270643375342992', 'Cousinhood', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo, Juan Carlos Gómez, Antton Zabala', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Inma Cuesta, Raúl Arévalo, Antonio de la Torre, Adrián Lastra, Clara Lago, Núria Gago, Alicia Rubio', null, 'Three cousins travel to the village where they spent summer vacations as kids.', 'Three cousins travel to the village where they spent summer vacations as kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPZj6Uym4xCxADxkuWSKKEV5azf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56647'),
  ('875259738146263028', 'Cousins', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joel Schumacher, David W. Rose, Gary Pembroke Allen', 'Stephen Metcalfe', 'Ted Danson, Isabella Rossellini, Sean Young, William Petersen, Lloyd Bridges, Norma Aleandro, Keith Coogan, George Coe', 'PG-13', 'When Larry and Maria learn that their respective spouses are cheating on them, they try to turn the tables on them by pretending to have an affair. However, they soon find themselves falling in love.', 'When Larry and Maria learn that their respective spouses are cheating on them, they try to turn the tables on them by pretending to have an affair. However, they soon find themselves falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8dgW6b17JGaBYC9vzQ3Em0f6Kx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31674'),
  ('749808095993006009', 'Couture', 2026, 'Drama', 'Alice Winocour, André Chemetoff, Luc Bricault', 'Alice Winocour', 'Angelina Jolie, Ella Rumpf, Anyier Anei, Louis Garrel, Garance Marillier, Vincent Lindon, Finnegan Oldfield, Aurore Clément', null, 'In the frenzy of Fashion Week, three women cross paths in Paris, grappling with the world''s tragedies and the questions of their lives: Maxine, an American film director in her forties, discovers she has cancer; Ada, a young South Sudanese model, escapes a predetermined destiny to be thrust into a deceptive universe and French makeup artist Angèle, a small hand working in the shadows of the catwalks, dreams of escaping her life.', 'In the frenzy of Fashion Week, three women cross paths in Paris, grappling with the world''s tragedies and the questions of their lives: Maxine, an American film director in her forties, discovers she has cancer; Ada, a young South Sudanese model, escapes a predetermined destiny to be thrust into a deceptive universe and French makeup artist Angèle, a small hand working in the shadows of the catwalks, dreams of escaping her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhdWrG2KebrnIbHd3UJpcpX1feE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1390382'),
  ('67862787557527734', 'Coven', 1997, 'Drama, Horror', 'Mark Borchardt', 'Mark Borchardt', 'Mark Borchardt, Tom Schimmels, Jack Bennett, Mike Schank, Miriam Frost, Tommy Dallace, Robert Richard Jorge, Sherrie Beaupre', null, 'An alcohol/drug abuser re-examines his life until he nearly dies from an overdose. Then a friend convinces him to join a self-help group which turns out to be demonic.', 'An alcohol/drug abuser re-examines his life until he nearly dies from an overdose. Then a friend convinces him to join a self-help group which turns out to be demonic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z7AzUriysDApYoz6YGZmA6m1y26.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21714'),
  ('344573985624176183', 'Coven', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Silvina Guglielmotti, Guadalupe Balaguer Trelles, Óscar Marcos Bello', 'Katell Guillou, Pablo Agüero', 'Àlex Brendemühl, Amaia Aberasturi, Daniel Fanego, Garazi Urkola, Yune Nogueiras, Jone Laspiur, Irati Sáez de Urabain, Lorea Ibarra', 'NR', 'French Basque Country, year 1609. The men of a small fishing village have gone to sea. Judge Rostegui, who has been charged by the king with ridding the country of the devil''s wiles, arrests Ana and her friends and accuses them of witchcraft.', 'French Basque Country, year 1609. The men of a small fishing village have gone to sea. Judge Rostegui, who has been charged by the king with ridding the country of the devil''s wiles, arrests Ana and her friends and accuses them of witchcraft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyB3yoQbGO3LiCVuSOD2g17Hr6p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655187'),
  ('20799511944567097', 'Cover Boy', 2008, 'Drama', 'Carmine Amoroso, Paolo Ferrari', null, 'Chiara Caselli, Walter D''Errico, Eduard Gabia, Susan Lay, Luca Lionello, Luciana Littizzetto, Gabriel Spahiu, Francesco Maria Dominedò', null, 'The story of the friendship between Ioan and Michele respectively Romanian and Italian. The serendipitous encounter of two worlds apart: the travails of a young man, son of the Post-Communist Revolution, who flees his country in search of a better future and the travails of another youth who instead scrapes along the margins of a Western society that is unable to offer gainful employment to so much of its youth. In the background of this rapport between a simple Romanian youth and his marginalized Italian counterpart, there is a West which on one side is still reeling from the collapse of the Communist ideology and on the other, in the clutches of a Capitalist myth which has increasingly assumed, as it propulsive force, harsh competitiveness and an intensification of social inequality.', 'The story of the friendship between Ioan and Michele respectively Romanian and Italian. The serendipitous encounter of two worlds apart: the travails of a young man, son of the Post-Communist Revolution, who flees his country in search of a better future and the travails of another youth who instead scrapes along the margins of a Western society that is unable to offer gainful employment to so much of its youth. In the background of this rapport between a simple Romanian youth and his marginalized Italian counterpart, there is a West which on one side is still reeling from the collapse of the Communist ideology and on the other, in the clutches of a Capitalist myth which has increasingly assumed, as it propulsive force, harsh competitiveness and an intensification of social inequality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rS5FXvaXFQmc6ozCScvsgPhwyZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15729'),
  ('684192009423067991', 'Cover Girl', 1944, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Rudolph Maté, Allen M. Davey, Charles Vidor', 'Virginia Van Upp', 'Rita Hayworth, Gene Kelly, Lee Bowman, Phil Silvers, Jinx Falkenburg, Leslie Brooks, Eve Arden, Otto Kruger', 'NR', 'A nightclub dancer makes it big in modeling, leaving her dancer boyfriend behind.', 'A nightclub dancer makes it big in modeling, leaving her dancer boyfriend behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhZATA1Of1vjnG62JwUcdb18v3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21622'),
  ('385943805668928230', 'Cover Girl Killer', 1959, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Terry Bishop, Gerald Gibbs, Peter Yates', 'Terry Bishop', 'Harry H. Corbett, Felicity Young, Spencer Teakle, Victor Brooks, Bernadette Milnes, Christina Gregg, Tony Doonan, John Barrard', null, 'A madman is on the loose... killing fashion models that appear on the cover of magazines. The police start a manhunt in an attempt to capture the killer.', 'A madman is on the loose... killing fashion models that appear on the cover of magazines. The police start a manhunt in an attempt to capture the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhZhhAQJNTUoWVnGwBUkZZsRIWE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45570'),
  ('424959226160560097', 'Cover Up', 1949, 'Mystery', 'Alfred E. Green, Ernest Laszlo, Harold Godsoe', 'Dennis O''Keefe, Jerome Odlum', 'William Bendix, Dennis O''Keefe, Barbara Britton, Art Baker, Helen Spring, Ann E. Todd, Doro Merande, Virginia Christine', 'NR', 'Insurance investigator Sam Donovan is looking into the apparent suicide of a man in a small Midwestern town. All clues leads him into suspecting murder. Unfortunately, no one wants to assist him with the case, including Sheriff Larry Best.', 'Insurance investigator Sam Donovan is looking into the apparent suicide of a man in a small Midwestern town. All clues leads him into suspecting murder. Unfortunately, no one wants to assist him with the case, including Sheriff Larry Best.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8T890IORE2kMxoeV4T7SW2eXtEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37615'),
  ('621999153996194994', 'Cover Up', 1983, 'Crime, Romance, Thriller', 'Philippe Labro, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Jacques Labib, Philippe Labro, Jean-Patrick Manchette', 'Claude Brasseur, Gabrielle Lazure, Jean-Claude Brialy, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Dayle Haddon, Robert Hirsch, Jacques Dacqmine, Daniel Jégou', null, 'A well-known business lawyer is shot dead in the courthouse. A commissioner of the Criminal Brigade is in charge of the investigation and is helped by a journalist.', 'A well-known business lawyer is shot dead in the courthouse. A commissioner of the Criminal Brigade is in charge of the investigation and is helped by a journalist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5WTgxEFiZTe7BnR8rig90ALU6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249786'),
  ('979587680362764187', 'Cover-Up', 1991, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Manny Coto, David Gurfinkel, Vic Armstrong', 'William Tannen', 'Dolph Lundgren, Louis Gossett Jr., Lisa Berkley, John Finn, Gil Kopel, Howard Rypp, Ofer Lehavi, Zadok Zarum', 'R', 'Mike Anderson, a tough American reporter on a dangerous foreign assignment, finds his own life in jeopardy when he uncovers a deadly labyrinth of political intrigue that threatens the lives of thousands. Dispatched to investigate a mysterious and fatal attack on an overseas US naval base, Anderson, a leading investigative journalist and ex-US marine, finds himself back on familiar ground. Instinct makes him question the official CIA explanation that cites an unknown terrorist group called Black October. Alone, and armed only with his combat training and determination to uncover the truth, he sets out to expose a complex and dangerous political web.', 'Mike Anderson, a tough American reporter on a dangerous foreign assignment, finds his own life in jeopardy when he uncovers a deadly labyrinth of political intrigue that threatens the lives of thousands. Dispatched to investigate a mysterious and fatal attack on an overseas US naval base, Anderson, a leading investigative journalist and ex-US marine, finds himself back on familiar ground. Instinct makes him question the official CIA explanation that cites an unknown terrorist group called Black October. Alone, and armed only with his combat training and determination to uncover the truth, he sets out to expose a complex and dangerous political web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rn9qE7iQSKs8gUwESqhHSfDkstk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88067'),
  ('106740342862369416', 'Cover-Up', 2025, 'Documentary', 'Laura Poitras, Mark Obenhaus, Mia Cioffi Henry', null, 'Seymour Hersh, Jeff Gerth, David Obst, Bob Woodward, Max Friedman, Amy Davidson Sorkin, Antonio Taguba, Camille Lo Sapio', 'R', 'He''s devoted his career to uncovering stories the powerful want buried. From My Lai to Abu Ghraib, dig into the life''s work of journalist Seymour Hersh.', 'He''s devoted his career to uncovering stories the powerful want buried. From My Lai to Abu Ghraib, dig into the life''s work of journalist Seymour Hersh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kVAkwPrNNw3kxe2yJVatj86QKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1516391'),
  ('1119318975922580747', 'Covert One: The Hades Factor', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Mick Jackson', null, 'Stephen Dorff, Mira Sorvino, Blair Underwood, Danny Huston', null, 'Academy Award winner Mira Sorvino, Academy and Golden Globe Award winner Anjelica Huston and Stephen Dorff star in this nail-biting tale of action and intrigue about members of an elite undercover team who race against time to locate the source of a deadly virus threatening the lives of millions of Americans.', 'Academy Award winner Mira Sorvino, Academy and Golden Globe Award winner Anjelica Huston and Stephen Dorff star in this nail-biting tale of action and intrigue about members of an elite undercover team who race against time to locate the source of a deadly virus threatening the lives of millions of Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqDg462IA9sJu7W55kWN47XFO7V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23925'),
  ('947819295703334042', 'Covet: Island of Desire', 2017, 'Romance', 'Kim Jin-sung', null, 'Han Jae Bum, Kim Hwa-yeon, Park Cho-hyeon, Bae Geon-sik, Lee Min-Sik, Yu Naang', null, 'People who are on a fishing boat in a secluded countryside wake up to a deep desire in their heart. Money, sex, power ... In the uninhabited desert of endless desire, it turns out that somebody is found as a body and another person is on the island. Can they escape safely from the island of desire?', 'People who are on a fishing boat in a secluded countryside wake up to a deep desire in their heart. Money, sex, power ... In the uninhabited desert of endless desire, it turns out that somebody is found as a body and another person is on the island. Can they escape safely from the island of desire?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNebLQ3O2BNNI1qCDqTRCzxJTrS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458083'),
  ('648900328152397015', 'COVID-21: Lethal Virus', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Daniel H. Torrado, Pepe Añón', 'Nerea Bermúdez, Diego de la Concepción, Daniel H. Torrado', 'Christian Stamm, Loretta Hope, Lee Partridge, Ramon Álvarez, Tomás Paredes, Chus de Castro, Natascha Cridewi-Tol, Helena de la Concepción', null, 'The climate change has released an ancient rabies virus trapped in the Antarctica ice. A female scientist tries to get to the laboratory to create a cure to save the world, protected by an eccentric and two members of the special forces.', 'The climate change has released an ancient rabies virus trapped in the Antarctica ice. A female scientist tries to get to the laboratory to create a cure to save the world, protected by an eccentric and two members of the special forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z8wVwHtFXbRWP2dwVPTj9906HS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782760'),
  ('181666080193219629', 'Cow', 2009, 'Drama, War', 'Guan Hu, Song Xiaofei', 'Guan Hu', 'Huang Bo, Yan Ni, Gao Hu, Lai Xi, Hu Xiaoguang, Tao Zeru', null, 'A Chinese peasant is given the responsibility of protecting his village''s special dairy cow during a particularly harsh winter in 1940.', 'A Chinese peasant is given the responsibility of protecting his village''s special dairy cow during a particularly harsh winter in 1940.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uQKHfYoTIiaNkFpOLsWElbzFGxt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44714'),
  ('420225950083371324', 'Cow', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Magda Kowalczyk, Andrea Arnold', null, 'Lin Gallagher', null, 'A close-up portrait of the daily lives of a pair of cows: told by way of some narrative-free, intimate POV photography, with plenty of close shot images, we follow the daily routine of these animals as they live what can only be described as mundane, boring lives - all with an ultimate purpose within the human food chain.', 'A close-up portrait of the daily lives of a pair of cows: told by way of some narrative-free, intimate POV photography, with plenty of close shot images, we follow the daily routine of these animals as they live what can only be described as mundane, boring lives - all with an ultimate purpose within the human food chain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faszRX0wSzGqjIzDXt79H9ibsXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661348'),
  ('39391714864921563', 'Cow Belles', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Francine McDougall, Tony Westman', null, 'Aly Michalka, AJ Michalka, Jack Coleman, Sheila McCarthy, Michael Trevino, Christian Serratos, Ron Gabriel, Chris Gallinger', 'G', 'In order to learn how to be responsible, two wealthy teen sisters are forced to work in the family business by their exasperated father. When company funds goes missing, it''s up to the girls to save the day.', 'In order to learn how to be responsible, two wealthy teen sisters are forced to work in the family business by their exasperated father. When company funds goes missing, it''s up to the girls to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kA15KXpFHGKSqrRaJHAf0bhjQcT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24801'),
  ('476135892803834689', 'Coward Love', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carmen Blanco, Jacobo Herrero', 'Carmen Blanco', 'Blanca Parés, Ignacio Montes, Anna Coll Miller, Tusti de las Heras, Agustín Otón, David Mora, Alejandro Vergara', null, 'Eva is a young and independent cartoonist who returns to Málaga (Spain) to spend the summer holidays. There she meets her mother and Gema, her best friend. What she does not expect is to meet again with Rubén, her old boyfriend, with whom she has not had any contact since he broke off all relations with her unexpectedly, without farewells, six years ago. Eva will have to think about whether to give Rubén a second chance while she remembers her past, as well as the reason why the young man decided to get away from her.', 'Eva is a young and independent cartoonist who returns to Málaga (Spain) to spend the summer holidays. There she meets her mother and Gema, her best friend. What she does not expect is to meet again with Rubén, her old boyfriend, with whom she has not had any contact since he broke off all relations with her unexpectedly, without farewells, six years ago. Eva will have to think about whether to give Rubén a second chance while she remembers her past, as well as the reason why the young man decided to get away from her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSdzAVChcDqqgnM8mznOZZ5lesY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529218'),
  ('1144670178665005323', 'Coward of the County', 1981, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry, Skip Beaudine, Richard Espinoza', null, 'Kenny Rogers, Fredric Lehne, Largo Woodruff, Mariclare Costello, Ana Alicia, William Schreiner, Frank Koppala, Todd Waring', null, 'A lifelong yellow-belly who made a deathbed promise to his father to be a pacifist seeks bloody revenge on the men who gang-raped his wife.', 'A lifelong yellow-belly who made a deathbed promise to his father to be a pacifist seeks bloody revenge on the men who gang-raped his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qKPMcduN2IVEroJ8YyEpyVoUe9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116849'),
  ('686224799190151436', 'Cowards', 2008, 'Drama', 'Juan Cruz, José Corbacho, David Omedes', 'José Corbacho, Juan Cruz', 'Eduardo Garé, Eduardo Espinilla, Elvira Mínguez, Blanca Suárez, Antonio de la Torre, Daniel Medrán, Carla Tous', null, 'A young victim of bullying at school realizes that even the adult world is dominated by fear similar to his own. He pays a high price when he decides to fight back.', 'A young victim of bullying at school realizes that even the adult world is dominated by fear similar to his own. He pays a high price when he decides to fight back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d24lyFcduhUoaDNjxBah9dbJIwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40429'),
  ('1076317194405342169', 'Cowards Bend the Knee', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Guy Maddin, Guy Maddin, Rubén Guzmán', 'Guy Maddin', 'Darcy Fehr, Melissa Dionisio, Tara Birtwhistle, Louis Negin, Amy Stewart, Mike Bell, David Stuart Evans, Victor Cowie', null, 'When he takes his girlfriend to a seedy abortion clinic in the back room of a combination hair salon / bordello, Guy Maddin meets the madam’s daughter and falls in love. But she won’t let any man touch her until her father’s murder has been avenged.', 'When he takes his girlfriend to a seedy abortion clinic in the back room of a combination hair salon / bordello, Guy Maddin meets the madam’s daughter and falls in love. But she won’t let any man touch her until her father’s murder has been avenged.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Oto4m94iirzlTD5v0y7jXv0qsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17595'),
  ('226811680611226580', 'Cowboy', 1958, 'Western', 'Delmer Daves, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Edmund H. North, Dalton Trumbo', 'Glenn Ford, Jack Lemmon, Anna Kashfi, Brian Donlevy, Dick York, Víctor Manuel Mendoza, Richard Jaeckel, King Donovan', 'NR', 'Chicago hotel clerk Frank Harris dreams of life as a cowboy, and he gets his chance when, jilted by the father of the woman he loves, he joins Tom Reece and his cattle-driving outfit. Soon, though, the tenderfoot finds out life on the range is neither what he expected nor what he''s been looking for...', 'Chicago hotel clerk Frank Harris dreams of life as a cowboy, and he gets his chance when, jilted by the father of the woman he loves, he joins Tom Reece and his cattle-driving outfit. Soon, though, the tenderfoot finds out life on the range is neither what he expected nor what he''s been looking for...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArI7lT0mo7EJ4FGjAs2zQScRKqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39435'),
  ('210084148834866876', 'Cowboy', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Mariage', 'Benoît Mariage', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, François Damiens, Gilbert Melki, Julie Depardieu, Bouli Lanners, Jean-Marie Barbier, Geneviève Grzelczyk, Christiane Dargenton', null, 'Daniel Piron has the blues. His relationship is monotonous, his ideals have vanished, and even his job as a journalist is a joke. The only idea that still inspires him is to find and film Tony Sacchi, the revolutionary hero of his youth. Through this adventure, Daniel wants to rehabilitate the passionate and committed young man he once was. But, unfortunately for him, Sacchi has become a cynical gigolo. At the end of this tragicomic epic, will Daniel Piron finally understand that he must accept his disillusionment in order to find himself again?', 'Daniel Piron has the blues. His relationship is monotonous, his ideals have vanished, and even his job as a journalist is a joke. The only idea that still inspires him is to find and film Tony Sacchi, the revolutionary hero of his youth. Through this adventure, Daniel wants to rehabilitate the passionate and committed young man he once was. But, unfortunately for him, Sacchi has become a cynical gigolo. At the end of this tragicomic epic, will Daniel Piron finally understand that he must accept his disillusionment in order to find himself again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUy6skp3yVoDcgqf5FbfadIagZB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30132'),
  ('75142470648234162', 'Cowboy', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Till Kleinert, Linus de Paoli, Martin Hanslmayr', 'Till Kleinert', 'Oliver Scherz, Pit Bukowski, Isabelle Höpfner, Sabine Bernd, Angelina Grusa, Manuela Bischoff, Dieter Günther, Rainer Kruse', null, 'Real estate agent Christian travels the countryside scouting for investment prospects. In a forgotten, seemingly abandoned village far off the main roads, he finds more than he is looking for. Getting entangled in an encounter with a taciturn teenage farmhand, he confronts his sexual frustrations and, in the process, gets drawn into the undergrowth of a bloodthirsty rustic community.', 'Real estate agent Christian travels the countryside scouting for investment prospects. In a forgotten, seemingly abandoned village far off the main roads, he finds more than he is looking for. Getting entangled in an encounter with a taciturn teenage farmhand, he confronts his sexual frustrations and, in the process, gets drawn into the undergrowth of a bloodthirsty rustic community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yKszf9ufrAhs3z1WqTrWwV5kjel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113398'),
  ('706383614337508447', 'Cowboy', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Juan Minujín, Federico Rotstein, Tomás Sala', 'Juan Minujín, Facundo Agrelo', 'Juan Minujín, Guillermo Arengo, Esmeralda Mitre, Marcos Odasso, Ana Caruso, Daniel Fanego, Alberto Suárez, Leonardo Sbaraglia', null, 'The story of Julián Lamar, an Argentine actor who tries to get a part in a North American western that will be shot in Argentina.', 'The story of Julián Lamar, an Argentine actor who tries to get a part in a North American western that will be shot in Argentina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkNvejvsWMqw14hrGwJkS6XAE5g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221094'),
  ('943157325641107673', 'Cowboy Bebop: Don''t Bother None', 2012, 'Action, Crime, Western', 'Shinichiro Watanabe', 'Shinichiro Watanabe', 'B-BANDJ, Tim Jensen, Rina Ohta, Xiaodong Wang, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'When three bounty hunters accidentally meet in a bar, their stark personalities begin to clash, turning into a three way gun fight.', 'When three bounty hunters accidentally meet in a bar, their stark personalities begin to clash, turning into a three way gun fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oio8N3TauBTEPkuef3hnXUKbrZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525191'),
  ('888345476540677376', 'Cowboy Bebop: The Movie', 2001, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shinichiro Watanabe, Yoshiyuki Takei, Masami Goto', 'Keiko Nobumoto', 'Koichi Yamadera, Unsho Ishizuka, Aoi Tada, Ai Kobayashi, Megumi Hayashibara, Mickey Curtis, Tsutomu Isobe, Jin Hirao', 'R', 'The year is 2071. Following a terrorist bombing, a deadly virus is released on the populace of Mars and the government has issued the largest bounty in history, for the capture of whoever is behind it. The bounty hunter crew of the spaceship Bebop; Spike, Faye, Jet and Ed, take the case with hopes of cashing in the bounty. However, the mystery surrounding the man responsible, Vincent, goes deeper than they ever imagined, and they aren''t the only ones hunting him.', 'The year is 2071. Following a terrorist bombing, a deadly virus is released on the populace of Mars and the government has issued the largest bounty in history, for the capture of whoever is behind it. The bounty hunter crew of the spaceship Bebop; Spike, Faye, Jet and Ed, take the case with hopes of cashing in the bounty. However, the mystery surrounding the man responsible, Vincent, goes deeper than they ever imagined, and they aren''t the only ones hunting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34H5bsNc0EPILVr49TfOYXj50qV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11299'),
  ('1052192165303605867', 'Cowboys', 2020, 'Drama', 'Anna Kerrigan, John Wakayama Carey', 'Anna Kerrigan', 'Steve Zahn, Jillian Bell, Sasha Knight, Ann Dowd, Gary Farmer, Chris Coy, John Reynolds, Bob Stephenson', null, 'Troy and his young transgender son Joe are on the run from his conservative mother in the Montana wilderness, with a detective in hot pursuit.', 'Troy and his young transgender son Joe are on the run from his conservative mother in the Montana wilderness, with a detective in hot pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88ddT0lpefhVCwN0hNCA4dH2IKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681022'),
  ('305188298164336129', 'Cowboys & Aliens', 2011, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Western', 'David B. Nowell, K.C. Hodenfield, David Ticotin', 'Alex Kurtzman, Roberto Orci, Mark Fergus', 'Daniel Craig, Harrison Ford, Olivia Wilde, Sam Rockwell, Adam Beach, Paul Dano, Noah Ringer, Keith Carradine', 'PG-13', 'A stranger stumbles into the desert town of Absolution with no memory of his past and a futuristic shackle around his wrist. With the help of mysterious beauty Ella and the iron-fisted Colonel Dolarhyde, he finds himself leading an unlikely posse of cowboys, outlaws, and Apache warriors against a common enemy from beyond this world in an epic showdown for survival.', 'A stranger stumbles into the desert town of Absolution with no memory of his past and a futuristic shackle around his wrist. With the help of mysterious beauty Ella and the iron-fisted Colonel Dolarhyde, he finds himself leading an unlikely posse of cowboys, outlaws, and Apache warriors against a common enemy from beyond this world in an epic showdown for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9uZsGCP4rvOHVGCpMpYq5gNCuNI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49849'),
  ('483106001780819866', 'Cowboys & Angels', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Gleeson, Volker Tittel', 'David Gleeson', 'Michael Legge, Allen Leech, Amy Shiels, Sean Power, Frank Kelly, David Murray, Colm Coogan, Maeve McGrath', 'NR', 'This story concerns a hapless civil servant who gets more than he bargains for when he moves into an apartment in Limerick with a gay fashion student and becomes a star on the catwalk. A contemporary story embracing the essence of what it is to be young in today''s Ireland.', 'This story concerns a hapless civil servant who gets more than he bargains for when he moves into an apartment in Limerick with a gay fashion student and becomes a star on the catwalk. A contemporary story embracing the essence of what it is to be young in today''s Ireland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8S55zmOu7cdN6v71M9AzKLVdrOr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20148'),
  ('754795990575070196', 'Cowboys vs. Dinosaurs', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Western', 'Ari Novak, Stuart Brereton, Joe Bohn', 'Anthony Fankhauser, Rafael Jordan', 'Vernon Wells, Rib Hillis, Casey Fitzgerald, John Freeman, Kelcey Watson, Sara Malakul Lane, Heather Foote, Eric Roberts', null, 'After an accidental explosion at a local mine, dinosaurs emerge from the rubble to terrorize a small western town. Now, a group of gunslingers must defend their home if anyone is going to survive in a battle of cowboys versus dinosaurs.', 'After an accidental explosion at a local mine, dinosaurs emerge from the rubble to terrorize a small western town. Now, a group of gunslingers must defend their home if anyone is going to survive in a battle of cowboys versus dinosaurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inxX7yOvXXFV9NiyO90CF7wIQZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337208'),
