  ('151256833579451609', 'Coyote Creek Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'David I. Strasser, Thomas M. Harting', 'Alexa Garster', 'Janel Parrish, Ryan Paevey, Cameron Bancroft, Azriel Dalman, Naomi King, Dolores Drake, Linda Minard, Nimet Kanji', 'G', 'While throwing a "Christmas Around the World" party at her family''s inn, an event planner discovers Christmas magic with a charming father-son duo whose presence brings about tension and joy.', 'While throwing a "Christmas Around the World" party at her family''s inn, an event planner discovers Christmas magic with a charming father-son duo whose presence brings about tension and joy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2p5fffaFToQM1gmNdF4MxyjuL6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874127'),
  ('466621351792316434', 'Coyote Ugly', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Romance', 'David McNally, David Kelley, Amir Mokri', 'Gina Wendkos', 'Piper Perabo, Maria Bello, Bridget Moynahan, Tyra Banks, Izabella Miko, John Goodman, LeAnn Rimes, Adam Garcia', 'PG-13', 'Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her "day" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The "Coyotes" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.', 'Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her "day" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The "Coyotes" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6282'),
  ('293409782695086650', 'Coyote''s Morning', 2001, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Olaf Lubaszenko, Andrzej Ramlau', 'Mikołaj Korzyński', 'Karolina Rosińska, Janusz Józefowicz, Maciej Stuhr, Agnieszka Włodarczyk, Michał Milowicz, Magdalena Kumorek, Edward Linde-Lubaszenko, Roman Bugaj', null, 'Kuba, a young cartoon artist who works as a waiter at sophisticated parties, falls in love with beautiful Noemi and accidentally gets involved in gangster affairs', 'Kuba, a young cartoon artist who works as a waiter at sophisticated parties, falls in love with beautiful Noemi and accidentally gets involved in gangster affairs', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIFA5olWYJbval7RrA8U1X8MWJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31857'),
  ('273357680636576355', 'Coyotes', 2025, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Colin Minihan, Bradley Stuckel', 'Nick Simon, Tad Daggerhart', 'Justin Long, Mila Harris, Brittany Allen, Kate Bosworth, Norbert Leo Butz, Kevin Glynn, Katherine McNamara, Norma Nivia', 'R', 'Trapped in their Hollywood Hills home, a family fights for survival when caught between a raging wildfire and a pack of savage coyotes.', 'Trapped in their Hollywood Hills home, a family fights for survival when caught between a raging wildfire and a pack of savage coyotes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSzs9ZXYcrln0FRrjGIPCjuB6En.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386827'),
  ('283367536478779925', 'CQ', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roman Coppola, Laurent Herbiet, Iris Wong Yat-Tung', 'Roman Coppola', 'Jeremy Davies, Angela Lindvall, Élodie Bouchez, Gérard Depardieu, Giancarlo Giannini, Massimo Ghini, Jason Schwartzman, Billy Zane', 'R', 'A young filmmaker in 1960s Paris juggles directing a cheesy sci-fi debacle, directing his own personal art film, coping with his crumbling relationship with his girlfriend, and a new-found infatuation with the sci-fi film''s starlet.', 'A young filmmaker in 1960s Paris juggles directing a cheesy sci-fi debacle, directing his own personal art film, coping with his crumbling relationship with his girlfriend, and a new-found infatuation with the sci-fi film''s starlet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aFAPOT77Jh7lNWYtojC6nxi4CpJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27834'),
  ('306453052882452062', 'Crab Trap', 2009, 'Drama', 'Oscar Ruiz Navia, Sofia Oggioni', 'Oscar Ruiz Navia', 'Arnobio Salazar Rivas, Rodrigo Vélez, Karent Hinestroza', null, 'A drama set in the black communities of Colombia''s Pacific coast, where a man looking to flee the country by boat encounters a local fisherman.', 'A drama set in the black communities of Colombia''s Pacific coast, where a man looking to flee the country by boat encounters a local fisherman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWpikcHcJ3OZA5u38BqPwR3LNoo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82939'),
  ('557916023302493022', 'Crabs!', 2021, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Pierce Berolzheimer', 'Pierce Berolzheimer', 'Dylan Riley Snyder, Jessica Morris, Allie Jennings, Robert Craighead, Dash Pomerantz, Bryce Durfee, Kurt Carley, Katrina Landa', null, 'A horde of murderous crab monsters descend on a sleepy coastal town on Prom night, and only a ragtag group of outcasts can save the day.', 'A horde of murderous crab monsters descend on a sleepy coastal town on Prom night, and only a ragtag group of outcasts can save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1gdFxHgcA49sXpSReq7GS18JeT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375358'),
  ('272299755886538495', 'Crac!', 1980, 'Animation, Drama', 'Frédéric Back', 'Frédéric Back', null, null, 'A wooden rocking chair serves as a tool to delve through the history of Quebec in the last century.', 'A wooden rocking chair serves as a tool to delve through the history of Quebec in the last century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fgvKKoZw3Pcg4cHAgLWBsILNoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90781'),
  ('1152762651463956351', 'Crack 6T', 1997, 'Drama', 'Valérie Le Gurun, Jean-François Richet', 'Arco Descat, Jean-François Richet', 'Arco Descat, Jean-Marie Robert, Malik Zeggou, Jean-François Richet, Virginie Ledoyen, Brigitte Sy, Emile Abossolo M''bo, Mustapha Ziad', null, 'Outwardly a chilling portrait of the aimless lives of unemployed inner city youths living on society''s fringe, the underlying message of this volatile drama seems to call for violence to rectify social injustices. The film centers on two teenaged gangs who basically terrorize their neighborhoods with their anarchic behavior. There are few limits to their unpleasant philosophy of "desire equals acquisition." The loosely structured tale reaches its climax at a concert where the two rival groups collide.', 'Outwardly a chilling portrait of the aimless lives of unemployed inner city youths living on society''s fringe, the underlying message of this volatile drama seems to call for violence to rectify social injustices. The film centers on two teenaged gangs who basically terrorize their neighborhoods with their anarchic behavior. There are few limits to their unpleasant philosophy of "desire equals acquisition." The loosely structured tale reaches its climax at a concert where the two rival groups collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNZInVQv3yZBff4AcOEYnDSx6wK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45350'),
  ('4270893748081206', 'Crack Glass Eulogy', 1991, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'A nostalgic envisionment of city living - the potential shards of memory seen as if always on the verge of cutting the mind to pieces.', 'A nostalgic envisionment of city living - the potential shards of memory seen as if always on the verge of cutting the mind to pieces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgOQCPeDPLy4xD8ZaWlLlO1Ynpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126213'),
  ('182302451788764493', 'Crack House', 1989, 'Action, Drama', 'Michael Fischa, Arledge Armenaki', 'Blake Schaeffer', 'Jim Brown, Anthony Geary, Richard Roundtree, Cheryl Butler, Gregg Thomsen, Angel Tompkins, Clyde Jones, Albert Michel Jr.', 'R', 'Rick and Melissa are a pair of young lovers hoping to get out of the slums for good and escape the poverty and crime their families and friends have gotten involved in. All this comes to an end when Rick feels he must rejoin his old gang to avenge the killing of his cousin by a rival gang. In the course of getting even, Rick is arrested, leaving Melissa without anyone to protect her. She falls in with a crack dealer and quickly becomes addicted to the drug. When she gets taken by a drug kingpin to settle a debt, only Rick can save her.', 'Rick and Melissa are a pair of young lovers hoping to get out of the slums for good and escape the poverty and crime their families and friends have gotten involved in. All this comes to an end when Rick feels he must rejoin his old gang to avenge the killing of his cousin by a rival gang. In the course of getting even, Rick is arrested, leaving Melissa without anyone to protect her. She falls in with a crack dealer and quickly becomes addicted to the drug. When she gets taken by a drug kingpin to settle a debt, only Rick can save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzX64nqljJpL9NgXdvrhN7KMU38.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50295'),
  ('938893409827721035', 'Crack in the World', 1965, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Andrew Marton, Manuel Berenguer, José María Ochoa', 'Jon Manchip White, Julian Zimet', 'Dana Andrews, Janette Scott, Kieron Moore, Alexander Knox, Peter Damon, Sydna Scott, Gary Lasdun, John Karlsen', 'NR', 'Dr. Steven Sorenson plans to tap the geothermal energy of the Earth''s interior by means of a thermonuclear device detonated deep within the Earth. This experiment causes a crack to form and grow within the Earth''s crust, which threatens to split the earth in two if it is not stopped in time.', 'Dr. Steven Sorenson plans to tap the geothermal energy of the Earth''s interior by means of a thermonuclear device detonated deep within the Earth. This experiment causes a crack to form and grow within the Earth''s crust, which threatens to split the earth in two if it is not stopped in time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIzwXn0pU5wjOkzzRvO79gb2KjT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30374'),
  ('28412439911498501', 'Crack-Up', 1936, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Malcolm St. Clair, Barney McGill', 'Charles Kenyon, Sam Mintz', 'Peter Lorre, Brian Donlevy, Helen Wood, Ralph Morgan, Thomas Beck, Kay Linaker, Lester Matthews, Earle Foxe', 'NR', 'Betrayal and espionage abound as an experimental aircraft is readied for its maiden voyage.', 'Betrayal and espionage abound as an experimental aircraft is readied for its maiden voyage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wr2OChqksOGXuMAkutKZxnMZT5X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245372'),
