  ('210471561717349190', 'Cracked Quack', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Daffy Duck takes shelter from a blizzard by sneaking into a cozy home owned by Porky Pig. Daffy tries to secretly mooch off of Porky for an entire winter, but Porky''s dog realizes that Daffy isn''t the stuffed ornament he pretends to be and keeps trying to alert Porky to Daffy''s ruse.', 'Daffy Duck takes shelter from a blizzard by sneaking into a cozy home owned by Porky Pig. Daffy tries to secretly mooch off of Porky for an entire winter, but Porky''s dog realizes that Daffy isn''t the stuffed ornament he pretends to be and keeps trying to alert Porky to Daffy''s ruse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncQRf6Wt65fMnfO99g8DPH2n1Mh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235939'),
