  ('805077097478548243', 'Crackerjack 2', 1997, 'Thriller, Action', 'Robert Lee', 'Chris Hyde', 'Judge Reinhold, Carol Alt, Michael Sarrazin, Karel Roden, Robert Russel, Kateřina Brožová, Richard Toth, Terry Barclay', 'R', 'Police officer Jack Wild discovers that the well-known international terrorist Hans Becker is on a train, carrying a wealthy business man and his girlfriend. Without a second to loose Jack hires a helicopter to drop him down onto the train to try and stop whatever scheme Becker is planning.', 'Police officer Jack Wild discovers that the well-known international terrorist Hans Becker is on a train, carrying a wealthy business man and his girlfriend. Without a second to loose Jack hires a helicopter to drop him down onto the train to try and stop whatever scheme Becker is planning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWy4tMvu142IDmCOGyD5rbeLmWh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90737'),
  ('684929062584538349', 'Crackers', 1984, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Louis Malle, Henry Larrecq, László Kovács', 'Jeffrey Alan Fiskin', 'Donald Sutherland, Jack Warden, Sean Penn, Wallace Shawn, Larry Riley, Trinidad Silva, Christine Baranski, Charlayne Woodard', null, 'Down-and-out Weslake is reduced to minding the counter at a San Francisco pawn shop when he stumbles onto a scheme by some of the boss''s disgruntled misfit clients to rob the place. Rather than blow the whistle, however, he insinuates himself as the heist''s mastermind.', 'Down-and-out Weslake is reduced to minding the counter at a San Francisco pawn shop when he stumbles onto a scheme by some of the boss''s disgruntled misfit clients to rob the place. Rather than blow the whistle, however, he insinuates himself as the heist''s mastermind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AkfLpER2b9gAtOH49z6KnvbxzuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87235'),
