  ('831192616918182226', 'Craig Before the Creek', 2023, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Matt Burnett, Najja Porter, Ben Levin', 'Matt Burnett, Ben Levin', 'Philip Solomon, Noël Wells, H. Michael Croner, Vico Ortiz, Kimberly Hébert Gregory, Byron Marc Newsome, Lucia Cunningham, Phil LaMarr', 'PG', 'Before he was Craig of the Creek, he was just Craig — a new kid in a new town. All Craig wants is to go back to his old friends at his old home. But when he learns that the nearby creek is hiding a lost treasure that could make his wish come true, Craig sets off on a journey to find it — navigating the perilous suburban wilderness, forging new friendships, all while being pursued by a fearsome band of pirates who are bent on destroying the Creek itself.', 'Before he was Craig of the Creek, he was just Craig — a new kid in a new town. All Craig wants is to go back to his old friends at his old home. But when he learns that the nearby creek is hiding a lost treasure that could make his wish come true, Craig sets off on a journey to find it — navigating the perilous suburban wilderness, forging new friendships, all while being pursued by a fearsome band of pirates who are bent on destroying the Creek itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CCNNJyhOxGdSoFuBjWHA1c4HPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928833'),
  ('674179850775446956', 'Craig''s Wife', 1936, 'Drama', 'Dorothy Arzner, Lucien Ballard, Morris Stoloff', 'Mary C. McCall, Jr.', 'Rosalind Russell, John Boles, Billie Burke, Jane Darwell, Dorothy Wilson, Alma Kruger, Thomas Mitchell, Raymond Walburn', 'NR', 'Harriet, Walter Craig''s wife, is an upper-class woman obsessed with control, material possessions and social status whose behavior makes difficult her relationship with domestic service and family members.', 'Harriet, Walter Craig''s wife, is an upper-class woman obsessed with control, material possessions and social status whose behavior makes difficult her relationship with domestic service and family members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30vQfNP0O40izigUrPc0WHffyey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120357'),
  ('675020324819264547', 'Craigslist Joe', 2012, 'Adventure, Documentary', 'Joseph Garner', null, 'Kristos Andrews, Joseph Garner, Gina Keatley, Fran McGee, Tig Notaro, Jeff Richards', null, 'In a time when America''s economy was crumbling and sense of community was in question, one guy left everything behind to see if he could survive solely on the support and goodwill of the 21st century''s new town square: Craigslist.', 'In a time when America''s economy was crumbling and sense of community was in question, one guy left everything behind to see if he could survive solely on the support and goodwill of the 21st century''s new town square: Craigslist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mz1U5yBS0FXlnwHSyvn1KNlRfnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117266'),
  ('134950616865572898', 'Crainquebille', 1922, 'Drama', 'Maurice Forster, Léonce-Henri Burel, Jacques Feyder', 'Jacques Feyder', 'Maurice de Féraudy, Félix Oudart, Jean Forest, Marguerite Carré, Jeanne Cheirel, René Worms, Charles Mosnier, Armand Numès', null, 'Jérôme Crainquebille, is an ageing vegetable seller who has sold groceries from his cart in in Paris for over 40 years. One day, he is harassed by a policeman who insists that he moves on. When he protests, Crainquebille is arrested, supposedly for swearing at the policeman.', 'Jérôme Crainquebille, is an ageing vegetable seller who has sold groceries from his cart in in Paris for over 40 years. One day, he is harassed by a policeman who insists that he moves on. When he protests, Crainquebille is arrested, supposedly for swearing at the policeman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHexVjgfpwRdpyBfECeJ5ZK6OwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66145'),
