  ('713689407096285501', 'Crank', 2006, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Brian Taylor, Mark Neveldine, Adam Biddle', 'Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor', 'Jason Statham, Amy Smart, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Efren Ramirez, Dwight Yoakam, Carlos Sanz, Reno Wilson, Edi Gathegi', 'R', 'Chev Chelios, a hit man wanting to go straight, lets his latest target slip away. Then he awakes the next morning to a phone call that informs him he has been poisoned and has only an hour to live unless he keeps adrenaline coursing through his body while he searches for an antidote.', 'Chev Chelios, a hit man wanting to go straight, lets his latest target slip away. Then he awakes the next morning to a phone call that informs him he has been poisoned and has only an hour to live unless he keeps adrenaline coursing through his body while he searches for an antidote.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsKmhnvzJezjwC1Ud2Hh37oNpdQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1948'),
  ('208854270784022824', 'Crank: High Voltage', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor, Juana Franklin', 'Mark Neveldine, Brian Taylor', 'Jason Statham, Amy Smart, Dwight Yoakam, Efren Ramirez, Julanne Chidi Hill, Jose Pablo Cantillo, Reno Wilson, Keone Young', 'R', 'Chelios faces a Chinese mobster who has stolen his nearly indestructible heart and replaced it with a battery-powered ticker that requires regular jolts of electricity to keep working.', 'Chelios faces a Chinese mobster who has stolen his nearly indestructible heart and replaced it with a battery-powered ticker that requires regular jolts of electricity to keep working.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tzTC4EEvF0OPL63frEiogxL2T8M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15092'),
  ('303706581363481915', 'Cranston Academy: Monster Zone', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy, Horror', 'Francisco Herrera Carrillo, Leopoldo Aguilar', 'Bob Barlen, Cal Brunker', 'Jamie Bell, Ruby Rose, Idzi Dutkiewicz, Ellie Piercy, Terry Mynott, Ryan Samson, Ellie Pierce, Bianca Hendrickse', 'PG', 'An intelligent 15-year-old high school student is unexpectedly transferred to a boarding school where he opens a portal of monsters from another dimension.', 'An intelligent 15-year-old high school student is unexpectedly transferred to a boarding school where he opens a portal of monsters from another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIhtLxiBhGHiSXSVJ1FzUrAuKCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627661'),
  ('367797561604091480', 'Crash', 2005, 'Drama', 'Paul Haggis, J. Michael Muro, Dylan Goss', 'Paul Haggis, Bobby Moresco', 'Don Cheadle, Sandra Bullock, Brendan Fraser, Matt Dillon, Jennifer Esposito, Michael Peña, Terrence Howard, Thandiwe Newton', 'R', 'In post-Sept. 11 Los Angeles, tensions erupt when the lives of a Brentwood housewife, her district attorney husband, a Persian shopkeeper, two cops, a pair of carjackers and a Korean couple converge during a 36-hour period.', 'In post-Sept. 11 Los Angeles, tensions erupt when the lives of a Brentwood housewife, her district attorney husband, a Persian shopkeeper, two cops, a pair of carjackers and a Korean couple converge during a 36-hour period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86BdPC6RDX88NC880pLidKn2LCj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1640'),
  ('1030585773249214190', 'Crash and Burn', 1990, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action, Horror', 'Charles Band, Michael Cardone, Karin Liebrand', 'J.S. Cardone', 'Paul Ganus, Megan Ward, Ralph Waite, Bill Moseley, Eva LaRue, Jack McGee, Elizabeth Maclellan, Katherine Armstrong', 'R', 'Unicom is a powerful organization overseeing most of the world after its economic collapse. They have banned computers and robots in an attempt to insure "life, liberty, and the pursuit of economic stability". When a Unicom Synth robot infiltrates a southwest TV station and kills the manager, a revolutionary against the gestapo-like corporation, a lowly Unicom delivery man must help the rest of the station survive through the incoming "thermal storm".', 'Unicom is a powerful organization overseeing most of the world after its economic collapse. They have banned computers and robots in an attempt to insure "life, liberty, and the pursuit of economic stability". When a Unicom Synth robot infiltrates a southwest TV station and kills the manager, a revolutionary against the gestapo-like corporation, a lowly Unicom delivery man must help the rest of the station survive through the incoming "thermal storm".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5tysnCndwYJ6I7D8lw1lHdD3AsF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24862'),
  ('272733488032786443', 'Crash Dive', 1943, 'War, Romance, Drama, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Archie Mayo, Leon Shamroy', 'Jo Swerling', 'Tyrone Power, Anne Baxter, Dana Andrews, James Gleason, May Whitty, Harry Morgan, Ben Carter, Stanley Andrews', 'NR', 'A US Navy submarine, the USS Corsair, is operating in the North Atlantic, hunting German merchant raiders that are preying on Allied shipping. Its new executive officer, Lt. Ward Stewart, has been transferred back into submarines after commanding his own PT boat. At the submarine base in New London, Connecticut, he asks his new captain, Lt. Cmdr. Dewey Connors, for a weekend leave to settle his affairs before taking up his new assignment. On a train bound for Washington D.C., Stewart accidentally encounters New London school teacher Jean Hewlett and her students. Despite her initial resistance to his efforts, he charms her and they fall in love.', 'A US Navy submarine, the USS Corsair, is operating in the North Atlantic, hunting German merchant raiders that are preying on Allied shipping. Its new executive officer, Lt. Ward Stewart, has been transferred back into submarines after commanding his own PT boat. At the submarine base in New London, Connecticut, he asks his new captain, Lt. Cmdr. Dewey Connors, for a weekend leave to settle his affairs before taking up his new assignment. On a train bound for Washington D.C., Stewart accidentally encounters New London school teacher Jean Hewlett and her students. Despite her initial resistance to his efforts, he charms her and they fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iiHO2RKRQXLT2FJeHwBOGrgoStX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74012'),
  ('477435062885899929', 'Crash Dive', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andrew Stevens, Michael Slovis', 'William C. Martell', 'Michael Dudikoff, Frederic Forrest, Reiner Schöne, Jay Acovone, Clay Greenbush, Catherine Bell, Michael Cavanaugh, Cyrus Farmer', null, 'The crew of the nuclear submarine USS Ulysses rescues supposed victims of a boat disaster, but the victims turn out to be terrorists intent on capturing nuclear weapons aboard the sub. Only a former SEAL, now a submarine consultant, can save the crew by sliding aboard while the sub is underwater. The term "crash dive" refers to the sudden dropping of a sub to escape detection, an act that a nuclear sub is never supposed to make. Of course, it comes into play in this film.', 'The crew of the nuclear submarine USS Ulysses rescues supposed victims of a boat disaster, but the victims turn out to be terrorists intent on capturing nuclear weapons aboard the sub. Only a former SEAL, now a submarine consultant, can save the crew by sliding aboard while the sub is underwater. The term "crash dive" refers to the sudden dropping of a sub to escape detection, an act that a nuclear sub is never supposed to make. Of course, it comes into play in this film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIlvyDLiQbEpBa75FQpALoePT79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160019'),
  ('444540338530325343', 'Crash Goes the Hash', 1944, 'Comedy', 'Jules White', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Bud Jamison, Vernon Dent, Dick Curtis, Judy Malcolm, Symona Boniface', 'NR', 'Its suspected that a society matron, Mrs. Van Bustle, will marry the exotic Prince Shaam. To get the story, reporters Curly, Larry and Moe take jobs in her mansion as a cook and two butlers. The parrot climbing into the turkey scene is a Stooge classic. This was the last of many Stooge appearances by supporting actor Bud Jamison, who passed away in September, 1944, at the age of 50. First appearance by Stooge supporting actress Judy Malcolm.', 'Its suspected that a society matron, Mrs. Van Bustle, will marry the exotic Prince Shaam. To get the story, reporters Curly, Larry and Moe take jobs in her mansion as a cook and two butlers. The parrot climbing into the turkey scene is a Stooge classic. This was the last of many Stooge appearances by supporting actor Bud Jamison, who passed away in September, 1944, at the age of 50. First appearance by Stooge supporting actress Judy Malcolm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oOD0KvvOSqbxKsecTOvxv8Ke9u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116078'),
  ('217637635652316333', 'Crash Landing', 2006, 'Action', 'Jim Wynorski, Andrea V. Rossotto, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Paul A. Birkett, William Langlois, Jim Wynorski', 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Michael Paré, Brianne Davis, Kevin Dobson, Rene Rivera, Mercedes Colon, Patrick St. Esprit, John Beck', 'NR', 'When a hostage situation arises on-board a private plane with the daughter of a billionaire on-board. Major John Masters (Sabato Jr.) teams up with Captain Williams (Michael Paré) to stop the terrorist and land the plane.', 'When a hostage situation arises on-board a private plane with the daughter of a billionaire on-board. Major John Masters (Sabato Jr.) teams up with Captain Williams (Michael Paré) to stop the terrorist and land the plane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sT9qrEC357bH0kooCGAxrUQiTvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86254'),
  ('190160903459257483', 'Crash Landing: The Rescue of Flight 232', 1992, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Lamont Johnson, Jerry Grandey, William Wages', 'Harve Bennett', 'Charlton Heston, Richard Thomas, James Coburn, Leon Russom, John M. Jackson, Tom O''Brien, Philip Baker Hall, Tom Everett', null, 'Authentic drama of United Airlines flight 232 from Denver to Chicago. The DC-10 crashed during an emergency landing at Sioux City Gateway Airport on July 19, 1989. 184 people survived, partly thanks to the ground rescue workers who had 40 minutes to prepare for the event', 'Authentic drama of United Airlines flight 232 from Denver to Chicago. The DC-10 crashed during an emergency landing at Sioux City Gateway Airport on July 19, 1989. 184 people survived, partly thanks to the ground rescue workers who had 40 minutes to prepare for the event', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KPcSdAWvnuvMHFNnkka76Y964a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127361'),
  ('97706118678733922', 'Crash of Moons', 1954, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Hollingsworth Morse, Guy Roe, Dick Moder', 'Warren Wilson', 'Richard Crane, Scotty Beckett, Sally Mansfield, Robert Lyden, Maurice Cass, Charles Meredith, Patsy Parsons, Harry Lauter', 'NR', 'A three-part episode from the TV series Rocky Jones, Space Ranger edited together and released as a feature for 16mm rental only. Season 1 episodes 21, 22, 23. Episode 21: Rocky saves a space station and his friends when they are trapped between gypsy moons. Episode 22: Cleolanthe tries to destroy one of the gypsy moons with a barrage of missiles. Episode 23: Rocky evacuates the gypsy moon Posetta and stops Cleolanthe''s missile barrage.', 'A three-part episode from the TV series Rocky Jones, Space Ranger edited together and released as a feature for 16mm rental only. Season 1 episodes 21, 22, 23. Episode 21: Rocky saves a space station and his friends when they are trapped between gypsy moons. Episode 22: Cleolanthe tries to destroy one of the gypsy moons with a barrage of missiles. Episode 23: Rocky evacuates the gypsy moon Posetta and stops Cleolanthe''s missile barrage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ItQQY9H03fNDwWHlYWcCxvH5BC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89998'),
  ('608015457562332932', 'Crash Pad', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Seamus Tierney, Jody Ryan, Paula Antil', 'Jeremy Catalino', 'Domhnall Gleeson, Christina Applegate, Thomas Haden Church, Nina Dobrev, Dan Gill, Britt Irvin, Anna Van Hooft, Balinder Johal', 'R', 'Hopeless romantic Stensland thinks he''s found true love with an older woman, Morgan, only to learn that she''s married and that their fling is merely an instrument of revenge against her neglectful husband, Grady. Initially out for blood, Grady finds himself strangely sympathetic to Stensland''s plight and decides to get revenge on his wife instead.', 'Hopeless romantic Stensland thinks he''s found true love with an older woman, Morgan, only to learn that she''s married and that their fling is merely an instrument of revenge against her neglectful husband, Grady. Initially out for blood, Grady finds himself strangely sympathetic to Stensland''s plight and decides to get revenge on his wife instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zyZkoztIEPpFJfkFSL3o5CG5NqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390053'),
  ('762671784426591332', 'Crash Point: Berlin', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Thomas Jauch, Peter Krause', 'Marc Hillefeld, Bettina Platz', 'Peter Haber, Maximilian von Pufendorf, Hannes Jaenicke, Bernadette Heerwagen, Julia Hartmann, Devid Striesow, Horst Sachtleben, Petra Kelling', null, 'After a mid-air collision, an uncontrollable passenger plane with 90 souls on board speeds through the skies over Germany. The impact point for the inevitable plane crash is easily calculated: the center of Berlin. Now the race is on to prevent the catastrophe. Will the plane have to be shot down by fighter pilots?', 'After a mid-air collision, an uncontrollable passenger plane with 90 souls on board speeds through the skies over Germany. The impact point for the inevitable plane crash is easily calculated: the center of Berlin. Now the race is on to prevent the catastrophe. Will the plane have to be shot down by fighter pilots?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVdROAfyWlm2zBPO412kKL3LaDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86760'),
  ('1085529820465366913', 'Crash Test Aglae', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Eric Gravel, Gilles Piquard', 'Eric Gravel', 'India Hair, Julie Depardieu, Yolande Moreau, Anne Charrier, Frédérique Bel, Tristán Ulloa, Adil Hussain, Hanns Zischler', null, 'Aglaé, a young factory worker, has only one focus in life: her job at a car crash test site. When she learns that the factory is going to be relocated abroad, she accepts, to everyone''s surprise, to go to India in order to hold on to her job. Accompanied by two colleagues, she sets out on a perilous road trip to the other side of the world.', 'Aglaé, a young factory worker, has only one focus in life: her job at a car crash test site. When she learns that the factory is going to be relocated abroad, she accepts, to everyone''s surprise, to go to India in order to hold on to her job. Accompanied by two colleagues, she sets out on a perilous road trip to the other side of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wPNgdZQsv4oXc2hAK3fkQyYDFq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456768'),
  ('696719584176168503', 'Crash!', 1971, 'Drama', 'Harley Cokeliss', 'J.G. Ballard', 'J.G. Ballard, Gabrielle Drake', null, 'A surreal, moody short about the fetishisation of automobiles and auto accidents.', 'A surreal, moody short about the fetishisation of automobiles and auto accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1pP9PUouyFyN9dgkCeUwCfPz1YI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:275023'),
  ('292923991656692843', 'Crash!', 1976, 'Horror', 'Charles Band, Andrew Davis, Bill Williams', 'Marc Marais', 'José Ferrer, Sue Lyon, John Ericson, Leslie Parrish, John Carradine, Jerome Guardino, Richard Band, Gary Baxley', 'PG', 'After a professor is crippled in a car accident, he blames his wife for the ordeal and attempts to have her killed using the same means. Now hospitalized with amnesia, she appears to be protected by a tiny voodoo trinket that she still clutches in her hand, which possesses her car and other objects, causing mayhem throughout the city.', 'After a professor is crippled in a car accident, he blames his wife for the ordeal and attempts to have her killed using the same means. Now hospitalized with amnesia, she appears to be protected by a tiny voodoo trinket that she still clutches in her hand, which possesses her car and other objects, causing mayhem throughout the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qKKtcrI4v4aXNxHR1XqodH6H0Ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114013'),
  ('672966321858759770', 'Crashing Through the Snow', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Rich Newey, Diana Kim, Paul Suderman', 'Tamar Laddy', 'Amy Acker, Warren Christie, Summer H. Howell, Erik Athavale, Kristian Bruun, Andrea del Campo, Brooke Nevin, Myla Volk', 'G', 'Maggie and Sam are crashing Christmas. When he proposes they team up against his sister''s perfect Christmas, neither of them are prepared for the blended family challenges that lie ahead.', 'Maggie and Sam are crashing Christmas. When he proposes they team up against his sister''s perfect Christmas, neither of them are prepared for the blended family challenges that lie ahead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4biEo7gMRiDP50efRtc8Hft6zys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:840372'),
  ('434891738759843886', 'Crashout', 1955, 'Crime', 'Russell Metty, Lewis R. Foster', 'Lewis R. Foster, Hal E. Chester', 'William Bendix, Arthur Kennedy, Luther Adler, William Talman, Gene Evans, Marshall Thompson, Beverly Michaels, Gloria Talbott', 'NR', 'Convict Van Duff engineers a large-scale prison break; the six survivors hide out in a forgotten mine working near the prison, then set out on a long, dangerous journey by foot, car, train and truck to retrieve Duff''s bank loot. En route, as they touch the lives of "regular folks," each has his own rendezvous with destiny.', 'Convict Van Duff engineers a large-scale prison break; the six survivors hide out in a forgotten mine working near the prison, then set out on a long, dangerous journey by foot, car, train and truck to retrieve Duff''s bank loot. En route, as they touch the lives of "regular folks," each has his own rendezvous with destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dT2gRySinIJHfXlzdj2TX6n2gqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34147'),
  ('968961547936015789', 'Crater', 2018, 'Drama', 'Silvia Luzi, Luca Bellino, Luca Bellino', 'Luca Bellino, Silvia Luzi', 'Sharon Caroccia, Rosario Caroccia, Tina Amariutei, Assunta Arcella, Imma Benvenuto, Eros Caroccia, Mariaelianna Caroccia, Rosario Junior Caroccia', null, 'The Crater is a land of underdogs, indistinct space, constant noise. Rosario is a street vendor, a gitane of village fairs, who gives away soft toys to whoever draws a winning number. The war he has declared against his own destiny has the immature and indolent body of his thirteen-year-old daughter: Sharon is pretty and can sing, and in this hotbed of stopgaps and desperate living, she’s his weapon for survival. But success becomes an obsession, and talent becomes a punishment.', 'The Crater is a land of underdogs, indistinct space, constant noise. Rosario is a street vendor, a gitane of village fairs, who gives away soft toys to whoever draws a winning number. The war he has declared against his own destiny has the immature and indolent body of his thirteen-year-old daughter: Sharon is pretty and can sing, and in this hotbed of stopgaps and desperate living, she’s his weapon for survival. But success becomes an obsession, and talent becomes a punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NjlMzoAQ0ScWNZ08KWzFxl7YN6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475862'),
  ('105808184162151691', 'Crater', 2023, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Family', 'Jas Shelton, Dave Macomber, Dan Majkut', 'John Griffin', 'Isaiah Russell-Bailey, Mckenna Grace, Billy Barratt, Orson Hong, Thomas Boyce, Kid Cudi, Selenis Leyva, Hero Hunter', 'PG', 'After the death of his father, a boy growing up on a lunar mining colony takes a trip to explore a legendary crater, along with his four best friends, prior to being permanently relocated to another planet.', 'After the death of his father, a boy growing up on a lunar mining colony takes a trip to explore a legendary crater, along with his four best friends, prior to being permanently relocated to another planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8ZpMwYT02XjpQHpSxn1eJw5Zpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620705'),
  ('1034534761723502245', 'Craving Desire', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sergio Martino, Gianni Costantino, Giandomenico Trillo', 'Sergio Martino, Maurizio Rasio', 'Vittoria Belvedere, Ron Nummi, Simona Borioni, Riccardo Parisio Perrotti, Viviana Polic, Barbara Cavallari, Serena Bennato, Antonio Ferrante', null, 'Luigi, who is engaged to a rich bourgeois, Cinzia, meets his lovely cousin, Sonia, at the cremation of their grandmother. Six months later, Sonia moves in and enters his life, and gradually succeeds in seducing him. Sonia upsets his life. Now, Cinzia is jealous but he can not resist the seductress.', 'Luigi, who is engaged to a rich bourgeois, Cinzia, meets his lovely cousin, Sonia, at the cremation of their grandmother. Six months later, Sonia moves in and enters his life, and gradually succeeds in seducing him. Sonia upsets his life. Now, Cinzia is jealous but he can not resist the seductress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b79ozXY3NkPauD33xcdxm3s7yoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110143'),
  ('845504789298421209', 'Crawl', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Anton Brand, Alexandre Aja, Christopher Landry', 'Shawn Rasmussen, Michael Rasmussen', 'Kaya Scodelario, Barry Pepper, Morfydd Clark, Ross Anderson, Jose Palma, George Somner, Anson Boon, Ami Metcalf', 'R', 'When a huge hurricane hits her hometown in Florida, Haley ignores evacuation orders to look for her father. After finding him badly wounded, both are trapped by the flood. With virtually no time to escape the storm, they discover that rising water levels are the least of their problems.', 'When a huge hurricane hits her hometown in Florida, Haley ignores evacuation orders to look for her father. After finding him badly wounded, both are trapped by the flood. With virtually no time to escape the storm, they discover that rising water levels are the least of their problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WH6AZd473lRZ3hUp8TYiv2LfZW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:511987'),
  ('802251184945961396', 'Crawl or Die', 2014, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Oklahoma Ward', 'Oklahoma Ward', 'Nicole Alonso, Torey Byrne, Tommy Ball, Wil Crown, David Paul Baker, Tom Chamberlain, Clayton Burgess', 'R', 'Earth as we know it is gone. A virus has destroyed the planet and rendered all its women infertile, all but one. An elite team of soldiers are tasked with bringing the woman to safety on the newly habitable Earth Two. But when they are forced underground they find themselves fighting for survival from an bloodthirsty creature in a maze of ever shrinking tunnels. As the team''s ranks start to dwindle, the tunnels shrink and the ammunition run out, the crawl for survival becomes more and more desperate.', 'Earth as we know it is gone. A virus has destroyed the planet and rendered all its women infertile, all but one. An elite team of soldiers are tasked with bringing the woman to safety on the newly habitable Earth Two. But when they are forced underground they find themselves fighting for survival from an bloodthirsty creature in a maze of ever shrinking tunnels. As the team''s ranks start to dwindle, the tunnels shrink and the ammunition run out, the crawl for survival becomes more and more desperate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5KGwSbuyyAxnEEaPlmnBa9sIzSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286657'),
  ('1035127154435803785', 'Crawlers', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'James Kniest, Brandon Zuck, Joshua Fruehling', null, 'Giorgia Whigham, Pepi Sonuga, Cameron Fuller, Olivia Liang, Jude Demorest, Zachary Roozen, David Carzell, Virginia Louise Smith', 'NR', 'On Saint Patrick''s day—a night of wild parties and drunken revelry—three unlikely friends band together to save a college town from a vicious horde of body-snatching aliens.', 'On Saint Patrick''s day—a night of wild parties and drunken revelry—three unlikely friends band together to save a college town from a vicious horde of body-snatching aliens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p21gW49vIj9hjuitReZ0Xue9OJi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680734'),
  ('191954202896625984', 'Crawlspace', 1972, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Buzz Kulik, John Newland, Urs Furrer', 'Ernest Kinoy', 'Arthur Kennedy, Teresa Wright, Tom Happer, Eugene Roche, Matthew Cowles, Dan Morgan, Roger Serbagi, Fleet Emerson', null, 'A childless middle-age couple adopt a troubled youth they find living in their crawlspace and attempt to get him to rejoin society with tragic results.', 'A childless middle-age couple adopt a troubled youth they find living in their crawlspace and attempt to get him to rejoin society with tragic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Sx8runR8lkgPAPjXTYZVTKJA6i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98219'),
  ('904978830790529086', 'Crawlspace', 1986, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Schmoeller, Sergio Salvati', 'David Schmoeller', 'Klaus Kinski, Talia Balsam, Barbara Whinnery, Carole Francis, Tane McClure, Sally Brown, Jack Heller, David Abbott', 'R', 'A man who runs an apartment house for women is the demented son of a Nazi surgeon who has the house equipped with secret passageways, hidden rooms and torture and murder devices.', 'A man who runs an apartment house for women is the demented son of a Nazi surgeon who has the house equipped with secret passageways, hidden rooms and torture and murder devices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzrHUY2aksJcLGchBkLg6fTFgI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56705'),
  ('660923064593441994', 'Crawlspace', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Mystery, Thriller', 'Nathan Hart, Justin Dix, Nathan Croft', 'Eddie Baroo, Justin Dix, Adam Patrick Foster', 'Amber Clayton, Eddie Baroo, Justin Batchelor, Nicholas Bell, John Brumpton, Ditch Davey, Leslie Simpson, Fletcher Humphrys', 'NR', 'A group of elite soldiers sent to infiltrate and extract the lead science team from Pine Gap, Australia''s top secret underground military compound, after it comes under attack from unknown forces. The mission is compromised when they encounter a young woman with no memory of who she is or how she came to be there. As they try to escape, the group quickly discovers all is not as it seems and the facility has become a testing ground for something far more sinister.', 'A group of elite soldiers sent to infiltrate and extract the lead science team from Pine Gap, Australia''s top secret underground military compound, after it comes under attack from unknown forces. The mission is compromised when they encounter a young woman with no memory of who she is or how she came to be there. As they try to escape, the group quickly discovers all is not as it seems and the facility has become a testing ground for something far more sinister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bO7buGzOASNZIhM994zChemLzml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138496'),
  ('679821333348971693', 'Crawlspace', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Scott McClellan, L. Gustavo Cooper', 'Jacob D. Wehrman', 'Henry Thomas, Bradley Stryker, C. Ernst Harth, Jennifer Robertson, Olivia Taylor Dudley, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Joe Costa, Colin Decker', 'R', 'After witnessing a brutal murder in a cabin, a man hides in a crawlspace while the killers scour the property for a hidden fortune. As they draw nearer, he must decide if the crawlspace will be his tomb or the battleground in his fight for survival.', 'After witnessing a brutal murder in a cabin, a man hides in a crawlspace while the killers scour the property for a hidden fortune. As they draw nearer, he must decide if the crawlspace will be his tomb or the battleground in his fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yZVByCjWvKdSWcYLacoFmnOoSpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879538'),
  ('149005092581318104', 'Crayon Shin-chan the Movie: Our Dinosaur Diary', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Shinobu Sasaki, Hideo Harigaya, Katsunori Hara', 'Moral', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Takumi Kitamura', null, 'Follow the friendship between the Nobara family''s pet dog Shiro and a "small dinosaur". Their connection helps the growth of Shinnosuke and the Kusakabe Defense Squad.', 'Follow the friendship between the Nobara family''s pet dog Shiro and a "small dinosaur". Their connection helps the growth of Shinnosuke and the Kusakabe Defense Squad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n7YcOeqPOmvQ2PUatn4UqV5YStj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221404'),
  ('744870115017538464', 'Crayon Shin-chan the Movie: Super Hot! The Spicy Kasukabe Dancers', 2025, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Masakazu Hashimoto, Akira Ookuma, Toshiyuki Umeda', 'Kimiko Ueno', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Show Hayami', null, 'Shin-chan and his friends travel to India for a dance festival, but Bo-chan accidentally becomes possessed by an evil force from a mysterious backpack and turns into a powerful tyrant. Now, the Kasukabe Guard must work together to save Bo-chan and stop his rampage.', 'Shin-chan and his friends travel to India for a dance festival, but Bo-chan accidentally becomes possessed by an evil force from a mysterious backpack and turns into a powerful tyrant. Now, the Kasukabe Guard must work together to save Bo-chan and stop his rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bxLr3VzoSq0G4CSWUCnZBNS8Eeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1404404'),
  ('532171191288759355', 'Crayon Shin-chan the Movie: The Tornado Legend of Ninja Mononoke', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Masakazu Hashimoto, Takatoshi Omori, Yuichiro Sueyoshi', 'Masakazu Hashimoto, Kimiko Ueno', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Chie Sato', null, 'One day, a woman named Chiyome Hesogakure with a child named Chinzō visits the Nohara family and claims that she is the real mother of Shinnosuke and takes him away to a Ninja Village. In the Ninja Village, the Hesogakure family has been protecting "the earth''s navel" by blocking it with a pure gold stopper using the "Mononoke technique" that has been passed down from generation. If it comes off, the earth will wither, the rotation will stop, and the "tomorrow" of the world will be lost! It is up to Shinnosuke to reveal the mystery of his birth and protect the future of the earth and the "tomorrow" of his family.', 'One day, a woman named Chiyome Hesogakure with a child named Chinzō visits the Nohara family and claims that she is the real mother of Shinnosuke and takes him away to a Ninja Village. In the Ninja Village, the Hesogakure family has been protecting "the earth''s navel" by blocking it with a pure gold stopper using the "Mononoke technique" that has been passed down from generation. If it comes off, the earth will wither, the rotation will stop, and the "tomorrow" of the world will be lost! It is up to Shinnosuke to reveal the mystery of his birth and protect the future of the earth and the "tomorrow" of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyYfIWUtetlfxor8ibugKXthdKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955666'),
  ('777791529015875787', 'Crayon Shin-chan: A Storm-Invoking Jungle', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Keiichi Hara, Toshiyuki Umeda, Katsunori Hara', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tessyo Genda, Akio Otsuka', null, 'The Noharas go on an Action Mask-themed cruise, where all the grown-ups get kidnapped by a gang of monkeys. It''s up to the kids to rescue them!', 'The Noharas go on an Action Mask-themed cruise, where all the grown-ups get kidnapped by a gang of monkeys. It''s up to the kids to rescue them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rv5BVa21vCut8rlYKY1Ozo4cPRD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117087'),
  ('298492965187466092', 'Crayon Shin-chan: A Storm-invoking Splendor! The Battle of the Warring States', 2002, 'Animation', 'Keiichi Hara, Toshiyuki Umeda, Katsunori Hara', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Yusaku Yara, Ai Kobayashi, Hisao Egawa', null, 'Shin-chan somehow travels back in time, where he promptly involves himself in samurai wars and political intrigue, changing history left and right!', 'Shin-chan somehow travels back in time, where he promptly involves himself in samurai wars and political intrigue, changing history left and right!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYG4cpmMktwob8cNwGYpXmwYPP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117084'),
  ('1061186099454320732', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Action Mask vs. Leotard Devil', 1993, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Mitsuru Hongo, Noriyuki Tsutsumi, Hideko Takahashi', 'Ryo Motohira', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Chafurin, Chie Sato, Daisuke Gori, Etsuko Kozakura, Hisako Kyoda', 'G', 'Everyone''s favorite TV superhero Action Mask shows up in Kasukabe, and he''s trying to get something from Shin-chan -- but what could it be?', 'Everyone''s favorite TV superhero Action Mask shows up in Kasukabe, and he''s trying to get something from Shin-chan -- but what could it be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9GzmjFn1iosYdKn7DPnClK8ezrE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128868'),
  ('937974181148667757', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Burst Serving! Kung Fu Boys ~Ramen Rebellion~', 2018, 'Comedy, Adventure, Animation', 'Yuichiro Sueyoshi, Katsunori Hara, Hideo Harigaya', 'Kimiko Ueno', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Satomi Korogi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Chie Sato', 'G', 'Shin-chan is all set to challenge Kung Fu in the Chinatown of Kasukabe city, known as Aiyā Town. He and the Kasukabe Defence Force are going to put up a totally no-stunt Kung Fu challenge on the stage.', 'Shin-chan is all set to challenge Kung Fu in the Chinatown of Kasukabe city, known as Aiyā Town. He and the Kasukabe Defence Force are going to put up a totally no-stunt Kung Fu challenge on the stage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWv5pUwyf96MDImATZYx0toI7T7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507562'),
  ('798212522554039168', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Crash! Scribble Kingdom and Almost Four Heroes', 2020, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Toshiyuki Umeda, Takatoshi Omori, Hideo Harigaya', 'Ryo Takada, Takahiko Kyougoku', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Tessyo Genda, Kyary Pamyu Pamyu, Mina Tominaga, Shizuka Itoh, Tomoyo Kurosawa, Tamao Hayashi, Jouji Nakata', null, 'The kingdom that floats above in the sky, that uses free doodles as an energy source, “Rakuga Kingdom.” However, now in the face of a lack in energy, they are on the brink of ruin. In order to force the creation of doodles, the kingdom’s army begins its attack on Kasukabe on the surface! Meanwhile, as the drawings begin to move, the hero who is bestowed the hidden treasure of the kingdom, the “Miracle Crayon”—is none other than the “super happy-go-lucky 5-year-old,” Nohara Shinnosuke!! Together as the “Almost Four Heroes,” Shinnosuke and the drawn doodles try to take back Kasukabe! Amongst that, they discover the weakness of the doodles, where they dissolve upon contact with water! To make matters worse, a raincloud that looks to start pouring at any moment hovers above… What awaits their encounter with the doodles and the end of their adventure—will it be smiles, or tears!?', 'The kingdom that floats above in the sky, that uses free doodles as an energy source, “Rakuga Kingdom.” However, now in the face of a lack in energy, they are on the brink of ruin. In order to force the creation of doodles, the kingdom’s army begins its attack on Kasukabe on the surface! Meanwhile, as the drawings begin to move, the hero who is bestowed the hidden treasure of the kingdom, the “Miracle Crayon”—is none other than the “super happy-go-lucky 5-year-old,” Nohara Shinnosuke!! Together as the “Almost Four Heroes,” Shinnosuke and the drawn doodles try to take back Kasukabe! Amongst that, they discover the weakness of the doodles, where they dissolve upon contact with water! To make matters worse, a raincloud that looks to start pouring at any moment hovers above… What awaits their encounter with the doodles and the end of their adventure—will it be smiles, or tears!?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qcaJphCRI9jOfNPWw0I1L6CY3bk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:731249'),
  ('1058507346399904667', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Dengeki! Buta no Hizume Daisakusen', 1998, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Keiichi Hara, Toshiyuki Umeda, Noriyuki Tsutsumi', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Tessyo Genda, Kotono Mitsuishi, Koichi Yamadera, Show Hayami', null, 'It all begins when a secret agent hiding in the ship where dinner Futaba school students. The Pig Hoof follow and take the boat with her, Shin Chan and his friends on board. From there, Shin Chan, Masao, Nene, Kazama and Boo Chan van with Agent everywhere as their hostages.', 'It all begins when a secret agent hiding in the ship where dinner Futaba school students. The Pig Hoof follow and take the boat with her, Shin Chan and his friends on board. From there, Shin Chan, Masao, Nene, Kazama and Boo Chan van with Agent everywhere as their hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j8Z2iPQVavtZvtQW9a8Yy0vb9Ri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128875'),
  ('159581937100461766', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Explosion! The Hot Spring''s Feel Good Final Battle', 1999, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Keiichi Hara', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Shinji Ogawa, Yumi Hikita, Yukari Tamura, Iemasa Kayumi', null, 'There''s only one way to stop a filthy evil scientist from destroying the world, and it''s with a powerful hot spring located under Shin-chan''s house!', 'There''s only one way to stop a filthy evil scientist from destroying the world, and it''s with a powerful hot spring located under Shin-chan''s house!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buQjzchKfrbKioiptk22y2TQNSj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128878'),
  ('966856531681910936', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Fast Asleep! Dreaming World Big Assault!', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Wataru Takahashi, Katsunori Hara, Yuichiro Sueyoshi', 'Wataru Takahashi, Gekidan Hitori', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Chie Sato, Haruhi Nanao', 'G', 'One night, the Nohara family were enjoying a pleasant dream, when suddenly a big fish appeared in their dreams and ate them. The next morning, Hiroshi read in the newspaper that everybody in another town had the same nightmare as him, but it seemed to have ended. But Hiroshi also heard the same dream from Misae, Shinnosuke, Himawari and even Shiro. They were surprised and thought if the same thing is happening in Kasukabe too. In kindergarten, on telling others about his nightmare, Shinnosuke was surprised to know that everybody too had the same dream. Then a mysterious girl named Saki was transferred to Futaba Kindergarten and joined Shinnosuke''s class. Everyone in the class, including the rather inactive Bo-chan, were all excited and happy on seeing her. But Saki had a cold attitude and didn''t get along well.', 'One night, the Nohara family were enjoying a pleasant dream, when suddenly a big fish appeared in their dreams and ate them. The next morning, Hiroshi read in the newspaper that everybody in another town had the same nightmare as him, but it seemed to have ended. But Hiroshi also heard the same dream from Misae, Shinnosuke, Himawari and even Shiro. They were surprised and thought if the same thing is happening in Kasukabe too. In kindergarten, on telling others about his nightmare, Shinnosuke was surprised to know that everybody too had the same dream. Then a mysterious girl named Saki was transferred to Futaba Kindergarten and joined Shinnosuke''s class. Everyone in the class, including the rather inactive Bo-chan, were all excited and happy on seeing her. But Saki had a cold attitude and didn''t get along well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKuyrnlm3x3dF8DY43IZWQpUFDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424656'),
  ('151462273128688039', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Fierceness That Invites Storm! Operation Golden Spy', 2011, 'Animation', 'Soichi Masui, Akira Ookuma, Toshiyuki Umeda', 'Kyo Kogure', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Rikako Aikawa, Tomo Sakurai, Kenyu Horiuchi, Fubito Yamano', 'G', 'A girl named Lemon arrives with a message for Shinnosuke, and he starts training as an action spy. But can he foil double agents and secret plots?', 'A girl named Lemon arrives with a message for Shinnosuke, and he starts training as an action spy. But can he foil double agents and secret plots?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXorDERG6ARfayQwKNCC4d37OWd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163754'),
  ('28473183533440530', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Great Adventure In Henderland', 1996, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mitsuru Hongo, Katsunori Hara, Noriyuki Tsutsumi', 'Mitsuru Hongo, Keiichi Hara', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Yuriko Fuchizaki, Hochu Otsuka, Hideyuki Tanaka, Akiko Hinagata', null, 'The Futaba Kindergarten kids are so excited for their trip to the Henderland amusement park, but Shin-chan soon learns there are evil forces at play!', 'The Futaba Kindergarten kids are so excited for their trip to the Henderland amusement park, but Shin-chan soon learns there are evil forces at play!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRUkRelMJSvbNxIin1ZlKIr7zaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128871'),
  ('1078973472087319094', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Honeymoon Hurricane ~The Lost Hiroshi~', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Yuichiro Sueyoshi, Hidetoshi Ōmori, Katsunori Hara', 'Kimiko Ueno, Munenori Mizuno', 'Yumiko Kobayashi, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Chie Sato, Hochu Otsuka', null, 'Hiroshi and Misae have never been to a honeymoon trip to a foreign country. One day, Misae discovered an inexpensive and family-friendly holiday package to Australia and the Nohara family decided to make it their first honeymoon vacation. Hiroshi gets kidnapped upon arrival to Australia, leaving Shinnosuke, Misae and others on a dangerous journey. It turns out that Hiroshi is the key to a secret treasure. The remaining members of the Nohara Family must rescue Hiroshi, while a mysterious masked man and treasure hunters from all over the world are after him. The struggle is among three different groups in this action-filled treasure hunting adventure.', 'Hiroshi and Misae have never been to a honeymoon trip to a foreign country. One day, Misae discovered an inexpensive and family-friendly holiday package to Australia and the Nohara family decided to make it their first honeymoon vacation. Hiroshi gets kidnapped upon arrival to Australia, leaving Shinnosuke, Misae and others on a dangerous journey. It turns out that Hiroshi is the key to a secret treasure. The remaining members of the Nohara Family must rescue Hiroshi, while a mysterious masked man and treasure hunters from all over the world are after him. The struggle is among three different groups in this action-filled treasure hunting adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lX4GqaRoOdnQB34mQjDzwnscvj6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596302'),
  ('130811237677642770', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Intense Battle! Robo Dad Strikes Back', 2014, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Toshiyuki Umeda, Wataru Takahashi, Akira Ookuma', 'Kazuki Nakashima', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Keiji Fujiwara, Satomi Korogi, Emi Takei, Koji Yusa, Shin''ya Ohwada, Mari Mashiba', 'G', 'A diabolical plot to empower pushover dads causes Shin-chan''s father to return home as a robot. The Nohara family bond is about to be put to the test!', 'A diabolical plot to empower pushover dads causes Shin-chan''s father to return home as a robot. The Nohara family bond is about to be put to the test!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/esfaXxlsOfUwWknzvUq9n0M0fiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305143'),
  ('509675507739139375', 'Crayon Shin-chan: Invasion!! Alien Shiriri', 2017, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Masakazu Hashimoto, Toshiyuki Umeda, Yuichiro Sueyoshi', 'Masakazu Hashimoto', 'Akiko Yajima, Miki Narahashi, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Satomi Korogi, Mari Mashiba, Tamao Hayashi, Teiyu Ichiryusai, Chie Sato', 'G', 'When the mysterious Shiriri turns his parents into children, Shin-chan must trek across Japan to help return them to adult form.', 'When the mysterious Shiriri turns his parents into children, Shin-chan must trek across Japan to help return them to adult form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa7X8NXBoeQfhqzJ079SN8WAJMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453575'),
