  ('474424953188285178', 'Crazy', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Sonja Rom', 'Michael Gutmann, Hans-Christian Schmid', 'Robert Stadlober, Tom Schilling, Oona-Devi Liebich, Julia Hummer, Can Taylanlar, Christoph Ortmann, Joseph Bolz, Willy Rachow', null, 'Benjamin, a 16-year-old with lousy grades, switches to a boarding school in order to eventually reach grammar school. Adjusting to his new environment is difficult as he has to struggle with being a teen... specially when he falls in love to the school''s dream girl, Malen.', 'Benjamin, a 16-year-old with lousy grades, switches to a boarding school in order to eventually reach grammar school. Adjusting to his new environment is difficult as he has to struggle with being a teen... specially when he falls in love to the school''s dream girl, Malen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tZ36iWvmrzupMOvleGh57nb94Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9375'),
