  ('656996184696092258', 'Crazy in the Noodle', 1957, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Maurice Régamey', 'Yvan Audouard, Jean Redon, Maurice Régamey', 'Louis de Funès, Noëlle Adam, Jacques Jouanneau, Danielle Lamar, Nadine Tallier, Christian Duvaleix, Christian Méry, Louis Massis', null, 'Pierre Cousin, a depressive compositor, wants to die. After five vain attempts at committing suicide, he decides to hire professional hit men to do the job on him. But as he''s waiting for death, he accidentally saves a suicidal young woman''s life... and falls in love. Having suddenly found a reason to live, he now fears the killers he himself hired. Is there still time to call off his contract?', 'Pierre Cousin, a depressive compositor, wants to die. After five vain attempts at committing suicide, he decides to hire professional hit men to do the job on him. But as he''s waiting for death, he accidentally saves a suicidal young woman''s life... and falls in love. Having suddenly found a reason to live, he now fears the killers he himself hired. Is there still time to call off his contract?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUTQL8oRdWliFM7bIfkJgfR3R1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63960'),
  ('235279398854660095', 'Crazy Jungle Adventure', 1982, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Harald Reinl, Hans Kühle Jr., Carl Schenkel', 'Mortimer Ellis, Manfred Purzer', 'James Mitchum, René Strickler, Alexander Grill, Thomas Ohrner, Jenny Jürgens, Baldwyn Dakile, Klaus Havenstein, Werner Pochath', null, 'A sleazy airline owner forces boozy former pilot Butch Donovan to climb into the cockpit by threatening to harm his son in this outlandish German comedy. Unbeknownst to Butch, the plane has been rigged to crash as part of an insurance scam. After miraculously surviving a harrowing landing on a remote jungle island, Butch and the other passengers find a whole new set of dangers awaits, including wild beasties and hired hit men.', 'A sleazy airline owner forces boozy former pilot Butch Donovan to climb into the cockpit by threatening to harm his son in this outlandish German comedy. Unbeknownst to Butch, the plane has been rigged to crash as part of an insurance scam. After miraculously surviving a harrowing landing on a remote jungle island, Butch and the other passengers find a whole new set of dangers awaits, including wild beasties and hired hit men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m1xXphE6PmMst9PFKm1u0L6IbXC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247814'),
