  ('92297904289750591', 'Crazy Rich Asians', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mike Topoozian, Jon M. Chu, Vanja Černjul', 'Peter Chiarelli, Adele Lim', 'Constance Wu, Henry Golding, Michelle Yeoh, Gemma Chan, Lisa Lu, Awkwafina, Harry Shum Jr., Ken Jeong', 'PG-13', 'An American-born Chinese economics professor accompanies her boyfriend to Singapore for his best friend''s wedding, only to get thrust into the lives of Asia''s rich and famous.', 'An American-born Chinese economics professor accompanies her boyfriend to Singapore for his best friend''s wedding, only to get thrust into the lives of Asia''s rich and famous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XxL4LJ5WHdrcYcihEZUCgNCpAW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455207'),
