  ('687748171041736003', 'Crazy Samurai Musashi', 2020, 'Action', 'Isao Karasawa, Masahiro Soejima, Isao Kaneko', 'Sion Sono', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Kento Yamazaki, Yousuke Saito, Ben Hiura, Arata Yamanaka, Fuka Hara, Kôsei Kimura, Nobu Morimoto', null, 'In 1604, Miyamoto Musashi attacked the Yoshioka family at their dojo and defeated master Seijūrō and his younger brother Denshichirō in two duels. To save their reputation, the Yoshioka family decides to fight back with all 100 family members and hire an additional 300 samurai. Now Musashi sets out to defeat all 400 enemies in his most famous battle.', 'In 1604, Miyamoto Musashi attacked the Yoshioka family at their dojo and defeated master Seijūrō and his younger brother Denshichirō in two duels. To save their reputation, the Yoshioka family decides to fight back with all 100 family members and hire an additional 300 samurai. Now Musashi sets out to defeat all 400 enemies in his most famous battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/izKIwWr9LqKfXScLQX5GXPgoPAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675476'),
  ('1045745547712182070', 'Crazy Scum: Adult Movies', 2003, 'Drama', 'Siu Keung', null, 'Carmen Yeung Ka-Man, Cherry Chan Chiu-Chiu, Celina Fong Si-Lin, Kau Man-Lung, April Tung Ling, Chow Keung', null, 'Film director Wai asks gang leader Ball to invest in a movie. He cheats famous actors Lok and Sa Sa to take the classical film, and then he finds two stunt actors, April and KK, for the love scene. With the editing, he changes the film with famous actors acting erotic movie. Everything is smooth, but Ball comes up and asks for “special service” from April in exchange for his continued investment in the movie…', 'Film director Wai asks gang leader Ball to invest in a movie. He cheats famous actors Lok and Sa Sa to take the classical film, and then he finds two stunt actors, April and KK, for the love scene. With the editing, he changes the film with famous actors acting erotic movie. Everything is smooth, but Ball comes up and asks for “special service” from April in exchange for his continued investment in the movie…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmh5ceFCL45aqCvb8Rc8tkQS292.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365592'),
