  ('314626708540772648', 'Crazy Stone', 2006, 'Action, Comedy', 'Ning Hao, Du Jie', 'Zhou Zhiyong', 'Guo Tao, Liu Hua, Liu Gang, Huang Bo, Yue Xiaojun, Teddy Lin Wai-Kin, Wang Xun, Xu Zheng', null, 'Three thieves try to steal a valuable jade that is tightly guarded by a security chief. But the security guards are not the only obstacle these thieves are facing. An extremely unlucky internationally known master thief is also trying to get a hand on this piece of precious jade. What would be the final destination of this piece of crazy stone?', 'Three thieves try to steal a valuable jade that is tightly guarded by a security chief. But the security guards are not the only obstacle these thieves are facing. An extremely unlucky internationally known master thief is also trying to get a hand on this piece of precious jade. What would be the final destination of this piece of crazy stone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NVNv2sQKZKb1HtGExUqp3Ukd7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45380'),
  ('1073559166473373030', 'Crazy Thunder Road', 1980, 'Action, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Akira Ogata, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Masumi Hirayanagi, Mitsuhiko Akita, Gakuryu Ishii', 'Koji Nanjo, Tatsuo Yamada, Michiko Kitahara, Masamitsu Daichi, Yōsuke Nakajima, Tadashi Kamiya, Akihiro Kimura, Hiroyuki Kiyosue', null, 'When Ken, the leader of the once-notorious biker gang of Tokyo, falls in love with a barmaid, he quickly loses his rebellious ideals. The rest of the gang feels betrayed, especially the reputedly troubled kid Jin who revolts against his former friend.', 'When Ken, the leader of the once-notorious biker gang of Tokyo, falls in love with a barmaid, he quickly loses his rebellious ideals. The rest of the gang feels betrayed, especially the reputedly troubled kid Jin who revolts against his former friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXya6Y6jqIN4CIpaeKU1mSXoO4V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83297'),
  ('526191487974192931', 'Crazy Tsunami', 2021, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Zhou Jiuqin', null, 'Rong Fei, Wang Yinglu, Canti Lau Sek-Ming, Daniella Wang, Huo Weimin, Tong Xi, Li Junru, Li Yan', null, 'A sudden tsunami came as a shock, trapping Jiang Peng and his daughter, Jiang Xiao Hu, in Chinatown of Southeast Asia. The two of them, with other inhabitants, took a brace to fight against the terrible monster that followed. However, after the life-and-death struggle, they found surprisingly a man-made calamity instead of a natural disaster.', 'A sudden tsunami came as a shock, trapping Jiang Peng and his daughter, Jiang Xiao Hu, in Chinatown of Southeast Asia. The two of them, with other inhabitants, took a brace to fight against the terrible monster that followed. However, after the life-and-death struggle, they found surprisingly a man-made calamity instead of a natural disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX3oIneivfQNwaxXAHgMchc3gYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852005'),
  ('1010914116328601668', 'Crazy Underwear', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Roberto D''Agostino, Alfio Contini, Claudio Bernabei', 'Roberto D''Agostino, Fiorenzo Senese', 'Monica Guerritore, Eva Grimaldi, Marisa Merlini, Barbara Kero, Debora Calì, Venantino Venantini, Luigi Petrucci, Irma Capece Minutolo', null, 'Alessia, a TV showgirl, tries to win the favor of an official. Amalia, a morning show host, satisfies the masochistic director in order to go to prime time. Stefania "works hard" to act in a risqué film by a famous director, but the part is stolen from her by her friend Beatrice, apparently only devoted to her studies.', 'Alessia, a TV showgirl, tries to win the favor of an official. Amalia, a morning show host, satisfies the masochistic director in order to go to prime time. Stefania "works hard" to act in a risqué film by a famous director, but the part is stolen from her by her friend Beatrice, apparently only devoted to her studies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxTgtsgNPUaiAJEeXcz4IeDENj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201811'),
  ('82470878998637711', 'Crazy with the Heat', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bob Carlson', null, 'Clarence Nash, Pinto Colvig, Paul Frees', 'NR', 'Donald and Goofy are driving across the desert, apparently the Sahara. The car breaks down (out of gas), and they start walking. Before long, they are out of water, and are seeing mirages of soda fountains and icebergs. Fortunately, they find a camel.', 'Donald and Goofy are driving across the desert, apparently the Sahara. The car breaks down (out of gas), and they start walking. Before long, they are out of water, and are seeing mirages of soda fountains and icebergs. Fortunately, they find a camel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urKe06V5k5GgcYUyQKcD8qoTieh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53773'),
  ('493661950331251048', 'Crazy-Town', 1932, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Mae Questel, Billy Murray', null, 'Betty Boop and Bimbo take a wild streetcar ride to Crazy Town, where birds swim, fish fly, and everthing else reverses normal behavior.', 'Betty Boop and Bimbo take a wild streetcar ride to Crazy Town, where birds swim, fish fly, and everthing else reverses normal behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cJfDL8LqCmuIAAuPI1mZQJa0tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156459'),
  ('1136851682590775690', 'Crazy, Not Insane', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Ben Bloodwell', 'Alex Gibney', 'Dorothy Lewis, Laura Dern, Eric Lewis, Gillian Lewis, Richard Burr, Bill Hagmaier, Park Dietz, Catherine Yeager', null, 'Fascinated by the human brain and its capacity for ruthlessness, psychiatrist Dr. Dorothy Otnow Lewis has spent her life investigating the interior lives of violent people. With each case, she came closer to developing a unified field theory of what makes a killer. Along the way - steering away from the conventional wisdom of her colleagues - she explored the world of multiple personality disorder.', 'Fascinated by the human brain and its capacity for ruthlessness, psychiatrist Dr. Dorothy Otnow Lewis has spent her life investigating the interior lives of violent people. With each case, she came closer to developing a unified field theory of what makes a killer. Along the way - steering away from the conventional wisdom of her colleagues - she explored the world of multiple personality disorder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NCSkyVXVpMOUc6u8yhyXo107Qu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:682589'),
  ('1004201885015435033', 'Crazy, Stupid, Love.', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Glenn Ficarra, John Requa, Andrew Dunn', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Steve Carell, Ryan Gosling, Julianne Moore, Emma Stone, Lio Tipton, Jonah Bobo, Joey King, Marisa Tomei', 'PG-13', 'Cal Weaver is living the American dream. He has a good job, a beautiful house, great children and a beautiful wife, named Emily. Cal''s seemingly perfect life unravels, however, when he learns that Emily has been unfaithful and wants a divorce. Over 40 and suddenly single, Cal is adrift in the fickle world of dating. Enter, Jacob Palmer, a self-styled player who takes Cal under his wing and teaches him how to be a hit with the ladies.', 'Cal Weaver is living the American dream. He has a good job, a beautiful house, great children and a beautiful wife, named Emily. Cal''s seemingly perfect life unravels, however, when he learns that Emily has been unfaithful and wants a divorce. Over 40 and suddenly single, Cal is adrift in the fickle world of dating. Enter, Jacob Palmer, a self-styled player who takes Cal under his wing and teaches him how to be a hit with the ladies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4RafgAPk558muOjnBMHhMArjS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50646'),
