  ('305353347844274592', 'Creating The Queen''s Gambit', 2021, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Anya Taylor-Joy, Scott Frank, Bruce Pandolfini, Allan Scott, Thomas Brodie-Sangster, Sabine Schaaf, Uli Hanisch, Alexander Lambriev', null, 'A fascinating character. Exquisite sets. A wig for every era. The stars, creators and crew reveal how the hit series about a chess prodigy came to life.', 'A fascinating character. Exquisite sets. A wig for every era. The stars, creators and crew reveal how the hit series about a chess prodigy came to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKxPyeItCrOscP8On4y5sG3WY9A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784047'),
  ('898215982134103915', 'Creation', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Jon Amiel, Jess Hall, Bill Crutcher', 'John Collee', 'Paul Bettany, Jennifer Connelly, Martha West, Guy Henry, Jeremy Northam, Toby Jones, Benedict Cumberbatch, Jim Carter', 'PG-13', 'A psychological, heart-wrenching love story that provides a unique and inside look at Charles Darwin. Torn between faith and science, he struggles to finish his legendary book "On the Origin of the Species," which goes on to become the foundation for evolutionary biology.', 'A psychological, heart-wrenching love story that provides a unique and inside look at Charles Darwin. Torn between faith and science, he struggles to finish his legendary book "On the Origin of the Species," which goes on to become the foundation for evolutionary biology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vS6ne76vjRH7Z88rAqYLCcQatB4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30431'),
  ('979339883730611939', 'Creation of the Gods I: Kingdom of Storms', 2023, 'Action, Fantasy, War', 'Wuershan, Wang Yu, Sang Lin', 'Ran Ping, Ran Jianan, Wuershan', 'Yu Shi, Kris Phillips, Li Xuejian, Huang Bo, Narana Erdyneeva, Chen Muchi, Xia Yu, Yuan Quan', null, 'Based on the most well-known classical fantasy novel of China, Fengshenyanyi, the trilogy is a magnificent eastern high fantasy epic that recreates the prolonged mythical wars between humans, immortals and monsters, which happened more than three thousand years ago.', 'Based on the most well-known classical fantasy novel of China, Fengshenyanyi, the trilogy is a magnificent eastern high fantasy epic that recreates the prolonged mythical wars between humans, immortals and monsters, which happened more than three thousand years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6VOV2wU3WEyN0H1QtrbAS6whXPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856289'),
  ('273880122366236265', 'Creation of the Gods II: Demon Force', 2025, 'Action, Fantasy, War', 'Wuershan, Wang Yu', 'Ran Ping, Ran Jianan, Wuershan', 'Huang Bo, Yu Shi, Nashi, Chen Muchi, Kris Phillips, Narana Erdyneeva, Wu Hsing-Guo, Han Pengyi', 'NR', 'Taishi Wen Zhong led the army of Shang Dynasty including Deng Chanyu and four generals of the Mo Family to Xiqi. With the help of Kunlun immortals such as Jiang Ziya, Ji Fa led the army and civilians of Xiqi to defend their homeland.', 'Taishi Wen Zhong led the army of Shang Dynasty including Deng Chanyu and four generals of the Mo Family to Xiqi. With the help of Kunlun immortals such as Jiang Ziya, Ji Fa led the army and civilians of Xiqi to defend their homeland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfUCs5HNtGu4fofh83uiE2Qcy3v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155281'),
  ('58454661923390695', 'Creation of the Gods III: Creation Under Heaven', null, 'Action, Fantasy, War', 'Wuershan', null, 'Kris Phillips, Yu Shi, Chen Muchi, Chen Kun', null, 'Ji Fa unites the princes of the four directions to march into Chaoge. Yin Shou and Tong Tian Jiaozhu set up the ''Nine-bend Yellow River Formation'' and the ''Zhu Xian Formation''. Yuan Shi Tianzun brings the twelve golden immortals down the mountain, and the war between the three realms of humans, immortals and demons is about to break out.', 'Ji Fa unites the princes of the four directions to march into Chaoge. Yin Shou and Tong Tian Jiaozhu set up the ''Nine-bend Yellow River Formation'' and the ''Zhu Xian Formation''. Yuan Shi Tianzun brings the twelve golden immortals down the mountain, and the war between the three realms of humans, immortals and demons is about to break out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny8A2v1pxD0TvKmbEE5f7BMhC4C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1155282'),
  ('785798748608022118', 'Creation Stories', 2021, 'Drama, Music', 'Roberto Schaefer, Nick Moran, Sophie Kenny', 'Dean Cavanagh, Irvine Welsh', 'Ewen Bremner, Suki Waterhouse, Richard Jobson, Seána Kerslake, Leo Flanagan, Charlie Murphy, Jason Flemyng, Jason Isaacs', null, 'The true story of the rise and fall of Creation Records and its infamous founder Alan McGee; the man responsible for supplying the “Brit Pop” soundtrack to the ‘90s, a decade of cultural renaissance known as Cool Britannia. From humble beginnings to Downing Street soirées, from dodging bailiffs to releasing multi-platinum albums, Creation had it all. Breakdowns, bankruptcy, fights and friendships… and not forgetting the music. Featuring some of the greatest records you have ever heard, we follow Alan through a drug-fuelled haze of music and mayhem, as his rock’n’roll dream brings the world Oasis, Primal Scream, and other generation-defining bands.', 'The true story of the rise and fall of Creation Records and its infamous founder Alan McGee; the man responsible for supplying the “Brit Pop” soundtrack to the ‘90s, a decade of cultural renaissance known as Cool Britannia. From humble beginnings to Downing Street soirées, from dodging bailiffs to releasing multi-platinum albums, Creation had it all. Breakdowns, bankruptcy, fights and friendships… and not forgetting the music. Featuring some of the greatest records you have ever heard, we follow Alan through a drug-fuelled haze of music and mayhem, as his rock’n’roll dream brings the world Oasis, Primal Scream, and other generation-defining bands.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qjWOHYUjJhw5qe86Qk790vaegf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:624793'),
  ('874101475937584887', 'Creative Control', 2016, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Adam Newport-Berra, Benjamin Dickinson, Joshua Hartsoe', 'Micah Bloomberg, Benjamin Dickinson', 'Benjamin Dickinson, Nora Zehetner, Dan Gill, Alexia Rasmussen, Gavin McInnes, Reggie Watts, Paul Manza, Jay Eisenberg', 'R', 'Smooth advertising executive David is in a relationship with yoga teacher Juliette. Then his eye is caught by Sophie, the girlfriend of his best friend Wim, a fashion photographer. Things get completely out of hand during a campaign for augmented reality-glasses, for which David designs an avatar of the coveted Sophie.', 'Smooth advertising executive David is in a relationship with yoga teacher Juliette. Then his eye is caught by Sophie, the girlfriend of his best friend Wim, a fashion photographer. Things get completely out of hand during a campaign for augmented reality-glasses, for which David designs an avatar of the coveted Sophie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8toiQT0xb6mLWT84xVhUNXICdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320146'),
  ('1119897406702188028', 'Creator', 1985, 'Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Ivan Passer, Robbie Greenberg', 'Jeremy Leven', 'Peter O''Toole, Mariel Hemingway, Vincent Spano, Virginia Madsen, David Ogden Stiers, John Dehner, Karen Kopins, Kenneth Tigar', 'R', 'With the help of student assistant Boris and stolen university equipment, Dr. Harry Wolper plans to clone his dead wife. But then he meets Meli, an egg donor for his experiment, and they fall in love. Faced with choosing between his deceased wife and Meli, Dr. Wolper sees his situation in a new light when Boris'' own new love, Barbara, falls into a coma. Meanwhile, another professor tries shutting down the cloning project.', 'With the help of student assistant Boris and stolen university equipment, Dr. Harry Wolper plans to clone his dead wife. But then he meets Meli, an egg donor for his experiment, and they fall in love. Faced with choosing between his deceased wife and Meli, Dr. Wolper sees his situation in a new light when Boris'' own new love, Barbara, falls into a coma. Meanwhile, another professor tries shutting down the cloning project.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53zIIzpBGwcvxZtGibMavnawMYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41243'),
  ('982722029322247340', 'Creators: The Past', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure, Romance, Fantasy, Mystery, Drama', 'Ezio Gamba, Andrea Torreano, Elisa Micalef', 'Bruce Payne, Piergiuseppe Zaia, Eleonora Fani', 'William Shatner, Gérard Depardieu, Eleonora Fani, Bruce Payne, Marc Fiorini, Jennifer Mischiati, Kristina Pimenova, Jonna Cambrand', null, 'Where do we come from and where do we go ? The eternal question of humanity which religions have tried to answer over the centuries - lt''s the end of the year 2012. The Universe is about to undergo an imposing planetary alignment and a Total Eclipse will soon be upon Planet Earth. Great vibrational changes are imminent and set to disturb us. The eight members of the Galactic Council, led by Lord Ogmha (William Shatner), meet to discuss the effects of the imminent alignment. They are 8 creators (aliens) and each one of them governs a Planet. They are each responsible for the security and well-being of a ''LENS''. Together they balance the conflict and allegiance of the Universe. Treason puts Earth in danger and the LENS, the hard disc (crystal core) containing the recording of the entire history, DNA, memories and nucleus of mankind is hidden somewhere in Italy. Everyone is searching for it. If the Lens is opened and in the wrong hands it could reveal to the human beings the shocking', 'Where do we come from and where do we go ? The eternal question of humanity which religions have tried to answer over the centuries - lt''s the end of the year 2012. The Universe is about to undergo an imposing planetary alignment and a Total Eclipse will soon be upon Planet Earth. Great vibrational changes are imminent and set to disturb us. The eight members of the Galactic Council, led by Lord Ogmha (William Shatner), meet to discuss the effects of the imminent alignment. They are 8 creators (aliens) and each one of them governs a Planet. They are each responsible for the security and well-being of a ''LENS''. Together they balance the conflict and allegiance of the Universe. Treason puts Earth in danger and the LENS, the hard disc (crystal core) containing the recording of the entire history, DNA, memories and nucleus of mankind is hidden somewhere in Italy. Everyone is searching for it. If the Lens is opened and in the wrong hands it could reveal to the human beings the shocking', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hOqK5Of1fEululDAhkfAy8mUGM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466994'),
  ('1006824763409788180', 'Creatura', 2023, 'Drama', 'Elena Martín Gimeno, Alana Mejía González, Miguel Gago', 'Clara Roquet, Elena Martín Gimeno', 'Elena Martín Gimeno, Clàudia Malagelada, Mila Borràs, Oriol Pla, Clara Segura, Carla Linares, Àlex Brendemühl, Marc Cartanyà', null, 'After moving in with her boyfriend, Mila becomes aware of her loss of desire.', 'After moving in with her boyfriend, Mila becomes aware of her loss of desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1HELwyz6NMKi16cc6VRbXsaZCsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071846'),
  ('5405346646048777', 'Creature', 1985, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Malone, Harry Mathias', 'Alan Reed, William Malone', 'Stan Ivar, Wendy Schaal, Lyman Ward, Klaus Kinski, Annette McCarthy, Marie Laurin, Robert Jaffe, Diane Salinger', 'R', 'A crew of scientists arrives on a far, cold planet to examine archaic artifacts of unknown origin. They discover that their German enemies already have a ship there. When they seek their help after a failed landing, they only find the Germans’ bodies, obviously slaughtered by one of the archaic creatures, awoken to new life. Now the alien is after them.', 'A crew of scientists arrives on a far, cold planet to examine archaic artifacts of unknown origin. They discover that their German enemies already have a ship there. When they seek their help after a failed landing, they only find the Germans’ bodies, obviously slaughtered by one of the archaic creatures, awoken to new life. Now the alien is after them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tv4xMEUqYvfJAW9BtUF25JnCHqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58903'),
  ('801286618234870758', 'Creature', 2011, 'Horror', 'Cory Johnson, Christopher Faloona, Valerie Rodriguez', 'Fred Andrews, Tracy Morse', 'Mehcad Brooks, Serinda Swan, Dillon Casey, Lauren Schneider, Aaron Hill, Amanda Fuller, Wayne Péré, David Jensen', 'R', 'An ex-Navy seal, his girlfriend and their friends head out on a road trip to New Orleans. The group decides to stop at a roadside convenience store owned by Chopper, who tells them the tale of Lockjaw, a fabled god-like creature who is half-man, half-alligator.', 'An ex-Navy seal, his girlfriend and their friends head out on a road trip to New Orleans. The group decides to stop at a roadside convenience store owned by Chopper, who tells them the tale of Lockjaw, a fabled god-like creature who is half-man, half-alligator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SrKrYh4Qmhpfcn9PsW2jpLROul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73963'),
  ('1041585715956130229', 'Creature 3D', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Bipasha Basu, Mukul Dev, Imran Abbas, Deepraj Rana, Bikramjeet Kanwarpal, Natasha Rana, Mohan Kapur, Amit Tandon', null, 'People attend their first halt in a newly opened lodge in deep forest, but something is waiting for them.', 'People attend their first halt in a newly opened lodge in deep forest, but something is waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbfirdO1slPZjzIcZoMev00bpUC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292830'),
  ('130550410131332262', 'Creature Comforts', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Nick Park, David Sproxton, Fred Reed', 'Nick Park', 'Julie Sedgewick', 'NR', 'A humorous and thought-provoking view of what animals in zoos might be thinking about their captivity and surroundings.', 'A humorous and thought-provoking view of what animals in zoos might be thinking about their captivity and surroundings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ap8XavPP8AyvW9TDQDAZzEGT200.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54825'),
  ('649924400071259866', 'Creature Designers: The Frankenstein Complex', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Gilles Penso, Alexandre Poncet', 'Gilles Penso, Alexandre Poncet', 'Alec Gillis, Chris Walas, Dennis Muren, Greg Nicotero, Guillermo del Toro, Joe Dante, John Landis, Kevin Smith', null, 'The Frankenstein Complex takes a historical as well as a creative perspective, with a mix of fascinating scenes behind the camera, film clips, and dozens of interviews with all the big names in the industry. In addition to the many wonderful anecdotes, the film also offers a wealth of beautiful test material, while along the way showing how the art of filmmaking has changed over the years. An affectionate ode to monster makers throughout history.', 'The Frankenstein Complex takes a historical as well as a creative perspective, with a mix of fascinating scenes behind the camera, film clips, and dozens of interviews with all the big names in the industry. In addition to the many wonderful anecdotes, the film also offers a wealth of beautiful test material, while along the way showing how the art of filmmaking has changed over the years. An affectionate ode to monster makers throughout history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k0TtR7GcO7oTjZvGcs20TURR21.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392918'),
  ('662532616638795112', 'Creature from Black Lake', 1976, 'Mystery, Horror, Drama', 'Joy N. Houck Jr., Dean Cundey, Bill Baker', 'Jim McCullough Jr.', 'Jack Elam, Dub Taylor, Dennis Fimple, John David Carson, Bill Thurman, Jim McCullough Jr., Roy Tatum, Cathryn Hartt', 'PG', 'Some fishermen are attacked in the Louisiana swamps. When the word gets out of a mysterious Bigfoot-type creature, two researchers come to a small town to study and hopefully discover what the beast is. Their research from some farmers help the two men to learn that the creature may be a very angry and murderous missing link.', 'Some fishermen are attacked in the Louisiana swamps. When the word gets out of a mysterious Bigfoot-type creature, two researchers come to a small town to study and hopefully discover what the beast is. Their research from some farmers help the two men to learn that the creature may be a very angry and murderous missing link.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXYmNFbJyA1Jcr3x54hCNuOWnk4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43753'),
  ('459960635829166292', 'Creature from the Black Lagoon', 1954, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'William E. Snyder, Jack Arnold, Russ Haverick', 'Harry Essex, Arthur A. Ross', 'Richard Carlson, Julie Adams, Richard Denning, Antonio Moreno, Nestor Paiva, Whit Bissell, Bernie Gozier, Henry A. Escalante', 'G', 'When scientists exploring the Amazon River stumble on a “missing link” connecting humans and fish, they plan to capture it for later study. But the Creature has plans of his own, and has set his sights on the lead scientist''s beautiful fiancée, Kay.', 'When scientists exploring the Amazon River stumble on a “missing link” connecting humans and fish, they plan to capture it for later study. But the Creature has plans of his own, and has set his sights on the lead scientist''s beautiful fiancée, Kay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euCzA2Exc70MpTDCVYih8tdE7z1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10973'),
  ('450927272242607822', 'Creature from the Haunted Sea', 1961, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Roger Corman, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Antony Carbone, Betsy Jones-Moreland, Robert Towne, Beach Dickerson, Robert Bean, Esther Sandoval, Sonia Noemí González, Edmundo Rivera Álvarez', 'NR', 'A crook decides to bump off members of his inept crew and blame their deaths on a legendary sea creature. What he doesn''t know is that the creature is real.', 'A crook decides to bump off members of his inept crew and blame their deaths on a legendary sea creature. What he doesn''t know is that the creature is real.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fZwh9aYHPw5pOT199R3yprJBgb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48202'),
  ('199629451393607470', 'Creature of Destruction', 1967, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Larry Buchanan, Robert C. Jessup, Annabelle Weenick', 'Tony Huston', 'Les Tremayne, Pat Delaney, Aron Kincaid, Neil Fletcher, Annabelle Weenick, Ron Scott, Roger Ready, Suzanne Roy', null, 'A mad stage hypnotist Dr. John Basso reverts his beautiful assistant Doreena into the physical form of a prehistoric sea monster she was in a past life. Using this power he attempts to find fame and fortune by predicting a series of murders and then using the monster to carry them out.', 'A mad stage hypnotist Dr. John Basso reverts his beautiful assistant Doreena into the physical form of a prehistoric sea monster she was in a past life. Using this power he attempts to find fame and fortune by predicting a series of murders and then using the monster to carry them out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CZ58DbRbBHX9EjqKz7JZ1uw0T0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97306'),
  ('426416976555805435', 'Creature of the Walking Dead', 1965, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jerry Warren, Jerry Warren', 'Jerry Warren', 'Fernando Casanova, Sonia Furió, Katherine Victor, Robert Christopher, Fred Hoffman, Aurora Alvarado, Rosa Maria Gallardo, Bruno VeSota', null, 'Brought back to life by his grandson, a diabolical scientist with an unquenchable thirst for blood goes on a rampage. A revision of the Mexican horror film LA MARCA DEL MUERTE, considerably edited and with 20 minutes of new American-made footage.', 'Brought back to life by his grandson, a diabolical scientist with an unquenchable thirst for blood goes on a rampage. A revision of the Mexican horror film LA MARCA DEL MUERTE, considerably edited and with 20 minutes of new American-made footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6cdDRd3TAUnYi6NBrIFZUtXB1NW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115128'),
  ('203655031020997483', 'Creature with the Atom Brain', 1955, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Edward L. Cahn, Fred Jackman Jr., Eddie Saeta', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Richard Denning, S. John Launer, Michael Granger, Gregory Gaye, Angela Stevens, Linda Bennett, Charles Evans, Tristram Coffin', 'NR', 'Murders, with victims dying from spines broken by brute strength, erupt in the city and the killers, when encountered, walk away unharmed by police bullets which strike them. A police doctor''s investigation of the deaths leads to the discovery of an army of dead criminal musclemen restored to life, remotely controlled by a vengeful former crime boss and a former Nazi scientist, from the latter''s laboratory hidden in the suburbs.', 'Murders, with victims dying from spines broken by brute strength, erupt in the city and the killers, when encountered, walk away unharmed by police bullets which strike them. A police doctor''s investigation of the deaths leads to the discovery of an army of dead criminal musclemen restored to life, remotely controlled by a vengeful former crime boss and a former Nazi scientist, from the latter''s laboratory hidden in the suburbs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71ZgmkyVQpaOK9TSCzR8qmhZAto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35919'),
  ('831535728617879269', 'Creature with the Blue Hand', 1967, 'Crime, Horror', 'Alfred Vohrer, Ernst W. Kalinke', 'Herbert Reinecker', 'Harald Leipnitz, Klaus Kinski, Carl Lange, Ilse Steppat, Hermann Lenschau, Diana Körner, Gudrun Genest, Albert Bessler', null, 'Scotland Yard is after a homicidal maniac called The Blue Hand, which is what he uses to kill his victims.', 'Scotland Yard is after a homicidal maniac called The Blue Hand, which is what he uses to kill his victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksRhsRYDGiWt3i7YpiPo8BUdZDP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63024'),
  ('1150005442462072386', 'Creatures', 2021, 'Horror, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Tony Jopia, Joseph Morel, Theodore Rowan Salisbury', 'Andrew Fawn, Tony Jopia, Stu Jopia', 'Jo Hart, Steve Aaron-Sipple, Arthur Sylense, Rina Saito, Kelsie Mcdonald, Chris Kyriacou, Andrew Greaves, Derek Frood', null, 'A group of astronomy students get more than they bargained for after finding an injured alien who is being targeted by a group of bloodthirsty CREATURES!', 'A group of astronomy students get more than they bargained for after finding an injured alien who is being targeted by a group of bloodthirsty CREATURES!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0mO09HUkeYv6DGU51vouK33rCt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:713479'),
  ('1077385857046288843', 'Creatures the World Forgot', 1971, 'Adventure, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Don Chaffey, Vincent G. Cox, Ferdinand Fairfax', 'Michael Carreras', 'Julie Ege, Brian O''Shaughnessy, Tony Bonner, Marcia Fox, Rosalie Crutchley, Don Leonard, Beverly Blake, Sue Wilson', 'PG', 'As the first nomadic tribes wander across the vast wilderness of the infant planet they confront hostilities created by the harsh environment and each other. After a massive volcanic eruption a tribal chief is killed and his two sons fight for supremacy, not only for the leadership of the tribe but also for the love of a beautiful young woman. The age-old battlegrounds of rivalry, envy and passion are explored in this tale of prehistoric adventure.', 'As the first nomadic tribes wander across the vast wilderness of the infant planet they confront hostilities created by the harsh environment and each other. After a massive volcanic eruption a tribal chief is killed and his two sons fight for supremacy, not only for the leadership of the tribe but also for the love of a beautiful young woman. The age-old battlegrounds of rivalry, envy and passion are explored in this tale of prehistoric adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hW4PTOcbqbeLKcVlFqfMxX6jz7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102443'),
  ('552842257736746151', 'Creed', 2015, 'Drama', 'J.R. Campbell, George Pierre, Karen Davis', 'Aaron Covington, Ryan Coogler', 'Michael B. Jordan, Sylvester Stallone, Tessa Thompson, Phylicia Rashād, Andre Ward, Tony Bellew, Ritchie Coster, Jacob ''Stitch'' Duran', 'PG-13', 'The former World Heavyweight Champion Rocky Balboa serves as a trainer and mentor to Adonis Johnson, the son of his late friend and former rival Apollo Creed.', 'The former World Heavyweight Champion Rocky Balboa serves as a trainer and mentor to Adonis Johnson, the son of his late friend and former rival Apollo Creed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BfTsk5VWuw8FCocAhCyqnRbEzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:312221'),
  ('505575341346269097', 'Creed II', 2018, 'Drama, Action', 'Steven Holleran, Michele Ziegler, Xanthus Valan', 'Sylvester Stallone, Juel Taylor', 'Michael B. Jordan, Sylvester Stallone, Tessa Thompson, Wood Harris, Russell Hornsby, Phylicia Rashād, Dolph Lundgren, Florian Munteanu', 'PG-13', 'Between personal obligations and training for his next big fight against an opponent with ties to his family''s past, Adonis Creed is up against the challenge of his life.', 'Between personal obligations and training for his next big fight against an opponent with ties to his family''s past, Adonis Creed is up against the challenge of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3QyboWRoA4O9RbcsqH8tJMe8EB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480530'),
  ('73496009248388903', 'Creed III', 2023, 'Drama, Action', 'Aeric Adams, Clayton J. Barber, Roger Berard', 'Zach Baylin, Keenan Coogler', 'Michael B. Jordan, Tessa Thompson, Jonathan Majors, Phylicia Rashād, Mila Davis-Kent, Wood Harris, José Benavidez Jr., Florian Munteanu', 'PG-13', 'After dominating the boxing world, Adonis Creed has thrived in his career and family life. When a childhood friend and former boxing prodigy, Damian Anderson, resurfaces after serving a long sentence in prison, he is eager to prove that he deserves his shot in the ring. The face-off between former friends is more than just a fight. To settle the score, Adonis must put his future on the line to battle Damian — a fighter with nothing to lose.', 'After dominating the boxing world, Adonis Creed has thrived in his career and family life. When a childhood friend and former boxing prodigy, Damian Anderson, resurfaces after serving a long sentence in prison, he is eager to prove that he deserves his shot in the ring. The face-off between former friends is more than just a fight. To settle the score, Adonis must put his future on the line to battle Damian — a fighter with nothing to lose.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvsXj3I9Q2iyyIo95AecSd1tad7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:677179'),
  ('759772617980292381', 'Creep', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Christopher Smith, Danny Cohen, Matthew Gray', 'Christopher Smith', 'Franka Potente, Sean Harris, Vas Blackwood, Ken Campbell, Jeremy Sheffield, Paul Rattray, Kelly Scott, Strapper', 'R', 'Trapped in a London subway station, a woman who''s being pursued by a potential attacker heads into the unknown labyrinth of tunnels beneath the city''s streets', 'Trapped in a London subway station, a woman who''s being pursued by a potential attacker heads into the unknown labyrinth of tunnels beneath the city''s streets', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w5oxV6MDEfL48FMK9BmYTD2wQRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8555'),
  ('348889973689892671', 'Creep', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Brice, Patrick Brice', null, 'Mark Duplass, Patrick Brice, Katie Aselton', 'R', 'Looking for work, Aaron comes across a cryptic online ad: “$1,000 for the day. Filming service. Discretion is appreciated.” Low on cash and full of naiveté, he decides to go for it. He drives to a cabin in a remote mountain town where he meets Josef, his cinematic subject for the day. Josef is sincere and the project seems heartfelt, so Aaron begins to film. But as the day goes on, it becomes clear that Josef is not who he says, and his intentions are not at all pure.', 'Looking for work, Aaron comes across a cryptic online ad: “$1,000 for the day. Filming service. Discretion is appreciated.” Low on cash and full of naiveté, he decides to go for it. He drives to a cabin in a remote mountain town where he meets Josef, his cinematic subject for the day. Josef is sincere and the project seems heartfelt, so Aaron begins to film. But as the day goes on, it becomes clear that Josef is not who he says, and his intentions are not at all pure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn53D574tT0YRyLgirEFHQwGUXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250574'),
  ('85186239505820004', 'Creep 2', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Brice, Desiree Akhavan, Patrick Brice', 'Patrick Brice, Mark Duplass', 'Mark Duplass, Desiree Akhavan, Karan Soni, Kyle Field, Caveh Zahedi, Jeff Man, Patrick Brice', 'R', 'After finding an ad online for “video work,” Sara, a video artist whose primary focus is creating intimacy with lonely men, thinks she may have found the subject of her dreams. She drives to a remote house in the forest and meets a man claiming to be a serial killer. Unable to resist the chance to create a truly shocking piece of art, she agrees to spend the day with him. However, as the day goes on, she discovers she may have dug herself into a hole from which she can’t escape.', 'After finding an ad online for “video work,” Sara, a video artist whose primary focus is creating intimacy with lonely men, thinks she may have found the subject of her dreams. She drives to a remote house in the forest and meets a man claiming to be a serial killer. Unable to resist the chance to create a truly shocking piece of art, she agrees to spend the day with him. However, as the day goes on, she discovers she may have dug herself into a hole from which she can’t escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0m7WciFnBqpcyH1Yi8i4tdvk0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:396493'),
  ('50675738306688216', 'Creepozoids', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Thomas L. Callaway, David DeCoteau, Thomas L. Callaway', 'David DeCoteau, Dave Eisenstark', 'Linnea Quigley, Ken Abraham, Michael Aranda, Ashlyn Gere, Richard L. Hawkins, Joi Wilson', 'R', 'Five Army deserters wander the post-apocalyptic, post-industrial LA landscape seeking shelter from an increasingly toxic environment and poisonous rain.', 'Five Army deserters wander the post-apocalyptic, post-industrial LA landscape seeking shelter from an increasingly toxic environment and poisonous rain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xgXlJIq8oyzZch2FvlHT0Fs1UuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28223'),
  ('423626121360758590', 'Creepshow', 1982, 'Horror, Comedy', 'George A. Romero, Michael Gornick, Alan Brennecke', 'Stephen King', 'Hal Holbrook, Adrienne Barbeau, Fritz Weaver, Leslie Nielsen, Carrie Nye, E.G. Marshall, Viveca Lindfors, Ed Harris', 'R', 'Five grisly tales from a 1950s-style comic, including a murdered father rising from beyond, a bizarre meteor, a vengeful husband, a mysterious crate''s occupant, and a plague of cockroaches.', 'Five grisly tales from a 1950s-style comic, including a murdered father rising from beyond, a bizarre meteor, a vengeful husband, a mysterious crate''s occupant, and a plague of cockroaches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SoyTCEpsgLjX6yAyMsx3AsAyRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16281'),
  ('199704849101937754', 'Creepshow 2', 1987, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Richard Hart, Michael Gornick, Leonard Finger', 'George A. Romero', 'Lois Chiles, George Kennedy, Dorothy Lamour, Daniel Beer, Jeremy Green, Page Hannah, Don Harvey, David Holbrook', 'R', 'Three macabre tales from the latest issue of a boy''s favorite comic book, dealing with a vengeful wooden Native American, a monstrous blob in a lake, and an undying hitchhiker.', 'Three macabre tales from the latest issue of a boy''s favorite comic book, dealing with a vengeful wooden Native American, a monstrous blob in a lake, and an undying hitchhiker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bbanIymLuTYmQGis9nlCkFlT1eg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16288'),
  ('1112068708795081396', 'Creepshow 3', 2006, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ana Clavell, James Glenn Dudelson, James M. LeGoy', 'James Glenn Dudelson, Pablo C. Pappano, Ana Clavell', 'Stephanie Pettee, Justin Smith, Roy Abramsohn, Susan Schramm, Matt Fromm, Bunny Gibson, AJ Bowen, Elina Madison', 'R', 'This follow-up to the George Romero/Stephen King-launched anthology series features five new tales of horror and a wraparound. The main stories deal with alternative realities ("Alice"), possessed communication devices ("The Radio"), vampires and serial killers in lust ("Call Girl"), mad inventors ("The Professor''s Wife"), and hauntings from beyond the grave ("Haunted Dog").', 'This follow-up to the George Romero/Stephen King-launched anthology series features five new tales of horror and a wraparound. The main stories deal with alternative realities ("Alice"), possessed communication devices ("The Radio"), vampires and serial killers in lust ("Call Girl"), mad inventors ("The Professor''s Wife"), and hauntings from beyond the grave ("Haunted Dog").', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qvJSdbruD4e5cUxruoUFUkJrsqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16304'),
  ('858480036065443094', 'Creepy', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Akiko Ashizawa, Atsushi Unno', 'Chihiro Ikeda, Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Yuko Takeuchi, Teruyuki Kagawa, Haruna Kawaguchi, Masahiro Higashide, Ryoko Fujino, Takashi Sasano, Masahiro Toda', null, 'After having narrowly escaped an attempt on his life at the hands of a psychopath, detective inspector Takakura quits active service in the police force and takes up a position as a university lecturer in criminal psychology. But his desire to get to the bottom of criminals’ motives remains, and he does not hesitate long when former colleague Nogami asks him to reopen an old case.', 'After having narrowly escaped an attempt on his life at the hands of a psychopath, detective inspector Takakura quits active service in the police force and takes up a position as a university lecturer in criminal psychology. But his desire to get to the bottom of criminals’ motives remains, and he does not hesitate long when former colleague Nogami asks him to reopen an old case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zo6pQt1Oelc5JpapfwFy2Nj3IS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380620'),
  ('1025831215829119071', 'Creepy Crawly', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'Chalit Krileadmongkon, Pakphum Wongjinda, Metee Thuentap', 'Charoen Kaithitisuwan, Chalit Krileadmongkon, Pakphum Wongjinda', 'Mike Angelo, Chanya McClory, David Asavanond, Paramej Noiam, Kulteera Yordchang, Benjamin Joseph Varney, Chanidapa Pongsilpipat, Wanpiya Oamsinnoppakulj', null, 'A quarantine hotel where overseas travellers stay in isolation to curb the spread of a contagious virus, but they soon become prey to a strange breed of a 100-legged monster.', 'A quarantine hotel where overseas travellers stay in isolation to curb the spread of a contagious virus, but they soon become prey to a strange breed of a 100-legged monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YcyoVVC2hDHBxVgcxA6fsafDot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949697'),
  ('319893027684550851', 'Creezy', 1974, 'Drama', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Pierre Granier-Deferre, Walter Wottitz', 'Pierre Granier-Deferre, Pascal Jardin', 'Alain Delon, Jeanne Moreau, Sydne Rome, Claude Rich, Louis Seigner, Jean-Marc Bory, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Nadia Samir', null, 'Julien Dandieu, leader of the socialist political party PRU is asked to be part of the new conservative government as minister of foreign affairs. However his reputation is somewhat tarnished by his adulterous relationship with Creezy, a fashion model seen on every magazine cover. Ready to sacrifice his family for his career, he is eventually faced with the ultimate choice: his career ambitions or a lifetime with his beautiful girlfriend, who has recently mysteriously disappeared.', 'Julien Dandieu, leader of the socialist political party PRU is asked to be part of the new conservative government as minister of foreign affairs. However his reputation is somewhat tarnished by his adulterous relationship with Creezy, a fashion model seen on every magazine cover. Ready to sacrifice his family for his career, he is eventually faced with the ultimate choice: his career ambitions or a lifetime with his beautiful girlfriend, who has recently mysteriously disappeared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0vP1pIuhf8eZ44ThQAWlRFvv3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66187'),
  ('502385806636477637', 'Cremaster 1', 1996, 'Comedy, Music', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Marti Domination', null, 'CREMASTER 1 (1995) is a musical revue performed on the blue Astroturf playing field of Bronco Stadium in Boise, Idaho - Barney''s hometown. Two Goodyear Blimps float above the arena like the airships that often transmit live sporting events via television broadcast. Four air hostesses tend to each blimp. The only sound is soft ambient music, which suggests the hum of the engines.', 'CREMASTER 1 (1995) is a musical revue performed on the blue Astroturf playing field of Bronco Stadium in Boise, Idaho - Barney''s hometown. Two Goodyear Blimps float above the arena like the airships that often transmit live sporting events via television broadcast. Four air hostesses tend to each blimp. The only sound is soft ambient music, which suggests the hum of the engines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gO4JEStg31S8gOEawUbnYq6xpkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23984'),
  ('815409892813767349', 'Cremaster 2', 1999, 'Fantasy, Horror, Western', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Norman Mailer, Matthew Barney, Lauren Pine, Scott Ewalt, Patty Griffin, Michael Thompson, Dave Lombardo, Bruce Steele', null, 'CREMASTER 2 is rendered as a gothic Western that introduces conflict into the system. On the biological level it corresponds to the phase of fetal development during which sexual division begins. In Matthew Barney''s abstraction of this process, the system resists partition and tries to remain in the state of equilibrium imagined in Cremaster 1.', 'CREMASTER 2 is rendered as a gothic Western that introduces conflict into the system. On the biological level it corresponds to the phase of fetal development during which sexual division begins. In Matthew Barney''s abstraction of this process, the system resists partition and tries to remain in the state of equilibrium imagined in Cremaster 1.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89Fohd57satfOatQ1REbS5Nutxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23985'),
  ('896162906089430637', 'Cremaster 3', 2002, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Richard Serra, Matthew Barney, Aimee Mullins, Nesrin Karanouh, Peter Donald Badalamenti II, The Mighty Biggs, Paul Brady, Terry Gillespie', null, 'CREMASTER 3 (2002) is set in New York City and narrates the construction of the Chrysler Building, which is in itself a character - host to inner, antagonistic forces at play for access to the process of (spiritual) transcendence. These factions find form in the struggle between Hiram Abiff or the Architect ...', 'CREMASTER 3 (2002) is set in New York City and narrates the construction of the Chrysler Building, which is in itself a character - host to inner, antagonistic forces at play for access to the process of (spiritual) transcendence. These factions find form in the struggle between Hiram Abiff or the Architect ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aa4k3iHCFT0iwVENcfe3M3QAlen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23986'),
  ('642633322438111343', 'Cremaster 4', 1995, 'Fantasy', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Matthew Barney, Christa Bauch, Colette Guimond, Sharon Marvel, Dave Molyneux, Graham Molyneux, Steve Sinnott, Kart Sinnott', null, 'CREMASTER 4 (1994) adheres most closely to the project''s biological model. This penultimate episode describes the system''s onward rush toward descension despite its resistance to division. The logo for this chapter is the Manx triskelion - three identical armored legs revolving around a central axis. Set on the Isle of Man, the film absorbs the island''s folklore ...', 'CREMASTER 4 (1994) adheres most closely to the project''s biological model. This penultimate episode describes the system''s onward rush toward descension despite its resistance to division. The logo for this chapter is the Manx triskelion - three identical armored legs revolving around a central axis. Set on the Isle of Man, the film absorbs the island''s folklore ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89GirHIVsbdQu1T5OqiTNyDsLN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23987'),
  ('482364947016112925', 'Cremaster 5', 1997, 'Drama, Music', 'Matthew Barney, Peter Strietmann', 'Matthew Barney', 'Ursula Andress, Matthew Barney, Joanne Rha, Susan Rha, Amy Chiang, Mei-Chiao Chiu, Michelle Ingkavet, Yoko Hyun', null, 'Cremaster 5 is a five-act opera (sung in Hungarian) set in late-ninteenth century Budapest. The last film in the series, Cremaster 5 represents the moment when the testicles are finally released and sexual differentiation is fully attained. The lamenting tone of the opera suggests that Barney invisions this as a moment of tragedy and loss. The primary character is the Queen of Chain (played by Ursula Andress). Barney, himself, plays three characters who appear in the mind of the Queen: her Diva, Magician, and Giant. The Magician is a stand-in for Harry Houdini, who was born in Budapest in 1874 and appears as a recurring character in the Cremaster cycle.', 'Cremaster 5 is a five-act opera (sung in Hungarian) set in late-ninteenth century Budapest. The last film in the series, Cremaster 5 represents the moment when the testicles are finally released and sexual differentiation is fully attained. The lamenting tone of the opera suggests that Barney invisions this as a moment of tragedy and loss. The primary character is the Queen of Chain (played by Ursula Andress). Barney, himself, plays three characters who appear in the mind of the Queen: her Diva, Magician, and Giant. The Magician is a stand-in for Harry Houdini, who was born in Budapest in 1874 and appears as a recurring character in the Cremaster cycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cugY47OHyyg6Wuq0UuEmeJ9KZkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36702'),
  ('1036863595057070351', 'Crescendo', 1970, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alan Gibson, Paul Beeson', 'Alfred Shaughnessy, Jimmy Sangster', 'Stefanie Powers, James Olson, Joss Ackland, Margaretta Scott, Jane Lapotaire, Kirsten Lindholm', 'PG', 'An innocent project transforms into a perilous nightmare when researcher Susan Roberts arrives in France in search of information on a deceased composer.', 'An innocent project transforms into a perilous nightmare when researcher Susan Roberts arrives in France in search of information on a deceased composer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQIhKHR4GmurIcurg0j6IDAUc4D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69058'),
  ('620860553265814255', 'Crescendo', 2020, 'Music, Drama', 'Gero Steffen, Dror Zahavi', 'Stephen Glantz, Marcus O. Rosenmüller, Johannes Rotter', 'Peter Simonischek, Bibiana Beglau, Daniel Donskoy, Sabrina Amali, Mehdi Meskar, Eyan Pinkovich, Götz Otto, Hitham Omari', null, 'When world-famous conductor Eduard Sporck accepts the job to create an Israeli-Palestinian youth orchestra, he is quickly drawn into a tempest of sheer unsolvable problems.', 'When world-famous conductor Eduard Sporck accepts the job to create an Israeli-Palestinian youth orchestra, he is quickly drawn into a tempest of sheer unsolvable problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8oBxxOtvfm6gwX69KpWw7iZ7iwo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647456'),
  ('322461854888932656', 'Crescent City', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Raja Collins, Alex Salahi, Adam Werth', 'Rich Ronat', 'Terrence Howard, Esai Morales, Nicky Whelan, Alec Baldwin, Michael Sirow, Weston Cage, Anjul Nigam, Rose Lane Sanfilippo', 'R', 'When a ruthless serial killer terrorizes a small Southern town, everyone becomes a suspect -- including local authorities. As the body count rises and the dark mystery deepens, the chief detective becomes haunted by the horrors of his past.', 'When a ruthless serial killer terrorizes a small Southern town, everyone becomes a suspect -- including local authorities. As the body count rises and the dark mystery deepens, the chief detective becomes haunted by the horrors of his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWwIkWextuqVUvAEM9DwJfEfkKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245708'),
  ('25885812555677718', 'Cresceranno i carciofi a Mimongo', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Marco Cristiani, Antonio Morabito, Fulvio Ottaviano', 'Fulvio Ottaviano, Francesco Ranieri Martinotti', 'Daniele Liotti, Francesca Schiavo, Valerio Mastandrea, Patrizia Pezza, Francesco Siciliano, Chantal Ughi, Luisa Ammaniti, Elena Bermani', null, 'Sergio has a degree in botanics, but cannot find a job. Then, he gets the announcement that his former girlfriend is getting married.', 'Sergio has a degree in botanics, but cannot find a job. Then, he gets the announcement that his former girlfriend is getting married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tWjmWkuAtFawMFgQn4vczPFx0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56898'),
  ('1152637379720502735', 'Crest of Betrayal', 1994, 'Horror, Drama, Action, History, Fantasy', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Shigeru Ishihara', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Motomu Furuta', 'Koichi Sato, Saki Takaoka, Keiko Oginome, Renji Ishibashi, Eri Watanabe, Shōhei Hino, Naomasa Musaka, Maiko Kikuchi', null, 'Weaving two storylines together: the first is the story of 18th-century shogunate intrigue and loyalty, and the second is a ghost story about a beautiful woman who falls victim to passion and evil.', 'Weaving two storylines together: the first is the story of 18th-century shogunate intrigue and loyalty, and the second is a ghost story about a beautiful woman who falls victim to passion and evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3luogbx7uS0N0hx7O4JosaJHeN2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:224120'),
  ('564765303792089903', 'Crew', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Rajesh Krishnan, Anuj Dhawan', 'Mehul Suri, Nidhi Mehra', 'Tabu, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Kriti Sanon, Diljit Dosanjh, Rajesh Sharma, Trupti Khamkar, Kapil Sharma, Saswata Chatterjee', null, 'Three ordinary air hostesses from Mumbai embark on a journey to pursue their dreams but find themselves caught up in unexpected misfortunes.', 'Three ordinary air hostesses from Mumbai embark on a journey to pursue their dreams but find themselves caught up in unexpected misfortunes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mnCtQngfhYt0W0BmkrCePutmvy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045931'),
  ('952880504866800583', 'Cri Cri el Grillito Cantor', 1963, 'Drama, Family, Music, Animation', 'Tito Davison, Rosalío Solano, Bill Justice', 'Tito Davison, Edmundo Báez', 'Ignacio López Tarso, Marga López, Eduardo Alcaraz, Juan Antonio Edwards, Micaela Castejón, Enrique Lucero, José M. Rosano, Amparo Arozamena', null, 'Biography of the famous composer of children''s music Gabilondo Soler. Starts from his childhood, when he worked as a pastor and grandmother tried to teach him to play the piano. Later he went to the city to study music theory and began writing his first songs.', 'Biography of the famous composer of children''s music Gabilondo Soler. Starts from his childhood, when he worked as a pastor and grandmother tried to teach him to play the piano. Later he went to the city to study music theory and began writing his first songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iagDvl2cP3rbH1bj0rBK6El0T3J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182404'),
