  ('150536093561955739', 'Criando ratas', 2016, 'Drama', 'Carlos Salado', 'Carlos Salado', 'Ramón Guerrero, José Antonio Francés, Mauricio Manzano, Carlos Victoria', null, 'Latest example of Spanish "neokinki" cinema, which was popular in the late seventies/early eighties, right after the end of Franco''s dictatorship. Destructured families of low social classes are the perfect environment for delinquency, drugs, violence and broken lives.', 'Latest example of Spanish "neokinki" cinema, which was popular in the late seventies/early eighties, right after the end of Franco''s dictatorship. Destructured families of low social classes are the perfect environment for delinquency, drugs, violence and broken lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qwJ9KzAuuPHuRfyvZ9OkkW83Hgl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:434357'),
  ('233213623259426436', 'Criature', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Cécile Allégra', 'Francesco Ghiaccio, Marco D''Amore', 'Marco D''Amore, Maria Esposito, Marianna Fontana, Alessio Gallo, Giuseppe Pirozzi, Antonio Guerra, Ciro Minopoli, Martina Abbate', null, 'A social worker dedicates himself to the recovery of children who have dropped out of school in the streets of Naples thanks to the circus arts. His work, however, is not well received by the families of the neighborhood and the courage of these children, with their stilts and their red noses, will clash with the harsh reality.', 'A social worker dedicates himself to the recovery of children who have dropped out of school in the streets of Naples thanks to the circus arts. His work, however, is not well received by the families of the neighborhood and the courage of these children, with their stilts and their red noses, will clash with the harsh reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rinMnnmRdmjbwfNPXbIp0katq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1222522'),
  ('189961163643766584', 'Cricket on the Hearth', 1967, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Danny Thomas, Marlo Thomas, Roddy McDowall, Hans Conried, Paul Frees, Ed Ames, Abbe Lane', null, 'A delightful, animated musical version of Charles Dickens'' classic tale. A Cricket on the Hearth, tells the story of a poor toymaker and his daughter whom a helpful Cricket named Crocket befriends on Christmas morning. When tragedy strikes the family, it''s Crocket who comes to the rescue and restores peace and happiness.', 'A delightful, animated musical version of Charles Dickens'' classic tale. A Cricket on the Hearth, tells the story of a poor toymaker and his daughter whom a helpful Cricket named Crocket befriends on Christmas morning. When tragedy strikes the family, it''s Crocket who comes to the rescue and restores peace and happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZRYBDUyGpq3ylyIePvZntvmvHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49743'),
  ('523946626141191180', 'Cries in the Night', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Fruet, Mark Irwin', 'Ida Nelson', 'Kay Hawtrey, Lesleh Donaldson, Barry Morse, Dean Garbett, Stephen E. Miller, Alf Humphreys, Peggy Mahon, Harvey Atkin', 'R', 'A young woman arrives at her grandmother''s house, which used to be a funeral home, to help her turn the place into a bed-and-breakfast inn. After they open, however, guests begin disappearing or turning up dead.', 'A young woman arrives at her grandmother''s house, which used to be a funeral home, to help her turn the place into a bed-and-breakfast inn. After they open, however, guests begin disappearing or turning up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lglKODPrvTuLGgqEJbPSlHDHG8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71503'),
