  ('188357366931409469', 'Crime Is Our Business', 2008, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Pascal Thomas, Renan Pollès', 'Clémence de Biéville, François Caviglioli, Pascal Thomas', 'Catherine Frot, André Dussollier, Claude Rich, Chiara Mastroianni, Melvil Poupaud, Alexandre Lafaurie, Christian Vadim, Hippolyte Girardot', null, 'Loosely based on "4.50 from Paddington" by Agatha Christie.', 'Loosely based on "4.50 from Paddington" by Agatha Christie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w1RfhaiRN9TjEaQ5wAoHQm0YuPr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15437'),
  ('319003895439335', 'Crime of Crimes', 1989, 'Horror, Drama', 'Alfredo Zacarías, Connie Paige', 'Alfredo Zacarías', 'David Carradine, Richard Yniguez, Aldo Ray, Jeff Celentano, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez, Susan Saldivar, Jimmy Williams, Maggie Ochoa', null, 'A Latino family new to Los Angeles find itself in trouble when the husband is arrested for a murder he didn''t commit. His pregnant wife winds up in the hospital, and his little daughter is kidnapped by a child molester.', 'A Latino family new to Los Angeles find itself in trouble when the husband is arrested for a murder he didn''t commit. His pregnant wife winds up in the hospital, and his little daughter is kidnapped by a child molester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atRYKCFcELxSN9KWwdTKSS9nJGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120225'),
  ('379947345040261933', 'Crime of Passion', 1956, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Joseph LaShelle, Gerd Oswald, Jack R. Berne', 'Jo Eisinger', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Sterling Hayden, Raymond Burr, Fay Wray, Virginia Grey, Royal Dano, Robert Griffin, Dennis Cross', 'NR', 'Kathy leaves the newspaper business to marry homicide detective Bill, but is frustrated by his lack of ambition and the banality of life in the suburbs. Her drive to advance Bill''s career soon takes her down a dangerous path.', 'Kathy leaves the newspaper business to marry homicide detective Bill, but is frustrated by his lack of ambition and the banality of life in the suburbs. Her drive to advance Bill''s career soon takes her down a dangerous path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dDpstkYlTAE8n9jqcTYt3jJVNXm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1920'),
  ('631376978123374343', 'Crime of the Century', 1996, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Mark Rydell, Toyomichi Kurita', 'William Nicholson', 'Stephen Rea, Isabella Rossellini, J.T. Walsh, Michael Moriarty, Allen Garfield, John Harkins, Barry Primus, David Paymer', null, 'In 1932, the nation was shocked when the 14-month-old son of Charles Lindbergh was kidnapped, held for ransom, and murdered. Two years later, Bruno Richard Hauptmann was arrested, convicted, and executed. This film dramatizes the investigation against Hauptmann, the trial, and the execution, painting a picture of a corrupt police force under pressure to finger a killer framing an innocent man by manufacturing evidence, paying-off and blackmailing witnesses, and covering up exculpatory evidence.', 'In 1932, the nation was shocked when the 14-month-old son of Charles Lindbergh was kidnapped, held for ransom, and murdered. Two years later, Bruno Richard Hauptmann was arrested, convicted, and executed. This film dramatizes the investigation against Hauptmann, the trial, and the execution, painting a picture of a corrupt police force under pressure to finger a killer framing an innocent man by manufacturing evidence, paying-off and blackmailing witnesses, and covering up exculpatory evidence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnfRkYErOIPQwpm2WT5Ac7U98dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198389'),
  ('1152670699057868861', 'Crime on a Summer Morning', 1965, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jacques Deray, Juan Julio Baena, Jean Charvein', 'Maurice Fabre, Michel Audiard, Jacques Deray', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Geraldine Chaplin, Sophie Daumier, Georges Géret, Gabriele Ferzetti, Akim Tamiroff, Adolfo Celi, Jacques Monod', null, 'An ill-assorted group of international criminals executes a tightly-planned ransom sting in Spain. Things go along swimmingly until various tensions within the group come to the fore.', 'An ill-assorted group of international criminals executes a tightly-planned ransom sting in Spain. Things go along swimmingly until various tensions within the group come to the fore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghjQZ6qCPuNDvi0HBupbd4sB7sF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83788'),
  ('792749365809050940', 'Crime on the Highway', 1982, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Carlo Carlini, Bruno Corbucci, Roberto Tatti', 'Mario Amendola, Bruno Corbucci', 'Tomas Milian, Viola Valentino, Olimpia Di Nardo, Giorgio Trestini, Adriana Russo, Gabriella Giorgelli, Paco Fabrini, Bombolo', null, 'Undercover cop Nico Giraldi is once again transformed, now as a trucker in a criminal gang.', 'Undercover cop Nico Giraldi is once again transformed, now as a trucker in a criminal gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVLkRCvJqQ9rafp48VKcPndRYmQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52113'),
  ('444430997805484631', 'Crime Scenes', 2000, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Frédéric Schoendoerffer, Jean-Pierre Sauvaire', 'Yann Brion', 'Charles Berling, André Dussollier, Ludovic Schoendoerffer, Pierre Mottet, Hubert Saint-Macary, Élodie Navarre, Éva Darlan, Djemel Barek', null, 'The disappearance of a young woman puts two forensic police officers on the trail of a serial killer. Their fears are confirmed by the discovery of several corpses, what follows is a long hunt across Paris.', 'The disappearance of a young woman puts two forensic police officers on the trail of a serial killer. Their fears are confirmed by the discovery of several corpses, what follows is a long hunt across Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XgVM5zm3WdO82tIFe8IFaTXUW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69758'),
  ('369565771063757782', 'Crime School', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lewis Seiler, Arthur L. Todd, William Clemens', 'Crane Wilbur, Vincent Sherman', 'Humphrey Bogart, Gale Page, Billy Halop, Bobby Jordan, Huntz Hall, Leo Gorcey, Bernard Punsly, Gabriel Dell', null, 'In the slums, teenager Frankie Warren hangs out with a rowdy gang who one day knock him out in a fight. In court, the boys refuse to reveal who struck the knockout blow, and all are subsequently sentenced to a reformatory, cruelly run by two corrupt guards. New deputy commissioner Mark Braden arrives determined to change things, but despite the help of Frankie''s sister, Mark''s reform plans -- and Frankie''s future -- may be sabotaged from within.', 'In the slums, teenager Frankie Warren hangs out with a rowdy gang who one day knock him out in a fight. In court, the boys refuse to reveal who struck the knockout blow, and all are subsequently sentenced to a reformatory, cruelly run by two corrupt guards. New deputy commissioner Mark Braden arrives determined to change things, but despite the help of Frankie''s sister, Mark''s reform plans -- and Frankie''s future -- may be sabotaged from within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/711a1AAfFQ5IVlCLUQHWCdI68Pd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79129'),
  ('889383375114299389', 'Crime Spree', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Brad Mirman, Derek Rogers, Matthew Williams', 'Brad Mirman', 'Gérard Depardieu, Harvey Keitel, Johnny Hallyday, Renaud, Saïd Taghmaoui, Stéphane Freiss, Shawn Lawrence, Albert Dray', 'R', 'An out-of-town heist becomes a nightmare for a crew of French burglars when they mistakenly rob the head of the Chicago mafia. Unaccustomed to the ways of the American underworld, it is not long before they have the mafia, the FBI and a couple of street gangs on their backs as they attempt to make their way back to Paris.', 'An out-of-town heist becomes a nightmare for a crew of French burglars when they mistakenly rob the head of the Chicago mafia. Unaccustomed to the ways of the American underworld, it is not long before they have the mafia, the FBI and a couple of street gangs on their backs as they attempt to make their way back to Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxiL0nUW82RGz5lNv8HbRf95Dc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6277'),
  ('1017956760289904436', 'Crime Story', 1993, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Kirk Wong Chi-Keung, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Andy Lam Kwok-Wah', 'Chun Tin-Nam, Chan Man-Keung, Joyee Cheung Lai-Ling', 'Jackie Chan, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Christine Ng Wing-Mei, Law Kar-Ying, Susanna Au-Yeung Pui-San, Ken Lo Wai-Kwong, Pan Lingling, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung', 'R', 'A special agent is assigned to protect a wealthy business magnate. However, when the businessman is kidnapped in a daring ambush, he teams up with a seasoned detective to crack the case. But soon he discovers the case isn''t that simple.', 'A special agent is assigned to protect a wealthy business magnate. However, when the businessman is kidnapped in a daring ambush, he teams up with a seasoned detective to crack the case. But soon he discovers the case isn''t that simple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1LzBLlptRC7ogT8OPi8cb0NrDQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18857'),
  ('517688574332564993', 'Crime Story', 2021, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Adam Lipsius, John DeFazio, Bashir Taylor', 'Adam Lipsius', 'Richard Dreyfuss, Mira Sorvino, D.W. Moffett, Cress Williams, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Derek Russo, Haviland Stillwell, Andrea Frankle', 'R', 'When ex-mob boss Ben Myers is targeted in a home robbery, he goes on a deadly rampage of vengeance. But with his family caught in the crosshairs, Myers must finally face the consequences of his dark past.', 'When ex-mob boss Ben Myers is targeted in a home robbery, he goes on a deadly rampage of vengeance. But with his family caught in the crosshairs, Myers must finally face the consequences of his dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nGGXXnR0CP2VqHsqSxFlsYdSTq4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847153'),
  ('676346257842113840', 'Crime Wave', 1953, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Bert Glennon, André de Toth, James McMahon', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Sterling Hayden, Gene Nelson, Phyllis Kirk, Ted de Corsia, Charles Bronson, Jay Novello, Nedrick Young, James Bell', 'NR', 'Reformed parolee Steve Lacey is caught in the middle when a wounded former cellmate seeks him out for shelter. The other two former cellmates then attempt to force him into doing a bank job.', 'Reformed parolee Steve Lacey is caught in the middle when a wounded former cellmate seeks him out for shelter. The other two former cellmates then attempt to force him into doing a bank job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6eQiEo6fxb5SdJ3PolsTHv75gL2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19618'),
  ('914719409620261318', 'Crime Wave', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime', 'John Paizs', 'John Paizs', 'Eva Kovacs, John Paizs, Darrell Baran, Mark Yuill, Neil Lawrie, Martin Bresin, Jeffrey Owen Maden, Tea Andrea Tanner', 'PG-13', 'A young director intent on making "the greatest color crime movie ever" can''t seem to finish his script--he has a beginning and an end, but he can''t quite figure out the middle. The daughter of his landlord, excited to have a real "movie person" living nearby, tries to help by putting him in touch with a man who wants to collaborate on a script--the strange "Dr. Jolly"', 'A young director intent on making "the greatest color crime movie ever" can''t seem to finish his script--he has a beginning and an end, but he can''t quite figure out the middle. The daughter of his landlord, excited to have a real "movie person" living nearby, tries to help by putting him in touch with a man who wants to collaborate on a script--the strange "Dr. Jolly"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v55czA2dnYQ0u3ByfJtXk3jB1DH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27294'),
  ('583378057683594568', 'Crime Wave', 2018, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gracia Querejeta, Ángel Amorós', 'Luis Marías', 'Maribel Verdú, Antonio Resines, Luis Tosar, Juana Acosta, Paula Echevarría, Txema Blasco, Asier Rikarte, Javier Perdiguero', null, 'Leyre lives a quiet and comfortable life which ends abruptly when an act of rage of her teenage son leads her to protect him by any means necessary.', 'Leyre lives a quiet and comfortable life which ends abruptly when an act of rage of her teenage son leads her to protect him by any means necessary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iK0eUBcBVT2LkcFXVpMB8gz92e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529207'),
  ('572658294532767473', 'Crime Without Passion', 1934, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ben Hecht, Charles MacArthur, Lee Garmes', 'James L. Shute', 'Claude Rains, Margo, Whitney Bourne, Stanley Ridges, Leslie Adams, Dorothy Bradshaw, Fanny Brice, Jack Carr', null, 'Caddish lawyer Lee Gentry is going out with Katy Costello, but carrying on an affair with dancer Carmen Brown. When he wants to end the dalliance with Carmen, she is so distraught that she becomes suicidal. Seizing the gun from Carmen, he accidentally shoots her, and thinking she''s dead, concocts a series of increasingly outlandish alibis to cover his tracks under the guidance of a ghostly apparition that is his alter ego.', 'Caddish lawyer Lee Gentry is going out with Katy Costello, but carrying on an affair with dancer Carmen Brown. When he wants to end the dalliance with Carmen, she is so distraught that she becomes suicidal. Seizing the gun from Carmen, he accidentally shoots her, and thinking she''s dead, concocts a series of increasingly outlandish alibis to cover his tracks under the guidance of a ghostly apparition that is his alter ego.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DHkiHKEdWB7TRjqTIJf7AQWEzm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28157'),
  ('819568684944398195', 'Crime Zone', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Luis Llosa, Cusi Barrio', 'Daryl Haney', 'David Carradine, Peter Nelson, Sherilyn Fenn, Michael Shaner, Orlando Sacha, Alfredo Álvarez Calderón, Diana Quijano, Don Manor', 'R', 'In a post-nuclear future, crime has been eliminated in the city of Soleil through a strict class structure imposed upon the population. Two illegal young lovers are enticed into becoming criminals by a shady guy who promises them a way out of the city so they can continue their lives in peace.', 'In a post-nuclear future, crime has been eliminated in the city of Soleil through a strict class structure imposed upon the population. Two illegal young lovers are enticed into becoming criminals by a shady guy who promises them a way out of the city so they can continue their lives in peace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDhJuaQFjD3nfGx7pWXhX5CZuDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71072'),
  ('979128441639127429', 'Crime, Inc.', 1945, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lew Landers, James S. Brown Jr.', 'Raymond L. Schrock', 'Leo Carrillo, Tom Neal, Martha Tilton, Lionel Atwill, Grant Mitchell, Sheldon Leonard, Harry Shannon, Danny Morton', 'NR', 'A crime reporter writes book to expose names and methods of the criminal leaders. He is held on a charge after refusing to explain how he got his information, but is released and helps to expose the syndicate.', 'A crime reporter writes book to expose names and methods of the criminal leaders. He is held on a charge after refusing to explain how he got his information, but is released and helps to expose the syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9a5U5L91P3VMp4FJM1SiNVpgkW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35916'),
  ('271168057023344604', 'Crimes and Misdemeanors', 1989, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Woody Allen, Sven Nykvist, Thomas A. Reilly', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Martin Landau, Mia Farrow, Alan Alda, Anjelica Huston, Joanna Gleason, Sam Waterston, Jerry Orbach', 'PG-13', 'A renowned ophthalmologist is desperate to cut off an adulterous relationship…which ends up in murder; and a frustrated documentary filmmaker woos an attractive television producer while making a film about her insufferably self-centered boss.', 'A renowned ophthalmologist is desperate to cut off an adulterous relationship…which ends up in murder; and a frustrated documentary filmmaker woos an attractive television producer while making a film about her insufferably self-centered boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vC6MLYUICH57MmEVi1UaNaj2Qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11562'),
  ('429298303161537607', 'Crimes at the Dark House', 1940, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'George King, Hone Glendinning, Hal Mason', null, 'Tod Slaughter, Sylvia Marriott, Hilary Eaves, Geoffrey Wardwell, Hay Petrie, Margaret Yarde, Rita Grant, David Horne', null, 'In this lurid melodrama, Tod Slaughter plays a villain who murders the wealthy Sir Percival Glyde in the gold fields of Australia and assumes his identity in order to inherit Glyde''s estate in England. On arriving in England, "Sir Percival" schemes to marry an heiress for her money, and, with the connivance of the cunning Dr. Isidor Fosco, embarks on a killing spree of all who suspect him to be an imposter and would get in the way of his plans to stay Lord of the Manor.', 'In this lurid melodrama, Tod Slaughter plays a villain who murders the wealthy Sir Percival Glyde in the gold fields of Australia and assumes his identity in order to inherit Glyde''s estate in England. On arriving in England, "Sir Percival" schemes to marry an heiress for her money, and, with the connivance of the cunning Dr. Isidor Fosco, embarks on a killing spree of all who suspect him to be an imposter and would get in the way of his plans to stay Lord of the Manor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zGJOZs6QSBrii3aKHdcO5LyyY3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87907'),
  ('1012313766924585824', 'Crimes of Fashion', 2004, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stuart Gillard, David McLeod, Manfred Guthe', 'David Mickel', 'Kaley Cuoco, Megan Fox, Dominic Chianese, Pat Kelly, Chuck Shamata, Jill Morrison, Tim Rozon, Serena Lee', null, 'Brooke, a plain but creative and hard-working student at the top fashion school in the nation, who has come a long way from her tough childhood spent going from one foster home to another as an orphan. She has always dreamed of becoming a fashion designer, and is thrilled to finally be on her way. But, when the grandfather she never knew about passes away, her life is suddenly turned upside down. Not only has he left her his estate, but he''s left her in charge of the family business, as mob boss to one of the top crime syndicates that has been trying to go legit. If that isn''t enough, the handsome new student she''s falling for is actually an undercover FBI agent aiming to get dirt on her to bring down the family empire.', 'Brooke, a plain but creative and hard-working student at the top fashion school in the nation, who has come a long way from her tough childhood spent going from one foster home to another as an orphan. She has always dreamed of becoming a fashion designer, and is thrilled to finally be on her way. But, when the grandfather she never knew about passes away, her life is suddenly turned upside down. Not only has he left her his estate, but he''s left her in charge of the family business, as mob boss to one of the top crime syndicates that has been trying to go legit. If that isn''t enough, the handsome new student she''s falling for is actually an undercover FBI agent aiming to get dirt on her to bring down the family empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GEanRXR1tIfSXQlDK9bPZKpaKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36290'),
  ('40272436151108322', 'Crimes of Passion', 1984, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Ken Russell, Dick Bush, Pat Kehoe', 'Barry Sandler', 'Kathleen Turner, Anthony Perkins, John Laughlin, Annie Potts, Bruce Davison, Norman Burton, Stephen Lee, Gordon Hunt', 'R', 'Fashion designer Joanna Crane leads a double life. By night she is China Blue, a prostitute who''s attracted the attention of a sexually frustrated private detective, and a psychopathic priest in possession of a murderous sex toy.', 'Fashion designer Joanna Crane leads a double life. By night she is China Blue, a prostitute who''s attracted the attention of a sexually frustrated private detective, and a psychopathic priest in possession of a murderous sex toy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tstF6JMrZe75AdEAoPejwPrDfMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40814'),
  ('977523579030272794', 'Crimes of Passion', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Walter Doehner', 'Erick Ismael Hernández', 'Plutarco Haza, Maria de la Fuente, Alejandro Belmonte, Emilio Guerrero, Alejandra Ambrosi', null, 'Arturo Bolaño is a mediocre insurance salesman who loves women, booze and any short cut he can find to Easy Street. He thinks he''s found it with the beautiful Rebeca Solis, the wife of the owner of the hotel where he stays on business. Rebeca wants nothing more than to escape from her husband and after Arturo falls in love, she asks him to help her get rid of him. The plan goes without a hitch but just as they think they are going to get away with murder, they receive an anonymous letter from a witness to the crime.', 'Arturo Bolaño is a mediocre insurance salesman who loves women, booze and any short cut he can find to Easy Street. He thinks he''s found it with the beautiful Rebeca Solis, the wife of the owner of the hotel where he stays on business. Rebeca wants nothing more than to escape from her husband and after Arturo falls in love, she asks him to help her get rid of him. The plan goes without a hitch but just as they think they are going to get away with murder, they receive an anonymous letter from a witness to the crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/suVksVmaSMsm1G1bsBPOxY5nPfa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96438'),
  ('857769018692712260', 'Crimes of the Future', 1970, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'David Cronenberg, David Cronenberg', 'David Cronenberg', 'Ronald Mlodzik, Jon Lidolt, Tania Zolty, Paul Mulholland, Jack Messinger, Iain Ewing, William Haslam, Raymond Woodley', 'NR', 'Crimes of the Future is set in a future where sexually mature women appear to have been obliterated by a plague produced by the use of cosmetics. The film details the wanderings of Adrian Tripod, director of the dermatological clinic the House of Skin. Tripod seems at a loss following the disappearance of his mentor Antoine Rouge.', 'Crimes of the Future is set in a future where sexually mature women appear to have been obliterated by a plague produced by the use of cosmetics. The film details the wanderings of Adrian Tripod, director of the dermatological clinic the House of Skin. Tripod seems at a loss following the disappearance of his mentor Antoine Rouge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w28rLVOO5hrmA7fe4cbZgS2993Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27371'),
  ('1151215828992353470', 'Crimes of the Future', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'David Cronenberg, Anna Deligianni, Douglas Koch', 'David Cronenberg', 'Viggo Mortensen, Léa Seydoux, Scott Speedman, Kristen Stewart, Welket Bungué, Don McKellar, Tanaya Beatty, Nadia Litz', 'R', 'With his partner, a celebrity performance artist publicly showcases the metamorphosis of his organs in avant-garde performances. An investigator from the National Organ Registry obsessively tracks their movements, which is when a mysterious group is revealed... Their mission — to use the artist''s notoriety to shed light on the next phase of human evolution.', 'With his partner, a celebrity performance artist publicly showcases the metamorphosis of his organs in avant-garde performances. An investigator from the National Organ Registry obsessively tracks their movements, which is when a mysterious group is revealed... Their mission — to use the artist''s notoriety to shed light on the next phase of human evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RAFYMC0NgK9In9aGY6k6wsIL8w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819876'),
  ('716022550930234009', 'Crimes of the Heart', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce Beresford, Richard Luke Rothschild, Joel Segal', 'Beth Henley', 'Diane Keaton, Jessica Lange, Sissy Spacek, Sam Shepard, Tess Harper, David Carpenter, Hurd Hatfield, Beeson Carroll', 'PG-13', 'Three sisters try to come to grips with the meaning of their mother''s suicide.', 'Three sisters try to come to grips with the meaning of their mother''s suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yet0Ww2A7f5qT7MisDuIBSXdV3r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48259'),
  ('1041075023677711410', 'Crimetime', 1996, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'George Sluizer, Jules van den Steenhoven', 'Brendan Somers', 'Stephen Baldwin, Pete Postlethwaite, Sadie Frost, Geraldine Chaplin, Karen Black, James Faulkner, Phil Davis, Marianne Faithfull', 'R', 'The star of a TV crime reenactment show becomes caught up in the mind of the killer he is playing.', 'The star of a TV crime reenactment show becomes caught up in the mind of the killer he is playing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SLvvmMPt1I97ea1SOoD0k26Kak.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99859'),
  ('603098962996478086', 'Crimewave', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Sam Raimi, Robert Primes, John Cameron', 'Sam Raimi, Ethan Coen, Joel Coen', 'Reed Birney, Louise Lasser, Sheree J. Wilson, Paul L. Smith, Brion James, Edward R. Pressman, Bruce Campbell, Frances McDormand', 'PG-13', 'A pair of whacked-out cartoon-like exterminator/hitmen kill the owner of a burglar-alarm company, and stalk the partner who hired them, his wife, and a nerd framed for the murder, who tells the story in flashback from the electric chair.', 'A pair of whacked-out cartoon-like exterminator/hitmen kill the owner of a burglar-alarm company, and stalk the partner who hired them, his wife, and a nerd framed for the murder, who tells the story in flashback from the electric chair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bP8zmzcJiIqMwUAfpfYgP5IHif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21627'),
  ('816944411034714736', 'Criminal', 2004, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Chris Menges, Gregory Jacobs', 'Fabián Bielinsky', 'John C. Reilly, Diego Luna, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Peter Mullan, Zitto Kazann, Jonathan Tucker, Laura Cerón, Soledad St. Hilaire', 'R', 'Needing a new partner capable of intricate cons, Richard Gaddis, recruits Rodrigo, a crook with a perfect poker face. The two plan a big-time scam: selling a fake Silver Certificate to currency collector William Hannigan. Rodrigo distrusts his new associate, but needs money to help out his ill father. The situation becomes more complicated when Rodrigo falls for Gaddis'' sister, Valerie, drawing another player into the game.', 'Needing a new partner capable of intricate cons, Richard Gaddis, recruits Rodrigo, a crook with a perfect poker face. The two plan a big-time scam: selling a fake Silver Certificate to currency collector William Hannigan. Rodrigo distrusts his new associate, but needs money to help out his ill father. The situation becomes more complicated when Rodrigo falls for Gaddis'' sister, Valerie, drawing another player into the game.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Nd816rpRLxuq8YU3dPcDsoTpWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14198'),
  ('110485185025809873', 'Criminal', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Ariel Vromen, Dana Gonzales, Grant Armstrong', 'Douglas S. Cook, David Weisberg', 'Kevin Costner, Gary Oldman, Tommy Lee Jones, Gal Gadot, Alice Eve, Ryan Reynolds, Michael Pitt, Jordi Mollà', 'R', 'CIA Agent Bill Pope is on a mission to track down a shadowy hacker named ''The Dutchman''. When he gets mysteriously killed, an experimental procedure transfers his memories into a dangerous ex-convict. When he wakes up Pope''s memories, his mission is to eliminate The Dutchman before the hacker launches ICBMs and starts World War III.', 'CIA Agent Bill Pope is on a mission to track down a shadowy hacker named ''The Dutchman''. When he gets mysteriously killed, an experimental procedure transfers his memories into a dangerous ex-convict. When he wakes up Pope''s memories, his mission is to eliminate The Dutchman before the hacker launches ICBMs and starts World War III.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hn6HmGTopbbxv4Myy2IwGWxViFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302156'),
  ('157125733025123149', 'Criminal Activities', 2015, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Jackie Earle Haley, Chris Debenedetto, Seamus Tierney', 'Robert Lowell', 'Dan Stevens, John Travolta, Michael Pitt, Jackie Earle Haley, Travis Aaron Wade, Christopher Abbott, Rob Brown, Edi Gathegi', 'R', 'Four young men make a risky investment together that gets them into trouble with the mob.', 'Four young men make a risky investment together that gets them into trouble with the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwPUSDETHavt2c2bdLbG1RKxkVB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334527'),
  ('783950233784308003', 'Criminal Court', 1946, 'Crime, Drama', 'Robert Wise, Frank Redman, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Lawrence Kimble', 'Tom Conway, Martha O''Driscoll, June Clayworth, Robert Armstrong, Addison Richards, Pat Gleason, Steve Brodie, Robert Warwick', 'NR', 'A lawyer who is planning to run for District Attorney accidentally kills a gangster who owns the nightclub where the attorney''s girlfriend is a singer. Although he manages to cover up his involvement in the crime, his girlfriend discovers the body and is subsequently charged with the murder.', 'A lawyer who is planning to run for District Attorney accidentally kills a gangster who owns the nightclub where the attorney''s girlfriend is a singer. Although he manages to cover up his involvement in the crime, his girlfriend discovers the body and is subsequently charged with the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bimtyuhd6w8vEP2UnyYivGYz0bs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46095'),
  ('695195881095585083', 'Criminal Law', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Martin Campbell, Carole Dubuc, Tommy Groszman', 'Mark Kasdan', 'Gary Oldman, Kevin Bacon, Tess Harper, Karen Young, Joe Don Baker, Sean McCann, Ron Lea, Michael Sinelnikoff', 'R', 'Ben Chase is an on-the-rise Boston attorney currently defending a wealthy client in a high-profile murder case. Martin Thiel is the wealthy young man on trial for a particularly brutal murder. The verdict sets Thiel free. Within 24 hours another grizzly and all-too-familiar murder has taken place with striking similarities to the first crime. Chase inexplicably agrees to act as his defense attorney; but this time it will be to gather evidence that will put away his client for good.', 'Ben Chase is an on-the-rise Boston attorney currently defending a wealthy client in a high-profile murder case. Martin Thiel is the wealthy young man on trial for a particularly brutal murder. The verdict sets Thiel free. Within 24 hours another grizzly and all-too-familiar murder has taken place with striking similarities to the first crime. Chase inexplicably agrees to act as his defense attorney; but this time it will be to gather evidence that will put away his client for good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5cPgWYrJtXBzJZuPmzhlYrEmrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41952'),
  ('151186907772073130', 'Criminal Lovers', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller, Romance', 'François Ozon, Pierre Stoeber', 'Marcia Romano, Annabelle Perrichon', 'Natacha Régnier, Jérémie Renier, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Salim Kéchiouche, Yasmine Belmadi, Bernard Maume, Jean-Louis Debard, Catherine Vierne', null, 'After a perverted impulse drives them to kill, Alice and her boyfriend, Luc, drag the body into the woods, only to find themselves hopelessly lost – much like the fairy-tale plight of Hansel and Gretel. Starving and with no hope of being found, they chance upon a dilapidated cottage where a hulking man takes them prisoner and proceeds to feed Luc''s sexual appetite.', 'After a perverted impulse drives them to kill, Alice and her boyfriend, Luc, drag the body into the woods, only to find themselves hopelessly lost – much like the fairy-tale plight of Hansel and Gretel. Starving and with no hope of being found, they chance upon a dilapidated cottage where a hulking man takes them prisoner and proceeds to feed Luc''s sexual appetite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFqPlZh9S1wP1MR3RiiyWiyc50i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33828'),
  ('1023859732918992304', 'Criminal Passion', 1994, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Donna Deitch, Richard Weinman, Wendy Ikeguchi', 'Max Strom, John Allen Nelson', 'Joan Severance, Tony Denison, John Allen Nelson, David Labiosa, Wolfgang Bodison, Henry Darrow, Lou Felder, Shannon McLeod', 'R', 'Homicide detective Melanie Hudson begins a torrid affair with a senator''s son who is a suspect in a series of grisly murders.', 'Homicide detective Melanie Hudson begins a torrid affair with a senator''s son who is a suspect in a series of grisly murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fGazr8ls4d1FGVufdF0u3bb73V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219645'),
  ('7523070310751393', 'Criminal Talent', 1988, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Sergej Ashkenazy, Serhiy Stasenko', 'Yuri Makarov', 'Aleksandra Zakharova, Aleksei Zharkov, Igor Nefyodov, Vladimir Simonov, Vladimir Korenev, Alla Budnitskaya, Yuriy Dubrovin, Anna Nazaryeva', null, 'A tragicomic story about a long going duel between experienced detective and young and pretty girl in the start of her grafter career.', 'A tragicomic story about a long going duel between experienced detective and young and pretty girl in the start of her grafter career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rB4sxI3m8kXyeQY8mdZr7I06oEs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63294'),
  ('575432716290917307', 'Criminal Woman: Killing Melody', 1973, 'Action, Crime', 'Shinichi Hashimoto, Atsushi Mihori, Masahiko Iimura', 'Hirō Matsuda, Fumio Kōnami', 'Reiko Ike, Miki Sugimoto, Yumiko Katayama, Chiyoko Kazama, Masami Sôda, Ryōji Hayama, Shinzō Hotta, Seiya Satō', null, 'Reiko Ike stars as the daughter of a man who has been pushed into drug dealing by the local Yakuza mob. Having outlived his usefulness to the gang he is murdered and Reiko is gang raped, leading her to attempt a knife attack on the Yakuza boss (Ryoji Hayama) at a swank nightclub. Failing to kill him she ends up in prison, where she befriends a crew of other malcontents (including Yumiko Katayama and Chiyoko Kazama) and meets the Yakuza boss''s girlfriend (Miki Sugimoto). Upon release Reiko reassembles her mob and launches a Machiavellian scheme to engineer a gang war between Hayama''s Oba Industries and the formerly dominant Hamayasu Clan. The rival gangs begin killing each other off and Reiko works her way closer to her ultimate vengeance.', 'Reiko Ike stars as the daughter of a man who has been pushed into drug dealing by the local Yakuza mob. Having outlived his usefulness to the gang he is murdered and Reiko is gang raped, leading her to attempt a knife attack on the Yakuza boss (Ryoji Hayama) at a swank nightclub. Failing to kill him she ends up in prison, where she befriends a crew of other malcontents (including Yumiko Katayama and Chiyoko Kazama) and meets the Yakuza boss''s girlfriend (Miki Sugimoto). Upon release Reiko reassembles her mob and launches a Machiavellian scheme to engineer a gang war between Hayama''s Oba Industries and the formerly dominant Hamayasu Clan. The rival gangs begin killing each other off and Reiko works her way closer to her ultimate vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pYiZ5xLLe4xc6sEjocfEt5sIb74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45503'),
  ('987761966314340586', 'Criminally Insane', 1975, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Nick Millard', 'Nick Millard', 'Priscilla Alden, Michael Flood, Jane Lambert, George Buck Flower, Sonny La Rocca, Lisa Farros, Ginna Martine, Cliff McDonald', 'R', 'An obese woman recently released from an insane asylum kills anyone who attempts to get her to stop eating.', 'An obese woman recently released from an insane asylum kills anyone who attempts to get her to stop eating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5z5DvkdCz2mNHzFBBtU2TQA8oGI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89659'),
  ('576850419302793990', 'Criminally Insane 2', 1987, 'Horror', 'Nick Millard', null, 'Priscilla Alden, Albert Eskinazi, Frances Millard, Royal Farros, Nick Millard', null, 'A mental hospital, faced with a severe decrease in funding, is forced to release mass-murderer Ethel Janowski into a halfway house. Ethel is psychotic, delusional and has a hefty appetite. In fact, her killing spree began 13 years before with the murder of her grandmother, who had forced her to go on a diet. Now that she''s tasted the home-cooked fare at the halfway house, she''ll do absolutely anything to get more.', 'A mental hospital, faced with a severe decrease in funding, is forced to release mass-murderer Ethel Janowski into a halfway house. Ethel is psychotic, delusional and has a hefty appetite. In fact, her killing spree began 13 years before with the murder of her grandmother, who had forced her to go on a diet. Now that she''s tasted the home-cooked fare at the halfway house, she''ll do absolutely anything to get more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Lk1kHyHoEkYrvGlRG67QNcB8vV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163447'),
  ('794444473226943485', 'Crimson Bat, the Blind Swordswoman', 1969, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Sadatsugu Matsuda, Shintarō Kawasaki, Toshiro Hasebe', 'Hajime Takaiwa, Ichirō Miyagawa, Ikuro Suzuki', 'Yōko Matsuyama, Chizuko Arai, Jun Tatara, Shinichi Yanagisawa, Akitake Kōno, Misako Tominaga, Bin Amatsu, Kozo Yamamura', null, 'A young girl named Oichi is abandoned by her mother and blinded by a lightning strike. When her guardian is killed, she learns to wield a sword from a traveling ronin. As she develops into a master swordsman, her profession becomes that of a bounty hunter. Many test her sword and many die by her skills. She travels throughout the countryside to seek her mother and her revenge.', 'A young girl named Oichi is abandoned by her mother and blinded by a lightning strike. When her guardian is killed, she learns to wield a sword from a traveling ronin. As she develops into a master swordsman, her profession becomes that of a bounty hunter. Many test her sword and many die by her skills. She travels throughout the countryside to seek her mother and her revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6WbcujCIWr2eIk5Ard8pTIWeK2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110455'),
  ('724500801322919666', 'Crimson Curtain', 1952, 'Drama', 'André Barsacq, François Chavane', 'André Barsacq', 'Michel Barsacq, Edmond Beauchamp, Pierre Brasseur, Michel Simon, Paul Barge, Monelle Valentin, Jean Brochard, Olivier Hussenot', null, 'Bertal, a despotic and hated theater director, is assassinated before a performance of Macbeth in which he was to play with Aurélia Nobli, his companion and Ludovic Arn, her lover. The police arrive on the scene and the investigation begins. Suspicion first falls on Sigurd, an old actor who had threatened Bertal. But parallels appear between the characters in the play and the actors who play them.', 'Bertal, a despotic and hated theater director, is assassinated before a performance of Macbeth in which he was to play with Aurélia Nobli, his companion and Ludovic Arn, her lover. The police arrive on the scene and the investigation begins. Suspicion first falls on Sigurd, an old actor who had threatened Bertal. But parallels appear between the characters in the play and the actors who play them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rxn7S78wWdUBHBlzfW3B3o533mS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67544'),
  ('1040988436848999695', 'Crimson Gold', 2003, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Jafar Panahi, Hossein Jafarian, Ramin Rastad', 'Abbas Kiarostami', 'Hossain Emadeddin, Kamyar Sheisi, Azita Rayeji, Shahram Vaziri, Ehsan Amani, Pourang Nakhael, Kaveh Najmabadi, Saber Safael', null, 'Pizza man Hussein is a daily witnesses to the unjust distribution of wealth in his native Iran. One day, he finds a purse filled with shockingly expensive receipts from an upscale jewelry store. He attempts to bring the purse back to the store, but because of his working-class attire, he''s not allowed inside. Then, during a delivery, a rich man invites Hussein into his extravagant mansion – an event that spurs Hussein to make a desperate bid for wealth.', 'Pizza man Hussein is a daily witnesses to the unjust distribution of wealth in his native Iran. One day, he finds a purse filled with shockingly expensive receipts from an upscale jewelry store. He attempts to bring the purse back to the store, but because of his working-class attire, he''s not allowed inside. Then, during a delivery, a rich man invites Hussein into his extravagant mansion – an event that spurs Hussein to make a desperate bid for wealth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5faNHWvJ7RdSiUKT07MJNhwkSKe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40427'),
  ('369772021877862059', 'Crimson Peak', 2015, 'Horror, Mystery, Romance', 'Adam Bocknek, Missy Morris, Zameret Kleiman', 'Guillermo del Toro, Matthew Robbins', 'Mia Wasikowska, Jessica Chastain, Tom Hiddleston, Charlie Hunnam, Jim Beaver, Burn Gorman, Leslie Hope, Jonathan Hyde', 'R', 'In the aftermath of a family tragedy, an aspiring author is torn between love for her childhood friend and the temptation of a mysterious outsider. Trying to escape the ghosts of her past, she is swept away to a house that breathes, bleeds… and remembers.', 'In the aftermath of a family tragedy, an aspiring author is torn between love for her childhood friend and the temptation of a mysterious outsider. Trying to escape the ghosts of her past, she is swept away to a house that breathes, bleeds… and remembers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9TOb5anVwZeSbYjU1qNxPk3KUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201085'),
  ('749318617899855955', 'Crimson Rivers II: Angels of the Apocalypse', 2004, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Olivier Dahan, Alex Lamarque', 'Luc Besson', 'Jean Reno, Benoît Magimel, Camille Natta, Christopher Lee, Johnny Hallyday, Gabrielle Lazure, Serge Riaboukine, Augustin Legrand', null, 'No one is safe when seemingly random killings emerge as a deadly pattern intended to usher in the end of the world. A murder victim with the same DNA as Christ. A serial killer mimicking the deaths of the 12 Apostles. Inspector Niemans and a young, rebellious detective team up with a beautiful expert in religion to crack the case before their elusive suspect completes the cycle of terror, paving the way to an even bigger bloody catastrophe.', 'No one is safe when seemingly random killings emerge as a deadly pattern intended to usher in the end of the world. A murder victim with the same DNA as Christ. A serial killer mimicking the deaths of the 12 Apostles. Inspector Niemans and a young, rebellious detective team up with a beautiful expert in religion to crack the case before their elusive suspect completes the cycle of terror, paving the way to an even bigger bloody catastrophe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvQZKLVzW3cYfR5bjgGTGZuCuHs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60672'),
  ('47985479684685862', 'Crimson Tide', 1995, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, War', 'Tony Scott, Dariusz Wolski, Daniel Maltese', 'Michael Schiffer', 'Denzel Washington, Gene Hackman, Matt Craven, George Dzundza, Viggo Mortensen, James Gandolfini, Rocky Carroll, Jaime Gomez', 'R', 'After the Cold War, a breakaway Russian republic with nuclear warheads becomes a possible worldwide threat. U.S. submarine Capt. Frank Ramsey signs on a relatively green but highly recommended Lt. Cmdr. Ron Hunter to the USS Alabama, which may be the only ship able to stop a possible Armageddon. When Ramsey insists that the Alabama must act aggressively, Hunter, fearing they will start rather than stop a disaster, leads a potential mutiny to stop him.', 'After the Cold War, a breakaway Russian republic with nuclear warheads becomes a possible worldwide threat. U.S. submarine Capt. Frank Ramsey signs on a relatively green but highly recommended Lt. Cmdr. Ron Hunter to the USS Alabama, which may be the only ship able to stop a possible Armageddon. When Ramsey insists that the Alabama must act aggressively, Hunter, fearing they will start rather than stop a disaster, leads a potential mutiny to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21nqRJ6ofEgVvEl68J4O9V26Xzy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8963'),
  ('525753795439173433', 'Crimson, the Color of Blood', 1973, 'Drama, Horror', 'Juan Fortuny', 'Marius Lesoeur, Juan Fortuny', 'Paul Naschy, Silvia Solar, Olivier Mathot, Evelyne Scott, Claude Boisson, Gilda Arancio, Pierre Biet, Víctor Israel', null, 'A mad doctor performs a head transplant on an injured criminal, which results in him being even more dangerous and murderous than before.', 'A mad doctor performs a head transplant on an injured criminal, which results in him being even more dangerous and murderous than before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9h8fAOf12vYA0dWGTZd3azTsWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135605'),
  ('1116996297473782123', 'Crip Camp: A Disability Revolution', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Justin Schein, Jim LeBrecht, Nicole Newnham', 'Nicole Newnham, Jim LeBrecht', 'Jim LeBrecht, Lionel Je''Woodyard, Joseph O''Conor, Ann Cupolo Freeman, Denise Sherer Jacobson, Larry Allison, Judith Heumann, Ellie Abrashkin', 'R', 'Down the road from Woodstock in the early 1970s, a revolution blossomed in a ramshackle summer camp for disabled teenagers, transforming their young lives and igniting a landmark movement.', 'Down the road from Woodstock in the early 1970s, a revolution blossomed in a ramshackle summer camp for disabled teenagers, transforming their young lives and igniting a landmark movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iALSypN3MhC6kBVwc9VpuJUlm1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653725'),
  ('264022752506014372', 'Cripple Creek', 1952, 'Western', 'Ray Nazarro, William V. Skall', 'Richard Schayer', 'George Montgomery, Karin Booth, Jerome Courtland, William Bishop, Richard Egan, Don Porter, John Dehner, Roy Roberts', 'NR', 'It''s 1893 and gold is being smuggled out of the country. Instead of stealing gold bars, the outlaws are stealing high grade ore, having it smelted, and then having it plated to look like lead. The Government sends agents Bret and Larry who arrive in Cripple Creek posing as Texas gunfighters. Bret finds the smelting operation and Larry learns of the payoff. But the crooked town Marshal is suspicious of the two men and the reply of his inquiry to Texas exposes them putting their lives in danger.', 'It''s 1893 and gold is being smuggled out of the country. Instead of stealing gold bars, the outlaws are stealing high grade ore, having it smelted, and then having it plated to look like lead. The Government sends agents Bret and Larry who arrive in Cripple Creek posing as Texas gunfighters. Bret finds the smelting operation and Larry learns of the payoff. But the crooked town Marshal is suspicious of the two men and the reply of his inquiry to Texas exposes them putting their lives in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s0FrrRhbcVTVzi4hBEoYSHF9xR3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179855'),
  ('36323347274541903', 'Crippled Avengers', 1978, 'Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Cho Wai-Kei, Chiang Sheng', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Phillip Kwok Chui, Lo Meng, Sun Chien, Chiang Sheng, Lu Feng, Johnny Wang Lung-Wei, Yang Hsiung', null, 'A group of martial artists seek revenge after being crippled by Tu Tin-To, a martial arts master, and his son.', 'A group of martial artists seek revenge after being crippled by Tu Tin-To, a martial arts master, and his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKdvNCKtiuUFvwCXtpwISw8jqZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40081'),
  ('22829061300510731', 'Crips and Bloods: Made in America', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Stacy Peralta', 'Stacy Peralta', 'Forest Whitaker, Jim Brown', null, 'With a first-person look at the notorious Crips and Bloods, this film examines the conditions that have lead to decades of devastating gang violence among young African Americans growing up in South Los Angeles.', 'With a first-person look at the notorious Crips and Bloods, this film examines the conditions that have lead to decades of devastating gang violence among young African Americans growing up in South Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3sRr4aYMjXFq453ru3slJi5nnWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18529'),
  ('345096605939651577', 'Crisis', 1946, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ingmar Bergman, Gösta Roosling', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Inga Landgré, Stig Olin, Marianne Löfgren, Dagny Lind, Allan Bohlin, Ernst Eklund, Signe Wirff, Svea Holst', null, 'A small-town piano teacher is shocked by the arrival of her foster daughter''s biological mother, whose young lover soon follows and causes further disruption.', 'A small-town piano teacher is shocked by the arrival of her foster daughter''s biological mother, whose young lover soon follows and causes further disruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6nUMIm7SfqKMBXNo646iVPL2NP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30734'),
  ('405151634150312014', 'Crisis', 1950, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Richard Brooks, Ray June', 'Richard Brooks', 'Cary Grant, José Ferrer, Paula Raymond, Signe Hasso, Ramon Novarro, Gilbert Roland, Leon Ames, John George', null, 'An American doctor gets caught in the middle of a revolution when he''s forced to operate on a South American dictator.', 'An American doctor gets caught in the middle of a revolution when he''s forced to operate on a South American dictator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpP3JwkvaBAJIreGruRx0WaLCFG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52364'),
  ('398170011778028209', 'Crisis', 2021, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Nicholas Jarecki, Nicolas Bolduc', 'Nicholas Jarecki', 'Gary Oldman, Armie Hammer, Evangeline Lilly, Greg Kinnear, Michelle Rodriguez, Luke Evans, Lily-Rose Depp, Guy Nadon', 'R', 'Three stories about the world of opioids collide: a drug trafficker arranges a multi-cartel Fentanyl smuggling operation between Canada and the U.S., an architect recovering from an OxyContin addiction tracks down the truth behind her son''s involvement with narcotics, and a university professor battles unexpected revelations about his research employer, a drug company with deep government influence bringing a new "non-addictive" painkiller to market.', 'Three stories about the world of opioids collide: a drug trafficker arranges a multi-cartel Fentanyl smuggling operation between Canada and the U.S., an architect recovering from an OxyContin addiction tracks down the truth behind her son''s involvement with narcotics, and a university professor battles unexpected revelations about his research employer, a drug company with deep government influence bringing a new "non-addictive" painkiller to market.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/15e2VcMTtk3pqgGlHWxisvygFAw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:580532'),
  ('1096586228362074195', 'Crisis Negotiators', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Herman Yau, Han Ping, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung', 'Herman Yau', 'Sean Lau Ching-wan, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Yeung Wai-Lun, Cherry Ngan Cheuk-Ling, Philip Keung Ho-Man, Kent Cheng Jak-Si', null, 'Negotiator expert Cheuk Man Wai unexpectedly becomes the prime suspect in a murder case. Forced into a corner, he occupies the police station, taking officers hostage, and demands negotiations with the former negotiator Tse Ka Chun. With Tse''s expertise in psychological manipulation and Check''s exceptional skills, they engage in a battle of wits. As the verbal sparring deepens, their positions and mindsets gradually change.', 'Negotiator expert Cheuk Man Wai unexpectedly becomes the prime suspect in a murder case. Forced into a corner, he occupies the police station, taking officers hostage, and demands negotiations with the former negotiator Tse Ka Chun. With Tse''s expertise in psychological manipulation and Check''s exceptional skills, they engage in a battle of wits. As the verbal sparring deepens, their positions and mindsets gradually change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nBr1HD711Zo8pBFr5ZUDQ4Wyql.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1255065'),
  ('452479511747215511', 'Crisis: Behind a Presidential Commitment', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Robert Drew, Gregory Shuker', null, 'James Lipscomb, John F. Kennedy, George Wallace, Robert F. Kennedy, Vivian Malone, James Hood, Nicholas Katzenbach', null, 'During a two-day period before and after the University of Alabama integration crisis, the film uses five camera crews to follow President John F. Kennedy, attorney general Robert F. Kennedy, Alabama governor George Wallace, deputy attorney general Nicholas Katzenbach and the students Vivian Malone and James Hood. As Wallace has promised to personally block the two black students from enrolling in the university, the JFK administration discusses the best way to react to it, without rousing the crowd or making Wallace a martyr for the segregationist cause. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 1999.', 'During a two-day period before and after the University of Alabama integration crisis, the film uses five camera crews to follow President John F. Kennedy, attorney general Robert F. Kennedy, Alabama governor George Wallace, deputy attorney general Nicholas Katzenbach and the students Vivian Malone and James Hood. As Wallace has promised to personally block the two black students from enrolling in the university, the JFK administration discusses the best way to react to it, without rousing the crowd or making Wallace a martyr for the segregationist cause. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with The Film Foundation in 1999.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkBQDLYzGM23Hz7pLDKoAqYwdpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162494'),
  ('131938062018644003', 'Criss Cross', 1949, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Siodmak, Franz Planer, Fred Frank', 'William Bowers', 'Burt Lancaster, Yvonne De Carlo, Dan Duryea, Stephen McNally, Esy Morales, Tom Pedi, Percy Helton, Alan Napier', 'NR', 'An armored-car guard must join a robbery after being caught with his ex-wife by her gangster husband.', 'An armored-car guard must join a robbery after being caught with his ex-wife by her gangster husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AwmyVw6h3nZWvkZUuNpZYDA2Dly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22112'),
