  ('1071141777309745886', 'Cristiana, Devil Nun', 1972, 'Drama', 'Marcello Cascape, Sergio Bergonzelli, Antonio Maccoppi', 'Sergio Bergonzelli', 'Toti Achilli, Magda Konopka, Vassili Karis, Gerardo Rossi, Maria Virginia Benati, Eva Czemerys, Marco Guglielmi, Carla Mancini', null, 'When it looks like the plane that Cristiana is traveling on is about to crash, she makes a pledge to become a nun if her life is spared. The plane lands safely & Cristiana upholds her end of the bargain, but even as a nun she cannot leave her promiscuous ways behind her.', 'When it looks like the plane that Cristiana is traveling on is about to crash, she makes a pledge to become a nun if her life is spared. The plane lands safely & Cristiana upholds her end of the bargain, but even as a nun she cannot leave her promiscuous ways behind her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4uBnCMZ9UT76bUw7Fnl0YnYeWG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148188'),
