  ('1025947850545286160', 'Critic', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Emilie Lesclaux, Kleber Mendonça Filho', 'Babak Payami, Tom Tykwer, Michel Ciment, João Moreira Salles, Pierre Murat, Elia Suleiman, Deborah Young, Cláudio Assis', null, 'Seventy critics and filmmakers discuss cinema around the conflict between the artist and the observer, the creator and the critic. Between 1998 and 2007, Kléber Mendonça Filho recorded testimonies about this relationship in Brazil, the United States and Europe, based on his experience as a critic.', 'Seventy critics and filmmakers discuss cinema around the conflict between the artist and the observer, the creator and the critic. Between 1998 and 2007, Kléber Mendonça Filho recorded testimonies about this relationship in Brazil, the United States and Europe, based on his experience as a critic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1oavqX1H6TVjsz9nr8J9aAlL2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134754'),
  ('800628713177181954', 'Critic''s Choice', 1963, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Don Weis, Russell Llewellyn, Charles Lang', 'Jack Sher', 'Bob Hope, Lucille Ball, Marilyn Maxwell, Rip Torn, Jessie Royce Landis, John Dehner, Jim Backus, Ricky Kelman', 'NR', 'Parker Ballantine is a New York theater critic and his wife writes a play that may or may not be very good. Now Parker must either get out of reviewing the play or cause the breakup of his marriage.', 'Parker Ballantine is a New York theater critic and his wife writes a play that may or may not be very good. Now Parker must either get out of reviewing the play or cause the breakup of his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYqHxE7yzL82wtx9qEr2B4wYigp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59838'),
  ('601651936653184913', 'Critical Care', 1997, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sidney Lumet, David Watkin', 'Steven Schwartz', 'James Spader, Kyra Sedgwick, Helen Mirren, Albert Brooks, Anne Bancroft, Wallace Shawn, Jeffrey Wright, Margo Martindale', 'R', 'Werner Ernst is a young hospital resident who becomes embroiled in a legal battle between two half-sisters who are fighting over the care of their comatose father. But are they really fighting over their father''s care, or over his $10 million estate? Meanwhile, Werner must contend with his nutty supervisor, who insists that he only care for patients with full insurance. Can Werner sidestep the hospital''s legal team and do what''s best for the patient?', 'Werner Ernst is a young hospital resident who becomes embroiled in a legal battle between two half-sisters who are fighting over the care of their comatose father. But are they really fighting over their father''s care, or over his $10 million estate? Meanwhile, Werner must contend with his nutty supervisor, who insists that he only care for patients with full insurance. Can Werner sidestep the hospital''s legal team and do what''s best for the patient?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4UPT3vvdKHsv6PbhvvtFm8w5Zx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61337'),
  ('211512311200504354', 'Critical Condition', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Michael Apted, Ralf D. Bode, Robert V. Girolami', 'Denis Hamill, John Hamill', 'Richard Pryor, Rachel Ticotin, Rubén Blades, Maria Cardinale, Joe Mantegna, Bob Dishy, Sylvia Miles, Joe Dallesandro', 'R', 'Eddie is a con artist. When he''s framed and comes before a judge, he hopes to get off the hook by claiming insanity—but instead ends up in a hospital for a mental assessment. That night, a storm causes a power failure and, in the ensuing chaos, Eddie is mistaken for a doctor and suddenly finds himself in charge of the hospital.', 'Eddie is a con artist. When he''s framed and comes before a judge, he hopes to get off the hook by claiming insanity—but instead ends up in a hospital for a mental assessment. That night, a storm causes a power failure and, in the ensuing chaos, Eddie is mistaken for a doctor and suddenly finds himself in charge of the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajJXJhnvmMlb768jKdOzEkoqgyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31563'),
  ('744446377331886583', 'Critical Thinking', 2020, 'Drama', 'John Leguizamo, Zach Zamboni', 'Dito Montiel', 'John Leguizamo, Rachel Bay Jones, Michael Kenneth Williams, Corwin C. Tuggles, Jorge Lendeborg Jr., Angel Bismark Curiel, Will Hochman, Jeffry Batista', null, 'Based on a true story from 1998, five Latino and Black teenagers from the toughest underserved ghetto in Miami fight their way into the National Chess Championship under the guidance of their unconventional but inspirational teacher.', 'Based on a true story from 1998, five Latino and Black teenagers from the toughest underserved ghetto in Miami fight their way into the National Chess Championship under the guidance of their unconventional but inspirational teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l1OR2xTnOOX95KGrS3dm5YQopy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665877'),
  ('903359804367619034', 'Critters', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Stephen Herek, Tim Suhrstedt, Perry Husman', 'Stephen Herek, Domonic Muir', 'Dee Wallace, M. Emmet Walsh, Billy Green Bush, Scott Grimes, Nadine Van der Velde, Don Keith Opper, Lin Shaye, Billy Zane', 'PG-13', 'Carnivorous aliens arrive unannounced at a Kansas family farm; two intergalactic bounty hunters soon follow, determined to blow them off the planet.', 'Carnivorous aliens arrive unannounced at a Kansas family farm; two intergalactic bounty hunters soon follow, determined to blow them off the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dxBy4WePZY06Bk5KvXb4K3UnjCy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3980'),
  ('972044216981907527', 'Critters 2', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Russell Carpenter, Mick Garris, Jerry Ketcham', 'David Twohy, Mick Garris', 'Scott Grimes, Liane Curtis, Don Keith Opper, Barry Corbin, Tom Hodges, Sam Anderson, Lindsay Parker, Herta Ware', 'PG-13', 'Three bounty hunters from space fly back to the town of Grovers Bend, hoping to save local residents from a new batch of Critter eggs.', 'Three bounty hunters from space fly back to the town of Grovers Bend, hoping to save local residents from a new batch of Critter eggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rR3dVJXnXskkBBWKbLg5EDKWtT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10127'),
  ('500591935979608998', 'Critters 3', 1991, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John E. Vohlers, Stuart B. Hagen, Romney Pearl', 'David J. Schow', 'Aimee Brooks, John Calvin, Katherine Cortez, Leonardo DiCaprio, Geoffrey Blake, Diana Bellamy, William Dennis Hunt, Frances Bay', 'PG-13', 'As fanged, furious furballs viciously invade an L.A. apartment building and sink their teeth into the low-rent tenants, Josh leads the battle to beat back the conniving critters and save the planet.', 'As fanged, furious furballs viciously invade an L.A. apartment building and sink their teeth into the low-rent tenants, Josh leads the battle to beat back the conniving critters and save the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frjklbq23pRgBjhekEq6drQkrZm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12702'),
  ('1074390123026418500', 'Critters 4', 1992, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John E. Vohlers, Stuart B. Hagen, Romney Pearl', 'Joseph Lyle, David J. Schow', 'Don Keith Opper, Paul Whitthorne, Angela Bassett, Anders Hove, Eric DaRe, Brad Dourif, Terrence Mann, Martine Beswick', 'PG-13', 'A super strain of genetically engineered mutants are designed to take over the universe, hungry to conquer the galaxy, with an appetite for mankind.', 'A super strain of genetically engineered mutants are designed to take over the universe, hungry to conquer the galaxy, with an appetite for mankind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1Xio02tnxgyFA9PnlP2OSCIK2C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12525'),
  ('332192697755418874', 'Critters Attack!', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Bobby Miller, Hein de Vos, Patrick Arias', 'Scott Lobdell', 'Tashiana Washington, Ava Preston, Jack Fulton, Jaeden Noel, Dee Wallace, Stephen Jennings, Pierre Malherbe, Alex Jeaven', 'R', 'Mysterious alien Critters have crash-landed in a small college town, devouring every living thing they encounter. Drea and the kids she''s babysitting must try desperately to save themselves from the ravenous, rolling beasts. Will Drea discover her inner badass, and will it be enough to stop the Critter onslaught?', 'Mysterious alien Critters have crash-landed in a small college town, devouring every living thing they encounter. Drea and the kids she''s babysitting must try desperately to save themselves from the ravenous, rolling beasts. Will Drea discover her inner badass, and will it be enough to stop the Critter onslaught?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQJQNElDQqQ3iXf46pyMmhReoyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597856'),
  ('1082890284533778226', 'Crô', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Bruno Barreto, Hugo Colace', 'Aguinaldo Silva', 'Marcelo Serrado, Carolina Ferraz, Alexandre Nero, Kátia Moraes, Carlos Machado, Milhem Cortaz, Úrzula Canaviri, Nataly Cabanas', null, 'After inheriting a fortune Tereza Cristina, Crodoalvo Valerius, better known as "Crô", is tired of life millionaire. Determined to find a new muse who can devote his life, he begins a personal quest that makes interview several turkeys. Your goal is to find one that is best qualified to own that he can serve as a steward, as he did with his former employer. However, after much review, just realizing that his ideal muse is exactly the one I had ever imagined.', 'After inheriting a fortune Tereza Cristina, Crodoalvo Valerius, better known as "Crô", is tired of life millionaire. Determined to find a new muse who can devote his life, he begins a personal quest that makes interview several turkeys. Your goal is to find one that is best qualified to own that he can serve as a steward, as he did with his former employer. However, after much review, just realizing that his ideal muse is exactly the one I had ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UbOGLwfsBuSCg1fl67hoSeBtAZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227968'),
  ('184725991076165763', 'Crô em Família', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Dante Belluti, Rossine A. Freitas, Anita Barbosa', 'Leandro Soares', 'Marcelo Serrado, Arlete Salles, Tonico Pereira, Jefferson Schroeder, Rosi Campos, João Baldasserini, Karina Marthin, Mel Maia', null, 'Already famous, at the top of his career, owner of his own school of etiquette, Crô sees himself alone and without a family. Lonely and vulnerable, he ends up living at the whim of supposed family, Orlando, Marinalva, Luane and Nando, whose intentions are far from the best. With the inseparable Geni, Magda and Jurema by his side, Crô will embark on an adventure to find his true family while constantly avoiding the venom of the top columnist Carlota Valdez.', 'Already famous, at the top of his career, owner of his own school of etiquette, Crô sees himself alone and without a family. Lonely and vulnerable, he ends up living at the whim of supposed family, Orlando, Marinalva, Luane and Nando, whose intentions are far from the best. With the inseparable Geni, Magda and Jurema by his side, Crô will embark on an adventure to find his true family while constantly avoiding the venom of the top columnist Carlota Valdez.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i3hfC09ov7ozxAwbof8IwcahYUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544946'),
  ('540205488171008981', 'Cro Minion', 2015, 'Animation, Family', 'Didier Ah-Koon, Régis Schuller', 'Brett Hoffman', 'Pierre Coffin, Chris Renaud, Tara Strong', 'NR', 'Two minions have to babysit a little Neanderthal baby.', 'Two minions have to babysit a little Neanderthal baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gduXRlGrywqLry0sdDrf37Tyibh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366141'),
  ('1102648834108473303', 'Croc', 2007, 'Horror, Action, TV Movie', 'Stewart Raffill, Terry Bamber, Vasit Suchitta', 'Ken Solarz', 'Michael Madsen, Peter Tuinstra, Sherry Edwards, Elizabeth Healey, Scott Hazell, Amy Lackgren, Elizabeth Lackgren, Nipaporn Jam Potong', null, 'A large man-eating crocodile terrorizes tourists and locals near Krabi, in Thailand. Michael Madsen plays a hunter stalking the immense reptile, while sub-plots include a rivalry between a foreigner, who owns a crocodile-farm, and a Thai man who plays a part in framing the foreigner for the crocodile''s rampage.', 'A large man-eating crocodile terrorizes tourists and locals near Krabi, in Thailand. Michael Madsen plays a hunter stalking the immense reptile, while sub-plots include a rivalry between a foreigner, who owns a crocodile-farm, and a Thai man who plays a part in framing the foreigner for the crocodile''s rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3moWZrfZRp38FWystfNYTrGOh4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35040'),
  ('394847951550947159', 'Crock of Gold: A Few Rounds with Shane MacGowan', 2020, 'Documentary, History, Drama', 'Julien Temple, Steve Organ', 'Julien Temple', 'Victoria Clarke, Johnny Depp, Shane MacGowan, Ann Scanlon, Terry Edwards, Gerry Adams, Bobby Gillespie, Paolo Ikonomi', 'NR', 'A celebration of the Irish punk/poet Shane MacGowan, lead singer and songwriter of The Pogues, that combines unseen archive footage from the band and MacGowan’s family with original animations.', 'A celebration of the Irish punk/poet Shane MacGowan, lead singer and songwriter of The Pogues, that combines unseen archive footage from the band and MacGowan’s family with original animations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/O25m9xEWCP9okDsXI823P0Mfd2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730506'),
  ('286868905473541647', 'Crockett-Doodle-Do', 1960, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Foghorn Leghorn decides to take an egghead genius chick out to the woods to distract him from his long-haired atomic science books and teach him about such practical things as scouting and woodcraft, but finds that the kid is more knowledgeable than he in these matters.', 'Foghorn Leghorn decides to take an egghead genius chick out to the woods to distract him from his long-haired atomic science books and teach him about such practical things as scouting and woodcraft, but finds that the kid is more knowledgeable than he in these matters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFhKrktOClfOMouHnH9MlGzg7nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234761'),
  ('1021384219335253500', 'Crocodile', 1996, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Cho Jae-hyun, Jeon Moo-song, An Jae-hong, Woo Yun-kyeong, Yang Dong-jae, Han Tae-il, Song Keum-Sik', null, 'Under the Han River lives Crocodile, a rugged member of the lumpenproletariat who exists from schemes and stealing. His position as a scavenger of society undermines South Korea’s boasts of its newfound economic position as an Asian Tiger. One day, Crocodile finds a girl floating in his river.', 'Under the Han River lives Crocodile, a rugged member of the lumpenproletariat who exists from schemes and stealing. His position as a scavenger of society undermines South Korea’s boasts of its newfound economic position as an Asian Tiger. One day, Crocodile finds a girl floating in his river.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jeahTw8QqY1Fls1yhtsVMteDLKn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25652'),
  ('236374859847412520', 'Crocodile', 2000, 'Horror', 'Tobe Hooper, Maximillian D. Day, Greg Nicotero', 'Michael D. Weiss, Jace Anderson, Adam Gierasch', 'Mark McLachlan, Caitlin Martin, Chris Solari, D.W. Reiser, Julie Mintz, Rhett Wilkins, Greg Wayne, Harrison Young', 'R', 'Eight college students board a houseboat for spring break that promises to be the best of their young lives...how many will survive?', 'Eight college students board a houseboat for spring break that promises to be the best of their young lives...how many will survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g7bzqpaFHmOB6rbWPttszUvii8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40466'),
  ('711314751787226968', 'Crocodile', 2019, 'Drama', 'Zebina Guerra, Artur-Pol Camprubí, Jorge Yúdice', 'Jorge Yúdice', 'Marta Bayarri, Alejandro Bordanove, Javier Casamayor', null, 'Like each afternoon, Alicia makes herself a cup of tea and watches VictorGaming, her favorite YouTube channel. Victor, the YouTuber, is just streaming questions from his fans and answering them, but Alicia has something very important to tell him.', 'Like each afternoon, Alicia makes herself a cup of tea and watches VictorGaming, her favorite YouTube channel. Victor, the YouTuber, is just streaming questions from his fans and answering them, but Alicia has something very important to tell him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mofW5P6YcVtOZtj491oy7Vlp1zt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625283'),
  ('183728521250021286', 'Crocodile', 2026, 'Documentary', 'The Critics, Pietra Brettkelly', 'Pietra Brettkelly', 'Raymond J. Yusuff, Godwin Josiah, Ronald Yusuff, Richard Yusuff, Victor Josiah', null, 'A young Nigerian art collective creates DIY sci-fi films with homemade equipment, documenting their lives while exploring fantastical alternate realities. An energetic celebration of creativity and resourceful storytelling.', 'A young Nigerian art collective creates DIY sci-fi films with homemade equipment, documenting their lives while exploring fantastical alternate realities. An energetic celebration of creativity and resourceful storytelling.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FfEdIoE2RFsRQZOu4zZLLvDbIALj.jpg', 'plex:movie:crocodile-2026'),
  ('749020800394040621', 'Crocodile 2: Death Roll', 2002, 'Horror', 'Gary Jones', 'Jace Anderson, Adam Gierasch', 'Heidi Lenhart, Jon Sklaroff, Martin Kove, Darryl Theirse, David Valcin, James Parks, Steven Moreno, Chuck Walczak', null, 'After a bank robbery, four criminals escape to Mexico, but a storm causes an accident which takes down the plane where several die in the crash. The criminals take it into their own hands to continue when one survivor is attacked and eaten by a crocodile. The criminals kill it, but from then on the mother Crocodile is on a killing spree with a goal to kill each survivor. But that is not the only worry, because they''re trapped within it''s world, and if it doesn''t kill them, the criminals will.', 'After a bank robbery, four criminals escape to Mexico, but a storm causes an accident which takes down the plane where several die in the crash. The criminals take it into their own hands to continue when one survivor is attacked and eaten by a crocodile. The criminals kill it, but from then on the mother Crocodile is on a killing spree with a goal to kill each survivor. But that is not the only worry, because they''re trapped within it''s world, and if it doesn''t kill them, the criminals will.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wEcHMLFvtgT2yvKqJNOgJeNHVa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39862'),
  ('1135406446549212247', 'Crocodile Dundee', 1986, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Russell Boyd, Peter Faiman, Jon Kilik', 'John Cornell, Paul Hogan, Ken Shadie', 'Paul Hogan, Linda Kozlowski, Mark Blum, David Gulpilil, Michael Lombard, John Meillon, Ritchie Singer, Maggie Blinco', 'PG-13', 'When a New York reporter plucks crocodile hunter Mick Dundee from the Australian Outback for a visit to the Big Apple, it''s a clash of cultures and a recipe for good-natured comedy as naïve Dundee negotiates the concrete jungle. He proves that his instincts are quite useful in the city and adeptly handles everything from wily muggers to high-society snoots without breaking a sweat.', 'When a New York reporter plucks crocodile hunter Mick Dundee from the Australian Outback for a visit to the Big Apple, it''s a clash of cultures and a recipe for good-natured comedy as naïve Dundee negotiates the concrete jungle. He proves that his instincts are quite useful in the city and adeptly handles everything from wily muggers to high-society snoots without breaking a sweat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pduPduL1ub5kok3lPYT15ryC9L6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9671'),
  ('1152164288908626430', 'Crocodile Dundee II', 1988, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Russell Boyd, John Cornell, Mark Turnbull', 'Paul Hogan, Brett Hogan', 'Paul Hogan, Linda Kozlowski, John Meillon, Ernie Dingo, Charles S. Dutton, Hechter Ubarry, Juan Fernández, Luis Guzmán', 'PG', 'Australian outback expert protects his New York love from gangsters who''ve followed her down under.', 'Australian outback expert protects his New York love from gangsters who''ve followed her down under.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Nf0xeDuToLHysdkWj3aT5r42rC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9396'),
  ('174807565539210723', 'Crocodile Dundee in Los Angeles', 2001, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Simon Wincer, David Burr, David Eggby', 'Matthew Berry', 'Paul Hogan, Linda Kozlowski, Jere Burns, Jonathan Banks, Alec Wilson, Gerry Skilton, Steve Rackman, Serge Cockburn', 'PG', 'After settling in the tiny Australian town of Walkabout Creek with his significant other and his young son, Mick "Crocodile" Dundee is thrown for a loop when a prestigious Los Angeles newspaper offers his honey a job. The family migrates back to the United States, and Croc and son soon find themselves learning some lessons about American life -- many of them inadvertent', 'After settling in the tiny Australian town of Walkabout Creek with his significant other and his young son, Mick "Crocodile" Dundee is thrown for a loop when a prestigious Los Angeles newspaper offers his honey a job. The family migrates back to the United States, and Croc and son soon find themselves learning some lessons about American life -- many of them inadvertent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwt6iJjPuXRDKJON5s9G9pdfPbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9290'),
  ('173400672483495034', 'Crocodile Island', 2020, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Xu Shixing, Simon Zhao', 'Ni Minming', 'Gallen Lo Ka-Leung, Liao Yinyue, Wang Bingxiang, Dang Wei, Hu Xue''er, He Qiwei, Zuo Zhao, Zhao Zhiyan', null, 'The surrounding areas of the Devil''s Sea is also known as the Bermuda Triangle of Asia. Due to electromagnetic interference, aviation accidents are common in the region. Lin Hao and his daughter Yi are passengers of Flight GZ261. As it flies over the Devil''s Sea, the plane malfunctions, causing an emergency landing on a crocodile island. Hao and other driving passengers encounter enormous sized crocodiles and spiders and engages in a battle for survival. When Yi is captured by the giant beasts, Hao fights for his life to rescue her daughter.', 'The surrounding areas of the Devil''s Sea is also known as the Bermuda Triangle of Asia. Due to electromagnetic interference, aviation accidents are common in the region. Lin Hao and his daughter Yi are passengers of Flight GZ261. As it flies over the Devil''s Sea, the plane malfunctions, causing an emergency landing on a crocodile island. Hao and other driving passengers encounter enormous sized crocodiles and spiders and engages in a battle for survival. When Yi is captured by the giant beasts, Hao fights for his life to rescue her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OhnqWeRDma9GxJQQLKjDsn5V16.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669748'),
  ('454517568084393631', 'Crocodile River', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lo Wei, Pan Xiu-Fo, Ho Meng-Hua', 'Chang Cheh', 'Lee Ting, Paul Chang Chung, Liu Liang-Hua, Lo Wei, Man Theeraphol, Ah Kung, Yaowarat Nisakorn, Malee Wetpraseri', null, 'Crocodile River features Romeo And Juliet-flavored story. Families are against each other. Yodi is the Romeo and Lee Ting is his Juliet. The two students love each other from across a river that is filled with crocodiles.', 'Crocodile River features Romeo And Juliet-flavored story. Families are against each other. Yodi is the Romeo and Lee Ting is his Juliet. The two students love each other from across a river that is filled with crocodiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1nA8YOF7aZRJbza3icyxqlzrzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297778'),
  ('1090889841578039389', 'Crocus', 1971, 'Animation', 'Suzan Pitt', 'Suzan Pitt', null, null, 'A woman''s nightly domestic rituals—from putting her baby to bed to making love—unspool in a playful parade of surreal, straight-from-the-id images.', 'A woman''s nightly domestic rituals—from putting her baby to bed to making love—unspool in a playful parade of surreal, straight-from-the-id images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UGMc8uYgdJ1s6ugdbmVg6ne5h9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563689'),
  ('266362576149848011', 'Croesus', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jean Giono, Costa-Gavras, Roger Hubert', 'Jean Giono', 'Fernandel, Marcelle Ranson-Hervé, Rellys, René Génin, Miguel Gamy, Edouard Hemme, Paul Préboist, Jeanne Pérez', null, 'Jules is a shepherd who lives a humble and solitary life in rural Provence. From time to time, he is visited by a lonely widow, Fine, who longs to be his wife. One day, Jules comes across an unexploded bomb lying on the ground in open countryside. After a few foolhardy attempts to set the bomb off, Jules makes a surprising discovery. It is filled with thousands of bank notes…', 'Jules is a shepherd who lives a humble and solitary life in rural Provence. From time to time, he is visited by a lonely widow, Fine, who longs to be his wife. One day, Jules comes across an unexploded bomb lying on the ground in open countryside. After a few foolhardy attempts to set the bomb off, Jules makes a surprising discovery. It is filled with thousands of bank notes…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZtWwlktvzdzA4dXe3SS5nn9SxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70440'),
  ('751596236129973052', 'Cromartie High School: The Movie', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Yudai Yamaguchi', 'Shoichiro Masumoto', 'Takamasa Suga, Tak Sakaguchi, Kenichi Endo, Itsuji Itao, Ryuji Akiyama, Kai Ato, Shinya Hashimoto, Mika Kanai', null, 'When a good student named Kamiyama gets placed in a high school filled with disobedient kids, he steps up to the plate and takes a position of leadership. Urging the young slackers and rebels to clean up their act, Kamiyama is in store for a lot of resistance.', 'When a good student named Kamiyama gets placed in a high school filled with disobedient kids, he steps up to the plate and takes a position of leadership. Urging the young slackers and rebels to clean up their act, Kamiyama is in store for a lot of resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iX2yZlXiRlBAG4MNVkbckWNh8Ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39022'),
  ('233017351816018393', 'Cromwell', 1970, 'Drama, History, War', 'Ken Hughes, Ted Sturgis, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'Ken Hughes', 'Richard Harris, Alec Guinness, Robert Morley, Dorothy Tutin, Frank Finlay, Timothy Dalton, Patrick Wymark, Patrick Magee', 'G', 'Disgusted with the policies of King Charles I, Oliver Cromwell plans to take his family to the New World. But on the eve of their departure, Cromwell is drawn into the tangled web of religion and politics that will result in the English Civil War.', 'Disgusted with the policies of King Charles I, Oliver Cromwell plans to take his family to the New World. But on the eve of their departure, Cromwell is drawn into the tangled web of religion and politics that will result in the English Civil War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qlnKlQGEdRl70KDpAv03F8uGzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31675'),
  ('743931310315455285', 'Crónicas', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Sebastián Cordero, Enrique Chediak', 'Sebastián Cordero', 'John Leguizamo, Damián Alcázar, Leonor Watling, Alfred Molina, José María Yázpik, Camilo Luzuriaga, Henry Layana', null, 'A suspense thriller about a reporter from Miami who travels to Ecuador in pursuit of a serial killer known as the "Monster of Babahoyo."', 'A suspense thriller about a reporter from Miami who travels to Ecuador in pursuit of a serial killer known as the "Monster of Babahoyo."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pPQOC8eyaJmlouI9Il4dCF2iS6E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20511'),
