  ('829971583145176128', 'Cronofobia', 2019, 'Drama', 'Simon Guy Fässler, Francesco Rizzi', 'Francesco Rizzi, Daniela Gambaro', 'Vinicio Marchioni, Sabine Timoteo, Leonardo Nigro, Giorgia Salari, Jun Ichikawa, Jasmin Mattei, Joachim Aeschlimann, Andrea Bruschi', null, 'A mysterious lonely man and a young rebel woman, confront each other in a psychological drama about suspended identity.', 'A mysterious lonely man and a young rebel woman, confront each other in a psychological drama about suspended identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vZbFXj6ubyqhsZ1yTq0QSHSk5rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548638'),
  ('1088410237136707965', 'Cronos', 1993, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Guillermo del Toro, Guillermo Navarro, Batan Silva', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Federico Luppi, Ron Perlman, Claudio Brook, Margarita Isabel, Tamara Shanath, Mario Iván Martínez, Daniel Giménez Cacho, Farnesio de Bernal', 'R', 'Faced with his own mortality, an ingenious alchemist tried to perfect an invention that would provide him with the key to eternal life. It was called the Cronos device. When he died more than 400 years later, he took the secrets of this remarkable device to the grave with him. Now, an elderly antiques dealer has found the hellish machine hidden in a statue and learns about its incredible powers. The more he uses the device, the younger he becomes...but nothing comes without a price. Life after death is just the beginning as this nerve-shattering thriller unfolds and the fountain of youth turns bloody.', 'Faced with his own mortality, an ingenious alchemist tried to perfect an invention that would provide him with the key to eternal life. It was called the Cronos device. When he died more than 400 years later, he took the secrets of this remarkable device to the grave with him. Now, an elderly antiques dealer has found the hellish machine hidden in a statue and learns about its incredible powers. The more he uses the device, the younger he becomes...but nothing comes without a price. Life after death is just the beginning as this nerve-shattering thriller unfolds and the fountain of youth turns bloody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRX8au50CnhC8hXr8AbsCNdb96G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11655'),
  ('1136012647306940433', 'Crook', 2010, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Mohit Suri, Keshab Raj Paudel, Ravi Walia', 'Ankur Tewari', 'Emraan Hashmi, Neha Sharma, Arjan Bajwa, Gulshan Grover, Smiley Suri, Kavin Dave, Francis Chouler, Shella Alan', null, 'Corrupt police and racially motivated attacks against Indian students complicate a re-located crook''s life in Australia.', 'Corrupt police and racially motivated attacks against Indian students complicate a re-located crook''s life in Australia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR6fRSwxEPOKhm4LpYXBUu0duyC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51728'),
  ('513197957959391203', 'Crook and the Cross', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Axel von Ambesser, Lucie Berndsen, Oskar Schnirch', 'Curth Flatow', 'Gert Fröbe, Karlheinz Böhm, Rudolf Vogel, Ellen Schwiers, Lucie Englisch, Manfred Kunst, Barbara Gallauner, Hans Jürgen Diedrich', null, 'With the help of God, the loveable safecracker Paul Wittkowski – aka “Cracker-Paulie” – manages to escape the clutches of the cops. He dresses up as a priest and ends up in a village, whose pastor is in dispute with an influential businessman. To help the pastor and a young widow, Paulie has to use his own special abilities. This work leads him back to the path of righteousness. He contacts the police and, after serving his time, starts a new life with the widow.', 'With the help of God, the loveable safecracker Paul Wittkowski – aka “Cracker-Paulie” – manages to escape the clutches of the cops. He dresses up as a priest and ends up in a village, whose pastor is in dispute with an influential businessman. To help the pastor and a young widow, Paulie has to use his own special abilities. This work leads him back to the path of righteousness. He contacts the police and, after serving his time, starts a new life with the widow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6d3DottjB9v149fJK2M8ct7gw2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133376'),
  ('101579538307566472', 'Crook''s Tour', 1940, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'John Baxter, James Wilson', null, 'Basil Radford, Naunton Wayne, Greta Gynt, Noel Hood, Charles Oliver, Gordon McLeod, Abraham Sofaer, Bernard Rebel', null, 'Charters and Caldicott are touring the Middle East. After visiting Saudi Arabia they find themselves in Bagdad where they are mistaken by a group of German spies for the messengers who are to carry a song record by beautiful singer La Palermo which contains secret instructions of the German Intelligence. Realizing their error, the German spies follow Charters and Caldicott to Istanbul and Budapest, trying to eliminate them and retrieve the record.', 'Charters and Caldicott are touring the Middle East. After visiting Saudi Arabia they find themselves in Bagdad where they are mistaken by a group of German spies for the messengers who are to carry a song record by beautiful singer La Palermo which contains secret instructions of the German Intelligence. Realizing their error, the German spies follow Charters and Caldicott to Istanbul and Budapest, trying to eliminate them and retrieve the record.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzyPbGpuD3MUmsuEkeUZmt5SPIm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91650'),
  ('201572423948056406', 'Crooked Hearts', 1991, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michael Bortman, Tak Fujimoto', 'Michael Bortman', 'Peter Berg, Vincent D''Onofrio, Noah Wyle, Juliette Lewis, Jennifer Jason Leigh, Peter Coyote, Cindy Pickett, Wendy Gazelle', 'R', 'An upper-middle class family in Washington state deals with failures, infidelities and troubling secrets. Charley is 26 and still lives at home, despite his simmering anger at his father, Edward. Charley''s younger brother, Tom, just dropped out of college and returned home to live. Tom''s unstable new girlfriend, Marriet, has designs on joining the family, but she''s hardly a calming influence on the crumbling home.', 'An upper-middle class family in Washington state deals with failures, infidelities and troubling secrets. Charley is 26 and still lives at home, despite his simmering anger at his father, Edward. Charley''s younger brother, Tom, just dropped out of college and returned home to live. Tom''s unstable new girlfriend, Marriet, has designs on joining the family, but she''s hardly a calming influence on the crumbling home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KaquePedqlWghwcatiLlT9emzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93002'),
  ('441772831924614546', 'Crooked House', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Gilles Paquet-Brenner, Sebastian Winterø, Mark Hedges', 'Tim Rose Price, Julian Fellowes, Gilles Paquet-Brenner', 'Glenn Close, Max Irons, Stefanie Martini, Christina Hendricks, Terence Stamp, Honor Kneafsey, Julian Sands, Gillian Anderson', 'PG-13', 'A private investigator helps a former flame solve the murder of her wealthy grandfather, who lived in a sprawling estate surrounded by his idiosyncratic family.', 'A private investigator helps a former flame solve the murder of her wealthy grandfather, who lived in a sprawling estate surrounded by his idiosyncratic family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AewyKG2cvgZQBG4XU6SVomfu1k5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419835'),
  ('750931997385728517', 'Crooklyn', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Spike Lee, Arthur Jafa', 'Joie Lee, Cinqué Lee, Spike Lee', 'Alfre Woodard, Delroy Lindo, David Patrick Kelly, Zelda Harris, Carlton Williams, Sharif Rashed, Tse-Mach Washington, Christopher Knowings', 'PG-13', 'From Spike Lee comes this vibrant semi-autobiographical portrait of a school-teacher, her stubborn jazz-musician husband and their five kids living in ''70s Brooklyn.', 'From Spike Lee comes this vibrant semi-autobiographical portrait of a school-teacher, her stubborn jazz-musician husband and their five kids living in ''70s Brooklyn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFqe07F78SO0SIBzWcK4I5MwNvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34152'),
  ('696494023562845907', 'Crooks', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Hermoso, Fernando Arribas', 'Miguel Hermoso', 'Francisco Rabal, Arturo Fernández, Isabel Mestres, Vicky Lagos, Rafael Díaz, Antonio Gamero, Elena Arnao, Alberto Fernández', null, 'A man of a certain social position falls in jail and request protection to a pickpocket and con man during his stay. On his release he promises to help his friend what then creates many problems.', 'A man of a certain social position falls in jail and request protection to a pickpocket and con man during his stay. On his release he promises to help his friend what then creates many problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNucLtbkxrGxZEGljiIImAHgO4g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161389'),
  ('710363317079273018', 'Crooks Anonymous', 1962, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Ken Annakin', 'Ken Annakin, Jack Davies', 'Leslie Phillips, Stanley Baxter, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Julie Christie, James Robertson Justice, Michael Medwin, Pauline Jameson, Robertson Hare', 'NR', 'A former burglar trying to go straight joins a rehabilitation scheme using much the same methods as AA. Through the process, he takes work as a department store Santa, where the endless parade of goods and money, not to mention the pretty young shop hands have him like a moth to a flame in no time flat.', 'A former burglar trying to go straight joins a rehabilitation scheme using much the same methods as AA. Through the process, he takes work as a department store Santa, where the endless parade of goods and money, not to mention the pretty young shop hands have him like a moth to a flame in no time flat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxyFKMoV7eaIiDe8dxywPBDpa8e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171075'),
  ('922706187680906635', 'Crooks in Cloisters', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Jeremy Summers, Harry Waxman', 'T. J. Morrison, Mike Watts', 'Barbara Windsor, Ronald Fraser, Melvyn Hayes, Francesca Annis, Bernard Cribbins, Davy Kaye, Wilfrid Brambell, Grégoire Aslan', null, 'Having pulled off the smallest ever train robbery, Little Walter and his crew decide to get out of London. The six of them set up business in a disused monastery off the Cornish coast, despite the fact that none of them really qualifies as a monk - least of all Walter''s moll Bikini. Bit by bit, the quiet way of life starts becoming a habit.', 'Having pulled off the smallest ever train robbery, Little Walter and his crew decide to get out of London. The six of them set up business in a disused monastery off the Cornish coast, despite the fact that none of them really qualifies as a monk - least of all Walter''s moll Bikini. Bit by bit, the quiet way of life starts becoming a habit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1hgKEhIXnoiAelttZ2R2CybKWVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119486'),
  ('83537821934304188', 'Cropsey', 2009, 'Crime, Documentary, Mystery, Horror', 'Joshua Zeman, Barbara Brancaccio, Chad Davidson', 'Joshua Zeman', 'Joshua Zeman, Barbara Brancaccio, Bill Ellis, Dorothy D''Eletto, Geraldo Rivera, Karen Schweiger, David Navarro, Donna Cutugno', 'NR', 'Realizing the urban legend of their youth has actually come true, two filmmakers delve into the mystery surrounding five missing children and the real-life boogeyman linked to their disappearances.', 'Realizing the urban legend of their youth has actually come true, two filmmakers delve into the mystery surrounding five missing children and the real-life boogeyman linked to their disappearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yemDtWalM9x2AD6dYSQSND6W8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56811'),
  ('568211997087320467', 'Cross', 2011, 'Action, Fantasy', 'Patrick Durham, Mark Munson, Richard Murken', 'Patrick Durham, Tanner Wiley, Jonathan Sachar', 'Brian Austin Green, Danny Trejo, Michael Clarke Duncan, Tom Sizemore, Vinnie Jones, Rachel Miner, Jake Busey, Robert Carradine', 'R', 'Given incredible power by an ancient Celtic Cross. Callan continues to fight evil... Now, joined by a team of weapons experts, Callan battles an unstoppable empire in Los Angeles.', 'Given incredible power by an ancient Celtic Cross. Callan continues to fight evil... Now, joined by a team of weapons experts, Callan battles an unstoppable empire in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ueGM26s8DeNyKxvLMulVtynYIq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64325'),
  ('681656557931078472', 'Cross Away', 2024, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gilles Bourdos, Mark Lee Ping-Bing, Éric Simille', 'Steven Knight', 'Vincent Lindon, Micha Lescot, Grégory Gadebois, Pascale Arbillot, Emmanuelle Devos, Cédric Kahn, Milo Machado-Graner, Solan Machado-Graner', null, 'Joseph Cross looks like his job. Solid like concrete. Married, two children, his existence is perfectly organized. Yet this night, alone behind the wheel, he must make a decision that could ruin his life.', 'Joseph Cross looks like his job. Solid like concrete. Married, two children, his existence is perfectly organized. Yet this night, alone behind the wheel, he must make a decision that could ruin his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njJ48XMyVOMJ7gw5TZB8Sl2wSZd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1300331'),
  ('909976592487384103', 'Cross Country Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Jeremy Marc Poitras, Masha Jenkins, Pieter Stathis', 'Kirsten Hansen', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Greyston Holt, Jon Cor, Robyn Bradley, Erica Elliot, Sebastian Stewart, Keith MacKechnie, Raylene Harewood', null, 'Former classmates Lina and Max are traveling home for the holidays, until a storm hits and they have to work together to make it home in time, no matter the mode of transportation.', 'Former classmates Lina and Max are traveling home for the holidays, until a storm hits and they have to work together to make it home in time, no matter the mode of transportation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lF5Bmfx8TZmDnNn8i7pSKA6zlEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737780'),
  ('993196060532277028', 'Cross Creek', 1983, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, John A. Alonzo', 'Dalene Young', 'Mary Steenburgen, Rip Torn, Peter Coyote, Dana Hill, Alfre Woodard, Joanna Miles, Ike Eisenmann, Toni Hudson', 'PG', 'In the 1930s, Marjorie Kinnan Rawlings moves to Florida''s backwaters to write in peace. She feels bothered by affectionate men, editors and confused neighbors, but soon she connects and writes The Yearling, a classic of American literature.', 'In the 1930s, Marjorie Kinnan Rawlings moves to Florida''s backwaters to write in peace. She feels bothered by affectionate men, editors and confused neighbors, but soon she connects and writes The Yearling, a classic of American literature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klil5YyD3GunFzEIYBbwLRjsVUb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115332'),
  ('553045189740971806', 'Cross My Heart', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Armyan Bernstein, Thomas Del Ruth', 'Armyan Bernstein, Gail Parent', 'Annette O''Toole, Martin Short, Paul Reiser, Joanna Kerns, Jessica Puscas, Lee Arenberg, Corinne Bohrer, Jason Stuart', 'R', 'A man and a woman go out on a "big" third date. He''s ashamed to admit he just lost his job, and she''s afraid he''ll run away if he finds out that she has a kid. Small lies lead to bigger ones and the night gets crazy very soon.', 'A man and a woman go out on a "big" third date. He''s ashamed to admit he just lost his job, and she''s afraid he''ll run away if he finds out that she has a kid. Small lies lead to bigger ones and the night gets crazy very soon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uxLHTkClfhUaKJvOlgjQTBF57pX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57738'),
  ('137277332758327260', 'Cross My Heart', 1991, 'Drama, Adventure, Romance', 'Jean-Claude Saillier, Jacques Fansten', 'Jacques Fansten', 'Sylvain Copans, Nicolas Parodi, Olivier Montiege, Cécilia Rouaud, Lucie Blossier, Delphine Gouttman, Benoît Gautier, Kaldi el Hadj', null, 'Young Martin has been acting strange. At his school, his teacher and classmates notice that he is less talkative and more withdrawn. When those around him begin to prod, they discover that Martin’s single mother has died. Fearful that he will be sent away from home now that he has no parents, Martin looks to his friends for help. With Jerome leading the charge to save Martin from the orphanage, the first thing they decide to do is dispose of the mother’s body.', 'Young Martin has been acting strange. At his school, his teacher and classmates notice that he is less talkative and more withdrawn. When those around him begin to prod, they discover that Martin’s single mother has died. Fearful that he will be sent away from home now that he has no parents, Martin looks to his friends for help. With Jerome leading the charge to save Martin from the orphanage, the first thing they decide to do is dispose of the mother’s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eDV8JMcoWOC40UGLoEQqcFr4l8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66545'),
  ('474714973904892634', 'Cross My Heart', 2017, 'Drama', 'Luc Picard, François Dutil', 'Nicole Bélanger', 'Milya Corbeil-Gauvreau, Henri Picard, Anthony Bouchard, Alexis Guay, Clare Coulter, Julie Ménard, Maude Laurendeau, Jean-François Boudreau', null, '12-years-old Manon promises her younger brother, Mimi, that they will stay together, despite their difficult family circumstances and the ominous signs of being put into foster care. During the height of Quebec''s FLQ Crisis in 1970, they stage their own rebellion by kidnapping an elderly woman and hiding her in the country, aided by their two cousins.', '12-years-old Manon promises her younger brother, Mimi, that they will stay together, despite their difficult family circumstances and the ominous signs of being put into foster care. During the height of Quebec''s FLQ Crisis in 1970, they stage their own rebellion by kidnapping an elderly woman and hiding her in the country, aided by their two cousins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8BYDwhW1PamIOJtjLmTXjF8RPP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477500'),
  ('92897683967527579', 'Cross My Heart and Hope to Die', 1994, 'Drama, Family', 'Marius Holst, Philip Øgaard', 'Marius Holst', 'Martin Dahl Garfalk, Trond Halbo, Jan Devo Kornstad, Kjersti Holmen, Ingar Helge Gimle, Bjørn Floberg, Reidar Sørensen, Gisken Armand', null, 'A story about a young boy, Otto, whose childhood is brought to an abrupt end when Frank, an older boy, suddenly enters his life.', 'A story about a young boy, Otto, whose childhood is brought to an abrupt end when Frank, an older boy, suddenly enters his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hbe1T0AvLwlkuJkG23MTNoSN0a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32121'),
  ('1040219299556066518', 'Cross of Iron', 1977, 'Drama, Action, History, War', 'Sam Peckinpah, John Coquillon, Bert Batt', 'James Hamilton, Julius J. Epstein, Walter Kelley', 'James Coburn, Maximilian Schell, James Mason, David Warner, Klaus Löwitsch, Vadim Glowna, Roger Fritz, Dieter Schidor', 'R', 'It is 1943, and the German army—ravaged and demoralised—is hastily retreating from the Russian front. In the midst of the madness, conflict brews between the aristocratic yet ultimately pusillanimous Captain Stransky and the courageous Corporal Steiner. Stransky is the only man who believes that the Third Reich is still vastly superior to the Russian army. However, within his pompous persona lies a quivering coward who longs for the Iron Cross so that he can return to Berlin a hero. Steiner, on the other hand is cynical, defiantly non-conformist and more concerned with the safety of his own men rather than the horde of military decorations offered to him by his superiors.', 'It is 1943, and the German army—ravaged and demoralised—is hastily retreating from the Russian front. In the midst of the madness, conflict brews between the aristocratic yet ultimately pusillanimous Captain Stransky and the courageous Corporal Steiner. Stransky is the only man who believes that the Third Reich is still vastly superior to the Russian army. However, within his pompous persona lies a quivering coward who longs for the Iron Cross so that he can return to Berlin a hero. Steiner, on the other hand is cynical, defiantly non-conformist and more concerned with the safety of his own men rather than the horde of military decorations offered to him by his superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fR6pqh5aFn0fawsn7sR2zC15swx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10839'),
  ('586575307702431870', 'Cross of the Seven Jewels', 1987, 'Horror', 'Marco Antonio Andolfi', 'Marco Antonio Andolfi', 'Marco Antonio Andolfi, Annie Belle, Gordon Mitchell, George Ardisson, Zaira Zoccheddu, Giulio Massimini', null, 'A man becomes a werewolf after being cursed by a black magic society. Only a jeweled necklace he wears can stop the transformations taking place.', 'A man becomes a werewolf after being cursed by a black magic society. Only a jeweled necklace he wears can stop the transformations taking place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAhpfFM3HMd5Q1Ko00cmtkH5koP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28491'),
  ('1002720975469463646', 'Cross Road', 2014, 'Animation', 'Makoto Shinkai, Makoto Shinkai, Masayoshi Tanaka', 'Makoto Shinkai', 'Ayane Sakura, Kensho Ono, Masahiko Tanaka', null, 'High school students Miho and Shouta are preparing for college entrance examinations. Miho comes from an island without even one cram school, while Shouta lives in Tokyo and works a part-time job. Both are striving to pass exams so they can enter college. The pair enroll in Z-Kai''s correspondence education courses, and their lives cross before they realize it.', 'High school students Miho and Shouta are preparing for college entrance examinations. Miho comes from an island without even one cram school, while Shouta lives in Tokyo and works a part-time job. Both are striving to pass exams so they can enter college. The pair enroll in Z-Kai''s correspondence education courses, and their lives cross before they realize it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gcV3PyrfEuOtBkkuUPJdIMS46V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277095'),
  ('1064362262307397114', 'Cross the Line', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime', 'David Victori, Elías M. Félix', 'David Victori, Jordi Vallejo, Clara Viola', 'Mario Casas, Elisabeth Larena, Milena Smit, Fernando Valdivielso, Victor Solé, Joaquín Caserza, Javier Mula, Albert Green', null, 'A good-natured man has an unexpected deadly confrontation. Instincts kick in to clean up the mess caused in the name of self-defense but does one really get away free after killing someone?', 'A good-natured man has an unexpected deadly confrontation. Instincts kick in to clean up the mess caused in the name of self-defense but does one really get away free after killing someone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYqTGyqHydFqfMD1LWaQG59FWsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681580'),
  ('142983309757433002', 'Crosscurrent', 2016, 'Drama', 'Yang Chao, Mark Lee Ping-Bing', 'Yang Chao', 'Qin Hao, Xin Zhilei, Wu Lipeng, Wang Hongwei, Tan Kai, Jiang Hualin', null, 'A voyage between a woman searching for the meaning of life and a man holding a book of poems on the longest river of Mainland China.', 'A voyage between a woman searching for the meaning of life and a man holding a book of poems on the longest river of Mainland China.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36mGVqkAclNKidvt4M1Wks1sJaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378696'),
  ('668606480759429861', 'Crossed Tracks', 2007, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gérard de Battista, Claude Lelouch, Rémi Bergman', 'Pierre Uytterhoeven, Claude Lelouch', 'Dominique Pinon, Fanny Ardant, Audrey Dana, Michèle Bernier, Myriam Boyer, Zinedine Soualem, Boris Ventura-Diaz, Marc Rioufol', 'R', 'The successful novelist Judith Ralitzer is interrogated in the police station about the disappearance of her ghost-writer. A serial-killer escapes from a prison in Paris. A missing school teacher leaves his wife and children. In the road, the annoying and stressed hairdresser Hughette is left in a gas station by her fiancé Paul while driving to the poor farm of her family in the country. A mysterious man offers a ride to her and she invites him to assume the identity of Paul during 24 hours to not disappoint her mother. Who might be the unknown man and what is real and what is fiction?', 'The successful novelist Judith Ralitzer is interrogated in the police station about the disappearance of her ghost-writer. A serial-killer escapes from a prison in Paris. A missing school teacher leaves his wife and children. In the road, the annoying and stressed hairdresser Hughette is left in a gas station by her fiancé Paul while driving to the poor farm of her family in the country. A mysterious man offers a ride to her and she invites him to assume the identity of Paul during 24 hours to not disappoint her mother. Who might be the unknown man and what is real and what is fiction?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6F68SR9Ps8gQPfPlv4p8tchPBR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14949'),
  ('541842533632155665', 'Crossfire', 1947, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Edward Dmytryk, J. Roy Hunt, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'John Paxton', 'Robert Young, Robert Mitchum, Robert Ryan, Gloria Grahame, Paul Kelly, Sam Levene, Jacqueline White, Steve Brodie', 'NR', 'A man is murdered, apparently by one of a group of soldiers just out of the army. But which one? And why?', 'A man is murdered, apparently by one of a group of soldiers just out of the army. But which one? And why?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3EFBiCsc4Ckc1tntoHAEnhZtSO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28120'),
  ('254304580160761745', 'Crossfire', 2000, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Shusuke Kaneko, Kenji Takama, Hideaki Murakami', 'Kota Yamada, Shusuke Kaneko, Masahiro Yokotani', 'Akiko Yada, Kaori Momoi, Hisashi Yoshizawa, Hideaki Ito, Ryuji Harada, Masami Nagasawa, Toshiyuki Nagashima, Hidenori Tokuyama', null, 'Junko was born with a type of ESP called pyrokinesis which she can use to incinerate anyone and anything at will. Junko is secretly in love with Kazuki, a young man who works with her. His sister is killed and a boy named Masaki suspected but the police don''t arrest him. Junko tells Kazuki about her powers and takes revenge.', 'Junko was born with a type of ESP called pyrokinesis which she can use to incinerate anyone and anything at will. Junko is secretly in love with Kazuki, a young man who works with her. His sister is killed and a boy named Masaki suspected but the police don''t arrest him. Junko tells Kazuki about her powers and takes revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ifh96Tx3owxqwvhJy705OJLmp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45474'),
  ('768434294220906553', 'Crossfire', 2008, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Claude-Michel Rome, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Olivier Dazat, Claude-Michel Rome', 'Richard Berry, Aïssa Maïga, Zabou Breitman, Pascal Elbé, Bernard Blancan, Guilaine Londez, Moussa Maaskri, Frédéric Saurel', null, 'A grizzled Parisian detective is sent to an outpost town in Southern France to dismantle a gang of killers which has freed a notorious criminal. The detective inherits a team of unmotivated and dishevelled detectives, and he makes connections nobody else ever saw because nobody else bothered to look. A mysterious, charismatic figure, he leads by example, and gradually his team begins to feel like cops again.', 'A grizzled Parisian detective is sent to an outpost town in Southern France to dismantle a gang of killers which has freed a notorious criminal. The detective inherits a team of unmotivated and dishevelled detectives, and he makes connections nobody else ever saw because nobody else bothered to look. A mysterious, charismatic figure, he leads by example, and gradually his team begins to feel like cops again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SvsQjHVy6VeIofdblQHF2gFfTC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26559'),
  ('71753671460859848', 'Crossfire Hurricane', 2012, 'Documentary, Music', 'Brett Morgen', 'Brett Morgen', 'Mick Jagger, Keith Richards, Charlie Watts, Ronnie Wood, Bill Wyman, Mick Taylor, Brian Jones', 'NR', 'This film is released as part of the ongoing 50th anniversary celebration of the Rolling Stones. It tells the story of the Stones'' unparalleled journey from blues obsessed teens in the early 60s to their undisputed status as rock royalty. All of the Stones have been newly interviewed and their words form the narrative arc that links together archive footage of performances, news coverage, and interviews, much of it previously unseen. Taking its title from a lyric in "Jumpin'' Jack Flash," this film gives the viewer an intimate insight into exactly what it''s like to be part of the Rolling Stones as they overcome denunciation, drugs, dissensions, and death to become the definitive survivors. Over a year in the making and produced with the full cooperation and involvement of the Stones, this film is and will remain the definitive story of the world''s greatest rock ''n'' roll band', 'This film is released as part of the ongoing 50th anniversary celebration of the Rolling Stones. It tells the story of the Stones'' unparalleled journey from blues obsessed teens in the early 60s to their undisputed status as rock royalty. All of the Stones have been newly interviewed and their words form the narrative arc that links together archive footage of performances, news coverage, and interviews, much of it previously unseen. Taking its title from a lyric in "Jumpin'' Jack Flash," this film gives the viewer an intimate insight into exactly what it''s like to be part of the Rolling Stones as they overcome denunciation, drugs, dissensions, and death to become the definitive survivors. Over a year in the making and produced with the full cooperation and involvement of the Stones, this film is and will remain the definitive story of the world''s greatest rock ''n'' roll band', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rGmjuPjtddvMcfrvaRuxIzCUew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137285'),
  ('1144401813311630932', 'Crossfire Trail', 2001, 'Romance, Western, Action, TV Movie', 'Simon Wincer, David Eggby', null, 'Tom Selleck, Virginia Madsen, David O''Hara, Christian Kane, Ken Pogue, Patrick Kilpatrick, William Sanderson, Daniel Parker', null, 'Rafe Covington is as good as his word, and he''s determined to keep his promise to a dying man that he''ll look after the man''s widow and Wyoming ranch. But the widow doubts the integrity of drifter Covington. And an unscrupulous land grabber and his gunmen are sizing up the ranch the way a spider eyes a fly.', 'Rafe Covington is as good as his word, and he''s determined to keep his promise to a dying man that he''ll look after the man''s widow and Wyoming ranch. But the widow doubts the integrity of drifter Covington. And an unscrupulous land grabber and his gunmen are sizing up the ranch the way a spider eyes a fly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWFOBdMabfDUF5Qk8wEPNy9hpAR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35381'),
  ('273980021635761395', 'Crossing', 2008, 'Drama', 'Kim Tae-gyun, Kim Gyu-min, Park Gun-woo', 'Lee Yoo-jin', 'Cha In-pyo, Shin Myeong-cheol, Joo Ah-reum, Jeong In-gi, Lee Young-hoo, Kim Jae-rok, Bae Joong-sik, Jang So-yeon', null, 'Yong-soo is an ex-soccer player who lives in a small coal-mine village in North Korea with his wife and young son, Joon. Although living in extreme poverty like many other families in North Korea, the family is happy just to be with each other. Then one day, Yong-soo''s pregnant wife becomes critically ill. Let alone medicine, Yong-soo can''t even find food for her in North Korea. So he decides to secretly cross the border to China hoping to find the medicine for his wife.', 'Yong-soo is an ex-soccer player who lives in a small coal-mine village in North Korea with his wife and young son, Joon. Although living in extreme poverty like many other families in North Korea, the family is happy just to be with each other. Then one day, Yong-soo''s pregnant wife becomes critically ill. Let alone medicine, Yong-soo can''t even find food for her in North Korea. So he decides to secretly cross the border to China hoping to find the medicine for his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3ARmpUH2wPyc4Rc4qiRKBEfPMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49556'),
  ('1116054403865786580', 'Crossing', 2024, 'Drama', 'Lisabi Fridell, Nino Agladze, Ketevan Gunia', 'Levan Akin', 'Mzia Arabuli, Luke Kankava, Deniz Dumanlı, Nino Karchava, Levan Bochorishvili, Nino Tedoradze, Bünyamin Değer, Sema Sultan Elekci', null, 'Lia, a retired teacher from Georgia, learns from her young neighbor, Achi, that her long-lost transgender niece, Tekla, has crossed the border into Turkey. In search of Tekla, Lia travels to Istanbul with the unpredictable Achi, where they explore the hidden depths of the city.', 'Lia, a retired teacher from Georgia, learns from her young neighbor, Achi, that her long-lost transgender niece, Tekla, has crossed the border into Turkey. In search of Tekla, Lia travels to Istanbul with the unpredictable Achi, where they explore the hidden depths of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJa6e7BjWBlBQyWsUYLTeogeemd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:765421'),
  ('493807042140023086', 'Crossing Borders', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Carlos Iglesias, Tote Trenas, Francisco Periñán', 'Carlos Iglesias', 'Carlos Iglesias, Javier Gutiérrez, Nieve de Medina, Iván Martín, Tim Frederic Quast, Eloísa Vargas, Isabel Blanco, Aldo Sebastianelli', null, 'In 1960, Martín and Marcos are forced by their difficult personal circumstances to travel to Switzerland in search of work, leaving their families in the Madrid of Franco''s Spain. But they undertake more than a simple journey; they begin the road to a new life.', 'In 1960, Martín and Marcos are forced by their difficult personal circumstances to travel to Switzerland in search of work, leaving their families in the Madrid of Franco''s Spain. But they undertake more than a simple journey; they begin the road to a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbxndlfCBb3jspjS1mhm1gMoT5s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34594'),
  ('654669549417596335', 'Crossing Delancey', 1988, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joan Micklin Silver, Theo van de Sande', 'Susan Sandler', 'Amy Irving, Peter Riegert, Reizl Bozyk, Jeroen Krabbé, Sylvia Miles, George Martin, John Bedford Lloyd, Claudia Silver', 'PG', 'Thirty-something Isabelle spends her time going from her tiny, solitary West Side apartment to that of her grandmother on the Lower East Side. While her grandmother plots to find her a romantic match, Isabelle is courted by a married, worldly author, Anton, yet can''t seem to shake the down-to-earth appeal of Sam, a pickle vendor.', 'Thirty-something Isabelle spends her time going from her tiny, solitary West Side apartment to that of her grandmother on the Lower East Side. While her grandmother plots to find her a romantic match, Isabelle is courted by a married, worldly author, Anton, yet can''t seem to shake the down-to-earth appeal of Sam, a pickle vendor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62GF6vgxIvEpSPrH0WXHtCHm3zB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27397'),
  ('396431436898208739', 'Crossing Over', 2009, 'Crime, Drama', 'Wayne Kramer, Nicholas Mastandrea, Maria Mantia', 'Wayne Kramer', 'Harrison Ford, Ray Liotta, Alice Eve, Ashley Judd, Jim Sturgess, Cliff Curtis, Alice Braga, Summer Bishil', 'R', 'Immigrants from around the world enter Los Angeles every day, with hopeful visions of a better life, but little notion of what that life may cost. Their desperate scenarios test the humanity of immigration enforcement officers. In Crossing Over, writer-director Wayne Kramer explores the allure of the American dream, and the reality that immigrants find – and create -- in 21st century L.A.', 'Immigrants from around the world enter Los Angeles every day, with hopeful visions of a better life, but little notion of what that life may cost. Their desperate scenarios test the humanity of immigration enforcement officers. In Crossing Over, writer-director Wayne Kramer explores the allure of the American dream, and the reality that immigrants find – and create -- in 21st century L.A.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6A4WdvbWHJoIN4Y9Q5HXG8R1VYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15577'),
  ('698967059134999150', 'Crossing the Bridge', 1992, 'Drama', 'Mike Binder, Newton Thomas Sigel', 'Mike Binder', 'Josh Charles, Jason Gedrick, Stephen Baldwin, Cheryl Pollak, Rita Taggart, Hy Anzell, Richard Edson, Ken Jenkins', 'R', 'A film about three high school friends who find their happy-go-lucky existence tarnished forever the instant they get embroiled in a drug-running scheme that goes awry. When things start getting messy, they rue the day they agreed to the venture; instead of smuggling weed from Canada to Detroit, which they''d expected, the threesome''s forced to traffic a huge stash of heroin.', 'A film about three high school friends who find their happy-go-lucky existence tarnished forever the instant they get embroiled in a drug-running scheme that goes awry. When things start getting messy, they rue the day they agreed to the venture; instead of smuggling weed from Canada to Detroit, which they''d expected, the threesome''s forced to traffic a huge stash of heroin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foUGj7SQu2b5GgVlc7ADyWhZGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186809'),
  ('478023484718915810', 'Crossing the Bridge: The Sound of Istanbul', 2005, 'Documentary, Music', 'Fatih Akin', 'Fatih Akin', 'Alexander Hacke, Orhan Gencebay, Sezen Aksu, Baba Zula, Erkin Koray, Mercan Dede, Sertab Erener, Müzeyyen Senar', null, 'German musician Alexander Hacke explores Istanbul''s rich music culture and attempts to create a portrait of Turkey through music genres. On this journey, he encounters a mosaic that covers countless genres from rock to arabesque, electronic to hip-hop.', 'German musician Alexander Hacke explores Istanbul''s rich music culture and attempts to create a portrait of Turkey through music genres. On this journey, he encounters a mosaic that covers countless genres from rock to arabesque, electronic to hip-hop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPT26kzmlzOoBPzXEXqRvfWgVsM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29138'),
  ('445639980787565018', 'Crossing the Line', 1990, 'Drama', 'Gary Graver, Harmon Cusack', 'Rick Marcus', 'Rick Hearst, Paul L. Smith, Jon Stafford, Vernon Wells, Cameron Mitchell, John Saxon, Simon Poland, Colleen Morris', null, 'A rich kid, with a fondness for fast bikes, is blamed when a motorcycle accident puts his best friend in a coma.', 'A rich kid, with a fondness for fast bikes, is blamed when a motorcycle accident puts his best friend in a coma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUUWyeML379KYs8i5F6HQm9mwGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94454'),
  ('953334784118200978', 'Crossing the Line', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Pietro Marcello, Daria D''Antonio', 'Pietro Marcello', null, null, 'A journey through Italian landscapes as seen through the windows of a long-distance express train.', 'A journey through Italian landscapes as seen through the windows of a long-distance express train.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YGzxZLVZ0aMC49m7T5Hz44i9Kh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352371'),
  ('1007059400178853945', 'Crossover', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Preston A. Whitmore II, Regina Gordon, Christian Sebaldt', 'Preston A. Whitmore II', 'Anthony Mackie, Marcello Thedford, Allen Payne, Wesley Jonathan, Wayne Brady, Lil J.J., Philip Champion, Alecia Jai Fears', 'PG-13', 'The clock strikes midnight, money changes hands, the crowd is on their feet, and the court is alive with fast-paced razzle-dazzle basketball. These players don''t play for a school or a pro team. They play for the street and it''s underground...way underground.', 'The clock strikes midnight, money changes hands, the crowd is on their feet, and the court is alive with fast-paced razzle-dazzle basketball. These players don''t play for a school or a pro team. They play for the street and it''s underground...way underground.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jMShqkxESzjcXWdhGJz65CPWi8L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14351'),
  ('305541996646984308', 'Crossplot', 1969, 'Thriller, Action', 'Brendan J. Stafford, Alvin Rakoff', 'Leigh Vance', 'Roger Moore, Martha Hyer, Alexis Kanner, Claudie Lange, Derek Francis, Ursula Howells, Bernard Lee, Francis Matthews', null, 'A successful London ad-exec hires a beautiful Hungarian girl to pose for some modeling shots, little realising that she has overheard an assassination plot and is now being hunted by some dangerous killers.', 'A successful London ad-exec hires a beautiful Hungarian girl to pose for some modeling shots, little realising that she has overheard an assassination plot and is now being hunted by some dangerous killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CoDjBf2gZQJLNvEZ6Vpl1VWXHf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107321'),
  ('1076367769605516611', 'Crossroads', 1928, 'Drama', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa, Kōhei Sugiyama', 'Teinosuke Kinugasa', 'Junosuke Bandô, Akiko Chihaya, Yukiko Ogawa, Minoru Takase, Yoshie Nakagawa, Misao Seki, Teruko Sanjô, Keinosuke Sawada', null, 'After falling in love with a courtesan, Rikiya is blinded by ash during a fight in a brothel. Believing the blindness permanent and his opponent dead, Rikiya goes back home to his sister. Okiku, desperate to protect her brother who thinks himself a murderer, wants to sacrifice herself for him and become a prostitute to pay for Rikiya''s treatment.', 'After falling in love with a courtesan, Rikiya is blinded by ash during a fight in a brothel. Believing the blindness permanent and his opponent dead, Rikiya goes back home to his sister. Okiku, desperate to protect her brother who thinks himself a murderer, wants to sacrifice herself for him and become a prostitute to pay for Rikiya''s treatment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/487kCNtHR7ZWKr5BToKijb2Ifv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190147'),
  ('702885385581020991', 'Crossroads', 1942, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Jack Conway, Joseph Ruttenberg', 'Guy Trosper', 'William Powell, Hedy Lamarr, Claire Trevor, Basil Rathbone, Margaret Wycherly, Felix Bressart, Sig Ruman, H.B. Warner', 'NR', 'A French diplomat who''s recovered from amnesia is blackmailed over crimes he can''t remember.', 'A French diplomat who''s recovered from amnesia is blackmailed over crimes he can''t remember.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JnVb5EzDHI3uhACWpQfO772yO4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42825'),
  ('10416679768855241', 'Crossroads', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Bruce Conner', null, null, null, 'The 1945 atomic-bomb explosion at Bikini Atoll becomes a thing of terrible beauty and haunting visual poetry when shown in extreme slow motion, shown from 27 different angles, and accompanied by avant-garde Western classical music composed for electric organ by Terry Riley. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Pacific Film Archive in 1995.', 'The 1945 atomic-bomb explosion at Bikini Atoll becomes a thing of terrible beauty and haunting visual poetry when shown in extreme slow motion, shown from 27 different angles, and accompanied by avant-garde Western classical music composed for electric organ by Terry Riley. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with Pacific Film Archive in 1995.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2S3Ia3g5SHlioqMvcQKtvsJP7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111793'),
  ('152615404228845985', 'Crossroads', 1986, 'Drama, Music, Mystery, Romance', 'Walter Hill, John Bailey', 'John Fusco', 'Ralph Macchio, Joe Seneca, Jami Gertz, Joe Morton, Robert Judd, Steve Vai, Tim Russ, Dennis Lipscomb', 'R', 'A wanna-be blues guitar virtuoso seeks a long-lost song by legendary musician, Robert Johnson.', 'A wanna-be blues guitar virtuoso seeks a long-lost song by legendary musician, Robert Johnson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sMo7gwZ8L7KttiW210T0ueJ2eX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15392'),
  ('680708591059837438', 'Crossroads', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Tamra Davis, Robert Lorenz, Melissa Cummins Lorenz', 'Shonda Rhimes', 'Britney Spears, Zoe Saldaña, Taryn Manning, Anson Mount, Dan Aykroyd, Kim Cattrall, Justin Long, Beverly Johnson', 'PG-13', 'After eight years apart, three childhood friends - Lucy, Kit, and Mimi - rediscover their friendship on a cross-country trip. With barely a plan, practically no money but plenty of dreams, the girls catch a lift with Mimi''s handsome friend Ben in his convertible. Along the way they not only gather experiences that will change their lives, but they also discover how important it is to hold onto their hearts'' desires.', 'After eight years apart, three childhood friends - Lucy, Kit, and Mimi - rediscover their friendship on a cross-country trip. With barely a plan, practically no money but plenty of dreams, the girls catch a lift with Mimi''s handsome friend Ben in his convertible. Along the way they not only gather experiences that will change their lives, but they also discover how important it is to hold onto their hearts'' desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prdFY9Bc28frBhhWl7mPSr7JmFp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17130'),
  ('122161730217912501', 'Crossway', 2008, 'Drama', 'Cyril Legann', null, 'Sabine Bail, Alexandre Palmieri, Fabien de Marchi, Thomas Badek, Johan Libéreau, Christian Giudicelli', null, 'A very interesting thriller about the coming of age of a troubled young man searching his place in this world. Teenage boy Jonathan (Fabien de Marchi) is having a hard time living with his father and stepmother. On a whim, he steals some money and embarks on a journey of forbidden pleasures. He spends the night in abandoned building and wakes up bound and is held prisoner by Antoine (Johan Libéreau), a young drug dealer wanted by the police. The two boys forge an ambiguous relationship between violence, compassion and fascination. Victim, Jonathan ends up taking a liking to his tormentor.', 'A very interesting thriller about the coming of age of a troubled young man searching his place in this world. Teenage boy Jonathan (Fabien de Marchi) is having a hard time living with his father and stepmother. On a whim, he steals some money and embarks on a journey of forbidden pleasures. He spends the night in abandoned building and wakes up bound and is held prisoner by Antoine (Johan Libéreau), a young drug dealer wanted by the police. The two boys forge an ambiguous relationship between violence, compassion and fascination. Victim, Jonathan ends up taking a liking to his tormentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yavtq3wSnqxEvXgcHS7xdDARCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179779'),
  ('1049041340997167448', 'Crossword Mysteries: A Puzzle to Die For', 2019, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Thriller', 'Paul Dudar, Peter Benison, Don McCutcheon', null, 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Barbara Niven, John Kapelos, Victor A. Young, Zach Smadu, Genevieve Kang, Kelly Penner', null, 'A crossword puzzle editor finds her life completely disrupted when several of the clues in her recent puzzles are linked to unsolved crimes, and she is pulled into the police investigation.', 'A crossword puzzle editor finds her life completely disrupted when several of the clues in her recent puzzles are linked to unsolved crimes, and she is pulled into the police investigation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6T3MopiUUWoye1VHDQ85lrj0hki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529245'),
  ('55796389689494797', 'Crossword Mysteries: Abracadaver', 2020, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime', 'Jonathan Yapp, Jonathan Wright, John Bradshaw', 'Cecily Rhett, Kathryn Rhett', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Barbara Niven, John Kapelos, Genevieve Kang, Steve Belford, Noam Jenkins, Kaitlyn Leeb', 'PG', 'During her birthday celebration, Tess and Logan find themselves swept up in a world that isn''t always what it seems when the headlining magician at the Magic Manor winds up dead.', 'During her birthday celebration, Tess and Logan find themselves swept up in a world that isn''t always what it seems when the headlining magician at the Magic Manor winds up dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkFB81pZF0iJLxM0Hd4LzOXcIaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639289'),
  ('45132695415860869', 'Crossword Mysteries: Proposing Murder', 2019, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime', 'Don McCutcheon, Jonathan Yapp, Sartaj Aulakh', 'Gregg Rossen, Brian Sawyer', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Barbara Niven, John Kapelos, Romaine Waite, Lara Jean Chorostecki, Alex Paxton-Beesley, Kimberly J. Brown', 'PG', 'When an old friend of New York Sentinel Crosswords editor Tess Harper is found murdered on the very day her puzzle includes his proposal of marriage, Tess unofficially teams up with Detective Logan O’Connor to find the killer.', 'When an old friend of New York Sentinel Crosswords editor Tess Harper is found murdered on the very day her puzzle includes his proposal of marriage, Tess unofficially teams up with Detective Logan O’Connor to find the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7F68QPWGpQalpMeGVTGZjoWYvKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639254'),
  ('36091343204303290', 'Crossword Mysteries: Riddle Me Dead', 2021, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'Dan Dumouchel, Paula Antil, David Winning', 'Pierluigi D. Cothran', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Barbara Niven, John Kapelos, Jon Cor, Parveen Dosanjh, Lucia Walters, Lane Edwards', null, 'Tess gets invited to be a part of a popular game show, but when the host is unexpectedly murdered, she and Detective Logan O''Connor seek to uncover who was behind it all.', 'Tess gets invited to be a part of a popular game show, but when the host is unexpectedly murdered, she and Detective Logan O''Connor seek to uncover who was behind it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AC6r7wgq8gToysiVSZYlRnB4Rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:784410'),
  ('534076153261458238', 'Crossword Mysteries: Terminal Descent', 2021, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Romance', 'Peter Benson, Geoff Wallace', 'Pierluigi D. Cothran', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Barbara Niven, John Kapelos, Parveen Dosanjh, Matthew James Dowden, Brandi Alexander, Cardi Wong', 'PG', 'After volunteering to participate in a crossword solving competition with a new supercomputer, crossword puzzle editor Tess Harper finds herself swept into the investigation of the bizarre murder of a tech CEO', 'After volunteering to participate in a crossword solving competition with a new supercomputer, crossword puzzle editor Tess Harper finds herself swept into the investigation of the bizarre murder of a tech CEO', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6H2nRC9GaFQNpMSzY54tGnGorNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783508'),
  ('823160837227452168', 'Crossworlds', 1996, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Michael A. Allowitz, W. Scott Wolf, Christopher Walling', 'Raman Rao, Krishna Rao', 'Rutger Hauer, Josh Charles, Andrea Roth, Perry Anzilotti, Jack Black, Richard McGregor, Ellen Geer, Beverly Johnson', 'PG-13', 'College good guy Joe is drawn into a battle to save the world from arch-enemy Ferris. Joe''s heirloom pendant just happens to be the key to the staff that opens doors to the Crossworlds. When Laura shows up to check on the key and Ferris'' goons begin their assaults, they run to semi-retired adventurer A.T. for help and guidance.', 'College good guy Joe is drawn into a battle to save the world from arch-enemy Ferris. Joe''s heirloom pendant just happens to be the key to the staff that opens doors to the Crossworlds. When Laura shows up to check on the key and Ferris'' goons begin their assaults, they run to semi-retired adventurer A.T. for help and guidance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2aqbMX7EoYg23NfD6lCusZrZyR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17821'),
  ('653535406883741238', 'Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon', 2000, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Romance', 'Ang Lee, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Yuen Woo-Ping', 'Wang Huiling, James Schamus, Tsai Kuo-Jung', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Michelle Yeoh, Zhang Ziyi, Chang Chen, Lung Sihung, Cheng Pei-Pei, Li Fazeng, Gao Xian', null, 'Two warriors in pursuit of a stolen sword and a notorious fugitive are led to an impetuous, physically-skilled, teenage nobleman''s daughter, who is at a crossroads in her life.', 'Two warriors in pursuit of a stolen sword and a notorious fugitive are led to an impetuous, physically-skilled, teenage nobleman''s daughter, who is at a crossroads in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNDVBFNz4XyYzM9Lwip6atSTFqf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146'),
  ('1143084648490310630', 'Crouching Tiger, Hidden Dragon: Sword of Destiny', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Newton Thomas Sigel, Nick Bassett', 'John Fusco, Bey Logan', 'Donnie Yen, Michelle Yeoh, Jason Scott Lee, Natasha Liu Bordizzo, Harry Shum Jr., Eugenia Yuan, Roger Yuan, Chris Pang', 'PG-13', 'A story of lost love, young love, a legendary sword and one last opportunity at redemption.', 'A story of lost love, young love, a legendary sword and one last opportunity at redemption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/te3aeAyhkfqgpa5BSTq3oNxGqQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263341'),
  ('350168906761582572', 'Croupier', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Mike Hodges, Michael Garfath', 'Paul Mayersberg', 'Clive Owen, Kate Hardie, Alex Kingston, Gina McKee, Nicholas Ball, Alexander Morton, Paul Reynolds, Nick Reding', 'R', 'Jack Manfred is an aspiring writer who to make ends meet, takes a job as a croupier. Jack remains an observer, knowing that everything in life is a gamble and that gamblers are born to lose. Inevitably, he gets sucked into the world of the casino which takes its toll on his relationships and the novel he is writing.', 'Jack Manfred is an aspiring writer who to make ends meet, takes a job as a croupier. Jack remains an observer, knowing that everything in life is a gamble and that gamblers are born to lose. Inevitably, he gets sucked into the world of the casino which takes its toll on his relationships and the novel he is writing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaWqZXnXe5agLUjAqS0Cg8dq3Rw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12706'),
  ('405026603690340361', 'Crowhaven Farm', 1970, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Walter Grauman, Fleet Southcott', 'John McGreevey', 'Hope Lange, Paul Burke, Lloyd Bochner, John Carradine, Cyril Delevanti, Milton Selzer, Patricia Barry, Cindy Eilbacher', null, 'A couple, Maggie and Ben Porter, inherit an old farmhouse and move in, hoping to reinvigorate their marriage. When they learn the home was occupied long ago by a woman who was executed for practicing witchcraft, Maggie begins to have nightmares about her.', 'A couple, Maggie and Ben Porter, inherit an old farmhouse and move in, hoping to reinvigorate their marriage. When they learn the home was occupied long ago by a woman who was executed for practicing witchcraft, Maggie begins to have nightmares about her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3JF9ntnWhpqba1caOLNEh6bEri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28760'),
  ('959140647584879789', 'Crowing Pains', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'Henery Hawk hides in an egg to catch his first chicken, while Foghorn Leghorn tells him that Sylvester is the real chicken and the farm dog joins in the fun.', 'Henery Hawk hides in an egg to catch his first chicken, while Foghorn Leghorn tells him that Sylvester is the real chicken and the farm dog joins in the fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhlrMvee60Ghq0WhkuXwOKBgMtp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177340'),
  ('251440463126318080', 'Crown for Christmas', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Alex Zamm, Viorel Sergovici', 'Tippi Dobrofsky, Neal H. Dobrofsky', 'Danica McKellar, Rupert Penry-Jones, Ellie Botterill, Pavel Douglas, Colin McFarlane, Amy Marston, Alexandra Evans, Emma Sutton', 'G', 'Allie Foster, a struggling New York artist, reluctantly accepts to act as a governess to a rebellious Princess Theodora of Winshire. When Allie forms an unlikely bond with the princess, she attracts the attention of the handsome King Maximillian, who’s facing an arranged marriage against his heart’s wishes. As Christmas Eve draws near, Allie finds herself swept up in romance, royalty and the spirit of the holidays.', 'Allie Foster, a struggling New York artist, reluctantly accepts to act as a governess to a rebellious Princess Theodora of Winshire. When Allie forms an unlikely bond with the princess, she attracts the attention of the handsome King Maximillian, who’s facing an arranged marriage against his heart’s wishes. As Christmas Eve draws near, Allie finds herself swept up in romance, royalty and the spirit of the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lRL9n6Zvvl7BMpGzELvzWJx2df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360603'),
  ('983224306639289119', 'Crown Heights', 2017, 'Drama', 'Matt Ruskin, Ben Kutchins', 'Matt Ruskin', 'LaKeith Stanfield, Nnamdi Asomugha, Natalie Paul, Bill Camp, Nestor Carbonell, Amari Cheatom, Gbenga Akinnagbe, Sarah Goldberg', 'R', 'When Colin Warner was wrongfully convicted of murder, his best friend Carl King devoted his life to proving his innocence.', 'When Colin Warner was wrongfully convicted of murder, his best friend Carl King devoted his life to proving his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksTHqOb8bPPdbIsZXHnWX3NrgfH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425507'),
  ('647185467994490612', 'Crown of Russian Empire, or the Elusives Again', 1971, 'Action, Adventure, Family', 'Edmond Keosayan, Mikhail Ardabyevsky, Artashes Vanetsian', 'Aleksandr Chervinsky, Edmond Keosayan', 'Mikhail Metyolkin, Viktor Kosykh, Vasiliy Vasilev, Valentina Kurdyukova, Ivan Pereverzev, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Vladimir Ivashov, Vladislav Strzhelchik', null, 'The Russian Civil War is over and the White Guard are all dead or abroad. Some of the exiled nobles are attempting to crown a new Tsar/Emperor abroad, and a couple of impostors are vying for the position. At the same time, some of the Elusive Avengers'' old foes are trying to return to Russia, for mysterious reasons. The avengers are assigned the task of finding out what''s going on. Turns out the bad guys are after the Russian Crown, which is encrusted with many diamonds and jewels. It is not clear whether the crown is only wanted for the coronation ceremony or if the bad guys are trying to sell it to the highest bidder, but either way they must be stopped. The avengers are after them. Two go to Paris to infiltrate the emigrant community, and the other two work on the Russian soil.', 'The Russian Civil War is over and the White Guard are all dead or abroad. Some of the exiled nobles are attempting to crown a new Tsar/Emperor abroad, and a couple of impostors are vying for the position. At the same time, some of the Elusive Avengers'' old foes are trying to return to Russia, for mysterious reasons. The avengers are assigned the task of finding out what''s going on. Turns out the bad guys are after the Russian Crown, which is encrusted with many diamonds and jewels. It is not clear whether the crown is only wanted for the coronation ceremony or if the bad guys are trying to sell it to the highest bidder, but either way they must be stopped. The avengers are after them. Two go to Paris to infiltrate the emigrant community, and the other two work on the Russian soil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wEieow2ch8shKbOai7X00nLNIuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65594'),
  ('326552907730917345', 'Crown v. Stevens', 1936, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Basil Emmott, Michael Powell', 'Brock Williams', 'Beatrix Thomson, Patric Knowles, Glennis Lorimer, Reginald Purdell, Allan Jeayes, Frederick Piper, Googie Withers, Mabel Poulton', null, 'When an ex-dancer marries a man for his money she is surprised to find he is a real skinflint. She owes a lot of money to a loan-shark who is after her. However, her husband does carry a lot of life insurance.', 'When an ex-dancer marries a man for his money she is surprised to find he is a real skinflint. She owes a lot of money to a loan-shark who is after her. However, her husband does carry a lot of life insurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQ0g9bGz93E804eAJ2X3qLRH4kA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112408'),
  ('30431362423590359', 'Crown Vic', 2019, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Joel Souza, Thomas Scott Stanton', 'Joel Souza', 'Thomas Jane, Luke Kleintank, Josh Hopkins, David Krumholtz, Bridget Moynahan, Scottie Thompson, Emma Ishta, Devon Werkheiser', 'R', 'One memorable night in the life of veteran patrol officer Ray Mandel and his trainee, ambitious rookie cop Nick Holland in the LAPD''s Olympic Division. With two cop killers on the loose and hunting for more targets, Mandel and Holland must contend with a city about to boil over, as well as Jack VanZandt, an unhinged rogue cop out for payback running wild in their patrol zone.', 'One memorable night in the life of veteran patrol officer Ray Mandel and his trainee, ambitious rookie cop Nick Holland in the LAPD''s Olympic Division. With two cop killers on the loose and hunting for more targets, Mandel and Holland must contend with a city about to boil over, as well as Jack VanZandt, an unhinged rogue cop out for payback running wild in their patrol zone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUFuuUMd4nMbt3pdzulnFRxbY6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524659'),
  ('145294267601315404', 'Crows', 1995, 'Drama', 'Dorota Kędzierzawska, Artur Reinhart', 'Dorota Kędzierzawska', 'Karolina Ostrozna, Katarzyna Szczepanik, Małgorzata Hajewska-Krzysztofik, Anna Prucnal, Ewa Bukowska, Krzysztof Grabarczyk, Agnieszka Pilaszewska, Antoni Majak', null, 'In a quiet, lonesome Polish city, a neglected ten year old girl kidnaps a pampered toddler and pretends to be her mother.', 'In a quiet, lonesome Polish city, a neglected ten year old girl kidnaps a pampered toddler and pretends to be her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3elu1rIwsViFgIaXyWzRvewDxwr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82027'),
  ('1056234677462353685', 'Crows Are White', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Ahsen Nadeem', 'Ahsen Nadeem, Matt H. Mayes', 'Dawn Light Blackman, Ryushin, Ahsen Nadeem', null, 'After decades of living a secret life, a filmmaker travels to a strict Japanese monastery in search of guidance but the only monk who will help him prefers ice cream and heavy metal over meditation. Crows are White is an exploration of truth, faith and love, from the top of a mountain to the bottom of a sundae.', 'After decades of living a secret life, a filmmaker travels to a strict Japanese monastery in search of guidance but the only monk who will help him prefers ice cream and heavy metal over meditation. Crows are White is an exploration of truth, faith and love, from the top of a mountain to the bottom of a sundae.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F4subTG603cLn1oanNPiTqJpNHcZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:crows-are-white'),
  ('44446858022704731', 'Crows Explode', 2014, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, Megumu Sawada, Ryo Otsuka', 'Kosuke Mukai, Mataichirô Yamamoto, Takashi Hasegawa', 'Masahiro Higashide, Taichi Saotome, Yuya Yagira, Ryo Katsuji, Takanori Iwata, Kento Nagayama, Kyosuke Yabe, Motoki Fukami', 'PG-13', 'A month after Genji Takiya graduates, a new battle for supremacy at Suzuran All-Boys High School begins. Transfer student Kaburagi Kazeo combats Kagami Ryohei for the coveted top spot, amidst a brewing inter-school conflict with Kurosaki Industrial High.', 'A month after Genji Takiya graduates, a new battle for supremacy at Suzuran All-Boys High School begins. Transfer student Kaburagi Kazeo combats Kagami Ryohei for the coveted top spot, amidst a brewing inter-school conflict with Kurosaki Industrial High.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4Zm4kxN1G3wa5bdmeMUxkb7js5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253451'),
  ('757276364334094552', 'Crows Zero', 2007, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Takashi Miike, Takumi Furuya, Kaori Ohtagaki', 'Shogo Muto', 'Shun Oguri, Kyosuke Yabe, Meisa Kuroki, Takayuki Yamada, Kenichi Endo, Goro Kishitani, Kenta Kiritani, Sousuke Takaoka', 'PG-13', 'The students of Suzuran High compete for the King of School title. An ex-graduate yakuza is sent to kill the son of a criminal group, but he can''t make himself do it as he reminds him of his youth.', 'The students of Suzuran High compete for the King of School title. An ex-graduate yakuza is sent to kill the son of a criminal group, but he can''t make himself do it as he reminds him of his youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/so1E9wUAXJi9hqGRNPgoVQd7HaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14943'),
  ('382455599844967352', 'Crows Zero II', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Takuma Yoshimi', 'Shogo Muto, Mataichirô Yamamoto', 'Shun Oguri, Takayuki Yamada, Kenta Kiritani, Meisa Kuroki, Kyosuke Yabe, Sousuke Takaoka, Tsutomu Takahashi, Kaname Endo', null, 'Genji and his victorious G.P.S. alliance find themselves facing down a new challenge by the students of Hosen Academy, feared by everyone as ''The Army of Killers.'' The two schools, in fact, have a history of bad blood between them. And the simmering embers of hatred are about to flare up again, burning away any last remnants of the truce they had so rigorously observed until now.', 'Genji and his victorious G.P.S. alliance find themselves facing down a new challenge by the students of Hosen Academy, feared by everyone as ''The Army of Killers.'' The two schools, in fact, have a history of bad blood between them. And the simmering embers of hatred are about to flare up again, burning away any last remnants of the truce they had so rigorously observed until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wHLXk6cgXhcSXksdXcMOEoUIvC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25716'),
  ('332768543048047074', 'Crows'' Feat', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Hawley Pratt', null, 'Mel Blanc, Tom Holland', null, 'Two Mexican crows, flying to Guadalajara on the wings of an airplane, spot a corn field on the ground below and dive into it...', 'Two Mexican crows, flying to Guadalajara on the wings of an airplane, spot a corn field on the ground below and dive into it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnhCob8cmD5v1Y9PjXoVRHZLG7q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234531'),
  ('387512658960075256', 'Crucible of Horror', 1971, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Viktors Ritelis, Colin Lloyd, Christopher Toyne', 'Olaf Pooley', 'Michael Gough, Yvonne Mitchell, Sharon Gurney, Simon Gough, Nicholas Jones, Olaf Pooley, Mary Hignett, David Butler', null, 'A mother and daughter hatch a scheme to murder their family''s domineering and sadistic patriarch.', 'A mother and daughter hatch a scheme to murder their family''s domineering and sadistic patriarch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYs1se2bMYZecw3sSZZbDaXsztp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30792'),
  ('419040993835611278', 'Crucible of Terror', 1972, 'Drama, Horror', 'Ted Hooker, Ted Sturgis', 'Ted Hooker, Tom Parkinson', 'Mike Raven, James Bolam, Mary Maude, Ronald Lacey, Betty Alberge, Beth Morris, Judy Matheson, Melissa Stribling', null, 'An obsessed sculptor kills a young women to make a perfect bronze sculpture of her. Years later at his secluded home a number of people become trapped in a web of revenge, murder and horror.', 'An obsessed sculptor kills a young women to make a perfect bronze sculpture of her. Years later at his secluded home a number of people become trapped in a web of revenge, murder and horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOqrlGGNAeUqhylXqhbpq4dE0PL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79576'),
  ('479469087067480127', 'Cruel', 2017, 'Crime, Horror', 'Eric Cherrière', 'Eric Cherrière', 'Jean-Jacques Lelté, Richard Duval, Maurice Poli, Magali Moreau', null, 'Pierre Tardieu, a day laborer, lives with his sick father. Reminiscing about his childhood with his mother on the beach, he can''t free himself from her. Murdering someone becomes the only way of realizing his existence. One day, he meets a pianist called Laure in a bookstore and falls in love with her.', 'Pierre Tardieu, a day laborer, lives with his sick father. Reminiscing about his childhood with his mother on the beach, he can''t free himself from her. Murdering someone becomes the only way of realizing his existence. One day, he meets a pianist called Laure in a bookstore and falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdPeqnzvdiwTvk6lzyXpHXR4Ywa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349193'),
  ('924398428100430205', 'Cruel Gun Story', 1964, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Takumi Furukawa, Saburō Isayama, 坂口喜久男', 'Hisataka Kai', 'Joe Shishido, Chieko Matsubara, Tamio Kawachi, Yuji Odaka, Minako Kozuki, Shōbun Inoue, Zenji Yamada, Yuzo Kiura', null, 'Businessmen arrange the early release from prison of Togawa, serving time for taking revenge on the truck driver whose carelessness confined Togawa''s sister, Rie, to a wheelchair. They want Togawa to hijack an armored truck loaded with 120 million yen; their leverage is to promise him money for surgery for Rie. Togawa consents and plans the heist with three others. The plan is solid, but it doesn''t go smoothly. Togawa must improvise, there are traitors somewhere, and double-crosses mount. Can Togawa escape with enough money to help his sister and ensure a passage out of Japan?', 'Businessmen arrange the early release from prison of Togawa, serving time for taking revenge on the truck driver whose carelessness confined Togawa''s sister, Rie, to a wheelchair. They want Togawa to hijack an armored truck loaded with 120 million yen; their leverage is to promise him money for surgery for Rie. Togawa consents and plans the heist with three others. The plan is solid, but it doesn''t go smoothly. Togawa must improvise, there are traitors somewhere, and double-crosses mount. Can Togawa escape with enough money to help his sister and ensure a passage out of Japan?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wobDzcGe4i2WzF4HBAPif3kACrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71722'),
  ('212086358088571422', 'Cruel Instruction', 2022, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Drama', 'Stanley M. Brooks, Amy Belling, Paula Antil', 'Adrienne Rush', 'Kelcey Mawema, Morgan Taylor Campbell, Camryn Manheim, Cynthia Bailey, Jason Gray-Stanford, Calder Stewart, Sydney Scotia, Genea Charpentier', 'PG-13', 'The story of 16-year-old Kayla Adams, whose mother, Karen is advised by the school’s counselor to send Kayla to get treatment at a youth residential treatment center after she gets expelled from school. Kayla arrives at the Utah facility on the same day as her roommate Amanda, a treatment program veteran who knows exactly what the girls were in for. Led by headmistress Miss Connie, the staff uses draconian methods including force-feeding medications, arbitrary punishments, solitary confinement, verbal and physical abuse to keep the students in line. After being pushed to their limits and stripped of their lifelines, including any ability to freely communicate with the outside world, the two young women must band together to survive and fight to expose the abuse before it’s too late.', 'The story of 16-year-old Kayla Adams, whose mother, Karen is advised by the school’s counselor to send Kayla to get treatment at a youth residential treatment center after she gets expelled from school. Kayla arrives at the Utah facility on the same day as her roommate Amanda, a treatment program veteran who knows exactly what the girls were in for. Led by headmistress Miss Connie, the staff uses draconian methods including force-feeding medications, arbitrary punishments, solitary confinement, verbal and physical abuse to keep the students in line. After being pushed to their limits and stripped of their lifelines, including any ability to freely communicate with the outside world, the two young women must band together to survive and fight to expose the abuse before it’s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNhfPGpTzDQlhSLMvttth4fOtMU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:946581'),
  ('1069525016062055234', 'Cruel Intentions', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Roger Kumble, Theo van de Sande, Sam Hill', 'Roger Kumble', 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Ryan Phillippe, Reese Witherspoon, Selma Blair, Louise Fletcher, Joshua Jackson, Eric Mabius, Sean Patrick Thomas', 'R', 'Slaking a thirst for dangerous games, Kathryn challenges her stepbrother, Sebastian, to deflower their headmaster''s daughter before the summer ends. If he succeeds, the prize is the chance to bed Kathryn. But if he loses, Kathryn will claim his most prized possession.', 'Slaking a thirst for dangerous games, Kathryn challenges her stepbrother, Sebastian, to deflower their headmaster''s daughter before the summer ends. If he succeeds, the prize is the chance to bed Kathryn. But if he loses, Kathryn will claim his most prized possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/76cCsRtQ5MJBAqoigojXsLXLJwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796'),
  ('510301330034496086', 'Cruel Intentions 2', 2000, 'Drama', 'Roger Kumble, James R. Bagdonas, Neil Huhta', 'Roger Kumble', 'Robin Dunne, Sarah Thompson, Keri Lynn Pratt, Amy Adams, Barry Flatman, Mimi Rogers, Teresa Hill, Barclay Hope', 'R', 'After his precocious behavior has gotten him bounced out of one more in a string of exclusive private schools, 16-year old Sebastian Valmont has arrived in New York City to live with his father and stepmother. The cunning and handsome Sebastian may have met his match, however in his equally manipulative and beautiful stepsister Kathryn Merteuil.', 'After his precocious behavior has gotten him bounced out of one more in a string of exclusive private schools, 16-year old Sebastian Valmont has arrived in New York City to live with his father and stepmother. The cunning and handsome Sebastian may have met his match, however in his equally manipulative and beautiful stepsister Kathryn Merteuil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/soO0nrnh9lEdTgGFBT0IIvejwcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5458'),
  ('774947757277368742', 'Cruel Intentions 3', 2004, 'Drama', 'Scott Ziehl, Thomas L. Callaway, Joe Lotito', 'Rhett Reese', 'Kerr Smith, Kristina Anapau, Nathan Wetherington, Melissa Yvonne Lewis, Natalie Ramsey, Tom Parker, Michael Pemberton, Tara Carroll', 'R', 'Meet Cassie, Jason and Patrick, three amoral college students who, through a series of sexual wagers, take malicious pleasure in ruining the lives of their fellow classmates.', 'Meet Cassie, Jason and Patrick, three amoral college students who, through a series of sexual wagers, take malicious pleasure in ruining the lives of their fellow classmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pxjJf3QnZxe3EO8NuwEeK0Yldcd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5460'),
  ('826803114150614222', 'Cruel Jaws', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller, Adventure, Comedy', 'Bruno Mattei, Geoff Turner, Germano Saracco', 'Linda Morrison, Robert Feen, Bruno Mattei', 'David Luther, George Barnes Jr., Scott Silveria, Kirsten Urso, Richard Dew, Sky Palma, Norma J. Nesheim, Gregg Hood', 'PG-13', 'A tiger shark bred by the Navy as a killing machine is wreaking havoc in the sleepy tourist town of Hampton Bay.', 'A tiger shark bred by the Navy as a killing machine is wreaking havoc in the sleepy tourist town of Hampton Bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aLabIgttFYtHaN7eVQAA9nGdHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84060'),
  ('56261485997961817', 'Cruel Passion', 1977, 'Drama, Horror', 'Chris Boger, Roger Deakins', 'Ian Cullen', 'Koo Stark, Lydia Lisle, Martin Potter, Katherine Kath, Hope Jackman, Barry McGinn, Maggie Petersen, Ann Michelle', null, 'Justine is a nubile young virgin cast out of a French orphanage and thrust into a depraved world of prostitution, predatory lesbians, a fugitive murderess, bondage, branding, and one supremely sadistic monk. It''s a twisted tale of strange desires, perverse pleasures and the ultimate corruption of innocence as told by the Marquis de Sade.', 'Justine is a nubile young virgin cast out of a French orphanage and thrust into a depraved world of prostitution, predatory lesbians, a fugitive murderess, bondage, branding, and one supremely sadistic monk. It''s a twisted tale of strange desires, perverse pleasures and the ultimate corruption of innocence as told by the Marquis de Sade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/owEm8u0D7cdBGo0QMciTdo4yRjN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39006'),
  ('1122161089604405624', 'Cruel Peter', 2020, 'Horror', 'Christian Bisceglia, Duccio Cimatti', 'Ascanio Malgarini', 'Angelica Alleruzzo, Antonio Alveario, Aran Bevan, Alessio Bonaffini, Terence Booth, Claudio Castrogiovanni, Arcangelo Ciulla, Matteo De Gregori', null, 'It is Christmas 1908 in Messina, one of the richest merchant cities of the Mediterranean. Peter, the 13 year-old son of a rich English family is notorious for his cruelty to children, animals and servants. One night he is ambushed and wakes up in a coffin underground in the city''s Gothic cemetery, buried in retaliation for his callousness by a servant boy from his mother''s estate. When a powerful earthquake razes Messina to the ground, Peter is trapped and his whereabouts are forgotten. Until a century later an English archaeologist and his daughter arrive in the city.', 'It is Christmas 1908 in Messina, one of the richest merchant cities of the Mediterranean. Peter, the 13 year-old son of a rich English family is notorious for his cruelty to children, animals and servants. One night he is ambushed and wakes up in a coffin underground in the city''s Gothic cemetery, buried in retaliation for his callousness by a servant boy from his mother''s estate. When a powerful earthquake razes Messina to the ground, Peter is trapped and his whereabouts are forgotten. Until a century later an English archaeologist and his daughter arrive in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CXlIZFOOjpEwoTbvqVLmp9zWrM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664561'),
  ('784192231445344664', 'Cruel Restaurant', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Koji Kawano', 'Satoshi Ôwada, Koji Kawano', 'Mihiro, Sakae Yamazaki, Katsuya Naruse, Yûsuke Iwata, Miho Funatsu, Toshiyuki Teranaka, Chihiro Koganezaki, Kêsuke', null, 'Just what is the mystery ingredient in the pot stickers at Togen Restaurant? Those who look for the answer have a habit of disappearing. So when body parts start washing up on the beach, police trace the murders to Togen''s seemingly innocent owner. But the slaughter of a few curious fans is the least shocking secret coming out of Togen''s kitchen! Mihiro, Sakae Yamazaki, Katsuya Naruse and Yusuke Iwata star in this pitch-black comic horror tale.', 'Just what is the mystery ingredient in the pot stickers at Togen Restaurant? Those who look for the answer have a habit of disappearing. So when body parts start washing up on the beach, police trace the murders to Togen''s seemingly innocent owner. But the slaughter of a few curious fans is the least shocking secret coming out of Togen''s kitchen! Mihiro, Sakae Yamazaki, Katsuya Naruse and Yusuke Iwata star in this pitch-black comic horror tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndziFzdfFk8CvsqPmwtd0iQEvIo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45065'),
  ('26185352917696210', 'Cruel Story of Youth', 1960, 'Romance, Drama, Crime', 'Nagisa Ōshima, Takashi Kawamata, Toshirō Ishidō', 'Nagisa Ōshima', 'Yūsuke Kawazu, Miyuki Kuwano, Yoshiko Kuga, Fumio Watanabe, Shinji Tanaka, Yosuke Hayashi, Toshiko Kobayashi, Jun Hamamura', null, 'A harsh young man seduces a freeloading young woman and eventually takes advantage of her knack for hitchhiking to rob middle-class men.', 'A harsh young man seduces a freeloading young woman and eventually takes advantage of her knack for hitchhiking to rob middle-class men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLPbvJEGGnOEWCUl7IhNSETDXs9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88527'),
  ('465666576620976863', 'Cruel Winter Blues', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Jeong-beom, Kim Dong-cheon', 'Lee Jeong-beom', 'Sul Kyung-gu, Jo Han-sun, Na Moon-hee, Yoon Je-moon, Ryu Seung-ryong, Oh Yong, Shim Yi Young, Kim Joon-bae', null, 'A gangster''s quest for revenge is sidetracked by an encounter with his target''s mother in this deeply-felt hybrid of a crime thriller and a family drama.', 'A gangster''s quest for revenge is sidetracked by an encounter with his target''s mother in this deeply-felt hybrid of a crime thriller and a family drama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfirknzm8qr0L54jlxnBhROVWzL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70131'),
  ('667799769052730141', 'Cruel World', 2006, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Kelsey T. Howard, Ward Russell, Jonathan Giles Zimmerman', 'Paul Lawrence, Eugene Hess, Paul T. Murray', 'Edward Furlong, Jaime Pressly, Daniel Franzese, Andrew Keegan, Susan Ward, Laura Ramsey, Aimee Garcia, Brian Geraghty', 'R', 'Following his dismissal from a television reality show, a deranged young man lures a group of beautiful coeds to his abode by telling them they will be the stars of a new show he is creating. What the women do not know is that when they lose their slot on the show, they lose their lives as well.', 'Following his dismissal from a television reality show, a deranged young man lures a group of beautiful coeds to his abode by telling them they will be the stars of a new show he is creating. What the women do not know is that when they lose their slot on the show, they lose their lives as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwJnkCghNpjnJ6GkSDg5YYooGV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44250'),
  ('873539933377080845', 'Cruella', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Craig Gillespie, Martin Foley, Nicolas Karakatsanis', 'Dana Fox, Tony McNamara', 'Emma Stone, Emma Thompson, Joel Fry, Paul Walter Hauser, John McCrea, Emily Beecham, Mark Strong, Kayvan Novak', 'PG-13', 'In 1970s London amidst the punk rock revolution, a young grifter named Estella is determined to make a name for herself with her designs. She befriends a pair of young thieves who appreciate her appetite for mischief, and together they are able to build a life for themselves on the London streets. One day, Estella’s flair for fashion catches the eye of the Baroness von Hellman, a fashion legend who is devastatingly chic and terrifyingly haute. But their relationship sets in motion a course of events and revelations that will cause Estella to embrace her wicked side and become the raucous, fashionable and revenge-bent Cruella.', 'In 1970s London amidst the punk rock revolution, a young grifter named Estella is determined to make a name for herself with her designs. She befriends a pair of young thieves who appreciate her appetite for mischief, and together they are able to build a life for themselves on the London streets. One day, Estella’s flair for fashion catches the eye of the Baroness von Hellman, a fashion legend who is devastatingly chic and terrifyingly haute. But their relationship sets in motion a course of events and revelations that will cause Estella to embrace her wicked side and become the raucous, fashionable and revenge-bent Cruella.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjS9mH8KvRiGHgjk6VUZH7OT0Ng.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337404'),
  ('91193409642173170', 'Cruise', 2018, 'Romance', 'Robert D. Siegel, Noah Greenberg', 'Robert D. Siegel', 'Spencer Boldman, Emily Ratajkowski, Noah Robbins, Kathrine Narducci, Gino Cafarelli, Sebastian Maniscalco, Theresa Moriarty, Lucas Salvagno', null, 'Set in the 1980s, a young Italian-American from the wrong side of the tracks falls for a Jewish girl from Long Island.', 'Set in the 1980s, a young Italian-American from the wrong side of the tracks falls for a Jewish girl from Long Island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwE2QWiwiuHg1vKHG3EZn3WDIXo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365240'),
  ('1059593443339807350', 'Cruise Cat', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Paul Frees', 'NR', 'Tom is the official cat on the cruise ship S.S. Aloha, but he''ll be kicked off if the captain finds even one mouse. That one, of course, is Jerry, who sneaks on board just before sailing.', 'Tom is the official cat on the cruise ship S.S. Aloha, but he''ll be kicked off if the captain finds even one mouse. That one, of course, is Jerry, who sneaks on board just before sailing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQpmz4zCHxRYOQMQUgS373bSZvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53849'),
  ('495732333158666896', 'Cruising', 1980, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'William Friedkin, James A. Contner, Alan Hopkins', 'William Friedkin', 'Al Pacino, Paul Sorvino, Karen Allen, Richard Cox, Don Scardino, Joe Spinell, Jay Acovone, Gene Davis', 'R', 'When New York is caught in the grip of a sadistic serial killer who preys on patrons of the city''s underground bars, young rookie Steve Burns infiltrates the S&M subculture to try and lure him out of the shadows.', 'When New York is caught in the grip of a sadistic serial killer who preys on patrons of the city''s underground bars, young rookie Steve Burns infiltrates the S&M subculture to try and lure him out of the shadows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bb9CND0WyfwdHOZY5XmP4Qn8taz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27958'),
  ('437177065334198131', 'Cruising Bar', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Robert Ménard, Pierre Mignot', 'Claire Wojas', 'Michel Côté, Louise Marleau, Geneviève Rioux, Véronique Le Flaguais, Diane Jules, Marthe Turgeon, Pauline Lapointe, Jean-Pierre Bergeron', null, 'Saturday, 12 p.m. The countdown has begun for four men on the make for women. Massage studios, last minute shopping, bodybuilding; our men ardently throw themselves into the ritual of appearance. It is impossible to resist the ferociously burlesque and remarkably stereotypical behavior of these characters. We will meet Gérard known as The Bull, Patrice known as The Lion, Jean-Jacques known as The Peacock and Serge known as The Earthworm. All of this is set in the clubs and bars of late night Montréal.', 'Saturday, 12 p.m. The countdown has begun for four men on the make for women. Massage studios, last minute shopping, bodybuilding; our men ardently throw themselves into the ritual of appearance. It is impossible to resist the ferociously burlesque and remarkably stereotypical behavior of these characters. We will meet Gérard known as The Bull, Patrice known as The Lion, Jean-Jacques known as The Peacock and Serge known as The Earthworm. All of this is set in the clubs and bars of late night Montréal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tH7g51H2FtS728jgNFuoCEuQI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33987'),
  ('882713943683304746', 'Cruising Bar 2', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Robert Ménard, Pierre Mignot, Michel Côté', 'Michel Côté, Robert Ménard, Claire Wojas', 'Michel Côté, Véronique Le Flaguais, Marie-France Duquette, Hélène Major, Martin Thibaudeau, Noémie Yelle, Jean-François Casabonne, Kathleen Fortin', null, 'Fifteen years later, the heroes from Cruising Bar may hardly have changed but the world around them most certainly has! For the Bull, reality is brutal. His wife of 30 years, sick of his infidelity, decides to show him the door. But the Bull, who has a positive outlook on life, isn''t so easily defeated and fights for his survival. The Lion too faces a break-up when his girlfriend leaves. All alone, he''s force to relearn the art of seduction. The Peacock, on the other hand, is trying to figure out his sexual identity with the help of a psychologist. As for the Earthworm, his long wait for a soulmate will, at last, be requited.', 'Fifteen years later, the heroes from Cruising Bar may hardly have changed but the world around them most certainly has! For the Bull, reality is brutal. His wife of 30 years, sick of his infidelity, decides to show him the door. But the Bull, who has a positive outlook on life, isn''t so easily defeated and fights for his survival. The Lion too faces a break-up when his girlfriend leaves. All alone, he''s force to relearn the art of seduction. The Peacock, on the other hand, is trying to figure out his sexual identity with the help of a psychologist. As for the Earthworm, his long wait for a soulmate will, at last, be requited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm9PZx2qD5ud4JO2tgcaN471M7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33989'),
  ('392635491002377618', 'Crumb', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Terry Zwigoff, Maryse Alberti', 'Terry Zwigoff', 'Robert Crumb, Aline Kominsky, Charles Crumb, Maxon Crumb, Robert Hughes, Martin Müller, Spain Rodriguez, Don Donahue', 'R', 'This movie chronicles the life and times of R. Crumb. Robert Crumb is the cartoonist/artist who drew Keep On Truckin'', Fritz the Cat, and played a major pioneering role in the genesis of underground comix. Through interviews with his mother, two brothers, wife, ex-wife and ex-girlfriends, as well as selections from his vast quantity of graphic art, we are treated to a darkly comic ride through one man''s subconscious mind.', 'This movie chronicles the life and times of R. Crumb. Robert Crumb is the cartoonist/artist who drew Keep On Truckin'', Fritz the Cat, and played a major pioneering role in the genesis of underground comix. Through interviews with his mother, two brothers, wife, ex-wife and ex-girlfriends, as well as selections from his vast quantity of graphic art, we are treated to a darkly comic ride through one man''s subconscious mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ocTHdBCJdwJ65Tubg3lYlfMxEY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26564'),
  ('966669226241102331', 'Crumb at a Gallop', 1992, 'Family, Comedy', 'Sven Methling, Peter Roos, Finn Henriksen', 'John Stefan Olsen', 'Laus Høybye, Dick Kaysø, Karen-Lise Mynster, Line Kruse, Lukas Graham Forchhammer, Elin Reimer, Buster Larsen, Sonja Oppenhagen', null, 'Everything is normal with the Krumborg family – but when you know them, nothing can surprise you anymore. The two robbers Boris and Ivan want to kidnap Krumme. Krumme wants to learn to ride a horse. Mom wants a healthy Christmas. Dad doesn''t want a healthy Christmas. And it''s hardly surprising that Krumme''s Christmas present for Yrsa ends up under Mrs. Olsen''s bed, or that caretaker Svendsen tries to repair Mrs. Olsen''s sink – even though it''s not broken. And the youngest member of the family, Grunk, has eaten all the Christmas decorations. Yes, everything is completely normal in the Krumborg family...', 'Everything is normal with the Krumborg family – but when you know them, nothing can surprise you anymore. The two robbers Boris and Ivan want to kidnap Krumme. Krumme wants to learn to ride a horse. Mom wants a healthy Christmas. Dad doesn''t want a healthy Christmas. And it''s hardly surprising that Krumme''s Christmas present for Yrsa ends up under Mrs. Olsen''s bed, or that caretaker Svendsen tries to repair Mrs. Olsen''s sink – even though it''s not broken. And the youngest member of the family, Grunk, has eaten all the Christmas decorations. Yes, everything is completely normal in the Krumborg family...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s279XbpFsFaNNoUtXdBrIYcczqe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71844'),
  ('47407516799592889', 'Crusade in Jeans', 2006, 'Adventure, Fantasy, History', 'Reinier van Brummelen, Ben Sombogaart', 'Jean-Claude Van Rijckeghem, Chris Craps', 'Johnny Flynn, Stephanie Leonidas, Emily Watson, Robert Timmins, Michael Culkin, Benno Fürmann, Ryan Winsley, Jake Kedge', 'PG', 'Dolf a 15 year old boy is sent back in time by a timemachine. Accidentally he is sent back to the Middle Ages. He is rescued by children who are part of a childrens'' crusade, on their way to rescue Jeruzalem. During the trip Dolf finds out the danger is not coming from outside the crusade, but from within.', 'Dolf a 15 year old boy is sent back in time by a timemachine. Accidentally he is sent back to the Middle Ages. He is rescued by children who are part of a childrens'' crusade, on their way to rescue Jeruzalem. During the trip Dolf finds out the danger is not coming from outside the crusade, but from within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4kphpgrPkkB26IConFGp8bE1vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2286'),
  ('295201754979801795', 'Crush', 2002, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Henry Braham, John McKay', 'John McKay', 'Andie MacDowell, Imelda Staunton, Anna Chancellor, Kenny Doughty, Bill Paterson, Richenda Carey, Andrew Bicknell, Jeremy Gittins', null, 'Three 40-something women in a small English town meet weekly for a ritual of gin, cigarettes, and sweets -- and swapped stories arguing which of them has the most pathetic love life. Kate is headmistress at the local school; her best friends are the town''s police chief and a cynical, thrice-divorced doctor.', 'Three 40-something women in a small English town meet weekly for a ritual of gin, cigarettes, and sweets -- and swapped stories arguing which of them has the most pathetic love life. Kate is headmistress at the local school; her best friends are the town''s police chief and a cynical, thrice-divorced doctor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZEWDLOhlOymdcitI31kwulUJ6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18435'),
  ('241376801518267567', 'Crush', 2009, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jeffrey Gerritsen, John V. Soto', 'John V. Soto', 'Emma Lung, Christopher Egan, Brooke Harman', null, 'Julian is perfectly happy in his relationship with the pretty blond Clare. That is, until he meets Anna, a dark-haired, bikini-clad beauty who he encounters while he is house-sitting. Passion reigns in their relationship, and soon Julian learns that Anna is more dangerous than he ever would have thought.', 'Julian is perfectly happy in his relationship with the pretty blond Clare. That is, until he meets Anna, a dark-haired, bikini-clad beauty who he encounters while he is house-sitting. Passion reigns in their relationship, and soon Julian learns that Anna is more dangerous than he ever would have thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gT8g35uxLV5fZCuFzOlYKi6qeYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24091'),
  ('223113388372369305', 'Crush', 2013, 'Thriller', 'Lori Ashfield, Dan Katzman, Scott Kevan', 'Sonny Mallhi', 'Lucas Till, Crystal Reed, Sarah Bolger, Caitríona Balfe, Reid Ewing, Holt McCallany, D.J. Kemp, Camille Guaty', 'PG-13', 'A secret admirer''s crush on a high school athlete takes a fatal turn.', 'A secret admirer''s crush on a high school athlete takes a fatal turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntQhvoStjTJhmj755UFx6TuC6yp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183662'),
  ('313183119124724050', 'Crush', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sammi Cohen, Justin Hogan, Matthew Wise', 'Kirsten King, Casey Rackham', 'Rowan Blanchard, Auliʻi Cravalho, Isabella Ferreira, Tyler Alvarez, Teala Dunn, Rico Paris, Aasif Mandvi, Michelle Buteau', null, 'When an aspiring young artist is forced to join her high school track team, she uses it as an opportunity to pursue the girl she''s been harboring a long-time crush on. But she soon finds herself falling for an unexpected teammate and discovers what real love feels like.', 'When an aspiring young artist is forced to join her high school track team, she uses it as an opportunity to pursue the girl she''s been harboring a long-time crush on. But she soon finds herself falling for an unexpected teammate and discovers what real love feels like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hayr56csDzCSADaejgrRMVPHyDy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:860159'),
  ('21313825496046096', 'Crush and Blush', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Kyoung-mi, Kim Dong-young, Son Jae-hyuk', 'Park Chan-wook, Lee Kyoung-mi, Park Eun-kyo', 'Gong Hyo-jin, Lee Jong-hyuk, Seo Woo, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Pang Eun-jin, Bae Sung-woo, Ra Mi-ran, Seo Bo-ik', null, 'After being demoted from teaching Russian to middle-school English students, Me-sook is literally red-faced with shame, because on top of all her other issues — unrequited love, unpopularity — Me-sook has a blushing problem.', 'After being demoted from teaching Russian to middle-school English students, Me-sook is literally red-faced with shame, because on top of all her other issues — unrequited love, unpopularity — Me-sook has a blushing problem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tsQttgxlnZOWkntP2zfkOZlbqJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52415'),
  ('900339676685587999', 'Crush in Jaipur', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Arnauld Mercadier', 'Arnauld Mercadier, Tatiana Werner', 'Lucie Lucas, Rayane Bensetti, Xavier Robic, Cécile Rebboah, Alison Petrier, Frankie Wallach, Delphine Forest, Saunskruti Kher', null, 'A light hearted romantic-road comedy produced by Big Band Story in association with the French TV network TF1. The film had its world premiere in Festival de la Fiction TV, La Rochelle. The film stars popular French TV stars Rayane Bensetti, Lucie Lucas, Cécile Rebboah & Xavier Robic.', 'A light hearted romantic-road comedy produced by Big Band Story in association with the French TV network TF1. The film had its world premiere in Festival de la Fiction TV, La Rochelle. The film stars popular French TV stars Rayane Bensetti, Lucie Lucas, Cécile Rebboah & Xavier Robic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pqdl03Wz2U9P3BQpIyXJ61aqReQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418333'),
  ('287316961087384490', 'Crush the Skull', 2015, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror', 'Viet Nguyen, John Reyes-Nguyen, Tuan Quoc Le', 'Viet Nguyen, Chris Dinh, Chris Dinh', 'Katie Savoy, Chris Riedell, Tim Chiou, Lauren Reeder, Leonard Wu, Lincoln Hoppe, Chris Dinh, Jerry Ying', null, 'A couple of master thieves find themselves trapped within a house they intended to rob, only to discover they''ve inadvertently wandered into the lair of a deranged serial killer.', 'A couple of master thieves find themselves trapped within a house they intended to rob, only to discover they''ve inadvertently wandered into the lair of a deranged serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMUeUhmsKN4mwaXyfgUa4K6RO6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345069'),
  ('747831832905783929', 'Crush The Wicked', 2026, 'Action, Crime', 'Cheng Siyi, Ma Erkang, Guo Yulong', 'Yifan Shi', 'Pan Binlong, Bao Bei''er, Zhao Runnan, Clara Lee, Zhou Dayong, Yu Bolin, Guo Ziheng, Hou Haoran', null, 'A detective and a vengeful survivor hunt a fugitive serial killer who resurfaces to commit one last desperate crime.', 'A detective and a vengeful survivor hunt a fugitive serial killer who resurfaces to commit one last desperate crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4Bq8KtU9hNdxPQOQFlgOC82HRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1654429'),
  ('970894676063163787', 'Crusher Joe', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko, Sadayoshi Fujino', 'Yoshikazu Yasuhiko', 'Hiroshi Takemura, Run Sasaki, Noriko Ohara, Kiyoshi Kobayashi, Issei Futamata, Gorō Naya, Akira Kume, Kazuyuki Sogabe', null, 'Enter the tale of the Crusher Council, a group of rugged individuals known for assignments ranging from transportation to terraforming and everything in between. In the early days of space exploration the Crushers took on the job of destroying asteroids and defining space lanes. Because of their work, they were nicknamed "Crushers" which eventually became their business moniker. Despite the rough and ready nature of the Crushers'' work, they subscribe to a few steadfast rules. Unethical and illegal assignments are taboo, and any Crusher accepting one is barred from the Union. Of course, this presents problems for shady clients who try to trick the Crushers into accepting misleading assignments. They know that once the Union accepts a case the Crushers are honor-bound to follow it through. Among the various worlds, the Crusher Council has a stunning reputation, and among the Crushers, the most elite team is the one led by Crusher Dan and his successor, Crusher Joe.', 'Enter the tale of the Crusher Council, a group of rugged individuals known for assignments ranging from transportation to terraforming and everything in between. In the early days of space exploration the Crushers took on the job of destroying asteroids and defining space lanes. Because of their work, they were nicknamed "Crushers" which eventually became their business moniker. Despite the rough and ready nature of the Crushers'' work, they subscribe to a few steadfast rules. Unethical and illegal assignments are taboo, and any Crusher accepting one is barred from the Union. Of course, this presents problems for shady clients who try to trick the Crushers into accepting misleading assignments. They know that once the Union accepts a case the Crushers are honor-bound to follow it through. Among the various worlds, the Crusher Council has a stunning reputation, and among the Crushers, the most elite team is the one led by Crusher Dan and his successor, Crusher Joe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmIvh9qWorbwDDEozCVUrZks3CM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76729'),
  ('550946021809793459', 'Crusoe', 1989, 'Adventure', 'Caleb Deschanel, Tomislav Pinter', 'Walon Green', 'Aidan Quinn, Ade Sapara, Elvis Payne, Richard D. Sharp, Shane Rimmer, Timothy Spall, Oliver Platt, Warren Clarke', 'PG-13', 'Robinson Crusoe is shipwrecked and he finds himself all alone on a tropical island. With a few tools he manages to rescue from the wreck he has to learn to support himself until help arrives.', 'Robinson Crusoe is shipwrecked and he finds himself all alone on a tropical island. With a few tools he manages to rescue from the wreck he has to learn to support himself until help arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vx6QhJa0AwfTvMnj1J9dYj0JysD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41953'),
  ('993641452234045909', 'Cry ''Havoc''', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Richard Thorpe, Hal Rosher, Karl Freund', 'Paul Osborn', 'Margaret Sullavan, Ann Sothern, Joan Blondell, Fay Bainter, Ella Raines, Marsha Hunt, Frances Gifford, Diana Lewis', 'NR', 'The Army nurses on Bataan need help badly, but when it arrives, it sure isn''t what they expected. A motley crew, including a Southern belle, a waitress, and a stripper, show up. Many conflicts arise among these women who are thrown together in what is a desperate and ultimately hopeless situation.', 'The Army nurses on Bataan need help badly, but when it arrives, it sure isn''t what they expected. A motley crew, including a Southern belle, a waitress, and a stripper, show up. Many conflicts arise among these women who are thrown together in what is a desperate and ultimately hopeless situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqcsC9aNTYpSiiv5R53J9LiGjmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72103'),
