  ('284423212619740987', 'Cry_Wolf', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Romeo Tirone, Jeff Wadlow, Geoffrey Haley', 'Jeff Wadlow, Beau Bauman', 'Julian Morris, Sandra McCoy, Lindy Booth, Jon Bon Jovi, Jesse Janzen, Jared Padalecki, Kristy Wu, Paul James', 'PG-13', 'After a local woman is murdered, a group of teenage liars create a warning e-mail of a serial killer named “The Wolf”, coming on the next full moon. The teens describe each death method The Wolf uses, but when the described victims actually do start turning up dead, suddenly no one knows where the lies end and the truth begins.', 'After a local woman is murdered, a group of teenage liars create a warning e-mail of a serial killer named “The Wolf”, coming on the next full moon. The teens describe each death method The Wolf uses, but when the described victims actually do start turning up dead, suddenly no one knows where the lies end and the truth begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OQ2McKYgnyfIHHkm0jBxQnu7ou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10092'),
