  ('587632483796857979', 'Cry, Onion!', 1975, 'Western, Comedy', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Alejandro Ulloa, Luis Gómez Valdivieso', 'Luciano Vincenzoni, Sergio Donati', 'Franco Nero, Sterling Hayden, Martin Balsam, Leo Anchóriz, Romano Puppo, Nazzareno Zamperla, Helmut Brasch, Duilio Cruciani', 'PG', 'Onion Jack has bought a piece of land on which to settle, but the property is still in possession of the orphans of the original owner and is coveted by the local oil baron.', 'Onion Jack has bought a piece of land on which to settle, but the property is still in possession of the orphans of the original owner and is coveted by the local oil baron.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Atf4NQ1vxZv1r5PNiBeNC86ft3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93708'),
  ('1059803202824338205', 'Cry, the Beloved Country', 1951, 'Drama', 'Zoltan Korda, Robert Krasker', 'Alan Paton, John Howard Lawson', 'Canada Lee, Charles Carson, Sidney Poitier, Joyce Carey, Geoffrey Keen, Vivien Clinton, Michael Goodliffe, Albertina Temba', 'NR', 'In the back country of South Africa, black minister Stephen Kumalo journeys to the city to search for his missing son, only to find his people living in squalor and his son a criminal. Reverend Misimangu is a young South African clergyman who helps find his missing son-turned-thief and sister-turned-prostitute in the slums of Johannesburg.', 'In the back country of South Africa, black minister Stephen Kumalo journeys to the city to search for his missing son, only to find his people living in squalor and his son a criminal. Reverend Misimangu is a young South African clergyman who helps find his missing son-turned-thief and sister-turned-prostitute in the slums of Johannesburg.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8inNsImz4yRfjGUkBzO6urIBM5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173893'),
  ('1112509189219940514', 'Cry, the Beloved Country', 1995, 'Drama', 'Paul Gilpin, Darrell James Roodt', 'Ronald Harwood, Joshua Sinclair', 'Richard Harris, James Earl Jones, Charles S. Dutton, Vusi Kunene, Tsholofelo Wechoemang, Dolly Rathebe, Jack Robinson, Ramalao Makhene', 'PG-13', 'A South-African preacher goes to search for his wayward son who has committed a crime in the big city.', 'A South-African preacher goes to search for his wayward son who has committed a crime in the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96TZr6o4kuiIEryC5jkzaQoP6m5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34615'),
  ('317007428424732091', 'Crying Fist', 2005, 'Drama, Action', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Cho Yong-kyu, Lee Jung-hoon', 'Ryoo Seung-wan', 'Choi Min-sik, Ryoo Seung-bum, Im Won-hee, Cheon Ho-jin, Kim Su-hyun, Na Moon-hee, Ki Joo-bong, Byun Hee-bong', null, 'Jobless, besieged by creditors, and abandoned by his wife, the once silver medalist Tae-shik has sunk to street hustling, becoming a human punching bag. Meanwhile, young Sang-hwan''s delinquent ways land him behind bars. Both men look to boxing to turn around lives gone astray, aiming for the amateur title, ultimately pitting them against each other, but more importantly, against themselves.', 'Jobless, besieged by creditors, and abandoned by his wife, the once silver medalist Tae-shik has sunk to street hustling, becoming a human punching bag. Meanwhile, young Sang-hwan''s delinquent ways land him behind bars. Both men look to boxing to turn around lives gone astray, aiming for the amateur title, ultimately pitting them against each other, but more importantly, against themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h94psE0hXhSRUoysT8gQ0Uk1TCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40452'),
  ('262155552082470809', 'Crying Free Sex', 2018, 'Comedy, Action', 'Tomohiko Iwasaki, Akira Nobi', 'Tomohiko Iwasaki', 'Allen Ai, Michael Fanconi, Kôsuke Takaki, Yoshie Suzuki, Bueno, Keisaku Kimura', null, 'Cobra and Naomi are working under cover and infiltrating a secret organization. They get hyped up and have sex, and their genitals get stuck together. The two fight against enemies, remaining stuck together. Can they make it through?', 'Cobra and Naomi are working under cover and infiltrating a secret organization. They get hyped up and have sex, and their genitals get stuck together. The two fight against enemies, remaining stuck together. Can they make it through?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5B6wrcsDEomFJj9P0vR6tx4wfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532142'),
  ('146523598502004318', 'Crying Freeman', 1995, 'Action, Crime', 'Christophe Gans, Thomas Burstyn, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'Thierry Cazals, Christophe Gans, Roger Avary', 'Mark Dacascos, Julie Condra, Rae Dawn Chong, Byron Mann, Masaya Katō, Yoko Shimada, Mako, Tchéky Karyo', null, 'A lethal assassin for a secret Chinese organisation, who sheds tears of regret each time he kills, is seen swiftly and mercilessly executing three Yakuza gangsters by a beautiful artist. She is captivated by the grace of his kill and later falls in love with him. An intense power struggle for the leadership of the Yakuza Clans ensues as they seek vengeance for the death of their leader.', 'A lethal assassin for a secret Chinese organisation, who sheds tears of regret each time he kills, is seen swiftly and mercilessly executing three Yakuza gangsters by a beautiful artist. She is captivated by the grace of his kill and later falls in love with him. An intense power struggle for the leadership of the Yakuza Clans ensues as they seek vengeance for the death of their leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vkvIlExu2a8ZJRdbw5rywmeaQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9501'),
  ('512543614272952449', 'Crying Freeman 1: Portrait of a Killer', 1988, 'Animation', 'Daisuke Nishio, Hisao Shirai, Hideki Hamasu', 'Higashi Shimizu', 'Chiharu Kataishi, Toshio Furukawa, Kohei Miyauchi, Masako Katsuki, Nobuyo Tsuda, Ryusei Nakao, Takaya Hashi, Yusaku Yara', null, 'Emu Hino, a 29-year-old virgin, witnesses a mob hit and fears that the killer will now find her and kill her. Indeed, he sets out to do so; he''s Yo Hinomura, a talented potter and artist who''s been conscripted against his will to be the prime hitman for the 108 Dragons, a gang within the Chinese Mafia, who are determined to push aside Tokyo''s local crime lords. He breaks into her house, and she asks that he make love to her before he kills her; she connects to his inner self, and he becomes her protector. Now he must defend her against the local crime gang, who have connections with corrupt Tokyo police. Will Yo and Emu make it out alive, and will the 108 Dragons triumph?', 'Emu Hino, a 29-year-old virgin, witnesses a mob hit and fears that the killer will now find her and kill her. Indeed, he sets out to do so; he''s Yo Hinomura, a talented potter and artist who''s been conscripted against his will to be the prime hitman for the 108 Dragons, a gang within the Chinese Mafia, who are determined to push aside Tokyo''s local crime lords. He breaks into her house, and she asks that he make love to her before he kills her; she connects to his inner self, and he becomes her protector. Now he must defend her against the local crime gang, who have connections with corrupt Tokyo police. Will Yo and Emu make it out alive, and will the 108 Dragons triumph?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1WntiTPpZl0JjPTNCVfU7XPuM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197846'),
  ('435389560652245395', 'Crying Out Love in the Center of the World', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isao Yukisada, Noboru Shinoda', 'Yuji Sakamoto, Chihiro Ito, Isao Yukisada', 'Takao Osawa, Ko Shibasaki, Masami Nagasawa, Mirai Moriyama, Tsutomu Yamazaki, Kankuro Kudo, Kanji Tsuda, Issey Takahashi', null, 'While searching for his fiancee Ritsuko, Sakutarou rediscovers through flashbacks the void deep within him caused by the events from his high school days.', 'While searching for his fiancee Ritsuko, Sakutarou rediscovers through flashbacks the void deep within him caused by the events from his high school days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoQyo9jszUXm0r04zEsazfRSprh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36091'),
  ('220147758441100855', 'Crying... Silicon Tears', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Michalis Reppas, Thanasis Papathanasiou, Agnes Sklavos', 'Thanasis Papathanasiou, Michalis Reppas', 'Anna Panagiotopoulou, Mirka Papakonstantinou, Tasos Halkias, Maria Kavoyianni, Joyce Evidi, Trifon Karatzas, Anna Kyriakou, Mina Adamaki', null, 'This is the story of two Greek families, named Delafrangas and Bisbikides. The former family is very wealthy & lucky, the latter very poor and continually struck by fate. Poor but honest Martha is in love with Giakoumis, a young builder and bouzouki organist, but all her dreams fall apart when posh Tzela "steals" the love of her beloved one... A couple of flash backs, following their families roots back to WW2 and the Turkish domination, and a hidden secret will unfold the story''s ending..', 'This is the story of two Greek families, named Delafrangas and Bisbikides. The former family is very wealthy & lucky, the latter very poor and continually struck by fate. Poor but honest Martha is in love with Giakoumis, a young builder and bouzouki organist, but all her dreams fall apart when posh Tzela "steals" the love of her beloved one... A couple of flash backs, following their families roots back to WW2 and the Turkish domination, and a hidden secret will unfold the story''s ending..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8bi5paxTmFDPIomPsxpTcPMDfiE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47118'),
  ('154240407317412252', 'Cryo', 2022, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Barrett Burgin', 'Barrett Burgin, Mason D. Davis', 'Jyllian Petrie, Emily Marie Palmer, Mason D. Davis, Curt Doussett, Morgan Gunter, Michael Flynn', 'PG-13', 'Five scientists awake from a cryogenic sleep and find themselves trapped in an underground facility. With no memory of who they are or how long they''ve been asleep, they begin to realize they may have been part of a scientific experiment gone wrong. After a series of strange events, the scientists find themselves being hunted. They do not know who is hunting them or for what reason, but the scientists begin to suspect that one of them may be the killer.', 'Five scientists awake from a cryogenic sleep and find themselves trapped in an underground facility. With no memory of who they are or how long they''ve been asleep, they begin to realize they may have been part of a scientific experiment gone wrong. After a series of strange events, the scientists find themselves being hunted. They do not know who is hunting them or for what reason, but the scientists begin to suspect that one of them may be the killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5TV49AaIdZ1jiTCTYAF420mal8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:953542'),
  ('242424155701686877', 'Crypt of the Vampire', 1964, 'Horror', 'Camillo Mastrocinque, Tonino Valerii, Julio Ortas', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Tonino Valerii', 'Christopher Lee, Adriana Ambesi, Ursula Davis, José Campos, Véra Valmont, Carla Calò, José Villasante, John Karlsen', null, 'Count Karnstein sends for a doctor to help his sick daughter Laura. Her nurse believes she is possessed by the spirit of a dead ancestor, Carmilla. A young woman becomes intrigued by the mysterious deaths surrounding Laura after a carriage accident outside the castle forces her to stay. They become close friends until Laura becomes convinced the spirit of Carmilla is forcing her to kill.', 'Count Karnstein sends for a doctor to help his sick daughter Laura. Her nurse believes she is possessed by the spirit of a dead ancestor, Carmilla. A young woman becomes intrigued by the mysterious deaths surrounding Laura after a carriage accident outside the castle forces her to stay. They become close friends until Laura becomes convinced the spirit of Carmilla is forcing her to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wf5yZPhdl0PWU4184Ba1MWODncx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221767'),
  ('519858808094981230', 'Crypto', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Heidi K. Eklund, Ramona Adair, Terri Martin', 'David Frigerio, Carlyle Eubank', 'Beau Knapp, Alexis Bledel, Luke Hemsworth, Kurt Russell, Jeremie Harris, Jill Hennessy, Vincent Kartheiser, Malaya Rivera Drew', 'R', 'A young agent is tasked with investigating a tangled web of corruption and fraud in New York.', 'A young agent is tasked with investigating a tangled web of corruption and fraud in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzTvnA3buXsjdmjrYRDozKBFF78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567733'),
  ('756239974244414656', 'Crypto Boy', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shady El-Hamus, Daan Bukman', 'Jeroen Scholten van Aschat, Shady El-Hamus', 'Shahine El-Hamus, Sabri Saad El-Hamus, Minne Koole, Isabelle Kafando, Manoushka Zeegelaar-Breeveld, Raymond Thiry, Leny Breederveld, Loes Schnepper', null, 'Following a dispute with his father, a young man falls prey to cryptocurrency''s allure and an entrepreneur''s audacious promises of financial freedom.', 'Following a dispute with his father, a young man falls prey to cryptocurrency''s allure and an entrepreneur''s audacious promises of financial freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SVbLd0L1L611hWYGxSqyFyGu1f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1181538'),
  ('544172164554999483', 'Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains & the Future of the Internet', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Torsten Hoffmann, Michael Watchulonis', 'Torsten Hoffmann', 'Torsten Hoffmann, Roger Ver, Charlie Lee, Wences Casares, Andreas M. Antonopoulos, Craig S Wright', null, 'Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains and the Future of the Internet takes a deep dive into the crypto ecosystem and blockchain technology to discover the good, the bad and the ugly of this controversial industry, its major narratives, conflicts and the major players behind it. Can blockchain technology be used to create a new, fairer, decentralised and uncensored web3.0 where we can control our data and protect our online identities? Or will the potential be squandered as mega corporations once again compete for dominance in this new field. With his unrivalled and exclusive access, award-winning filmmaker Torsten Hoffman (Bitcoin: The End of Money as We Know It) takes us on a journey into the heart of this brave new world.', 'Cryptopia: Bitcoin, Blockchains and the Future of the Internet takes a deep dive into the crypto ecosystem and blockchain technology to discover the good, the bad and the ugly of this controversial industry, its major narratives, conflicts and the major players behind it. Can blockchain technology be used to create a new, fairer, decentralised and uncensored web3.0 where we can control our data and protect our online identities? Or will the potential be squandered as mega corporations once again compete for dominance in this new field. With his unrivalled and exclusive access, award-winning filmmaker Torsten Hoffman (Bitcoin: The End of Money as We Know It) takes us on a journey into the heart of this brave new world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3dGOQ5PsfKvtv9ew8Ee3S6A5JR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:702738'),
  ('1101789466800457188', 'Cryptozoo', 2021, 'Animation, Fantasy, Drama', 'Dash Shaw, Jane Samborski', 'Dash Shaw', 'Lake Bell, Michael Cera, Alex Karpovsky, Zoe Kazan, Louisa Krause, Angeliki Papoulia, Thomas Jay Ryan, Peter Stormare', null, 'Cryptozookeepers try to capture a Baku, a dream-eating hybrid creature of legend, and start wondering if they should display these beasts or keep them hidden and unknown.', 'Cryptozookeepers try to capture a Baku, a dream-eating hybrid creature of legend, and start wondering if they should display these beasts or keep them hidden and unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xABkUfBl7YG0Z2uIkYMMd5SjTum.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776660'),
  ('107648821988483351', 'Crystal Eyes', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ezequiel Endelman, Leandro Montejano', 'Ezequiel Endelman, Leandro Montejano', 'Silvia Montanari, Anahí Politi, Erika Boveri, Ernesto Claudio, Valeria Giorcelli, Camila Pizzo, Diego Benedetto, Agustina Del Rosal', null, 'Buenos Aires, 1985. It''s the first anniversary of the death of Alexis Carpenter, the unstable supermodel who died tragically when she was set on fire while closing a runaway show. Lucia L''uccello - Editor-in-Chief of the most important magazine in Buenos Aires - chooses supermodels Eva Lantier and Irene del Lago to honor Alexis on the cover of the anniversary issues dedicated to the famous model. The night before the photo shoot, Alexis''s original dresses that were going to be used by the models are stolen. From that moment, members of the important fashion magazine and the agency begin to disappear, one by one, at the hands of a stealthy, sinister female silhouette in a long black leather raincoat. Is someone seeking revenge? Or has Alexis returned from the grave?', 'Buenos Aires, 1985. It''s the first anniversary of the death of Alexis Carpenter, the unstable supermodel who died tragically when she was set on fire while closing a runaway show. Lucia L''uccello - Editor-in-Chief of the most important magazine in Buenos Aires - chooses supermodels Eva Lantier and Irene del Lago to honor Alexis on the cover of the anniversary issues dedicated to the famous model. The night before the photo shoot, Alexis''s original dresses that were going to be used by the models are stolen. From that moment, members of the important fashion magazine and the agency begin to disappear, one by one, at the hands of a stealthy, sinister female silhouette in a long black leather raincoat. Is someone seeking revenge? Or has Alexis returned from the grave?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvrD1fKqqOWraud0BOqmqZveebd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488604'),
  ('1032285248193700055', 'Crystal Fairy & the Magical Cactus', 2013, 'Comedy, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Cristián Petit-Laurent, Sebastián Silva, Karla Bravo', 'Sebastián Silva', 'Michael Cera, Gaby Hoffmann, Juan Andrés Silva, José Miguel Silva, Agustín Silva, Sebastián Silva, Manuela Baldovino, Gepe', 'NR', 'Jamie is a boorish, insensitive American twentysomething traveling in Chile, who somehow manages to create chaos at every turn. He and his friends are planning on taking a road trip north to experience a legendary shamanistic hallucinogen called the San Pedro cactus. In a fit of drunkenness at a wild party, Jamie invites an eccentric woman—a radical spirit named Crystal Fairy—to come along.', 'Jamie is a boorish, insensitive American twentysomething traveling in Chile, who somehow manages to create chaos at every turn. He and his friends are planning on taking a road trip north to experience a legendary shamanistic hallucinogen called the San Pedro cactus. In a fit of drunkenness at a wild party, Jamie invites an eccentric woman—a radical spirit named Crystal Fairy—to come along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jX34ccG13P66S4qVqLRRyR0hZLS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157409'),
  ('637686514929867799', 'Crystal Girl', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Domenico Croce, Cristiano Di Nicola, Daniela Baldasarre', 'Ciro Zecca, Luca Mastrogiovanni', 'Carolina Sala, Tommaso Ragno, Marouane Zotti, Giustiniano Alpi, Massimiliano Caprara, Marta Pilato, Leonardo Giuliani, Matteo Fofi', null, 'A seventeen-year-old girl hasn’t left her room in an indefinite amount of time. Those like her call them hikikomori, they are teenagers who decide to build themselves a little prison, leaving the outside world outside the door. Her routine is broken when, online, she meets Dev, a boy ten years older. The two fall in love immediately.For her it is the first love. In order to meet Dev, she must leave that cage. But there is someone willing to do anything to prevent her from getting out of there.', 'A seventeen-year-old girl hasn’t left her room in an indefinite amount of time. Those like her call them hikikomori, they are teenagers who decide to build themselves a little prison, leaving the outside world outside the door. Her routine is broken when, online, she meets Dev, a boy ten years older. The two fall in love immediately.For her it is the first love. In order to meet Dev, she must leave that cage. But there is someone willing to do anything to prevent her from getting out of there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gp86X0rBnPMoCNnsmru3IF1Gs7b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838879'),
  ('958040017386634151', 'Crystal Heart', 1986, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Gil Bettman, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Linda Shayne', 'Lee Curreri, Tawny Kitaen, Lloyd Bochner, May Heatherly, Simón Andreu, Marina Saura, LaGena Hart, Cal Gibson', 'R', 'A 22 year old man who has lived inside a crystal room because of a rare illness, meets an up and coming rock star, and the two fall in love.', 'A 22 year old man who has lived inside a crystal room because of a rare illness, meets an up and coming rock star, and the two fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZz58JwJu9ELqDkOP30fRDCSbuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83079'),
  ('390998346984011917', 'Crystal Inferno', 2017, 'Adventure, Action', 'Éric Summer, Martin Chichov', 'Regina Luvitt, Phillip J. Roth', 'Claire Forlani, Nigel Barber, Lorina Kamburova, Jamie Bamber, Atanas Srebrev, Riley Jackson, Isaac Rouse, Delly Allen', null, 'Disaster hits when two teenagers are caught in a fire on the 20th floor of a skyscraper. Their parents are on the 60th. Will they survive the flames?', 'Disaster hits when two teenagers are caught in a fire on the 20th floor of a skyscraper. Their parents are on the 60th. Will they survive the flames?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3laQfentQdbloFeGCPeCGZrzrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465545'),
  ('208158772071649066', 'Crystal Lake Memories: The Complete History of Friday the 13th', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Farrands, Buz Wallick', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Emma Jacobs, Peter M. Bracke, Jennifer Banko, Kristi Angus, Corey Feldman, Gabriel Bartalos, Samantha Delutri, Kimberly Higgins', 'NR', 'Taking inspiration from Peter M. Bracke''s definitive book of the same name, this seven-hour documentary dives into the making of all twelve Friday the 13th films, with all-new interviews from the cast and the crew.', 'Taking inspiration from Peter M. Bracke''s definitive book of the same name, this seven-hour documentary dives into the making of all twelve Friday the 13th films, with all-new interviews from the cast and the crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qp9aFykNAJ6qsCbyoGrCkjzkRDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222724'),
  ('500395192402912300', 'Crystal Moon', 1990, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Tizuka Yamasaki, Edgar Moura', 'Cacá Diniz, Yoya Wursch, Luís Carlos Góes', 'Xuxa Meneghel, Sérgio Mallandro, Marilu Bueno, Júlia Lemmertz, Avelar Love, Duda Little, Rubens Correia, Cláudio Mamberti', null, 'The fairy tale story of Maria da Graça, a small town girl with big time dreams of becoming a singer, who moves to Rio de Janeiro to pursue her ambitions.', 'The fairy tale story of Maria da Graça, a small town girl with big time dreams of becoming a singer, who moves to Rio de Janeiro to pursue her ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykEm0EvCtGI0727XK6xt7fCbUlQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45179'),
