  ('516654212177068647', 'CSI: Immortality', 2015, 'Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Cort Fey, Louis Shaw Milito', 'Anthony E. Zuiker', 'Ted Danson, Jorja Fox, Eric Szmanda, Robert David Hall, Wallace Langham, David Berman, Elisabeth Harnois, Jon Wellner', null, 'An explosion inside a casino brings Catherine Willows back to Las Vegas to investigate. And when the crime is tied to Lady Heather, Gil Grissom is brought back as well to aid the investigation. This is a 2 part TV Special. Series Finale', 'An explosion inside a casino brings Catherine Willows back to Las Vegas to investigate. And when the crime is tied to Lady Heather, Gil Grissom is brought back as well to aid the investigation. This is a 2 part TV Special. Series Finale', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HeYrGHsBNrgxYChaztHKrfzy03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369892'),
  ('18550089184173898', 'Cthulhu', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Gildark, Sean Kirby', 'Grant Cogswell', 'Jason Cottle, Casey Curran, Cara Buono, Hunter Stroud, Rob Hamm, Scott Patrick Green, Tori Spelling, Dennis Kleinsmith', 'R', 'A Seattle history professor, drawn back to his estranged family on the Oregon coast to execute his late mother''s estate, is reacquainted with his best friend from childhood, with whom he has a long-awaited tryst. Caught in an accelerating series of events, he discovers aspects of his father''s New Age cult which take on a dangerous and apocalyptic significance.', 'A Seattle history professor, drawn back to his estranged family on the Oregon coast to execute his late mother''s estate, is reacquainted with his best friend from childhood, with whom he has a long-awaited tryst. Caught in an accelerating series of events, he discovers aspects of his father''s New Age cult which take on a dangerous and apocalyptic significance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgf0vEc19nRmscRPu9y410GbhgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19205'),
