  ('552487709337217111', 'CTRL', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Vikramaditya Motwane, Pratik Shah, Anmol Ahuja', 'Avinash Sampath, Vikramaditya Motwane', 'Ananya Panday, Vihaan Samat, Aparshakti Khurana, Devika Vatsa, Kamakshi Bhat, Samit Gambhir, Ravish Desai, Suchita Trivedi', null, 'Nella and Joe are the perfect influencer couple. But when he cheats on her, she turns to an AI app to erase him from her life — until it takes control.', 'Nella and Joe are the perfect influencer couple. But when he cheats on her, she turns to an AI app to erase him from her life — until it takes control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCaaJkJqRA6unsVe5hvtgJq301H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1146577'),
