  ('123459091826450979', 'Cuánto me queda', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carolina Bassecourt', 'Marta Buchaca', 'Kira Miró, Salva Reina, Antonio Pagudo, Eva Ugarte', null, 'Two doctors, leading a stable life, are shocked to learn from new technology that one of them has less than a month to live. Seized by the urgency of their dwindling time together, they strive to savor every precious moment while fearlessly confronting their deepest desires and fears.', 'Two doctors, leading a stable life, are shocked to learn from new technology that one of them has less than a month to live. Seized by the urgency of their dwindling time together, they strive to savor every precious moment while fearlessly confronting their deepest desires and fears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6j5SqbOjN5287eToVgNWo0LEOiG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1205915'),
