  ('951767748181250548', 'Cucciolo', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Neri Parenti, Maria Pia Rocco, Lucy Amor', 'Neri Parenti, Enrico Vanzina', 'Massimo Boldi, Claudia Koll, Bruno Gambarotta, Gisella Sofio, Enzo Robutti, Mario Bianco, Lunetta Savino, Mirko Setaro', null, 'Massimo is forty-two years old, but has been attending eighth grade for thirty-two years, in short he is a teenager in all respects. In reality, Massimo has always refused, on an unconscious level, to grow up and become part of society. Amedeo and Lucia, Massimo''s eighty-year-old parents, obviously worried, go to a doctor who explains to them that their son suffers from Peter Pan Syndrome. Only a big shock can bring him back to normal.', 'Massimo is forty-two years old, but has been attending eighth grade for thirty-two years, in short he is a teenager in all respects. In reality, Massimo has always refused, on an unconscious level, to grow up and become part of society. Amedeo and Lucia, Massimo''s eighty-year-old parents, obviously worried, go to a doctor who explains to them that their son suffers from Peter Pan Syndrome. Only a big shock can bring him back to normal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9t8XZnbiLsL3Fsb3N4xRbxCG2K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59148'),
