  ('1148140438375792930', 'Cuidado con el amor', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama, Western', 'Miguel Zacarías, Raúl Martínez Solares', 'Miguel Zacarías', 'Pedro Infante, Elsa Aguirre, Fanny Schiller, Emma Roldán, Óscar Pulido, Eulalio González, Arturo Soto Rangel, Maruja Grifell', null, 'Salvador accompanied by two friends of his father whom he calls uncles, they arrive at a fair in the village, there he meets Ana. When he wins a bet he is paid with a mortgaged house, to his surprise upon entering the hom he realizes that Ana and her mother live in it, provoking a funny entanglement with an explosive final.', 'Salvador accompanied by two friends of his father whom he calls uncles, they arrive at a fair in the village, there he meets Ana. When he wins a bet he is paid with a mortgaged house, to his surprise upon entering the hom he realizes that Ana and her mother live in it, provoking a funny entanglement with an explosive final.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7QIEbYrAxGLhwmvbWHthANX5s0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71636'),
