  ('683337974400437658', 'Culo e camicia', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Giancarlo Ferrando, Giuseppe Ruzzolini', 'Ottavio Jemma, Renato Pozzetto', 'Enrico Montesano, Daniela Poggi, Gino Pernice, Gianni Agus, Umberto Zuanelli, Ennio Antonelli, Renato Pozzetto, Leopoldo Mastelloni', null, 'The movie is basically two unrelated comedic features: the first one features the travails of a man who stutters and tries to woo a woman he wants to date. The second features the wonderful Renato Pozetto as a gay man who lives with a partner, but finds himself falling for a woman, and not knowing how to tell his partner, who is prone to melodrama.', 'The movie is basically two unrelated comedic features: the first one features the travails of a man who stutters and tries to woo a woman he wants to date. The second features the wonderful Renato Pozetto as a gay man who lives with a partner, but finds himself falling for a woman, and not knowing how to tell his partner, who is prone to melodrama.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYt5Dp9eHWFUulldDKYqpAkrNKK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42540'),
  ('525918085989762205', 'Cult', 2013, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Koji Shiraishi, Toru Hirao', 'Koji Shiraishi', 'Yû Abiru, Mayuko Iwasa, Mari Iriki, Natsumi Okamoto, Mari Hayashida, Hajime Inoue, Shigehiro Yamaguchi, Sayuri Oyamada', null, 'Three female idols appear on a television show to investigate an exorcism. An exorcist with psychic powers named Unsui claims that the show’s subjects, the Kaneda family, are cursed by a demon that’s too powerful for him to banish on his own, so he calls in a fellow exorcist to help. Soon, a reckless ghost hunter enters the fray as the three idols witness a series of terrifying events.', 'Three female idols appear on a television show to investigate an exorcism. An exorcist with psychic powers named Unsui claims that the show’s subjects, the Kaneda family, are cursed by a demon that’s too powerful for him to banish on his own, so he calls in a fellow exorcist to help. Soon, a reckless ghost hunter enters the fray as the three idols witness a series of terrifying events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j2acim7xoRErW4WmzFihmKE0pn8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225666'),
  ('789854281654601919', 'Cult Killer', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Jon Keeyes, Austin Schmidt', 'Charles Burnley', 'Alice Eve, Antonio Banderas, Shelley Hennig, Olwen Fouéré, Kim DeLonghi, Paul Reid, Kwaku Fortune, Matthew Tompkins', 'R', 'A private investigator is forced into a dangerous alliance with a killer in order to uncover a quiet town’s grisly criminal underbelly and clear the name of her mentor, who is implicated in the crimes.', 'A private investigator is forced into a dangerous alliance with a killer in order to uncover a quiet town’s grisly criminal underbelly and clear the name of her mentor, who is implicated in the crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSR06FpV1H36OmW0jfEmvG73l2r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1059345'),
  ('304293390812185442', 'Cult of Chucky', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Douglas Mitchell, Reed Makayev, Cody McCullough', 'Don Mancini', 'Fiona Dourif, Brad Dourif, Alex Vincent, Jennifer Tilly, Michael Therriault, Adam Hurtig, Elisabeth Rosen, Zak Santiago', 'R', 'Confined to an asylum for the criminally insane for the past four years, Nica is wrongly convinced that she, not Chucky, murdered her entire family... until a string of grisly deaths occur after her psychiatrist introduces a new group therapy tool -- a "Good Guy" doll.', 'Confined to an asylum for the criminally insane for the past four years, Nica is wrongly convinced that she, not Chucky, murdered her entire family... until a string of grisly deaths occur after her psychiatrist introduces a new group therapy tool -- a "Good Guy" doll.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r5JUiMYfatwYeDkxkLWYUx5GIjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393345'),
  ('873441001599017883', 'Cult of the Cobra', 1955, 'Horror', 'Francis D. Lyon, Russell Metty, George Lollier', 'Cecil Maiden, Richard Collins, Jerry Davis', 'Faith Domergue, Richard Long, Marshall Thompson, Kathleen Hughes, William Reynolds, Jack Kelly, Myrna Hansen, David Janssen', null, 'While stationed in Asia, six American G.I.''s witness the secret ritual of Lamians (worshipers of women who can change into serpents). When discovered by the cult, the High Lamian Priest vows that "the Cobra Goddess will avenge herself". Once back in the United States, a mysterious woman enters into their lives and accidents begin to happen. The shadow of a cobra is seen just before each death.', 'While stationed in Asia, six American G.I.''s witness the secret ritual of Lamians (worshipers of women who can change into serpents). When discovered by the cult, the High Lamian Priest vows that "the Cobra Goddess will avenge herself". Once back in the United States, a mysterious woman enters into their lives and accidents begin to happen. The shadow of a cobra is seen just before each death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypQ7rC8lUgt9g7yAMmmfq5vx0Fo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35911'),
  ('1007715162020714584', 'Culture Shock', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gigi Saul Guerrero, Dave Halls', 'James Benson, Gigi Saul Guerrero, Efrén Hernández', 'Martha Higareda, Shawn Ashmore, Richard Cabral, Barbara Crampton, Chris Carlisle, Creed Bratton, Katie Wilson, Gigi Saul Guerrero', 'NR', 'A young Mexican woman crosses the border in search of the American dream, only to instead find her worst nightmare lying within.', 'A young Mexican woman crosses the border in search of the American dream, only to instead find her worst nightmare lying within.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g12GgEf9WXS8Ww0UbDpMH5NeVbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601083'),
  ('277473370307581249', 'Cumali Ceber 2', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Kamil Çetin', 'Görkem Çakın', 'Halil Söyletmez, Serkan Şengül, Doğa Konakoğlu, Emre Keskin, Esra İşgüzar, İsmail Düvenci, Köksal Engür, Muhammed Cangören', null, 'Cumali spends his time preparing to ask for a girl''s hand in marriage for his son Cevher. Just then, he receives some shocking news. The land where his grandfather''s retirement home stands has been sold, and a shopping mall will be built in its place. To convince his grandfather to change his mind, Cumali must first reconcile with him. Believing that giving his grandfather the family heirloom watch will lead to reconciliation, Cumali sets out to retrieve the watch from his brother-in-law Çetin. Along the way, Cumali finds himself caught up in an unexpected love story and adventure.', 'Cumali spends his time preparing to ask for a girl''s hand in marriage for his son Cevher. Just then, he receives some shocking news. The land where his grandfather''s retirement home stands has been sold, and a shopping mall will be built in its place. To convince his grandfather to change his mind, Cumali must first reconcile with him. Believing that giving his grandfather the family heirloom watch will lead to reconciliation, Cumali sets out to retrieve the watch from his brother-in-law Çetin. Along the way, Cumali finds himself caught up in an unexpected love story and adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdR5ya9nONK6K35ZuclK81GMeJN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587245'),
  ('85537081551060814', 'Cumali Ceber: Allah Seni Alsın', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Gökhan Gök', 'Cihan Berk Berkeban', 'Halil Söyletmez, Doğa Konakoğlu, Emre Keskin, Ece Seçkin, Ferhat Göçer, Gökhan Keser, Samsun Demir, Serkan Şengül', null, 'Funny character "Cumali Ceber" goes to a vacation with his unclever friends. The fun saga continues during the holiday.', 'Funny character "Cumali Ceber" goes to a vacation with his unclever friends. The fun saga continues during the holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW8BnBaaePoh3CaXrnPuzrsW88V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470121'),
  ('104806256734186894', 'Cumbia Callera', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'René Villarreal', 'Ana Rebuelta', 'Fernanda García Castañeda, Oliver Cantú Lozano, Andul Zambrano, Emma Mirthala Cantú, Rubén González Garza', null, 'Framed by the high mountain chains that surround the city of Monterrey (Mexico), three youngsters live passions and dilemmas, roaming between the steep slums and the luxury districts, crowned by the irresistible rhythm of the "colombia regiomontana".', 'Framed by the high mountain chains that surround the city of Monterrey (Mexico), three youngsters live passions and dilemmas, roaming between the steep slums and the luxury districts, crowned by the irresistible rhythm of the "colombia regiomontana".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssbn91zAiprmbnJG7SVDDJ0TNvf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71753'),
  ('880746704209951368', 'Cunk on Life', 2024, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Al Campbell, Sam Hardy', 'Charlie Brooker, Diane Morgan, Ben Caudell', 'Diane Morgan, Douglas Hedley, Rupert Sheldrake, Alison Wright, Celia Deane-Drummond, Paul Nurse, Jim Al-Khalili, Joyce Harper', 'R', 'Pioneering documentary maker Philomena Cunk returns with her most ambitious quest to date: venturing right up the universe and everything to examine life and existence in an attempt to find out the point of it all. Along the way, she interrogates experts on subjects from the big bang to biology and art to artificial intelligence. Really get to the nub of it.', 'Pioneering documentary maker Philomena Cunk returns with her most ambitious quest to date: venturing right up the universe and everything to examine life and existence in an attempt to find out the point of it all. Along the way, she interrogates experts on subjects from the big bang to biology and art to artificial intelligence. Really get to the nub of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZx5a595bYuNxd8TdoRflxATFML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1253971'),
  ('198750475371546319', 'Cuori nella tormenta', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Roberto Palmerini, Harry Alberto Monducci', 'Furio Scarpelli, Ettore Scola, Carlo Verdone', 'Carlo Verdone, Lello Arena, Marina Suma, Rossana Di Lorenzo, Nicola Natalia, Stefania Sinceri, Sandra Mantegna, Franca Fioravanti', null, 'Walter is a non-commissioned officer of the Navy, while Raf is a ship''s cook. They become great friends but unfortunately they fall in love, without knowing it, with the same girl Sonia.', 'Walter is a non-commissioned officer of the Navy, while Raf is a ship''s cook. They become great friends but unfortunately they fall in love, without knowing it, with the same girl Sonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/au3aAAeFnQa1IjCHyWWl5uhFmja.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61798'),
  ('947690522163791127', 'Cupid', 2020, 'Horror', 'Becca Hirani, Scott Chambers', 'Scott Chambers', 'Georgina Jane, Michael Owusu, Abi Casson Thompson, Ali Barouti, Bao Tieu, Sarah T. Cohen, Georgie Banks, Kelly Juvilee', 'NR', 'After being embarrassed by the mean girls at school, Faye, a practicing witch, summons the evil Cupid to take revenge on all those who wronged her. On Valentine’s Day, Cupid does in fact rise and will stop at nothing until the walls are covered in blood. The students must figure out a way to stop Cupid and undo the spell before their hearts get broken… literally.', 'After being embarrassed by the mean girls at school, Faye, a practicing witch, summons the evil Cupid to take revenge on all those who wronged her. On Valentine’s Day, Cupid does in fact rise and will stop at nothing until the walls are covered in blood. The students must figure out a way to stop Cupid and undo the spell before their hearts get broken… literally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b1QQPNKNSqhE45HxofvAmLgGLki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663706'),
  ('155169480284605653', 'Cupid & Cate', 2000, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Brent Shields', 'Ron Raley, Jennifer Miller', 'Mary-Louise Parker, Peter Gallagher, Bebe Neuwirth, Philip Bosco, Joanna Going, David Lansbury, Rebecca Luker, Brenda Fricker', 'NR', 'Cate has a small boutique where she sells vintage clothes. She is dating Phillip, a snob whose parents think that Cate isn''t good enough, so when she meets Harry and sparks fly, she starts to question her choices in life.', 'Cate has a small boutique where she sells vintage clothes. She is dating Phillip, a snob whose parents think that Cate isn''t good enough, so when she meets Harry and sparks fly, she starts to question her choices in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2bnsLm4lm1NxqWZjbFuVk9SGNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57686'),
  ('342483377882912768', 'Curdled', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Steven Bernstein, Reb Braddock', 'John Maass, Reb Braddock', 'William Baldwin, Angela Jones, Bruce Ramsay, Lois Chiles, Barry Corbin, Mel Gorham, Daisy Fuentes, Carmen López', 'R', 'A death-obsessed cleaning woman uncovers a clue identifying a Florida bartender for a series of socialite murders.', 'A death-obsessed cleaning woman uncovers a clue identifying a Florida bartender for a series of socialite murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/quXWXtOp6umg1qzPdWD6bB3x9EW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12241'),
  ('585399425766382241', 'Cure', 1997, 'Crime, Thriller, Horror, Mystery', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Tokushō Kikumura', 'Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Koji Yakusho, Masato Hagiwara, Tsuyoshi Ujiki, Anna Nakagawa, Yukijiro Hotaru, Yoriko Doguchi, Denden, Ren Osugi', 'NR', 'A wave of gruesome murders sweeps Tokyo, and the only link is a bloody X carved into the victims'' necks. In each case, the murderer is found nearby and recalls nothing of the crime. Detective Takabe and psychologist Sakuma are called in to figure out the connection, but their investigation goes nowhere. An odd young man, arrested near the latest murder, has a strange effect on everyone with whom he comes into contact. Takabe starts a series of interrogations to determine the man''s connection with the killings.', 'A wave of gruesome murders sweeps Tokyo, and the only link is a bloody X carved into the victims'' necks. In each case, the murderer is found nearby and recalls nothing of the crime. Detective Takabe and psychologist Sakuma are called in to figure out the connection, but their investigation goes nowhere. An odd young man, arrested near the latest murder, has a strange effect on everyone with whom he comes into contact. Takabe starts a series of interrogations to determine the man''s connection with the killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTRrqIGusJuzG5Pe3iFQTnHg1Ps.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36095'),
  ('762712455307704877', 'Cured Duck', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash, Gloria Blondell', 'NR', 'Donald visits Daisy. When he can''t open a window, he flies into a rage and practically destroys her house. She won''t see him again until he takes care of that temper. He orders a mail-order insult machine, which promises that if Donald can endure 10 minutes of abuse without losing his temper, he''ll be cured. It proceeds to deliver physical and verbal abuse, and Donald is cured. He goes back and Daisy tests him on the balky window.', 'Donald visits Daisy. When he can''t open a window, he flies into a rage and practically destroys her house. She won''t see him again until he takes care of that temper. He orders a mail-order insult machine, which promises that if Donald can endure 10 minutes of abuse without losing his temper, he''ll be cured. It proceeds to deliver physical and verbal abuse, and Donald is cured. He goes back and Daisy tests him on the balky window.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWMUOSf6p8GdEzHaHK9G4oe63nj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53916'),
  ('113438935165869918', 'Cured of Fears', 1992, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Adolfo Martínez Solares, Armando Castillón', 'Juan Manuel Soler, Daniel M. Peterson, Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Alfonso Zayas, Lina Santos, Roberto ''El Flaco'' Guzmán, César Bono, Michelle Mayer, José René Ruiz, Yirah Aparicio, Claudio Báez', null, 'During an excavation, archaeologist Magdalena accidentally resurrects a centuries-old vampire named Vladimir, who promptly disappears. When she attempts to warn authorities, she''s institutionalized. Upon release, she sets out to stop Vladimir, who''s now taken over a nightclub.', 'During an excavation, archaeologist Magdalena accidentally resurrects a centuries-old vampire named Vladimir, who promptly disappears. When she attempts to warn authorities, she''s institutionalized. Upon release, she sets out to stop Vladimir, who''s now taken over a nightclub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95x5Idua3oy1jSzaPXgBxlyhLjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422325'),
  ('1014042479105004092', 'Curfew', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Gary Winick, Makoto Watanabe', 'Kevin Kennedy', 'Kyle Richards, Wendell Wellman, John Putch, Frank Miller, Jean Brooks, Peter Nelson, Niels Mueller, Nori Morgan', 'R', 'Two brothers whose grisly killing spree has landed them on death row plot a daring escape, breaking free from prison with vengeance in mind, and setting targets in the form of the key witnesses against them.', 'Two brothers whose grisly killing spree has landed them on death row plot a daring escape, breaking free from prison with vengeance in mind, and setting targets in the form of the key witnesses against them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mjcjk2UlX0jfMWICHfaL0SMd5xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40088'),
  ('621255085878932277', 'Curfew', 2012, 'Drama', 'Shawn Christensen, Andrew Napier, Daniel Katz', 'Shawn Christensen', 'Fatima Ptacek, Shawn Christensen, Dana Segal, Kirsten Holly Smith, Kim Allen, Helga Athineos, gino patti', 'PG', 'At the lowest point of his life, Richie gets a call from his estranged sister asking him to look after his nine-year old niece, Sophia, for a few hours.', 'At the lowest point of his life, Richie gets a call from his estranged sister asking him to look after his nine-year old niece, Sophia, for a few hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1VvfX68rqTAMuKbWugWADBDO4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157289'),
  ('614199782338459745', 'Curiosa', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Lou Jeunet, Simon Roca', 'Lou Jeunet, Raphaëlle Desplechin', 'Noémie Merlant, Niels Schneider, Benjamin Lavernhe, Camélia Jordana, Amira Casar, Scali Delpeyrat, Mathilde Warnier, Mélodie Richard', null, 'A passionate love story set against a backdrop of sexual freedom, loosely based on the relationship between 19th century authors Pierre Louÿs and Marie de Régnier.', 'A passionate love story set against a backdrop of sexual freedom, loosely based on the relationship between 19th century authors Pierre Louÿs and Marie de Régnier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxHchovLxOnH65Eel3fAHr9i4Qi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487616'),
  ('122460479904559044', 'Curious Caterer: Dying for Chocolate', 2022, 'TV Movie, Mystery, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Sean Cox, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Erinne Dobson, John Christian Plummer', 'Nikki DeLoach, Andrew W. Walker, Jaycie Dotin, Jason Schombing, Lochlyn Munro, Riley Davis, Kendall Cross, Jason Tremblay', 'PG', 'Goldy is a spirited single mom who’s thrust into the role of town sleuth to help solve a friend’s mysterious death. With the clock ticking to find the culprit, Goldy strikes up an unlikely partnership with Detective Tom Schultz, who leans into Goldy’s local knowledge. As their relationship shows signs of becoming something more, the suspect list rises. Will Goldy narrow in on the killer before the killer narrows in on her?', 'Goldy is a spirited single mom who’s thrust into the role of town sleuth to help solve a friend’s mysterious death. With the clock ticking to find the culprit, Goldy strikes up an unlikely partnership with Detective Tom Schultz, who leans into Goldy’s local knowledge. As their relationship shows signs of becoming something more, the suspect list rises. Will Goldy narrow in on the killer before the killer narrows in on her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7quPRcCVUmMBxKO58QwPuIADtYG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936897'),
  ('308174368358334930', 'Curious Caterer: Fatal Vows', 2023, 'TV Movie, Drama, Mystery', 'Paul Ziller, Dan Dumouchel, Robert Gardiner', 'Kariné Marwood, Julie Kim', 'Nikki DeLoach, Andrew W. Walker, Kareem Malcolm, Amanda Khan, Jaycie Dotin, Neil Webb, Riley Davis, Zebastin Borjeau', null, 'Professional caterer and amateur detective Goldy Berry is hired to cater for a big wedding. The bride, Jessamyn Cole is the ex-wife of Goldy''s current romantic interest, detective Tom Schultz. The town is shocked when they find the groom, Sterling Clearwater dead and Jessamyn missing. To complicate matters, a new detective with a vendetta against Tom is hired to oversee the case. Forced to take matters into their own hands, Goldy and Tom must find Jessamyn before she meets Sterling''s fate.', 'Professional caterer and amateur detective Goldy Berry is hired to cater for a big wedding. The bride, Jessamyn Cole is the ex-wife of Goldy''s current romantic interest, detective Tom Schultz. The town is shocked when they find the groom, Sterling Clearwater dead and Jessamyn missing. To complicate matters, a new detective with a vendetta against Tom is hired to oversee the case. Forced to take matters into their own hands, Goldy and Tom must find Jessamyn before she meets Sterling''s fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9diQ2QpAwO9lJDtoL6UkOk2sdEZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1132282'),
  ('83543515752736679', 'Curious George', 2006, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Matthew O''Callaghan', 'Ken Kaufman', 'Will Ferrell, Drew Barrymore, David Cross, Eugene Levy, Joan Plowright, Dick Van Dyke, Frank Welker, Ed O''Ross', 'G', 'When The Man in the Yellow Hat befriends Curious George in the jungle, they set off on a non-stop, fun-filled journey through the wonders of the big city toward the warmth of true friendship.', 'When The Man in the Yellow Hat befriends Curious George in the jungle, they set off on a non-stop, fun-filled journey through the wonders of the big city toward the warmth of true friendship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SpokDLiRHON9H36GdlF7vWKOm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9975'),
  ('1053761745981162601', 'Curious George 2: Follow That Monkey!', 2009, 'Animation, Family', 'Norton Virgien', 'Chuck Tately', 'Frank Welker, Amy Hill, Ed O''Ross, Carlos Alazraqui, Jeff Bennett, Fred Tatasciore, Nickie Bryar, Jamie Kennedy', 'G', 'The film chronicles George''s adventures as he befriends Kayla, a baby elephant, at a magic circus show and helps her travel across the country to be reunited with her family.Accompanied by his friend, the Man with the Yellow Hat, George travels by foot, train, and truck to reach Kayla''s brother and sister in California, only to be accused of elephant-napping and brought all the way back to New York.', 'The film chronicles George''s adventures as he befriends Kayla, a baby elephant, at a magic circus show and helps her travel across the country to be reunited with her family.Accompanied by his friend, the Man with the Yellow Hat, George travels by foot, train, and truck to reach Kayla''s brother and sister in California, only to be accused of elephant-napping and brought all the way back to New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jkSEqOvp3CnA3UzWrT56cu7yLR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23903'),
  ('727961271137649341', 'Curious George: A Halloween Boo Fest', 2013, 'Family, Animation', 'Scott Heming, Andrei Svislotski, Jeff McGrath', 'Joe Fallon', 'Frank Welker, Jeff Bennett, Rino Romano, Carlos Alazraqui, Jim Cummings, Lara Jill Miller, Annie Mumolo, Cree Summer', 'G', 'Halloween is almost here and George can''t wait for the festivities to begin: carving pumpkins, costume contests, and especially the Annual Boo Festival. Eager to get the festivities started, George and Allie visit Renkins'' Farm to pick out the perfect pumpkin. There, they are told the spooky tale of the Legend of No Noggin. As the story goes, No Noggin is a hat-kicking scarecrow who appears on Halloween to kick people''s hats off. On Halloween night, George and Allie are determined to get a picture of No Noggin and prove he''s real once and for all. Will they be able to get the proof? Only the curious will find out!', 'Halloween is almost here and George can''t wait for the festivities to begin: carving pumpkins, costume contests, and especially the Annual Boo Festival. Eager to get the festivities started, George and Allie visit Renkins'' Farm to pick out the perfect pumpkin. There, they are told the spooky tale of the Legend of No Noggin. As the story goes, No Noggin is a hat-kicking scarecrow who appears on Halloween to kick people''s hats off. On Halloween night, George and Allie are determined to get a picture of No Noggin and prove he''s real once and for all. Will they be able to get the proof? Only the curious will find out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUXJXP4ASZLU47L4BfMiTeaDSgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256051'),
  ('392985845351863987', 'Curious George: A Very Monkey Christmas', 2009, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Scott Heming, Cathy Malkasian, Jeff McGrath', 'Joe Fallon', 'Grey DeLisle, Frank Welker, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, E. G. Daily, Debi Derryberry, Rob Paulsen, B.J. Ward', null, 'George and The Man In The Yellow Hat are having a merry time counting down to Christmas. But neither can decide what to give each other. Will they find the answers before Christmas morning?', 'George and The Man In The Yellow Hat are having a merry time counting down to Christmas. But neither can decide what to give each other. Will they find the answers before Christmas morning?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1XR8pCHbUoxqr2Age456fGqrRm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263945'),
  ('1020956442417504073', 'Curious George: Go West, Go Wild', 2020, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Michael LaBash', 'Jana Howington, Sherri Stoner', 'Frank Welker, Jeff Bennett, Max Mittelman, April Stewart, Phil Morris, Adrienne Barbeau, Dee Bradley Baker, Dee Bradley Baker', 'G', 'While farm-sitting, George accidentally lets the farm animals escape. Ted, George and wannabe cowboy Emmett must round ''em up, accounting for every animal -- and emerging with some new skills, to boot.', 'While farm-sitting, George accidentally lets the farm animals escape. Ted, George and wannabe cowboy Emmett must round ''em up, accounting for every animal -- and emerging with some new skills, to boot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azDVclNJPVWJamcffDFkZp0alY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:743904'),
  ('529359068447252666', 'Curious George: Royal Monkey', 2019, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Doug Murphy', 'Joe Stillman, Elana Lesser, Dan Wicksman', 'Frank Welker, Jeff Bennett, Daniela Bobadilla, Philip Anthony-Rodriguez, Eliza Schneider, Ed O''Ross, Adrienne C. Moore, Mick Wingert', 'G', 'Join your favorite monkey as he takes on his most regal role yet in the all-new movie, Curious George: Royal Monkey. After disrupting a meeting with a stuffy royal family, George accidentally trades places with the king''s snooty monkey, Philippe. While Philippe puzzles Ted with his flawless manners, George travels to the castle where his fun-loving antics raise eyebrows and bring shy Princess Isabel out of her shell. Featuring all-new music from Andy Grammer, this king-sized adventure reminds us all that doing what you love is the key to happiness.', 'Join your favorite monkey as he takes on his most regal role yet in the all-new movie, Curious George: Royal Monkey. After disrupting a meeting with a stuffy royal family, George accidentally trades places with the king''s snooty monkey, Philippe. While Philippe puzzles Ted with his flawless manners, George travels to the castle where his fun-loving antics raise eyebrows and bring shy Princess Isabel out of her shell. Featuring all-new music from Andy Grammer, this king-sized adventure reminds us all that doing what you love is the key to happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8FIw6AoEToSL4lXNWAuHIcy1Cyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:627093'),
  ('974876231188698475', 'Curious Tales of a Temple', 2025, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy, Animation', 'Xie Junwei, Zou Jing, Cui Yuemei', 'Shen Junle, Zhang Xuejie', 'Lu Lifeng, Lin Qiang, Zhang He, Chen Ziping, Fu Bohan, Chen Linling, Liu Xiaoyu, Gu Jiangshan', null, 'An epic animated fantasy anthology film intertwining six storylines from China''s classic supernatural story collection "Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio" by Pu Songling. The six stories center on Lanruo Temple, an ancient ruin haunted by spirits. Weaving in classic tales like "Taoist from Laoshan Mountain," "Princess Lotus," "Nie Xiaoqian," "The Painted Skin" and "The Daughter of Magistrate Lu." These stories — spanning humans, ghosts and demons — explore love, death and morality against shifting time. The film merges six distinct styles into one anthology. For example, "Taoist from Laoshan Mountain" uses felt-textured animation, while "The Painted Skin" mirrors Song dynasty painting aesthetics.', 'An epic animated fantasy anthology film intertwining six storylines from China''s classic supernatural story collection "Strange Tales from a Chinese Studio" by Pu Songling. The six stories center on Lanruo Temple, an ancient ruin haunted by spirits. Weaving in classic tales like "Taoist from Laoshan Mountain," "Princess Lotus," "Nie Xiaoqian," "The Painted Skin" and "The Daughter of Magistrate Lu." These stories — spanning humans, ghosts and demons — explore love, death and morality against shifting time. The film merges six distinct styles into one anthology. For example, "Taoist from Laoshan Mountain" uses felt-textured animation, while "The Painted Skin" mirrors Song dynasty painting aesthetics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z1CNbHQe9LBIo8LfaLxLhhZ13ry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1481390'),
  ('242857941807608592', 'Curious Tobi and the Treasure Hunt to the Flying Rivers', 2023, 'Family, Adventure', 'Carolin Flammang, Robert Mayer, Johannes Honsell', 'Johannes Honsell', 'Marina Blanke, Tobi Krell, Klaas Heufer-Umlauf', null, 'In Curious Tobi and the Treasure Hunt to the Flying Rivers, adventurer Tobi needs to find his best friend from childhood Marina, the only person who can help him unlock a mysterious treasure chest. Tobi’s search for Marina kickstarts an adventure that takes him to the greatest and most stunning places in the world. Always with one goal in mind: solving the riddle of the treasure chest and finding the mysterious flying rivers.', 'In Curious Tobi and the Treasure Hunt to the Flying Rivers, adventurer Tobi needs to find his best friend from childhood Marina, the only person who can help him unlock a mysterious treasure chest. Tobi’s search for Marina kickstarts an adventure that takes him to the greatest and most stunning places in the world. Always with one goal in mind: solving the riddle of the treasure chest and finding the mysterious flying rivers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhotTqmEBGZBbGtByD9V6hvnYXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1069293'),
  ('651680445447467536', 'Curling', 2010, 'Drama', 'Denis Côté, Josée Deshaies', 'Denis Côté', 'Emmanuel Bilodeau, Philomène Bilodeau, Roc LaFortune, Sophie Desmarais, Muriel Dutil, Yves Trudel, Johanne Haberlin, Anie Pascale', null, 'Set in a rural Québec village in the dead of winter, Jean-François, a single father, works at a deserted bowling alley at night and in a rundown motel during the day. His daughter, Julyvonne, never leaves their home. Jean-François isolates her in fear that contact with the outside world will scar her the way it has him.', 'Set in a rural Québec village in the dead of winter, Jean-François, a single father, works at a deserted bowling alley at night and in a rundown motel during the day. His daughter, Julyvonne, never leaves their home. Jean-François isolates her in fear that contact with the outside world will scar her the way it has him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gacRv2RRysKEKvDCsbGa94pm5UT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63049'),
  ('487963492928211665', 'Curly Sue', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Jeffrey L. Kimball, John Hughes', 'John Hughes', 'Jim Belushi, Alisan Porter, Kelly Lynch, John Getz, Steve Carell, Fred Thompson, Edie McClurg, Viveka Davis', 'PG', 'Bill is a penniless drifter who scams strangers out of just enough money to feed himself and his partner in crime, an orphan girl known as Curly Sue. Bill and Curly Sue target Grey, a yuppie lawyer, but their con takes an unexpected turn when the successful woman begins to like the ramshackle duo. But there''s one problem—Grey''s jealous, conniving boyfriend, Walker.', 'Bill is a penniless drifter who scams strangers out of just enough money to feed himself and his partner in crime, an orphan girl known as Curly Sue. Bill and Curly Sue target Grey, a yuppie lawyer, but their con takes an unexpected turn when the successful woman begins to like the ramshackle duo. But there''s one problem—Grey''s jealous, conniving boyfriend, Walker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11894'),
  ('141248182995549067', 'Curly Top', 1935, 'Family, Music, Comedy', 'Irving Cummings, John F. Seitz', 'Patterson McNutt, Arthur J. Beckhard', 'Shirley Temple, John Boles, Rochelle Hudson, Jane Darwell, Rafaela Ottiano, Esther Dale, Etienne Girardot, Arthur Treacher', null, 'Wealthy Edward Morgan becomes charmed with a curly-haired orphan and her pretty older sister Mary and arranges to adopt both under the alias of "Mr. Jones". As he spends more time with them, he soon finds himself falling in love with Mary.', 'Wealthy Edward Morgan becomes charmed with a curly-haired orphan and her pretty older sister Mary and arranges to adopt both under the alias of "Mr. Jones". As he spends more time with them, he soon finds himself falling in love with Mary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86I2edVODRBQaUw2rZM2M9wvKuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29877'),
  ('229432025206494782', 'Curral', 2021, 'Drama', 'Beto Martins, Marcelo Brennand', 'Marcelo Brennand, Marcelo Müller, Fernando Honesko', 'Thomás Aquino, Rodrigo Garcia, Carla Salle, José Dumont, Ane Oliva, Fernando Teixeira, Clébia Sousa, Marvin Mendes', null, 'Curral is a political drama set in the rural Brazilian city of Gravatá. During the mayoral elections, the population is divided between the Blue and Red parties, two political oligarchies fighting each other for power. A recent severe drought means water is the main bargaining chip when it comes to securing a majority of people''s votes. Chico Caixa is a former city employee. He lost his job trying to take water supplies to a poor neighborhood which had been abandoned for political reasons. Caixa is invited by a childhood partner, Joel, to work on his councilor campaign. Joel presents himself as a new alternative to the older candidates, who have been in power for decades. But as the campaign progresses, Chico Caixa soon realizes that breaking apart from the established political game is not always as easy as it may seem', 'Curral is a political drama set in the rural Brazilian city of Gravatá. During the mayoral elections, the population is divided between the Blue and Red parties, two political oligarchies fighting each other for power. A recent severe drought means water is the main bargaining chip when it comes to securing a majority of people''s votes. Chico Caixa is a former city employee. He lost his job trying to take water supplies to a poor neighborhood which had been abandoned for political reasons. Caixa is invited by a childhood partner, Joel, to work on his councilor campaign. Joel presents himself as a new alternative to the older candidates, who have been in power for decades. But as the campaign progresses, Chico Caixa soon realizes that breaking apart from the established political game is not always as easy as it may seem', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbSOhSteIIJuJE4ApNgM2fcQUP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752622'),
  ('304784254096275312', 'Currency and Peace', 1988, 'Drama, Crime', 'Vít Olmer, Ota Kopřiva, Jan Malíř', 'Radek John, Vít Olmer', 'Jan Potměšil, Veronika Jeníková, Josef Nedorost, Tomáš Hanák, Roman Skamene, Miloslav Kopečný, Vítězslav Jirsák, Miloš Čálek', null, 'Martin is an innocent lad from small-town Mlada Boleslav who comes to big-city Prague, hoping to exchange his krona for deutschemarks so that he can visit Germany. A local spiv named Robert obliges Martin, but at an unfair exchange rate. When Martin finds out he was rooked, he plans revenge on Robert ... but then decides to join Robert''s gang instead.', 'Martin is an innocent lad from small-town Mlada Boleslav who comes to big-city Prague, hoping to exchange his krona for deutschemarks so that he can visit Germany. A local spiv named Robert obliges Martin, but at an unfair exchange rate. When Martin finds out he was rooked, he plans revenge on Robert ... but then decides to join Robert''s gang instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1Oa3lZMlhTi9lKB6no1eGMTJpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15386'),
  ('555535070337369009', 'Current', 1964, 'Drama', 'Sára Sándor, István Gaál, Zoltán Huszárik', 'István Gaál', 'Andrea Drahota, Marianna Moór, Sándor Csikós, András Kozák, János Harkányi, Tibor Orbán, Istvánné Zsipi, Gyula Szersén', null, 'A group of students cope with the disappearance of their friend.', 'A group of students cope with the disappearance of their friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMPJiyRpJ7LfbN8zdGQIxLIArXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263112'),
  ('77916778204410190', 'Curriculum Vitae', 1975, 'Drama', 'Krzysztof Kieślowski, Jacek Petrycki, Tadeusz Rusinek', 'Janusz Fastyn, Krzysztof Kieślowski', null, null, 'A communist party control committee interrogates a worker and party activist who is to be excluded from the party.', 'A communist party control committee interrogates a worker and party activist who is to be excluded from the party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3XeH1lQAukOizlOAbM3qPDa0b4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49102'),
  ('688947346221998237', 'Curry & Cyanide: The Jolly Joseph Case', 2023, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Christo Tomy, Fazly Kabir, Upasana Nattoji Roy', 'Shalini Usha Devi', 'Jolly Joseph, Renji Wilson, Remo Roy, Rojo Thomas, M. S. Mathew, K. G. Simon, Aloor, Nikhila Henry', null, 'This true-crime documentary investigates six shocking deaths in the same family and the woman at the center of the unbelievable case: Jolly Joseph.', 'This true-crime documentary investigates six shocking deaths in the same family and the woman at the center of the unbelievable case: Jolly Joseph.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdXu8YeDqg1qxEP9LJuTIFBtR5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217392'),
  ('204931107005236805', 'Curry & Pepper', 1990, 'Comedy, Action, Crime', 'Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'James Yuen Sai-Sang', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Stephen Chow, Ann Bridgewater, Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Barry Wong Ping-Yiu, Michael Dinga, John Shum Kin-Fun', null, 'Two best friends and cop partners become the subject of a beautiful news reporter''s documentary. The two soon find themselves competing for screen time as well as the love of the reporter while after a murderous arms dealer.', 'Two best friends and cop partners become the subject of a beautiful news reporter''s documentary. The two soon find themselves competing for screen time as well as the love of the reporter while after a murderous arms dealer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmNu9zI4Aq4v1jkpvcA4ZVpHs6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148380'),
  ('505830134578790735', 'Curse II: The Bite', 1989, 'Horror', 'Frederico Prosperi, Roberto D''Ettorre Piazzoli', 'Frederico Prosperi', 'Jill Schoelen, J. Eddie Peck, Jamie Farr, Savina Geršak, Marianne Muellerleile, Al Fann, Sydney Lassick, Terrence Evans', 'R', 'After a young man is bitten on the hand by a radioactive snake, his hand changes into a lethal snake head, which attacks everyone he comes into contact with. Also, his body becomes filled with snakes. Now, he must prevent himself from hurting others.', 'After a young man is bitten on the hand by a radioactive snake, his hand changes into a lethal snake head, which attacks everyone he comes into contact with. Also, his body becomes filled with snakes. Now, he must prevent himself from hurting others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lLLeb7vySU4f17ATJlMfYk6LYCd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87704'),
  ('646741914464325983', 'Curse III: Blood Sacrifice', 1991, 'Horror', 'Sean Barton, Philip Grosvenor', 'John Hunt, Sean Barton', 'Christopher Lee, Jenilee Harrison, Henry Cele, André Jacobs, Zoe Randall, Olivia Dyer, Jennifer Steyn, Gavin Hood', null, 'When an American plantation owner''s wife and her sister interrupt an African death ritual to save the sacrificial goat, the witch doctor places a curse on them, summoning a god from the sea to slaughter them and anyone in its way with a panga, a curved, African machete.', 'When an American plantation owner''s wife and her sister interrupt an African death ritual to save the sacrificial goat, the witch doctor places a curse on them, summoning a god from the sea to slaughter them and anyone in its way with a panga, a curved, African machete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64fOfmLPX3ZUl8tQp5LugzUHMTV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94436'),
  ('1057402941345533032', 'Curse of Bigfoot', 1975, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Dave Flocker', 'James T. Flocker', 'Bob Clymire, Jan Swihart, Bill Simonsen, Dennis Kottmeier, Ruth Ann Mannella, Ken Kloepfer, Mary Brownless, Dave Flocker', null, 'A group of high school students on an archaeological dig discover a centuries old mummified body in a sealed cave. Removing the mummy, it soon comes back to life, revealing itself to be an inhuman beast that terrorizes a small California town.', 'A group of high school students on an archaeological dig discover a centuries old mummified body in a sealed cave. Removing the mummy, it soon comes back to life, revealing itself to be an inhuman beast that terrorizes a small California town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZxyiTkUrpWuI6j1Urwnb2FBW1r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86571'),
  ('873542814043155874', 'Curse of Chucky', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Douglas Mitchell, Joel Jeffrey Nishimine, Martin Ellis', 'Don Mancini', 'Fiona Dourif, Brad Dourif, Danielle Bisutti, Summer H. Howell, Brennan Elliott, Maitland McConnell, A Martinez, Chantal Quesnel', 'R', 'After her mother''s mysterious death, Nica begins to suspect that the talking, red-haired doll her visiting niece has been playing with may be the key to the mounting bloodshed and chaos.', 'After her mother''s mysterious death, Nica begins to suspect that the talking, red-haired doll her visiting niece has been playing with may be the key to the mounting bloodshed and chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9DzkDWp8O82Wzxk6otuD9bce9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167032'),
