  ('1077911948996758083', 'Curse of the Blue Lights', 1988, 'Horror', 'John Henry Johnson', 'John Henry Johnson', 'Brent Ritter, Bettina Julius, Clayton A. McCaw, Patrick Keller, Deborah McVencenty, Becky Golladay, Kent E. Fritzell, James Asbury', 'R', 'A group of teenagers battle a horde of zombies and evil creatures that live underneath a graveyard.', 'A group of teenagers battle a horde of zombies and evil creatures that live underneath a graveyard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/viKVTov33TtO2BOSSN9nkAQJlJR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44097'),
  ('213610360721777433', 'Curse of the Crimson Altar', 1968, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Vernon Sewell, John Coquillon', 'Henry Lincoln, Mervyn Haisman', 'Christopher Lee, Boris Karloff, Mark Eden, Virginia Wetherell, Barbara Steele, Michael Gough, Roger Avon, Michael Warren', 'R', 'When his brother disappears, a man visits the remote country house where he was last seen. While the host seems outwardly friendly and his niece more demonstrably so, there''s a feeling of menace in the air with the overhanging legend of Lavinia Morley, the Black Witch of Greymarsh.', 'When his brother disappears, a man visits the remote country house where he was last seen. While the host seems outwardly friendly and his niece more demonstrably so, there''s a feeling of menace in the air with the overhanging legend of Lavinia Morley, the Black Witch of Greymarsh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y45LdkyTdZvihACTjNNeUZZbbHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28073'),
