  ('259203670768094758', 'Curse of the Golden Flower', 2006, 'Action, Drama, Fantasy', 'Zhang Yimou, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Wu Nan', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Gong Li, Jay Chou, Liu Ye, Qin Junjie, Li Man, Ni Dahong, Chen Jin', 'R', 'During China''s Tang dynasty the emperor has taken the princess of a neighboring province as his wife. She has borne him two sons and raised his eldest. Now his control over his dominion is complete, including the royal family itself.', 'During China''s Tang dynasty the emperor has taken the princess of a neighboring province as his wife. She has borne him two sons and raised his eldest. Now his control over his dominion is complete, including the royal family itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHkkDpfo5YnOrbVfwtDHi91BkrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1494'),
  ('867060152727209725', 'Curse of the Mayans', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joaquin Rodriguez', 'Joaquin Rodriguez', 'Carla Ortiz, Steve Wilcox, Mark Tacher, Luis Felipe Tovar, Olga Fonda, Luis Salinas, Alberto Haggar, Emilio Koh Albornoz', null, 'Danielle Noble (played by Carla Ortiz) and her team of expert cave divers led by an ambitious american archaeologist (Steve Wilcox), undertake an expedition in search of the lost Mayan Library, without imagining they will instead find the hidden gates of hell known as Xib''alb''a.', 'Danielle Noble (played by Carla Ortiz) and her team of expert cave divers led by an ambitious american archaeologist (Steve Wilcox), undertake an expedition in search of the lost Mayan Library, without imagining they will instead find the hidden gates of hell known as Xib''alb''a.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piKOoGPT1vw78WbLfkCc7JmrP4N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267767'),
  ('1085847304087574078', 'Curse of the Nun', 2018, 'Horror', 'Aaron Mirtes', 'Aaron Mirtes', 'Lacy Hartselle, Jonathan Everett, Rae Hunt, Kate Kilcoyne, Aaron Mirtes, Alice Raver, Cale Adcock, Michael T. Flynn', 'R', 'A damaged young woman is looking forward to moving to a beautiful new home, but the spirit of a deranged nun wants her to stay right where she is.', 'A damaged young woman is looking forward to moving to a beautiful new home, but the spirit of a deranged nun wants her to stay right where she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ksU3xPkEnfd7XClq7c2owSTKIA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545612'),
  ('725824682784465548', 'Curse of the Pink Panther', 1983, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Blake Edwards, Dick Bush, Kuki López Rodero', 'Blake Edwards, Geoffrey Edwards', 'David Niven, Robert Wagner, Herbert Lom, Joanna Lumley, Capucine, Robert Loggia, Harvey Korman, Burt Kwouk', 'PG', 'Inspector Clouseau disappears, and the Surete wants the world''s second best detective to look for him. However, Clouseau''s enemy, Dreyfus, rigs the Surete''s computer to select, instead, the world''s WORST detective, NYPD Sgt. Clifton Sleigh. Sleigh obtusely bungles his way past assassins and corrupt officials as though he were Clouseau''s American cousin.', 'Inspector Clouseau disappears, and the Surete wants the world''s second best detective to look for him. However, Clouseau''s enemy, Dreyfus, rigs the Surete''s computer to select, instead, the world''s WORST detective, NYPD Sgt. Clifton Sleigh. Sleigh obtusely bungles his way past assassins and corrupt officials as though he were Clouseau''s American cousin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vd4bjWY1wJrjjl0c0ar2wccGT96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36576'),
  ('4098179024787130', 'Curse of the Puppet Master', 1998, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'David DeCoteau, Howard Wexler', 'Neal Marshall Stevens', 'George Peck, Emily Harrison, Josh Green, Michael Guerin, Michael Sollenberger, Marc Newburger, Scott Boyer, Jason Dean Booher', 'R', 'Andre Toulon''s diminutive assassins take up residence at The House of Marvels, a traveling doll circus run by Dr. Magrew, who has been trying to create a living doll of his own with little success.', 'Andre Toulon''s diminutive assassins take up residence at The House of Marvels, a traveling doll circus run by Dr. Magrew, who has been trying to create a living doll of his own with little success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ILnKSbE9IwKj0b9dquTfUgjR23.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26959'),
  ('803207485017172628', 'Curse of the Queerwolf', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Mark Pirro, Bruce Heinsius', 'Mark Pirro', 'Michael Palazzolo, Kent Butler, Taylor Whitney, Cynthia Brownell, Darwyn Carson, Sergio Bandera, Jim Bruce, Mark Pirro', null, 'After being bitten by what he thinks is a transvestite, Larry starts having nightmares about hillbillies, ominous visits from an old gypsy woman, and having the strangest reactions to the full moon...', 'After being bitten by what he thinks is a transvestite, Larry starts having nightmares about hillbillies, ominous visits from an old gypsy woman, and having the strangest reactions to the full moon...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1u1H08c657Ibt5aaS7eoDEDfROL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25762'),
  ('573869767814714400', 'Curse of the Screaming Dead', 1982, 'Horror', 'Tony Malanowski', 'Tony Malanowski', 'Steve Sandkuhler, Christopher Gummer, Rebecca Bach, Judy Dixon, Bumb Roberts, Mark Redfield, Richard Ruxton, Mimi Ishikawa', null, 'Three young couples head off into the woods for a weekend of camping, beer-guzzling, and love-making. Shortly into their trip, however, they stumble across a Civil War cemetery, making the ill-fated decision to pocket an old diary hidden at the site, which triggers a horde of rotting, undead soldiers to awaken from their tortured slumber.', 'Three young couples head off into the woods for a weekend of camping, beer-guzzling, and love-making. Shortly into their trip, however, they stumble across a Civil War cemetery, making the ill-fated decision to pocket an old diary hidden at the site, which triggers a horde of rotting, undead soldiers to awaken from their tortured slumber.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNQ1ItDaixf15FJlsyljRI1fqCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169534'),
  ('351619722447797206', 'Curse of the Swamp Creature', 1968, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Ralph K. Johnson, Larry Buchanan', 'Tony Huston', 'John Agar, Francine York, Jeff Alexander, Shirley McLine, Cal Duggan, Charles McLine, Bill McGhee, Bill Thurman', null, 'While searching for oil in the deadly swamplands of the Florida Everglades, members of a geological expedition meet an insane doctor who is working on an experiment to create a creature that is part man and part alligator.', 'While searching for oil in the deadly swamplands of the Florida Everglades, members of a geological expedition meet an insane doctor who is working on an experiment to create a creature that is part man and part alligator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b5l8EZouDEieTMtKlrYY5JJs0vq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93630'),
  ('18658374185550743', 'Curse of the Undead', 1959, 'Horror, Western', 'Ellis W. Carter, Edward Dein, James Welch', 'Mildred Dein, Edward Dein', 'Eric Fleming, Michael Pate, Kathleen Crowley, John Hoyt, Bruce Gordon, Edward Binns, Jimmy Murphy, Helen Kleeb', null, 'A mysterious epidemic has struck an Old West frontier town and young girls are falling deathly ill. Doc Carter, his lovely daughter Dolores, and preacher Dan Young have their hands full caring for the infirm. When one of the patients dies unexpectedly, Dan notices two puncture wounds on her neck. His investigation leads him to the strange gunslinger Drake Robey, who always seems to be slower on the draw than his opponents, but who—despite being outdrawn, and even shot—always manages to survive these deadly encounters. Dan soon discovers that Drake also has an aversion to crucifixes, sleeps in coffins, and cannot tolerate sunlight...', 'A mysterious epidemic has struck an Old West frontier town and young girls are falling deathly ill. Doc Carter, his lovely daughter Dolores, and preacher Dan Young have their hands full caring for the infirm. When one of the patients dies unexpectedly, Dan notices two puncture wounds on her neck. His investigation leads him to the strange gunslinger Drake Robey, who always seems to be slower on the draw than his opponents, but who—despite being outdrawn, and even shot—always manages to survive these deadly encounters. Dan soon discovers that Drake also has an aversion to crucifixes, sleeps in coffins, and cannot tolerate sunlight...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jlWWAtiO1GBzcgWxPET6Evyc1hC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147941'),
  ('498755006427030211', 'Curse of the Vampires', 1966, 'Horror, Drama', 'Gerardo de Leon', 'Pierre Salas', 'Amalia Fuentes, Romeo Vasquez, Eddie Garcia, Johnny Monteiro, Rosario del Pilar, Mary Walter, Francisco Cruz, Paquito Salcedo', null, 'Siblings discover that their father has their vampire mother chained up in the cellar. The mother bites her son and soon everyone in the community is either dead or a vampire.', 'Siblings discover that their father has their vampire mother chained up in the cellar. The mother bites her son and soon everyone in the community is either dead or a vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2fdiz7SPvr7botg5vNnjyaW6TRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87487'),
  ('833318165134761559', 'Curse of the Weeping Woman: J-ok''el', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Benjamin Williams, Marti Torrens, April Therese Shannon', 'Andy Whitaker, Jeremy Svenson, Peter Theis', 'Tom Parker, Ana Patricia Rojo, Dee Wallace, Jesús Ochoa, Diana Bracho, Angelique Boyer, Pablo Bracho, Alondra Salinas', null, 'An unworldly and closed-minded American travels to a small village in exotic Chiapas, Mexico; at the behest of his estranged mother when his half-sister disappears during a local epidemic of kidnappings attributed to the legendary J-ok''el, the weeping woman, who drowned her own babies, centuries ago and whose spirit has returned to claim more children as her own.', 'An unworldly and closed-minded American travels to a small village in exotic Chiapas, Mexico; at the behest of his estranged mother when his half-sister disappears during a local epidemic of kidnappings attributed to the legendary J-ok''el, the weeping woman, who drowned her own babies, centuries ago and whose spirit has returned to claim more children as her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/buhmse22wY7xMQYhU75tPDFvzgQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53933'),
  ('91206025569809643', 'Cursed', 2004, 'Horror', 'Yoshihiro Hoshino', 'Hirotoshi Kobayashi, Yumeaki Hirayama, Yoshihiro Hoshino', 'Kyôko Akiba, Yumeaki Hirayama, Takaaki Iwao, Hiroko Satoh, Etsuyo Mitani, Osamu Takahashi, Susumu Terajima', 'NR', 'Employees at a convenience store must get to the bottom of supernatural goings-on occurring within their workplace.', 'Employees at a convenience store must get to the bottom of supernatural goings-on occurring within their workplace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSHPJRtPJXmgcC0g0EmJ9pTqPQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62338'),
  ('417840989557743526', 'Cursed', 2005, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Robert McLachlan, Wes Craven, Ethan Ormsby', 'Kevin Williamson', 'Christina Ricci, Joshua Jackson, Jesse Eisenberg, Judy Greer, Scott Baio, Milo Ventimiglia, Kristina Anapau, Portia De Rossi', 'PG-13', 'A werewolf loose in Los Angeles changes the lives of three young adults who, after being mauled by the beast, learn that the only way to break the curse put upon them is to kill the one who started it all.', 'A werewolf loose in Los Angeles changes the lives of three young adults who, after being mauled by the beast, learn that the only way to break the curse put upon them is to kill the one who started it all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/em45jL4CfTMyj5V83kj7rhdorJu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10012'),
  ('1012397097924440821', 'Cursed', 2023, 'Horror, Action, Drama', 'Carlos Marbán', 'Carlos Marbán', 'Daniela Casas, Noah Casas, Roxana Visan, Laila Núñez, Haizea Carneros, Nacho Guerreros, Vanesa Romero', null, 'The lives of six girls belong to different worlds although connected to each other through a doll called Molly, whose existence dates back to 1976, when she appeared among the rubble of the great fire of the San Carlos orphanage, in northern Spain', 'The lives of six girls belong to different worlds although connected to each other through a doll called Molly, whose existence dates back to 1976, when she appeared among the rubble of the great fire of the San Carlos orphanage, in northern Spain', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQlq8Dp0DiYbAmybZFwp2JvS2Ml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154864'),
  ('697289407033155530', 'Cursed Friends', 2022, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Laura Murphy', 'Will Eisenberg, Aaron Eisenberg', 'Jessica Lowe, Harvey Guillén, Nicole Byer, Andrew Lewis Caldwell, Joey Fatone, Rob Riggle, James Austin Johnson, Kathy Griffin', 'PG-13', 'Four friends wake on Halloween and realize the predict-your-future game they played in 2002 is coming true in disturbing ways. They must band together to help each other escape the wild fates that have turned their lives upside down.', 'Four friends wake on Halloween and realize the predict-your-future game they played in 2002 is coming true in disturbing ways. They must band together to help each other escape the wild fates that have turned their lives upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKxK1rZ0y3k6SQfRotq0jLMzz2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1031206'),
  ('468312013230412638', 'Cursed Hearse', 2026, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Matthew Luke Tucci', 'Matthew Luke Tucci, Louis Rocky Bacigalupo', 'Krystian Bester, Arina Bacigalupo, Louis Rocky Bacigalupo', null, 'When a down on his luck hipster buys an old hearse with the hopes of converting it into a limousine service, he soon finds out that there''s a lot more to the hearse than he bargained for .', 'When a down on his luck hipster buys an old hearse with the hopes of converting it into a limousine service, he soon finds out that there''s a lot more to the hearse than he bargained for .', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9xhxT0o9CimXNEfAlOkQoM7FQdX.jpg', 'plex:movie:cursed-hearse'),
  ('928445587038303336', 'Curtain Call', 1998, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Yates, Sven Nykvist', 'Todd Alcott', 'James Spader, Polly Walker, Michael Caine, Maggie Smith, Buck Henry, Sam Shepard, Frank Whaley, Marcia Gay Harden', 'PG-13', 'A bachelor afraid of marriage angers his long-time girlfriend by buying a splendid townhouse just for himself, only to find it haunted by the ghosts of a famous theatrical couple, who teach him about love and commitment.', 'A bachelor afraid of marriage angers his long-time girlfriend by buying a splendid townhouse just for himself, only to find it haunted by the ghosts of a famous theatrical couple, who teach him about love and commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZmI4sd3KHxjujVAjzSu9huWHCJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48689'),
  ('698287994617850783', 'Curtain Razor', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Dave Barry, Stan Freberg, Dorothy Lloyd, Cliff Nazarro, John Woodburry', null, 'Porky, a talent scout for "Goode and Korney Talent Agency," auditions various acts. A final gag has a wolf performing this "stupendous act" where he wears a devil hat, cape and the like, drinks nitroglycerin, gasoline and other explosive stuff, then swallows a match. KABOOM! Porky thinks that the act is really good until the wolf''s ghost comes in and says that there''s a catch... "I can only do it once!"(Source: bcdb.com)', 'Porky, a talent scout for "Goode and Korney Talent Agency," auditions various acts. A final gag has a wolf performing this "stupendous act" where he wears a devil hat, cape and the like, drinks nitroglycerin, gasoline and other explosive stuff, then swallows a match. KABOOM! Porky thinks that the act is really good until the wolf''s ghost comes in and says that there''s a catch... "I can only do it once!"(Source: bcdb.com)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUUM5dfZQ1THwNW4whQCsNWUBV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226427'),
  ('876750785815547530', 'Curtains', 1983, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Richard Ciupka, Robert Paynter, Donato Baldassarra', 'William Gray', 'John Vernon, Samantha Eggar, Linda Thorson, Anne Ditchburn, Lynne Griffin, Sandee Currie, Lesleh Donaldson, Deborah Burgess', 'R', 'Six young actresses auditioning for a movie role at a remote mansion are targeted by a mysterious masked murderer.', 'Six young actresses auditioning for a movie role at a remote mansion are targeted by a mysterious masked murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpMClX0G1Gsia1Dn1HaFGPXqjd0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67087'),
  ('20446285298205434', 'Curucu, Beast of the Amazon', 1956, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Curt Siodmak, Rudolf Icsey', 'Curt Siodmak', 'John Bromfield, Beverly Garland, Tom Payne, Harvey Chalk, Sérgio de Oliveira, Larri Thomas, Wilson Viana, Andrea Bayard', null, 'Rock and Dr. Andrea travel up the Amazon to find out why the plantation workers have left their work in panic, allegedly because of attacks from Curucu, a monster who is said to live up the river where no white man has ever been before...', 'Rock and Dr. Andrea travel up the Amazon to find out why the plantation workers have left their work in panic, allegedly because of attacks from Curucu, a monster who is said to live up the river where no white man has ever been before...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfA6A5xcgQ01STfLLmSFBc60w73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29405'),
  ('940145449953484625', 'Curvature', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Diego Hallivis, Noah Rosenthal', 'Brian DeLeeuw', 'Lyndsy Fonseca, Linda Hamilton, Glenn Morshower, Noah Bean, Alex Lanipekun, Zach Avery, Barry Mulholland, John E. Brownlee', null, 'Helen tries to cope with the recent death of her husband, a scientist who killed himself right when he was on the verge of successfully completing the invention of a time machine. One day, she receives a phone call, and a voice suspiciously resembling her own voice warns her that she’s in danger. Is it possible Helen has time travelled? And what could have led her to do something like that?', 'Helen tries to cope with the recent death of her husband, a scientist who killed himself right when he was on the verge of successfully completing the invention of a time machine. One day, she receives a phone call, and a voice suspiciously resembling her own voice warns her that she’s in danger. Is it possible Helen has time travelled? And what could have led her to do something like that?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQ1CwqwGCNZHAkMC0HyEoWYJwzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475961'),
  ('788264852170071463', 'Curve', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Merwin, Richard Graves, Iain Softley', 'Kimberly Lofstrom Johnson, Lee Patterson', 'Julianne Hough, Teddy Sears, Madalyn Horcher, Drew Rausch, Penelope Mitchell, Kurt Bryant', 'R', 'A soon-to-be bride on her way to a wedding rehearsal is having second thoughts and decides to take a detour. Her car breaks down and a hitch-hiker offers help. Could it be fate?', 'A soon-to-be bride on her way to a wedding rehearsal is having second thoughts and decides to take a detour. Her car breaks down and a hitch-hiker offers help. Could it be fate?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9AGJMNrUfBMIGkCeKNccQbj0Nyg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347754'),
  ('895753210789941584', 'Curve', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Tim Egan, Tim Egan', 'Tim Egan', 'Laura Jane Turner', null, 'Clinging to a smooth, curved surface high above a sentient abyss, a woman tries to cover the few feet back to safety without losing purchase and falling to her death.', 'Clinging to a smooth, curved surface high above a sentient abyss, a woman tries to cover the few feet back to safety without losing purchase and falling to her death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehQdA0835DFN6Jsv7uUWcDEJZMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391262'),
  ('554982927158588068', 'Curveball', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, War', 'Johannes Naber, Sten Mende, Sven Kämmerer', 'Oliver Keidel, Johannes Naber', 'Sebastian Blomberg, Dar Salim, Virginia Kull, Thorsten Merten, Michael Wittenborn, Franziska Brandmeier', null, 'Although he already has searched Iraq unsuccessfully for weapons of mass destruction as a member of a UN mission, German bio-weapons expert Arndt Wolf is still obsessed with the idea that Saddam Hussein is hiding something. Nobody around him is interested in this topic any more. This changes abruptly when an Iraqi asylum seeker claims to have been involved in the manufacture of chemical weapons. The German Federal Intelligence Service summons Dr. Wolf to ascertain the legitimacy of the claims made by the informant, who has been given the code name “Curveball”.', 'Although he already has searched Iraq unsuccessfully for weapons of mass destruction as a member of a UN mission, German bio-weapons expert Arndt Wolf is still obsessed with the idea that Saddam Hussein is hiding something. Nobody around him is interested in this topic any more. This changes abruptly when an Iraqi asylum seeker claims to have been involved in the manufacture of chemical weapons. The German Federal Intelligence Service summons Dr. Wolf to ascertain the legitimacy of the claims made by the informant, who has been given the code name “Curveball”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lavCCgz01xUfIhnTwpMhUAwcgOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667938'),
  ('899729849251530929', 'Custer of the West', 1967, 'History, Western, Drama', 'Robert Siodmak, Cecilio Paniagua', 'Julian Zimet, Bernard Gordon', 'Robert Shaw, Mary Ure, Ty Hardin, Jeffrey Hunter, Lawrence Tierney, Marc Lawrence, Kieron Moore, Charles Stalmaker', 'G', 'The story of U.S. Army commander George Armstrong Custer, a flamboyant hero of the Civil War who later fought and was exterminated with his entire command by warring Sioux and Cheyenne tribes at the battle of Little Big Horn in 1876.', 'The story of U.S. Army commander George Armstrong Custer, a flamboyant hero of the Civil War who later fought and was exterminated with his entire command by warring Sioux and Cheyenne tribes at the battle of Little Big Horn in 1876.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ha6x7zXvJrgHiaXu5bQBcDaS7QS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82379'),
  ('655214613577632175', 'Custodio de señoras', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Víctor Hugo Caula, Alejandro Arando, Horacio Guisado', 'Hugo Sofovich', 'Jorge Porcel, Graciela Alfano, Javier Portales, Augusto Larreta, Raquel Álvarez, Maurice Jouvet, Carlos Rotundo, Emilio Vidal', null, 'Jorge is a photographer for a newspaper, from which he is fired. He then begins to work in a detective agency, where he is assigned the mission of protecting Monica, a beautiful woman threatened with death by an ex-boyfriend.', 'Jorge is a photographer for a newspaper, from which he is fired. He then begins to work in a detective agency, where he is assigned the mission of protecting Monica, a beautiful woman threatened with death by an ex-boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ep9WimkMSFri4AlnOBrcMVzQdeh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548269'),
  ('196780294197758538', 'Custody', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Antonin Huet Calafat, Xavier Legrand, Marie Doller', 'Xavier Legrand', 'Léa Drucker, Denis Ménochet, Thomas Gioria, Mathilde Auneveux, Mathieu Saikaly, Florence Janas, Saadia Bentaïeb, Sophie Pincemaille', null, 'Miriam and Antoine have recently separated. While she’s willing to permit their 17-year-old daughter Josephine to decide living arrangements for herself, Miriam is desperate to keep her youngest, 11-year-old Julien, away from his father. But the magistrate rules in favour of joint custody, and suddenly the boy is thrown directly into the middle of an escalating parental conflict, where it seems inevitable that sides must be chosen.', 'Miriam and Antoine have recently separated. While she’s willing to permit their 17-year-old daughter Josephine to decide living arrangements for herself, Miriam is desperate to keep her youngest, 11-year-old Julien, away from his father. But the magistrate rules in favour of joint custody, and suddenly the boy is thrown directly into the middle of an escalating parental conflict, where it seems inevitable that sides must be chosen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0c6zFIbYqn5H5mxVqQuI0PNY9D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451657'),
  ('131280916254379106', 'Custody of the Child', 1909, 'Drama', 'Louis Feuillade', null, 'Renée Carl, Christiane Mandelys, Maurice Vinot', null, 'Melodrama about a rich father who gains custody of his child while the mother goes off in tears. Of course, the child is miserable even though he has everything in the world but after a weekend trip at his poor mother''s house, the child realizes that money isn''t everything and he has to convince the father that his money is evil.', 'Melodrama about a rich father who gains custody of his child while the mother goes off in tears. Of course, the child is miserable even though he has everything in the world but after a weekend trip at his poor mother''s house, the child realizes that money isn''t everything and he has to convince the father that his money is evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZlkdfD2U13rxMd92uVrMsmGDsU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194058'),
  ('253630187005608131', 'Customers Wanted', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer, Margie Hines, Pinto Colvig', null, 'Popeye and Bluto are running competing penny arcades, trying to bring in customer Wimpy. Of course, he would gladly pay Tuesday for a penny today. And of course, their competing arcades show clips featuring each of them, with well over half of this short thus recycled.', 'Popeye and Bluto are running competing penny arcades, trying to bring in customer Wimpy. Of course, he would gladly pay Tuesday for a penny today. And of course, their competing arcades show clips featuring each of them, with well over half of this short thus recycled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSNRon04CXyVRpI2u8tuPQCg5KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236264'),
  ('1071818169336677082', 'Customs Frontline', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Herman Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung', 'Eric Lee, Erica Li', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Liu Yase, Shek Sau, Kenny Kwan, Michelle Wai Si-Nga', null, 'Hong Kong Customs and Excise Department officers Chow Ching-lai and Cheung Wan-nam share a close mentor-student relationship. On a case involving seized smuggled arms, Ching-lai is sent to take part in a joint operation with Interpol to capture a reclusive arms dealer. However, Wan-nam makes a drastic decision that further complicates the case.', 'Hong Kong Customs and Excise Department officers Chow Ching-lai and Cheung Wan-nam share a close mentor-student relationship. On a case involving seized smuggled arms, Ching-lai is sent to take part in a joint operation with Interpol to capture a reclusive arms dealer. However, Wan-nam makes a drastic decision that further complicates the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a869Prbl9FEWeWPWSw0Q3phE4Iv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989909'),
  ('327735402274950097', 'Cut', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kimble Rendall, Clair Parker, Kath McIntyre', 'Dave Warner', 'Molly Ringwald, Frank Roberts, Kylie Minogue, Geoff Revell, Stephen Curry, Jessica Napier, Cathy Adamek, Sarah Kants', 'R', 'A group of film students set out to finish filming a movie that was never completed after its director was murdered. After they begin filming, they realize they''re in for a bit of trouble, not unlike the late director...', 'A group of film students set out to finish filming a movie that was never completed after its director was murdered. After they begin filming, they realize they''re in for a bit of trouble, not unlike the late director...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64Dn0qJdC0E744uIWYtN5xQL9om.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10205'),
  ('214161777641508776', 'Cut', 2011, 'Drama', 'Amir Naderi, Keiji Hashimoto', 'Shinji Aoyama, Yuichi Tazawa', 'Hidetoshi Nishijima, Takako Tokiwa, Takashi Sasano, Shun Sugata, Denden, Takuji Suzuki, Ikuji Nakamura, Satoshi Nikaido', null, 'Shuji is an uncompromising young filmmaker at odds with Japanese society. One day he learns that his loan shark brother, who had helped to finance his films, has been executed by his own yakuza gang for failing to repay his debts.', 'Shuji is an uncompromising young filmmaker at odds with Japanese society. One day he learns that his loan shark brother, who had helped to finance his films, has been executed by his own yakuza gang for failing to repay his debts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dbCFUWn9KYqOmn5RpK7LHRwBrh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172489'),
  ('780252413748360639', 'Cut and Run', 1985, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Ruggero Deodato, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Cesare Frugoni, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Lisa Blount, Leonard Mann, Richard Lynch, Willie Aames, Richard Bright, Michael Berryman, Eriq La Salle, Gabriele Tinti', 'R', 'A reporter and her cameraman connect a surviving Jonestown leader and a TV exec''s missing son to a drug war where jungle installations are being massacred by an army of natives and a skilled white assassin.', 'A reporter and her cameraman connect a surviving Jonestown leader and a TV exec''s missing son to a drug war where jungle installations are being massacred by an army of natives and a skilled white assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nM79J0phqXnnXxR2rYBIk880gRv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30877'),
  ('805115465529709720', 'Cut Bank', 2014, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Matt Shakman, Ben Richardson, Johanna Posthuma', 'Roberto Patino', 'Liam Hemsworth, Teresa Palmer, John Malkovich, Bruce Dern, Billy Bob Thornton, Michael Stuhlbarg, Oliver Platt, Ty Olsson', 'R', '25-year-old Dwayne McLaren, a former athlete turned auto mechanic, dreams of getting out of tiny Cut Bank, Montana the coldest town in America. But his effort to do so sets in motion a deadly series of events that change his life and the life of the town forever...', '25-year-old Dwayne McLaren, a former athlete turned auto mechanic, dreams of getting out of tiny Cut Bank, Montana the coldest town in America. But his effort to do so sets in motion a deadly series of events that change his life and the life of the town forever...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hP5N3R8qqe7JT4N3esgh23GOpCN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276902'),
  ('896458353271525673', 'Cut Off', 2018, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror, Mystery', 'Jakub Bejnarowicz, Christian Alvart', 'Christian Alvart', 'Moritz Bleibtreu, Jasna Fritzi Bauer, Lars Eidinger, Fahri Yardım, Niels-Bruno Schmidt, Jana Klinge, John Vaughan, Klara Höfels', 'R', 'A coroner finds a capsule in the head of a heavily mutilated corpse, containing a phone number and single word: the name of his daughter.', 'A coroner finds a capsule in the head of a heavily mutilated corpse, containing a phone number and single word: the name of his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/927kgdzuNNHX6wubSbqi50kZse0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436387'),
  ('723454984773102562', 'Cut Throat City', 2020, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'RZA', 'Paul Cuschieri', 'Shameik Moore, Demetrius Shipp Jr., Denzel Whitaker, Keean Johnson, Kat Graham, T.I., Terrence Howard, Rob Morgan', null, 'Four boyhood friends return to New Orleans’ Lower Ninth Ward after Hurricane Katrina, to find their home decimated and prospects for work swept away. Turning to a local gangster for employment, the crew is hired to pull off a daring casino heist, right in the heart of the city.', 'Four boyhood friends return to New Orleans’ Lower Ninth Ward after Hurricane Katrina, to find their home decimated and prospects for work swept away. Turning to a local gangster for employment, the crew is hired to pull off a daring casino heist, right in the heart of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9702nIZf5EVxS3FrzycamQUlSjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493065'),
  ('422152404111293447', 'Cut-Throats Nine', 1971, 'Drama, Western', 'Joaquín Romero Marchent, Luis Cuadrado, Mariano Canales', 'Santiago Moncada, Joaquín Romero Hernández', 'Claudio Undari, Emma Cohen, Alberto Dalbés, Antonio Iranzo, Manuel Tejada, Ricardo Díaz, José Manuel Martín, Carlos Romero Marchent', 'R', 'A group of ruthless convicts is led to prison through an inhospitable mountain range by a small cavalry detachment commanded by Sergeant Brown, who is accompanied by his young and beautiful daughter.', 'A group of ruthless convicts is led to prison through an inhospitable mountain range by a small cavalry detachment commanded by Sergeant Brown, who is accompanied by his young and beautiful daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2YJpPfcmliO36dtjsBOroN9tgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29496'),
  ('988318676918204029', 'Cutaway', 2000, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Gerry Lively, Norman Kent, Guy Manos', 'Greg Manos, Guy Manos, Ted Williams', 'Tom Berenger, Stephen Baldwin, Dennis Rodman, Maxine Bahns, Ron Silver, Roy Ageloff, Marcos A. Ferraez, Adam Wylie', null, 'The successful undercover agent Victor Cooper is assigned for his ninth mission: to find how the loadings of drug is being brought to Miami. He suspects that the drug is coming through the air and joins a team of sky diving, under the leadership of Red Line, a fanatic and considered the athlete number one in this sport in the world. Due to his profile of winner, Vic gets involved with the group and he "disconnects" from his position of infiltrated agent, "connecting" with the team.', 'The successful undercover agent Victor Cooper is assigned for his ninth mission: to find how the loadings of drug is being brought to Miami. He suspects that the drug is coming through the air and joins a team of sky diving, under the leadership of Red Line, a fanatic and considered the athlete number one in this sport in the world. Due to his profile of winner, Vic gets involved with the group and he "disconnects" from his position of infiltrated agent, "connecting" with the team.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiCZFNL6JoSNh0vdKc4GrxPhY5B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2089'),
  ('296979862024145826', 'Cute and Dangerous', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Özcan Deniz', 'Özcan Deniz', 'Şükrü Özyıldız, Ayça Ayşin Turan, Türkan Kılıç, Taner Turan, Cem Avnayim, Ahmet Özarslan, Burçin Birben, Evrim Doğan', null, 'Years after abducting baby Zeliş from a grieving Edirne family, Zarok gets a chance at redemption by rescuing her once more and setting out to reunite her with her true kin.', 'Years after abducting baby Zeliş from a grieving Edirne family, Zarok gets a chance at redemption by rescuing her once more and setting out to reunite her with her true kin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8fuHx6uoLbK0Qr7jRRfrugdfHlU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325134'),
  ('311836844977891460', 'Cute But Ordinary', 1981, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Braz Chediak', 'Doc Comparato', 'Lucélia Santos, José Wilker, Vera Fischer, Carlos Kroeber, Milton Moraes, Miriam Pires, Sônia Oiticica, Monah Delacy', null, 'The youngest daughter of a rich man has been raped by five black men in the slums of Rio de Janeiro, and her father arranges her marriage to one of his employees in order to save the family’s honor.', 'The youngest daughter of a rich man has been raped by five black men in the slums of Rio de Janeiro, and her father arranges her marriage to one of his employees in order to save the family’s honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4YXVxQHv4XSp1hE3Dsx2wIiuwTy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187826'),
  ('151411940772390669', 'Cute Girl', 1980, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chi Kai-Ching, Chen Kun-hou', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien', 'Kenny Bee, Fong Fei-fei, Anthony Chan Yau, Chang Ping-Yu, Chi Kai-Ching, Qian Lu, Chou Wan-Sheng, Hui-Fen Chuang', null, 'The daughter of a wealthy man takes French lessons so she can go to France with her fiancée, but ends up falling for a poor man who studies civil engineering.', 'The daughter of a wealthy man takes French lessons so she can go to France with her fiancée, but ends up falling for a poor man who studies civil engineering.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/P1reYyYNv5i53e2pPu738ZR2tZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159862'),
  ('871530018596359346', 'Cutie and the Boxer', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Zachary Heinzerling', null, 'Noriko Shinohara, Ushio Shinohara', 'R', 'This candid New York love story explores the chaotic 40-year marriage of famed boxing painter Ushio Shinohara and his wife, Noriko. Anxious to shed her role as her overbearing husband''s assistant, Noriko finds an identity of her own.', 'This candid New York love story explores the chaotic 40-year marriage of famed boxing painter Ushio Shinohara and his wife, Noriko. Anxious to shed her role as her overbearing husband''s assistant, Noriko finds an identity of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aq1lwd2yQGNaoEPv3ivHSkCK9B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159002'),
  ('355727801867456416', 'Cutie Honey', 2004, 'Action', 'Hideaki Anno, Katsuro Onoue, Kosuke Matsushima', 'Rumi Takahashi, Hideaki Anno', 'Eriko Sato, Mikako Ichikawa, Jun Murakami, Mitsuhiro Oikawa, Hairi Katagiri, Sie Kohinata, Mayumi Shintani, Ryo Kase', null, 'When Honey''s uncle gets kidnapped by the evil criminal gang known as "Panther Claw," she must use her magical powers of transformation to save him. Meanwhile the same crime group has been responsible for a number of other crime sprees across Tokyo. In the process, Honey teams up with the seemingly cold police woman Natsuko Aki and hot shot journalist Seiji Hayami as well as battle the four "claws" of the Panther Claw gang to save her uncle and the rest of the city.', 'When Honey''s uncle gets kidnapped by the evil criminal gang known as "Panther Claw," she must use her magical powers of transformation to save him. Meanwhile the same crime group has been responsible for a number of other crime sprees across Tokyo. In the process, Honey teams up with the seemingly cold police woman Natsuko Aki and hot shot journalist Seiji Hayami as well as battle the four "claws" of the Panther Claw gang to save her uncle and the rest of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WoyOCZUuCovSO6Q4nj1C4cmNyz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20921'),
  ('671580201998343535', 'Cutie Honey: Tears', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Takeshi Asai, Ryo Higuchi, Yûichirô Ohtsuka', 'Yasu Tanaka', 'Mariya Nishiuchi, Takahiro Miura, Nicole Ishida, Sousuke Takaoka, Tasuku Nagase, Ren Imai, Koichi Iwaki, Hina Fukatsu', null, 'At the end of the 21st century, the world is plagued by a mysterious virus and unusual weather. Genius scientist Dr. Kisaragi creates an android with the code name “Cutie Honey” (Mariya Nishiuchi). The android is unique in that it possesses human emotions. To save mankind, Cutie Honey goes up against an evil organization.', 'At the end of the 21st century, the world is plagued by a mysterious virus and unusual weather. Genius scientist Dr. Kisaragi creates an android with the code name “Cutie Honey” (Mariya Nishiuchi). The android is unique in that it possesses human emotions. To save mankind, Cutie Honey goes up against an evil organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuzYqC7uftEoNVYg2SCeicXDGH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436022'),
  ('427254241709902594', 'Cutlass', 2007, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kate Hudson, Dan Mindel', 'Kate Hudson', 'Virginia Madsen, Dakota Fanning, Kristen Stewart, Kurt Russell, Chevy Chase, Sarah Roemer, Brian Hooks, Ethan Suplee', null, 'When Robin''s daughter Lacy wants to buy an expensive guitar, Robin reminisces about the days when she was a teenager, asking her dad for her first car, an Olds Cutlass Supreme.', 'When Robin''s daughter Lacy wants to buy an expensive guitar, Robin reminisces about the days when she was a teenager, asking her dad for her first car, an Olds Cutlass Supreme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0OzJGrS6Otk2H8oR0nvjUX0Nbv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4633'),
  ('215117220345212093', 'Cutter''s Way', 1981, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Ivan Passer, Jordan Cronenweth, Jeffrey Chernov', 'Jeffrey Alan Fiskin', 'Jeff Bridges, John Heard, Lisa Eichhorn, Stephen Elliott, Arthur Rosenberg, Nina van Pallandt, Ann Dusenberry, Patricia Donahue', 'R', 'Alex Cutter is a boozy, belligerent and deeply cynical Vietnam veteran whose encounter with a landmine during the war has left him minus an eye, a leg and an arm. When his drifter playboy friend Richard Bone is falsely accused of murder, Cutter sets out for revenge in his own inimitable style.', 'Alex Cutter is a boozy, belligerent and deeply cynical Vietnam veteran whose encounter with a landmine during the war has left him minus an eye, a leg and an arm. When his drifter playboy friend Richard Bone is falsely accused of murder, Cutter sets out for revenge in his own inimitable style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Qsy3teeaBv3uH3vCVZPkbhyYih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31593'),
  ('1010299239001834282', 'Cutterhead', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Martin Munch, Rasmus Kloster Bro', 'Rasmus Kloster Bro, Mikkel Bak Sørensen', 'Christine Sønderris, Krešimir Mikić, Samson Semere, Adrian Heili, Salvatore Striano, Lilli Fernanda Kondrup, Rasmus Hammerich, Anders Nylander Thomsen', null, 'Rie is a PR-coordinator visiting a tunnel boring machine to portray the well-oiled European cooperation in the Metro construction when an accident suddenly occurs. Unable to escape, she takes refuge in an airlock with Croatian miner Ivo and Bharan, a worker from Eritrea.', 'Rie is a PR-coordinator visiting a tunnel boring machine to portray the well-oiled European cooperation in the Metro construction when an accident suddenly occurs. Unable to escape, she takes refuge in an airlock with Croatian miner Ivo and Bharan, a worker from Eritrea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXNnROR2XrE8ujIv2j27D6MmUKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531489'),
  ('387085318468747957', 'Cutthroat Island', 1995, 'Action, Adventure', 'Peter Levy, Renny Harlin, Kuki López Rodero', 'Marc Norman, Robert King', 'Geena Davis, Matthew Modine, Frank Langella, Maury Chaykin, Patrick Malahide, Stan Shaw, Rex Linn, Paul Dillon', 'PG-13', 'Morgan Adams and her slave, William Shaw, are on a quest to recover the three portions of a treasure map. Unfortunately, the final portion is held by her murderous uncle, Dawg. Her crew is skeptical of her leadership abilities, so she must complete her quest before they mutiny against her. This is made yet more difficult by the efforts of the British crown to end her pirate raids.', 'Morgan Adams and her slave, William Shaw, are on a quest to recover the three portions of a treasure map. Unfortunately, the final portion is held by her murderous uncle, Dawg. Her crew is skeptical of her leadership abilities, so she must complete her quest before they mutiny against her. This is made yet more difficult by the efforts of the British crown to end her pirate raids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYdeBZ4BFXivdouxLfQGWNE6zRx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1408'),
  ('961532925787648826', 'Cutting Class', 1989, 'Horror, Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Rospo Pallenberg, Avraham Karpick', 'Steve Slavkin', 'Donovan Leitch, Jill Schoelen, Brad Pitt, Roddy McDowall, Martin Mull, Brenda James, Robert Glaudini, Dirk Blocker', 'R', 'High school student Paula Carson''s affections are being sought after by two of her classmates: Dwight, the "bad boy", and Brian, a disturbed young man who has just been released from a mental hospital where he was committed following the suspicious death of his father. Soon after being released, more murders start happening. Is Brian back to his old tricks, or is Dwight just trying to eliminate the competition?', 'High school student Paula Carson''s affections are being sought after by two of her classmates: Dwight, the "bad boy", and Brian, a disturbed young man who has just been released from a mental hospital where he was committed following the suspicious death of his father. Soon after being released, more murders start happening. Is Brian back to his old tricks, or is Dwight just trying to eliminate the competition?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxJAqSdJTc9YaGKVq2SfJDVVVco.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21799'),
  ('733144545106774157', 'Cutting It Short', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Jiří Menzel, Jaromír Šofr, Milan Klacek', 'Bohumil Hrabal, Jiří Menzel', 'Magda Vášáryová, Jiří Schmitzer, Jaromír Hanzlík, Rudolf Hrušínský, Petr Čepek, Oldřich Vlach, František Řehák, Miloslav Štibich', null, 'Francin, manager of a small-town brewery, has a charming wife whose abundant blonde locks are an adornment to the town. Maryska looks ethereal but loves meat and beer, while Francin is an ascetic. The strict members of the brewery board of directors come to audit the accounts, but are diverted from concentrating on Francin''s detailed reports by Maryska, who has organized a pig-killing feast and is ably assisting the butcher. When she invites the old curmudgeons on the board to enjoy the fresh pork, they are too happy to agree. Francin doesn''t know whether he is going to get a permanent contract. To make things worse his brother Pepin - eccentric, noisy and garrulous - turns up on an indefinite visit.', 'Francin, manager of a small-town brewery, has a charming wife whose abundant blonde locks are an adornment to the town. Maryska looks ethereal but loves meat and beer, while Francin is an ascetic. The strict members of the brewery board of directors come to audit the accounts, but are diverted from concentrating on Francin''s detailed reports by Maryska, who has organized a pig-killing feast and is ably assisting the butcher. When she invites the old curmudgeons on the board to enjoy the fresh pork, they are too happy to agree. Francin doesn''t know whether he is going to get a permanent contract. To make things worse his brother Pepin - eccentric, noisy and garrulous - turns up on an indefinite visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1C1oGhqssgiUSxVwGSvbn3jDZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51178'),
  ('45204930875705536', 'Cutting Moments', 1997, 'Horror, Drama', 'Douglas Buck, Nicola Saraval, Frank Centro', 'Douglas Buck', 'Nicca Ray, Gary Betsworth, Jared Barsky', null, 'In the center of a monotonous suburban existence, Sarah lives silently and in subservience to her icy husband Patrick. They have been together far too long, and Patrick''s affections for his wife have all but vanished. Instead, his sexual urges are tempting him to lust after their own son. Realizing how far gone her husband is, Sarah undertakes drastic, shockingly sickening measures to salvage some sense of her life and purge her years of festering resentment.', 'In the center of a monotonous suburban existence, Sarah lives silently and in subservience to her icy husband Patrick. They have been together far too long, and Patrick''s affections for his wife have all but vanished. Instead, his sexual urges are tempting him to lust after their own son. Realizing how far gone her husband is, Sarah undertakes drastic, shockingly sickening measures to salvage some sense of her life and purge her years of festering resentment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v80b9yYe93KeCgkI4XA4moCQlxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31091'),
  ('760022331229177986', 'Cuttputlli', 2022, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ranjit Tiwari, Jakesh Dalal, Rajeev Ravi', 'Aseem Arora', 'Akshay Kumar, Rakul Preet Singh, Sargun Mehta, Chandrachur Singh, Gurpreet Ghuggi, Hrishitaa Bhatt, Sujith Sankar, Shahid Latief', null, 'When a small town gets plunged into the nightmare of serial killings, rookie cop Arjan embarks on a chase for the truth and unravels a gruesome conspiracy.', 'When a small town gets plunged into the nightmare of serial killings, rookie cop Arjan embarks on a chase for the truth and unravels a gruesome conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVQweL2bdoTlmrVYbcicZQ5VcNP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956757'),
  ('223707519357354196', 'CVLT', 2023, 'Horror', 'Dario Argento', 'Roberto Nugnes, Dario Argento', 'Salmo, Dario Argento, Noyz Narcos', null, 'In the clip for the song "Cvlt" the rappers Salmo and Noyz Narcos go to the master''s house. Things take an unexpected turn.', 'In the clip for the song "Cvlt" the rappers Salmo and Noyz Narcos go to the master''s house. Things take an unexpected turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/amPqChxIe2p9rgqIVSQNEvCoXIt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189988'),
  ('657309655374221162', 'Cy-Warrior', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Giannetto De Rossi', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Giannetto De Rossi', 'Henry Silva, Frank Zagarino, Sherrie Rose, Ronald Lang, Brandon Hammond, James Summers', null, 'An accident causes the activation of the top-secret Cyber Warrior or ''Cyw'' before his programming has been completed. Concerned that the Cyw may fall into the hands of enemies, prove unable to control or simply receive unwanted attention from the public or foreign powers, the military dispatches a crack squad led by Colonel Hammer to bring back the Cyw one way or another. (from Giallo Fever blog)', 'An accident causes the activation of the top-secret Cyber Warrior or ''Cyw'' before his programming has been completed. Concerned that the Cyw may fall into the hands of enemies, prove unable to control or simply receive unwanted attention from the public or foreign powers, the military dispatches a crack squad led by Colonel Hammer to bring back the Cyw one way or another. (from Giallo Fever blog)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPtR59IbpXm6s86gJbQiq2DaPEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242514'),
  ('845745403019351872', 'Cyanide', 2013, 'Drama', 'Séverine Cornamusaz, Carlo Varini', 'Marcel Beaulieu, Séverine Cornamusaz', 'Alexandre Etzlinger, Roy Dupuis, Sabine Timoteo, Christophe Sermet, Ludivine Geschworner, Thierry Jorand, Isabelle Caillat, Michel Demierre', null, 'Achille, 13, awaits, full of hope, the release from prison of his father, unknown and fantasized. His dream of living as a threesome, like a real family, will be seriously undermined by a mother exhausted from waiting and this father who is unsuitable and made irresponsible by so many years of incarceration. Will this vulnerable person with a flamboyant past be able to keep the promise he made to his son to never live apart from him again?', 'Achille, 13, awaits, full of hope, the release from prison of his father, unknown and fantasized. His dream of living as a threesome, like a real family, will be seriously undermined by a mother exhausted from waiting and this father who is unsuitable and made irresponsible by so many years of incarceration. Will this vulnerable person with a flamboyant past be able to keep the promise he made to his son to never live apart from him again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3l4unT8YRpkpLc9oHqB6XgYexK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208305'),
  ('753668722408217715', 'Cybele: A Pastoral Ritual in Five Scenes', 1969, null, 'Donald Richie', 'Yoshirō Katō', 'Yoshihiro Kato', null, 'A documentary of an avant-garde theatre performance, presents an orgiastic rite of sex, degradation, and bloody sacrifice, performed by Zero-Jigen.', 'A documentary of an avant-garde theatre performance, presents an orgiastic rite of sex, degradation, and bloody sacrifice, performed by Zero-Jigen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5vaPbQWPZcUKiBbE1UHdJqonmxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258058'),
  ('635318088347520805', 'Cyber City Oedo 808', 1990, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Horror, Action, Crime', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Morio Asaka, Satoru Namekawa', 'Akinori Endo', 'Hiroya Ishimaru, Kaneto Shiozawa, Tessyo Genda, Norio Wakamoto, Mitsuko Horie, Kyousei Tsukui, Emi Shinohara, Arihiro Masuda', null, 'In the city of Oedo 2808a.d., three Cyber criminals are given two choices, to either rot in jail or to join a special force of the Cyber Police to get possibly one more chance at freedom ever again. For each criminal apprehended, and for each successful mission done, the state will agree to reduce their sentences. Lead by Hasegawa, the new recruits: Sengoku, Gogul, and Benton will bring some hard justice to Oedo and possibly taste freedom again.', 'In the city of Oedo 2808a.d., three Cyber criminals are given two choices, to either rot in jail or to join a special force of the Cyber Police to get possibly one more chance at freedom ever again. For each criminal apprehended, and for each successful mission done, the state will agree to reduce their sentences. Lead by Hasegawa, the new recruits: Sengoku, Gogul, and Benton will bring some hard justice to Oedo and possibly taste freedom again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mNmqEDz1mm93C8XjhqyzmuiNP2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97187'),
  ('211618470818971248', 'Cyber Heist', 2023, 'Thriller, Crime, Action', 'Cheng Siu-Keung, Hing Fan Wong', 'Lui Koon-Nam, Yip Ming-Ho, Shum Kwan-Sin', 'Aaron Kwok, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Simon Yam, Megan Lai, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Tony Wu, Zeno Koo, Wiyona Yeung Lau-Ching', null, 'A computer expert accidentally falls into the conspiracy of online financial crime and has to seize the time to participate in the struggle.', 'A computer expert accidentally falls into the conspiracy of online financial crime and has to seize the time to participate in the struggle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRSeVamw11W0Y5FsNm5vTEWtkPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741602'),
  ('273091494048762489', 'Cyber Hell: Exposing an Internet Horror', 2022, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Choi Jin-sung, Cho Gyu-young, Park Hong-yeol', 'Choi Jin-sung', 'Kim Gyu-nam', null, 'Anonymous and exploitative, a network of online chat rooms ran rampant with sex crimes. The hunt to take down its operators required guts and tenacity.', 'Anonymous and exploitative, a network of online chat rooms ran rampant with sex crimes. The hunt to take down its operators required guts and tenacity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRlW6yvXHyXPuN0Ea6u6Sc48lGm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965143'),
  ('292683382579934609', 'Cyber Ninja', 1988, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Keita Amemiya, Toshimitsu Oneda, Kazuo Sagawa', 'Keita Amemiya, Hajime Tanaka', 'Hanbei Kawai, Eri Morishita, Makoto Yokoyama, Fuyukichi Maki, Shōhei Yamamoto, Mizuho Yoshida, Hiroaki Mita, Kunihiko Ida', null, 'In a futuristic version of medieval Japan, a band of swordsmen battles an evil warlord and his mechanical army of ninjas, and are aided by a mysterious heroic cyborg ninja, Shiranui.', 'In a futuristic version of medieval Japan, a band of swordsmen battles an evil warlord and his mechanical army of ninjas, and are aided by a mysterious heroic cyborg ninja, Shiranui.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eMGJvWIrSm5wpyOaYdDs2uoH16W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163586'),
  ('563065451224443809', 'Cyber Seduction: His Secret Life', 2005, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Tom McLoughlin, Rudolf Blahacek', null, 'Jeremy Sumpter, Lyndsy Fonseca, John Robinson, Kelly Lynch, Briony Glassco, Michael Seater, Kyle Schmid, Krysta Carter', null, 'A high school kid develops an addiction to Internet porn so intense that it begins to destroy his life and tear his family apart.', 'A high school kid develops an addiction to Internet porn so intense that it begins to destroy his life and tear his family apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jwNPGYiK3VeBRRG4EGZOMcKJlfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63483'),
  ('12541745062973289', 'Cyber Vengeance', 1995, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'J. Christian Ingvordsen, Matthew M. Howe', 'John Weiner', 'Robert Davi, Matthias Hues, J. Gregory Smith, Josh Mosby, Terry Serpico, Susan Rollman, Susan Misner, J. Christian Ingvordsen', null, 'In the year 2005, the prison system has been completely privatized and cyber prisons have become the new means for housing the guilty. The bodies of inmates are kept in suspended animation while their minds are kept in a virtual reality prison. Business tycoon R.D. Crowley has found a way to capitalize on these virtual prisons by allowing rich men to pay in order to engage in a form of virtual reality hunting that has real-life consequences for the inmates. Will, a guard at one of these prisons, soon finds himself coerced into one of these virtual cat and mouse games. Armed with his knowledge of history, along with his expert skills in VR combat, Will must work with the inmates in order to save their lives and escape from the prison before it''s too late.', 'In the year 2005, the prison system has been completely privatized and cyber prisons have become the new means for housing the guilty. The bodies of inmates are kept in suspended animation while their minds are kept in a virtual reality prison. Business tycoon R.D. Crowley has found a way to capitalize on these virtual prisons by allowing rich men to pay in order to engage in a form of virtual reality hunting that has real-life consequences for the inmates. Will, a guard at one of these prisons, soon finds himself coerced into one of these virtual cat and mouse games. Armed with his knowledge of history, along with his expert skills in VR combat, Will must work with the inmates in order to save their lives and escape from the prison before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wyx26jnoriwKodgl0bGDHM7oTxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28240'),
  ('477045931475015025', 'Cyber-C.H.I.C.', 1990, 'Action, Comedy', 'Jeffrey Mandel, Ed Hansen, J. Michael Wemple', 'Jeffrey Mandel, Ed Hansen', 'Kathy Shower, Jennifer Daly, Burt Ward, Ranson Baker, Kip King, Phil Proctor, Jack Carter', 'PG-13', 'A madman is holding the world hostage for a billion dollars. Chaos and violence rule the streets. Enter Robo C.H.I.C.… a Computerized, Humanoid, Intelligence Clone… an unstoppable killing machine packed into one of the hottest bodies around! The ultimate crime fighter, she''s faster than a laser beam, more powerful than an atom bomb and able to wipe out ten men with a single blast from her ion shooting orbs. The challenge: can this bodacious bombshell wipe out the bad guys, save the world, fall in love and get her hair done all in the same day? Or, will the vicious scum take over the earth and get all of the great looking babes?', 'A madman is holding the world hostage for a billion dollars. Chaos and violence rule the streets. Enter Robo C.H.I.C.… a Computerized, Humanoid, Intelligence Clone… an unstoppable killing machine packed into one of the hottest bodies around! The ultimate crime fighter, she''s faster than a laser beam, more powerful than an atom bomb and able to wipe out ten men with a single blast from her ion shooting orbs. The challenge: can this bodacious bombshell wipe out the bad guys, save the world, fall in love and get her hair done all in the same day? Or, will the vicious scum take over the earth and get all of the great looking babes?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOwBrd7lzhuEQoK2OaiGNcuWTRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42447'),
  ('971561920929205287', 'Cyberbully', 2011, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Pierre Gill, Don Terry, Charles Binamé', null, 'Emily Osment, Kay Panabaker, Meaghan Rath, Kelly Rowan, Jon McLaren, Robert Naylor, Nastassia Markiewicz, Jade Hassouné', null, 'A woman tries to help her teenage daughter when she becomes the victim of online bullying.', 'A woman tries to help her teenage daughter when she becomes the victim of online bullying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJIGiUaknsC6tLL2Om0dATZu90Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70821'),
  ('418161730484948530', 'Cyberbully', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Ben Chanan, Ben Moulden', 'Ben Chanan, David Lobatto', 'Maisie Williams, Ella Purnell, Haruka Abe, Jake Davies, Daisy Waterstone, Wilson Haagens, Anthony Shuster', null, 'A chilling real-time thriller featuring a teenager, Casey, battling with an anonymous cyber-stalker.', 'A chilling real-time thriller featuring a teenager, Casey, battling with an anonymous cyber-stalker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9IBBA6ypk0LEaOgDdutVK0NPzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317144'),
  ('245236284207894835', 'Cyberbunker: The Criminal Underworld', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Kilian Lieb, Max Rainer, Joseph Strauch', 'Kilian Lieb, Max Rainer', 'Ismail Tanriver', 'PG-13', 'This documentary reveals how a group of hackers powered the darkest corners of the internet from a Cold War-era bunker in a quiet German tourist town.', 'This documentary reveals how a group of hackers powered the darkest corners of the internet from a Cold War-era bunker in a quiet German tourist town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNW35K9SPQzve8iuvo9V8TZ0HzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1191658'),
  ('650821793094136355', 'Cyberjack', 1995, 'Science Fiction', 'Robert Lee, Alan M. Trow', 'Eric Poppen', 'Michael Dudikoff, Suki Kaiser, Brion James, James Thom, Topaz Hasfal-Schou, Garvin Cross, Dean Mckenzie, Duncan Fraser', 'R', 'In the near future Nassim, terrorist leader, storms computer company headquarters. His aim is deadly computer virus that could bring him world domination. Nick, company janitor and ex-cop, will get in his way.', 'In the near future Nassim, terrorist leader, storms computer company headquarters. His aim is deadly computer virus that could bring him world domination. Nick, company janitor and ex-cop, will get in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d14QqTD97uXYXt1jIVCzYykIDYw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2072'),
  ('1146997973095238650', 'Cybernator', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Robert Rundle, Jimmy Williams', 'Edward Sanchez, Robert Rundle', 'Lonnie Schuyler, Jeff Jenkins, Christina Lucia Peralta-Ramos, Jack Senior, Stephanie Warner, Sandy Palm, William Smith, Jimmy Williams', 'R', 'In the future, an L.A. cop whose girlfriend is a stripper uncovers a conspiracy concerning killer cyborgs.', 'In the future, an L.A. cop whose girlfriend is a stripper uncovers a conspiracy concerning killer cyborgs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aErSnTbfaRPM5M03GpQC2IwdVvY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158571'),
  ('384199290895484690', 'Cybernetic Grandma', 1963, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Jiří Trnka, Ivan Renč, Jiří Šafář', 'Jiří Trnka', 'Otýlie Beníšková, Jana Werichová', null, 'Trnka’s sci-fi vision of the future in which machines and robots try to substitute themselves into the most beautiful human relationships. A cybernetic robot is supposed to substitute for the loving grandmother of a little girl. The wise grandmother, however, comes back and the girl finds the warmth of her grandmother’s loving arms again. Trnka’s artistic ideas in this film can be described as both poetically fragile and dramatically cautionary.', 'Trnka’s sci-fi vision of the future in which machines and robots try to substitute themselves into the most beautiful human relationships. A cybernetic robot is supposed to substitute for the loving grandmother of a little girl. The wise grandmother, however, comes back and the girl finds the warmth of her grandmother’s loving arms again. Trnka’s artistic ideas in this film can be described as both poetically fragile and dramatically cautionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ChxWfwCn7vjjUnjXz8x76qFkyl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67104'),
  ('819421663226561178', 'CyberTracker', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Ken Blakey, Richard Pepin, Garett Griffin', 'Joe Hart', 'Don Wilson, Richard Norton, Stacie Foster, Joseph Ruskin, John Aprea, Abby Dalton, Steve Burton, David Barnathan', 'R', 'Eric is a secret agent currently working as security guard for senator Dilly. The senator is the main advocate for a new kind of police officer: the Tracker, a perfect and nearly invulnerable android. When Eric realizes that senator Dilly is playing dirty games, he does not only have Dilly''s security chief Ross after him, but also those nearly undefeatable Trackers.', 'Eric is a secret agent currently working as security guard for senator Dilly. The senator is the main advocate for a new kind of police officer: the Tracker, a perfect and nearly invulnerable android. When Eric realizes that senator Dilly is playing dirty games, he does not only have Dilly''s security chief Ross after him, but also those nearly undefeatable Trackers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nFRhXWT46YGY8OLO31sJEHClcOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78375'),
  ('1126572635852107636', 'CyberTracker 2', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Richard Pepin, Michael K. DeVaney, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Richard Preston Jr.', 'Don Wilson, Stacie Foster, Tony Burton, Jim Maniaci, Anthony De Longis, John Kassir, Stephen Rowe, Steve Burton', null, 'A Secret Service agent battles an arms dealer who is creating a cyborg army.', 'A Secret Service agent battles an arms dealer who is creating a cyborg army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlYD4rNwmQPKdCDY0MUGcoaVvQK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29820'),
  ('681858103771208278', 'Cyberzone', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Fred Olen Ray, Howard Wexler', 'William C. Martell', 'Marc Singer, Matthias Hues, Rochelle Swanson, Robin Clarke, Kin Shriner, Cal Bartlett, Robert Quarry, Ross Hagen', null, 'In the future, the threat of global takeover by cyborg units has forced Earth to outlaw their use. But when four female androids are smuggled to Earth, Jack Ford is assigned to track them down. An adventurous chase takes him from the mean streets of Phoenix to the depths of New Angeles, an underwater city, and into the diabolical clutches of a maniacal kingpin and his criminal army.', 'In the future, the threat of global takeover by cyborg units has forced Earth to outlaw their use. But when four female androids are smuggled to Earth, Jack Ford is assigned to track them down. An adventurous chase takes him from the mean streets of Phoenix to the depths of New Angeles, an underwater city, and into the diabolical clutches of a maniacal kingpin and his criminal army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uKSvQFvvlv2rDmpPCQjAG4jqxF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29890'),
  ('160175289648915585', 'Cyborg', 1989, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Albert Pyun, Philip Alan Waters, Barbara D''Alessandro', 'Albert Pyun', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Deborah Richter, Vincent Klyn, Alex Daniels, Ralf Moeller, Dayle Haddon, Blaise Loong, Haley Peterson', 'R', 'A martial artist hunts a killer in a plague-infested urban dump of the future.', 'A martial artist hunts a killer in a plague-infested urban dump of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwzRUC6inDraeIQD8f0FYteSonL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10134'),
  ('266095696669901963', 'Cyborg 009 vs. Devilman', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Jun Kawagoe', 'Tadashi Hayakawa', 'Jun Fukuyama, Shintaro Asanuma, Haruka Shiraishi, Tomoaki Maeno, Mao Ichimichi, Hiroki Touchi, Tsuyoshi Koyama, Yu Mizushima', null, 'After discovering that demonic hordes threaten Japan, the cyborgs led by Dr. Gilmore encounter Devilman, a powerful demon who appears to be an ally of Black Ghost, an evil terrorist organization.', 'After discovering that demonic hordes threaten Japan, the cyborgs led by Dr. Gilmore encounter Devilman, a powerful demon who appears to be an ally of Black Ghost, an evil terrorist organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzDvVYNnb1eMSByhw9EPO0XciPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387626'),
  ('576132483030552895', 'Cyborg 2', 1993, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Michael Schroeder, Jamie Thompson, Kelly Schroeder', 'Michael Schroeder, Ron Yanover, Mark Geldman', 'Elias Koteas, Angelina Jolie, Jack Palance, Billy Drago, Karen Sheperd, Allen Garfield, Ric Young, Renee Griffin', 'R', 'In the year 2074, the cybernetics market is dominated by two rival companies: USA''s Pinwheel Robotics and Japan''s Kobayashi Electronics. Cyborgs are commonplace, used for anything from soldiers to prostitutes. Casella Reese is a prototype cyborg developed for corporate espionage and assassination. She is filled with a liquid explosive called Glass Shadow. Pinwheel plans to eliminate the entire Kobayashi board of directors by using Casella', 'In the year 2074, the cybernetics market is dominated by two rival companies: USA''s Pinwheel Robotics and Japan''s Kobayashi Electronics. Cyborgs are commonplace, used for anything from soldiers to prostitutes. Casella Reese is a prototype cyborg developed for corporate espionage and assassination. She is filled with a liquid explosive called Glass Shadow. Pinwheel plans to eliminate the entire Kobayashi board of directors by using Casella', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hYNJ4KNMVaVgR5JAqC5qlgbJEmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16437'),
  ('935377987105913249', 'Cyborg 2087', 1966, 'Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Franklin Adreon, Alan Stensvold', 'Arthur C. Pierce', 'Michael Rennie, Karen Steele, Wendell Corey, Warren Stevens, Eduard Franz, Harry Carey, Jr., Adam Roarke, Chubby Johnson', 'NR', 'In the future world of the year 2087, freedom of thought is illegal and the thoughts of the world''s populations are controlled by the government. A small band of "free thinkers" send a cyborg back in time to the year 1966 to prevent a scientist from making the breakthrough that will eventually lead to the mass thought control of the future. Our time traveler soon discovers he is not alone when government agents from the future try to prevent him from carrying out his mission.', 'In the future world of the year 2087, freedom of thought is illegal and the thoughts of the world''s populations are controlled by the government. A small band of "free thinkers" send a cyborg back in time to the year 1966 to prevent a scientist from making the breakthrough that will eventually lead to the mass thought control of the future. Our time traveler soon discovers he is not alone when government agents from the future try to prevent him from carrying out his mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cky33CKcd0iWtMYjdEKLKS7CQ9H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61031'),
  ('49304620405440013', 'Cyborg 3: The Recycler', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Schroeder, Phil Parmet, Todd Pike', 'Troy Bolotnick, Barry Victor', 'Zach Galligan, Khrystyne Haje, Richard Lynch, Andrew Bryniarski, Malcolm McDowell, Michael Bailey Smith, Evan Lurie, Bill Quinn', 'NR', 'Prepare yourself for the all too deadly future. Cash, the heroine of Cyborg 2, is living safe in the free zone. But not for long. Biomechanical problems are taking down her systems and a visit to a doctor in Silica confirms her worst fears. She is more then a marvel of cyborg technology. She is the first of her kind to become a creator-she is pregnant.', 'Prepare yourself for the all too deadly future. Cash, the heroine of Cyborg 2, is living safe in the free zone. But not for long. Biomechanical problems are taking down her systems and a visit to a doctor in Silica confirms her worst fears. She is more then a marvel of cyborg technology. She is the first of her kind to become a creator-she is pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjMV4kkkPQrq1lGJ8cHR3GQNfxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25391'),
  ('533937003425956437', 'Cyborg Cop', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Sam Firstenberg, Yossi Wein', 'Glenn A. Bruce, Greg Latter', 'David Bradley, John Rhys-Davies, Todd Jensen, Alonna Shaw, Ron Smerczak, Rufus Swart, Anthony Fridjhon, Robert Whitehead', null, 'Ex-DEA agent Jack receives an emergency message from his brother Phillip, whose team was ambushed on the Caribbean island of St. Keith. Jack goes to St. Keith to find his brother, who has been turned into a cyborg by the drug runner he was after.', 'Ex-DEA agent Jack receives an emergency message from his brother Phillip, whose team was ambushed on the Caribbean island of St. Keith. Jack goes to St. Keith to find his brother, who has been turned into a cyborg by the drug runner he was after.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imTBB3Q2dr5tZsKkbmlkYaoDBrP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73587'),
  ('137170915858587086', 'Cyborg Cop II', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Sam Firstenberg', 'Jon Stevens', 'David Bradley, Morgan Hunter, Jill Pierce, Victor Melleney, Douglas Bristow, Dale Cutts, Adrian Waldron, Hector Rabotabi', 'R', 'Jack, a cop, loses his partner to a crazed terrorist during a hostage rescue sending the man to death row. What Jack doesn''t know is that the terrorist will be taken and turned into a cyborg for the "Anti-Terrorist Group".', 'Jack, a cop, loses his partner to a crazed terrorist during a hostage rescue sending the man to death row. What Jack doesn''t know is that the terrorist will be taken and turned into a cyborg for the "Anti-Terrorist Group".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGcE6wnsK3zNEQqVtNTfnQmNSlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64160'),
  ('949625453049419304', 'Cyborg Cop III', 1995, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Yossi Wein, Rod Stewart', 'Jeff Albert, Dennis Dimster', 'Bryan Genesse, Frank Zagarino, Jenny McShane, Justin Illusion, Michael Brunner, Hal Orlandini, Ian Yule, Jurgen Hellberg', 'R', 'A cop tries to stop a scientist''s experiments to turn students into cyborg-mercenaries.', 'A cop tries to stop a scientist''s experiments to turn students into cyborg-mercenaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7p1ReBzef8Lmnl6TBzpB8cST1v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64161'),
  ('116539087223586186', 'Cyborg She', 2008, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Kwak Jae-yong, Daiji Masumoto, Junichiro Hayashi', 'Kwak Jae-yong', 'Haruka Ayase, Keisuke Koide, Risa Ai, Yoshikazu Ebisu, Kenichi Endo, Kenta Kiritani, Masatô Ibu, Fumiyo Kohinata', 'PG-13', 'A lonely university student develops a romance with a beautiful interesting woman, who turns out to be a cyborg from the future.', 'A lonely university student develops a romance with a beautiful interesting woman, who turns out to be a cyborg from the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kt2wjQjJqTh15IRirPOBByFVAEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19486'),
  ('1141882101175947616', 'Cyborg X', 2016, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action', 'Benjamin Hole, Joshua Moroni Watso, Kevin King', 'Kevin King', 'Eve Mauro, Danny Trejo, Jake Stormoen, Adam Johnson, Angie Papanikolas, Rocky Myers, Chalet Lizette Brannan, Jill Adler', 'NR', 'After X-Corp, a radical weapons manufacturer, is taken over by a Cyber Virus, a group of survivors must fight to save humanity from the army of Machines the Virus now controls.', 'After X-Corp, a radical weapons manufacturer, is taken over by a Cyber Virus, a group of survivors must fight to save humanity from the army of Machines the Virus now controls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7py7DuHIYJx2a0Pp5JMyaK3OYtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:397873'),
  ('913468698506186605', 'Cyborgs', 2017, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Akhtem Seitablaiev, Yurii Korol', 'Nataliia Vorozhbyt', 'Viacheslav Dovzhenko, Makar Tykhomyrov, Andrii Isaienko, Viktor Zhdanov, Oleksandr Piskunov, Kostiantyn Temliak, Roman Semysal, Natalia Moseychuk', null, '‘The Cyborgs’ is re-telling the recent history of Ukraine – the legendary fight for Donetsk Airport in 2014 during Russian invasion. The freedom fighters from various divisions of Ukrainian army and volunteer battalions took a 242-days stand against the Russian backed militants until the complete destruction of the airport’s terminal.', '‘The Cyborgs’ is re-telling the recent history of Ukraine – the legendary fight for Donetsk Airport in 2014 during Russian invasion. The freedom fighters from various divisions of Ukrainian army and volunteer battalions took a 242-days stand against the Russian backed militants until the complete destruction of the airport’s terminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xa0xgL5ykFThoJRVE91W2EYWKoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484936'),
  ('988898204560085817', 'Cycle of Time', 2025, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Vinciane Millereau, Philippe Guibert, Charlotte Cristin', 'Vinciane Millereau, Julien Lambroschini', 'Elsa Zylberstein, Didier Bourdon, Mathilde Le Borgne, Céline Fuhrer, Maxim Foster, Aurore Clément, Didier Flamand, Romain Cottard', null, 'In 1950s France, Helene and Michel lead a simple life until a freak accident in 2025 leads to Helene becoming a bank executive and Michel struggling with unemployment and depression. Their children grow up in a technology-dominated world.', 'In 1950s France, Helene and Michel lead a simple life until a freak accident in 2025 leads to Helene becoming a bank executive and Michel struggling with unemployment and depression. Their children grow up in a technology-dominated world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63QJSYPjR3i3mwr4PmpvwfyLgDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1284496'),
  ('493271746563553660', 'Cycle Vixens', 1978, 'Drama, Action', 'John Arnold, Peter Perry Jr.', 'John Arnold', 'Loraine Ferris, Daphne Lawrence, Deborah Marcus, Lonnie Pense, Kevin O''Neill, Bee Lechat, Billy Bullet, Lee Blankenship', 'R', 'Three Colorado girls decide to hop on their motorcycles and head to California. On the way they get mixed up in drugs, rape and stolen motorcycles.', 'Three Colorado girls decide to hop on their motorcycles and head to California. On the way they get mixed up in drugs, rape and stolen motorcycles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJOGtbqVPUf7XolZt2ci1Nry8Vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38211'),
  ('756151410541076341', 'Cycling the Frame', 1988, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Cynthia Beatt, Diethelm Trapp', 'Cynthia Beatt', 'Tilda Swinton', null, 'In 1988, Tilda Swinton toured round the Berlin Wall on a bicycle - starting and ending at the Brandenburg Gate - accompanied by filmmaker Cynthia Beatt. As Swinton travels through fields and historic neighborhoods, past lakes and massive concrete apartment buildings, the Wall is a constant presence.', 'In 1988, Tilda Swinton toured round the Berlin Wall on a bicycle - starting and ending at the Brandenburg Gate - accompanied by filmmaker Cynthia Beatt. As Swinton travels through fields and historic neighborhoods, past lakes and massive concrete apartment buildings, the Wall is a constant presence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ24PdLK0J9NTPrhapxe5GP2fzu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261369'),
  ('231768924077727468', 'Cycling with Molière', 2013, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Philippe Le Guay, Jean-Claude Larrieu', 'Philippe Le Guay', 'Fabrice Luchini, Lambert Wilson, Maya Sansa, Camille Japy, Ged Marlon, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Annie Mercier, Christine Murillo', null, 'Serge Tanneur is at the pinnacle of his acting career when he decides to turn his back on show business and become a hermit living off of France’s Atlantic coast. Three years later, Gauthier Valence, a beloved TV actor, shows up on the island to offer Serge a role in his directorial debut – a rendition of Molière’s classic play, “The Misanthrope”. Serge refuses at first, but then suggests that they rehearse the first scene and after five days he’ll decide if he wants to dothe play or not. What ensues is a battle of brawn and wits and peculiar encounters with a hotel maid who longs to be a pornstar and an Italian divorcée.', 'Serge Tanneur is at the pinnacle of his acting career when he decides to turn his back on show business and become a hermit living off of France’s Atlantic coast. Three years later, Gauthier Valence, a beloved TV actor, shows up on the island to offer Serge a role in his directorial debut – a rendition of Molière’s classic play, “The Misanthrope”. Serge refuses at first, but then suggests that they rehearse the first scene and after five days he’ll decide if he wants to dothe play or not. What ensues is a battle of brawn and wits and peculiar encounters with a hotel maid who longs to be a pornstar and an Italian divorcée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ao4KVqDGpJvraAurV1mZXbPUKNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156236'),
  ('745158253175976832', 'Cyclo', 1995, 'Drama, Crime', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Benoît Delhomme, Jean-Michel Simonet', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Le Van Loc, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Như Quỳnh, Hoàng Phúc, Ngo Quang Hai, Tuyết Ngân, Doan Viet Ha, Bjuhoang Huy', 'R', 'Follows a young cyclo driver on his poverty-driven descent into criminality in modern-day Ho Chi Minh City. The boy''s struggles to scratch out a living for his two sisters and grandfather in the mean streets of the city lead to petty crime on behalf of a mysterious Madame from whom he rents his cyclo.', 'Follows a young cyclo driver on his poverty-driven descent into criminality in modern-day Ho Chi Minh City. The boy''s struggles to scratch out a living for his two sisters and grandfather in the mean streets of the city lead to petty crime on behalf of a mysterious Madame from whom he rents his cyclo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdOsnSVTLwHMEH1juOLMiwXcO5o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36266'),
  ('1104575011047782854', 'Cyclone', 1978, 'Horror', 'René Cardona Jr., Américo Fernández, León Sánchez', 'René Cardona Jr., Carlos Valdemar', 'Arthur Kennedy, Carroll Baker, Lionel Stander, Andrés García, Hugo Stiglitz, Mario Almada, Olga Karlatos, Stefania D''Amario', 'PG-13', 'An airplane goes down in the ocean during a storm and a few survivors find refuge on a small tour boat. Swept out to sea, these people slowly starve to death in the hot sun with barely any food or clean water. With no place to turn, the boat survivors resort to cannibalism to stay alive...that is ..until the rescue planes come to pick them up and the man eating sharks decide its time to eat as well.', 'An airplane goes down in the ocean during a storm and a few survivors find refuge on a small tour boat. Swept out to sea, these people slowly starve to death in the hot sun with barely any food or clean water. With no place to turn, the boat survivors resort to cannibalism to stay alive...that is ..until the rescue planes come to pick them up and the man eating sharks decide its time to eat as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xeJ4qtyJHMCl4s4alGDO41WczC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42202'),
  ('886793480624446810', 'Cyclone', 1987, 'Action, Thriller', 'Fred Olen Ray, Paul Elliott, Richard Oswald', 'Paul Garson', 'Heather Thomas, Jeffrey Combs, Ashley Ferrare, Dar Robinson, Martine Beswick, Robert Quarry, Martin Landau, Huntz Hall', 'R', 'Rick has developed the ultimate motorcycle, the Cyclone. It is a $5 million bike equipped with rocket launchers and laser guns. Rick meets his fate and it is up to his girlfriend Teri to keep the Cyclone from falling into the wrong hands. Teri can trust no one but herself.', 'Rick has developed the ultimate motorcycle, the Cyclone. It is a $5 million bike equipped with rocket launchers and laser guns. Rick meets his fate and it is up to his girlfriend Teri to keep the Cyclone from falling into the wrong hands. Teri can trust no one but herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9H2XnNehu3bGZyAvtd9RUzAdDT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81573'),
  ('548134706108369363', 'Cyclops', 2008, 'TV Movie, Action, Fantasy', 'Declan O''Brien, Emil Topuzov, Techi Stefan Janev', 'Frances Doel', 'Eric Roberts, Kevin Stapleton, Frida Farrell, Craig Archibald, Mike Straub, John Laskowski, Hristo Mitzkov, Dan Golden', null, 'The corrupt Emperor Tiberius forces his bravest general, Marcus, to subdue the monstrous Cyclops that has been decimating the countryside...', 'The corrupt Emperor Tiberius forces his bravest general, Marcus, to subdue the monstrous Cyclops that has been decimating the countryside...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPGmwuZ2TZ52NssmIXRnV6b6llf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41550'),
  ('991799598999667265', 'Cymbeline', 2014, 'Drama', 'Michael Almereyda, Tim Orr, Amy Lynn', 'Michael Almereyda', 'Ed Harris, Dakota Johnson, Milla Jovovich, Ethan Hawke, Penn Badgley, Anton Yelchin, Bill Pullman, John Leguizamo', 'R', 'War erupts between dirty cops and outlaw bikers as a drug kingpin tries to protect his empire.', 'War erupts between dirty cops and outlaw bikers as a drug kingpin tries to protect his empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uNajzrrYttWofGj3zu672J3NUbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240745'),
  ('1073572931955131839', 'Cynara', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'King Vidor, Ray June, Alfred Newman', 'Lynn Starling, Frances Marion', 'Ronald Colman, Kay Francis, Phyllis Barry, Henry Stephenson, Viva Tattersall, Florine McKinney, Clarissa Selwynne, Paul Porcasi', null, 'A London barrister''s marriage is under strain after his affair with a shopgirl who is out to have him. The story is told in flashback.', 'A London barrister''s marriage is under strain after his affair with a shopgirl who is out to have him. The story is told in flashback.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4MXPZMoT7oac7uXHaLTfOAXc2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183650'),
  ('1000990534686952873', 'Cynthia todavía tiene las llaves', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gonzalo Tobal, Lucas Gaynor', 'Gonzalo Tobal', 'María Villar', null, 'Cynthia takes us through the rooms of her ex-boyfriend''s house, while she carries out her plan.', 'Cynthia takes us through the rooms of her ex-boyfriend''s house, while she carries out her plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6Mv0mzFk9VZl4ttYRY38asgUHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:729066'),
  ('8599131376489412', 'Cypher', 2002, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Vincenzo Natali, Derek Rogers', 'Brian King', 'Jeremy Northam, Kristina Nicoll, Nigel Bennett, Kari Matchett, Lucy Liu, Timothy Webber, David Hewlett, Joseph Scoren', 'R', 'An unsuspecting, disenchanted man finds himself working as a spy in the dangerous, high-stakes world of corporate espionage. Quickly getting way over-his-head, he teams up with a mysterious femme fatale.', 'An unsuspecting, disenchanted man finds himself working as a spy in the dangerous, high-stakes world of corporate espionage. Quickly getting way over-his-head, he teams up with a mysterious femme fatale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wYwmDuCbdKF7sAcLj7eqrNaiam.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10133'),
  ('21418343309068220', 'Cyprien', 2009, 'Comedy', 'David Charhon, Antoine Roch', 'Romain Lévy, Benjamin Guedj, Élie Semoun', 'Élie Semoun, Léa Drucker, Laurent Stocker, Vincent Desagnat, Elisa Tovati, Catherine Deneuve, Mouloud Achour, Élise Otzenberger', null, 'Thirty-five years old and still a virgin, Cyprien is a shy, awkward young man until he discovers a magic deodorant that will transform him into a gorgeous and irresistible creature.', 'Thirty-five years old and still a virgin, Cyprien is a shy, awkward young man until he discovers a magic deodorant that will transform him into a gorgeous and irresistible creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jWl1U5rAPZtYDrLTjIVTepiJsMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15439'),
  ('843021948144020788', 'Cyrano', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Seamus McGarvey, Elaine Kusmishko, Gianpaolo Rifino', 'Erica Schmidt', 'Peter Dinklage, Haley Bennett, Kelvin Harrison Jr., Ben Mendelsohn, Monica Dolan, Bashir Salahuddin, Joshua James, Anjana Vasan', 'PG-13', 'A man ahead of his time, Cyrano de Bergerac dazzles whether with ferocious wordplay at a verbal joust or with brilliant swordplay in a duel. But, convinced that his appearance renders him unworthy of the love of a devoted friend, the luminous Roxanne, Cyrano has yet to declare his feelings for her—and Roxanne has fallen in love, at first sight, with Christian.', 'A man ahead of his time, Cyrano de Bergerac dazzles whether with ferocious wordplay at a verbal joust or with brilliant swordplay in a duel. But, convinced that his appearance renders him unworthy of the love of a devoted friend, the luminous Roxanne, Cyrano has yet to declare his feelings for her—and Roxanne has fallen in love, at first sight, with Christian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e4koV8iC2cCM57bqUnEnIL2a2zH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730047'),
  ('950447413804195357', 'Cyrano Agency', 2010, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kim Hyun-seok, Kim Woo-hyung, Kim Seung-gyu', 'Kim Hyun-seok', 'Uhm Tae-woong, Lee Min-jung, Choi Daniel, Park Shin-hye, Park Cheol-min, Jeon Min-Joon, Song Sae-byuk, Ryu Hyun-kyung', null, 'The Cyrano Agency is a dating agency which helps people who can''t date to have a love life. The agency staff try helping their clients without being noticed. The agency''s representatives Byeong-hoon and Min-yeong are giving their best to pair up their client, Sang-yong, with his love interest named Hee-joong. But when Byeong-hun sees Hee-joong''s profile, he begins to doubt their abilities. Will "Cyrano Agency" succeed in their mission?', 'The Cyrano Agency is a dating agency which helps people who can''t date to have a love life. The agency staff try helping their clients without being noticed. The agency''s representatives Byeong-hoon and Min-yeong are giving their best to pair up their client, Sang-yong, with his love interest named Hee-joong. But when Byeong-hun sees Hee-joong''s profile, he begins to doubt their abilities. Will "Cyrano Agency" succeed in their mission?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twx3c3SYYvpkuKOpZ57yfodNr0f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53514'),
  ('1068250438289899597', 'Cyrano and d''Artagnan', 1964, 'Adventure', 'Abel Gance, Otello Martelli', 'Abel Gance', 'José Ferrer, Jean-Pierre Cassel, Sylva Koscina, Daliah Lavi, Philippe Noiret, Michel Simon, Gabrielle Dorziat, Rafael Rivelles', null, 'Duelist and poet Cyrano de Bergerac and musketeer d''Artagnan meet and team up to stop the conspiracy against King Louis XIII of France.', 'Duelist and poet Cyrano de Bergerac and musketeer d''Artagnan meet and team up to stop the conspiracy against King Louis XIII of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTi58bNHMj3QUZljgiEsP9FtLh5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138642'),
  ('863736682642414587', 'Cyrano de Bergerac', 1900, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Clément Maurice', null, 'Benoit Constant Coquelin', null, 'Considered the first motion picture to employ both color and sound, the only film record ever made of the original star of Rostand''s famous play performing a scene from his most famous role. It is accompanied by a sound-on-cylinder recording of Coquelin''s voice reciting one of Cyrano''s speeches.', 'Considered the first motion picture to employ both color and sound, the only film record ever made of the original star of Rostand''s famous play performing a scene from his most famous role. It is accompanied by a sound-on-cylinder recording of Coquelin''s voice reciting one of Cyrano''s speeches.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwC2JXjXMzZQg8CyICmliEGJszK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195635'),
  ('1079137574101192273', 'Cyrano de Bergerac', 1950, 'Romance, Drama, Adventure', 'Michael Gordon, Dimitri Tiomkin, Ivan Volkman', 'Carl Foreman', 'José Ferrer, Mala Powers, William Prince, Morris Carnovsky, Ralph Clanton, Lloyd Corrigan, Virginia Farmer, Edgar Barrier', 'NR', 'France, 1640. Cyrano, the charismatic swordsman-poet with the absurd nose, hopelessly loves the beauteous Roxane; she, in turn, confesses to Cyrano her love for the handsome but tongue-tied Christian. The chivalrous Cyrano sets up with Christian an innocent deception, with tragic results.', 'France, 1640. Cyrano, the charismatic swordsman-poet with the absurd nose, hopelessly loves the beauteous Roxane; she, in turn, confesses to Cyrano her love for the handsome but tongue-tied Christian. The chivalrous Cyrano sets up with Christian an innocent deception, with tragic results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4JFOXslwb90opz8xozfIhPke8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43386'),
  ('445035276338845571', 'Cyrano de Bergerac', 1990, 'Drama, Comedy, History, Romance', 'Thierry Chabert, Romain Brémond, Pierre Lhomme', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Gérard Depardieu, Anne Brochet, Vincent Perez, Jacques Weber, Roland Bertin, Philippe Morier-Genoud, Pierre Maguelon, Josiane Stoléru', 'PG-13', 'Famed swordsman and poet Cyrano de Bergerac is in love with his cousin Roxane. He has never expressed his love for her as he his large nose undermines his self-confidence. Then he finds a way to express his love to her, indirectly.', 'Famed swordsman and poet Cyrano de Bergerac is in love with his cousin Roxane. He has never expressed his love for her as he his large nose undermines his self-confidence. Then he finds a way to express his love to her, indirectly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80XJ5UkGuYTKDuALeG03BLk1OT1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11673'),
  ('754136855350850350', 'Cyrano, My Love', 2018, 'Comedy, History', 'Alexis Michalik, Bruno Amestoy, Giovanni Fiore Coltellacci', 'Alexis Michalik', 'Thomas Solivérès, Olivier Gourmet, Mathilde Seigner, Tom Leeb, Lucie Boujenah, Alice de Lencquesaing, Clémentine Célarié, Igor Gotesman', 'R', 'Paris, France, December 1897. The young playwright Edmond Rostand feels like a failure. Inspiration has abandoned him. Married and father of two children, desperate and penniless, he persuades the great actor Constant Coquelin to perform the main role in his new play. But there is a problem: Coquelin wants to premiere it at Christmas and Edmond has not written a single word.', 'Paris, France, December 1897. The young playwright Edmond Rostand feels like a failure. Inspiration has abandoned him. Married and father of two children, desperate and penniless, he persuades the great actor Constant Coquelin to perform the main role in his new play. But there is a problem: Coquelin wants to premiere it at Christmas and Edmond has not written a single word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Y1VxSfJdu8fqQqgX0x6OObxvUw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544510'),
  ('36650809687772643', 'Cyrus', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass, Jas Shelton', 'Mark Duplass, Jay Duplass', 'John C. Reilly, Jonah Hill, Marisa Tomei, Catherine Keener, Matt Walsh, Kathy Ann Wittes, Diane Mizota, Katie Aselton', 'R', 'With John''s social life at a standstill and his ex-wife about to get remarried, a down on his luck divorcée finally meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover she has another man in her life - her son. Before long, the two are locked in a battle of wits for the woman they both love-and it appears only one man can be left standing when it''s over.', 'With John''s social life at a standstill and his ex-wife about to get remarried, a down on his luck divorcée finally meets the woman of his dreams, only to discover she has another man in her life - her son. Before long, the two are locked in a battle of wits for the woman they both love-and it appears only one man can be left standing when it''s over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkJ0rB1qf62TJ6thxEVRT7Eccqn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39053'),
  ('678766607487008222', 'Cyst', 2020, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Norah Alrowaitea, Blake Stowe, Tyler Russell', 'Andy Silverman, Tyler Russell', 'Eva Habermann, George Hardy, Greg Sestero, Jason Douglas, Gene Jones, Darren Ewing, Torren Davis, Terri Merritt Bennett', 'NR', 'In the 1960s, a nurse''s last day on her job is ruined when a doctor inadvertently creates a cyst monster that terrorizes the office.', 'In the 1960s, a nurse''s last day on her job is ruined when a doctor inadvertently creates a cyst monster that terrorizes the office.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nJwS765eHzCb5M8BTT2sl0lxxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741592'),
  ('582027195298605066', 'Czech Dream', 2004, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Filip Remunda, Vít Klusák', null, 'Varhan Orchestrovič Bauer, Jaromír Kalina , Vít Klusák, Martin Přikryl, Filip Remunda, Eva Williams, Alexander Hemala', null, 'Two students from the Czech Film Academy commission a leading advertising agency to organize a huge campaign for the opening of a new supermarket named Czech Dream. The supermarket however does not exist and is not meant to. The advertising campaign includes radio and television ads, posters, flyers with photos of fake Czech Dream products, a promotional song, an internet site, and ads in newspapers and magazines. Will people believe in it and show up for the grand opening?', 'Two students from the Czech Film Academy commission a leading advertising agency to organize a huge campaign for the opening of a new supermarket named Czech Dream. The supermarket however does not exist and is not meant to. The advertising campaign includes radio and television ads, posters, flyers with photos of fake Czech Dream products, a promotional song, an internet site, and ads in newspapers and magazines. Will people believe in it and show up for the grand opening?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnmdNDHtCYwoBDOi3NPwnXPc8Xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33916'),
  ('990233663835607285', 'Czechoslovakia 1968', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Robert M. Fresco, Denis Sanders', null, 'Leonid Brezhnev, Neville Chamberlain, Alexander Dubček, Adolf Hitler, Ludvík Svoboda', null, 'Short documentary about 50 years of history of Czechoslovakia, with archive images.', 'Short documentary about 50 years of history of Czechoslovakia, with archive images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPGWGNfzh6QIhu2FwSPz5ynp31F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154645'),
  ('790104664012288373', 'D', 2005, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Vishram Sawant, Srikanth Naroj', 'Manish Gupta', 'Randeep Hooda, Chunky Panday, Rukhsar Rehman, Isha Koppikar, Sushant Singh, Yashpal Sharma, Goga Kapoor, Zakir Hussain', null, 'Deshu, a mechanic from Dubai, comes home to Mumbai, and gets embroiled in a crime by accident. The film shows his meteoric rise from common, law-abiding man to underworld kingpin.', 'Deshu, a mechanic from Dubai, comes home to Mumbai, and gets embroiled in a crime by accident. The film shows his meteoric rise from common, law-abiding man to underworld kingpin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDL3RikOCwbH6qEUtVHr7HJ6PFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97361'),
  ('636594433867496365', 'D Is for Distance', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Chris Petit, Emma Matthews, Jussi Eerola', 'Chris Petit', 'Jodhi May, Louis Petit', null, 'A film essay montage of contemporary footage, archive and cinema history, about the age of post-truth and how one young man''s childhood epilepsy became representative of the woes of the world and how he triumphed against adversity.', 'A film essay montage of contemporary footage, archive and cinema history, about the age of post-truth and how one young man''s childhood epilepsy became representative of the woes of the world and how he triumphed against adversity.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7HSoksSOVKIG4v0QRwzSRsmCwP3.jpg', 'plex:movie:d-is-for-distance-2026'),
  ('1101678854479189267', 'D-Day', 2000, 'TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Søren Kragh-Jacobsen, Lars von Trier, Thomas Vinterberg', null, 'Nicolaj Kopernikus, Charlotte Sachs Bostrup, Dejan Čukić, Jesper Asholt, Helle Dolleris, Louise Mieritz, Klaus Bondam, Thomas Bo Larsen', null, 'Four people plan to rob a bank on new year''s eve, when no one will notice because of the celebrations.', 'Four people plan to rob a bank on new year''s eve, when no one will notice because of the celebrations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Yz0MtdZy4B1qwGrrI978jt4Sbp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55178'),
  ('1093649467259774292', 'D-Day', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Nikkhil Advani, Tushar Kanti Ray, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Ritesh Shah, Suresh Nair, Nikkhil Advani', 'Irrfan Khan, Arjun Rampal, Rishi Kapoor, Huma Qureshi, Imran Hasnee, Aakash Dahiya, Chandan Roy Sanyal, Shruti Haasan', null, 'Four Indian agents spend nine years under cover to track down India''s most wanted criminal.', 'Four Indian agents spend nine years under cover to track down India''s most wanted criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2pizfhonKPTWdB4OC49qJWbBqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206851'),
  ('1091186824096314295', 'D-Day 6.6.1944', 2004, 'Documentary, War', 'Richard Dale', 'Andrew Bampfield', 'Ian Holm, Lacy Moore, Graham McTavish, Albert Welling, Tim Bentinck, Robert Cambrinus, Andrew Havill, Tom Brooke', null, 'On June 6th, 1944 the largest military invasion and defence the world has ever seen occurred. D-Day tells the epic story of the preparation and execution of the Allied invasion of Normandy. It tells the story of the defence of the Western Front by the forces of the German Empire, and of the complex and deadly secret war fought by the men and women of France and mainland Europe. D-Day brings to life the dramatic and astounding tales of courage and sacrifice, joy and despair, love and betrayal. The planning for the Allied invasion on June 6th 1944 took two years and cost thousands of lives. It involved a deception of breathtaking audacity. Both the preparation leading up to and the actions and events on the day itself relied on the absolute discretion of many and the genius and nerve of a few. D-Day examines the intricate jigsaw from both sides - presenting events through the eyes of the men and women who were there, telling their extraordinary stories.', 'On June 6th, 1944 the largest military invasion and defence the world has ever seen occurred. D-Day tells the epic story of the preparation and execution of the Allied invasion of Normandy. It tells the story of the defence of the Western Front by the forces of the German Empire, and of the complex and deadly secret war fought by the men and women of France and mainland Europe. D-Day brings to life the dramatic and astounding tales of courage and sacrifice, joy and despair, love and betrayal. The planning for the Allied invasion on June 6th 1944 took two years and cost thousands of lives. It involved a deception of breathtaking audacity. Both the preparation leading up to and the actions and events on the day itself relied on the absolute discretion of many and the genius and nerve of a few. D-Day examines the intricate jigsaw from both sides - presenting events through the eyes of the men and women who were there, telling their extraordinary stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uhIYT71bpcEPQuhlN5BXdx9Zbk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67050'),
  ('103106670569824454', 'D-Day the Sixth of June', 1956, 'War, Drama, Romance', 'Henry Koster, Lee Garmes', 'Ivan Moffat, Harry Brown', 'Robert Taylor, Richard Todd, Dana Wynter, Edmond O''Brien, John Williams, Jerry Paris, Robert Gist, Richard Wyler', 'NR', 'En route to Normandy, an American and a British officer reminisce in flashback about their romances with the same woman.', 'En route to Normandy, an American and a British officer reminisce in flashback about their romances with the same woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghPpTqMNDYxexeuxPlc10aWIvot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64129'),
  ('685648742522832271', 'D-Railed', 2018, 'Horror', 'John Lazear, Saiah Galarza, Dale Fabrigar', 'Dale Fabrigar, Suzanne DeLaurentiis, Everette Wallin', 'Carter Scott, Shae Smolik, Everette Wallin, Logan Coffey, Leticia LaBelle, Brie Mattson, Tonya Kay, Jack Betts', 'NR', 'Passengers on a murder mystery train that crashes into a river must decide whether to risk waiting for help in the wreckage or take their chances in the murky depths below.', 'Passengers on a murder mystery train that crashes into a river must decide whether to risk waiting for help in the wreckage or take their chances in the murky depths below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24GnXIwhkK95Kdz0KkTWeepA6El.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551238'),
  ('148621325194053574', 'D-Tox', 2002, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Jim Gillespie, Dean Semler, J. Stephen Buck', 'Ron L. Brinkerhoff', 'Sylvester Stallone, Polly Walker, Charles S. Dutton, Kris Kristofferson, Christopher Fulford, Jeffrey Wright, Courtney B. Vance, Robert Patrick', 'R', 'A disgraced FBI agent with a drinking problem joins nine other troubled law enforcement officers at an isolated detox clinic in the wilds of Wyoming. But the therapeutic sanctuary becomes a nightmarish hellhole when a major snowstorm cuts off the clinic from the outside world and enables a killer on the inside to get busy.', 'A disgraced FBI agent with a drinking problem joins nine other troubled law enforcement officers at an isolated detox clinic in the wilds of Wyoming. But the therapeutic sanctuary becomes a nightmarish hellhole when a major snowstorm cuts off the clinic from the outside world and enables a killer on the inside to get busy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rn2Zu7zjOfNQCqQmqO7T1PDcBCq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10375'),
  ('1042800243359268878', 'D.A.R.Y.L.', 1985, 'Family, Science Fiction, Action', 'Simon Wincer, Frank Watts, Marcia Gay', 'Allan Scott, David Ambrose, Jeffrey Ellis', 'Barret Oliver, Mary Beth Hurt, Michael McKean, Kathryn Walker, Colleen Camp, Josef Sommer, Steve Ryan, Ron Frazier', 'PG', 'Daryl is a normal 10-year-old boy in many ways. However, unbeknown to his foster parents and friends, Daryl is actually a government-created robot with superhuman reflexes and mental abilities. Even his name has a hidden meaning -- it''s actually an acronym for Data Analyzing Robot Youth Life-form. When the organization that created him deems the "super soldier" experiment a failure and schedules Daryl to be disassembled, it is up to a few rogue scientists to help him escape.', 'Daryl is a normal 10-year-old boy in many ways. However, unbeknown to his foster parents and friends, Daryl is actually a government-created robot with superhuman reflexes and mental abilities. Even his name has a hidden meaning -- it''s actually an acronym for Data Analyzing Robot Youth Life-form. When the organization that created him deems the "super soldier" experiment a failure and schedules Daryl to be disassembled, it is up to a few rogue scientists to help him escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87huhTOQijJy0pLhusZfest1MoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16248'),
  ('119936484406695027', 'D.C Air Disaster: Final Minutes Revealed', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Peter Gauvain, Tim Jameson', null, 'Demetri Goritsas', 'TV-14', 'In January 2025, 67 people lost their lives when a passenger jet collided with a military helicopter over Washington, D.C. One year later, this program investigates the crash, asking what went wrong in the final minutes before the disaster.', 'In January 2025, 67 people lost their lives when a passenger jet collided with a military helicopter over Washington, D.C. One year later, this program investigates the crash, asking what went wrong in the final minutes before the disaster.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BNzlmYTI5ODItMDA0Mi00MmNkLWE3MTgtZWE5MDhiOWJkZjg1XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:d-c-air-disaster-final-minutes-revealed-2026'),
  ('432484479121619748', 'D.C. Cab', 1983, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Joel Schumacher, Dean Cundey', 'Topper Carew, Joel Schumacher', 'Mr. T, Max Gail, Adam Baldwin, Gary Busey, Bill Maher, Peter Paul, David Paul, Irene Cara', 'R', 'The tale of a hapless group of cabbies and a rundown cab company owned by Harold. Albert comes to town with a dream of starting his own cab company but needs to motivate Harold''s employees to want to make something out of themselves. It is only when Albert is kidnapped that the cabbies must decide whether or not they are loyal to Albert and his cause.', 'The tale of a hapless group of cabbies and a rundown cab company owned by Harold. Albert comes to town with a dream of starting his own cab company but needs to motivate Harold''s employees to want to make something out of themselves. It is only when Albert is kidnapped that the cabbies must decide whether or not they are loyal to Albert and his cause.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ToBZQaV5qspXjM8hat8kcbNcQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27679'),
  ('39730756232913264', 'D.C. Sniper: 23 Days of Fear', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Tom McLoughlin, Mark Wareham, Brian Whittred', 'Dave Erickson', 'Charles S. Dutton, Jay O. Sanders, Bobby Hosea, Helen Shaver, Tom O''Brien, Charlayne Woodard, Garwin Sanford, Trent Cameron', null, 'Based on the known events that shook the United States for 23 days in 2002. Within 24 hours six people were killed by a sniper in Maryland County. A man and his son get overlooked in all settings where shootings occur. The police, in cooperation with the FBI follows the wrong track of a white van, while the murderers act with impunity and panic seizes the population', 'Based on the known events that shook the United States for 23 days in 2002. Within 24 hours six people were killed by a sniper in Maryland County. A man and his son get overlooked in all settings where shootings occur. The police, in cooperation with the FBI follows the wrong track of a white van, while the murderers act with impunity and panic seizes the population', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wt9e6zLJ0mxIPoqG5rQbPCXoyd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10108'),
