  ('1074304683786935504', 'D.P.A. Detetives do Prédio Azul - O Filme', 2017, 'Family, Adventure, Mystery', 'Clara Machado, Julio Constantini, André Pellenz', 'Flávia Lins e Silva, L.G. Bayão', 'Letícia Braga, Anderson Lima, Pedro Motta, Letícia Pedro, Caio Manhente, Cauê Campos, Tamara Taxman, Ronaldo Reis', null, 'The Detetives do Prédio Azul are faced with the biggest case of their lives: saving the building itself from destruction. Pippo, Sol and Bento infiltrate Dona Leocádia''s party, the terrible manager who is literally a witch. There they witness a "magical" crime, which condemns the Blue Building to an emergency demolition.', 'The Detetives do Prédio Azul are faced with the biggest case of their lives: saving the building itself from destruction. Pippo, Sol and Bento infiltrate Dona Leocádia''s party, the terrible manager who is literally a witch. There they witness a "magical" crime, which condemns the Blue Building to an emergency demolition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ezEwZp2gUCfiT5STguLWNV4BYR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390867'),
  ('197939125781996113', 'D''Artagnan and the Three Musketeers', 2005, 'Adventure, Action', 'Pierre Aknine, Allen Smith', null, 'Emmanuelle Béart, Vincent Elbaz, Tchéky Karyo, Heino Ferch, Grégori Derangère, Grégory Gadebois, Stefania Rocca, Diana Amft', 'R', 'Exile and possibly death are in the cards for the Queen of France in this edgy cloak-and-dagger adventure based on Alexandre Dumas'' unrivaled tale of THE THREE MUSKETEERS and their reckless romantic friend D''Artagnan. Supernatural powers and dark mystical forces add an exciting twist to this classic tale.', 'Exile and possibly death are in the cards for the Queen of France in this edgy cloak-and-dagger adventure based on Alexandre Dumas'' unrivaled tale of THE THREE MUSKETEERS and their reckless romantic friend D''Artagnan. Supernatural powers and dark mystical forces add an exciting twist to this classic tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwk8yMUe5XbvbejiBJ6CQNNDUTr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119900'),
  ('1086632492675299695', 'D''Artagnan''s Daughter', 1994, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Patrick Blossier, Bertrand Tavernier, Tiffany Tavernier', 'Michel Léviant', 'Sophie Marceau, Philippe Noiret, Claude Rich, Sami Frey, Jean-Luc Bideau, Raoul Billerey, Charlotte Kady, Nils Tavernier', null, 'It is 1654, in the South of France. When horsemen follow a runaway slave into the convent where he''s taken sanctuary and kill both the fugitive and the Mother Superior, they little realise that one of the novices is the spirited daughter of retired musketeer D''Artagnan.', 'It is 1654, in the South of France. When horsemen follow a runaway slave into the convent where he''s taken sanctuary and kill both the fugitive and the Mother Superior, they little realise that one of the novices is the spirited daughter of retired musketeer D''Artagnan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxrzEpWLmNjkogpGXKR3BMlf3AV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10732'),
  ('639618662217490161', 'D@bbe: Curse of the Jinn', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Hasan Karacadağ, Serdar Özdemir, Nihan Kahraman', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Nil Günal, Ümit Bulent Dincer, Sultan Köroğlu Kılıç, Özbek Yıldız, Pelin Acar, Murat Seviş, Kubra Bayraktar, Elçin Atamgüç', null, 'Housewife Dilek suddenly starts to feel the presence of something abnormal in her house. Her husband Omer refuses to agree, and the situation worsens. The couple discover that an ancient paranormal creature called Jinn has cursed on Dilek. They seek a cure but instead they learn of Dilek''s demons.', 'Housewife Dilek suddenly starts to feel the presence of something abnormal in her house. Her husband Omer refuses to agree, and the situation worsens. The couple discover that an ancient paranormal creature called Jinn has cursed on Dilek. They seek a cure but instead they learn of Dilek''s demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTxE2jlADPgkgiaxDwBaus2evPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292828'),
