  ('696847295118941778', 'D@bbe: The Possession', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Nihan Kahraman, Hasan Karacadağ', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Cansu Kurgun, A. Murat Özgen, Irmak Örnek, Elçin Atamgüç, Sabriye Günüç, Sultan Köroğlu Kılıç, Orhan Gencer, Oguzhan Kocakli', null, 'Ahead of her wedding, Kübra is possessed by demons. When an examination reveals more horror, her friend, a psychiatrist, tries to perform an exorcism.', 'Ahead of her wedding, Kübra is possessed by demons. When an examination reveals more horror, her friend, a psychiatrist, tries to perform an exorcism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j537aN6h9w06VipRHqFHnuFB1Ef.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254712'),
  ('190951310649092308', 'D2: The Mighty Ducks', 1994, 'Comedy, Action, Family, Drama', 'Mark Irwin, Sam Weisman, Joel King', 'Steven Brill', 'Emilio Estevez, Kathryn Erbe, Michael Tucker, Jan Rubeš, Carsten Nørgaard, Joshua Jackson, María Ellingsen, Elden Henson', 'PG', 'After Gordon Bombay''s hockey comeback is cut short he is named coach of Team USA Hockey for the Junior Goodwill Games. Bombay reunites the Mighty Ducks and introduces a few new players, however, he finds himself distracted by his newfound fame and must regather if the Ducks are to defeat tournament favourites Iceland.', 'After Gordon Bombay''s hockey comeback is cut short he is named coach of Team USA Hockey for the Junior Goodwill Games. Bombay reunites the Mighty Ducks and introduces a few new players, however, he finds himself distracted by his newfound fame and must regather if the Ducks are to defeat tournament favourites Iceland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veGW1N6QUglP4osDdOUI6CZCcBI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11164'),
