  ('236174179678908655', 'Daaaaaalí!', 2024, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Marine Albert, Quentin Dupieux, Quentin Dupieux', 'Quentin Dupieux', 'Anaïs Demoustier, Gilles Lellouche, Édouard Baer, Jonathan Cohen, Pio Marmaï, Didier Flamand, Romain Duris, Agnès Hurstel', null, 'A young French journalist repeatedly meets iconic surrealist artist Salvador Dalí for a documentary project that never came to be.', 'A young French journalist repeatedly meets iconic surrealist artist Salvador Dalí for a documentary project that never came to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKMiUOT5rSWt7AJOhStuBpVeIUQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1045770'),
  ('797845906788795603', 'Daawat-e-Ishq', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Habib Faisal', 'Habib Faisal', 'Aditya Roy Kapur, Parineeti Chopra, Anupam Kher, Karan Wahi, Aziz Rizwan', 'PG', 'A deliciously romantic coming together of Gulrez “Gullu” Qadir a Hyderabadi shoe-sales girl disillusioned with love because of her encounters with dowry-seeking men; and Tariq “Taru” Haidar a Lucknawi cook who can charm anybody with the aroma and flavours of his biryani and kebabs.', 'A deliciously romantic coming together of Gulrez “Gullu” Qadir a Hyderabadi shoe-sales girl disillusioned with love because of her encounters with dowry-seeking men; and Tariq “Taru” Haidar a Lucknawi cook who can charm anybody with the aroma and flavours of his biryani and kebabs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIDcWsxYJTGVGkQ41fkaluvT3fZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291154'),
