  ('587795896202548699', 'Dabbe', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Hasan Karacadağ, Digba Ener, Digba Kurpjel', 'Hasan Karacadağ', 'Ebru Aykaç, Ümit Acar, Serdar Özer, Serhat Yiğit, Zeynep Hasdal Çolakoglu, Süha Tok, Murat Seviş, Kaan Girgin', null, 'A cruel suicide wave spreads from the United States to a small Turkish town, where a man kills himself after spending time on the computer. His friends are still getting disturbing emails from him.', 'A cruel suicide wave spreads from the United States to a small Turkish town, where a man kills himself after spending time on the computer. His friends are still getting disturbing emails from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1w3oxWGDPtEYAxqDZNgBNIfWvUW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75317'),
