  ('500800311030362997', 'Dachimawa Lee', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Western', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Cho Yong-kyu, Kwon Hyeok-jae', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Kwon Hyeok-jae', 'Im Won-hee, Gong Hyo-jin, Park Si-yeon, Hwang Bo-ra, Ryoo Seung-bum, Kim Su-hyun, Kim Roi-ha, An Kil-kang', null, 'Under Japanese imperialism, Korean national treasure Golden Buddha is stolen. More important to national security, the statue contains vital information concerning Korean freedom fighters and their whereabouts as well as their true identities. The interim Korean government appoints legendary Korean spy Agent Dachimawa Lee to recover the fabled statue and reveal the dark plot behind the theft.', 'Under Japanese imperialism, Korean national treasure Golden Buddha is stolen. More important to national security, the statue contains vital information concerning Korean freedom fighters and their whereabouts as well as their true identities. The interim Korean government appoints legendary Korean spy Agent Dachimawa Lee to recover the fabled statue and reveal the dark plot behind the theft.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pV0K3aamLwtLCIAkI9oeyemkFyH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19886'),
  ('845490370189819173', 'Dacoit', 2026, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Danush Bhaskar, Shaneil Deo, Kartikeya', 'Adivi Sesh, Shaneil Deo', 'Adivi Sesh, Mrunal Thakur, Anurag Kashyap, Prakash Raj, Sunil Varma, Zayn Marie Khan, Kamakshi Bhaskarla, Atul Kulkarni', null, 'A man is convicted for a crime he didn''t commit owing to a betrayal by his better half. He hunts her down seeking vengeance, as their stories intertwine with a series of robberies.', 'A man is convicted for a crime he didn''t commit owing to a betrayal by his better half. He hunts her down seeking vengeance, as their stories intertwine with a series of robberies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbrnJY7E0a9xxgj2cotNp6YI4dz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220522'),
  ('807218110043416530', 'Dad', 1989, 'Drama', 'Gary David Goldberg, Jan Kiesser', 'Gary David Goldberg', 'Jack Lemmon, Ted Danson, Ethan Hawke, Kevin Spacey, Olympia Dukakis, Kathy Baker, Zakes Mokae, J.T. Walsh', 'PG', 'A busy executive learns during a meeting that his mother may be dying and rushes home to her side. He ends up being his father''s caretaker and becomes closer to him than ever before. Estranged from his own son, the executive comes to realize what has been missing in his own life.', 'A busy executive learns during a meeting that his mother may be dying and rushes home to her side. He ends up being his father''s caretaker and becomes closer to him than ever before. Estranged from his own son, the executive comes to realize what has been missing in his own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l43BVUdXxbsSt3stBgiW53Dql1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21291'),
  ('878391995238621972', 'Dad for a Day', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Raúl Rodríguez Peila, Rolo Pulpeiro, Emiliano Torres', 'Jorge Maestro', 'Nicolás Cabré, Luisana Lopilato, Gimena Accardi, Miguel Ángel Rodríguez, Boy Olmi, Patricia Sosa, Gogó Andreu, Julieta Poggio', null, 'Federico is the coach of the women''s hockey team and is about to get married. The father suffers a heart attack and asks him to take care of his 8-year-old sister whom he doesn''t know. The pressure he feels is accentuated when he meets Julieta.', 'Federico is the coach of the women''s hockey team and is about to get married. The father suffers a heart attack and asks him to take care of his 8-year-old sister whom he doesn''t know. The pressure he feels is accentuated when he meets Julieta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOjPDcCJOhi9Lsx6O2G0hK59fVd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241408'),
  ('43109191820076161', 'Dad Friend', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Gallot, François Desagnat', 'Jeff Morris', 'Kad Merad, Pauline Étienne, Julie Gayet, François Deblock, Zabou Breitman, Guillaume Labbé, Chloé Jouannet, Louise Coldefy', null, 'Stéphane defers his frustration at not having had a son on his sons-in-law. So when her younger daughter decides to leave a rugby player than the idolatrous father for a doctor he can not stand, he will do everything to get his son-in-law back. His daughter will not let it go.', 'Stéphane defers his frustration at not having had a son on his sons-in-law. So when her younger daughter decides to leave a rugby player than the idolatrous father for a doctor he can not stand, he will do everything to get his son-in-law back. His daughter will not let it go.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzgcI6xyfHsY1ic2xskTEpuvAr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498247'),
  ('875339353634197705', 'Dad in Training', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Cyril Gelblat, Pierre-Hugues Galien', 'Cyril Gelblat', 'Manu Payet, Audrey Lamy, Aure Atika, Joe Bel, Jaïa Caltagirone, Bruno Clairefond, Vanessa Guide, Pascal Demolon', null, 'Following the breakdown of his marriage, a self-involved man begins to embrace fatherhood.', 'Following the breakdown of his marriage, a self-involved man begins to embrace fatherhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbYyGrDIssr5Y5D8yVvOiBq0tmf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384112'),
  ('619028801278776104', 'Dad must be crazy!', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Rodolfo Ledo', 'Rodolfo Ledo', 'Guillermo Francella, Lucía Galán, Daniel Aráoz, Patricio Contreras, Ingrid Grudke, Yahaira Guzmán, Lucrecia Capello, Iliana Calabró', null, 'On their scond honeymoon, a couple travels to the beaches of the Dominican Republic to reignite their marriage', 'On their scond honeymoon, a couple travels to the beaches of the Dominican Republic to reignite their marriage', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cicouQtJTsTVugMEzwVJhLB53Pl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75493'),
  ('569482995999042481', 'Dad or Mom', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Ernesto Contreras, Tonatiuh Martínez', 'María Torres, Estéfani Enríquez Soto, Enrique Vázquez', 'Mauricio Ochmann, Silvia Navarro, Axel Madrazo, Aranda Sokol, Erick Terroba García, Mauricio Barrientos, Veronica Toussaint, Bárbara López', null, 'Florencia and Vicente are getting divorced. When both are promoted at their jobs, they will do anything in order to do not keep custody of their children.', 'Florencia and Vicente are getting divorced. When both are promoted at their jobs, they will do anything in order to do not keep custody of their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e0ezklncv9ApFVj50FSYJZo08oT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980137'),
  ('8765760876446254', 'Dad Savage', 1998, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Betsan Morris Evans, Gavin Finney, Stephen Woolfenden', 'Steve Williams', 'Patrick Stewart, Kevin McKidd, Helen McCrory, Joseph McFadden, Marc Warren, Jake Wood', 'R', 'A wealthy, successful, East-Anglian tulip grower, Dad Savage is also something of a godfather in the local criminal fraternity but doesn''t trust banks to take care of his money. On recommendation from his son, Sav, Dad hires two of Sav''s unemployed school friends, Bob and Vic, to help with the business and the crime. After some careless talk from Harold, just known as ''H'', about Dad''s pension fund, Vic and Bob decide to steal the money from Dad if they can find it. The plans to liberate the money go awry and Sav is killed requiring Bob to call upon his sister Chris to rescue them. Dad intercepts their escape and forces a showdown to try to determine exactly the events of the night in order to identify his son''s killer.', 'A wealthy, successful, East-Anglian tulip grower, Dad Savage is also something of a godfather in the local criminal fraternity but doesn''t trust banks to take care of his money. On recommendation from his son, Sav, Dad hires two of Sav''s unemployed school friends, Bob and Vic, to help with the business and the crime. After some careless talk from Harold, just known as ''H'', about Dad''s pension fund, Vic and Bob decide to steal the money from Dad if they can find it. The plans to liberate the money go awry and Sav is killed requiring Bob to call upon his sister Chris to rescue them. Dad intercepts their escape and forces a showdown to try to determine exactly the events of the night in order to identify his son''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p565tXO9MO1Scfa1QiFBQNopHTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75579'),
  ('444670135420630953', 'Dad Wanted', 2020, 'Drama', 'Javier Colinas', 'Javier Colinas', 'Natalia Coronado, Juan Pablo Medina, Silvia Navarro, Ela Velden, Luis Ernesto Franco, Alberto Guerra, Gonzalo García Vivanco, Luis Arrieta', null, 'What does a thrill-seeker tween girl do when her mom forbids her to enter a BMX race? Cast an actor with nothing to lose to play her approving dad.', 'What does a thrill-seeker tween girl do when her mom forbids her to enter a BMX race? Cast an actor with nothing to lose to play her approving dad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eII9dyLFsGmpJnj2fAGAnYjzQMg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737802'),
  ('653915282243926306', 'Dad, Make Me Marry', 1975, 'Comedy', 'Oksal Pekmezoğlu', 'Ahmet Üstel', 'Barış Manço, Meral Zeren, Hulusi Kentmen, Serpil Nur, Sinan Ecer, Bilge Zobu, Ali Cağaloğlu, Diler Saraç', null, 'A hopelessly yearning hippie is left alone with a newborn baby when his just married parents go for a vacation, but wittily he finds a solution to get back his expatriate girlfriend, utilizing the baby who has no idea what is going on.', 'A hopelessly yearning hippie is left alone with a newborn baby when his just married parents go for a vacation, but wittily he finds a solution to get back his expatriate girlfriend, utilizing the baby who has no idea what is going on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ucByHuULeMvTFWPBLs5ObRyGH9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29099'),
  ('307785922318651117', 'Dad''s Army', 1971, 'Comedy, War', 'Norman Cohen, Terry Maher', 'David Croft, Jimmy Perry', 'Arthur Lowe, John Le Mesurier, Clive Dunn, John Laurie, James Beck, Arnold Ridley, Ian Lavender, Liz Fraser', 'PG-13', 'Dad''s Army was a 1971 feature film based on the BBC television sitcom Dad''s Army. Directed by Norman Cohen, it was filmed between series three and four and was based upon material from the early episodes of the television series. The film told the story of the Home Guard platoon''s formation and their subsequent endeavours at a training exercise.', 'Dad''s Army was a 1971 feature film based on the BBC television sitcom Dad''s Army. Directed by Norman Cohen, it was filmed between series three and four and was based upon material from the early episodes of the television series. The film told the story of the Home Guard platoon''s formation and their subsequent endeavours at a training exercise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vc6GWhFciyrL7JyAULko1nUdSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20051'),
  ('999811854025645642', 'Dad''s Army', 2016, 'Comedy, War', 'Oliver Parker, Christopher Ross', 'Hamish McColl', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Bill Nighy, Michael Gambon, Toby Jones, Mark Gatiss, Sarah Lancashire, Tom Courtenay, Blake Harrison', 'PG-13', 'A cinema remake of the classic sitcom Dad''s Army (1968). The Walmington-on-Sea Home Guard platoon deal with a visiting female journalist and a German spy as World War II draws to its conclusion.', 'A cinema remake of the classic sitcom Dad''s Army (1968). The Walmington-on-Sea Home Guard platoon deal with a visiting female journalist and a German spy as World War II draws to its conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6MnhydfF3L97zJ0GlukE58kOByo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332721'),
  ('314873430637749869', 'Dad''s Week Off', 1997, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Jan Kiesser, Neal Israel, Nancy Sorge', 'Neal Israel', 'Henry Winkler, Olivia D''Abo, Richard Jeni, Louis Ferreira, Ken Pogue, Wendel Meldrum, Don S. Davis, Colleen Winton', null, 'Henry Winkler stars as Jack, a stressed-out computer salesman who can''t sell his company''s defective product and can''t take any more noise from his hyperactive children. Jack looks forward to peace and quiet when his wife volunteers to take the kids camping - what he gets is a week that drives him even crazier! Jack''s troubles begin when a party animal co-worker introduces him to a beautiful but wildly unpredictable manicurist named Cherice. When Cherice isn''t handcuffing Jack to the bed, she''s baking cakes in the middle of the night or eluding the police in high speed chases. Cherice turns Jack''s dull, ordinary life into a wild non-stop adventure - and a delightfully zany comedy that will keep you laughing from start to finish.', 'Henry Winkler stars as Jack, a stressed-out computer salesman who can''t sell his company''s defective product and can''t take any more noise from his hyperactive children. Jack looks forward to peace and quiet when his wife volunteers to take the kids camping - what he gets is a week that drives him even crazier! Jack''s troubles begin when a party animal co-worker introduces him to a beautiful but wildly unpredictable manicurist named Cherice. When Cherice isn''t handcuffing Jack to the bed, she''s baking cakes in the middle of the night or eluding the police in high speed chases. Cherice turns Jack''s dull, ordinary life into a wild non-stop adventure - and a delightfully zany comedy that will keep you laughing from start to finish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlGMVxdZcNrLFnH59M6cU9h2mIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154130'),
  ('1150651592119207877', 'Daddio', 2024, 'Drama', 'Christy Hall, Phedon Papamichael', 'Christy Hall', 'Dakota Johnson, Sean Penn, Marcos A. Gonzalez, Zora Lloyd, Shannon Gannon', 'R', 'A woman taking a cab ride from JFK airport engages in a conversation with the driver about the important relationships in their lives.', 'A woman taking a cab ride from JFK airport engages in a conversation with the driver about the important relationships in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyrCsHUhOfpuci51lHcdAnO3db0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843416'),
  ('141786849775340074', 'Daddy', 1987, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Herzfeld, Stephen Shaw', 'John Herzfeld', 'Dermot Mulroney, John Karlen, Tess Harper, J.J. Cohen, Trey Aames, Patricia Arquette, Danny Aiello, Darren Dalton', null, 'Two high schoolers are unprepared for the reality of parenthood when the girl becomes pregnant.', 'Two high schoolers are unprepared for the reality of parenthood when the girl becomes pregnant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60yAzxBWZQzpYb4vru9uksbXeIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190537'),
  ('742323489471919656', 'Daddy', 2017, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Ashim Ahluwalia, Jessica Lee Gagné, Pankaj Kumar', 'Ashim Ahluwalia, Arjun Rampal', 'Arjun Rampal, Aishwarya Rajesh, Shruti Bapna, Farhan Akhtar, Anupriya Goenka, Nishikant Kamat, Anand Ingale, Rajesh Shringarpore', null, 'This is the gritty and sensational true story of Arun Gulab Gawli, a mill worker’s son who grew up in Mumbai’s impoverished Dagdi Chawl, to become an infamous don, politician and chief rival of the most powerful crime boss of the day, Dawood Ibrahim. Daddy realistically charts Mumbai’s true crime history from the 1970s and 1980s until 2012, when Gawli was finally sentenced to life imprisonment.', 'This is the gritty and sensational true story of Arun Gulab Gawli, a mill worker’s son who grew up in Mumbai’s impoverished Dagdi Chawl, to become an infamous don, politician and chief rival of the most powerful crime boss of the day, Dawood Ibrahim. Daddy realistically charts Mumbai’s true crime history from the 1970s and 1980s until 2012, when Gawli was finally sentenced to life imprisonment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hnpO5xuVOFhEgZ30B6xomYt4tiF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:461816'),
  ('1079640456521670721', 'Daddy and the Muscle Academy', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Ilppo Pohjola', 'Ilppo Pohjola', 'Touko Laaksonen, Nayland Blake, Durk Dehner, Isaac Julien, Bob Mizer', null, 'Tom of Finland is one of the gay world''s few authentic icons. His drawings have had an enormous influence on gay identity. Tom''s ultimate leather men are known and seen everywhere. They are symbols of gay pride and friendship. The documentary includes some titillating ''enactments'' inspired by Tom''s art work.', 'Tom of Finland is one of the gay world''s few authentic icons. His drawings have had an enormous influence on gay identity. Tom''s ultimate leather men are known and seen everywhere. They are symbols of gay pride and friendship. The documentary includes some titillating ''enactments'' inspired by Tom''s art work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFDxxjY4O9Uf5wsJ2JmwwKmlYH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59908'),
  ('492378425341263154', 'Daddy and Them', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Barry Markowitz, Melissa V. Barnes', 'Billy Bob Thornton', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Laura Dern, Brenda Blethyn, Andy Griffith, Diane Ladd, Kelly Preston, Jim Varney, John Prine', 'R', 'Ruby and her husband Claude are a working-class couple who live in suburban Arkansas. As crazy as they are for each other, their relationship is far from harmonious. (The lack of money doesn''t help matters, either.) In fact, their whole family is fraught with unresolved conflicts. Then Claude''s uncle is arrested on a felony charge, and everyone rallies round. Ruby''s mother Jewel and flirtatious sister Rose (Claude''s ex-girlfriend) even fly in from Tennessee; but, far from being a source of support, Jewel seems only to want to break up Ruby and Claude.', 'Ruby and her husband Claude are a working-class couple who live in suburban Arkansas. As crazy as they are for each other, their relationship is far from harmonious. (The lack of money doesn''t help matters, either.) In fact, their whole family is fraught with unresolved conflicts. Then Claude''s uncle is arrested on a felony charge, and everyone rallies round. Ruby''s mother Jewel and flirtatious sister Rose (Claude''s ex-girlfriend) even fly in from Tennessee; but, far from being a source of support, Jewel seems only to want to break up Ruby and Claude.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7MfP7nCRhSYePUec86i31DDPNMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33557'),
  ('880648317054057312', 'Daddy Cool', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Desagnat, Thomas Sorriaux', 'Thomas Sorriaux, François Desagnat', 'Daniel Auteuil, Juliette Lamboley, François Damiens, Lionel Abelanski, Julie Ferrier, François Berléand, Elise Larnicol, Benjamin Siksou', null, 'The story about the age gap between a scientist father, Philipe Le Tallec, and his newly discovered teen aged daughter, Eglantine.', 'The story about the age gap between a scientist father, Philipe Le Tallec, and his newly discovered teen aged daughter, Eglantine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RtKkbnIsuQQqcAf5Ky1SLYXPZs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10289'),
  ('1040727069103724857', 'Daddy Cool', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Maxime Govare', 'Noémie Saglio, Maxime Govare', 'Vincent Elbaz, Laurence Arné, Grégory Fitoussi, Jean-François Cayrey, Nadège Dabrowski, Bernard Le Coq, Juliette Pivolot, Abel Mansouri Asselain', null, 'Adrien, 40 years old and totally immature, is dumped by Maude, 35 years old, eager to finally found a family. In an attempt to regain the love of his life, Adrien decides to move into the future ex-married apartment: a nursery home - The beginning, an improbable educational experience.', 'Adrien, 40 years old and totally immature, is dumped by Maude, 35 years old, eager to finally found a family. In an attempt to regain the love of his life, Adrien decides to move into the future ex-married apartment: a nursery home - The beginning, an improbable educational experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrvJ9udxSMSy3GhJeDWuYTZB93x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452188'),
  ('54247810271997627', 'Daddy Daughter Trip', 2022, 'Family, Comedy', 'Rob Schneider, Andres Aguilar, Massimo Zeri', 'Patricia Schneider, Jamie Lissow', 'Rob Schneider, Jackie Sandler, Miranda Schneider, Mónica Huarte, Miguel Ángel Muñoz, Gavin Guerrero, John Cleese, Jamie Lissow', 'PG', 'A 2nd grader dreams of a fun-filled spring break vacation—but her family can’t afford it. Against the better judgement of her mother, and with only coins in their pockets, her dreamer father decides to take her on a spring break trip anyway.', 'A 2nd grader dreams of a fun-filled spring break vacation—but her family can’t afford it. Against the better judgement of her mother, and with only coins in their pockets, her dreamer father decides to take her on a spring break trip anyway.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pehdaRuVzeN3TwSI1ssvEl80LM3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848367'),
  ('976368766169043205', 'Daddy Day Camp', 2007, 'Family, Comedy', 'Fred Savage, Geno Salvatori', 'J. David Stem, Geoff Rodkey, David N. Weiss', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Tamala Jones, Paul Rae, Lochlyn Munro, Richard Gant, Brian Doyle-Murray, Taggart Hurtubise, Frank Gerrish', 'PG', 'Seeking to offer his son the satisfying summer camp experience that eluded him as a child, the operator of a neighborhood daycare center opens his own camp, only to face financial hardship and stiff competition from a rival camp.', 'Seeking to offer his son the satisfying summer camp experience that eluded him as a child, the operator of a neighborhood daycare center opens his own camp, only to face financial hardship and stiff competition from a rival camp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fhuhSVb3j8SShe6FhnVUAfSRg6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14144'),
  ('975817465675215560', 'Daddy Day Care', 2003, 'Comedy, Family', 'Steven Poster, Steve Carr', 'Geoff Rodkey', 'Eddie Murphy, Jeff Garlin, Steve Zahn, Regina King, Kevin Nealon, Jonathan Katz, Siobhan Fallon Hogan, Lisa Edelstein', 'PG', 'Two men get laid off and have to become stay-at-home dads when they can''t find jobs, which inspires them to open their own day-care center.', 'Two men get laid off and have to become stay-at-home dads when they can''t find jobs, which inspires them to open their own day-care center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uiey5XUKuPicwpIJMf1OpaOd1jL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10708'),
  ('923066826420055610', 'Daddy Duck', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'For some reason, Donald adopts a baby. It turns out not to be a duck, but a kangaroo. Donald takes little Joey home and tries to make him take a bath, with the help of the friendly lady of the adoption bureau on the telephone telling him what to do. After the bath, Donald''s baby is scared by the rug made of a bear.', 'For some reason, Donald adopts a baby. It turns out not to be a duck, but a kangaroo. Donald takes little Joey home and tries to make him take a bath, with the help of the friendly lady of the adoption bureau on the telephone telling him what to do. After the bath, Donald''s baby is scared by the rug made of a bear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alPSHgWZsMILoQDFysn1G1G311P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53926'),
  ('595548258131716939', 'Daddy Is My Idol', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Juan José Jusid', 'Marcos Carnevale', 'Guillermo Francella, Manuel Bandera, Millie Stegmann, Mapi Galán, Sebastián Francini, Yaiza Garzón, Javier Lombardo, Camila Bertone', null, 'Pablo is a former professional skier retired due to a health problem, who lives with Martín, his son. To celebrate his son''s birthday, Pablo takes him to Sierra Nevada, Spain where they will meet Ángela and Vicky, mother and daughter respectively, where a friendship and something more will emerge.', 'Pablo is a former professional skier retired due to a health problem, who lives with Martín, his son. To celebrate his son''s birthday, Pablo takes him to Sierra Nevada, Spain where they will meet Ángela and Vicky, mother and daughter respectively, where a friendship and something more will emerge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTngxZYycCjbn6JDdGkmFHpovNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415832'),
  ('649721128278619274', 'Daddy Long Legs', 1955, 'Music, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Leon Shamroy, Eli Dunn', 'Phoebe Ephron, Henry Ephron', 'Fred Astaire, Leslie Caron, Terry Moore, Thelma Ritter, Fred Clark, Charlotte Austin, Larry Keating, Kathryn Givney', 'NR', 'Wealthy American, Jervis Pendleton has a chance encounter at a French orphanage with a cheerful 18-year-old resident, and anonymously pays for her education at a New England college. She writes letters to her mysterious benefactor regularly, but he never writes back. Several years later, he visits her at school, while still concealing his identity, and—despite their large age difference—they soon fall in love.', 'Wealthy American, Jervis Pendleton has a chance encounter at a French orphanage with a cheerful 18-year-old resident, and anonymously pays for her education at a New England college. She writes letters to her mysterious benefactor regularly, but he never writes back. Several years later, he visits her at school, while still concealing his identity, and—despite their large age difference—they soon fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Tt12RPDJP4KnepYsJ4hrEQS7El.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33218'),
  ('312501432618720158', 'Daddy Long Legs', 2005, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gong Jung-shik, Seo Keun-hee, Park Hui-joo', 'Kim Hyoung-jun', 'Ha Ji-won, Yeon Jeong-hun, Shin Yi, Kim Jung-nan, Jeong Jun-ha, Hyun Bin, Park Eun-hye, Geum Bo-ra', null, 'A woman gets help from an unknown man and becomes a successful screenwriter and lives a happy life. Later, she remembers the unknown man and decides to find out who he is.', 'A woman gets help from an unknown man and becomes a successful screenwriter and lives a happy life. Later, she remembers the unknown man and decides to find out who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOoxXiA0MoMS9PxtYqOXvbc9QMi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54543'),
  ('649822417965900834', 'Daddy Nostalgia', 1990, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Tristan Ganne, Albane Guilhe', 'Colo Tavernier O''Hagan, Bertrand Tavernier', 'Dirk Bogarde, Jane Birkin, Odette Laure, Emmanuelle Bataille, Charlotte Kady, Michele Minns, Sophie Dalezio, Louis Ducreux', null, 'A half English, half French screenwriter visits her parents on the Riviera after her father''s heart surgery. Once there, she begins to connect with him in a way she never did before, as each member of the family tries to cope with his imminent death.', 'A half English, half French screenwriter visits her parents on the Riviera after her father''s heart surgery. Once there, she begins to connect with him in a way she never did before, as each member of the family tries to cope with his imminent death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wp6wEQni9T2vUZETxBLCU0DQVRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121895'),
  ('98046604154690105', 'Daddy or Mommy', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Martin Bourboulon, Laurent Dailland', 'Matthieu Delaporte, Alexandre de La Patellière', 'Marina Foïs, Laurent Lafitte, Alexandre Desrousseaux, Anna Lemarchand, Achille Potier, Judith El Zein, Michaël Abiteboul, Vanessa Guide', null, 'Florence and Vincent Leroy are a model couple. They have great jobs, a perfect marriage and delightful children. And now they want their divorce to be an equal success. But when they are both simultaneously promoted to their dream jobs, their relationship becomes a nightmare. From that moment on, the gloves are off, the two exes declare war and will do everything in their power to NOT have custody of their children.', 'Florence and Vincent Leroy are a model couple. They have great jobs, a perfect marriage and delightful children. And now they want their divorce to be an equal success. But when they are both simultaneously promoted to their dream jobs, their relationship becomes a nightmare. From that moment on, the gloves are off, the two exes declare war and will do everything in their power to NOT have custody of their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkn4hk62ZPlYWMknLuIccvomNm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319341'),
  ('468447327187604034', 'Daddy You, Daughter Me', 2017, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Jong-seok, Kim Hyung-hyup, Park Young-seok', 'Kim Hyung-hyup', 'Yoon Je-moon, Jung So-min, Lee Il-hwa, Shin Gu, Lee Mi-do, Min Do-hee, Park Hyuk-kwon, Lee You-jin', null, 'Sangtae and his teenage daughter Doyeon are constantly arguing and haven''t had a genuine conversation in years. When their souls are switched by a magical force for seven days, they must learn to tackle the awkward and unfamiliar situation in each other''s shoes.', 'Sangtae and his teenage daughter Doyeon are constantly arguing and haven''t had a genuine conversation in years. When their souls are switched by a magical force for seven days, they must learn to tackle the awkward and unfamiliar situation in each other''s shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IioGWgJplaQbulK4lPuGeOJEr4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451105'),
  ('1055164748384636362', 'Daddy-O', 1958, 'Crime, Music, Drama', 'Lou Place, C.M. Florance, Perry Finnerman', 'David Moessinger', 'Dick Contino, Bruno VeSota, Sandra Giles, Gloria Victor, Sonia Torgeson, Robert Banas, Hank Mann, Ron McNeil', 'NR', 'Phil, a part-time truck driver and singer who wears his pants far too high, meets a feisty platinum blonde who challenges him to a drag race through Griffith Park. When he is caught and loses his license, he meets up with the sketchy Frank Wooster who offers him a job singing in his new nightclub. When Phil discovers that his new job also includes drug running, he must fight to save his friends and himself.', 'Phil, a part-time truck driver and singer who wears his pants far too high, meets a feisty platinum blonde who challenges him to a drag race through Griffith Park. When he is caught and loses his license, he meets up with the sketchy Frank Wooster who offers him a job singing in his new nightclub. When Phil discovers that his new job also includes drug running, he must fight to save his friends and himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbG029DCHnlzuWXuzpF2QCk7KaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134732'),
  ('334610066859928880', 'Daddy, Darling', 1970, 'Drama', 'Joseph W. Sarno, Mikael Salomon', 'Joseph W. Sarno', 'Helli Louise, Gio Petré, Ole Wisborg, Lise Henningsen, Lise Thomsen, Tove Maës, Kyo Feza, Inger Gleerup', 'R', 'A young Danish girl seduces everything in sight after daddy refuses her naughty come-ons. She''ll have a lesbian affair with her teacher, pretend that her teenage boyfriend is dear old dad and finally get to her stepmother.', 'A young Danish girl seduces everything in sight after daddy refuses her naughty come-ons. She''ll have a lesbian affair with her teacher, pretend that her teenage boyfriend is dear old dad and finally get to her stepmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAPytje1rBmFg0HMOV4m8gnPKAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144625'),
  ('965288416417343918', 'Daddy, Father Frost Is Dead', 1991, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy', 'Vera Novikova, Mikhail Podtakui, Yuriy Nekrasov', 'Vladimir Maslov', 'Ivan Ganzha, Anatoliy Egorov, Maksim Gribov, Lyudmila Kozlovskaya, Boris Ilyasov, Valeri Krishtapenko', null, 'A biologist, obsessed with the idea of writing a treatise on a new kind of mouse, becomes witness to a number of bizarre and horrific events, from his son''s suicide, to the S&M engaged in by respectable middle-aged men, to his own family''s psychic morbidity.', 'A biologist, obsessed with the idea of writing a treatise on a new kind of mouse, becomes witness to a number of bizarre and horrific events, from his son''s suicide, to the S&M engaged in by respectable middle-aged men, to his own family''s psychic morbidity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NiZR1Zi8AhVqJ6jzdIFi7CF4Ob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246417'),
