  ('382710010427324799', 'Daffy Duck and the Dinosaur', 1939, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Jack Lescoulie', null, 'Casper Caveman is hungry, so he tries to hunt for a duck, Daffy Duck.', 'Casper Caveman is hungry, so he tries to hunt for a duck, Daffy Duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6WybZBSoeU4FdCllzH17RdZtYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137856'),
  ('24025096445348013', 'Daffy Duck Hunt', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig goes on a hunting expedition, accompanied by his dog, and they bring home a live Daffy Duck, to put into a freezer until cooking time.', 'Porky Pig goes on a hunting expedition, accompanied by his dog, and they bring home a live Daffy Duck, to put into a freezer until cooking time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/atisblukXYkg1Z1yglCEQaeoiiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146433'),
  ('963887916553823163', 'Daffy Duck in Hollywood', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Sara Berner, Herman Bing, Mel Blanc', null, 'Daffy Duck causes trouble on a Hollywood film set.', 'Daffy Duck causes trouble on a Hollywood film set.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvcXrCQRXIrWVvIOUxONmrtgzQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105560'),
  ('125776383888485790', 'Daffy Duck Slept Here', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Porky Pig has to share a hotel room with endlessly annoying roommate Daffy Duck.', 'Porky Pig has to share a hotel room with endlessly annoying roommate Daffy Duck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86q7pplqKmO5W83uLsQyAh7wWif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126069'),
  ('900231253363566830', 'Daffy Duck''s Movie: Fantastic Island', 1983, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Chuck Jones, Friz Freleng, Robert McKimson', 'Warren Foster, Robert McKimson', 'Mel Blanc, June Foray, Les Tremayne', 'G', 'Daffy Duck and Speedy Gonzales find a treasure map that leads them to a wishing well, which for a penny will grant any wish (through old cartoon footage). Daffy sets up a resort around the well and various Looney Tunes characters have their dreams come true. Meanwhile, Yosemite Sam and the Tasmanian Devil hunt for the varmints who stole their treasure map!', 'Daffy Duck and Speedy Gonzales find a treasure map that leads them to a wishing well, which for a penny will grant any wish (through old cartoon footage). Daffy sets up a resort around the well and various Looney Tunes characters have their dreams come true. Meanwhile, Yosemite Sam and the Tasmanian Devil hunt for the varmints who stole their treasure map!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYhasRbxKl8tregggAstihE1DwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80607'),
  ('212421663502135105', 'Daffy Duck''s Quackbusters', 1988, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Jones, Greg Ford, Terry Lennon', null, 'Mel Blanc, Roy Firestone, B.J. Ward, Mel Tormé, Ben Frommer, Julie Bennett, Mark Kausler', 'G', 'In this feature-length film combining footage from classic Warner Brothers cartoon shorts with newly animated bridging sequences, Daffy Duck, after having induced laughter in an ailing millionaire and forestalled the millionaire''s death for a time (as chronicled in Daffy Dilly (1948), is the beneficiary for the deceased millionaire''s assets. But the millionaire''s will clearly stipulates that Daffy must use the money for the common good, by providing a service, and should Daffy think of pursuing selfish aims, the millionaire''s ghost will "repossess" his millions by making them disappear from Earthly existence. Under the pretense of community service, Daffy opens an exorcism agency and employs Porky Pig, Sylvester Cat, and Bugs Bunny to track and eliminate ghosts, ghouls, and other monsters, while Daffy secretly schemes to use his learned "ghost-busting" talents to rid himself of the millionaire''s nagging spirit.', 'In this feature-length film combining footage from classic Warner Brothers cartoon shorts with newly animated bridging sequences, Daffy Duck, after having induced laughter in an ailing millionaire and forestalled the millionaire''s death for a time (as chronicled in Daffy Dilly (1948), is the beneficiary for the deceased millionaire''s assets. But the millionaire''s will clearly stipulates that Daffy must use the money for the common good, by providing a service, and should Daffy think of pursuing selfish aims, the millionaire''s ghost will "repossess" his millions by making them disappear from Earthly existence. Under the pretense of community service, Daffy opens an exorcism agency and employs Porky Pig, Sylvester Cat, and Bugs Bunny to track and eliminate ghosts, ghouls, and other monsters, while Daffy secretly schemes to use his learned "ghost-busting" talents to rid himself of the millionaire''s nagging spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9s1aOsnXfeSOlzYuX6VVmORrFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23521'),
  ('837517868336910483', 'Daffy''s Inn Trouble', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Daffy Duck vies with Porky Pig in the Western frontier hotel business. Porky has more success, attracting hordes of customers with a live-action saloon party. So, Daffy decides to undermine Porky''s good fortune by planting a bomb beneath Porky''s inn.', 'Daffy Duck vies with Porky Pig in the Western frontier hotel business. Porky has more success, attracting hordes of customers with a live-action saloon party. So, Daffy decides to undermine Porky''s good fortune by planting a bomb beneath Porky''s inn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7hnU3f0lSyeX4AtTMsCx3WFy9e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234697'),
  ('535101541818255326', 'Daffy''s Southern Exposure', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Norm McCabe, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc, Billy Bletcher', null, 'It''s the dead of winter, and Daffy Duck is starving. A fox and a weasel invite him into their cabin and feed him beans. But they have an ulterior motive--namely eating Daffy.', 'It''s the dead of winter, and Daffy Duck is starving. A fox and a weasel invite him into their cabin and feed him beans. But they have an ulterior motive--namely eating Daffy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irzbFUvpa7cb6i4R1ga4t2fOB2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236632'),
  ('1112745040816581703', 'Dafne', 2019, 'Drama', 'Piero Basso, Federico Bondi', 'Federico Bondi', 'Stefania Casini, Antonio Piovanelli, Carolina Raspanti, Bruno Cariello', null, 'Dafne has recently lost her mother – and Luigi his wife – in an accident. But whilst this 30-year-old, who was born with Down’s syndrome, is still managing to master her life with verve after the terrible disaster, her father sinks into a depression. It will take all the energy Dafne can muster to help him get back on his feet. Fortunately, headstrong Dafne happens to have a lot of it up her sleeve.', 'Dafne has recently lost her mother – and Luigi his wife – in an accident. But whilst this 30-year-old, who was born with Down’s syndrome, is still managing to master her life with verve after the terrible disaster, her father sinks into a depression. It will take all the energy Dafne can muster to help him get back on his feet. Fortunately, headstrong Dafne happens to have a lot of it up her sleeve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxmb3sPfQ7nLgemTuxin64zg1zC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570733'),
  ('1021409173795591559', 'Daft Punk Unchained', 2015, 'Music, Documentary', 'Hervé Martin-Delpierre', 'Hervé Martin-Delpierre, Marina Rozenman', 'Thomas Bangalter, Guy-Manuel de Homem-Christo, Ye, Pharrell Williams, Michel Gondry, Paul Williams, Giorgio Moroder, Tony Gardner', 'PG-13', 'Daft Punk Unchained is the first film about the pop culture phenomenon that is Daft Punk, the duo with 12 million albums sold worldwide and seven Grammy Awards. Throughout their career Thomas Bangalter and Guy-Manuel de Homem-Christo have always resisted compromise and the established codes of show business. They have remained determined to maintain control of every link in the chain of their creative process. In the era of globalisation and social networks, they rarely speak in public and neither do they show their faces on TV. This documentary explores this unprecedented cultural revolution revealing a duo of artists on a permanent quest for creativity, independence and freedom.', 'Daft Punk Unchained is the first film about the pop culture phenomenon that is Daft Punk, the duo with 12 million albums sold worldwide and seven Grammy Awards. Throughout their career Thomas Bangalter and Guy-Manuel de Homem-Christo have always resisted compromise and the established codes of show business. They have remained determined to maintain control of every link in the chain of their creative process. In the era of globalisation and social networks, they rarely speak in public and neither do they show their faces on TV. This documentary explores this unprecedented cultural revolution revealing a duo of artists on a permanent quest for creativity, independence and freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZhguyhaCAcRCSEn1QUHPCDSKzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346401'),
  ('408220658970762653', 'Dagger Eyes', 1983, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giuseppe Maccari', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Carole Bouquet, Duilio Del Prete, John Steiner, Gabriele Tinti, Peter Berling, Samuele Goldzader, Janet Ågren, Philip Coccioletti', null, 'Assassins are after a prostitute who has come into possession of a cigarette lighter that, unbeknownst to her, contains the negatives that show a politician''s assassination. A delightfully playful giallo starring the beautiful Carole Bouquet as Mystère, a high class call girl who becomes the target for a couple of assassins.', 'Assassins are after a prostitute who has come into possession of a cigarette lighter that, unbeknownst to her, contains the negatives that show a politician''s assassination. A delightfully playful giallo starring the beautiful Carole Bouquet as Mystère, a high class call girl who becomes the target for a couple of assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6HUCx7NuaoKI4kVlQhbNo3JWN0g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108074'),
  ('702324692654147717', 'Dagmar''s Hot Pants, Inc.', 1971, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Vernon P. Becker, Tony Forsberg', 'Vernon P. Becker, Louis M. Heyward', 'Diana Kjær, Robert Strauss, Annelie Alexandersson, Poul Bundgaard, Inger Sundh, Tommy Blom, Tor Isedal, Svend Johansen', null, 'Known to her clients as Dagmar, she''s a classy Swedish call girl in Copenhagen. After two years, she''s ready quit, and we follow her on what she hopes is her last day in the trade. She wakes at 9 AM, gets her first call and a marriage proposal, checks in with her doctor, pays final visits to various clients, arranges to lease her flat, passes on her black book to a colleague, tries to beg off on an impromptu session with Japanese businessmen, has a quick conversation with her brother, and makes a couple of charitable contributions. All the while, her eyes on the clock, there''s the threat of her pimp finding out about her plans. If she pulls it off, what awaits?', 'Known to her clients as Dagmar, she''s a classy Swedish call girl in Copenhagen. After two years, she''s ready quit, and we follow her on what she hopes is her last day in the trade. She wakes at 9 AM, gets her first call and a marriage proposal, checks in with her doctor, pays final visits to various clients, arranges to lease her flat, passes on her black book to a colleague, tries to beg off on an impromptu session with Japanese businessmen, has a quick conversation with her brother, and makes a couple of charitable contributions. All the while, her eyes on the clock, there''s the threat of her pimp finding out about her plans. If she pulls it off, what awaits?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7YxfwUZTWbGXltsDZ2qJKq4CGrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95077'),
  ('806943222834602660', 'Dagon', 2001, 'Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Stuart Gordon, Carlos Suárez', 'Dennis Paoli', 'Ezra Godden, Francisco Rabal, Raquel Meroño, Macarena Gómez, Brendan Price, Birgit Bofarull, Uxía Blanco, Ferran Lahoz', null, 'A boating accident off the coast of Spain sends Paul and his girlfriend Barbara to the decrepit fishing village of Imboca. As night falls, people start to disappear and things not quite human start to appear. Paul is pursued by the entire town. Running for his life, he uncovers Imboca''s secret..they worship Dagon, a monstrous god of the sea...and Dagon''s unholy offspring are on the loose...', 'A boating accident off the coast of Spain sends Paul and his girlfriend Barbara to the decrepit fishing village of Imboca. As night falls, people start to disappear and things not quite human start to appear. Paul is pursued by the entire town. Running for his life, he uncovers Imboca''s secret..they worship Dagon, a monstrous god of the sea...and Dagon''s unholy offspring are on the loose...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8S648eMKObi8ERFS7cSYDocxSaZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10836'),
  ('822448215547780626', 'Dagr', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Matthew Butler-Hart', 'Tori Butler-Hart, Matthew Butler-Hart', 'Riz Moritz, Ellie Duckles, Emma King, Graham Butler, Hattie Chapman, Luca Thompson, Matt Barber, Tori Butler-Hart', null, 'Fame seeking YouTubers find themselves in a paranormal nightmare when the advert team they are attempting to steal from awakens a druid demon from the past.', 'Fame seeking YouTubers find themselves in a paranormal nightmare when the advert team they are attempting to steal from awakens a druid demon from the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMX7TxNBjMH3effrFz8eQGPlIns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208704'),
  ('437032321733479070', 'Daguerréotypes', 1978, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Nurith Aviv, William Lubtchansky', 'Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda, Lucien Bossy, Leance Debrossian, Marcelle Debrossian, Robert François, Jean Guillard, Thibaud Jean, Boukraa Mustapha', 'NR', 'An intimate portrait of the small shops and shopkeepers of the Rue Daguerre in Paris, a picturesque street that has been the filmmaker’s home for more than 50 years.', 'An intimate portrait of the small shops and shopkeepers of the Rue Daguerre in Paris, a picturesque street that has been the filmmaker’s home for more than 50 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3XXWWVKbePGBu6Q7e0ngve5cwBB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49650'),
  ('864129399657136110', 'Daguerrotype', 2016, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror, Romance', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'Catherine Paillé, Kiyoshi Kurosawa, Eléonore Mahmoudian', 'Tahar Rahim, Constance Rousseau, Olivier Gourmet, Mathieu Amalric, Malik Zidi, Valérie Sibilia, Jacques Collard, Fabrice Adde', null, 'An aging photographer''s obsession with an early form of photography draws his assistant and daughter into a work of mystery.', 'An aging photographer''s obsession with an early form of photography draws his assistant and daughter into a work of mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sOW73ELc20myWY8zOV3FC3HIcEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374466'),
  ('214409008495108333', 'Dahmer', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, Horror', 'David Jacobson, Christopher Manley', 'David Jacobson', 'Jeremy Renner, Bruce Davison, Artel Great, Matt Newton, Dionysio Basco, Kate Williamson, Lily Knight, Christina Payano', 'R', 'On February 15, 1992 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Jeffrey Dahmer, one of the world''s most infamous serial killers, was convicted of 15 counts of murder and sentenced to 937 years in federal prison. This movie is based on events from his life.', 'On February 15, 1992 in Milwaukee, Wisconsin, Jeffrey Dahmer, one of the world''s most infamous serial killers, was convicted of 15 counts of murder and sentenced to 937 years in federal prison. This movie is based on events from his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gZPrXBXYf2s4VztHdQpd0441jF6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25853'),
  ('1150531834239394707', 'Dahomey', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Joséphine Drouin-Viallard, Gildas Adannou, Mati Diop', 'Mati Diop', 'Lucrèce Hougbelo, Parfait Vaiayinon, Didier Sedoha Nassangade, Sabine Badjogoumin, Dowoti Desir, Micheline Ayinon, Bicarel Gnikpo, Nadia Vihoutou Kponadou', null, 'Thousands of royal artifacts of Dahomey, a West African kingdom, were taken by French colonists in the 19th century for collection and display in Paris. Centuries later, a fraction returned to their home in modern-day Benin. This dramatized documentary follows the journey of 26 of the treasures as told by cultural art historians, embattled university students, and one of the repatriated statues himself.', 'Thousands of royal artifacts of Dahomey, a West African kingdom, were taken by French colonists in the 19th century for collection and display in Paris. Centuries later, a fraction returned to their home in modern-day Benin. This dramatized documentary follows the journey of 26 of the treasures as told by cultural art historians, embattled university students, and one of the repatriated statues himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9d8KvJ3OjUq9rwuM743QPQO48aL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101256'),
  ('27695995238638269', 'Dahufa', 2017, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Busifan', 'Busifan', 'Sheng Feng, King Shih-chieh, Zhang Youwu, Jiayi Li, Li Lanling, Xiao Liansha', null, 'A warrior named Dahufa goes to save his prince from a dystopian village. He finds the dystopian village ruled by a fake god and his guards. In order to save the prince, Dahufa has to defeat the god and his men, and disclose the whole conspiracy.', 'A warrior named Dahufa goes to save his prince from a dystopian village. He finds the dystopian village ruled by a fake god and his guards. In order to save the prince, Dahufa has to defeat the god and his men, and disclose the whole conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMhOT0UK06hviintbnTZObmiiOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466980'),
  ('351866315970956291', 'Daicon Film''s Return of Ultraman', 1983, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Takami Akai, Hideaki Anno', 'Toshio Okada', 'Hideaki Anno, Shuichi Hayashi, Yasuhiro Takeda, Norio Tamura, Takashi Nyoten, Toshihiko Nishigaki, Yuki Nishi, Takeshi Sawamura', null, 'The final fan-made Ultraman short film directed by Hideaki Anno. Based on The Return of Ultraman series.', 'The final fan-made Ultraman short film directed by Hideaki Anno. Based on The Return of Ultraman series.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4EELZFjPynlbJlWBECv6Xhw1gA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501567'),
  ('136116300794764967', 'Daily Lives of High School Boys', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Daigo Matsui, Hiroki Shioya', 'Hiroyuki Komine, Daigo Matsui', 'Masaki Suda, Shuhei Nomura, Ryo Yoshizawa, Anri Okamoto, Mizuki Yamamoto, Toko Miura, Taiga Nakano, Kumiko Shiratori', null, 'At an all boys high school, Tadakuni, Yoshitake and Hidenori are close friends and think usually all day about girls. Their high school then co-hosts a school festival with an all girls high school.', 'At an all boys high school, Tadakuni, Yoshitake and Hidenori are close friends and think usually all day about girls. Their high school then co-hosts a school festival with an all girls high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWUPngH8v0khKRssPYQTzHYd1U1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186627'),
  ('570132253966661272', 'Daimajin', 1966, 'Horror, Fantasy, Drama', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Fujio Morita', 'Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Miwa Takada, Yoshihiko Aoyama, Jun Fujimaki, Ryūtarō Gomi, Ryūzō Shimada, Tatsuo Endō, Saburo Date, Shizuhiro Izoguchi', null, 'A giant stone statue comes to life to protect the residents of a small town against the depradations of an evil warlord.', 'A giant stone statue comes to life to protect the residents of a small town against the depradations of an evil warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SFtiK4m6qkLaVKbAHX5QuDDbkn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28719'),
  ('649219757549109991', 'Dainah the Mixed', 1932, 'Drama', 'Jean Grémillon, Louis Page, Georges Périnal', 'Charles Spaak', 'Charles Vanel, Laurence Clavius, Gabrielle Fontan, Habib Benglia, Maryanne, Gaston Dubosc, Lucien Guérard', null, 'After three weeks and a long, hot voyage across the Pacific, an ocean liner finally arrives at its destination, Ecuador. That evening, the event is marked by a masked ball and a magic show.', 'After three weeks and a long, hot voyage across the Pacific, an ocean liner finally arrives at its destination, Ecuador. That evening, the event is marked by a masked ball and a magic show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sitSFAtJXAdjKxaT71Ywk6KmI7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125713'),
  ('418555806720457219', 'Daisies', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Věra Chytilová, Jaroslav Kučera, Rudolf Jaroš', 'Věra Chytilová, Ester Krumbachová', 'Jitka Cerhová, Ivana Karbanová, Helena Anýžová, Julius Albert, Jan Klusák, Jiřina Myšková, Oldřich Hora, Marcela Březinová', null, 'Two teenage girls embark on a series of destructive pranks in which they consume and destroy the world around them.', 'Two teenage girls embark on a series of destructive pranks in which they consume and destroy the world around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8sxMhdn3i1Pn8OlGCBBjr9rjP1y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46919'),
  ('5749056482574513', 'Daisy', 2006, 'Drama, Romance, Action', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Ng Man-Ching, Jonathan Li Tsz-Chun', 'Kwak Jae-yong, Felix Chong Man-Keung, Gordon Chan', 'Gianna Jun, Jung Woo-sung, Lee Sung-jae, Cheon Ho-jin, David Chiang Da-Wei, Dion Lam, Man-Lung Tang, Sara Bernardo Aires', 'NR', 'A painter in Amsterdam receives flowers from a mysterious admirer, while a hitman and cop find themselves in conflict.', 'A painter in Amsterdam receives flowers from a mysterious admirer, while a hitman and cop find themselves in conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twmYZWjyrHm0fhJnPxHcC4XtrA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18426'),
  ('378541698666539225', 'Daisy Diamond', 2007, 'Drama', 'Simon Staho, Eric Kress', 'Simon Staho, Peter Asmussen', 'Noomi Rapace, Trine Dyrholm, Sofie Gråbøl, Charlotte Munck, Thure Lindhardt, Benedikte Hansen, Morten Kirkskov, Stine Stengade', null, 'A tragic story about Anna who dreams of one thing only: making it as an actress. She moves from Sweden to Copenhagen to pursue her dream. But fate has something else in store for her. Though she struggles to give her 4-month-old daughter a good start in life, she ultimately fails to unite her dream of acting with a safe and loving environment for her child, culminating in a desperate act that has fatal consequences for Anna and her daughter.', 'A tragic story about Anna who dreams of one thing only: making it as an actress. She moves from Sweden to Copenhagen to pursue her dream. But fate has something else in store for her. Though she struggles to give her 4-month-old daughter a good start in life, she ultimately fails to unite her dream of acting with a safe and loving environment for her child, culminating in a desperate act that has fatal consequences for Anna and her daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deiYoL49RvZ6PLTlkC5wiHtFRyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35297'),
  ('897273981980151873', 'Daisy Kenyon', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Otto Preminger, Leon Shamroy, Alfred Newman', 'David Hertz', 'Joan Crawford, Dana Andrews, Henry Fonda, Ruth Warrick, Martha Stewart, Peggy Ann Garner, Connie Marshall, Nicholas Joy', null, 'Daisy Kenyon is a Manhattan commercial artist having an affair with an arrogant and overbearing but successful lawyer and family man named Dan O''Mara. Daisy meets a single man, a war veteran named Peter Lapham, and after a brief and hesitant courtship decides to marry him, although she is still in love with Dan.', 'Daisy Kenyon is a Manhattan commercial artist having an affair with an arrogant and overbearing but successful lawyer and family man named Dan O''Mara. Daisy meets a single man, a war veteran named Peter Lapham, and after a brief and hesitant courtship decides to marry him, although she is still in love with Dan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3uIBvjXZVIAsenyJyMvonarqQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20301'),
  ('724712369637526970', 'Daisy Miller', 1974, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Peter Bogdanovich, Alberto Spagnoli, Tony Brandt', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Cybill Shepherd, Barry Brown, Cloris Leachman, Duilio Del Prete, Mildred Natwick, Eileen Brennan, James McMurtry, Nicholas Jones', 'G', 'Despite mixed emotions, Frederick Winterbourne tries to figure out the bright and bubbly Daisy Miller, only to be helped and hindered by false judgments from their fellow friends.', 'Despite mixed emotions, Frederick Winterbourne tries to figure out the bright and bubbly Daisy Miller, only to be helped and hindered by false judgments from their fellow friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNchFArEWzP20lrQH0yH5Isf0jl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4703'),
  ('953270888857464366', 'Daisy Quokka: World''s Scariest Animal', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Ricard Cussó', 'Ryan Greaves', 'Angourie Rice, Sam Neill, Sharnee Tones, Grant Denyer, Lucy Durack, Frank Woodley, Andrew Cook, Karl Stefanovic', 'G', 'When an unbearably adorable, eternally optimistic Quokka named Daisy wants to achieve the impossible – to win the annual ‘World’s Scariest Animal’ championship, she enlists the guidance of a washed-up, former champion, a grouchy Saltwater Crocodile, to help her achieve her dreams and prove that champions can come in all sizes.', 'When an unbearably adorable, eternally optimistic Quokka named Daisy wants to achieve the impossible – to win the annual ‘World’s Scariest Animal’ championship, she enlists the guidance of a washed-up, former champion, a grouchy Saltwater Crocodile, to help her achieve her dreams and prove that champions can come in all sizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hx1ByfkqYTR8I5MBWzBkVXizsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:778814'),
  ('1102314345135222259', 'Daisy Town', 1971, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'René Goscinny', 'Morris, René Goscinny, Eddie Lateste', 'Marcel Bozzuffi, Pierre Trabaud, Jacques Balutin, Jacques Jouanneau, Jean Berger, Pierre Tornade, Roger Carel, Jacques Fabbri', null, 'When the members of a caravan of pioneers find a daisy growing in the middle of the desert they decide to stop there and to build their town on this very spot. Houses soon spring up like mushrooms, immediately followed by a bank, a saloon, a prison, etc. Daisy Town is born. Unfortunately a city does not go without its bad boys and the peaceful place is soon turned into a lawless place. To restore law and order, a lawman is needed. Lucky Luke, the cowboy who shoots faster than his shadow, will be this man: all the villains had better watch out!', 'When the members of a caravan of pioneers find a daisy growing in the middle of the desert they decide to stop there and to build their town on this very spot. Houses soon spring up like mushrooms, immediately followed by a bank, a saloon, a prison, etc. Daisy Town is born. Unfortunately a city does not go without its bad boys and the peaceful place is soon turned into a lawless place. To restore law and order, a lawman is needed. Lucky Luke, the cowboy who shoots faster than his shadow, will be this man: all the villains had better watch out!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKu2GtcbT95cH1O8BHbJOuIQgOu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52761'),
  ('769592935889457492', 'DAKAICHI - I''m being harassed by the sexiest man of the year - the Movie: Spain Arc', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Naoyuki Tatsuwa', 'Yoshimi Narita', 'Hiroki Takahashi, Yuki Ono, Kohsuke Toriumi, Wataru Hatano, Takuya Sato, Yuma Uchida, Show Hayami, Fukushi Ochiai', 'NR', 'Azumaya and Takato are set to star in "Blood Wedding," a two-person play that incorporates flamenco dancing; Takato decides to travel to Spain to learn about passion.', 'Azumaya and Takato are set to star in "Blood Wedding," a two-person play that incorporates flamenco dancing; Takato decides to travel to Spain to learn about passion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMzyq71sUoQ3atuQKQW8f5zg9Qy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820530'),
  ('1063167003739427431', 'Dakota', 1945, 'Western', 'Joseph Kane, Jack A. Marta, Walter Scharf', 'Lawrence Hazard', 'John Wayne, Vera Ralston, Walter Brennan, Ward Bond, Ona Munson, Hugo Haas, Mike Mazurki, Olive Blakeney', 'NR', 'In 1871, professional gambler John Devlin elopes with Sandra "Sandy" Poli, daughter of Marko Poli, an immigrant who has risen to railroad tycoon. Sandy, knowing that the railroad is to be extended into Dakota, plans to use their $20,000 nest egg to buy land options to sell to the railroad at a profit. On the stage trip to Ft. Abercrombie, their fellow passengers are Jim Bender and Bigtree Collins, who practically own the town of Fargo and Devlin is aware that they are prepared to protect the little empire... trying to drive out the farmers by burning their property, destroying their wheat, and blaming the devastation on the Indians. Continuing their journey north on the river aboard the "River Bird'', Sandy and John meet Captain Bounce, an irascible old seafarer. Two of Bendender''s henchmen, Slagin and Carp, board the boat and relieve John of his $20,000 at gunpoint. Captain Bounce, chasing the robber''s dinghy..', 'In 1871, professional gambler John Devlin elopes with Sandra "Sandy" Poli, daughter of Marko Poli, an immigrant who has risen to railroad tycoon. Sandy, knowing that the railroad is to be extended into Dakota, plans to use their $20,000 nest egg to buy land options to sell to the railroad at a profit. On the stage trip to Ft. Abercrombie, their fellow passengers are Jim Bender and Bigtree Collins, who practically own the town of Fargo and Devlin is aware that they are prepared to protect the little empire... trying to drive out the farmers by burning their property, destroying their wheat, and blaming the devastation on the Indians. Continuing their journey north on the river aboard the "River Bird'', Sandy and John meet Captain Bounce, an irascible old seafarer. Two of Bendender''s henchmen, Slagin and Carp, board the boat and relieve John of his $20,000 at gunpoint. Captain Bounce, chasing the robber''s dinghy..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqnyYhIgDuJWaaE8gS8AA0MBP1C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58455'),
  ('514323037263215551', 'Dakota', 2022, 'Family, Adventure, Drama', 'Giuseppe Pignone, Kirk Harris', 'Johnny Harrington', 'Abbie Cornish, Lola Sultan, William Baldwin, Tim Rozon, Patrick Muldoon, Robert Davide, Lorenzo McGovern Zaini, Luca Ghillino', null, 'Dakota, an ex-service dog, joins single mum Kate and her daughter Alex to live on their small-town family farm. Dakota quickly adjusts to her new home and becomes somewhat of a local hero, soon becoming inseparable from Alex. But when the farm’s existence is threatened by the town’s rogue sheriff, Dakota must help the family band together and save the land.', 'Dakota, an ex-service dog, joins single mum Kate and her daughter Alex to live on their small-town family farm. Dakota quickly adjusts to her new home and becomes somewhat of a local hero, soon becoming inseparable from Alex. But when the farm’s existence is threatened by the town’s rogue sheriff, Dakota must help the family band together and save the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j3eUOPUoDwkupwTPTDk6ESqrzGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955740'),
  ('91745232322310', 'Dakota Incident', 1956, 'Action, Western', 'Lewis R. Foster, Ernest Haller, Leonard Kunody', 'Frederick Louis Fox', 'Linda Darnell, Dale Robertson, John Lund, Ward Bond, Regis Toomey, Skip Homeier, Irving Bacon, John Doucette', 'NR', 'Indians attack a stagecoach, and a disparate band of passengers must band together to fight them off.', 'Indians attack a stagecoach, and a disparate band of passengers must band together to fight them off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCwqCf5JLczL43Is4SKfctN1OsD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75365'),
  ('1118682873694934495', 'Dakota Skye', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Humber', 'Chad J. Shonk', 'Eileen April Boylan, J.B. Ghuman Jr., Scott F. Anderson, Matt Baker, Calico Cooper, Ian Nelson', null, 'For as long as she could remember, Dakota Skye has been cursed with a super power. She has the ability to see the truth in any lie she hears. From small, harmless white lies, to the more devious kind, they have come from the people that she should trust the most; her family, friends and teachers. These lies have snowballed, leading to her becoming bitter and apathetic towards the world around her.', 'For as long as she could remember, Dakota Skye has been cursed with a super power. She has the ability to see the truth in any lie she hears. From small, harmless white lies, to the more devious kind, they have come from the people that she should trust the most; her family, friends and teachers. These lies have snowballed, leading to her becoming bitter and apathetic towards the world around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNenZySmzku77zfYCJDGaJCEFgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20513'),
  ('583228667784238949', 'Dakota''s Summer', 2014, 'Family', 'Timothy Armstrong', 'Timothy Armstrong', 'Haley Ramm, Jade Pettyjohn, Emily Bett Rickards, Keith Carradine, Julie Ann Emery, Spencer Boldman, Marin Hinkle, Amber Hayes', 'PG', 'Cowgirls ''n Angels Dakota''s Summer tells the story of Dakota Rose, a cowgirl and competitive trick rider who finds out at the age of seventeen that she was adopted. She secretly sets out to discover the truth about her adoption and meet her birth parents while visiting her grandfather, rodeo legend Austin Rose. At Austin''s ranch on break from the Sweethearts of the Rodeo trick riding team, Dakota discovers that family is not defined by blood, but rather personal commitment and by the love they share. Finally at peace, Dakota trains with Austin in order to prepare to rejoin the Sweethearts for their final competition against the talented Lone Star trick riding team and become the champion trick rider she was destined to be.', 'Cowgirls ''n Angels Dakota''s Summer tells the story of Dakota Rose, a cowgirl and competitive trick rider who finds out at the age of seventeen that she was adopted. She secretly sets out to discover the truth about her adoption and meet her birth parents while visiting her grandfather, rodeo legend Austin Rose. At Austin''s ranch on break from the Sweethearts of the Rodeo trick riding team, Dakota discovers that family is not defined by blood, but rather personal commitment and by the love they share. Finally at peace, Dakota trains with Austin in order to prepare to rejoin the Sweethearts for their final competition against the talented Lone Star trick riding team and become the champion trick rider she was destined to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u8Zpskuba1lU2sTqqYKdzvxI9Pt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255476'),
  ('11231744309100778', 'Dalecarlians', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maria Blom, Peter Mokrosinski', 'Maria Blom', 'Sofia Helin, Kajsa Ernst, Ann Petrén, Barbro Enberg, Cecilia Forss, Joakim Lindblad, Inga Ålenius, Willie Andréason', null, 'Mia returns from Stockholm to her parents'' home in a small town in Dalecarlia (Dalarna) to celebrate her father''s 70th birthday. Her elder sisters Eivor and Gunilla welcome her, but their different lifestyles prevent them from really communicating. The tension builds, and the party that should be a celebration turns out to be a turning point for the family and their friends', 'Mia returns from Stockholm to her parents'' home in a small town in Dalecarlia (Dalarna) to celebrate her father''s 70th birthday. Her elder sisters Eivor and Gunilla welcome her, but their different lifestyles prevent them from really communicating. The tension builds, and the party that should be a celebration turns out to be a turning point for the family and their friends', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNRtHq5QiyI0n3OV2IKq3pOhMtu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12604'),
  ('805409786777948646', 'Daleks'' Invasion Earth: 2150 A.D.', 1966, 'Family, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Gordon Flemyng, John Wilcox', 'Milton Subotsky', 'Peter Cushing, Bernard Cribbins, Ray Brooks, Andrew Keir, Roberta Tovey, Jill Curzon, Godfrey Quigley, Roger Avon', 'G', 'Doctor Who and his companions are hurled into the future and make a horrifying discovery: the Daleks have conquered Earth! The metal fiends have devastated entire continents and turned the survivors into Robomen.', 'Doctor Who and his companions are hurled into the future and make a horrifying discovery: the Daleks have conquered Earth! The metal fiends have devastated entire continents and turned the survivors into Robomen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5l0DjqEaqPLkP4A7yaj1a3FXI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16387'),
  ('675598294121831895', 'Dalia and the Red Book', 2024, 'Adventure, Drama, Fantasy, Animation', 'David Bisbano, María Paz Scafú, Ricardo Montes', 'David Bisbano', 'Agustina Gonzalez Cirulnik, Mora Kind, Gustavo Barrientos, Mariana Correa, Andrés Burecovics, Natalia Rosminati, Nicolás Espinosa, Lisette Freire Perez', 'G', 'Dalia, the daughter of a famous writer who has recently died, inherits the legacy of finishing his book. To do this, Dalia will become part of the book and will come face to face with the characters who have taken the theme of the book in order to be the protagonists.', 'Dalia, the daughter of a famous writer who has recently died, inherits the legacy of finishing his book. To do this, Dalia will become part of the book and will come face to face with the characters who have taken the theme of the book in order to be the protagonists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brk5WOAEQWPcMLMsRrkPBtpVk3f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1333099'),
  ('1083800528494172318', 'Dalida', 2017, 'Music, Drama', 'Antoine Sanier, Lisa Azuelos', 'Lisa Azuelos', 'Sveva Alviti, Riccardo Scamarcio, Jean-Paul Rouve, Niels Schneider, Alessandro Borghi, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Valentina Carli, Patrick Timsit', null, 'Based on the true story of acclaimed music icon "Dalida" born in Cairo, who gained celebrity in the 50s, singing in French, Spanish, Arabic, Hebrew, German, Italian, playing in awarded Youssef Chahine''s picture "Le Sixième Jour", and who later committed suicide in 1987 in Paris, after selling more than 130 million records worldwide.', 'Based on the true story of acclaimed music icon "Dalida" born in Cairo, who gained celebrity in the 50s, singing in French, Spanish, Arabic, Hebrew, German, Italian, playing in awarded Youssef Chahine''s picture "Le Sixième Jour", and who later committed suicide in 1987 in Paris, after selling more than 130 million records worldwide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZx4PGZBXePgMmo0HyBcHPbidZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382595'),
  ('601673791706845646', 'Dalíland', 2022, 'History, Drama', 'Marcel Zyskind, Mary Harron, Davy Hughes', 'Mary Harron, John C. Walsh', 'Ben Kingsley, Barbara Sukowa, Christopher Briney, Rupert Graves, Andreja Pejić, Suki Waterhouse, Alexander Beyer, Zachary Nachbar-Seckel', 'NR', 'In 1973, a young gallery assistant goes on a wild adventure behind the scenes as he helps aging genius Salvador Dali prepare for a big show in New York.', 'In 1973, a young gallery assistant goes on a wild adventure behind the scenes as he helps aging genius Salvador Dali prepare for a big show in New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RE6PmgeE6Kz0fur2oiiYZ50R0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522925'),
  ('922037700460661206', 'Dallas', 1950, 'Western', 'Stuart Heisler, Ernest Haller', 'John Twist', 'Gary Cooper, Ruth Roman, Steve Cochran, Raymond Massey, Barbara Payton, Leif Erickson, Antonio Moreno, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'After the Civil War, Confederate soldier Blayde Hollister travels to Dallas to avenge the savage murder of his family. Discovering his enemy is now an esteemed citizen, Hollister plots to expose the outlaw and his syndicate.', 'After the Civil War, Confederate soldier Blayde Hollister travels to Dallas to avenge the savage murder of his family. Discovering his enemy is now an esteemed citizen, Hollister plots to expose the outlaw and his syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/szVFvCur0ZMpvu2wSICtZKxHmMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113921'),
  ('180401788774587622', 'Dallas: J.R. Returns', 1996, 'Drama', 'Leonard Katzman, Don Reddy', 'Leonard Katzman, Arthur Bernard Lewis', 'Larry Hagman, Patrick Duffy, Linda Gray, Ken Kercheval, Audrey Landers, George Kennedy, Tracy Scoggins, Deborah Rennard', null, 'Years after J.R. Ewing lost Ewing Oil and apparently committed suicide, we learn that he is alive and well. He returns to Dallas, and plots what could be his greatest scheme: Bringing his family back together, and regaining control of Ewing Oil from arch-enemy Cliff Barnes. Will he be successful?', 'Years after J.R. Ewing lost Ewing Oil and apparently committed suicide, we learn that he is alive and well. He returns to Dallas, and plots what could be his greatest scheme: Bringing his family back together, and regaining control of Ewing Oil from arch-enemy Cliff Barnes. Will he be successful?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clqqA7rjIiy1bEUVJMQ5OhAC79t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174117'),
  ('945558309280715417', 'Dallas: War of The Ewings', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Michael Preece', null, 'Larry Hagman, Patrick Duffy, Linda Gray, Tracy Scoggins, Steve Kanaly, George Kennedy, Michelle Johnson, Jerry Jones', null, 'In the second of two Dallas reunion films, War of the Ewings follows Bobby and Sue Ellen Ewing two years after taking over control of Ewing Oil. Although J.R. is managing WestStar Oil, he wants to once again own his father''s company. When he discovers that Ray Krebbs'' land has undiscovered oil on it, he clashes with everyone — from Carter McKay to the Ewings — to get what he wants.', 'In the second of two Dallas reunion films, War of the Ewings follows Bobby and Sue Ellen Ewing two years after taking over control of Ewing Oil. Although J.R. is managing WestStar Oil, he wants to once again own his father''s company. When he discovers that Ray Krebbs'' land has undiscovered oil on it, he clashes with everyone — from Carter McKay to the Ewings — to get what he wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwB1lbs4UYijTEGyOslxVEP4XEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174122'),
  ('376972400406900343', 'Dallos', 1983, 'Animation, Science Fiction, War', 'Mamoru Oshii', 'Mamoru Oshii, Hisayuki Toriumi', 'Hideki Sasaki, Shuichi Ikeda, Yoshiko Sakakibara, Mizuho Suzuki, Hideyuki Tanaka, Rumiko Ukai, Tessyo Genda, Koji Tanaka', null, 'In a near future, mankind has moved from a drained Earth to the Moon. Rebel acts of terrorism lead to conflicts with the Earth Federal Government. A mysterious entity called Dallos appears to restore hope.', 'In a near future, mankind has moved from a drained Earth to the Moon. Rebel acts of terrorism lead to conflicts with the Earth Federal Government. A mysterious entity called Dallos appears to restore hope.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5yf3zDfGbUKwlH8PAyEEg9CfbH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285857'),
  ('326898215992632', 'Daltry Calhoun', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Katrina Holden Bronson, Matthew Irving', 'Katrina Holden Bronson, Katrina Holden Bronson', 'Johnny Knoxville, Elizabeth Banks, Juliette Lewis, David Koechner, Kick Gurry, Lawrence Bull Jr., Beth Grant, Thomas Jackson Burt', 'PG-13', 'In small town Tennessee, a ne''er-do-well man wrestling for control over his fading golf club is reunited with his estranged daughter, a 14-year-old musical prodigy.', 'In small town Tennessee, a ne''er-do-well man wrestling for control over his fading golf club is reunited with his estranged daughter, a 14-year-old musical prodigy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXJStu8CAPpgPD3waTdCDlXDqlR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20668'),
  ('404850199241315112', 'Dam Street', 2005, 'Drama', 'Li Yu', 'Li Yu, Fang Li', 'Huang Xingrao, Yizhu Wang, Li Kechun, Liu Rui, Yi Liu', null, 'Yun is shunned when she becomes pregnant in school, and her mother gives the child up for adoption. When Yun tutors a boy 10 years later, her mother discovers he is Yun''s son.', 'Yun is shunned when she becomes pregnant in school, and her mother gives the child up for adoption. When Yun tutors a boy 10 years later, her mother discovers he is Yun''s son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1OVP9azXo56ymqLWxapICebK82D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99735'),
  ('40065857637292846', 'Damage', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Louis Malle, Peter Biziou', 'David Hare', 'Jeremy Irons, Juliette Binoche, Miranda Richardson, Rupert Graves, Peter Stormare, Gemma Clarke, Ian Bannen, Julian Fellowes', 'R', 'The life of a respected British politician at the height of his career crumbles when he becomes obsessed with his son''s lover.', 'The life of a respected British politician at the height of his career crumbles when he becomes obsessed with his son''s lover.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alf3JOPP7EYP0iO24gwe5YfRnqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11012'),
  ('497131927805042870', 'Damage', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Jeff F. King, Thomas M. Harting', 'Frank Hannah', 'Steve Austin, Walton Goggins, Laura Vandervoort, William B. Davis, Christina Jastrzembska, Lynda Boyd, Katelyn Mager, Giles Panton', 'R', 'An ex-con battles it out in the cage to pay for the operation that would save the daughter of his victim. Along the way he finds fatherly love, and friendship, in the most unlikely of places.', 'An ex-con battles it out in the cage to pay for the operation that would save the daughter of his victim. Along the way he finds fatherly love, and friendship, in the most unlikely of places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qH5K0RDwcTRvXnIkzuO2X7QQwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24832'),
  ('376344866477548832', 'Damaged', 2024, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Stewart Hamilton, Christian Otty, Sean Hind', 'Paul Aniello, Koji Steven Sakai, Gianni Capaldi', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Vincent Cassel, Gianni Capaldi, Kate Dickie, John Hannah, Laura Haddock, Brian McCardie, Samantha Coughlan', 'R', 'A Chicago detective travels to Scotland after an emerging serial killer’s crimes match those that he investigated five years earlier, one of which was the crime scene of his murdered girlfriend.', 'A Chicago detective travels to Scotland after an emerging serial killer’s crimes match those that he investigated five years earlier, one of which was the crime scene of his murdered girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMO0YLXgJZBnIAjoTSz26zE33YN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1105407'),
  ('673485422363344065', 'Damaged Lives', 1933, 'Drama', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, Allen G. Siegler', 'Eugène Brieux, Edgar G. Ulmer, Donald Davis', 'Diane Sinclair, Lyman Williams, Harry Myers, Marceline Day, Jason Robards Sr., Charlotte Merriam, Murray Kinnell, George Irving', 'NR', 'An extramarital affair leads to a young couple contracting venereal disease.', 'An extramarital affair leads to a young couple contracting venereal disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4HCEbfyhY8157p9ljjLgMwlhpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140581'),
  ('472341585839448448', 'Damascus Cover', 2017, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Chloë Thomson, Daniel Zelik Berk', 'Daniel Zelik Berk, Samantha Newton', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Olivia Thirlby, John Hurt, Jürgen Prochnow, Igal Naor, Navid Negahban, Aki Avni, Selva Rasalingam', 'R', 'A spy navigates the precarious terrain of love and survival during an undercover mission in Syria.', 'A spy navigates the precarious terrain of love and survival during an undercover mission in Syria.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fstGX2lMtdPvDbrfg58MqB7kNzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324538'),
  ('229263758886820800', 'Damen', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Katharina Bischof', 'Stefanie Kremser', 'Salka Weber, Şafak Şengül, Anja Herden, Viet Pham, Patrick Isermeyer', null, 'Maya, Mitte 30, lebt in einer Münchener Wohngemeinschaft mit der temperamentvollen Sema, Optikerin und zugleich Influencerin und versucht, möglichst unbeschwert in der Gegenwart zu leben. Doch das Messie-Problem ihrer Mutter, bei dem ihr Vater leider auch keine Hilfe ist, holt sie ein. Ihre Balance zwischen den Jobs als mobile Nagelpflegerin und freie Maskenbildnerin am Theater gerät zunehmend ins Wanken - und dann verliebt sie sich auch noch in den Paradiesvogel des Stückes, verkörpert von dem charmanten, aber etwas flatterhaften Tänzer Philip. Zum Glück wird Maya von einer Gruppe kluger, humorvoller Frauen verschiedenster Herkunft umgeben, die ihr mit perfekten Fingernägeln, Witz und Lebensweisheiten zur Seite stehen: denn nur wer auch mal zurückblickt, findet den Rückenwind zum Abheben. So verschmelzen überraschend und wundersam die Geschichten afroamerikanischer GIs, vietnamesischer Boatpeople sowie türkischer und angolanischer Einwanderer im Hier und Heute und mit Mayas Leben in München.', 'Maya, Mitte 30, lebt in einer Münchener Wohngemeinschaft mit der temperamentvollen Sema, Optikerin und zugleich Influencerin und versucht, möglichst unbeschwert in der Gegenwart zu leben. Doch das Messie-Problem ihrer Mutter, bei dem ihr Vater leider auch keine Hilfe ist, holt sie ein. Ihre Balance zwischen den Jobs als mobile Nagelpflegerin und freie Maskenbildnerin am Theater gerät zunehmend ins Wanken - und dann verliebt sie sich auch noch in den Paradiesvogel des Stückes, verkörpert von dem charmanten, aber etwas flatterhaften Tänzer Philip. Zum Glück wird Maya von einer Gruppe kluger, humorvoller Frauen verschiedenster Herkunft umgeben, die ihr mit perfekten Fingernägeln, Witz und Lebensweisheiten zur Seite stehen: denn nur wer auch mal zurückblickt, findet den Rückenwind zum Abheben. So verschmelzen überraschend und wundersam die Geschichten afroamerikanischer GIs, vietnamesischer Boatpeople sowie türkischer und angolanischer Einwanderer im Hier und Heute und mit Mayas Leben in München.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FcWL5P0YwqTbCgCuZBLk1Hai3Yos.jpg', 'plex:movie:damen-2026'),
  ('1082631304017326410', 'Dames', 1934, 'Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Ray Enright, Busby Berkeley, Sidney Hickox', 'Delmer Daves', 'Joan Blondell, Dick Powell, Ruby Keeler, Zasu Pitts, Guy Kibbee, Hugh Herbert, Arthur Vinton, Phil Regan', null, 'A reformer''s daughter wins the lead role in a scandalous Broadway show.', 'A reformer''s daughter wins the lead role in a scandalous Broadway show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBRbAgn9FrC5RY48RiwMTl8QlbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43903'),
  ('659622524854229086', 'Damien - Omen II', 1978, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Bill Butler, Don Taylor, Al Nicholson', 'Stanley Mann, Mike Hodges', 'William Holden, Lee Grant, Jonathan Scott-Taylor, Robert Foxworth, Nicholas Pryor, Lew Ayres, Sylvia Sidney, Lance Henriksen', 'R', 'Since the sudden and suspicious deaths of his parents, young Damien has been in the charge of his wealthy aunt and uncle and enrolled in a military school. Widely feared to be the Antichrist, he relentlessly plots to seize control of his uncle''s business empire — and the world.', 'Since the sudden and suspicious deaths of his parents, young Damien has been in the charge of his wealthy aunt and uncle and enrolled in a military school. Widely feared to be the Antichrist, he relentlessly plots to seize control of his uncle''s business empire — and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nZBPvfAgy0GBTEw9YxAuWhoPj96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10766'),
  ('239174904219729957', 'Damini', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rajkumar Santoshi', 'Dilip Shukla, Sutanu Gupta', 'Meenakshi Sheshadri, Sunny Deol, Rishi Kapoor, Tinnu Anand, Vijayendra Ghatge, Rohini Hattangadi, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Amrish Puri', null, 'The theme revolves around the character Damini who represents truth and innocence. After her marriage in renowned wealthy family, Damini happens to see a cruel act done by her brother-in-law. She wants the victim to get justice, but the family including her husband oppose her, which leads her to leave the house. Soon she is helped by a drunkard, an ex-advocate, who helps her in all respect to reach to her aim and therefore justice', 'The theme revolves around the character Damini who represents truth and innocence. After her marriage in renowned wealthy family, Damini happens to see a cruel act done by her brother-in-law. She wants the victim to get justice, but the family including her husband oppose her, which leads her to leave the house. Soon she is helped by a drunkard, an ex-advocate, who helps her in all respect to reach to her aim and therefore justice', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHLHZG9aVO2zg3q5k5BIjvaEAsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138934'),
  ('292970567893280389', 'Dammi', 2023, 'Drama', 'Benoît Soler, Anaïs Couette, Cyril Pavaux', 'Rosa Attab, Yann Demange', 'Riz Ahmed, Souheila Yacoub, Yousfi Henine, Isabelle Adjani, Sandor Funtek, Suzy Bemba, Soumaye Bocoum, Aissatou Diallo Sagna', null, 'Returning to Paris, a man moves through memories of his past and surreal fragments of the present, searching for connection with his estranged father. On his journey, he meets a French-Algerian woman. As their intimacy grows, he is confronted with his shame and fears while exploring his lost Arab identity… Behind Paris is Algiers.', 'Returning to Paris, a man moves through memories of his past and surreal fragments of the present, searching for connection with his estranged father. On his journey, he meets a French-Algerian woman. As their intimacy grows, he is confronted with his shame and fears while exploring his lost Arab identity… Behind Paris is Algiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQk07kmMtuCDv87O7PC9vaPR5eR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147338'),
  ('779120441003811388', 'Damn the War', 1914, 'War, Drama', 'Alfred Machin', 'Alfred Machin', 'Baert, Suzanne Berni, Fernand Crommelynck, Nadia D''Angely, Henri Goidsen, Albert Hendrickx', null, 'An army pilot is visiting the home of another army pilot in a neighboring country, and falling in love with his sister, when war breaks out.', 'An army pilot is visiting the home of another army pilot in a neighboring country, and falling in love with his sister, when war breaks out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yC89sqsGpe6Yo8stfa3xyxrqocJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280570'),
