  ('132224247140737197', 'Damocles', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Manuel Schapira, Antoine Roch', 'Manuel Schapira, Raphaël Chevènement, Delphine de Vigan', 'Manu Payet, Laëtitia Spigarelli, Alma Jodorowsky, Gilles Cohen, Blanche Gardin, Claude Gensac, Olivier de Benoist, Xavier Alcan', null, 'Hélène and Paul, early 30s and long-term singles, have been living in a two-person flat for years. Currently, graphic designer Paul wants to escape the digital constraints of his time and has acquired an age-old phone on which only "real" friends can reach him. One evening Paul gets from a friend at a party, his future predicted: Soon he will meet the love of his life, but also commit a murder. A short time later, when he meets the stunning Camille and falls in love with her, he begins to doubt with all luck. Could the prophecy really be true?', 'Hélène and Paul, early 30s and long-term singles, have been living in a two-person flat for years. Currently, graphic designer Paul wants to escape the digital constraints of his time and has acquired an age-old phone on which only "real" friends can reach him. One evening Paul gets from a friend at a party, his future predicted: Soon he will meet the love of his life, but also commit a murder. A short time later, when he meets the stunning Camille and falls in love with her, he begins to doubt with all luck. Could the prophecy really be true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4pgvDzGsWBXghLCXgFJ6Szo1Bh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:417500'),
  ('896411130170276735', 'Damon the Mower', 1972, 'Animation', 'George Dunning', 'George Dunning', null, null, 'Inspired by an Andrew Marvell poem, George Dunning sketched short phrases of animated movement on index cards, which were then stuck to a table top and filmed. Animation bared to the bone, and still extraordinary.', 'Inspired by an Andrew Marvell poem, George Dunning sketched short phrases of animated movement on index cards, which were then stuck to a table top and filmed. Animation bared to the bone, and still extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vczg8rYZ6yPKHsG26lLSmBPS3dk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246193'),
