  ('456297260121237555', 'Dampyr', 2022, 'Horror, Fantasy, Action', 'Gail Stevens, Rebecca Farhall, Vittorio Omodei Zorini', 'Mauro Boselli, Alberto Ostini, Mauro Uzzeo', 'Wade Briggs, Stuart Martin, Frida Gustavsson, Sebastian Croft, Luke Roberts, David Morrissey, Radu Andrei Micu, Ionut Grama', 'R', 'In war-torn Balkans, bogus monster hunter Harlan Draka is hired by soldiers who happen to be under attack by an army of actual vampires, uncovering the hidden truth about his past in the process: he is half-human and half-vampire... a Dampyr.', 'In war-torn Balkans, bogus monster hunter Harlan Draka is hired by soldiers who happen to be under attack by an army of actual vampires, uncovering the hidden truth about his past in the process: he is half-human and half-vampire... a Dampyr.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdWjqmX4x0ObKIPqkr8Vptj99AZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644124'),
  ('85595093922111240', 'Damsel', 2018, 'Western, Drama, Comedy', 'David Zellner, Nathan Zellner, Adam Stone', 'David Zellner, Nathan Zellner', 'Robert Pattinson, Mia Wasikowska, David Zellner, Nathan Zellner, Joseph Billingiere, Robert Forster, Morgan Lund, David Wingo', 'R', 'Oregon, a small town near the sea, around 1870. Henry, a grieving man who aspires to preach as a way to overcome his unfortunate past, reunites with eccentric pioneer Samuel Alabaster, who has hired him to officiate at his marriage to the precious Penelope. What Henry ignores is that both must embark on a dangerous journey through the inhospitable wilderness to meet her.', 'Oregon, a small town near the sea, around 1870. Henry, a grieving man who aspires to preach as a way to overcome his unfortunate past, reunites with eccentric pioneer Samuel Alabaster, who has hired him to officiate at his marriage to the precious Penelope. What Henry ignores is that both must embark on a dangerous journey through the inhospitable wilderness to meet her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNZxjsJwmKorpPvd0kquJffYROr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:414018'),
  ('1134653517166787109', 'Damsel', 2024, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Larry Fong, Jason Knox-Johnston, Steven Hall', 'Dan Mazeau', 'Millie Bobby Brown, Brooke Carter, Nick Robinson, Robin Wright, Milo Twomey, Ray Winstone, Angela Bassett, Nicole Joseph', 'PG-13', 'A young woman''s marriage to a charming prince turns into a fierce fight for survival when she''s offered up as a sacrifice to a fire-breathing dragon.', 'A young woman''s marriage to a charming prince turns into a fierce fight for survival when she''s offered up as a sacrifice to a fire-breathing dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgHbB9DCE9aE57zkHjSmseszh6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763215'),
  ('169616009418513382', 'Damsels in Distress', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Whit Stillman, Doug Emmett, Daniel Lugo', 'Whit Stillman', 'Greta Gerwig, Lio Tipton, Megalyn Echikunwoke, Carrie MacLemore, Ryan Metcalf, Jermaine Crawford, Caitlin FitzGerald, Zach Woods', 'PG-13', 'A trio of beautiful girls set out to revolutionize life at a grungy American university: the dynamic leader Violet Wister, principled Rose and sexy Heather. They welcome transfer student Lily into their group which seeks to help severely depressed students with a program of good hygiene and musical dance numbers.', 'A trio of beautiful girls set out to revolutionize life at a grungy American university: the dynamic leader Violet Wister, principled Rose and sexy Heather. They welcome transfer student Lily into their group which seeks to help severely depressed students with a program of good hygiene and musical dance numbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kF5kdsQbRh1U8Bvjyu6iIxOAsEx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82533'),
  ('403143899638675138', 'Dan in Real Life', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Peter Hedges, Lawrence Sher', 'Peter Hedges, Pierce Gardner', 'Steve Carell, Juliette Binoche, Dane Cook, Alison Pill, Britt Robertson, Marlene Lawston, Dianne Wiest, John Mahoney', 'PG-13', 'Advice columnist Dan Burns is an expert on relationships, but somehow struggles to succeed as a brother, a son and a single parent to three precocious daughters. Things get even more complicated when Dan finds out that the woman he falls in love with is actually his brother''s new girlfriend.', 'Advice columnist Dan Burns is an expert on relationships, but somehow struggles to succeed as a brother, a son and a single parent to three precocious daughters. Things get even more complicated when Dan finds out that the woman he falls in love with is actually his brother''s new girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJkkkG4ditqNzlua0oJzoaICGiz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7211'),
  ('527739795581812269', 'Dana Carvey: Straight White Male, 60', 2016, 'Comedy, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Marcus Raboy', 'Dana Carvey', 'Dana Carvey', null, 'Emmy-winning comedian Dana Carvey blends pitch-perfect tales on big personalities with so-true-it-hurts stories from his life as a dad of millennials.', 'Emmy-winning comedian Dana Carvey blends pitch-perfect tales on big personalities with so-true-it-hurts stories from his life as a dad of millennials.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fL0q2Po8uD75wcU2mu8MPN4pjge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423122'),
  ('121529483168188933', 'Dance ''Til Dawn', 1988, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Paul Schneider', 'Steve Kreinberg, Andy Guerdat', 'Alyssa Milano, Brian Bloom, Christina Applegate, Matthew Perry, Tracey Gold, Tempestt Bledsoe, Chris Young, Brent Chalem', 'NR', 'The seniors of Herbert Hoover High School hold a prom they will never forget. Popular girl Shelley ditches her date and ends up spending the night with the more unpopular Dan; Kevin the jock goes out with nerdy Angela because he has heard she is easy; Patrice blames her boyfriend Roger for everything that doesn''t go the way she wants it to.', 'The seniors of Herbert Hoover High School hold a prom they will never forget. Popular girl Shelley ditches her date and ends up spending the night with the more unpopular Dan; Kevin the jock goes out with nerdy Angela because he has heard she is easy; Patrice blames her boyfriend Roger for everything that doesn''t go the way she wants it to.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXA0q8hZdKVeoEmkUUsaCytvDsP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24626'),
  ('927286513887815495', 'Dance Academy: The Movie', 2017, 'Drama', 'Jeffrey Walker', 'Samantha Strauss', 'Xenia Goodwin, Alicia Banit, Dena Kaplan, Thomas Lacey, Keiynan Lonsdale, Jordan Rodrigues, Tara Morice, Miranda Otto', null, 'This 2017 movie follows the original dance academy TV show and tracks where the characters are in their lives now.', 'This 2017 movie follows the original dance academy TV show and tracks where the characters are in their lives now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dduMngstBR9Ctn6Q4GN5f9rTEgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429765'),
  ('580741718865500950', 'Dance Dance', 1987, 'Action, Music', 'Babbar Subhash, Bappi Lahiri', 'Babbar Subhash', 'Mithun Chakraborty, Mandakini, Amrish Puri, Shakti Kapoor, Smita Patil, Om Shivpuri, Dalip Tahil, Geeta Sidharath', null, 'Radha (Smita Patil) and Ramu (Mithun Chakraborty) are siblings. Their parents Shyam and Sita are singers. Once, Shyam and Sita go to perform in Jalpaiguri where Sita catches the eye of a rich and powerful man called A.M. Singh (Amrish Puri). He stops them in the mid way home, kills Shyam and rapes Sita. Radha and Ramu get the news that their parents are dead and become homeless. Years later, Radha and Ramu have achieved success and are popular singers now. Ramu falls in love with Janita (Mandakini) and Radha gets married to Resham (Shakti Kapoor). But when Janita has to perform in Jalpaiguri she catches the eye of none other than A.M. Singh. Will history repeat itself, or can Ramu rescue Janita and his mother?', 'Radha (Smita Patil) and Ramu (Mithun Chakraborty) are siblings. Their parents Shyam and Sita are singers. Once, Shyam and Sita go to perform in Jalpaiguri where Sita catches the eye of a rich and powerful man called A.M. Singh (Amrish Puri). He stops them in the mid way home, kills Shyam and rapes Sita. Radha and Ramu get the news that their parents are dead and become homeless. Years later, Radha and Ramu have achieved success and are popular singers now. Ramu falls in love with Janita (Mandakini) and Radha gets married to Resham (Shakti Kapoor). But when Janita has to perform in Jalpaiguri she catches the eye of none other than A.M. Singh. Will history repeat itself, or can Ramu rescue Janita and his mother?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4bPDJ6Ru6rVEBqz9IypX2XkjuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131146'),
  ('1133351807452681535', 'Dance First', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Antonio Paladino, Laura Mihartescu, James Marsh', 'Neil Forsyth', 'Gabriel Byrne, Aidan Gillen, Sandrine Bonnaire, Fionn O''Shea, Maxine Peake, Bronagh Gallagher, Lisa Dwyer Hogg, Caroline Boulton', null, 'Parisian bon vivant, World War II Resistance fighter, Nobel Prize-winning playwright, philandering husband and recluse…Samuel Beckett lived a life of many parts. Titled after Beckett’s famous ethos “Dance first, think later”, the film is a sweeping account of the life of this 20th-century icon.', 'Parisian bon vivant, World War II Resistance fighter, Nobel Prize-winning playwright, philandering husband and recluse…Samuel Beckett lived a life of many parts. Titled after Beckett’s famous ethos “Dance first, think later”, the film is a sweeping account of the life of this 20th-century icon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DyDZrTBFH3apaLRqGiZfgaGC3p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978114'),
  ('760955038907611899', 'Dance Flick', 2009, 'Music, Comedy, Action', 'Damien Dante Wayans, Mark Irwin', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Damien Dante Wayans, Craig Wayans', 'Marlon Wayans, Shawn Wayans, Shoshana Bush, Damon Wayans Jr., Essence Atkins, Affion Crockett, Chris Elliott, David Alan Grier', 'PG-13', 'Street dancer Thomas Uncles is from the wrong side of the tracks, but his bond with the beautiful Megan White might help the duo realize their dreams as they enter in the mother of all dance battles.', 'Street dancer Thomas Uncles is from the wrong side of the tracks, but his bond with the beautiful Megan White might help the duo realize their dreams as they enter in the mother of all dance battles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqaM8jQhALhULwvm3eEepkBTQHJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21724'),
  ('539315209796395551', 'Dance Hall Racket', 1953, 'Action, Adventure, Crime', 'Phil Tucker, W. Merle Connell', 'Lenny Bruce', 'Timothy Farrell, Lenny Bruce, Bernie Jones, Honey Harlow, Sally Marr', 'NR', 'A gangster who operates a sleazy dance hall uses a sadistic bodyguard to keep his girls afraid and his customers in line.', 'A gangster who operates a sleazy dance hall uses a sadistic bodyguard to keep his girls afraid and his customers in line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmwMDUbQzCUpUBx2ZXiCKcJElcM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89664'),
  ('635167506047469185', 'Dance Macabre', 1992, 'Horror, Romance', 'Greydon Clark, Nikolai Pokoptsev, Robin Hessman', 'Greydon Clark', 'Robert Englund, Michelle Zeitlin, Marianna Moen, Julene Renee, Nina Goldman, Irina Davidoff, Aleksandr Sergeyev, Natasha Fesson', 'R', 'Jessica, an American ballerina, reluctantly enrolls in a Russian dance academy, where she meets the charismatic choreographer Anthony. A dead ringer for his long dead lover, Jessica becomes his favorite student -- and his personal obsession.', 'Jessica, an American ballerina, reluctantly enrolls in a Russian dance academy, where she meets the charismatic choreographer Anthony. A dead ringer for his long dead lover, Jessica becomes his favorite student -- and his personal obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8b58x4AcXHSPYzfwFOSLog59lI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126022'),
  ('602489048898692756', 'Dance Me Outside', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Comedy', 'Bruce McDonald, Mirosław Baszak', 'Don McKellar, John Frizzell, Bruce McDonald', 'Ryan Rajendra Black, Adam Beach, Jennifer Podemski, Lisa LaCroix, Kevin Hicks, Rose Marie Trudeau, Gloria May Eshkibok, Selim Running Bear Sandoval', null, 'Explores the sensitive, and tense, relationship between life on an First Nations reservation and life in the outside world. When Native Canadian Silas Crow is forced to write a personal essay in order to get a much-desired job, he tells the story of the rape and murder of an Indian girl by a drunken thug. When the killer received a lenient two-year sentence for manslaughter, the First Nations community felt shock and anger—and tried desperately to deal with the after-effects of this lack of justice.', 'Explores the sensitive, and tense, relationship between life on an First Nations reservation and life in the outside world. When Native Canadian Silas Crow is forced to write a personal essay in order to get a much-desired job, he tells the story of the rape and murder of an Indian girl by a drunken thug. When the killer received a lenient two-year sentence for manslaughter, the First Nations community felt shock and anger—and tried desperately to deal with the after-effects of this lack of justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exqsixP7i48pMsV2ejfBaSyWhno.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96461'),
  ('228558466455051301', 'Dance Me to My Song', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rolf de Heer', 'Rolf de Heer, Heather Rose, Frederick Stahl', 'John Brumpton, Rena Owen, Joey Kennedy, Heather Rose, Carmel Johnson', null, 'The story of Julia, a disabled woman in a wheelchair and voice synthesizer, who''s trapped psychologically by a cruel, manipulative caregiver. After the arrival of a mysterious man, Julia begins to question the day-to-day dramas and frustrations she''s tolerated for years. An achingly genuine and profoundly moving drama about a woman born with cerebral palsy.', 'The story of Julia, a disabled woman in a wheelchair and voice synthesizer, who''s trapped psychologically by a cruel, manipulative caregiver. After the arrival of a mysterious man, Julia begins to question the day-to-day dramas and frustrations she''s tolerated for years. An achingly genuine and profoundly moving drama about a woman born with cerebral palsy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deA55xHWzEDn95K1zkwWBhYqken.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139075'),
  ('525774911898626481', 'Dance of Chance', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Claude Lelouch, Robert Alazraki', 'Valérie Perrin, Claude Lelouch', 'Stéphane De Groodt, Elsa Zylberstein, Ary Abittan, Béatrice Dalle, Rufus, Philippe Lellouche, Agnès Soral, Marianne Denicourt', null, 'That day, there’s tension in the air: Marianne has her car and dog stolen from a highway parking lot. Stéphane is constantly arguing with his wife. Noémie can no longer stand her husband Aldo’s infidelities. A little-known orchestra performs for the last time…', 'That day, there’s tension in the air: Marianne has her car and dog stolen from a highway parking lot. Stéphane is constantly arguing with his wife. Noémie can no longer stand her husband Aldo’s infidelities. A little-known orchestra performs for the last time…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vDJYCBOskhoty54QcXQZAZHF86A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715313'),
  ('788395791563419824', 'Dance of the Damned', 1989, 'Horror, Drama, Romance', 'Katt Shea, Phedon Papamichael, Albert T. Dickerson III', 'Katt Shea, Andy Ruben', 'Starr Andreeff, Cyril O''Reilly, Maria Ford, Debbie Nassar, Athena Worthy, Tom Ruben, Chuck Rhee, J Bartell', 'R', 'A vampire follows his instincts to a strip joint where he focuses in on one of the performers. He picks her for his meal because she is contemplating suicide, but he wants to share her life before taking it, and during the course of the evening they discuss their differences, their fears, and their lifestyles. As the moment of truth approaches, the woman becomes less sure that she wants to die.', 'A vampire follows his instincts to a strip joint where he focuses in on one of the performers. He picks her for his meal because she is contemplating suicide, but he wants to share her life before taking it, and during the course of the evening they discuss their differences, their fears, and their lifestyles. As the moment of truth approaches, the woman becomes less sure that she wants to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwBCWAo241iRrZ3yoDgsQ4hIW9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27481'),
  ('497211399037473242', 'Dance of the Dead', 2005, 'Horror, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Tobe Hooper', 'Richard Christian Matheson', 'Robert Englund, Jessica Lowndes, Jonathan Tucker, Marylin Norry, Ryan McDonald, Lucie Guest', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic society, seventeen-year-old Peggy lives with her over-protective mother and works in the family restaurant. When punks enter the restaurant, and one takes an interest in her, Peggy makes a decision that will change her life forever.', 'In a post-apocalyptic society, seventeen-year-old Peggy lives with her over-protective mother and works in the family restaurant. When punks enter the restaurant, and one takes an interest in her, Peggy makes a decision that will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVQ3mUFIcuMgFfzbkdTOS35mlkh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319324'),
  ('446477195680125594', 'Dance of the Dead', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gregg Bishop', 'Joe Ballarini', 'Greyson Chadwick, Jared Kusnitz, Chandler Darby, Carissa Capobianco, Randy McDowell, Michael V. Mammoliti, Lucas Till, Justin Welborn', 'R', 'With Prom only hours away, the usual suspects of Cosa High (Cheerleaders, geeks, bad boys and the happy-go-lucky student council alike) are preoccupied with the annual rituals of teendom. On the night of the big dance when the dead unexpectedly rise to eat the living, polar opposite groups will be forced to unite in their final chance to save the town from the zombies.', 'With Prom only hours away, the usual suspects of Cosa High (Cheerleaders, geeks, bad boys and the happy-go-lucky student council alike) are preoccupied with the annual rituals of teendom. On the night of the big dance when the dead unexpectedly rise to eat the living, polar opposite groups will be forced to unite in their final chance to save the town from the zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUyLXz372Wd0r4xURDsYqX2m98w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13094'),
  ('745568399827534011', 'Dance of the Dragon', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Radel, Max Mannix', 'Max Mannix, John Radel', 'Jang Hyuk, Fann Wong, Jason Scott Lee, Kim Eung-soo, Yeo Jin-goo, Lim Kay Tong, Jason Chan, Andrea Lim', null, 'The story of three people whose lives are pulled into review and assessment when their paths cross. The initial sparks of what could be a new romance plays off against a couple falling out of love, a student and teacher, a father and son, a mother''s influence and competing suitors - all explored with sensitivity, delicacy and refined artistry.', 'The story of three people whose lives are pulled into review and assessment when their paths cross. The initial sparks of what could be a new romance plays off against a couple falling out of love, a student and teacher, a father and son, a mother''s influence and competing suitors - all explored with sensitivity, delicacy and refined artistry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNyKo4LPDsEFE3jx1tGl4hO9Wqv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27943'),
  ('1007270009793798928', 'Dance of the Drunk Mantis', 1979, 'Action, Comedy', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Raymond Chang', 'Ng See-Yuen', 'Simon Yuen Siu-Tien, Yuen Shun-Yi, Hwang Jang-Lee, Corey Yuen, Linda Lin Ying, Yen Shi-Kwan, Chin Yuet-Sang, Brandy Yuen Jan-Yeung', null, 'A year after training young Jackie Chan in the Drunken Fist, Sam the Seed discovers he has a son, Foggy. He tries to train Foggy but to no avail. Foggy is then trained in Drunken Fist from his uncle as he must face his father''s rival, Rubber Legs, another Drunken Fist master who combines it with Mantis Fist to create a deadly style.', 'A year after training young Jackie Chan in the Drunken Fist, Sam the Seed discovers he has a son, Foggy. He tries to train Foggy but to no avail. Foggy is then trained in Drunken Fist from his uncle as he must face his father''s rival, Rubber Legs, another Drunken Fist master who combines it with Mantis Fist to create a deadly style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNOdUZHi7MKhFTq88ZIRqSGrQD3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49642'),
  ('1020211160131134729', 'Dance of the Forty One', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'David Pablos, Carolina Costa', 'Monika Revilla', 'Alfonso Herrera, Emiliano Zurita, Fernando Becerril, Mabel Cadena, Paulina Álvarez Muñoz, Rodrigo Virago, Fernanda Echevarría del Rivero, Sergio Solís', 'NR', 'Mexico City, November 1901. The police raid a private home where a secret party is being held. Among those attending is the son-in-law of President Porfirio Díaz.', 'Mexico City, November 1901. The police raid a private home where a secret party is being held. Among those attending is the son-in-law of President Porfirio Díaz.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcSqwsEtT7wKfQ8oKaaulMMGUdS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660637'),
  ('444425666239979852', 'Dance of the Seasons', 2024, 'Music', 'Tommy Pascal', null, 'Bobbi Jene Smith, Or Schraiber, Imre, Marne van Opstal, Emilie Leriche', null, 'To celebrate the tercentenary of Vivaldi''s Four Seasons, five choreographers - Franck Chartier, Bobbi Jene Smith, Or Schraiber, Imre & Marne Van Opstal and Emilie Leriche - take inspiration from Max Richter''s masterful recomposition of this great work.', 'To celebrate the tercentenary of Vivaldi''s Four Seasons, five choreographers - Franck Chartier, Bobbi Jene Smith, Or Schraiber, Imre & Marne Van Opstal and Emilie Leriche - take inspiration from Max Richter''s masterful recomposition of this great work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hotmbNJOhy1L8qnSAeW7DTWOIK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1477708'),
  ('683885144321606041', 'Dance of the Seasons: Winter, Snow Dance', 1900, 'Music', 'Alice Guy-Blaché', null, null, null, 'A dancer personifying Winter, dances in the snow. "L''Hiver: Danse de la neige" is the fourth and last film of the series DANSE DES SAISONS. "Le Printemps: Danse des roses", "L''Eté: Danse de la moisson" and "L''Automne: Danse des vendanges" are lost or unlocated.', 'A dancer personifying Winter, dances in the snow. "L''Hiver: Danse de la neige" is the fourth and last film of the series DANSE DES SAISONS. "Le Printemps: Danse des roses", "L''Eté: Danse de la moisson" and "L''Automne: Danse des vendanges" are lost or unlocated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySGbrToZISEQicortXzB0QCe6nx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119971'),
  ('818352263552933505', 'Dance to Death', 2017, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Andrey Volgin, Vyacheslav Lisnevsky', 'Andrey Zolotarev', 'Ivan Zhvakin, Lukerya Ilyashenko, Denis Shvedov, Agniya Ditkovskite, Aleksandr Tyutin, Nikita Volkov, Nikita Dyuvbanov, Ola Keyru', null, 'Deadly dance tournament is carried out in the city survived after nuclear apocalypse. Energy is extracted from the loser for the city to survive. A young guy from the street is forced to take part in the tournament and falls in love with girl who volunteered to participate in the battle. Will they survive or the arena will take their lives?', 'Deadly dance tournament is carried out in the city survived after nuclear apocalypse. Energy is extracted from the loser for the city to survive. A young guy from the street is forced to take part in the tournament and falls in love with girl who volunteered to participate in the battle. Will they survive or the arena will take their lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqIkXPLgt9rvHnzIbzlkw6dUJ4p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428356'),
  ('150002000241191486', 'Dance with a Stranger', 1985, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tony Aherne, Fraser Copp, Micky Finch', 'Shelagh Delaney', 'Miranda Richardson, Rupert Everett, Ian Holm, Matthew Carroll, Tom Chadbon, Jane Bertish, David Troughton, Paul Mooney', 'R', 'Ruth Ellis lives with her ten-year old son Andy next to a night club. One night she meets David Blakely, and they start a love affair. However, for David with his upper-class background, it is impossible to uphold the relationship. He breaks up with her, something which makes Ellis, obsessed by him, very upset.', 'Ruth Ellis lives with her ten-year old son Andy next to a night club. One night she meets David Blakely, and they start a love affair. However, for David with his upper-class background, it is impossible to uphold the relationship. He breaks up with her, something which makes Ellis, obsessed by him, very upset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwAXFN8qHnfaeeGx1a0OMqmCwcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40913'),
  ('790593305329691675', 'Dance with Death', 1992, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Charles Philip Moore, William H. Molina, Scott P. Levy', 'Daryl Haney', 'Maxwell Caulfield, Barbara Alyn Woods, Martin Mull, Catya Sassoon, Tracey Burch, Steven Williams, Jill Pierce, Sean''a Mahoney', 'R', 'A string of murders at a local strip joint gives a reporter the chance to do an undercover investigation. She gets a job as a stripper at the establishment, where she befriends some of the other women, who know more about what is happening than they have publicly admitted. As she gets closer to the truth, her life is put in jeopardy.', 'A string of murders at a local strip joint gives a reporter the chance to do an undercover investigation. She gets a job as a stripper at the establishment, where she befriends some of the other women, who know more about what is happening than they have publicly admitted. As she gets closer to the truth, her life is put in jeopardy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU23Sb6DdkF5TrXEnIpda5CP2SQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222353'),
  ('110827538669397132', 'Dance with Him', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valérie Guignabodet, Denis Rouden', 'Valérie Guignabodet', 'Mathilde Seigner, Sami Frey, Jean-François Pignon, Anny Duperey, Anthony Delon, Élodie Navarre, Marie-Bénédicte Roy', null, 'Three years after simultaneously parting with a philanderer husband and experiencing a dramatic fall during a horse jumping contest, Alexandra Balzan, a Parisian architect, regains an appetite for life and love after a chance encounter with an aging misanthrope of a master horseman and his horse', 'Three years after simultaneously parting with a philanderer husband and experiencing a dramatic fall during a horse jumping contest, Alexandra Balzan, a Parisian architect, regains an appetite for life and love after a chance encounter with an aging misanthrope of a master horseman and his horse', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9EsqeUzwaQ5sDCH6F0HFMHo55x8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61659'),
  ('313814972862492772', 'Dance with Me', 1998, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Fred Murphy, Randa Haines', 'Daryl Matthews', 'Vanessa Williams, Chayanne, Kris Kristofferson, Joan Plowright, Jane Krakowski, Beth Grant, Victor Marcel, Harry Groener', 'PG', 'Young Cuban Rafael just buried his mother, and comes to Houston to meet his father John for the first time. The difficult part is that John doesn''t know he is Rafael''s father. John runs a dance studio, and everyone prepares for the World Open Dance championship in Las Vegas. It soon becomes clear Rafael is a very good dancer, and Ruby is the biggest hope for the studio at the championship.', 'Young Cuban Rafael just buried his mother, and comes to Houston to meet his father John for the first time. The difficult part is that John doesn''t know he is Rafael''s father. John runs a dance studio, and everyone prepares for the World Open Dance championship in Las Vegas. It soon becomes clear Rafael is a very good dancer, and Ruby is the biggest hope for the studio at the championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNUxfWLFGfM7IC7LpxZqWRCnVMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17915'),
  ('853971212585531634', 'Dance with Me', 2019, 'Comedy, Music', 'Kazuhiro Taniguchi, Yûsuke Inoue, Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Shinobu Yaguchi', 'Ayaka Miyoshi, Yuu Yashiro, Chay, Takahiro Miura, Tsuyoshi Muro, Akira Takarada, Daikichi Sugawara, Miyabi Matsuura', null, 'Suzuki Shizuka is an office lady at a conglomerate who is hypnotized at a local amusement park and left under the spell. Now she is compelled to sing and dance whenever she hears any melody whatsoever. She heads back to the hypnotist for relief, but he is nowhere to be found. So Shizuka sets off on a journey around Japan to find him and break the spell.', 'Suzuki Shizuka is an office lady at a conglomerate who is hypnotized at a local amusement park and left under the spell. Now she is compelled to sing and dance whenever she hears any melody whatsoever. She heads back to the hypnotist for relief, but he is nowhere to be found. So Shizuka sets off on a journey around Japan to find him and break the spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrgLg0RejVlvmC9RivBZzbNhRYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596445'),
  ('970865384480767635', 'Dance with Me, Henry', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Charles Barton, George Robinson', 'Devery Freeman', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Gigi Perreau, Rusty Hamer, Mary Wickes, Ted de Corsia, Ron Hargrave, Frank Wilcox', null, 'Bud and Lou are the owners of the amusement park Kiddieland. Bud, a compulsive gambler, gets in trouble with the mob, and Lou finds himself struggling to keep his adopted children. When Bud is forced to make a shady deal, Lou tries to arrange a deal with the DA, but winds up framed for murder.', 'Bud and Lou are the owners of the amusement park Kiddieland. Bud, a compulsive gambler, gets in trouble with the mob, and Lou finds himself struggling to keep his adopted children. When Bud is forced to make a shady deal, Lou tries to arrange a deal with the DA, but winds up framed for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEVFeaIruZpfoPZOUxOqJU0zCeP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33480'),
  ('1088340973833942273', 'Dance with the Devil', 1997, 'Action, Thriller', 'Flavio Martínez Labiano, Álex de la Iglesia, Tod Swindell', 'Barry Gifford, David Trueba, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Rosie Perez, Javier Bardem, Harley Cross, Aimee Graham, Screamin'' Jay Hawkins, Don Stroud, Demián Bichir, Santiago Segura', null, 'She''s sexy, shameless and loves taking people to their limit. She''s a dangerous young woman who dreams about a jaguar that licks her naked body and sleeps by her side. Her past is bathed in blood and weird passions. Now she''s met the man of her wildest dreams. He''s dark, tough and mysterious. He likes robbing banks, trafficking in corpses and spicing it all with voodoo rituals. Together, the duo sets off toward Mexico destined to become the most feared outlaws in the continent.', 'She''s sexy, shameless and loves taking people to their limit. She''s a dangerous young woman who dreams about a jaguar that licks her naked body and sleeps by her side. Her past is bathed in blood and weird passions. Now she''s met the man of her wildest dreams. He''s dark, tough and mysterious. He likes robbing banks, trafficking in corpses and spicing it all with voodoo rituals. Together, the duo sets off toward Mexico destined to become the most feared outlaws in the continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS9TtRHIxXAUMnhiB1tWGigxd0t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9845'),
  ('662780042833124799', 'Dance with the Jackals', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker, Murat Tunçel', 'Murat Şeker, Selami Genli', 'Şevket Çoruh, İlker Ayrık, Timur Acar, Murat Akkoyunlu, Tuba Ünsal, Kemal Uçar, Didem Balçın, Sümer Tilmaç', null, 'Servet the accountant makes a plan to steal money from a client. He decides to get his brother-in-law Gökhan involved to use his account for the money transfer. When two more friends Meatball Necmi and Del Piero are added to the plan, things start going bad.', 'Servet the accountant makes a plan to steal money from a client. He decides to get his brother-in-law Gökhan involved to use his account for the money transfer. When two more friends Meatball Necmi and Del Piero are added to the plan, things start going bad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGAZY7OTQH6hToMzj4PZwpmVFIF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59811'),
  ('80997952451157312', 'Dance with the Jackals 2', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Şevket Çoruh, İlker Ayrık, Timur Acar, Murat Akkoyunlu, Didem Balçın, Hakan Bilgin, Doğa Rutkay, Ceyhun Yılmaz', null, 'Stuck in jail, a quartet of misfits seize the chance for early parole when authorities seek volunteers for a drug trial with uncertain effects', 'Stuck in jail, a quartet of misfits seize the chance for early parole when authorities seek volunteers for a drug trial with uncertain effects', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ryM9LFTSFVGXR7pDT8iQLdqMuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187976'),
  ('657553660543667069', 'Dance with the Jackals 3', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Şevket Çoruh, İlker Ayrık, Timur Acar, Murat Akkoyunlu, Didem Balçın, Derya Şensoy, Derya Baykal, Ünal Silver', null, 'Brother Gokhan, Accountant Servet, Meatball Necmi and Del Piero Hikmet are released from prison on probation and they join group therapy in order to be reintegrated to society.', 'Brother Gokhan, Accountant Servet, Meatball Necmi and Del Piero Hikmet are released from prison on probation and they join group therapy in order to be reintegrated to society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fNAIanGhqUUMyBVymDuuUn7JRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336292'),
  ('461019749549959560', 'Dance with the Jackals 4', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Şevket Çoruh, İlker Ayrık, Timur Acar, Murat Akkoyunlu, Didem Balçın, Hakan Bilgin, Hande Katipoğlu, Tim Seyfi', null, '5 best friends, in search of finding ways to get rich, finally find a lot of gold in the forest. Just as they think they finally did it, they get in trouble with a German godfather who kidnapped one of them since he wanted the gold. The besties finally save their friend and return their usual loser days.', '5 best friends, in search of finding ways to get rich, finally find a lot of gold in the forest. Just as they think they finally did it, they get in trouble with a German godfather who kidnapped one of them since he wanted the gold. The besties finally save their friend and return their usual loser days.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tKH6s1p4Ca709DfsFg4e7sz6nH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435246'),
  ('325700605349158703', 'Dance with the Jackals 5', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Murat Şeker', 'Murat Şeker', 'Şevket Çoruh, İlker Ayrık, Timur Acar, Murat Akkoyunlu, Didem Balçın, Hakan Bilgin, Hande Katipoğlu, Uraz Kaygılaroğlu', null, 'Conditionally released four friends from jail must be away 100 meters from each other. but in the time they can not stay away each other, and come together for new adventure.', 'Conditionally released four friends from jail must be away 100 meters from each other. but in the time they can not stay away each other, and come together for new adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s3TzGC0fVFGyZSF26XVrRTXzTcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601326'),
  ('1150858719742533143', 'Dance-Off', 2014, 'Romance, Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Frank Paladino, Alex Di Marco', 'Mark Goodman', 'Kathryn McCormick, Shane Harper, Finola Hughes, Carolyn Hennesy, Erin Cardillo, Tyne Stecklein, Kinna McInroe, Marlowe Peyton', null, 'Two cross-town rival dance teams go head to head for the National Nationals Championship.', 'Two cross-town rival dance teams go head to head for the National Nationals Championship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rpWrfWNxv0Y9v2qj4qx5SSxtqN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296370'),
  ('407791433507510401', 'Dance, Fools, Dance', 1931, 'Drama, Crime, Romance', 'Harry Beaumont, Douglas Shearer, Charles Rosher', 'Richard Schayer', 'Joan Crawford, Lester Vail, Cliff Edwards, William Bakewell, William Holden, Clark Gable, Earle Foxe, Purnell Pratt', 'NR', 'When misfortune hits hard on the Jordan family of Chicago''s upper class, Bonnie Jordan, a dazzling and witty girl, finds a job as an aspiring reporter; however, her naive younger brother Rodney takes a twisted path and gets involved with the wrong people.', 'When misfortune hits hard on the Jordan family of Chicago''s upper class, Bonnie Jordan, a dazzling and witty girl, finds a job as an aspiring reporter; however, her naive younger brother Rodney takes a twisted path and gets involved with the wrong people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwieBi0VsQpGnKLMOomldAWgipR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154515'),
  ('103391415686372098', 'Dance, Girl, Dance', 1940, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Dorothy Arzner, Russell Metty, Edward Ward', 'Frank Davis, Tess Slesinger', 'Maureen O''Hara, Louis Hayward, Lucille Ball, Virginia Field, Ralph Bellamy, Maria Ouspenskaya, Mary Carlisle, Katharine Alexander', 'NR', 'Judy O''Brien is an aspiring ballerina in a dance troupe. Also in the company is Bubbles, a brash mantrap who leaves the struggling troupe for a career in burlesque. When the company disbands, Bubbles gives Judy a thankless job as her stooge. The two eventually clash when both fall for the same man.', 'Judy O''Brien is an aspiring ballerina in a dance troupe. Also in the company is Bubbles, a brash mantrap who leaves the struggling troupe for a career in burlesque. When the company disbands, Bubbles gives Judy a thankless job as her stooge. The two eventually clash when both fall for the same man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1gJuUG7SeVAbhmO9qXvkEVKY3Pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32196'),
  ('780906661347004199', 'Dancehall Queen', 1997, 'Drama', 'Don Letts, Louis Mulvey, Rick Elgood', 'Suzanne Fenn, Don Letts, Ed Wallace', 'Audrey Reid, Carl Davis, Mark Danvers, Henry Brown, Carl Bradshaw, Marlon King, Paul Campbell, Cherine Anderson', null, 'Marcia has a tough life in Kingston, Jamaica, where she''s the sole provider for her teenage daughter. Her business as a street vendor is threatened by thug Priest, and Marcia makes matters worse when she accepts money from Larry, who has eyes for her daughter. To get out of her problems, Marcia devises a plan that involves entering a dance contest in disguise, winning the top prize and pitting both men against each other.', 'Marcia has a tough life in Kingston, Jamaica, where she''s the sole provider for her teenage daughter. Her business as a street vendor is threatened by thug Priest, and Marcia makes matters worse when she accepts money from Larry, who has eyes for her daughter. To get out of her problems, Marcia devises a plan that involves entering a dance contest in disguise, winning the top prize and pitting both men against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1m05xnZbgYWqueMJQNSAaIdal5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19159'),
  ('100347711819782431', 'Dancer', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Steven Cantor, Mark Wolf', null, 'Sergei Polunin, Jade Hale-Christofi, Galyna Polunina, Vladymyr Polunin, Valentino Zucchetti, Igor Zelensky, Galina Ivanovna, David LaChapelle', null, 'Sergei Polunin is a breathtaking ballet talent who questions his existence and his commitment to dance just as he is about to become a legend.', 'Sergei Polunin is a breathtaking ballet talent who questions his existence and his commitment to dance just as he is about to become a legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PtRUBuAn2EX8HGX36LWR4PLeq6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411201'),
  ('1146793754790397100', 'Dancer, Texas Pop. 81', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Tim McCanlies, Andrew Dintenfass', 'Tim McCanlies', 'Breckin Meyer, Peter Facinelli, Eddie Mills, Ethan Embry, Ashley Johnson, Patricia Wettig, Michael O''Neill, Eddie Jones', 'PG', 'Four guys, best friends, have grown up together in DANCER, TEXAS POP. 81, a tiny town in West Texas. Years ago, they made a solemn vow to leave town together as soon as they graduate. Now, it''s that weekend and the time has come to "put up or shut up." The clock is ticking and as all 81 people in the town watch, comment, offer advice and place bets, these four very different boys with unique backgrounds struggle with the biggest decision of their lives... whether to stay or leave home.', 'Four guys, best friends, have grown up together in DANCER, TEXAS POP. 81, a tiny town in West Texas. Years ago, they made a solemn vow to leave town together as soon as they graduate. Now, it''s that weekend and the time has come to "put up or shut up." The clock is ticking and as all 81 people in the town watch, comment, offer advice and place bets, these four very different boys with unique backgrounds struggle with the biggest decision of their lives... whether to stay or leave home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khV9zPcvgOjrqwlk3dI1lGojZib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78373'),
  ('69616273067090163', 'Dancers', 1987, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Herbert Ross, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Sarah Kernochan', 'Mikhail Baryshnikov, Alessandra Ferri, Leslie Browne, Tommy Rall, Lynn Seymour, Victor Barbee, Julie Kent, Mariangela Melato', 'PG', 'A successful aging dancer takes a young female protegee.', 'A successful aging dancer takes a young female protegee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0NbLOYiUtKiM47lmL2OXbB8JfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163630'),
  ('804694668220659751', 'Dances with Dragon', 1991, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Paul Wong Kwan, Henry Chan, Wong Jing', 'Wong Jing', 'Andy Lau, Sharla Cheung, Deanie Ip, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Yvonne Yung Hung, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Wu Ma, May Lo Mei-Wei', null, 'Aaron, a young, successful Chinese businessman, drifts on to a rural island after a scuba accident. Mistaken for an illegal immigrant, he is forced to take refuge in a small, family-run grocery store. Enjoying the riches to rags transition, he tells nobody his true identity, and falls in love with the grocery store owner''s daughter, Yvonne. But while Aaron enjoys his life of anonymity, Yvonne covets the chance to escape her poverty. Meanwhile, in Aaron''s absense, a plot has been hatched to take over his company. Are Aaron''s and Yvonne''s lives too different to find happiness together?', 'Aaron, a young, successful Chinese businessman, drifts on to a rural island after a scuba accident. Mistaken for an illegal immigrant, he is forced to take refuge in a small, family-run grocery store. Enjoying the riches to rags transition, he tells nobody his true identity, and falls in love with the grocery store owner''s daughter, Yvonne. But while Aaron enjoys his life of anonymity, Yvonne covets the chance to escape her poverty. Meanwhile, in Aaron''s absense, a plot has been hatched to take over his company. Are Aaron''s and Yvonne''s lives too different to find happiness together?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wttxqne5W1wl0sIWsPHadVmxqcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172782'),
  ('651559066214163234', 'Dances with Wolves', 1990, 'Adventure, Drama, Western', 'Kevin Costner, Dean Semler, John Huneck', 'Michael Blake', 'Kevin Costner, Mary McDonnell, Graham Greene, Rodney A. Grant, Floyd ''Red Crow'' Westerman, Tantoo Cardinal, Robert Pastorelli, Charles Rocket', 'PG-13', 'Wounded Civil War soldier John Dunbar tries to commit suicide—and becomes a hero instead. As a reward, he''s assigned to his dream post, a remote junction on the Western frontier, and soon makes unlikely friends with the local Sioux tribe.', 'Wounded Civil War soldier John Dunbar tries to commit suicide—and becomes a hero instead. As a reward, he''s assigned to his dream post, a remote junction on the Western frontier, and soon makes unlikely friends with the local Sioux tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hw0ZEHAaTqTxSXGVwUFX7uvanSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581'),
  ('849752415462415600', 'Dancing', 1991, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Bruno Bozzetto', 'Bruno Bozzetto', null, null, 'A man wearing a colorful hat dances on a small island. All is well until the Grim Reaper appears in a small boat, beckoning the dancer to come with him. Does this mean the end for the dancer''s joyous footsteps?', 'A man wearing a colorful hat dances on a small island. All is well until the Grim Reaper appears in a small boat, beckoning the dancer to come with him. Does this mean the end for the dancer''s joyous footsteps?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nBVQHx66MAFwzGlPppGJrjeHSVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361216'),
  ('784125251889906761', 'Dancing at Lughnasa', 1998, 'Drama', 'Pat O''Connor, Kenneth MacMillan', 'Frank McGuinness', 'Meryl Streep, Catherine McCormack, Brid Brennan, Kathy Burke, Sophie Thompson, Michael Gambon, Rhys Ifans, Lorcan Cranitch', 'PG', 'Five unmarried sisters make the most of their simple existence in rural Ireland in the 1930s.', 'Five unmarried sisters make the most of their simple existence in rural Ireland in the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Rtf82SgyvN6QxtgHL3cmgIo1Lo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5332'),
  ('1072325926877814260', 'Dancing at the Blue Iguana', 2001, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Michael Radford', 'Michael Radford, David Linter', 'Charlotte Ayanna, Kristin Bauer, W. Earl Brown, Daryl Hannah, Chris Hogan, Sheila Kelley, Elias Koteas, Vladimir Mashkov', 'R', 'At the Blue Iguana, L.A.''s most notorious strip club, the lives of five exotic dancers converge, clash and ultimately bond over the course of one week.', 'At the Blue Iguana, L.A.''s most notorious strip club, the lives of five exotic dancers converge, clash and ultimately bond over the course of one week.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pk4SKueAF75H8oYNBtvrSM1CkYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23941'),
  ('16932731956145433', 'Dancing Dreams', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Anne Linsel, Rainer Hoffmann, Rainer Hoffmann', 'Anne Linsel', 'Pina Bausch, Jo-Ann Endicott, Bénédicte Billiet', null, 'The dance performance “Kontakthof” bears the unmistakable signature of Pina Bausch: it deals with forms of human contact, encounters between the sexes, and the search for love and tenderness, with all its attendant anxieties, yearnings and doubts. It is a dance about feelings, which always pose a big challenge – particularly for young people. Teenagers from more than eleven schools in Wuppertal went on an emotional journey that lasted almost a year. Every Saturday, forty students aged between fourteen and eighteen years of age took part in rehearsals that were led by Bausch-dancers Jo-Ann Endicott and Bénédicte Billiet and intensely supervised by Pina Bausch herself.', 'The dance performance “Kontakthof” bears the unmistakable signature of Pina Bausch: it deals with forms of human contact, encounters between the sexes, and the search for love and tenderness, with all its attendant anxieties, yearnings and doubts. It is a dance about feelings, which always pose a big challenge – particularly for young people. Teenagers from more than eleven schools in Wuppertal went on an emotional journey that lasted almost a year. Every Saturday, forty students aged between fourteen and eighteen years of age took part in rehearsals that were led by Bausch-dancers Jo-Ann Endicott and Bénédicte Billiet and intensely supervised by Pina Bausch herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHiCN8Ea29CoH9ZH7lwtiLtSLod.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57399'),
  ('622571837121988437', 'Dancing Girl', 1951, 'Drama', 'Mikio Naruse, Asakazu Nakai', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Mieko Takamine, So Yamamura, Mariko Okada, Isao Kimura, Heihachirō Ōkawa, Hiroshi Nihon''yanagi, Akihiko Katayama, Sadako Sawamura', null, 'The troubled relationship between a writer and his ballet teacher wife, who has for years loved another man, finally leads to the breakup of the family.', 'The troubled relationship between a writer and his ballet teacher wife, who has for years loved another man, finally leads to the breakup of the family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3L5XwblZBCVxmBPWF1ftFDTgbEp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257782'),
  ('30472673651881975', 'Dancing in the Dust', 2004, 'Drama', 'Asghar Farhadi, Hassan Karimi, Maryam Hazhirvand', 'Alireza Bazrafshan, Asghar Farhadi, Mohammad Reza Fazeli', 'Faramarz Gharibian, Yousef Khodaparast, Baran Kosari, Jalal Sarhad Seraj, Saeed Noorullahi', null, 'When forced to divorce his wife by family and social pressure because her mother is a prostitute, Nazar works double shifts to pay back the loan he took out for his impulsive wedding and to pay some ongoing restitution to his sweet jilted bride, Reyhaneh. When he falls behind in the payments he flees the police and ends up in the desert with an uncommunicative old man who catches poisonous snakes for their venom. These two are forced to coexist in the desert, because Nazar is unwilling to return to the city and wants to catch snakes to make enough money to settle his debts. His verbose, chattering annoys the reticent old man until Nazar''s life is endangered.', 'When forced to divorce his wife by family and social pressure because her mother is a prostitute, Nazar works double shifts to pay back the loan he took out for his impulsive wedding and to pay some ongoing restitution to his sweet jilted bride, Reyhaneh. When he falls behind in the payments he flees the police and ends up in the desert with an uncommunicative old man who catches poisonous snakes for their venom. These two are forced to coexist in the desert, because Nazar is unwilling to return to the city and wants to catch snakes to make enough money to settle his debts. His verbose, chattering annoys the reticent old man until Nazar''s life is endangered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZgTn4EcpPVeBTbzHttGfOfKE0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89066'),
  ('198388429714334303', 'Dancing in the Rain', 1961, 'Drama', 'Boštjan Hladnik, Janez Kališnik', 'Boštjan Hladnik', 'Duša Počkaj, Miha Baloh, Rado Nakrst, Ali Raner, Jože Zupan, Arnold Tovornik, Janez Jerman, Janez Albreht', null, 'Peter is the dark brooding type. Leading a vacuous, shapeless life, he longs for the ideal woman, while at the same time, half heartedly continuing with his habitual girlfriend, Marusa , who is considerably older, a fact that Peter is quick to point out. As an aging actress, struggling for parts in her local theatre, she oozes insecurity and breathes uncertainty. Together, they spend their time in the local restaurant, smoking, drinking and trading verbal blows. "I bet you''ll just end up a drunk," she tells Peter each time. Peter just grins and tells her how old she looks. Compounded by a thankless director who soon shows her the door, Marusa finds her identity being squeezed harder and harder against the wall. To escape, Peter and Marusa dream...', 'Peter is the dark brooding type. Leading a vacuous, shapeless life, he longs for the ideal woman, while at the same time, half heartedly continuing with his habitual girlfriend, Marusa , who is considerably older, a fact that Peter is quick to point out. As an aging actress, struggling for parts in her local theatre, she oozes insecurity and breathes uncertainty. Together, they spend their time in the local restaurant, smoking, drinking and trading verbal blows. "I bet you''ll just end up a drunk," she tells Peter each time. Peter just grins and tells her how old she looks. Compounded by a thankless director who soon shows her the door, Marusa finds her identity being squeezed harder and harder against the wall. To escape, Peter and Marusa dream...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oa5YWFpL0fPzGQtaPrOe7DIhBSU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207655'),
  ('262853419257875061', 'Dancing Lady', 1933, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Douglas Shearer, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Allen Rivkin, P.J. Wolfson', 'Joan Crawford, Clark Gable, Franchot Tone, May Robson, Winnie Lightner, Fred Astaire, Robert Benchley, Ted Healy', 'NR', 'Janie lives to dance and will dance anywhere, even stripping in a burlesque house. Tod Newton, the rich playboy, discovers her there and helps her get a job in a real Broadway musical being directed by Patch. Tod thinks he can get what he wants from Janie, Patch thinks Janie is using her charms rather than talent to get to the top, and Janie thinks Patch is the greatest. Steve, the stage manager, has the Three Stooges helping him manage all the show girls. Fred Astaire and Nelson Eddy make appearances as famous Broadway personalities.', 'Janie lives to dance and will dance anywhere, even stripping in a burlesque house. Tod Newton, the rich playboy, discovers her there and helps her get a job in a real Broadway musical being directed by Patch. Tod thinks he can get what he wants from Janie, Patch thinks Janie is using her charms rather than talent to get to the top, and Janie thinks Patch is the greatest. Steve, the stage manager, has the Three Stooges helping him manage all the show girls. Fred Astaire and Nelson Eddy make appearances as famous Broadway personalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJc8DTD34kbpccaMDROojHXJ0RS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43600'),
  ('85213337282511720', 'Dancing Machine', 1990, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Gilles Béhat, Emmanuel Finkiel, Laurent Herbiet', 'Paul-Loup Sulitzer, Loup Durand, Marc Cerrone', 'Alain Delon, Claude Brasseur, Patrick Dupond, Tonya Kinzinger, Marina Saura, Iñaki Aierra, Consuelo De Haviland, Etienne Chicot', null, 'Students of the prestigious dance school are dying under mysterious circumstances. Inspector Michel Eparvier suggests that the cause of death for women is physical exhaustion for dance lessons as their teacher Wolf brings the girls to exhaustion, making them to practice the technique of movement over and over again.', 'Students of the prestigious dance school are dying under mysterious circumstances. Inspector Michel Eparvier suggests that the cause of death for women is physical exhaustion for dance lessons as their teacher Wolf brings the girls to exhaustion, making them to practice the technique of movement over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBQlibFGnBfQR57ptSq0cqBdfIg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59259'),
  ('242939008321290522', 'Dancing On', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michèle Laroque, Gilles Porte', 'Michèle Laroque, Stéphane Ben Lahcene, Meg Leonard', 'Isabelle Nanty, Michèle Laroque, Thierry Lhermitte, Patrick Timsit, Jeanne Balibar, Antoine Duléry, Armelle, Laurent Spielvogel', null, 'After thirty years of marriage, Sandra finds out that her husband is having an affair with his best friend. She immediately leaves him and has no choice but to seek refuge in her childhood home, where her sister Danie still lives. The sisters couldn’t be more different. Danie, a stubborn single with a dog and the heart of a social justice warrior vs. Sandra, a bourgeois housewife with decades of a secure lifestyle on a posh vineyard behind her. Their cohabitation starts out rocky to say the least… But with the help of close buddies Roberto and Lucien, Danie coaxes Sandra into joining their local dance troupe, and reconnect with the greatest joy and talent of her youth. Through their shared passion for dance and the solidarity of the troupe’s other dancers, the sisters embark on a fresh life path. Because, really, it’s never too late... even to fall in love again.', 'After thirty years of marriage, Sandra finds out that her husband is having an affair with his best friend. She immediately leaves him and has no choice but to seek refuge in her childhood home, where her sister Danie still lives. The sisters couldn’t be more different. Danie, a stubborn single with a dog and the heart of a social justice warrior vs. Sandra, a bourgeois housewife with decades of a secure lifestyle on a posh vineyard behind her. Their cohabitation starts out rocky to say the least… But with the help of close buddies Roberto and Lucien, Danie coaxes Sandra into joining their local dance troupe, and reconnect with the greatest joy and talent of her youth. Through their shared passion for dance and the solidarity of the troupe’s other dancers, the sisters embark on a fresh life path. Because, really, it’s never too late... even to fall in love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNrJNRvBMBSCHDiMMf6oW8VXRjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:781478'),
  ('152910166507615932', 'Dancing on Glass', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jota Linares', 'Jota Linares, Jorge Naranjo', 'María Pedraza, Paula Losada, Mona Martínez, Marta Hazas, Ana Wagener, Juanjo Almeida, Jota Castellano, Iria del Río', null, 'When immense pressure threatens a ballerina in a new lead role, she and another dancer escape into a friendship that isolates them from the real world.', 'When immense pressure threatens a ballerina in a new lead role, she and another dancer escape into a friendship that isolates them from the real world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppF495JNP6poCCEAm4xM1nJEZzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800407'),
  ('550180152253080532', 'Dancing Pirate', 1936, 'Music, Adventure, Comedy', 'Lloyd Corrigan, William V. Skall', 'Lloyd Corrigan, Francis Edward Faragoh, Jack Wagner', 'Charles Collins, Frank Morgan, Steffi Duna, Luis Alberni, Victor Varconi, Rita Hayworth, Jack La Rue, Alma Real', null, 'Jonathan Pride is a mild-mannered dance instructor in 1820 Boston. En route to visit relatives, Jonathan is shanghaied by a band of zany pirates and forced to work as a galley boy. When the pirate vessel arrives at the port of Las Palomas, Jonathan, clad in buccaneer''s garb, makes his escape. Everyone in Las Palomas, including Governor Alcalde (Frank Morgan) and fetching senorita Serafina (Steffi Duna), assumes that Jonathan is the pirate chieftain, leading to a series of typical comic-opera complications.', 'Jonathan Pride is a mild-mannered dance instructor in 1820 Boston. En route to visit relatives, Jonathan is shanghaied by a band of zany pirates and forced to work as a galley boy. When the pirate vessel arrives at the port of Las Palomas, Jonathan, clad in buccaneer''s garb, makes his escape. Everyone in Las Palomas, including Governor Alcalde (Frank Morgan) and fetching senorita Serafina (Steffi Duna), assumes that Jonathan is the pirate chieftain, leading to a series of typical comic-opera complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vb0O3VELo71WUOMTtyHFklvaIpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188918'),
  ('154261511643745598', 'Dancing Queen', 2012, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Suk-hoon, Kim Jae-keun, Choi Jin-woong', 'Lee Suk-hoon', 'Uhm Jung-hwa, Hwang Jung-min, Lee Han-wi, Chung Sung-hwa, Ra Mi-ran, Jeong Gyu-su, Lee Dae-yeon, Seo Dong-won', null, 'The next mayor of Seoul candidate''s wife becomes a dance singer in this movie as Hwang Jeong-min takes on the role of poor lawyer turned politician and Uhm Jung-hwa as the wife who makes an attempt at singing without her husband knowing at first.', 'The next mayor of Seoul candidate''s wife becomes a dance singer in this movie as Hwang Jeong-min takes on the role of poor lawyer turned politician and Uhm Jung-hwa as the wife who makes an attempt at singing without her husband knowing at first.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbhn5P3Mks6LGl67fnHTxgZtc6o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91596'),
  ('705498171499214549', 'Dancing Queens', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Mokrosinski, Helena Bergström', 'Helena Bergström, Denize Karabuda', 'Molly Nutley, Christopher Wollter, Fredrik Quinones, Rakel Wärmländer, Mattias Nordkvist, Marie Göranzon, Claes Malmberg, Max Ulveson', 'NR', 'The story of Dylan Pettersson, a 23-year-old girl from a small island in the Swedish archipelago with big dancing aspirations.', 'The story of Dylan Pettersson, a 23-year-old girl from a small island in the Swedish archipelago with big dancing aspirations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xq2pkQZV5Yt1METvy5S0QjmCpsn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761270'),
  ('262778731940087491', 'Dancing Quietly', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fee Scherer, Philipp Eichholtz', 'Philipp Eichholtz', 'Martina Schöne-Radunski, Hans-Heinrich Hardt, Sebastian Fräsdorf, Claudia Jacob, Deleila Piasko, Tobias Borchers, Ruth Bickelhaupt, Renate Lorenz', null, 'After many dark years of depression Luca seeks to gain her high school diploma. Her little dog Mata helps her to find motivation and keep a positive attitude towards life...', 'After many dark years of depression Luca seeks to gain her high school diploma. Her little dog Mata helps her to find motivation and keep a positive attitude towards life...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btCx0tyNy5ufBbLI84xMS1T7DCF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393410'),
  ('498038728798429224', 'Dancing with Crime', 1947, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'John Paddy Carstairs, Reginald H. Wyer, George Burgess', 'Brock Williams', 'Richard Attenborough, Sheila Sim, Barry Jones, Barry K. Barnes, Judy Kelly, John Warwick, Garry Marsh, Diana Dors', null, 'When his best friend is murdered inside a London dancehall, a cab driver and his girlfriend involve themselves in the investigation and discover a major criminal operation hiding behind the club''s friendly facade.', 'When his best friend is murdered inside a London dancehall, a cab driver and his girlfriend involve themselves in the investigation and discover a major criminal operation hiding behind the club''s friendly facade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p29CDm3DjEHXKwGcIcvKxNZxObv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92486'),
  ('733400428678245798', 'Dancing With Ghosts', 2018, 'Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Director Baek', null, 'Lee Kwang-hoon, Ju Min-ha, Jung Joo-ri, Hong Hae-sol, Geum Na-rang, Jong-hak Choi, Yeon Hee', null, 'Yoo-jin appears in the dreams of Dong-jae who is a host for lonely women at night. She appears in real life, asking him for help. What she needs is to sleep with him once. Yoo-jin was a virgin ghost and she needed Dong-jae to help her to go back to the after world. However, he doesn''t want to sleep with her because she used to be his crush and he''d been waiting to see her in his dreams and in real life. He is afraid sleeping with her will make him lose her. Will he sleep with her or continue to live with her like this?', 'Yoo-jin appears in the dreams of Dong-jae who is a host for lonely women at night. She appears in real life, asking him for help. What she needs is to sleep with him once. Yoo-jin was a virgin ghost and she needed Dong-jae to help her to go back to the after world. However, he doesn''t want to sleep with her because she used to be his crush and he''d been waiting to see her in his dreams and in real life. He is afraid sleeping with her will make him lose her. Will he sleep with her or continue to live with her like this?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDmMjGuO93Z8bpSqiK0UaqhXhEC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549649'),
  ('655978904275917245', 'Dancing with Maria', 2014, 'Documentary', 'David Rubio, Ivan Gergolet, Ivan Gergolet', 'Ivan Gergolet', 'María Fux, Martina Serban, María José Vexenat, Marcos Ruiz, Macarena Battista, Diana Martínez', null, 'María Fux spends her life training dancers, particularly those with disabilities. But now, at 90, she finds her toughest student may be herself.', 'María Fux spends her life training dancers, particularly those with disabilities. But now, at 90, she finds her toughest student may be herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijxazIJGQoDk8QXQ09xOzP5ArwO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292369'),
  ('261531947631352851', 'Dancing with the Birds', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Mohan Sandhu, Matthew Aeberhard, Sam Stewart', 'Huw Cordey', 'Stephen Fry', null, 'Some of the world''s most majestic birds display delightfully captivating mating rituals, from flashy dancing to flaunting their colorful feathers.', 'Some of the world''s most majestic birds display delightfully captivating mating rituals, from flashy dancing to flaunting their colorful feathers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzc72pDxEZ6ziC4n7IUX9YQorDO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634541'),
  ('958382792483772553', 'Dandelion', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mark Milgard, Tim Orr', 'Mark Milgard', 'Vincent Kartheiser, Taryn Manning, Arliss Howard, Mare Winningham, Michelle Forbes, Blake Heron, Marshall Bell, Shawn Reaves', null, 'In a small town of rolling fields and endless skies, isolated 16 year old Mason lives in a world where families exist in fragmented silence and love seems to have gone missing. Then Mason meets Danny, a sensitive and troubled girl, and their tender bond is soon tested after a fatal accident and a series of complications takes Mason away for something he didn''t do.', 'In a small town of rolling fields and endless skies, isolated 16 year old Mason lives in a world where families exist in fragmented silence and love seems to have gone missing. Then Mason meets Danny, a sensitive and troubled girl, and their tender bond is soon tested after a fatal accident and a series of complications takes Mason away for something he didn''t do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7TXZamEJJOMn75R8bXelwjC1S9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16430'),
  ('999723080593175911', 'Dandelion''s Odyssey', 2026, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Indie', 'Momoko Seto', 'Momoko Seto, Alain Layrac, Mariette Désert', 'Gilles Marsalet, Sébastien Dohogne, Camille Jurdant', null, 'Rescued from Earth''s nuclear annihilation, four friends crash-land on an unknown planet and courageously set out to locate a new home capable of sustaining their species.', 'Rescued from Earth''s nuclear annihilation, four friends crash-land on an unknown planet and courageously set out to locate a new home capable of sustaining their species.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7iANFgxFGX9iXq2Bcbd46JDicHC.jpg', 'plex:movie:dandelions-odyssey'),
  ('1023202175845586604', 'Dandelions by the Roots', 1964, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Georges Lautner, Maurice Fellous', 'Georges Lautner, Clarence Weff, Michel Audiard', 'Louis de Funès, Michel Serrault, Mireille Darc, Francis Blanche, Maurice Biraud, Darry Cowl, Raymond Meunier, Hubert Deschamps', null, 'Jockey Jack has a bill open with a gangster just released from jail. He somehow manages to parry the gangster''s knife attack backstage at a theatre and the latter ends up dead being put into a double bass case. A day later the gangster mysteriously has disappeared, but it turns out that he was carrying a bet ticket for a horse race now worth over a million. A turbulent run for the money begins.', 'Jockey Jack has a bill open with a gangster just released from jail. He somehow manages to parry the gangster''s knife attack backstage at a theatre and the latter ends up dead being put into a double bass case. A day later the gangster mysteriously has disappeared, but it turns out that he was carrying a bet ticket for a horse race now worth over a million. A turbulent run for the money begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPMeDUi9SecR8jonStDMknaDNW0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59237'),
  ('718434503463296040', 'Dandy Dust', 1998, 'Science Fiction, Animation', 'A. Hans Scheirl, Jana Cipriani', 'A. Hans Scheirl', 'Suzie Krüger, Leonora Rogers-Wright, Tre Temperilli, A. Hans Scheirl, Svar Simpson, Angela de Castro, Tao Rogers-Wright, Jan Shakespeare', null, 'Dust, a split-personality cyborg of fluid gender, zooms through time and space in search of their own memories and a sense of understanding. They travel from the Planet of White Dust where war is constant, to the Planet of Blood and Swelling, a hybrid of their father’s body.', 'Dust, a split-personality cyborg of fluid gender, zooms through time and space in search of their own memories and a sense of understanding. They travel from the Planet of White Dust where war is constant, to the Planet of Blood and Swelling, a hybrid of their father’s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2KFgvLYblqa1g4FqT0wd0JpAI46.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227412'),
