  ('709088380353850061', 'Dangal', 2016, 'Drama, Family, Comedy', 'Satyajit Pande, Nitesh Tiwari', 'Nitesh Tiwari', 'Aamir Khan, Fatima Sana Shaikh, Sanya Malhotra, Zaira Wasim, Suhani Bhatnagar, Aparshakti Khurana, Girish Kulkarni, Sakshi Tanwar', 'PG', 'Dangal is an extraordinary true story based on the life of Mahavir Singh and his two daughters, Geeta and Babita Phogat. The film traces the inspirational journey of a father who trains his daughters to become world class wrestlers.', 'Dangal is an extraordinary true story based on the life of Mahavir Singh and his two daughters, Geeta and Babita Phogat. The film traces the inspirational journey of a father who trains his daughters to become world class wrestlers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CoKNi3XVyijPCvy0usDbSWEXAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360814'),
  ('504264153611760967', 'Dangan Runner', 1996, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'SABU, Shûji Kuriyama', 'SABU', 'Shinichi Tsutsumi, Tomorowo Taguchi, Diamond Yukai, SABU, Akaji Maro, Ren Osugi, Hiroshi Shimizu, Ikko Suzuki', null, 'A would-be bank robber forgets his mask on his first big heist, and then botches an attempt to shoplift a replacement mask from a nearby convenience store. The store''s clerk, a washed-up rock star, chases the thief and literally runs into a Yakuza to whom he owes money. Thus begins an all-night, three-way pursuit through the streets of Tokyo.', 'A would-be bank robber forgets his mask on his first big heist, and then botches an attempt to shoplift a replacement mask from a nearby convenience store. The store''s clerk, a washed-up rock star, chases the thief and literally runs into a Yakuza to whom he owes money. Thus begins an all-night, three-way pursuit through the streets of Tokyo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22wXh91BBekpF6zxR9DqSJ1828V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105130'),
  ('37697437179092578', 'Danger Close: The Battle of Long Tan', 2019, 'War, Action, Drama, History', 'Carl Edge, Greg Tynan, Kriv Stenders', 'Stuart Beattie, James Nicholas, Karel Segers', 'Travis Fimmel, Luke Bracey, Daniel Webber, Alexander England, Aaron Glenane, Nicholas Hamilton, Myles Pollard, Matt Doran', 'R', 'Vietnam War, 1966. Australia and New Zealand send troops to support the United States and South Vietnamese in their fight against the communist North. Soldiers are very young men, recruits and volunteers who have never been involved in a combat. On August 18th, members of Delta Company will face the true horror of a ruthless battle among the trees of a rubber plantation called Long Tân. They are barely a hundred. The enemy is a human wave ready to destroy them.', 'Vietnam War, 1966. Australia and New Zealand send troops to support the United States and South Vietnamese in their fight against the communist North. Soldiers are very young men, recruits and volunteers who have never been involved in a combat. On August 18th, members of Delta Company will face the true horror of a ruthless battle among the trees of a rubber plantation called Long Tân. They are barely a hundred. The enemy is a human wave ready to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB1rCWGMsM2mm1kBDleaPkqUCFo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508664'),
  ('767292762583253133', 'Danger Lights', 1931, 'Adventure, Drama', 'George B. Seitz, John W. Boyle, Karl Struss', null, 'Louis Wolheim, Robert Armstrong, Jean Arthur, Hugh Herbert, Frank Sheridan, Robert Edeson, Alan Roscoe, William P. Burt', 'NR', 'Head railroad man Dan is as ugly as he is honorable. When he spots a drifter who''d hopped a freight held up by a landslide, Dan offers the man a job; then he finds the man was a railroader, too, and takes him under his wing. Engaged to Mary, Dan doesn''t notice the growing attraction between his protégé and his intended but focuses instead on running the railroad.', 'Head railroad man Dan is as ugly as he is honorable. When he spots a drifter who''d hopped a freight held up by a landslide, Dan offers the man a job; then he finds the man was a railroader, too, and takes him under his wing. Engaged to Mary, Dan doesn''t notice the growing attraction between his protégé and his intended but focuses instead on running the railroad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkfk4boYgF5OoS3OkkmNf5X5iuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166316'),
  ('892935051321124025', 'Danger Route', 1967, 'Action, Thriller', 'Stephen Christian, Philip Martell, Seth Holt', 'Meade Roberts, Robert Banks Stewart', 'Richard Johnson, Carol Lynley, Barbara Bouchet, Sylvia Syms, Gordon Jackson, Diana Dors, Maurice Denham, Sam Wanamaker', null, 'Jonas Wilde, a British secret agent licensed to kill, wants to resign from his murderous work, but his superiors pressure him into taking on a new assignment-the assassination of a defecting Soviet scientist. In the course of the dangerous mission, he discovers a mole has infiltrated British intelligence.', 'Jonas Wilde, a British secret agent licensed to kill, wants to resign from his murderous work, but his superiors pressure him into taking on a new assignment-the assassination of a defecting Soviet scientist. In the course of the dangerous mission, he discovers a mole has infiltrated British intelligence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nIeyxSOvR270fKVlRNGkuSGorPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85625'),
  ('801506069189450882', 'Danger Signal', 1945, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Robert Florey, James Wong Howe, Elmer Decker', 'Adele Comandini, C. Graham Baker', 'Faye Emerson, Zachary Scott, Richard Erdman, Rosemary DeCamp, Bruce Bennett, Mona Freeman, John Ridgely, Mary Servoss', 'NR', 'After robbing and murdering his married lover and then making her death look like suicide, conniving philanderer Ronnie Mason relocates to Los Angeles. Under a new identity and claiming to be a writer, Ronnie finds lodging at the home of Hilda Fenchurch and her mother. He woos Hilda, knowing she has money, but when he discovers that Hilda''s sister, Anne, has just inherited $25,000, he switches his attentions to her.', 'After robbing and murdering his married lover and then making her death look like suicide, conniving philanderer Ronnie Mason relocates to Los Angeles. Under a new identity and claiming to be a writer, Ronnie finds lodging at the home of Hilda Fenchurch and her mother. He woos Hilda, knowing she has money, but when he discovers that Hilda''s sister, Anne, has just inherited $25,000, he switches his attentions to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTMfktEGDOxBd10wC2KnnWXJ2rs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36635'),
