  ('591699228672187382', 'Danger Zone', 1951, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Berke, John Francis Murphy, Jack Greenhalgh', 'Julian Harmon', 'Hugh Beaumont, Edward Brophy, Richard Travis, Tom Neal, Pamela Blake, Virginia Dale, Ralph Sanford, Paula Drew', 'NR', 'A San Francisco man is paid to bid on a saxophone and escort a woman to a yacht party.', 'A San Francisco man is paid to bid on a saxophone and escort a woman to a yacht party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVJ943Uq1AemP2Q4cei8YoAVcav.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126062'),
  ('1115156156148129327', 'Danger Zone', 1996, 'Action, Drama', 'Allan Eastman, Marina Van Tonder', 'Jeff Albert, Samuel Benedict', 'Billy Zane, Robert Downey Jr., Cary-Hiroyuki Tagawa, Lisa Collins, Ron Silver, Patrick Shai, Russel Savadier, Greg Latter', 'R', 'Rick Morgan, an American engineer who runs a mine in East Africa, is approached one day by his friend Jim Scott, who needs someplace to store canisters of toxic waste. Unfortunately, a spill occurs a short time later, resulting in deaths and Morgan having to leave the country. A year later, he is approached by a government agent looking for a missing supply of potentially hazardous poison, which in truth hides something even more valuable.', 'Rick Morgan, an American engineer who runs a mine in East Africa, is approached one day by his friend Jim Scott, who needs someplace to store canisters of toxic waste. Unfortunately, a spill occurs a short time later, resulting in deaths and Morgan having to leave the country. A year later, he is approached by a government agent looking for a missing supply of potentially hazardous poison, which in truth hides something even more valuable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvMKQxUS9cOQJT8Ny9QT19V68LQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253899'),
  ('445090570816834072', 'Danger: Diabolik', 1968, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Antonio Rinaldi, Mario Bava, Lamberto Bava', 'Mario Bava, Brian Degas, Tudor Gates', 'John Phillip Law, Marisa Mell, Michel Piccoli, Adolfo Celi, Claudio Gora, Mario Donen, Renzo Palmer, Caterina Boratto', 'PG-13', 'International man of mystery Diabolik and his sensuous lover Eva Kant pull off heist after heist, all while European cops led by Inspector Ginko and envious mobsters led by Ralph Valmont are closing in on them.', 'International man of mystery Diabolik and his sensuous lover Eva Kant pull off heist after heist, all while European cops led by Inspector Ginko and envious mobsters led by Ralph Valmont are closing in on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozU1Qgu3CqWg2MWz8God3P6PoF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2994'),
  ('321633682375701358', 'Danger!! Death Ray', 1967, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Manuel Hernández Sanjuán', 'Juan Antonio Cabezas, Jaime Comas Gil, Aldo Cristiani', 'Gordon Scott, Delfi Mauro, Nello Pazzafini, Alberto Dalbés, Silvia Solar, Massimo Righi, Tullio Altamura', null, 'Secret Agent Bart Fargo chases the kidnappers of the inventor of a death ray.', 'Secret Agent Bart Fargo chases the kidnappers of the inventor of a death ray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSbN7TeMc2gsj0B2ww9jhbNTgSZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84643'),
  ('908072443744743162', 'Dangerous', 1935, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfred E. Green, Russell Saunders, Ernest Haller', 'Laird Doyle', 'Bette Davis, Franchot Tone, Margaret Lindsay, Alison Skipworth, John Eldredge, Dick Foran, Walter Walker, Richard Carle', 'NR', 'Don Bellows finds former stage star Joyce Heath a penniless drunk and takes her to his Connecticut home for rehabilitation. He asks his fiancée Gail to free him and offers to sponsor Joyce in a play.', 'Don Bellows finds former stage star Joyce Heath a penniless drunk and takes her to his Connecticut home for rehabilitation. He asks his fiancée Gail to free him and offers to sponsor Joyce in a play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UskcpJ7iOCoXCMTWez7kourZDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52863'),
  ('182242321951267136', 'Dangerous', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Mark Dobrescu, David Hackl', 'Christopher Borrelli', 'Scott Eastwood, Mel Gibson, Tyrese Gibson, Kevin Durand, Famke Janssen, Brenda Bazinet, Ryan Robbins, Brendan Fletcher', 'R', 'A reformed sociopath heads to a remote island after the death of his brother. Soon after his arrival, the island falls under siege from a deadly gang of mercenaries, and when he discovers their role in his brother’s demise, he sets out on a relentless quest for vengeance.', 'A reformed sociopath heads to a remote island after the death of his brother. Soon after his arrival, the island falls under siege from a deadly gang of mercenaries, and when he discovers their role in his brother’s demise, he sets out on a relentless quest for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RqdjlPjyN59FnMkw5nnpaRXJde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763788'),
  ('892052457857339328', 'Dangerous Animals', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sean Byrne, Shelley Farthing-Dawe, Matt Enfield', 'Nick Lepard', 'Hassie Harrison, Jai Courtney, Josh Heuston, Rob Carlton, Ella Newton, Liam Greinke, Ali Basoka, Mike Goldman', 'R', 'A savvy and free-spirited surfer is abducted by a shark-obsessed serial killer. Held captive on his boat, she must figure out how to escape before he carries out a ritualistic feeding to the sharks below.', 'A savvy and free-spirited surfer is abducted by a shark-obsessed serial killer. Held captive on his boat, she must figure out how to escape before he carries out a ritualistic feeding to the sharks below.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9tk3Si960hg4E49eMt81dS7Qe9Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1285965'),
  ('1046065519719641491', 'Dangerous Beauty', 1998, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marshall Herskovitz, Bojan Bazelli, Kuki López Rodero', 'Jeannine Dominy', 'Catherine McCormack, Rufus Sewell, Oliver Platt, Fred Ward, Naomi Watts, Jacqueline Bisset, Moira Kelly, Jeroen Krabbé', 'R', 'Veronica is brilliant, gifted and beautiful, but the handsome aristocrat she loves, Marco Venier, cannot marry her because she is penniless and of questionable family. So Veronica''s mother, Paola, teaches her to become a courtesan, one of the exotic companions favored by the richest and most powerful Venetian men. Veronica courageously uses her charms to change destiny -- and to give herself a chance at true love.', 'Veronica is brilliant, gifted and beautiful, but the handsome aristocrat she loves, Marco Venier, cannot marry her because she is penniless and of questionable family. So Veronica''s mother, Paola, teaches her to become a courtesan, one of the exotic companions favored by the richest and most powerful Venetian men. Veronica courageously uses her charms to change destiny -- and to give herself a chance at true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uHX8qIr8VYPwdpVv4TCjXcVxDo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8583'),
  ('881088496291725745', 'Dangerous Brothers Present: World of Danger', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Paul Jackson', null, 'Rik Mayall, Adrian Edmondson, Morwenna Banks, Stephen Fry, Hugh Laurie, Helen Lederer, Norman Lovett, Jennifer Saunders', null, 'The Dangerous Brothers was a stage and TV act by anarchic comedy duo Rik Mayall and Ade Edmondson, performing respectively as "Richard Dangerous" and "Sir (or occasionally Lady) Adrian Dangerous". Although originating before the show, they appeared in a number of brief sketches in the 1980s TV programme Saturday Live. Eventually being banned for being "too sexy and too violent", they staged a protest by returning as ''The Ben Elton Brothers'', and blowing up the car park at LWT Studios. One of the final sketches prepared for Saturday Live was entitled ''Kinky Sex''. This fell foul of Channel 4 censors who banned it. The duo responded in the sketch Dangervision by apparently hijacking the programme and blowing up the wall on which the show''s logo was painted in graffiti art. The banned sketch, which by modern standards seems fairly tame, was finally released on a compilation video The Dangerous Brothers present: World of Danger.', 'The Dangerous Brothers was a stage and TV act by anarchic comedy duo Rik Mayall and Ade Edmondson, performing respectively as "Richard Dangerous" and "Sir (or occasionally Lady) Adrian Dangerous". Although originating before the show, they appeared in a number of brief sketches in the 1980s TV programme Saturday Live. Eventually being banned for being "too sexy and too violent", they staged a protest by returning as ''The Ben Elton Brothers'', and blowing up the car park at LWT Studios. One of the final sketches prepared for Saturday Live was entitled ''Kinky Sex''. This fell foul of Channel 4 censors who banned it. The duo responded in the sketch Dangervision by apparently hijacking the programme and blowing up the wall on which the show''s logo was painted in graffiti art. The banned sketch, which by modern standards seems fairly tame, was finally released on a compilation video The Dangerous Brothers present: World of Danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGQ4XGC9GlpI1Zp8ii9jip2Fwha.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79276'),
  ('363658366224264321', 'Dangerous Charm', 1984, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Ivan Andonov, Plamen Vagenshtain', 'Svoboda Bachvarova', 'Todor Kolev, Nevena Kokanova, Stefan Mavrodiev, Lyuben Chatalov, Georgi Rusev, Tatyana Lolova, Nadya Todorova, Tzvetana Maneva', null, 'He is well educated, charming, and gallant - a dream for each lonely lady. In reality he is a skillful swindler, who robs naive women. Cheating merchants with guilty consciences are his targets as well. This is the elusive protagonist of the movie. He constantly changes his name, stages his own death, and travels from town to town. His exploits are myriad and his life is an endless adventure. Yet, he remains an amiable swindler, an unrealized actor, whose only goal is make his life more interesting.', 'He is well educated, charming, and gallant - a dream for each lonely lady. In reality he is a skillful swindler, who robs naive women. Cheating merchants with guilty consciences are his targets as well. This is the elusive protagonist of the movie. He constantly changes his name, stages his own death, and travels from town to town. His exploits are myriad and his life is an endless adventure. Yet, he remains an amiable swindler, an unrealized actor, whose only goal is make his life more interesting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgZ85yUowZLJ8lyrwlGkwcjW1aH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258601'),
  ('1054243505880967627', 'Dangerous Crossing', 1953, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Joseph LaShelle, Joseph M. Newman, Arthur Lueker', 'Leo Townsend', 'Jeanne Crain, Michael Rennie, Max Showalter, Carl Betz, Mary Anderson, Marjorie Hoshelle, Willis Bouchey, Yvonne Peattie', 'NR', 'A honeymoon aboard an ocean liner is cut short when the bride finds herself suddenly alone, and unable to convince anyone of her husband’s existence.', 'A honeymoon aboard an ocean liner is cut short when the bride finds herself suddenly alone, and unable to convince anyone of her husband’s existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cSqIMcCkK79qPzZHD6jTFotow2G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36330'),
  ('720577429666925462', 'Dangerous Curves', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Lewis, David Lewis', 'Paul Brown, Michael Zand, Michael Dugan', 'Tate Donovan, Grant Heslov, Danielle von Zerneck, Valerie Breiman, Karen Lynn Scott, Robert Romanus, Robert Klein, Robert Stack', 'PG', 'A college graduate is offered a deal of a lifetime - deliver a Porsche for a client and join the company of your dreams in return. When the car gets stolen, he and his friend must go to a beauty pageant run by the thief to get it back.', 'A college graduate is offered a deal of a lifetime - deliver a Porsche for a client and join the company of your dreams in return. When the car gets stolen, he and his friend must go to a beauty pageant run by the thief to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cIyKTvp8TNvZMq0eB8ynrdT3YuE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93937'),
  ('1130295468322458820', 'Dangerous Dan McFoo', 1939, 'Animation', 'Tex Avery, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Tex Avery, Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce, Arthur Q. Bryan', null, 'An arctic saloon. The tiny dog, Dan McFoo, is playing a pinball-like marble game in the back. His girlfriend, Sue, sounding like Katharine Hepburn, stands by. A stranger comes in with eyes for Sue; he begins a boxing match with Dan. After Dan gets knocked down, he accuses the stranger of having something in the glove; the ref finds four horseshoes and a horse. After the fight goes on a while with no conclusion, the narrator tosses a couple of guns, the lights go out, and Dan is shot or is he?', 'An arctic saloon. The tiny dog, Dan McFoo, is playing a pinball-like marble game in the back. His girlfriend, Sue, sounding like Katharine Hepburn, stands by. A stranger comes in with eyes for Sue; he begins a boxing match with Dan. After Dan gets knocked down, he accuses the stranger of having something in the glove; the ref finds four horseshoes and a horse. After the fight goes on a while with no conclusion, the narrator tosses a couple of guns, the lights go out, and Dan is shot or is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVwG4ARGR7onBgV22aR85saJpEf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84678'),
  ('54143913638678693', 'Dangerous Drugs of Sex', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Kenichi Mori, Hideo Jojo, Eiji Iinuma', 'Hideo Jojo', 'Takashi Kitadai, Sho Watanabe, Kohei Nagano, Ruri Shinato, Seiki Chiba, Sousuke Yamamoto, Fumio Moriya', 'NR', 'An elite salaryman drunkenly tries to die by suicide, but is saved by a mysterious stranger who holds him captive and sexually torments him.', 'An elite salaryman drunkenly tries to die by suicide, but is saved by a mysterious stranger who holds him captive and sexually torments him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3EDZG21H6qPg3Mc0HtJkHN4qto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715756'),
  ('1101509838074093336', 'Dangerous Encounters of the First Kind', 1980, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Tsui Hark, David Chung, Paul Cheung Wing-Hung', 'Sze-To Cheuk-Hon, Chen Fang, Eddie Fong Ling-Ching', 'Lo Lieh, Lin Chen-Chi, Paul Che Biu-Law, Albert Au Shui-Keung, Lung Tin-Sang, Ray Lui, Leong Po-Chih, Ronny Yu', null, 'Three lazybones friends manufacture a firebomb and place it in a cinema. Pearl, a sadistic young girl, has observed the scene, follows the bombers and starts to manipulate them. The four criminals plan more and more daring acts.', 'Three lazybones friends manufacture a firebomb and place it in a cinema. Pearl, a sadistic young girl, has observed the scene, follows the bombers and starts to manipulate them. The four criminals plan more and more daring acts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/to8xnhanY8VMJFhEHE5kd8836h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104287'),
