  ('421754872567333380', 'Dangerous Game', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stephen Hopkins, Peter Levy', 'Peter West', 'Miles Buchanan, Marcus Graham, Steven Grives, Kathryn Walker, Sandie Lillingston, John Polson, Max Meldrum, Raquel Suarstzman', 'R', 'A game becomes deadly serious! An insane cop hunts down five students in a shopping mall after closing time. His life is ruined as he was dishonorably discharged from the police force because of these people. Armed with a Rambo knife and a crossbow, he initially only wants to scare them off, but when he accidentally injures one of the boys deadly, there is no turning back. The witnesses to the murder must be eliminated! So begins a relentless hunt through the mall at night…', 'A game becomes deadly serious! An insane cop hunts down five students in a shopping mall after closing time. His life is ruined as he was dishonorably discharged from the police force because of these people. Armed with a Rambo knife and a crossbow, he initially only wants to scare them off, but when he accidentally injures one of the boys deadly, there is no turning back. The witnesses to the murder must be eliminated! So begins a relentless hunt through the mall at night…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVft9gspfOUkAcOq9wssHWO7MRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70198'),
  ('89023482408616060', 'Dangerous Game', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Abel Ferrara, Chris Marazzo, Howell Caldwell', 'Nicholas St. John', 'Harvey Keitel, Madonna, James Russo, Nancy Ferrara, Reilly Murphy, Victor Argo, Leonard L. Thomas, Christina Fulton', 'R', 'A New York film director, working on his latest movie in Los Angeles, begins to reflect the actions in his movie and real life, especially when he begins an affair with the lead actress.', 'A New York film director, working on his latest movie in Los Angeles, begins to reflect the actions in his movie and real life, especially when he begins an affair with the lead actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lHD4z6KAjtDWKIMeChezIFon5bX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49299'),
  ('15889644594892555', 'Dangerous Game: The Legacy Murders', 2022, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Sean McNamara, Adam Sliwinski', 'Brian Buccellato', 'Jonathan Rhys Meyers, Will Sasso, Jon Voight, Laura Mennell, Megan Charpentier, Kaya Coleman, Skyler Shaye, Dylan Playfair', 'R', 'A family reunion at a remote mansion takes a lethal turn when they are trapped inside and forced to play a deadly survival game where only one will make it out alive.', 'A family reunion at a remote mansion takes a lethal turn when they are trapped inside and forced to play a deadly survival game where only one will make it out alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkRhMw0tBpDtg28bytxN2hrhyri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027385'),
  ('89785405726711363', 'Dangerous Ground', 1997, 'Drama, Crime', 'Darrell James Roodt, Paul Gilpin, Graham Hickson', 'Darrell James Roodt, Greg Latter', 'Ice Cube, Elizabeth Hurley, Ving Rhames, Thokozani Nkosi, Ron Smerczak, Wilson Dunster, Sechaba Morojele, Peter Khubeke', 'R', 'Vusi Madlazi returns to the South African village he left as a young boy to bury his father. He meets up with his brother Ernest, who tells him their other brother Stephen couldn''t be contacted. Vusi goes to Johannesburg to find him, but at first can only find his neighbor/girlfriend, Karin, a stripper. Vusi proceeds to learn how conditions have changed since the end of apartheid, not always for the better for black men.', 'Vusi Madlazi returns to the South African village he left as a young boy to bury his father. He meets up with his brother Ernest, who tells him their other brother Stephen couldn''t be contacted. Vusi goes to Johannesburg to find him, but at first can only find his neighbor/girlfriend, Karin, a stripper. Vusi proceeds to learn how conditions have changed since the end of apartheid, not always for the better for black men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3oFap1KH6zTTP1w0iQ6uQZrzKU4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52855'),
