  ('224838018279078811', 'Dangerous Touch', 1995, 'Thriller', 'Lou Diamond Phillips, Eric J. Goldstein, James Lemmo', 'Kurt Voss, Lou Diamond Phillips', 'Kate Vernon, Lou Diamond Phillips, Max Gail, Adam Roarke, Andrew Divoff, Monique Parent, Mitch Pileggi, Stacie Randall', 'R', 'A promiscuous radio sex therapist is dragged into blackmail by a young hustler.', 'A promiscuous radio sex therapist is dragged into blackmail by a young hustler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffz93TvSA02QumNvn2kysJw3UyO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219832'),
  ('66921415972973987', 'Dangerous Waters', 2023, 'Thriller', 'John Barr, John Rusk, John Barr', 'Mark Jackson', 'Odeya Rush, Eric Dane, Saffron Burrows, Ray Liotta, Roy Elghanayan, Terrence Julien, Sala Baker, Alexya Garcia', 'NR', 'A young woman, her single mother, and the mother''s new boyfriend embark on a sailing adventure to Bermuda. However, when criminals suddenly attack their boat, the pleasure trip turns into a desperate fight for survival and a quest for vengeance.', 'A young woman, her single mother, and the mother''s new boyfriend embark on a sailing adventure to Bermuda. However, when criminals suddenly attack their boat, the pleasure trip turns into a desperate fight for survival and a quest for vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIMbYsYVD2brZUTqc2LIoQRAXr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:980285'),
  ('1002776080724300138', 'Dangerous When Wet', 1953, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Walters, Sid Sidman, George Stoll', 'Dorothy Kingsley', 'Esther Williams, Fernando Lamas, Jack Carson, Charlotte Greenwood, Denise Darcel, William Demarest, Donna Corcoran, Barbara Whiting', 'NR', 'The health conscious, dairy-farming Higgins family begin each day with an invigorating swim. One day, traveling health-tonic salesman, Windy Weebe, comes to town and suggests they could swim the English Channel. Sponsored by "Liquapep" and coached by Windy, the family arrive in Europe. There it is decided that daughter Katie is the only one strong enough to enter the contest. But while she should be focused on the difficult and risky task ahead, Katie is pursed by dashing Frenchman, André Lanet... This comedic musical is well remembered for the scene when Katie dreams she is swimming with cartoon characters Tom & Jerry!', 'The health conscious, dairy-farming Higgins family begin each day with an invigorating swim. One day, traveling health-tonic salesman, Windy Weebe, comes to town and suggests they could swim the English Channel. Sponsored by "Liquapep" and coached by Windy, the family arrive in Europe. There it is decided that daughter Katie is the only one strong enough to enter the contest. But while she should be focused on the difficult and risky task ahead, Katie is pursed by dashing Frenchman, André Lanet... This comedic musical is well remembered for the scene when Katie dreams she is swimming with cartoon characters Tom & Jerry!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j74EmNAohpn5UzQgO61SYBOnfdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43193'),
  ('1029454680173814040', 'Dangerously Close', 1986, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Albert Pyun, Walt Lloyd, Robert Roda', 'John Stockwell, Scott Fields, Marty Ross', 'John Stockwell, John Edward Peck, Carey Lowell, Bradford Bancroft, Don Michael Paul, Thom Mathews, Gerard Christopher, Madison Mason', 'R', 'Rebel without a cause or a clue at an elite but uptight college discovers some of his classmates have formed an even more elite clique more or less hell-bent on ridding the school, and quite possibly American society, of what they deem to be its undesirables because of ethnicity, politics, etc. Our hero recruits a teacher and some other "less desirable" classmates to undermine the elitists, and, naturally, things get quite violent.', 'Rebel without a cause or a clue at an elite but uptight college discovers some of his classmates have formed an even more elite clique more or less hell-bent on ridding the school, and quite possibly American society, of what they deem to be its undesirables because of ethnicity, politics, etc. Our hero recruits a teacher and some other "less desirable" classmates to undermine the elitists, and, naturally, things get quite violent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uno9H8AwYu9kq31MjOKMB8EmBWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71841'),
  ('703462402880970152', 'Dangerously Excited', 2011, 'Music, Comedy', 'Koo Ja-hong, Oh Jae-ho, Kwon Ji-yoon', 'Koo Ja-hong', 'Yoon Je-moon, Song Ha-yoon, Sung Joon, Seo Hyeon-Jeong, Kwon Soo-hyun, Kim Hee-jung, Park Hae-il, Jung Hae-kyun', null, 'HAN Dae-huei, a public official in charge of residential pollution of Mapo district. No one can disturb his composure: a man who never loses his temper: a man of tranquility; the apotheosis of snobbery. He is a typically unenthusiastic public official up to his bone. Never expect him to try a new thing or change anything.', 'HAN Dae-huei, a public official in charge of residential pollution of Mapo district. No one can disturb his composure: a man who never loses his temper: a man of tranquility; the apotheosis of snobbery. He is a typically unenthusiastic public official up to his bone. Never expect him to try a new thing or change anything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wg5GLTUHWk9yzUDQaihcC4TDyG5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142533'),
  ('480785330540557223', 'Daniel', 1983, 'Drama', 'Sidney Lumet', 'E. L. Doctorow', 'Timothy Hutton, Mandy Patinkin, Lindsay Crouse, Ed Asner, Ellen Barkin, Julie Bovasso, Tovah Feldshuh, Joseph Leon', 'R', 'The fictionalized story of Daniel, the son of Paul and Rochelle Isaacson, who were executed as Soviet spies in the 1950s. As a graduate student in New York in the 1960s, Daniel is involved in the antiwar protest movement and contrasts his experiences to the memory of his parents and his belief that they were wrongfully convicted.', 'The fictionalized story of Daniel, the son of Paul and Rochelle Isaacson, who were executed as Soviet spies in the 1950s. As a graduate student in New York in the 1960s, Daniel is involved in the antiwar protest movement and contrasts his experiences to the memory of his parents and his belief that they were wrongfully convicted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5wr27gUyfi0sDdiTPa1jg48MvmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55819'),
  ('343066700334853080', 'Daniel & Ana', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Michel Franco, Chuy Chávez', 'Michel Franco', 'Dario Yazbek Bernal, Marimar Vega, Josemaría Torre-Hütt, Monserrat Ontiveros, Luis Miguel Lombana, Hector Kotsifakis, Armando Hernández, Gabriel de Cervantes', 'R', 'Being kidnapped shatters a brother and sister''s harmony, forcing them to confront their desires.', 'Being kidnapped shatters a brother and sister''s harmony, forcing them to confront their desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qdUuckSL6OAwp6aUpbMY6513YB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112631'),
  ('474904328462672572', 'Daniel Boone', 1936, 'Western', 'David Howard', 'Daniel Jarrett', 'George O''Brien, Heather Angel, John Carradine, Ralph Forbes, George Regas, Dickie Jones, Clarence Muse, Huntley Gordon', 'NR', 'In 1775, Daniel Boone settles Kentucky, despite menacing Indians and renegade whites.', 'In 1775, Daniel Boone settles Kentucky, despite menacing Indians and renegade whites.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPUGLygqiImCkM9bOYfjs8Ahy8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102379'),
  ('997801438403707923', 'Daniel Isn''t Real', 2019, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Adam Egypt Mortimer, Lyle Vincent, Duccio Fabbri', 'Brian DeLeeuw, Adam Egypt Mortimer', 'Miles Robbins, Patrick Schwarzenegger, Sasha Lane, Mary Stuart Masterson, Hannah Marks, Chukwudi Iwuji, Peter McRobbie, Chase Sui Wonders', 'NR', 'A troubled college freshman resurrects his imaginary friend to help him cope with a violent trauma.', 'A troubled college freshman resurrects his imaginary friend to help him cope with a violent trauma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFYYFEhKS6JZvNW7gXeKeqnbcS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537788'),
  ('99461858022583609', 'Daniel Sosa: Maleducado', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Marcos Bucay', null, 'Daniel Sosa', null, 'In his second stand-up special, Daniel Sosa reminisces about his childhood, ponders Mexican traditions and points out a major problem with "Coco".', 'In his second stand-up special, Daniel Sosa reminisces about his childhood, ponders Mexican traditions and points out a major problem with "Coco".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21utT8MgNgXVHcjktlfWWBhW85X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611710'),
  ('749657825115935411', 'Daniel Tosh: Completely Serious', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Daniel Tosh', 'Daniel Tosh', null, 'Fresh from his numerous appearances on late night TV and Comedy Central, cutting-edge comic Daniel Tosh brings his seriously funny brand of contemporary comedy to this riotous standup special. Like your Tosh a little raunchy? His unfiltered routine is here, along with a more family-friendly version that will have Grandma laughing, too.', 'Fresh from his numerous appearances on late night TV and Comedy Central, cutting-edge comic Daniel Tosh brings his seriously funny brand of contemporary comedy to this riotous standup special. Like your Tosh a little raunchy? His unfiltered routine is here, along with a more family-friendly version that will have Grandma laughing, too.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mD1uqbeD8dQcqFOyFZiXGyGhLmr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108176'),
  ('959375802980519895', 'Daniel, the Wizard', 2004, 'Music, Drama, Fantasy, Crime', 'Manuel Lommel, Max Nikoff, Ulli Lommel', 'Ulli Lommel', 'Lana Kaiser, Ulli Lommel, Rudolf Waldemar Brem, Katja Rupé, Günther Küblböck, Peter Schamoni, Adele Eden, Oliver Möller', null, 'Evil teenager assassins Rike & Tom want to kill and film the execution of the rock star Daniel Küblböck [or Lana Kaiser to be correct], who is spiritually supported by his dead grandfather Johnny, with the support of the mysterious Baltazar! Will our well-intentioned wizard succeed to survive this Christmas related mess and learn to forgive the others while beign kidnapped and almost executed, even if that means stickin'' his finger in cakes, rollin'' in tha snow like a cat or having psychedelic music dreams? (and singin'' some bangers in the meanwhile!)', 'Evil teenager assassins Rike & Tom want to kill and film the execution of the rock star Daniel Küblböck [or Lana Kaiser to be correct], who is spiritually supported by his dead grandfather Johnny, with the support of the mysterious Baltazar! Will our well-intentioned wizard succeed to survive this Christmas related mess and learn to forgive the others while beign kidnapped and almost executed, even if that means stickin'' his finger in cakes, rollin'' in tha snow like a cat or having psychedelic music dreams? (and singin'' some bangers in the meanwhile!)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uoB4dD1iYvBH0lCf8aYy7R1jWtS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9596'),
  ('688217294397655490', 'Danielle', 2017, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Román Martínez de Bujo, Alejandro Amenábar', 'Leo Burnett, Alejandro Amenábar', 'Charlotte Vega, Daniel Luque, Cayetana Recio, Lupe Cartié Roda, Néstor Arnas, Artur Busquets', null, 'A beautiful alien lands on earth and discovers love in the form of a Madrid native named Daniel. Realizing she can''t make it on her own, he takes her in. From there, their relationship develops. Will she be able to complete her mission in time?', 'A beautiful alien lands on earth and discovers love in the form of a Madrid native named Daniel. Realizing she can''t make it on her own, he takes her in. From there, their relationship develops. Will she be able to complete her mission in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iMmDRMn9YDAvD3P6Dn3iz3aG1T1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:487082'),
  ('917295566949845207', 'Danielle Steel''s Zoya', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Richard A. Colla, Laszlo George, Carole Dubuc', null, 'Melissa Gilbert, Bruce Boxleitner, Denise Alexander, Don Henderson, Zane Carney, Taryn Davis, David Warner, Diana Rigg', null, 'A young Russian countess escapes the 1917 revolution and, despite hardship, makes a new life for herself in America.', 'A young Russian countess escapes the 1917 revolution and, despite hardship, makes a new life for herself in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hRiztl4SJ1j9ttZacGareruV3UD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158097'),
  ('725108664548847001', 'Danika', 2006, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ariel Vromen, Darko Šuvak, Lynn K. D''Angona', 'Joshua Leibner', 'Marisa Tomei, Hannah Marks, Guy Camilleri, Akuyoe Graham, Ori Pfeffer, Jeffrey Nicholas Brown, Ridge Canipe, Bailey Hughes', 'R', 'Traumatized since childhood by her brother''s accidental death, Danika Merrick hallucinates a bank robbery and quits her job. Despite support from her three children and loving husband, Danika continues to experience unnerving visions. She seeks help from therapist Evelyn Harris but pervasive reports of violent incidents involving children make Danika fear for her own family, and she grows increasingly paranoid, worrying she may be going insane.', 'Traumatized since childhood by her brother''s accidental death, Danika Merrick hallucinates a bank robbery and quits her job. Despite support from her three children and loving husband, Danika continues to experience unnerving visions. She seeks help from therapist Evelyn Harris but pervasive reports of violent incidents involving children make Danika fear for her own family, and she grows increasingly paranoid, worrying she may be going insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Qk67gDdoR6eqJNYmb8ohBgbG1b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22105'),
  ('201181911860729871', 'Danilo Gentili: Politicamente Incorreto', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Danilo Gentili', null, 'Danilo Gentili', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed0UiO2eZ4s5p4FSDtmp69UqsaX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71727'),
  ('947725348019091555', 'Danny Boy', 2021, 'Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Sam Miller, Adam Gillham, David Crewdson', 'Robert Jones', 'Anthony Boyle, Toby Jones, Leah McNamara, Alex Ferns, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Sarah Niles, Kiran Sonia Sawar, Emma Lowndes', null, 'Soldier Brian Wood, is accused of war crimes in Iraq by the human rights lawyer Phil Shiner. The two men go head to head in a legal and moral conflict that takes us from the battlefield, at so-called Checkpoint Danny Boy, to the courtroom and one of Britain’s biggest ever public inquiries, the Al-Sweady Inquiry.', 'Soldier Brian Wood, is accused of war crimes in Iraq by the human rights lawyer Phil Shiner. The two men go head to head in a legal and moral conflict that takes us from the battlefield, at so-called Checkpoint Danny Boy, to the courtroom and one of Britain’s biggest ever public inquiries, the Al-Sweady Inquiry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc1EVTeZzI4hgQQOXpEDzS26BZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:822010'),
  ('654887086032819597', 'Danny Collins', 2015, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Dan Fogelman, Steve Yedlin, Jody Spilkoman', 'Dan Fogelman', 'Al Pacino, Annette Bening, Christopher Plummer, Jennifer Garner, Bobby Cannavale, Nick Offerman, Josh Peck, Katarina Čas', 'R', 'An ageing hard-living 1970s rock star decides to change his life when he discovers a 40-year-old undelivered letter written to him by John Lennon.', 'An ageing hard-living 1970s rock star decides to change his life when he discovers a 40-year-old undelivered letter written to him by John Lennon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf9ndc9l6alP9DhJF1ZpKz1PaXK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256924'),
  ('969228138488877947', 'Danny Deckchair', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Jeff Balsmeyer, Martin McGrath', 'Jeff Balsmeyer', 'Rhys Ifans, Miranda Otto, Justine Clarke, Rhys Muldoon, John Batchelor, Alan Flower, Julie Sobotta, Brian Langsworth', 'PG-13', 'Based on a true story, the tale of a cement truck driver named Danny, whose long awaited vacation is cancelled thanks to his scheming girlfriend, Trudy. Danny escapes his grim life in suburban Australia and blasts into the skies in a chair tied with helium balloons. A mighty thunderstorm blows him clean off the map, and spits him out far away over the lush green town of Clarence. In this new town, he rockets into the world of Glenda, the town''s only parking cop. While the media back home becomes obsessed with the story of his disappearance, Danny gets to reinvent himself in this new town, and in his great adventure, he discovers a true soul mate in Glenda. Fate catches up with him eventually, as Danny''s true identity is revealed and Trudy--now a tabloid celebrity--comes to the idyllic town to claim Danny and drag him back to Sydney. Danny, however, is a changed man; he''s discovered what it means to be happy and has found a new self-worth.', 'Based on a true story, the tale of a cement truck driver named Danny, whose long awaited vacation is cancelled thanks to his scheming girlfriend, Trudy. Danny escapes his grim life in suburban Australia and blasts into the skies in a chair tied with helium balloons. A mighty thunderstorm blows him clean off the map, and spits him out far away over the lush green town of Clarence. In this new town, he rockets into the world of Glenda, the town''s only parking cop. While the media back home becomes obsessed with the story of his disappearance, Danny gets to reinvent himself in this new town, and in his great adventure, he discovers a true soul mate in Glenda. Fate catches up with him eventually, as Danny''s true identity is revealed and Trudy--now a tabloid celebrity--comes to the idyllic town to claim Danny and drag him back to Sydney. Danny, however, is a changed man; he''s discovered what it means to be happy and has found a new self-worth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rL1WDYxTIPouUFDbdtcyqTyywu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14389'),
  ('31322520939962463', 'Danny Goes Aum', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sandeep Mohan, Subhash Maskara', 'Sandeep Mohan', 'Marianne Borgo, Anjali Patil, Andrew Sloman, Avinash Kuri, Divya Sharmaa', 'Not Rated', 'A burned out British Video Editor travels for inspiration to Goa where his hippie parents had met back in the 60''s', 'A burned out British Video Editor travels for inspiration to Goa where his hippie parents had met back in the 60''s', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fc992fd77752ad8fa450b006350ec07ab.jpg', 'plex:movie:danny-goes-aum'),
  ('1003553600959046405', 'Danny the Champion of the World', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie, Family', 'Gavin Millar, Oliver Stapleton', 'John Goldsmith', 'Jeremy Irons, Robbie Coltrane, Samuel Irons, Cyril Cusack, Michael Hordern, Lionel Jeffries, Jean Marsh, Jimmy Nail', null, 'Somewhere in England, in the Autumn of 1955, a widowed father and his son live an idyllic life together. Only their gas station happens to sit on a piece of land that a local developer wants to buy. And when he won''t take no for an answer, and sets government inspectors and social works onto Danny and his father, Danny and his father decide to get even with Hazell and his pheasant- shooting friends in a manner in keeping with their own family tradition.', 'Somewhere in England, in the Autumn of 1955, a widowed father and his son live an idyllic life together. Only their gas station happens to sit on a piece of land that a local developer wants to buy. And when he won''t take no for an answer, and sets government inspectors and social works onto Danny and his father, Danny and his father decide to get even with Hazell and his pheasant- shooting friends in a manner in keeping with their own family tradition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4nq8rvTTox4NTk8Vvbe1crUQhI2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53524'),
  ('161975211425710646', 'Dans la peau d''une grande', 2011, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Pascal Lahmani, Marc Falchier', 'Nathalie Abdelnour', 'Claire Keim, Mathieu Delarive, Julie-Anne Roth, Sophie de Fürst, Marc Rioufol, Marie-Armelle Deguy, Pénélope-Rose Lévèque, Lannick Gautry', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z76AGUhVieAMcPbGSoB5hES9ju.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117678'),
  ('326286809457980236', 'Dans la tête du tueur', 2004, 'Crime, TV Movie', 'Claude-Michel Rome, Bernard Déchet', 'Claude-Michel Rome, Didier Decoin', 'Bernard Giraudeau, Thierry Frémont, Pierre Laplace, Valérie Leboutte, Jean-Philippe Puymartin, Geoffroy Thiébaut, Fannie Brett, Xavier Letourneur', null, 'Jean-Francois Abgrall, today the head of a private detective agency, was just a simple provincial gendarme back in 1989 when he was assigned to investigate a murder on a beach. Instead, his investigation put him on the trial of one of France''s most terrifying serial killers, Francis Heaulme, who for eight years wandered the country committing some of the most brutal murders in the annals of modern crime. This is the true story of that manhunt, a tale of terror, suspense and determination.', 'Jean-Francois Abgrall, today the head of a private detective agency, was just a simple provincial gendarme back in 1989 when he was assigned to investigate a murder on a beach. Instead, his investigation put him on the trial of one of France''s most terrifying serial killers, Francis Heaulme, who for eight years wandered the country committing some of the most brutal murders in the annals of modern crime. This is the true story of that manhunt, a tale of terror, suspense and determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WqDIbHFQWpCvGnbYtIFBOl2f0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79549'),
  ('813523508900546341', 'Dans la tourmente', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Christophe Ruggia, Éric Guichard', 'Christophe Ruggia', 'Clovis Cornillac, Mathilde Seigner, Yvan Attal, Céline Sallette, Marc Brunet, Abel Jafri, Jean-Philippe Meyer, Nelly Antignac', null, 'Dans la région de Marseille, un patron prépare à l’insu de ses ouvriers la délocalisation de son usine, couplée d’un détournement de 2 millions d’euros. Franck, l’un de ses salariés l’apprend et, sans en parler à sa femme Hélène, décide avec Max, son ami de toujours, de passer à l’action...', 'Dans la région de Marseille, un patron prépare à l’insu de ses ouvriers la délocalisation de son usine, couplée d’un détournement de 2 millions d’euros. Franck, l’un de ses salariés l’apprend et, sans en parler à sa femme Hélène, décide avec Max, son ami de toujours, de passer à l’action...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wiWgNKTSvSGKjaHaGBqdQtsgaf9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112377'),
  ('122837303424139413', 'Dans une galaxie près de chez vous, le film', 2004, 'Comedy, Action, Family, Science Fiction', 'Claude Desrosiers, Serge Desrosiers', 'Claude Legault, Pierre-Yves Bernard', 'Guy Jodoin, Stéphane Crête, Claude Legault, Sylvie Moreau, Didier Lucien, Mélanie Maynard, Réal Bossé, Laurent-Christophe De Ruelle', null, 'The movie chronicles the long, futuristic voyage of a team of Québécois space explorers looking for a planet capable of sustaining life, in the year 2034, after the destruction of the ozone layer through excessive human pollution, prompting the need for a new planet to welcome humankind. The seven crew members venture outside their own galaxy to explore other star system in search of a new planet large enough to sustain 6 billion people. The few habitable planets encountered are ultimately abandoned either because they are already occupied (emphasizing the wrongdoing of invading other civilizations and cultures), or because upon closer inspection they are found to have other problems (cow-sized mosquitoes, high radiation levels, dog overpopulation, unsuitable living environment, ...).', 'The movie chronicles the long, futuristic voyage of a team of Québécois space explorers looking for a planet capable of sustaining life, in the year 2034, after the destruction of the ozone layer through excessive human pollution, prompting the need for a new planet to welcome humankind. The seven crew members venture outside their own galaxy to explore other star system in search of a new planet large enough to sustain 6 billion people. The few habitable planets encountered are ultimately abandoned either because they are already occupied (emphasizing the wrongdoing of invading other civilizations and cultures), or because upon closer inspection they are found to have other problems (cow-sized mosquitoes, high radiation levels, dog overpopulation, unsuitable living environment, ...).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCan91bSlSMmRmhXFcfK4AZIZDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60222'),
