  ('710301468486406397', 'Dante', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Pupi Avati, Cesare Bastelli', 'Pupi Avati', 'Sergio Castellitto, Alessandro Sperduti, Enrico Lo Verso, Alessandro Haber, Gianni Cavina, Leopoldo Mastelloni, Ludovica Pedetta, Morena Gentile', null, 'The tormented life of Dante Alighieri, from solitary childhood to death in exile, seen through Giovanni Boccaccio’s journey to rehabilitate his memory.', 'The tormented life of Dante Alighieri, from solitary childhood to death in exile, seen through Giovanni Boccaccio’s journey to rehabilitate his memory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wLi0pzD3JcmTeeg4D5WbzYruX5T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:819153'),
  ('604495231158867840', 'Dante 01', 2008, 'Science Fiction', 'Marc Caro, Jean Poisson', 'Marc Caro, Pierre Bordage', 'Lambert Wilson, Linh-Dan Pham, Simona Măicănescu, Dominique Pinon, Bruno Lochet, François Levantal, François Hadji-Lazaro, Lotfi Yahya Jedidi', 'R', 'Deep space, at the edge of the galaxy. The future. A new prisoner arrives on top security prison ship and psychiatric research unit Dante 01. Sole survivor of an encounter with an alien force, Saint-Georges is a man possessed by inner demons, caught up in the battle to control the monstrous power within him. It''s a power that will infect the other highly dangerous occupants of Dante 01, gaolors and prisoners alike, unleashing a violent rebellion that turns this terrifying, labyrinthine world upside down. In the otherworldly hell of the ship''s depths, through danger and redemption, each must journey to his very limits... each must confront his own Dragon.', 'Deep space, at the edge of the galaxy. The future. A new prisoner arrives on top security prison ship and psychiatric research unit Dante 01. Sole survivor of an encounter with an alien force, Saint-Georges is a man possessed by inner demons, caught up in the battle to control the monstrous power within him. It''s a power that will infect the other highly dangerous occupants of Dante 01, gaolors and prisoners alike, unleashing a violent rebellion that turns this terrifying, labyrinthine world upside down. In the otherworldly hell of the ship''s depths, through danger and redemption, each must journey to his very limits... each must confront his own Dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJxksg2IicE90KOsEanpozZC4rE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15125'),
  ('972861253431460969', 'Dante Goes To War', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Edoardo Clerici, Roberto Albanesi', 'Roberto Albanesi', 'Stefano Galli, Ivan Brusa, Roberta Nicosia, Claudio Abbiati, Paolo Riva, William Angiuli, Domitilla Colombo, Roberto Albanesi', null, 'An aimless, young Italian slacker makes a quirky new best friend who changes his life and helps him see the humor in everyday life.', 'An aimless, young Italian slacker makes a quirky new best friend who changes his life and helps him see the humor in everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUQ9QRoJ05C7PUEL6dyPHPj0nRh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:542135'),
  ('1010673637374422354', 'Dante''s Inferno', 1911, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Giuseppe de Liguoro, Francesco Bertolini, Adolfo Padovan', null, 'Salvatore Papa, Arturo Pirovano, Giuseppe de Liguoro, Augusto Milla, Attilio Motta, Emilise Beretta', null, 'The classic tale of Dante''s journey through hell, loosely adapted from the Divine Comedy and inspired by the illustrations of Gustav Doré. This historically important film stands as the first feature from Italy and the oldest fully-surviving feature in the world, and boasts beautiful sets and special effects that stand above other cinema of the era.', 'The classic tale of Dante''s journey through hell, loosely adapted from the Divine Comedy and inspired by the illustrations of Gustav Doré. This historically important film stands as the first feature from Italy and the oldest fully-surviving feature in the world, and boasts beautiful sets and special effects that stand above other cinema of the era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ky0z9hDlajlwL3fBqwsCSbjJGjR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70512'),
  ('204295128916113696', 'Dante''s Inferno', 1935, 'Drama, History, Horror', 'Harry Lachman', 'Robert Yost, Philip Klein', 'Spencer Tracy, Claire Trevor, Scotty Beckett, Henry B. Walthall, Alan Dinehart, Rita Hayworth, Willard Robertson, Morgan Wallace', 'NR', 'A carny builds a gambling empire at the expense of his family''s wellbeing.', 'A carny builds a gambling empire at the expense of his family''s wellbeing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6XB0FbpG1qsIc9CDws1VrteKi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164687'),
  ('778640294335698049', 'Dante''s Inferno', 1967, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Ken Russell, Nat Crosby', 'Austin Frazer', 'Oliver Reed, Judith Paris, Andrew Faulds, Iza Teller, Christopher Logue, Pat Ashton, Izabella Telezynska, Gala Mitchell', null, 'The story of the influential 19th century British poet Dante Gabriel Rossetti and his troubled and somewhat morbid relationship with his wife and his art.', 'The story of the influential 19th century British poet Dante Gabriel Rossetti and his troubled and somewhat morbid relationship with his wife and his art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Lf2zY5e3LAAGiNEMsMJt2RSA3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145230'),
  ('846581817053589400', 'Dante''s Inferno', 2007, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Sean Meredith, Michael Negrin', 'Sandow Birk, Paul Zaloom', 'Dermot Mulroney, James Cromwell, Olivia D''Abo, Martha Plimpton, Tony Abatemarco, Scott Adsit, Matt Besser, Bill Chott', 'NR', 'A darkly comedic travelogue of the underworld - set against an all-too-familiar urban backdrop of used car lots, gated communities, strip malls, and the U.S. Capitol. And populated with a contemporary cast of reprobates, including famous - and infamous - politicians, presidents, popes, pimps. And the Prince of Darkness himself.', 'A darkly comedic travelogue of the underworld - set against an all-too-familiar urban backdrop of used car lots, gated communities, strip malls, and the U.S. Capitol. And populated with a contemporary cast of reprobates, including famous - and infamous - politicians, presidents, popes, pimps. And the Prince of Darkness himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdwHFqp7Ix8vY6UI35VVFjCPRPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73103'),
  ('472177530924503446', 'Dante''s Inferno: An Animated Epic', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Horror', 'Mike Disa, Lee Seung-Gyu, Jong-Sik Nam', 'Brandon Auman', 'Graham McTavish, Vanessa Branch, Peter Jessop, Steve Blum, Mark Hamill, Victoria Tennant, Bart McCarthy, Kevin Michael Richardson', 'R', 'Dante journeys through the nine circles of Hell -- limbo, lust, gluttony, greed, anger, heresy, violence, fraud and treachery -- in search of his true love, Beatrice. An animated version of the video game of the same name.', 'Dante journeys through the nine circles of Hell -- limbo, lust, gluttony, greed, anger, heresy, violence, fraud and treachery -- in search of his true love, Beatrice. An animated version of the video game of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAEGEYTjbli3JoFgyrLn3blxDqi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31967'),
  ('857895265475251426', 'Dante''s Lunch', 2017, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Lee Unkrich, Jason Katz', null, null, null, 'Every dog has his day, but poor Dante can''t seem to catch a break.', 'Every dog has his day, but poor Dante can''t seem to catch a break.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/303lFHSSHSpJdINBeEesG9LPgpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449621'),
  ('629623622114455890', 'Dante''s Peak', 1997, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Roger Donaldson, Andrzej Bartkowiak, Ann Harris', 'Leslie Bohem', 'Pierce Brosnan, Linda Hamilton, Arabella Field, Jamie Renée Smith, Jeremy Foley, Elizabeth Hoffman, Charles Hallahan, Grant Heslov', 'PG-13', 'Volcanologist Harry Dalton comes to the sleepy town of Dante''s Peak to investigate the recent rumblings of the dormant volcano the burg is named for. Before long, his worst fears are realized when a massive eruption hits, and immediately, Harry, the mayor and the townspeople find themselves fighting for their lives amid a catastrophic nightmare.', 'Volcanologist Harry Dalton comes to the sleepy town of Dante''s Peak to investigate the recent rumblings of the dormant volcano the burg is named for. Before long, his worst fears are realized when a massive eruption hits, and immediately, Harry, the mayor and the townspeople find themselves fighting for their lives amid a catastrophic nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PRVIfZzDgw8EV3sDWJ6NA1ZMAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9619'),
  ('299246953909919238', 'Danton', 1983, 'Drama, History', 'Andrzej Wajda, Igor Luther, Krystyna Grochowicz', 'Jean-Claude Carrière, Agnieszka Holland, Andrzej Wajda', 'Gérard Depardieu, Wojciech Pszoniak, Patrice Chéreau, Angela Winkler, Roland Blanche, Alain Macé, Jacques Villeret, Anne Alvaro', null, 'Danton and Robespierre were close friends and fought together in the French Revolution, but by 1793 Robespierre was France''s ruler, determined to wipe out opposition with a series of mass executions that became known as the Reign of Terror. Danton, well known as a spokesman of the people, had been living in relative solitude in the French countryside, but he returned to Paris to challenge Robespierre''s violent rule and call for the people to demand their rights. Robespierre, however, could not accept such a challenge, even from a friend and colleague, and he blocked out a plan for the capture and execution of Danton and his allies.', 'Danton and Robespierre were close friends and fought together in the French Revolution, but by 1793 Robespierre was France''s ruler, determined to wipe out opposition with a series of mass executions that became known as the Reign of Terror. Danton, well known as a spokesman of the people, had been living in relative solitude in the French countryside, but he returned to Paris to challenge Robespierre''s violent rule and call for the people to demand their rights. Robespierre, however, could not accept such a challenge, even from a friend and colleague, and he blocked out a plan for the capture and execution of Danton and his allies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/az5XParmpea0fxAjwEgHpUrXzw0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4202'),
  ('80286164516582265', 'Danur: The Last Chapter', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Awi Suryadi, Sanjay Mulani, Arfian', 'Lele Laila', 'Prilly Latuconsina, Zee Asadel, Dito Darmawan, Lewis Robert, Muhammad Fauzan, Zachary Ayden, Said Darian Rizqi, Fillio Dheno', null, 'After years of separation from her ghost friends, Risa goes on with her life, closing the door to any communication with any ghosts. However, things change when her sister, Riri, is proposed. In an old theater and begins acting strangely in the time leading to her wedding. Not only does Riri change, but Risa also begins experiencing a series of strange events, as if she’s experiencing a painful death repeatedly. Risa suspects that this was happening because her ghost friends, Peter and his friends, were trying to convey something.', 'After years of separation from her ghost friends, Risa goes on with her life, closing the door to any communication with any ghosts. However, things change when her sister, Riri, is proposed. In an old theater and begins acting strangely in the time leading to her wedding. Not only does Riri change, but Risa also begins experiencing a series of strange events, as if she’s experiencing a painful death repeatedly. Risa suspects that this was happening because her ghost friends, Peter and his friends, were trying to convey something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/khU4SeP5G1et7q20tL8oNXJGiHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662723'),
  ('708266046556023475', 'Dany', 2018, 'Comedy', 'François Damiens', 'François Damiens, Benoît Mariage', 'François Damiens, Matteo Salamone, Tatiana Rojo, Christian Brahy, Serge Hutry, Éric Soriano', null, 'Dany, the king of petty thefts, did not wait until the end of his prison sentence to reunite with his 13-year-old son Sullivan. The only thing he now needs is a job and an apartment to regain custody of his son.', 'Dany, the king of petty thefts, did not wait until the end of his prison sentence to reunite with his 13-year-old son Sullivan. The only thing he now needs is a job and an apartment to regain custody of his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePxeIwodTq2ZNxnmFr6K2YGv2FY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515820'),
  ('374297579468956250', 'Dany de Boon des Hauts-de-France', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Dany Boon, Isabelle Nanty', null, 'Dany Boon', null, 'Dany Boon says farewell to the stage after 25 years of comedy. For the last time, Dany Boon paints his absurd scenes, colorful characters, life struggles and takes us to his homeland: north of France.', 'Dany Boon says farewell to the stage after 25 years of comedy. For the last time, Dany Boon paints his absurd scenes, colorful characters, life struggles and takes us to his homeland: north of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Il7OY2k8nIveh7XWThq7JUnBwJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520532'),
  ('967073636353093284', 'Danyka', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Alfonso Herrera Salcedo, Zulema Sánchez, Reydecel Martínez', 'Michael Rowe', 'Demián Bichir, Sasha González, Lisa Owen, Marco Antonio Treviño, Claudia Ríos, Arantxa Zubillaga, Candelario Ramos, Cristóbal Hagerman', null, 'A middle-aged man calls into question his life choices and his own morals after a flirtation with a teenage girl at the beach.', 'A middle-aged man calls into question his life choices and his own morals after a flirtation with a teenage girl at the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rhIONgbLOcEYwdkIv04CSy0Pdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741032'),
  ('1005693099615441154', 'Danzón', 1991, 'Drama', 'María Novaro, Moisés Ortiz Urquidi, Pablo Gómez Sáenz', 'María Novaro, Beatriz Novaro', 'María Rojo, Carmen Salinas, Tito Vasconcelos, Margarita Isabel, Víctor Carpinteiro, Blanca Guerra, Cheli Godínez, Adyari Chazaro', null, 'A telephone operator from Mexico City tries to support a family and her passion for popular dance.', 'A telephone operator from Mexico City tries to support a family and her passion for popular dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOeNtpe1qk03vYe03pzV2vAG9HU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114090'),
  ('515796548534181977', 'Daphne', 2007, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Clare Beavan, Christopher Titus King', 'Margaret Forster, Amy Jenkins', 'Geraldine Somerville, Elizabeth McGovern, Janet McTeer, Natalie Best, Felicity Montagu, Andrew Havill, Christopher Malcolm, Malcolm Sinclair', null, 'Set during the years between the "Rebecca" trial and the writing of Du Maurier''s short story "The Birds", including her relationship with her husband Frederick ''Boy'' Browning, and her largely unrequited infatuations with American publishing tycoon''s wife Ellen Doubleday and the actress Gertrude Lawrence.', 'Set during the years between the "Rebecca" trial and the writing of Du Maurier''s short story "The Birds", including her relationship with her husband Frederick ''Boy'' Browning, and her largely unrequited infatuations with American publishing tycoon''s wife Ellen Doubleday and the actress Gertrude Lawrence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lcteA8yv13pXj8HO00Hq3dyv2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204477'),
  ('289759594095152487', 'Daphne', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Mackie Burns, Alice Caronna, Adam Scarth', 'Nico Mensinga', 'Emily Beecham, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Nathaniel Martello-White, Ritu Arya, Karina Fernandez, Sinéad Matthews, Ragevan Vasan, Osy Ikhile', null, 'Daphne is a young woman negotiating the tricky business of modern life. Caught in the daily rush of her restaurant job and a nightlife kaleidoscope of new faces, she is witty, funny, the life of the party. Too busy to realise that deep down she is not happy. When she saves the life of a shopkeeper stabbed in a failed robbery, the impenetrable armour she wears to protect herself begins to crack, and Daphne is forced to confront the inevitability of a much-needed change in her life.', 'Daphne is a young woman negotiating the tricky business of modern life. Caught in the daily rush of her restaurant job and a nightlife kaleidoscope of new faces, she is witty, funny, the life of the party. Too busy to realise that deep down she is not happy. When she saves the life of a shopkeeper stabbed in a failed robbery, the impenetrable armour she wears to protect herself begins to crack, and Daphne is forced to confront the inevitability of a much-needed change in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dML8OAPjmwAYS1nXx0xRCaWrRxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436245'),
  ('188360159895653303', 'Daphne & Velma', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror, Action, Crime', 'Suzi Yoonessi, Meena Singh', 'Kyle Mack, Caitlin Meares', 'Sarah Jeffery, Sarah Gilman, Vanessa Marano, Courtney Dietz, Evan Castelloe, Brian Stepanek, Arden Myrin, Nadine Ellis', 'G', 'Before their eventual team-up with Scooby and the gang, bright and optimistic Daphne and whip-smart and analytical Velma are both mystery-solving teens who are best friends but have only met online - until now. Daphne has just transferred to Velma''s school, Ridge Valley High, an incredible tech-savvy institute with all the latest gadgets provided by the school''s benefactor, tech billionaire Tobias Bloom. And while competition is fierce among the students for a coveted internship at Bloom Innovative, Daphne and Velma dig beyond all the gadgets and tech to investigate what is causing some of the brightest students in school to disappear - only to emerge again in a zombie-fied state.', 'Before their eventual team-up with Scooby and the gang, bright and optimistic Daphne and whip-smart and analytical Velma are both mystery-solving teens who are best friends but have only met online - until now. Daphne has just transferred to Velma''s school, Ridge Valley High, an incredible tech-savvy institute with all the latest gadgets provided by the school''s benefactor, tech billionaire Tobias Bloom. And while competition is fierce among the students for a coveted internship at Bloom Innovative, Daphne and Velma dig beyond all the gadgets and tech to investigate what is causing some of the brightest students in school to disappear - only to emerge again in a zombie-fied state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zG2DHbo2GNxSmcFWqGkAPgS6hC8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489939'),
  ('236948850383333508', 'Daphnia', 1928, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé', null, null, null, 'Titles in French and English help us know what we''re seeing. In all waters, daphnia abound. They are crustaceans about 2 ml long, with one eye that turns in all directions. Antennae enable daphnia to move: in a close up magnified 150,000 times, we see the muscles of the antennae pulse. We see the eye, the nerve mass, blood globules, and the heart, beating several times per second. The intestine forms a long line. All are females; eggs develop above the intestine. New generations come rapidly. Inside each daphnia are tiny infusoria; we watch them clean the intestine of a dead daphnia. An enemy, the hydra, approaches. A daphnia dies, but many remain.', 'Titles in French and English help us know what we''re seeing. In all waters, daphnia abound. They are crustaceans about 2 ml long, with one eye that turns in all directions. Antennae enable daphnia to move: in a close up magnified 150,000 times, we see the muscles of the antennae pulse. We see the eye, the nerve mass, blood globules, and the heart, beating several times per second. The intestine forms a long line. All are females; eggs develop above the intestine. New generations come rapidly. Inside each daphnia are tiny infusoria; we watch them clean the intestine of a dead daphnia. An enemy, the hydra, approaches. A daphnia dies, but many remain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yH2WdpqJmLpXMRgpigc8uaLZD8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147015'),
  ('408891220442345331', 'Daphnis and Chloe', 1931, 'Drama, Romance', 'Orestis Laskos', 'Orestis Laskos', 'Apollon Marsyas, Lucy Matli, Μαρίκα Ραυτοπούλου, Giannis Avlonitis', null, 'In Lesvos, shepherd Lamonas someday finds an abandoned baby boy suckling a goat and adopts it, and names him Daphnis. Around the same time, another shepherd, Dryantas, finds too an abandoned baby girl and adopts it, naming her Chloe. Daphnis and Chloe grow together and, passing the threshold of puberty feel the buzz of first love. They do not know yet what is happening to them, until a beautiful woman who desires Daphnis, initiates him into the secrets of love. Daphnis in turn initiates Chloe, too. In the meantime, it is revealed that Daphnis is the son of Lord Dionysiofani, and Chloe daughter of a ruler of the island, Megacles.', 'In Lesvos, shepherd Lamonas someday finds an abandoned baby boy suckling a goat and adopts it, and names him Daphnis. Around the same time, another shepherd, Dryantas, finds too an abandoned baby girl and adopts it, naming her Chloe. Daphnis and Chloe grow together and, passing the threshold of puberty feel the buzz of first love. They do not know yet what is happening to them, until a beautiful woman who desires Daphnis, initiates him into the secrets of love. Daphnis in turn initiates Chloe, too. In the meantime, it is revealed that Daphnis is the son of Lord Dionysiofani, and Chloe daughter of a ruler of the island, Megacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pd16fDCIzSW0h3IzyHVaAkCYgel.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156424'),
  ('432220046643261965', 'Dar', 1967, null, 'Eugen Šinko, Miloslav Filip', 'Eugen Šinko', 'Mária Hájková, Ivan Krivosudský, Dušan Blaškovič, Viliam Polónyi, Ernest Kostelník, Emil Novotný', null, 'Promotion of free blood donation.', 'Promotion of free blood donation.', null, 'tmdb:movie:976476'),
  ('736793280995883384', 'Dara of Jasenovac', 2020, 'Drama, History, War', 'Predrag Antonijević', 'Nataša Drakulić', 'Biljana Čekić, Marko Janketić, Vuk Kostić, Igor Đorđević, Nataša Ninković, Radoslav ''Rale'' Milenković, Anja Stanić, Nikolina Friganović', null, 'During the Nazi-occupied Ustasha regime "NDH" in former Yugoslavia during WWII, little girl Dara is sent to the concentration camp complex Jasenovac in Croatia also known as "Balkan''s Auschwitz".', 'During the Nazi-occupied Ustasha regime "NDH" in former Yugoslavia during WWII, little girl Dara is sent to the concentration camp complex Jasenovac in Croatia also known as "Balkan''s Auschwitz".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inXhGdmfE6GCV1NpnZPUd6ECF2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:733740'),
  ('1018482874081251708', 'Darbar', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Santosh Sivan, A. R. Murugadoss, Nalini Rathnam', 'A. R. Murugadoss', 'Rajinikanth, Nayanthara, Suniel Shetty, Nivetha Thomas, Yogi Babu, Prateik Smita Patil, Nawab Shah, Shamata Anchan', null, 'Aaditya, the commissioner of Mumbai Police, sets out to catch Ajay, a drug peddler. However, he uncovers a deeper controversy linked to an international drug lord and must mete out justice.', 'Aaditya, the commissioner of Mumbai Police, sets out to catch Ajay, a drug peddler. However, he uncovers a deeper controversy linked to an international drug lord and must mete out justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39kVh9CWrY8cE6rIzRqwo6Dn1cZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594139'),
  ('622668051066919345', 'Darbujan and Pandrhola', 1960, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Martin Frič, Rudolf Jaroš, Marie Hejzlarová', 'Jan Drda, Martin Frič', 'Jiří Sovák, Běla Jurdová, Rudolf Hrušínský, Pavla Maršálková, Bohumil Švarc, Květa Fialová, Václav Lohniský, Bohuš Záhorský', null, 'A poor miner, Kuba Dařbuján, cares for his wife Markýtka and eleven children. When a newborn arrives, he seeks a godfather and, finding only Death fair to all, accepts a pact: as a doctor whom Death accompanies at the foot of a patient’s bed, he can heal; but if Death stands at the head, no cure is possible. Kuba eventually heals even a miserly brewer, violating the pact and imprisoning Death, leading to a world where no one can die and unforeseen chaos follows.', 'A poor miner, Kuba Dařbuján, cares for his wife Markýtka and eleven children. When a newborn arrives, he seeks a godfather and, finding only Death fair to all, accepts a pact: as a doctor whom Death accompanies at the foot of a patient’s bed, he can heal; but if Death stands at the head, no cure is possible. Kuba eventually heals even a miserly brewer, violating the pact and imprisoning Death, leading to a world where no one can die and unforeseen chaos follows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eLY0zSmvKimd9vbM0Cq7aCnfc0n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116174'),
  ('1134438548370590530', 'Darby and the Dead', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama', 'Silas Howard, Ante Cheng, Laura Klein', 'Becca Greene', 'Asher Angel, Riele Downs, Auliʻi Cravalho, Chosen Jacobs, Wayne Knight, Derek Luke, Tony Danza, Nicole Maines', 'PG-13', 'After Darby Harper suffered a near-death experience as a child, she gained the ability to see ghosts. To combat the existential boredom of high school, she runs a side business counseling local spirits in her spare time. When an unexpected occurrence happens between Darby and Capri, the most popular girl at her high school, Darby reluctantly agrees to help her and in the process learns how to fit in with the living world again.', 'After Darby Harper suffered a near-death experience as a child, she gained the ability to see ghosts. To combat the existential boredom of high school, she runs a side business counseling local spirits in her spare time. When an unexpected occurrence happens between Darby and Capri, the most popular girl at her high school, Darby reluctantly agrees to help her and in the process learns how to fit in with the living world again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v1mtYW0qShlS3YFy10D8GqTk6LI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898308'),
  ('381009767106301742', 'Darby O''Gill and the Little People', 1959, 'Adventure, Family, Fantasy, Romance', 'Robert Stevenson, Winton C. Hoch, Robert G. Shannon', 'Lawrence Edward Watkin', 'Albert Sharpe, Janet Munro, Sean Connery, Jimmy O''Dea, Kieron Moore, Estelle Winwood, Walter Fitzgerald, Denis O''Dea', 'G', 'A wily old codger matches wits with the King of the Leprechauns and helps play matchmaker for his daughter and the strapping lad who has replaced him as caretaker.', 'A wily old codger matches wits with the King of the Leprechauns and helps play matchmaker for his daughter and the strapping lad who has replaced him as caretaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2Nafax2MMq2Cg0wDReo5L8ILGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18887'),
  ('1150140733262862862', 'Darc', 2018, 'Action, Thriller', 'Julius R. Nasso', 'Dennis Venter', 'Tony Schiena, Armand Assante, Sho Ikushima, Dawn Olivieri, Kevan Ohtsji, Vienna Hehir, Kasey Ryne Mazak, Chance Hurstfield', null, 'To bring down a global human trafficking ring, an Interpol agent recruits the help of a brutal criminal with inside knowledge of the yakuza.', 'To bring down a global human trafficking ring, an Interpol agent recruits the help of a brutal criminal with inside knowledge of the yakuza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBxHNF0risAugpPJeAgLkiUW0P1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521647'),
  ('708001243228120093', 'Dard Divorce', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Burhan Özdal, Olaf Ittenbach', 'Olaf Ittenbach', 'Martina Ittenbach, Daryl Jackson, Jaymes Butler, Barrett Jones, Kamary Phillips, Gideon Jackson, Henora Jackson, Kami Esfahani', 'NR', 'What started with a routine divorce between Natalie Stein and her husband Tim, will soon take a turn into the unexpected and evolve into scenes of torture, bloodshed and slaughter.', 'What started with a routine divorce between Natalie Stein and her husband Tim, will soon take a turn into the unexpected and evolve into scenes of torture, bloodshed and slaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnl6DmWIGwXFpVwvOIgXf65bahu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13106'),
  ('681231852336612248', 'Dare', 2005, 'Drama', 'Adam Salky, Rick Siegel, Amy Swantko', 'David Brind', 'Adam Fleming, Michael Cassidy, Marla Burkholder, Terry Guerin, Carly Haines, Matt Lundy, Steve Sweigard', null, 'Smart and lonely high school senior Ben secretly lusts after bad boy classmate Johnny. After play practice one night for the senior production of “A Streetcar Named Desire,” “light-boy” Ben gives Johnny, the play’s Stanley, a ride home to help him with his lines.', 'Smart and lonely high school senior Ben secretly lusts after bad boy classmate Johnny. After play practice one night for the senior production of “A Streetcar Named Desire,” “light-boy” Ben gives Johnny, the play’s Stanley, a ride home to help him with his lines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NwUtCMTGhYUUHrdOQc0LTPgGup.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49113'),
  ('657561639822468585', 'Dare', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Adam Salky, Michael Fimognari, Yann Sobezynski', 'David Brind', 'Emmy Rossum, Zach Gilford, Ashley Springer, Ana Gasteyer, Rooney Mara, Sandra Bernhard, Alan Cumming, Cady Huffman', 'R', 'When a pompous actor tells good girl Alexa that she hasn''t lived, she embarks on a bold journey that takes her to mysterious bad boy Johnny. Envious, her shy best friend Ben also dares to pursue Johnny.', 'When a pompous actor tells good girl Alexa that she hasn''t lived, she embarks on a bold journey that takes her to mysterious bad boy Johnny. Envious, her shy best friend Ben also dares to pursue Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dofOOVLHyU1uI3CKt70NrfSXbVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32124'),
  ('41042775231021330', 'Dare to Stop Us', 2018, 'Drama', 'Tomohiko Tsuji, Kazuya Shiraishi, Ryôta Inoue', 'Junichi Inoue', 'Mugi Kadowaki, Arata Iura, Hiroshi Yamamoto, Soran Tamoto, Katsuya Maiguma, Nao Okabe, Kuu Izima, Shima Onishi', null, 'In Spring 1969, 21-year-old Megumi Yoshizumi goes to Wakamatsu Production. The company makes films popular with young people. Pink film director Koji Wakamatsu gathers there with young talented people who are all fascinated with movie making. When they are not making movies, they spend their time smoking, drinking alcohol, scouting for actresses and looking for material for their next film. When filming begins, everybody immerses themselves into the production and will do everything on the filming set from running, shouting to acting.', 'In Spring 1969, 21-year-old Megumi Yoshizumi goes to Wakamatsu Production. The company makes films popular with young people. Pink film director Koji Wakamatsu gathers there with young talented people who are all fascinated with movie making. When they are not making movies, they spend their time smoking, drinking alcohol, scouting for actresses and looking for material for their next film. When filming begins, everybody immerses themselves into the production and will do everything on the filming set from running, shouting to acting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znnmj6q0crAe1h8rt0KvvCvfqgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547442'),
