  ('175109929156047341', 'Daria in ''Is It College Yet?''', 2002, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Karen Disher, Karen Disher, Tony Kluck', 'Glenn Eichler, Peggy Nicoll', 'Tracy Grandstaff, Wendy Hoopes, Julián Rebolledo, Alvaro J. Gonzalez, Marc Thompson, Russell Hankin, Tim Novikoff, Steven Huppert', 'NR', 'All vile things must come to an end, and for Daria Morgendorffer that means it''s time to look beyond high school to college. Our little girl has grown up so fast. It''s time for higher learning, lowered expectations, and a heavy dose of sarcasm. Life can''t suck more after high school, can it?', 'All vile things must come to an end, and for Daria Morgendorffer that means it''s time to look beyond high school to college. Our little girl has grown up so fast. It''s time for higher learning, lowered expectations, and a heavy dose of sarcasm. Life can''t suck more after high school, can it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ws4PQmOVgRvCUlwyHv7JnJnrY3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24232'),
  ('112123783326867934', 'Daria in ''Is It Fall Yet?''', 2000, 'Animation, Comedy, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Karen Disher, Guy Moore', 'Glenn Eichler, Peggy Nicoll', 'Tracy Grandstaff, Wendy Hoopes, Alvaro J. Gonzalez, Russell Hankin, Jessica Cydnee Jackson, Julián Rebolledo, Janie Mertz, Carson Daly', 'PG-13', 'Daria is a 16-year-old girl who is a little too smart and funny to fit in with the crowd. It’s summertime and the livin'' is hard. Daria finds herself forced into volunteering at the OK To Cry Corral, a summer camp for the overly sensitive and those who''d like to be.', 'Daria is a 16-year-old girl who is a little too smart and funny to fit in with the crowd. It’s summertime and the livin'' is hard. Daria finds herself forced into volunteering at the OK To Cry Corral, a summer camp for the overly sensitive and those who''d like to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuj1qQ8LoizZCnzMQEPfBxZf9SF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44756'),
  ('587554392690462151', 'Dario Argento''s World of Horror', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Michele Soavi', 'Michele Soavi', 'Dario Argento, Romano Albani', 'NR', 'Documentary on horror/mystery filmmaker Dario Argento. Features an in-depth interview with Argento and covers his work from 1969 to 1985.', 'Documentary on horror/mystery filmmaker Dario Argento. Features an in-depth interview with Argento and covers his work from 1969 to 1985.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LXitYoiqgx80jTL3vFEQkyS0vn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92778'),
