  ('661749226333942008', 'Dark Alibi', 1946, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Phil Karlson, Theodore Joos, Joel Kronish', 'George Callahan', 'Sidney Toler, Mantan Moreland, Ben Carter, Benson Fong, Teala Loring, George Holmes, Joyce Compton, John Eldredge', 'NR', 'After three men are convicted of bank robberies, Charlie becomes suspicious. After some investigation Charlie finds the men are innocent and that the fingerprint evidence used to convict them had been forged. Charlie then proceeds to find the true bank robbers.', 'After three men are convicted of bank robberies, Charlie becomes suspicious. After some investigation Charlie finds the men are innocent and that the fingerprint evidence used to convict them had been forged. Charlie then proceeds to find the true bank robbers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKojx5sfIFglK3oifUQLkVkoPEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38471'),
  ('480604757933016848', 'Dark Angel', 1990, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Crime, Horror', 'Craig R. Baxley, Tom Zapata, Craig West', 'David Koepp, Jonathan Tydor', 'Dolph Lundgren, Brian Benben, Betsy Brantley, Matthias Hues, Jay Bilas, Jim Haynie, David Ackroyd, Suzanne Savoy', 'R', 'Jack Caine is a Houston vice cop who''s forgotten the rule book. His self-appointed mission is to stop the drugs trade and the number one supplier Victor Manning. While involved in an undercover operation to entrap Victor Manning, his partner is killed, and a sinister newcomer enters the scene...', 'Jack Caine is a Houston vice cop who''s forgotten the rule book. His self-appointed mission is to stop the drugs trade and the number one supplier Victor Manning. While involved in an undercover operation to entrap Victor Manning, his partner is killed, and a sinister newcomer enters the scene...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwsesgAluQKDmdAA2nhlEc4FhFd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19384'),
  ('1004866827534313481', 'Dark Angel: The Ascent', 1994, 'Horror, Romance, Fantasy', 'Linda Hassani, Michael Dignum, Vivi Drăgan Vasile', 'Matthew Bright', 'Angela Featherstone, Daniel Markel, Nicholas Worth, Charlotte Stewart, Mike Genovese, Michael C. Mahon, Milton James, Cristina Stoica', null, 'A bored female demon ventures to the surface world to punish the wicked before they enter her hellish domain.', 'A bored female demon ventures to the surface world to punish the wicked before they enter her hellish domain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrnpa4GDZlOYllHKOLJlZADwlnO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59051'),
  ('1119886315244268752', 'Dark Angels', 1998, 'Action, Crime', 'Edwin Myers, David Wadley', 'David Wadley', 'Je Nie Fleming, L. Sidney, Louis B. Murray, Roberto Gutierrez, A.J. Johnson, John Burton, Jr.', null, 'A faith-based action movie about a woman who faces a choice between her abusive, drug-dealing husband and her unborn baby on the way. Her world is full of sex, drugs, money, and power, with violence an ever-present threat. On the mean streets of Atlanta, the expectant mother finds that only spiritual awareness and the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse can help her escape the madness. Dark Angels was written, produced, and directed by David Wadley, featuring A.J. Johnson (Friday, Menace II Society). Dark Angels is available on multiple streaming services, including Prime Video and Tubi.', 'A faith-based action movie about a woman who faces a choice between her abusive, drug-dealing husband and her unborn baby on the way. Her world is full of sex, drugs, money, and power, with violence an ever-present threat. On the mean streets of Atlanta, the expectant mother finds that only spiritual awareness and the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse can help her escape the madness. Dark Angels was written, produced, and directed by David Wadley, featuring A.J. Johnson (Friday, Menace II Society). Dark Angels is available on multiple streaming services, including Prime Video and Tubi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt7Jg3Er2i9RHAIUMK3WOVMojRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727283'),
  ('705993109989727146', 'Dark Asset', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Michael Winnick, Mariano De Luca', 'Michael Winnick', 'Byron Mann, Robert Patrick, Helena Mattsson, Sabina Gadecki, Trương Ngọc Ánh, Marc Winnick, Shani Rigsbee, Erica Muñoz', 'R', 'A charming guy attempts to pick up a woman in a bar by spinning a tale involving spies, implanted microchips and the dangerous military scientist hunting him.', 'A charming guy attempts to pick up a woman in a bar by spinning a tale involving spies, implanted microchips and the dangerous military scientist hunting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hfxqsC8Bz2wMZmXKwEZqKyJiScT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1168521'),
  ('108168128540831485', 'Dark August', 1976, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Martin G. Goldman, Richard E. Brooks, Walter Rearick', 'J.J. Barry, Martin G. Goldman, Carolyne Barry', 'Kim Hunter, J.J. Barry, Carolyne Barry, Kate McKeown, Frank Bongiorno, William Robertson, Richard Allan Fay, Martin Harvey Friedberg', 'PG', 'A young girl is accidentally run down by a car driven by a careless city slicker. This careless injustice provokes the girl''s grandfather into summoning his mystical powers and placing a death curse on the young man. Desperate to stave off the dire consequences of the hex, Barry seeks the counsel of a local psychic medium.', 'A young girl is accidentally run down by a car driven by a careless city slicker. This careless injustice provokes the girl''s grandfather into summoning his mystical powers and placing a death curse on the young man. Desperate to stave off the dire consequences of the hex, Barry seeks the counsel of a local psychic medium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wuJOIOzpCBWQasBCiZiPJwP9Bgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105070'),
  ('875292395496251854', 'Dark Beast', 2016, 'Drama', 'Felipe Guerrero, Fernando Lockett', 'Felipe Guerrero', 'Marleyda Soto, Luisa Vides Galiano, Jocelyn Meneses', null, 'Oscuro animal tells the story of three women forced to flee their homes in a war torn region in Colombia. Each of their journeys, marked by terror, takes them on a trek from the deep jungle to the outskirts of Bogotá, where they will gather new strength to start a new life.', 'Oscuro animal tells the story of three women forced to flee their homes in a war torn region in Colombia. Each of their journeys, marked by terror, takes them on a trek from the deep jungle to the outskirts of Bogotá, where they will gather new strength to start a new life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8yd6Cqg9pQJGGkYKL82Dlq1ke8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376086'),
  ('141598341387138424', 'Dark Blood', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Harold Trompetero, Hugo Colace', 'Jeiver Pinto, Harold Trompetero, Gerardo Pinzón', 'John Leguizamo, Adriana Barraza, Ramiro Meneses, Hernán Méndez, Álvaro Rodríguez, María Nela Sinisterra', 'R', 'A father is imprisoned after committing a brutal revenge crime. During his confinement he must adapt to a new life of abuse, including injury and humiliation by guards and other prisoners.', 'A father is imprisoned after committing a brutal revenge crime. During his confinement he must adapt to a new life of abuse, including injury and humiliation by guards and other prisoners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nl98dpJQCHWmjB44ksw3LXz5xBu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:845885'),
  ('545761687938699971', 'Dark Blue', 2002, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Ron Shelton, Barry Peterson', 'David Ayer', 'Kurt Russell, Scott Speedman, Michael Michele, Brendan Gleeson, Ving Rhames, Kurupt, Dash Mihok, Jonathan Banks', 'R', 'Set during the Rodney King riots, a robbery homicide investigation triggers a series of events that will cause a corrupt LAPD officer to question his tactics.', 'Set during the Rodney King riots, a robbery homicide investigation triggers a series of events that will cause a corrupt LAPD officer to question his tactics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekW39lKhQ3L3rdOgzyF3d0CoPLV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4911'),
  ('1069512439407070523', 'Dark Blue Almost Black', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo, Juan Carlos Gómez, Ana Hernando', 'Daniel Sánchez Arévalo', 'Quim Gutiérrez, Antonio de la Torre, Raúl Arévalo, Héctor Colomé, Eva Pallarés, Manuel Morón, Ana Wagener, Roberto Enríquez', null, 'Jorge feels suffocated by his menial job but can''t break free of the obligations that keep him stuck — until he meets a woman who shakes his life up', 'Jorge feels suffocated by his menial job but can''t break free of the obligations that keep him stuck — until he meets a woman who shakes his life up', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oL4Pg64w1IfOTcwzmiRXeGa6iRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3865'),
  ('521314746640010630', 'Dark Blue Girl', 2017, 'Drama', 'Fabian Gamper, Mascha Schilinski', 'Mascha Schilinski', 'Helena Zengel, Karsten Mielke, Artemis Chalkidou', null, 'Luca is a strong-willed, soulful seven-year-old. After a two-year separation, her parents take her on a trip to pack up and sell their vacation home on a quiet island in the Aegean. Once there, her parents’ romantic connection is reignited. This newfound intimacy unsettles the family dynamic, as Luca suddenly ceases to be the center of attention. With childish cleverness and determination, she plays her parents against each other, intent on keeping her place as the center of their worlds.', 'Luca is a strong-willed, soulful seven-year-old. After a two-year separation, her parents take her on a trip to pack up and sell their vacation home on a quiet island in the Aegean. Once there, her parents’ romantic connection is reignited. This newfound intimacy unsettles the family dynamic, as Luca suddenly ceases to be the center of attention. With childish cleverness and determination, she plays her parents against each other, intent on keeping her place as the center of their worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdl5PdYycncSm8lFxXHfOZfuU0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441396'),
  ('370177744052246050', 'Dark Blue World', 2001, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Jan Svěrák, Mykola Geyko, Vaclav Mottl', 'Zdeněk Svěrák', 'Ondřej Vetchý, Kryštof Hádek, Tara Fitzgerald, Oldřich Kaiser, Linda Rybová, David Novotný, Charles Dance, Jaromír Dulava', 'R', 'Lt. Franta Slama is a top pilot in the Czech Air Force who is assigned to train a promising young flier, Karel Vojtisek, and they soon become friends. When Nazi Germany invades Czechoslovakia in 1939, they both reject the authority of their new leaders and escape to England where they join other Czech exiles in the RAF. While flying a mission over England, Karel crash lands and happens upon the farmhouse of Susan, a young woman whose husband is in the Navy. Karel soon falls head over heels for Susan but, while they enjoy a brief fling, in time Susan decides she prefers the company of the older and more worldly Franta. As Franta and Karel struggle to maintain their friendship despite their romantic rivalry.', 'Lt. Franta Slama is a top pilot in the Czech Air Force who is assigned to train a promising young flier, Karel Vojtisek, and they soon become friends. When Nazi Germany invades Czechoslovakia in 1939, they both reject the authority of their new leaders and escape to England where they join other Czech exiles in the RAF. While flying a mission over England, Karel crash lands and happens upon the farmhouse of Susan, a young woman whose husband is in the Navy. Karel soon falls head over heels for Susan but, while they enjoy a brief fling, in time Susan decides she prefers the company of the older and more worldly Franta. As Franta and Karel struggle to maintain their friendship despite their romantic rivalry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vu152xTO89l9UWDcqmE9zVD5xK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15813'),
  ('220947559430836610', 'Dark Breed', 1997, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Ken Blakey, Maurice K. McGuire, Richard Pepin', 'Richard Preston Jr.', 'Jack Scalia, Lance LeGault, Donna W. Scott, Robin Curtis, Jonathan Banks, Sal Landi, Cindy Ambuehl, Gregg Brazzel', 'R', 'Captain Saxon, an agent for the top secret Omega agency, has been given the assignment of tracking down and either capturing or killing the crew members of a secret space mission who returned to Earth against orders. It seems that they were all infected with an alien parasite, and they were trying to bring its eggs back to Earth. The eggs were lost in an accident, and both Saxon and the astronauts are trying to locate them.', 'Captain Saxon, an agent for the top secret Omega agency, has been given the assignment of tracking down and either capturing or killing the crew members of a secret space mission who returned to Earth against orders. It seems that they were all infected with an alien parasite, and they were trying to bring its eggs back to Earth. The eggs were lost in an accident, and both Saxon and the astronauts are trying to locate them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iALH5d68vUU1TFRPlyltOD0PBIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88258'),
  ('361956043356409962', 'Dark Buildings (A Crack in the Wall)', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Nicolás Gil Lavedra, Sol Lopatín', 'Nicolás Gil Lavedra, Emiliano Torres', 'Joaquín Furriel, Oscar Martínez, Soledad Villamil, Sara Sálamo, Santiago Segura, Laura Novoa, Zoe Hochbaum, Tulio Gómez Álzaga', null, 'When the beautiful Leonor arrives at the architecture studio Borla y Asociados looking for Nelson Jara, both Mario Borla and his partner Marta Hovart and Pablo Simó, the building''s oldest architect, claim to ignore that name completely. But they all lie. The truth begins to unravel through the memories of Pablo Simó. Pablo should carry out the unpleasant job of dealing with Nelson Jara, an indignant owner of the building adjoining a work of the studio, damaged by a crack in the wall of his living room caused by an error in the construction. But the fear and nervousness that provokes in the three involved the arrival of Leonor and her question "what happened to Nelson Jara?" Show something much darker and more suspicious. (FILMAFFINITY)', 'When the beautiful Leonor arrives at the architecture studio Borla y Asociados looking for Nelson Jara, both Mario Borla and his partner Marta Hovart and Pablo Simó, the building''s oldest architect, claim to ignore that name completely. But they all lie. The truth begins to unravel through the memories of Pablo Simó. Pablo should carry out the unpleasant job of dealing with Nelson Jara, an indignant owner of the building adjoining a work of the studio, damaged by a crack in the wall of his living room caused by an error in the construction. But the fear and nervousness that provokes in the three involved the arrival of Leonor and her question "what happened to Nelson Jara?" Show something much darker and more suspicious. (FILMAFFINITY)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2eCSXDYFFiUtZEja4ToRPukJxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499782'),
  ('214240481624531442', 'Dark Cat', 1991, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Horror', 'Iku Suzuki, Tsuguo Kozawa, Hirohide Shikishima', 'Toshiki Inoue', 'Tsutomu Kashiwakura, Ryotaro Okiayu, Yumi Touma, Aya Hisakawa, Shigeru Nakahara, Daisuke Gori, Hikaru Midorikawa, Junko Hagimori', null, 'Hyoi and Rui, two inhuman brothers with the powers of the Dark Cat, a spiritual martial art that allows them to sense supernatural beings and turn into cats, are caught up in a dilemma involving their Dark Cat master, Jakokubo, who plans to summon the evil in humans as a tremendous feast for himself and his power. What do a group of local high schoolers have to do with his nefarious plans, and will the Dark Cat brothers be able to save their newfound friends from certain danger?', 'Hyoi and Rui, two inhuman brothers with the powers of the Dark Cat, a spiritual martial art that allows them to sense supernatural beings and turn into cats, are caught up in a dilemma involving their Dark Cat master, Jakokubo, who plans to summon the evil in humans as a tremendous feast for himself and his power. What do a group of local high schoolers have to do with his nefarious plans, and will the Dark Cat brothers be able to save their newfound friends from certain danger?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4e84OOfYSKKuLCxKlsxYktWDFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73461'),
  ('729109088641642166', 'Dark Circles', 2013, 'Horror', 'Paul Soter, Brown Cooper, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Paul Soter', 'Johnathon Schaech, Pell James, Andrea Frankle, Philippe Brenninkmeyer, Jenn Foreman, Ever Eloise Landrum, Glen Warner, Suzanne Severio', 'R', 'When new parents Alex and Penny retreat from the city and move into a place outside town, the stress and massive sleep-deprivation caused by their infant has both of them seeing things in the house that may or may not exist. Persistent sightings of a strange woman has each of them wondering if they are suffering from hallucinations, or if their new home holds a dark, supernatural presence. As their fragile grasp on reality spirals into delirium, Alex and Penny find themselves nearly helpless to deal with the horrific truth of what is really going in this house.', 'When new parents Alex and Penny retreat from the city and move into a place outside town, the stress and massive sleep-deprivation caused by their infant has both of them seeing things in the house that may or may not exist. Persistent sightings of a strange woman has each of them wondering if they are suffering from hallucinations, or if their new home holds a dark, supernatural presence. As their fragile grasp on reality spirals into delirium, Alex and Penny find themselves nearly helpless to deal with the horrific truth of what is really going in this house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qaFRm7Ixvu41eCx4wIXXNq8M8KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:194121'),
  ('581002585573238661', 'Dark City', 1950, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Victor Milner, William Dieterle, Richard McWhorter', 'John Meredyth Lucas', 'Charlton Heston, Lizabeth Scott, Viveca Lindfors, Dean Jagger, Don DeFore, Jack Webb, Ed Begley, Harry Morgan', 'NR', 'Gamblers who "took" an out-of-town sucker in a crooked poker game feel shadowy vengeance closing in on them.', 'Gamblers who "took" an out-of-town sucker in a crooked poker game feel shadowy vengeance closing in on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mkj8Vv5lpndZnjdHNBdIV4fhoh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36331'),
  ('891708504912129832', 'Dark City', 1998, 'Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Alex Proyas, Dariusz Wolski, Topher Dow', 'David S. Goyer, Alex Proyas, Lem Dobbs', 'Rufus Sewell, William Hurt, Kiefer Sutherland, Jennifer Connelly, Richard O''Brien, Ian Richardson, Bruce Spence, Colin Friels', 'R', 'A man struggles with memories of his past, including a wife he cannot remember, in a nightmarish world with no sun and run by beings with telekinetic powers who seek the souls of humans.', 'A man struggles with memories of his past, including a wife he cannot remember, in a nightmarish world with no sun and run by beings with telekinetic powers who seek the souls of humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNPEGju4DpTdbhBphNmZoEi9Bd3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2666'),
  ('417168811739227447', 'Dark Cloud', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ben Enke, Jay Ness, Owen Royce', 'John J. Kaiser', 'Brittany Benjamin, Amanda Day, Alexys Gabrielle, Hugo Armstrong, Emily Atack, Amanda Day, Susan Chambers, Ali Daniels', 'R', 'Following the aftermath of a horrific accident, a woman is voluntarily subjected to artificial intelligence for rehabilitation.', 'Following the aftermath of a horrific accident, a woman is voluntarily subjected to artificial intelligence for rehabilitation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1ngkvPCnOYKeyNZjg8QqvaSnuZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:897424'),
  ('367727034120952209', 'Dark Command', 1940, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'Raoul Walsh, Jack A. Marta', 'Grover Jones, F. Hugh Herbert, Lionel Houser', 'Claire Trevor, John Wayne, Walter Pidgeon, Roy Rogers, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Porter Hall, Marjorie Main, Raymond Walburn', 'NR', 'When transplanted Texan Bob Seton arrives in Lawrence, Kansas he finds much to like about the place, especially Mary McCloud, daughter of the local banker. Politics is in the air however. It''s just prior to the civil war and there is already a sharp division in the Territory as to whether it will remain slave-free. When he gets the opportunity to run for marshal, Seton finds himself running against the respected local schoolteacher, William Cantrell. Not is what it seems however. While acting as the upstanding citizen in public, Cantrell is dangerously ambitious and is prepared to do anything to make his mark, and his fortune, on the Territory. When he loses the race for marshal, he forms a group of raiders who run guns into the territory and rob and terrorize settlers throughout the territory. Eventually donning Confederate uniforms, it is left to Seton and the good citizens of Lawrence to face Cantrell and his raiders in one final clash.', 'When transplanted Texan Bob Seton arrives in Lawrence, Kansas he finds much to like about the place, especially Mary McCloud, daughter of the local banker. Politics is in the air however. It''s just prior to the civil war and there is already a sharp division in the Territory as to whether it will remain slave-free. When he gets the opportunity to run for marshal, Seton finds himself running against the respected local schoolteacher, William Cantrell. Not is what it seems however. While acting as the upstanding citizen in public, Cantrell is dangerously ambitious and is prepared to do anything to make his mark, and his fortune, on the Territory. When he loses the race for marshal, he forms a group of raiders who run guns into the territory and rob and terrorize settlers throughout the territory. Eventually donning Confederate uniforms, it is left to Seton and the good citizens of Lawrence to face Cantrell and his raiders in one final clash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpnO4PU7Pc9ZUAfs0BM9QizA0bm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40639'),
  ('731654073489270179', 'Dark Confessions', 1998, 'Action, Drama, Horror', 'Lloyd A. Simandl, Keith Gruchala, Christopher Binney', 'David Speranza, Chris Hyde', 'Kate Rodger, Rena Riffel, Lisha Snelgrove, Kateřina Kornová, Andrew McIlroy, Richard Toth, Petra Špindlerová, Tina Wiseman', 'R', 'Two beautiful young women on vacation looking for fun. Two dirty cops looking for easy prey. One human auction where the rich, dominant and powerful bid for slaves to satisfy all sexual desires including lesbian submission. They have been located, framed and convinced to confess to a crime they did not commit or face a lifetime in a prison of women...now their innocence will be sold to the highest bidder.', 'Two beautiful young women on vacation looking for fun. Two dirty cops looking for easy prey. One human auction where the rich, dominant and powerful bid for slaves to satisfy all sexual desires including lesbian submission. They have been located, framed and convinced to confess to a crime they did not commit or face a lifetime in a prison of women...now their innocence will be sold to the highest bidder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVw318EdjspmvMHYVrXioj1kR82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201178'),
