  ('681754297657091939', 'Dark Crimes', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alexandros Avranas, Aleksander Pietrzak, Aleksander Pietrzak', 'Jeremy Brock', 'Jim Carrey, Marton Csokas, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Kati Outinen, Vlad Ivanov, Robert Więckiewicz, Agata Kulesza, Piotr Głowacki', 'R', 'Tadek, a Polish detective, becomes suspicious of a controversial author when the incidents described in his unpublished novel resemble the inner workings of an unsolved murder.', 'Tadek, a Polish detective, becomes suspicious of a controversial author when the incidents described in his unpublished novel resemble the inner workings of an unsolved murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bEwK1r4pmJ9huEjqrZf73NXJvFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340674'),
