  ('1033710785830532758', 'Dark Diamond', 2016, 'Crime, Drama', 'Tom Harari, Arthur Harari', 'Vincent Poymiro, Agnès Feuvre', 'Niels Schneider, August Diehl, Hafed Benotman, Hans Peter Cloos, Raphaële Godin, Raghunath Manet, Jos Verbist, Guillaume Verdier', null, 'Pier Ulmann lives from hand-to-mouth in Paris, between construction work and petty theft that he commits on behalf of Rachid, his only “family”. But life catches up with him the day his father is found dead in the street after a long decline. The black sheep of a rich Antwerp family who deals in diamonds, he has left his son nothing, apart from the story of his banishment from the Ulmann family and a thirst for revenge.', 'Pier Ulmann lives from hand-to-mouth in Paris, between construction work and petty theft that he commits on behalf of Rachid, his only “family”. But life catches up with him the day his father is found dead in the street after a long decline. The black sheep of a rich Antwerp family who deals in diamonds, he has left his son nothing, apart from the story of his banishment from the Ulmann family and a thirst for revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPJEpIJWbMbHVL4e9GHZdszAJjl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384212'),
  ('149159183955990436', 'Dark Distortion', 2026, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Joseph Herrera', 'Joseph Herrera', 'Jada Jay, April Hartman, Ethan Vaughan, Joe Walker, Christina Gonzalez', null, 'A group of adult models turned thieves who face unintended consequences after stealing a camcorder that houses the spirit of a murdered child.', 'A group of adult models turned thieves who face unintended consequences after stealing a camcorder that houses the spirit of a murdered child.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FpWkuNCFXgT6Q7nHdtfMKPAtmLO6.jpg', 'plex:movie:dark-distortion'),
  ('841006141357491875', 'Dark Encounter', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Carl Strathie, Bart Sienkiewicz, Thomas Bassett', 'Carl Strathie', 'Laura Fraser, Mel Raido, Sid Phoenix, Grant Masters, Spike White, Alice Lowe, Vincent Regan, Nicholas Pinnock', null, 'A year after the mysterious disappearance of an 8 year-old girl, we meet her grieving family as they return home from her memorial service in their small town. Later that evening, strange lights appear in the nearby forest and the family is exposed to an inexplicably strange phenomenon that rattles them to the core. The origin of the lights appear to be visitors from another world that seemingly terrorize the family. What they don''t realize is that these ''beings'' will lead the family to the truth behind the little girl''s disturbing disappearance.', 'A year after the mysterious disappearance of an 8 year-old girl, we meet her grieving family as they return home from her memorial service in their small town. Later that evening, strange lights appear in the nearby forest and the family is exposed to an inexplicably strange phenomenon that rattles them to the core. The origin of the lights appear to be visitors from another world that seemingly terrorize the family. What they don''t realize is that these ''beings'' will lead the family to the truth behind the little girl''s disturbing disappearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc18JXQ4yLkClFFJQUYgFahMBhZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:612515'),
