  ('903828416396006918', 'Dark Figure of Crime', 2018, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kang Dae-hui, Kim Tae-gyoon, Hwang Ki-suk', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Kim Tae-gyoon', 'Kim Yun-seok, Ju Ji-hoon, Moon Jeong-hee, Jin Sun-kyu, Jeong Jong-jun, Heo Jin, Kim Joong-ki, Kim Young-woong', null, 'A serial killer is caught for his seventh murder. A cop tries to solve the first six cases with the killer''s help, but starts to suspect that he has ulterior motives. Based on a true story.', 'A serial killer is caught for his seventh murder. A cop tries to solve the first six cases with the killer''s help, but starts to suspect that he has ulterior motives. Based on a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWislqbyIFvR02uN4n20zjDnAm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544627'),
