  ('290598481387077274', 'Dark Fortune', 2016, 'Drama', 'Stefan Haupt, Tobias Dengler', 'Stefan Haupt', 'Eleni Haupt, Noé Ricklin, Elisa Plüss, Carla Chiara Bär, Martin Hug, Peter Jecklin, Alice Flotron, Rebecca Indermaur', null, 'Late at night, the psychologist Eliane Hess is called to the hospital to take care of Yves, an eight-year-old boy, who just has lost his parents and siblings in a car accident. Eliane is both shocked and curiously drawn to the traumatized boy. As time goes by, she loses the professional distance to the patient, and when Yves'' relatives begin a heavy dispute about the boy''s future, Eliane makes an unorthodox decision, that throws her life off track.', 'Late at night, the psychologist Eliane Hess is called to the hospital to take care of Yves, an eight-year-old boy, who just has lost his parents and siblings in a car accident. Eliane is both shocked and curiously drawn to the traumatized boy. As time goes by, she loses the professional distance to the patient, and when Yves'' relatives begin a heavy dispute about the boy''s future, Eliane makes an unorthodox decision, that throws her life off track.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9BR5byI3BVASLI1GFzXTq9Lf3PM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424722'),
