  ('379644606520871422', 'Dark Horse', 1992, 'Family', 'Steve Yaconelli, David Hemmings', 'Janet MacLean', 'Ed Begley Jr., Mimi Rogers, Ari Meyers, Donovan Leitch, Samantha Eggar, BoJesse Christopher, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Tab Hunter', 'PG', '14 year old Allison has to go to a horse farm. With all the horses and the help of the owner Susan Hadley she finds new sense in her life.', '14 year old Allison has to go to a horse farm. With all the horses and the help of the owner Susan Hadley she finds new sense in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7Sk8HHxN5pJ0GTuZEPi7QJYcOg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191322'),
