  ('208761307162425244', 'Dark Matter', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Chen Shi-Zheng, Oliver Bokelberg', 'Billy Shebar', 'Liu Ye, Aidan Quinn, Meryl Streep, Chi Peng, Blair Brown, Jodi Russell, Erick Avari, Taylor Schilling', null, 'Liu Xing a brilliant Chinese student, arrives at University and makes the transition into American life with the help of Joanna Silver. Xing joins a cosmology group working to create a model of the origins of the universe. He is obsessed with the study of dark matter and a theory that conflicts with the group''s model. When he begins to make breakthroughs of his own, he encounters obstructions.', 'Liu Xing a brilliant Chinese student, arrives at University and makes the transition into American life with the help of Joanna Silver. Xing joins a cosmology group working to create a model of the origins of the universe. He is obsessed with the study of dark matter and a theory that conflicts with the group''s model. When he begins to make breakthroughs of his own, he encounters obstructions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zu5G3J4ITaGzwGu4z6FHa32XbkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18031'),
  ('62854754827074677', 'Dark Matter', 2013, 'Documentary', 'Massimo D''Anolfi, Martina Parenti, Massimo D''Anolfi', 'Martina Parenti, Massimo D''Anolfi', null, null, 'Materia oscura tells the story of a war zone in peacetime. The film location is the Salto di Quirra test range (Sardinia, Italy) where, for over fifty years, governments around the world have tested ''new weapons'' and where the Italian government has carried out controlled explosions of old weapon stocks, inexorably endangering the territory.', 'Materia oscura tells the story of a war zone in peacetime. The film location is the Salto di Quirra test range (Sardinia, Italy) where, for over fifty years, governments around the world have tested ''new weapons'' and where the Italian government has carried out controlled explosions of old weapon stocks, inexorably endangering the territory.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1iA4nD0TY0cgTSiDEz9ATHXQGp7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273313'),
  ('415018090681182762', 'Dark Mirror', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pablo Proenza, Armando Salas', 'Pablo Proenza, Matthew Reynolds', 'Lisa Vidal, David Chisum, Joshua Pelegrin, Lupe Ontiveros, Christine Lakin, David Farkas, John Newton, Jim Storm', null, 'The story about a photographer who moves her family into a home filled with mirrors which seem to reflect a different reality.', 'The story about a photographer who moves her family into a home filled with mirrors which seem to reflect a different reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ECVnTEVPI5CTWIReuyPQoMLKi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24874'),
  ('1064243731748666538', 'Dark Mission: Flowers of Evil', 1988, 'Action', 'Jesús Franco, Roger Fellous', 'Jesús Franco', 'Christopher Mitchum, Christopher Lee, Cristina Higueras, Brigitte Lahaie, Richard Harrison, Henri Lambert, Alicia Moro, Daniel Katz', null, 'An undercover CIA agent posing as a reporter travels to South America on a mission to destroy a drug cartel.', 'An undercover CIA agent posing as a reporter travels to South America on a mission to destroy a drug cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qe3fUXtFaXq2Mm0rnmz07hnZZGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28861'),
  ('392454945165567008', 'Dark Moon Rising', 2009, 'Horror', 'Dana Mennie, Mark Ream', 'Ian Cook, Dana Mennie', 'Chris Divecchio, Ginny Weirick, Max Ryan, María Conchita Alonso, Chris Mulkey, Billy Drago, Sid Haig, Lin Shaye', 'R', 'Small-town girl meets mysterious drifter boy, they fall in love. Only in this case, the boy brings with him a family curse and unimaginable horror that rains hell upon the small town', 'Small-town girl meets mysterious drifter boy, they fall in love. Only in this case, the boy brings with him a family curse and unimaginable horror that rains hell upon the small town', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7bluwqoNWyirCU7DjAgT79Q0rk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39564'),
  ('589641751142342782', 'Dark Mountain', 1944, 'Drama', 'William Berke', 'Maxwell Shane', 'Robert Lowery, Ellen Drew, Regis Toomey, Eddie Quillan, Elisha Cook Jr., Ralph Dunn, Walter Baldwin, Rose Plumer', 'NR', 'A woman doesn''t realize that the man she has just married is a gangster. When she is implicated in a murder he committed, she turns to an ex-boyfriend, who is now a park ranger, for help. He hides her out in a cabin up in the mountains, and her husband goes on the hunt for both of them.', 'A woman doesn''t realize that the man she has just married is a gangster. When she is implicated in a murder he committed, she turns to an ex-boyfriend, who is now a park ranger, for help. He hides her out in a cabin up in the mountains, and her husband goes on the hunt for both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qJf0zNfAM6NPaWuqKZZILbLMEa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103187'),
  ('353746828256428757', 'Dark Nature', 2023, 'Horror', 'Berkley Brady', 'Tim Cairo, Berkley Brady', 'Hannah Emily Anderson, Madison Walsh, Roseanne Supernault, Helen Belay, Kyra Harper, Daniel Arnold, Luke Moore, Griffin Cork', null, 'While recovering from an abusive relationship, Joy joins her friend''s therapy group on an isolated mountainous retreat. Led by a doctor with experimental methods, the group is soon forced to confront a monstrous entity.', 'While recovering from an abusive relationship, Joy joins her friend''s therapy group on an isolated mountainous retreat. Led by a doctor with experimental methods, the group is soon forced to confront a monstrous entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n77eq3pzs8sVzWUFgcreggohNZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:994138'),
  ('899393755383656870', 'Dark Night of the Scarecrow', 1981, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Frank De Felitta, Vincent A. Martinelli', null, 'Charles Durning, Larry Drake, Robert F. Lyons, Claude Earl Jones, Lane Smith, Tonya Crowe, Jocelyn Brando, Tom Taylor', 'NR', 'Bubba, an intellectually disabled man, is falsely accused of attacking a young girl. Disguised as a scarecrow, he hides in a cornfield, only to be hunted down and shot by four vigilante men. After they are acquitted due to lack of evidence, the men find themselves being stalked one by one.', 'Bubba, an intellectually disabled man, is falsely accused of attacking a young girl. Disguised as a scarecrow, he hides in a cornfield, only to be hunted down and shot by four vigilante men. After they are acquitted due to lack of evidence, the men find themselves being stalked one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pershJo6I8qqun0MEuwqmPSg9hH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30931'),
  ('389796641591071943', 'Dark Night, Calcutta', 1964, 'Drama', 'Marin Karmitz, Willy Kurant', 'Marguerite Duras', 'Maurice Garrel, Natasha Parry, Nicole Hiss', null, 'Marin Karmitz''s avant-garde short film is a haunting tale about an alcoholic novelist facing a crippling case of writer''s block.', 'Marin Karmitz''s avant-garde short film is a haunting tale about an alcoholic novelist facing a crippling case of writer''s block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iddxyFyLPkS7a9xHtSwKKxMfSPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256843'),
  ('868306574195813351', 'Dark Night, October 17, 1961', 2005, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Roger Dorieux, Alain Tasma', 'François-Olivier Rousseau, Patrick Rotman, Alain Tasma', 'Ouassini Embarek, Atmen Kelif, Abdelhafid Metalsi, Hocine Choutri, Mounir Margoum, Ahcène Nini, Jalil Naciri, Salem Kali', null, 'Parisian authorities clash with the Front de Libération Nationale (FLN) in director Alain Tasma’s recounting of one of the darkest moments of the Algerian War of Independence. As the war wound to a close and violence persisted in the streets of Paris, the FLN and its supporters adopted the tactic of murdering French policemen in hopes of forcing a withdrawal. When French law enforcement retaliated by brutalizing Algerians and imposing a strict curfew, the FLN organizes a peaceful demonstration that drew over 11,000 supporters, resulting in an order from the Paris police chief to take brutal countermeasures. Told through the eyes of both French policemen as well as Algerian protestors, Tasma’s film attempts to get to the root of the tragedy by presenting both sides of the story.', 'Parisian authorities clash with the Front de Libération Nationale (FLN) in director Alain Tasma’s recounting of one of the darkest moments of the Algerian War of Independence. As the war wound to a close and violence persisted in the streets of Paris, the FLN and its supporters adopted the tactic of murdering French policemen in hopes of forcing a withdrawal. When French law enforcement retaliated by brutalizing Algerians and imposing a strict curfew, the FLN organizes a peaceful demonstration that drew over 11,000 supporters, resulting in an order from the Paris police chief to take brutal countermeasures. Told through the eyes of both French policemen as well as Algerian protestors, Tasma’s film attempts to get to the root of the tragedy by presenting both sides of the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqnJEjIi0xxIqNLgc5jsMkxu5zY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31327'),
  ('171129203035261568', 'Dark Nuns', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Kwon Hyeok-jae, Choi Chan-min, Lee Chol-o', 'Kim Woo-jin', 'Song Hye-kyo, Jeon Yeo-been, Lee Jin-uk, Moon Woo-jin, Huh Joon-ho, Kim Guk-hee, Shin Jae-whi, Gang Dong-won', 'NR', 'Desperation drives two nuns to perform an exorcism no nun should attempt. With a possessed child at the mercy of evil and the opposition of the Catholic Church, they take on the dangerous forbidden rituals themselves, putting their immortal souls in grave danger. They must confront the terrifying cost of their sacrilegious actions, but one goal remains: the boy must be saved at all costs.', 'Desperation drives two nuns to perform an exorcism no nun should attempt. With a possessed child at the mercy of evil and the opposition of the Catholic Church, they take on the dangerous forbidden rituals themselves, putting their immortal souls in grave danger. They must confront the terrifying cost of their sacrilegious actions, but one goal remains: the boy must be saved at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Abt2GgscAGtGAXTrhH44qPhugI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1224993'),
  ('543897868209648373', 'Dark of the Sun', 1968, 'War, Adventure, Drama', 'Jack Cardiff, Edward Scaife, Ted Sturgis', 'Ranald MacDougall, Adrian Spies', 'Rod Taylor, Yvette Mimieux, Peter Carsten, Jim Brown, Kenneth More, André Morell, Olivier Despax, Guy Deghy', 'NR', 'A band of mercenaries led by Captain Curry travel through war-torn Congo across deadly terrain, battling rival armies, to steal $50 million in uncut diamonds. But infighting, sadistic rebels and a time lock jeopardize everything.', 'A band of mercenaries led by Captain Curry travel through war-torn Congo across deadly terrain, battling rival armies, to steal $50 million in uncut diamonds. But infighting, sadistic rebels and a time lock jeopardize everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yaIJyzcsbaUed9qh82gO1sZo0ko.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25553'),
  ('256751288513280129', 'Dark Paradise', 2019, 'Crime', 'Catalina Molina, Klemens Hufnagl', 'Catalina Molina, Sarah Wassermair', 'Stefanie Reinsperger, Manuel Rubey, Andrea Wenzl, Wolfgang Rauh, Ulrike Beimpold, Gerhard Greiner, Michael Menzel, Muriel Baumeister', null, 'The investigation of an escort girl found dead in a luxury hotel leads the detectives on a dangerous trail, flustering the local authorities of the wealthy town.', 'The investigation of an escort girl found dead in a luxury hotel leads the detectives on a dangerous trail, flustering the local authorities of the wealthy town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1G2j89BH7wSyEjt6Jj4koYL4yYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:655311'),
  ('995630099441098729', 'Dark Parasite', 2023, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Marco Ristori, Luca Boni, Tommaso Beneforti', 'Luca Boni, Marco Ristori', 'Michael Segal, Désirée Giorgetti, Aaron Stielstra, David White, Ottavia De Vivo, William Gambini', null, 'After a Robbery at a jewelry story, a group of robbers takes refuge with a host in a shabby apartment building in the suburbs. But they don''t know that in the basement hides an obscure alien creature with telepathic powers.', 'After a Robbery at a jewelry story, a group of robbers takes refuge with a host in a shabby apartment building in the suburbs. But they don''t know that in the basement hides an obscure alien creature with telepathic powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmfVO0q2LCsu2sTOe4KjH1aU5tG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1207413'),
  ('54052068130561552', 'Dark Passage', 1947, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Delmer Daves, Sidney Hickox, Richard Maybery', 'Delmer Daves', 'Humphrey Bogart, Lauren Bacall, Bruce Bennett, Agnes Moorehead, Tom D''Andrea, Clifton Young, Douglas Kennedy, Rory Mallinson', 'NR', 'A man convicted of murdering his wife escapes from prison and works with a woman to try and prove his innocence.', 'A man convicted of murdering his wife escapes from prison and works with a woman to try and prove his innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dvwmiD6qQ05gojrFQRaFbdhbNDF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16227'),
  ('836437649038972926', 'Dark Phoenix', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Simon Kinberg, Mauro Fiore, Josh McLaglen', 'Simon Kinberg', 'Sophie Turner, James McAvoy, Nicholas Hoult, Tye Sheridan, Michael Fassbender, Alexandra Shipp, Evan Peters, Jessica Chastain', 'PG-13', 'The X-Men face their most formidable and powerful foe when one of their own, Jean Grey, starts to spiral out of control. During a rescue mission in outer space, Jean is nearly killed when she''s hit by a mysterious cosmic force. Once she returns home, this force not only makes her infinitely more powerful, but far more unstable. The X-Men must now band together to save her soul and battle aliens that want to use Grey''s new abilities to rule the galaxy.', 'The X-Men face their most formidable and powerful foe when one of their own, Jean Grey, starts to spiral out of control. During a rescue mission in outer space, Jean is nearly killed when she''s hit by a mysterious cosmic force. Once she returns home, this force not only makes her infinitely more powerful, but far more unstable. The X-Men must now band together to save her soul and battle aliens that want to use Grey''s new abilities to rule the galaxy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCTJPelKGLhALq3r51A9uMonxKj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320288'),
  ('1096371047452323058', 'Dark Places', 1973, 'Horror', 'Don Sharp, Ernest Steward, Pamela Cornell', 'Joseph Van Winkle, Edward Brennan', 'Christopher Lee, Joan Collins, Herbert Lom, Jane Birkin, Robert Hardy, Jean Marsh, Carleton Hobbs, Roy Evans', 'PG', 'The heir of a mysterious estate must unveil its secrets and discover its treasures before a scheming doctor and his seductive sister can steal what is rightfully his.', 'The heir of a mysterious estate must unveil its secrets and discover its treasures before a scheming doctor and his seductive sister can steal what is rightfully his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdjzWGn8R2OsAyvgBM5KmqxoqFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120632'),
