  ('200656582348560155', 'Dark Places', 2026, 'Horror', 'Geno McGahee', 'Geno McGahee', 'Lindsey DeLand, Jake Tyler, Lorrie Bacon', null, 'A troubled college student, Natalie Parker, befriends the mysterious Jason Evans, only to be pulled into a world of satanic murder, family trauma, and psychological unraveling.', 'A troubled college student, Natalie Parker, befriends the mysterious Jason Evans, only to be pulled into a world of satanic murder, family trauma, and psychological unraveling.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FqoBBlfFacqXz2SHeBw3QaozrqzC.jpg', 'plex:movie:dark-places-2026'),
  ('621260027599168115', 'Dark Planet', 1997, 'Science Fiction', 'Albert Magnoli, William MacCollum, Christopher Landry', 'J. Reifel, Buzz Dixon, S.O. Lee', 'Paul Mercurio, Harley Jane Kozak, Michael York, Maria Ford, Ed O''Ross, Phil Morris, Amy Beth Cohn, Blake Boyd', null, 'Two sides, one known as the Alphas and the other the Rebels, struggle in a brutal war on Earth and in outer space. When a habitable planet is discovered in orbit around a star that is on the far side of a dangerous wormhole, the two sides mysteriously set aside their differences and send a joint mission to explore the planet. The mission of the starship Scylla is soon beset by political intrigue and treachery, jeopardizing not only the mission, but the lives of the entire crew', 'Two sides, one known as the Alphas and the other the Rebels, struggle in a brutal war on Earth and in outer space. When a habitable planet is discovered in orbit around a star that is on the far side of a dangerous wormhole, the two sides mysteriously set aside their differences and send a joint mission to explore the planet. The mission of the starship Scylla is soon beset by political intrigue and treachery, jeopardizing not only the mission, but the lives of the entire crew', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7dlcfwZGmeZ8q4TowgomgNKnxlx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58803'),
  ('866644648735394038', 'Dark Prince: The True Story of Dracula', 2000, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Joe Chappelle, Maggie Parker, Lari Maronese', 'Thomas Baum', 'Rudolf Martin, Jane March, Christopher Brand, Peter Weller, Roger Daltrey, Michael Sutton, Răzvan Vasilescu, Radu Amzulescu', null, 'Meet the man behind the legend in this true story of Vlad the Impaler, whose vicious and cruel reputation as a bloodthirsty warlord became the basis for the myth of Dracula.', 'Meet the man behind the legend in this true story of Vlad the Impaler, whose vicious and cruel reputation as a bloodthirsty warlord became the basis for the myth of Dracula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtPSncmiwK3lR9WCGKWD8PgdrNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26245'),
  ('477578452152738519', 'Dark Reel', 2008, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Josh Eisenstadt, Charles Rose', 'Aaron Pope', 'Lance Henriksen, Daniel Wisler, Edward Furlong, Tiffany Shepis, Tate Hanyok, Tracey Walter, Alexandra Holden, Rena Riffel', null, 'Murder, mystery and mayhem as B movie fan, Adam Waltz, wins Walk on Role in a film Featuring Scream Queen, Cassie Blue (Tiffany Shepis). Thinking his luck had changed for the better he steps into chaos with a killer loose and no one on the production safe.', 'Murder, mystery and mayhem as B movie fan, Adam Waltz, wins Walk on Role in a film Featuring Scream Queen, Cassie Blue (Tiffany Shepis). Thinking his luck had changed for the better he steps into chaos with a killer loose and no one on the production safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hbUBoLDTNqT4EEL8hpo2jLEQYCW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14915'),
  ('917495566358820524', 'Dark Remains', 2005, 'Horror', 'Brian Avenet-Bradley', null, 'Cheri Christian, Greg Thompson, Scott Hodges, Rachel Jordan, Michelle Kegley, Patrick G. Keenan, Rachael Rollings, Karla Droege', null, 'After their daughter is brutally murdered in their home, a grieving young couple, Allena and Julie Pkye; escape the city to find solace in the mountains. Julie photographs an abandoned prison she finds in the woods. Upon developing the prints, she becomes convinced her dead daughter is contacting her through the photographs.', 'After their daughter is brutally murdered in their home, a grieving young couple, Allena and Julie Pkye; escape the city to find solace in the mountains. Julie photographs an abandoned prison she finds in the woods. Upon developing the prints, she becomes convinced her dead daughter is contacting her through the photographs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRZSFKSzRYuxIc5D80mOTfDftSu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17482'),
  ('725211690529462', 'Dark Resurrection', 2007, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Angelo Licata', 'Angelo Licata', 'Marcella Braga, Riccardo Leto, Giuseppe Licata, Sergio Múñiz, Grazia Ogulin, Fabrizio Rizzolo, Sara Ronco, Elisa Werneck', null, 'An ancient prophesy convinces the powerful Master Sorran to commence an obsessive search for Eron, a mythical place capable of giving the Chosen One infinite knowledge.', 'An ancient prophesy convinces the powerful Master Sorran to commence an obsessive search for Eron, a mythical place capable of giving the Chosen One infinite knowledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voyuEfN4KRUF5s7pX3b1AK6Qmfc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24551'),
  ('734981661608585120', 'Dark Resurrection Volume 0', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Action', 'Riccardo Antonino, Angelo Licata', 'Fabrizio Rizzolo, Angelo Licata', 'Giuseppe Licata, Elena Cucci, Mattia Stancanelli, Fausto Brizzi, Nina Seničar, Daniel McVicar, Fabrizio Fenner, Marco Martani', null, 'Master Sorran is obsessed by his search for an ancient civilization which, according to legend, holds the secret of immortality. After many years he lights upon the wreck of the civilisation''s most powerful starship: the Resurrection. Sorran ignores the dangers and orders his crew to dock. The explorers and Sorran himself will face the mysteries of the Resurrection and the secret of the origins of the dark side.', 'Master Sorran is obsessed by his search for an ancient civilization which, according to legend, holds the secret of immortality. After many years he lights upon the wreck of the civilisation''s most powerful starship: the Resurrection. Sorran ignores the dangers and orders his crew to dock. The explorers and Sorran himself will face the mysteries of the Resurrection and the secret of the origins of the dark side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujrDzT9DYRjUUaTh71KbN6L7XBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131477'),
  ('1121798425495012160', 'Dark Ride', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Craig Singer, Rosser Goodman, Tim Brown', 'Robert Dean Klein, Craig Singer', 'Jamie-Lynn Sigler, Patrick Renna, David Clayton Rogers, Alex Solowitz, Andrea Bogart, Jennifer Tisdale, Brittney Coyle, Chelsey Coyle', 'R', 'Ten years after he brutally murdered two girls, a killer escapes from a mental institution and returns to his turf, the theme park attraction called Dark Ride. About to crash his path are a group of college kids on a road trip who stumble across the park.', 'Ten years after he brutally murdered two girls, a killer escapes from a mental institution and returns to his turf, the theme park attraction called Dark Ride. About to crash his path are a group of college kids on a road trip who stumble across the park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pQbQuJ7JBpaybG3n8pX43YvIoMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15422'),
  ('668138088253886222', 'Dark River', 2017, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Clio Barnard, Adriano Goldman', 'Clio Barnard', 'Ruth Wilson, Mark Stanley, Sean Bean, Esmé Creed-Miles, Dean Andrews, Joe Dempsie, Mike Noble, Aiden McCullough', 'NR', 'After her father dies, a young woman returns to her Yorkshire village for the first time in 15 years to claim the family farm she believes is hers.', 'After her father dies, a young woman returns to her Yorkshire village for the first time in 15 years to claim the family farm she believes is hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dAAl5Sm4XzSU5D0IozMTCliT1V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429195'),
  ('871694674728476423', 'Dark Sea', 2013, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Rodrigo Aragão, Joel Caetano, Marcelo Castanheira', 'Rodrigo Aragão', 'Marcelo Castanheira, Mayra Alarcón, Walderrama dos Santos, Kika de Oliveira, Gurcius Gewdner, Cristian Verardi, Mariana Zani, Petter Baiestorf', 'R', 'A strange black spot approaches the coast, bringing death and destruction to a fishing village. In a desperate flight to escape the chaos, lonely Albino fights for the great love of his life at the risk of his own soul.', 'A strange black spot approaches the coast, bringing death and destruction to a fishing village. In a desperate flight to escape the chaos, lonely Albino fights for the great love of his life at the risk of his own soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1g6Rqqw4681JqPPqm70JJMhgcvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:230430'),
  ('842080726793518841', 'Dark Seduction', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Walter Doehner', 'Erick Ismael Hernández', 'Elizabeth Cervantes, Julio Bekhor, Marco Antonio Treviño, Claudia Schmidt, Rocío Vázquez', null, 'Laura is a successful plastic surgeon who feels her life is somewhat empty. She meets a young nurse and falls in love and experiences sexuality to a extent not known to her. However, this spiral of desire and seduction is a dangerous game where no one is who they appear to be.', 'Laura is a successful plastic surgeon who feels her life is somewhat empty. She meets a young nurse and falls in love and experiences sexuality to a extent not known to her. However, this spiral of desire and seduction is a dangerous game where no one is who they appear to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/siRGgp01iwcQAyUrkZD4wOIDquy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113727'),
  ('338444181760452744', 'Dark Shadows', 1944, 'Crime, Drama', 'Paul Burnford, Walter Hart, Jackson Rose', 'Edward Bock, Richard H. Landau', 'Henry O''Neill, Morris Ankrum, Arthur Space, Paul Guilfoyle, Dorothy Adams, Paul Langton, William Tannen, Charles Thompson', null, 'A police psychiatrist is enlisted to catch a killer.', 'A police psychiatrist is enlisted to catch a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqyvrzWq3k9J3L84K8r308kSOwz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130884'),
  ('76737628459010946', 'Dark Shadows', 2012, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tim Burton, Bruno Delbonnel, Chris Lowe', 'Seth Grahame-Smith', 'Johnny Depp, Michelle Pfeiffer, Eva Green, Helena Bonham Carter, Chloë Grace Moretz, Bella Heathcote, Gulliver McGrath, Jackie Earle Haley', null, 'Vampire Barnabas Collins is inadvertently freed from his tomb and emerges into the very changed world of 1972. He returns to Collinwood Manor to find that his once-grand estate and family have fallen into ruin.', 'Vampire Barnabas Collins is inadvertently freed from his tomb and emerges into the very changed world of 1972. He returns to Collinwood Manor to find that his once-grand estate and family have fallen into ruin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fd9Ck4cxVlmtXsbeGtQW7WFuUFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62213'),
  ('771645804774781266', 'Dark Side of the Moon', 2002, 'Documentary', 'William Karel, Stéphane Saporito', 'William Karel', 'Philippe Faure, Christiane Kubrick, Jan Harlan, Vernon Walters, Farouk Elbaz, Jeffrey Hoffman, John F. Kennedy, Yuri Gagarin', null, 'A French documentary or, one might say more accurately, a mockumentary, by director William Karel which originally aired on Arte in 2002 with the title Opération Lune. The basic premise for the film is the theory that the television footage from the Apollo 11 Moon landing was faked and actually recorded in a studio by the CIA with help from director Stanley Kubrick.', 'A French documentary or, one might say more accurately, a mockumentary, by director William Karel which originally aired on Arte in 2002 with the title Opération Lune. The basic premise for the film is the theory that the television footage from the Apollo 11 Moon landing was faked and actually recorded in a studio by the CIA with help from director Stanley Kubrick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIPSKKCkx8XfzduPQjeYYwkWA5V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2740'),
  ('540254173550535608', 'Dark Skies', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Horror', 'Danny Giles, Adam Druxman, Kerry McCrohan', 'Scott Stewart', 'Keri Russell, Josh Hamilton, Dakota Goyo, J.K. Simmons, Trevor St. John, Annie Thurman, Myndy Crist, Josh Wingate', 'PG-13', 'From the producers of Paranormal Activity, Insidious, and Sinister comes Dark Skies: a supernatural thriller that follows a young family living in the suburbs. As husband and wife Daniel and Lacey Barret witness an escalating series of disturbing events involving their family, their safe and peaceful home quickly unravels. When it becomes clear that the Barret family is being targeted by an unimaginably terrifying and deadly force, Daniel and Lacey take matters in their own hands to solve the mystery of what is after their family.', 'From the producers of Paranormal Activity, Insidious, and Sinister comes Dark Skies: a supernatural thriller that follows a young family living in the suburbs. As husband and wife Daniel and Lacey Barret witness an escalating series of disturbing events involving their family, their safe and peaceful home quickly unravels. When it becomes clear that the Barret family is being targeted by an unimaginably terrifying and deadly force, Daniel and Lacey take matters in their own hands to solve the mystery of what is after their family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euLgEo2kvuLjYxbfOekWF3l82t6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145135'),
  ('484889386320236479', 'Dark Soul', 1962, 'Drama', 'Roberto Rossellini, Luciano Trasatti, Franco Rossellini', 'Roberto Rossellini, Alfio Valdarnini', 'Vittorio Gassman, Nadja Tiller, Annette Stroyberg, Yvonne Sanson, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Tony Brown, Rina Braido, Giuliano Cocuzzoli', null, 'A man with a past gets married and it seems that he will be able to start a new life, but an unexpected inheritance gets in the way and deteriorates the relationship with his wife.', 'A man with a past gets married and it seems that he will be able to start a new life, but an unexpected inheritance gets in the way and deteriorates the relationship with his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSYRbrpunRrssemQoa8CPqkQMW5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:225115'),
  ('346975140728589900', 'Dark Spell', 2021, 'Horror', 'Svyatoslav Podgaevsky, Anton Zenkovich', 'Nataliya Dubovaya, Ivan Kapitonov, Svyatoslav Podgaevsky', 'Yana Enzhaeva, Konstantin Beloshapka, Ilya Ermolov, Nikita Yuranov, Varvara Borodina, Sabina Akhmedova, Larysa Domaskina, Andrey Zavodyuk', null, 'Terror strikes when a heartbroken woman uses black magic to get her husband back.', 'Terror strikes when a heartbroken woman uses black magic to get her husband back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AbGdSGlU6CpiV3lswHUgE5CdAA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633802'),
  ('631475847946812264', 'Dark Star', 1974, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'John Carpenter, Douglas Knapp, J. Stein Kaplan', 'Dan O''Bannon, John Carpenter', 'Brian Narelle, Cal Kuniholm, Dan O''Bannon, Dre Pahich, Adam Beckenbaugh, Nick Castle, Joe Saunders, Cookie Knapp', 'G', 'A group of scientists are sent on a mission to destroy unstable planets. Twenty years into their mission, they have to battle their alien mascot as well as a "sensitive" and intelligent bombing device that starts to question the meaning of its existence.', 'A group of scientists are sent on a mission to destroy unstable planets. Twenty years into their mission, they have to battle their alien mascot as well as a "sensitive" and intelligent bombing device that starts to question the meaning of its existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiqLBiH0IWrog2Q78dZTT8Ad9Sp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1410'),
  ('366925665971394184', 'Dark Star: H. R. Giger''s World', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Belinda Sallin, Eric Stitzel', 'Belinda Sallin', 'H. R. Giger, Leslie Barany, Sandra Beretta, Mia Bonzanigo, Tom Gabriel Fischer, Stanislav Grof', null, 'An account of the life and work of Swiss painter, sculptor, architect and designer H. R. Giger (1940-2014), tormented father of creatures as fearsome as they are fascinating, inhabitants of nightmarish biomechanical worlds.', 'An account of the life and work of Swiss painter, sculptor, architect and designer H. R. Giger (1940-2014), tormented father of creatures as fearsome as they are fascinating, inhabitants of nightmarish biomechanical worlds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYnI4fSAzJ0PmzhRPF0XyrpVMys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295317'),
  ('162154069749875486', 'Dark Stories to Survive the Night', 2019, 'Horror', 'François Descraques, Guillaume Lubrano', null, 'Kristanna Loken, Michelle Ryan, Dominique Pinon, Scott Thrun, Tiphaine Daviot, Sébastien Lalanne, Delphine Chanéac, Slimane-Baptiste Berhoun', null, 'What if Demons, the Living Dead, Evil Dolls, Djinn and other Extra-terrestrial creatures came to haunt our apartments, houses, cafes, museums and other places of daily life? What would we do? How would we react? DARK STORIES tells five tales of gripping terror in a fantastic anthology where horror, suspense and humour intertwine with stark reality to make us shiver with fear! Join us for a Ghoul’s Feast, the Last Judgment before the impending Apocalypse, a surprise package from the deliveryman, a forensic scientist confronted by his zombie victim and the worst Moroccan monster nightmare.', 'What if Demons, the Living Dead, Evil Dolls, Djinn and other Extra-terrestrial creatures came to haunt our apartments, houses, cafes, museums and other places of daily life? What would we do? How would we react? DARK STORIES tells five tales of gripping terror in a fantastic anthology where horror, suspense and humour intertwine with stark reality to make us shiver with fear! Join us for a Ghoul’s Feast, the Last Judgment before the impending Apocalypse, a surprise package from the deliveryman, a forensic scientist confronted by his zombie victim and the worst Moroccan monster nightmare.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmzT0szsxwuL98KAYVH6EN4kJvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728797'),
  ('866065188814781350', 'Dark Storm', 2006, 'TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Jason Bourque, C. Kim Miles', 'Brett Schneider, John Cherfer, Sean Malcolm', 'Stephen Baldwin, Rob LaBelle, Gardiner Millar, Camille Sullivan, William B. Davis, Keegan Connor Tracy, Carrie Genzel, Phillip Mitchell', 'PG-13', 'On a secret military base a group of scientists have made a discovery unequaled since the invention of the A-bomb; code-named Eruptor, it''s a device that supercharges Dark Matter and uses it to change the molecular structure of its target, thereby eradicating it. But when the Eruptor malfunctions and a leading scientist on the project is blasted with Dark Matter, he receives incredible abilities', 'On a secret military base a group of scientists have made a discovery unequaled since the invention of the A-bomb; code-named Eruptor, it''s a device that supercharges Dark Matter and uses it to change the molecular structure of its target, thereby eradicating it. But when the Eruptor malfunctions and a leading scientist on the project is blasted with Dark Matter, he receives incredible abilities', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHZroeyMpXmOaIO2E0TER6rzte3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16173'),
  ('1050158124835898114', 'Dark Summer', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Paul Solet, Zoran Popović', 'Mike Le', 'Keir Gilchrist, Stella Maeve, Maestro Harrell, Gracie Gillam, Peter Stormare, Dinora Walcott', null, 'Follows the tale of a 17-year-old on house arrest for the summer. When his mother is away on business, a horrifying incident occurs, followed by an even more terrifying presence in the house.', 'Follows the tale of a 17-year-old on house arrest for the summer. When his mother is away on business, a horrifying incident occurs, followed by an even more terrifying presence in the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDyV0R7RGgpEm9AUdFbA0movkM6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306969'),
  ('186797364825373880', 'Dark Tales of Japan', 2004, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Masayuki Ochiai, Takashi Shimizu', null, 'Kayoko Shiraishi, Shozo Endo, Yoshinori Okada, Kanako Fukaura, Anri Sugihara, Yoko Maki, Miyako Yamaguchi, Shunsuke Nakamura', null, 'Dark Tales of Japan is a collection of five short horror films that are directed by five notable Japanese film directors, which are told by a mysterious old lady in kimono on a late-night bus traveling on a long isolated mountain road.', 'Dark Tales of Japan is a collection of five short horror films that are directed by five notable Japanese film directors, which are told by a mysterious old lady in kimono on a late-night bus traveling on a long isolated mountain road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fSnBWpGpb6x6S0V6wFSUeo0shA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97978'),
  ('438153114715969642', 'Dark Tide', 1994, 'Thriller', 'Luca Bercovici, Hanania Baer, Jeffrey F. January', 'Sam Bernard, Robert L. Levy', 'Chris Sarandon, Brigitte Bako, Richard Tyson, Rez Cortez, Adriana Agcaoili, Ernie Ortega, Romano Vasquez, Mel Capiz', 'R', 'Andi joins her husband Tim on a tropical island to help him with the capturing of poisonous sea snakes for their venom. Her flagrant sensuality attracts the attention of hired hand Dak, and when Tim becomes bitterly obsessed with his faltering job, Andi shares an intimate afternoon with the obsessed crewman, but then refuses to continue the affair, which leads the jilted lover to begin a series of escalating violent events.', 'Andi joins her husband Tim on a tropical island to help him with the capturing of poisonous sea snakes for their venom. Her flagrant sensuality attracts the attention of hired hand Dak, and when Tim becomes bitterly obsessed with his faltering job, Andi shares an intimate afternoon with the obsessed crewman, but then refuses to continue the affair, which leads the jilted lover to begin a series of escalating violent events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQ5f3Sl2TJOP4CO83g3v7YbBHHi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73083'),
  ('249970408670224752', 'Dark Tide', 2012, 'Thriller, Adventure, Drama', 'John Stockwell, Charlie Watson, Alison Goring', 'Ronnie Christensen, Amy Sorlie', 'Halle Berry, Olivier Martinez, Sizwe Msutu, Mark Elderkin, Thoko Ntshinga, Henrik Vos, Judith Kronenberg-Sarembock, Wayne Harrison', 'PG-13', 'A traumatized shark expert must battle her own fears to lead a thrill-seeking businessman on a dive into a dangerous section of water known as "Shark Alley."', 'A traumatized shark expert must battle her own fears to lead a thrill-seeking businessman on a dive into a dangerous section of water known as "Shark Alley."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gx56ZanaWd4pG930Z44eDLvnQ8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59963'),
  ('1068745759568802034', 'Dark Touch', 2013, 'Horror', 'Marina de Van, John Conroy', 'Marina de Van', 'Missy Keating, Marcella Plunkett, Charlotte Flyvholm, Pádraic Delaney, Art Parkinson, Anabel Sweeney, Mark Huberman, Olga Wehrly', null, 'Niamh is the lone survivor of a mysterious massacre in which the furniture and objects in her family’s isolated house took on a monstrous life of their own. The police ignore her wild stories, and the neighbours and social worker who take her into their care try to introduce her to a new life. But Niamh is unable to leave her violent past behind her, endangering everyone who crosses her path.', 'Niamh is the lone survivor of a mysterious massacre in which the furniture and objects in her family’s isolated house took on a monstrous life of their own. The police ignore her wild stories, and the neighbours and social worker who take her into their care try to introduce her to a new life. But Niamh is unable to leave her violent past behind her, endangering everyone who crosses her path.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uwcBBgIdgEYJyQYYEtbKVKUpjU1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174671'),
  ('550216508849234399', 'Dark Tower', 1987, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Dan Bradley, Federico Canudas, José María Ochoa', 'Ken Wiederhorn, Robert J. Avrech, Ken Blackwell', 'Michael Moriarty, Jenny Agutter, Carol Lynley, Theodore Bikel, Kevin McCarthy, Anne Lockhart, Patch Mackenzie, Bob Sherman', 'R', 'An architect, a security chief, a parapsychologist and an exorcist face evil in a Barcelona skyscraper.', 'An architect, a security chief, a parapsychologist and an exorcist face evil in a Barcelona skyscraper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nZcDsJFerQg604nydPPpHpRGV9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106280'),
  ('846117248057470185', 'Dark Universe', 1993, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Steve Latshaw, Maxwell J. Beck, Grant Austin Waldman', 'Patrick Moran', 'Blake Pickett, Joe Estevez, Laurie Sherman, Bently Tittle, John Maynard, Paul Austin Sanders, Patrick Moran, Tom Ferguson', null, 'On its way back to Earth, the space shuttle Nautilus passes through a cloud of alien spores causing its sole occupant, astronaut Steve Thomas to transform into a blood-thirsty monster. The shuttle crashes into a swampy region of central Florida, creating a situation which threatens contagion and/or death to all who encounter the shuttle or its mutated pilot.', 'On its way back to Earth, the space shuttle Nautilus passes through a cloud of alien spores causing its sole occupant, astronaut Steve Thomas to transform into a blood-thirsty monster. The shuttle crashes into a swampy region of central Florida, creating a situation which threatens contagion and/or death to all who encounter the shuttle or its mutated pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qsVmZmAWPiJAb6D6CkV3pV5vxYQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27892'),
  ('547014960844636756', 'Dark Victory', 1939, 'Drama, Romance', 'Edmund Goulding, Ernest Haller, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Casey Robinson', 'Bette Davis, George Brent, Humphrey Bogart, Geraldine Fitzgerald, Ronald Reagan, Henry Travers, Cora Witherspoon, Dorothy Peterson', 'NR', 'Socialite Judith Traherne lives a lavish but emotionally empty life. Riding horses is one of her few joys, and her stable master is secretly in love with her. Told she has a brain tumor by her doctor, Frederick Steele, Judith becomes distraught. After she decides to have surgery to remove the tumor, Judith realizes she is in love with Dr. Steele, but more troubling medical news may sabotage her new relationship, and her second chance at life.', 'Socialite Judith Traherne lives a lavish but emotionally empty life. Riding horses is one of her few joys, and her stable master is secretly in love with her. Told she has a brain tumor by her doctor, Frederick Steele, Judith becomes distraught. After she decides to have surgery to remove the tumor, Judith realizes she is in love with Dr. Steele, but more troubling medical news may sabotage her new relationship, and her second chance at life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbbzkhKJAxaA6lpHbcJqQIBaI1d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27972'),
  ('233981172164185105', 'Dark Was the Night', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ryan Samul, James Straus, Jack Heller', 'Tyler Hisel', 'Kevin Durand, Lukas Haas, Bianca Kajlich, Ethan Khusidman, Nick Damici, Sabina Gadecki, Heath Freeman, Steve Agee', null, 'An evil is unleashed in a small town when a logging company sets up shop in the neighboring woods. Isolated and threatened, a mysterious force hidden within the trees outside the small town of Maiden Woods, strikes fear in the townspeople as Sheriff Paul Shields attempts to overcome the demons of his past while protecting those that he loves.', 'An evil is unleashed in a small town when a logging company sets up shop in the neighboring woods. Isolated and threatened, a mysterious force hidden within the trees outside the small town of Maiden Woods, strikes fear in the townspeople as Sheriff Paul Shields attempts to overcome the demons of his past while protecting those that he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSC7sWXbafOCa24itOHTpKXwOAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300467'),
  ('958883351905756066', 'Dark Water', 2002, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hideo Nakata, Junichiro Hayashi, Masaki Adachi', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Kenichi Suzuki, Takashige Ichise', 'Hitomi Kuroki, Rio Kanno, Mirei Oguchi, Asami Mizukawa, Fumiyo Kohinata, Yuu Tokui, Isao Yatsu, Shigemitsu Ogi', null, 'A woman in the midst of an unpleasant divorce moves to an eerie apartment building with her young daughter. The ceiling of their apartment has a dark and active leak.', 'A woman in the midst of an unpleasant divorce moves to an eerie apartment building with her young daughter. The ceiling of their apartment has a dark and active leak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSq6J55RFLfwcceDKxYtMjOr1sz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12205'),
  ('970538742639527554', 'Dark Water', 2005, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Walter Salles, Affonso Beato, J. Ryan Halpenny', 'Rafael Yglesias', 'Jennifer Connelly, John C. Reilly, Tim Roth, Dougray Scott, Pete Postlethwaite, Ariel Gade, Camryn Manheim, Perla Haney-Jardine', 'PG-13', 'Dahlia and her five-year-old daughter are ready to begin a new life together. But their new apartment — dilapidated and worn — suddenly seems to take on a life of its own. Mysterious noises, persistent leaks of dark water and other strange happenings send Dahlia on a haunting and mystifying pursuit — one that unleashes a torrent of living nightmares.', 'Dahlia and her five-year-old daughter are ready to begin a new life together. But their new apartment — dilapidated and worn — suddenly seems to take on a life of its own. Mysterious noises, persistent leaks of dark water and other strange happenings send Dahlia on a haunting and mystifying pursuit — one that unleashes a torrent of living nightmares.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cm4M9xaBu78IjuAVNG4LCXdXsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9009'),
  ('493591357729094420', 'Dark Waters', 1944, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'André de Toth, Joseph Depew, Archie Stout', 'Joan Harrison, Marian B. Cockrell', 'Merle Oberon, Franchot Tone, Thomas Mitchell, Fay Bainter, Elisha Cook Jr., John Qualen, Rex Ingram, Nina Mae McKinney', 'NR', 'Leslie Calvin, the sole survivor of a submarine accident, goes to her relatives in order to recover emotionally. Unfortunately, she encounters various scam artists led by Mr. Sydney who intend to kill her and steal the family assets. Dr. George Grover helps Leslie to defeat Sydney.', 'Leslie Calvin, the sole survivor of a submarine accident, goes to her relatives in order to recover emotionally. Unfortunately, she encounters various scam artists led by Mr. Sydney who intend to kill her and steal the family assets. Dr. George Grover helps Leslie to defeat Sydney.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZm932Mo56dT1GLJUWIGptYB700.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36332'),
  ('549373219035381023', 'Dark Waters', 1993, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Mariano Baino, Alex Howe, Ekatarina Kondrateva', 'Mariano Baino, Andy Bark', 'Louise Salter, Venera Simmons, Mariya Kapnist, Valeriy Bassel, Lubov Snegur, Albina Skarga, Pavel Sokolov, Anna Rose Phipps', 'NR', 'After the death of her father, a young woman travels to a remote convent on an island in the Black Sea to find out why her father funded it for years.', 'After the death of her father, a young woman travels to a remote convent on an island in the Black Sea to find out why her father funded it for years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDcyo7b0XniwJlgGESKiqZ7xNFe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65899'),
  ('897770630819793997', 'Dark Waters', 2003, 'Horror, Action, Adventure, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Phillip J. Roth, Todd Barron', 'Brett Orr, Phillip J. Roth', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Simmone Mackinnon, Jeffrey Gorman, Bruce Gray, Ross Manarchy, Stefan Lysenko, Robert Zachar, Rodrigo Abed', null, 'Unusually vicious and aggressive sharks attack an oil rig in the middle of the Gulf of Mexico. Dane Quatrell and a team are sent to investigate, but the sharks are still on the prowl and now they have developed a taste for blood.', 'Unusually vicious and aggressive sharks attack an oil rig in the middle of the Gulf of Mexico. Dane Quatrell and a team are sent to investigate, but the sharks are still on the prowl and now they have developed a taste for blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOfW9J3GP6fVpBPYIjVXXRZbOd8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110545'),
  ('771881784226466899', 'Dark Waters', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Sarah Young, Danny Brown, Jeffrey Lazar', 'Mario Correa, Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Mark Ruffalo, Anne Hathaway, Tim Robbins, Bill Pullman, Bill Camp, Victor Garber, Mare Winningham, William Jackson Harper', 'PG-13', 'A tenacious attorney uncovers a dark secret that connects a growing number of unexplained deaths to one of the world''s largest corporations. In the process, he risks everything — his future, his family, and his own life — to expose the truth.', 'A tenacious attorney uncovers a dark secret that connects a growing number of unexplained deaths to one of the world''s largest corporations. In the process, he risks everything — his future, his family, and his own life — to expose the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzvzaHqKBSuGIIWhinTQPHvT0zf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552178'),
  ('428124754241901296', 'Dark Web: Cicada 3301', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Comedy', 'Stephanie Gorin, Michael Galbraith, Alan Ritchson', 'Joshua Montcalm, Alan Ritchson', 'Jack Kesy, Conor Leslie, Ron Funches, Alan Ritchson, Andreas Apergis, Kristen Holden-Ried, Jess Salgueiro, Patrick Garrow', 'R', 'Genius hacker Connor discovers Cicada 3301, an online treasure hunt that could be a recruiting tool for a secret society. Soon Conner, art-expert friend Avi, and secretive librarian Gwen are dashing from graffiti sites to ancient libraries to uncover real-world clues. But they must outrun aggressive NSA agents, also hot on the trail of Cicada, who want the glory for themselves.', 'Genius hacker Connor discovers Cicada 3301, an online treasure hunt that could be a recruiting tool for a secret society. Soon Conner, art-expert friend Avi, and secretive librarian Gwen are dashing from graffiti sites to ancient libraries to uncover real-world clues. But they must outrun aggressive NSA agents, also hot on the trail of Cicada, who want the glory for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJlLfuvIBBn5aFoyW1IQWeFHl6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791469'),
  ('663502915493884918', 'Dark Wind', 2017, 'Drama', 'Nila Madhab Panda, Ramanuj Dutta, Shubhi Aggarwal', 'Nitin Dixit', 'Sanjay Mishra, Ranvir Shorey, Bhupesh Singh, Tillotama Shome, Ekta Sawant, Harish Chhabra, Ram Naresh Diwakar, Vipin Katyal', null, 'In a village affected by climate change and scanty rainfall, a blind farmer strikes a deal with the debt recovery agent to save his son from a debt trap.', 'In a village affected by climate change and scanty rainfall, a blind farmer strikes a deal with the debt recovery agent to save his son from a debt trap.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mNDJDdkGCq9UJXGuyOFzeYkNoDk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:488445'),
  ('588753785954925343', 'Dark Windows', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Alex Herron, Jens Ramborg', 'Ulvrik Kraft', 'Rory Alexander, Vanessa Borgli, Anna Bullard, Annie Hamilton, Rachel Fowler, Morten Holst, Grace Binford Sheene, Jóel Sæmundsson', null, 'A group of teenagers grieving the death of their friend takes a trip to an isolated summerhouse in the countryside. What starts as a peaceful getaway turns into a horrific nightmare when a masked man begins to terrorize them in the most gruesome ways.', 'A group of teenagers grieving the death of their friend takes a trip to an isolated summerhouse in the countryside. What starts as a peaceful getaway turns into a horrific nightmare when a masked man begins to terrorize them in the most gruesome ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hANd38mgGlOzA3lt12vfXMZbj90.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1089228'),
  ('295136813253615004', 'Dark Wolf', 2003, 'Horror', 'Stuart Asbjornsen, Richard Friedman', 'Geoffrey Alan Holliday', 'Samaire Armstrong, Ryan Alosio, Andrea Bogart, Jaime Bergman, Alexis Cruz, Sasha Williams, Tippi Hedren, Kane Hodder', null, 'A vicious werewolf stalks the streets of Los Angeles. Between killings, its desperate goal is to mate with unsuspecting Josie, who is unaware of her special power attracting the beast. Forced to take over an investigation involving werewolves after his partner is killed, an LAPD Detective is led to the trail of this ravenously deadly hybrid werewolf.', 'A vicious werewolf stalks the streets of Los Angeles. Between killings, its desperate goal is to mate with unsuspecting Josie, who is unaware of her special power attracting the beast. Forced to take over an investigation involving werewolves after his partner is killed, an LAPD Detective is led to the trail of this ravenously deadly hybrid werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQa7vz4kgeipVsDuajjTxLELGas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4368'),
  ('937516444633659251', 'Dark Woods', 2003, 'Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Pål Øie, Tore Vollan, Sjur Aarthun', 'Christopher Grøndahl, Pål Øie', 'Bjørn Floberg, Kristoffer Joner, Eva Röse, Sampda Sharma, Marko Iversen Kanic, Simon Norrthon, Ivar Nørve, Torstein Løning', null, 'Five Norwegians head for a cabin in the wilderness for a few days of teambuilding. But strange things start happening — especially down by the water where they find an abandoned tent. Is there someone else?', 'Five Norwegians head for a cabin in the wilderness for a few days of teambuilding. But strange things start happening — especially down by the water where they find an abandoned tent. Is there someone else?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RN1dL0P8Gb6Jv9zL1WB4AkAsoe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41070'),
  ('1068805591874075363', 'Dark Woods II', 2015, 'Horror', 'Zsolt Szabo, Krisztina Barkóczy, Veronika László', 'Pål Øie, Kjersti Helen Rasmussen', 'Ellen Dorrit Petersen, Anders Baasmo Christiansen, Tomas Norström, Baard Owe, Mads Sjøgård Pettersen, Renate Reinsve, Éva Magyar, Torstein Løning', null, 'An old sanatorium is deteriorating in an isolated forest in the mountains. Five contract workers have taken on the task of tracking the huge building for hazardous waste before it''s demolished. They realize that the job is more than a search for asbestos and mercury when they encounter the building''s frightening past. You can demolish a building, but never remove the past.', 'An old sanatorium is deteriorating in an isolated forest in the mountains. Five contract workers have taken on the task of tracking the huge building for hazardous waste before it''s demolished. They realize that the job is more than a search for asbestos and mercury when they encounter the building''s frightening past. You can demolish a building, but never remove the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlFDrOk3Zpo9rDVhrBBbnfuFAJ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336884'),
  ('447209560257569243', 'Dark World', 2010, 'Fantasy, Mystery, Thriller', 'Anton Megerdichev, Aleksey Samodelko, Natalya Troitskaya', 'Alexey Sidorov, Aleksand Dorbinian', 'Svetlana Ivanova, Ivan Zhidkov, Elena Panova, Ilya Alekseev, Sergey Ugryumov, Mariya Kozhevnikova, Tatyana Kuznetsova, Vladimir Nosik', null, 'On a college trip to remote Northern forests, one of the students - Marina - encounters a burial site of an ancient witch, and is possessed by the spirits of the past. Now Marina and her companions must take part in the millennia old fight between good and evil, involving lake witches, sorcerers, and ancient forces from the myths.', 'On a college trip to remote Northern forests, one of the students - Marina - encounters a burial site of an ancient witch, and is possessed by the spirits of the past. Now Marina and her companions must take part in the millennia old fight between good and evil, involving lake witches, sorcerers, and ancient forces from the myths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGQ7SEhsM9DQ4uk6gUr1JgVWqkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51273'),
