  ('893869239452448627', 'Darker Shades of Summer', 2023, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Hyago Rodriguez, Ntiarna Xavier Knight, Becca Hirani', 'Scott Chambers, Craig McLearie', 'Danielle Scott, Mark Sears, Stephen Staley, May Kelly, Chrissie Wunna, Mark Haldor, Natasha Tosini, Eva Ray', 'NR', 'At a swingers retreat, a couple will undergo the ultimate test in the tense erotic thriller.', 'At a swingers retreat, a couple will undergo the ultimate test in the tense erotic thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s50eC3y60cEqQ7nS9UWWsvonr4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:981344'),
  ('299958108482031493', 'Darker Than Amber', 1970, 'Mystery, Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Robert Clouse, Frank V. Phillips', 'Ed Waters', 'Rod Taylor, Theodore Bikel, Suzy Kendall, Ahna Capri, William Smith, Janet MacLachlan, Robert Phillips, Jane Russell', 'PG', 'Professional beach bum and ''knight errant'' Travis McGee goes up against psychotic body-builder Terry Bartell. McGee pulls out all the stops when he joins a Caribbean cruise to bring the killer to justice.', 'Professional beach bum and ''knight errant'' Travis McGee goes up against psychotic body-builder Terry Bartell. McGee pulls out all the stops when he joins a Caribbean cruise to bring the killer to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz0rcv7G8RW6AgC5JetEjUx2879.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66466'),
  ('546319158502265640', 'Darker Than Black: Gaiden (OVA)', 2010, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', null, 'Shoutarou Suga, Takehiko Tamura, Yūsuke Sekitani', null, null, 'Tells the story of what happened to Yin and Hei between the first and second instalments.', 'Tells the story of what happened to Yin and Hei between the first and second instalments.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dYka4kdlDm6NIXrssJuU7qkYFc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1012835'),
  ('996803473051372857', 'Darker Than Midnight', 2014, 'Drama', 'Piero Basso, Levi Riso', 'Levi Riso', 'Davide Capone, Vincenzo Amato, Micaela Ramazzotti, Pippo Delbono, Fabio Grossi, Lucia Sardo, Manuela Lo Sicco', null, 'Davide is different from the other teenagers. Something makes him look like a girl. Davide is fourteen when he runs away from home. His intuition leads him to choose Villa Bellini, a park in Catania, as a refuge. The park is a world in itself, a world of the marginalized, to which the rest of the city turns a blind eye. But one day the past catches up and Davide has to face the most difficult choice, this time alone.', 'Davide is different from the other teenagers. Something makes him look like a girl. Davide is fourteen when he runs away from home. His intuition leads him to choose Villa Bellini, a park in Catania, as a refuge. The park is a world in itself, a world of the marginalized, to which the rest of the city turns a blind eye. But one day the past catches up and Davide has to face the most difficult choice, this time alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zkyp4VHMzjHxKc4OvzieSiRk9WE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269997'),
  ('428747805810567450', 'Darker Than Night', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Henry Bedwell, Marc Bellver', 'Henry Bedwell', 'Zuria Vega, Adriana Louvier, Eréndira Ibarra, Ona Casamiquela, Margarita Sanz, José María Torre, Lucía Guilmáin, Miguel Rodarte', null, 'When four women move into an old house left by one woman''s aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.', 'When four women move into an old house left by one woman''s aunt, strange things begin to happen. Bizarre voices, visions of ghosts, and mysterious noises lead them to discover the darkest powers of evil and a horror and agony beyond terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la4Rq013z1UPnX5WNR14LAhzvsT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267268'),
  ('885619071932859606', 'Darkest Hour', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Sarah Mooney, Tom Edmondson, Thomas Napper', 'Anthony McCarten', 'Gary Oldman, Stephen Dillane, Lily James, Ronald Pickup, Ben Mendelsohn, Kristin Scott Thomas, Nicholas Jones, Samuel West', 'PG-13', 'In May 1940, the fate of World War II hangs on Winston Churchill, who must decide whether to negotiate with Adolf Hitler or fight on knowing that it could mean the end of the British Empire.', 'In May 1940, the fate of World War II hangs on Winston Churchill, who must decide whether to negotiate with Adolf Hitler or fight on knowing that it could mean the end of the British Empire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xa6G3aKlysQeVg9wOb0dRcIGlWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399404'),
  ('80428952477703422', 'DarkGame', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Howard J. Ford, Louie Blystad-Collins', 'Gary Grant, Niall Johnson, Tom George', 'Ed Westwick, Andrew P. Stephen, Natalya Tsvetkova, Lola Wayne, Rory Alexander, Andrew McGillan, Miztli Rose, Rick Yale', null, 'A determined detective is in a race against time to stop a twisted game show on the dark web, where captives are forced to compete for their lives.', 'A determined detective is in a race against time to stop a twisted game show on the dark web, where captives are forced to compete for their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaARRhlsuJGnpOGeDmIhraxmOxi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160923'),
  ('639854732575125770', 'Darkland', 2017, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Fenar Ahmad, Kasper Tuxen, Kerren Lumer-Klabbers', 'Fenar Ahmad, Adam August', 'Dar Salim, Stine Fischer Christensen, Dulfi Al-Jabouri, Ali Sivandi, Jacob Lohmann, Roland Møller, B. Branco, Anis Al Oubaidi', null, 'Zaid is a successful heart surgeon with an expensive apartment and pregnant girlfriend. One night he gets a visit from his brother Yasin, who is desperate for money, but he refuses. Soon after, Yasin is found beaten to death and Zaid is overcome with guilt. As guilt gives way to anger, Zaid becomes a masked avenger and takes on Copenhagen''s criminal underworld in his quest for justice.', 'Zaid is a successful heart surgeon with an expensive apartment and pregnant girlfriend. One night he gets a visit from his brother Yasin, who is desperate for money, but he refuses. Soon after, Yasin is found beaten to death and Zaid is overcome with guilt. As guilt gives way to anger, Zaid becomes a masked avenger and takes on Copenhagen''s criminal underworld in his quest for justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn7d8LvRuLID5DIQL3EwO28BjMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425298'),
  ('44828376146335564', 'Darkland: The Return', 2023, 'Thriller, Action', 'Fenar Ahmad, Peter Holm Riis, Behrouz Bigdeli', 'Fenar Ahmad, Behrouz Bigdeli', 'Dar Salim, Birgitte Hjort Sørensen, Stine Fischer Christensen, Henrik Vestergård, Soheil Bavi, Mohamed Djeziri, Abud Mustafa, Asgar Hansen', null, 'Seven years ago, Zaid went to war against the Copenhagen underworld to avenge his dead brother. His identity as a respected doctor of cardiology and life as a family man is but a fading dream, and in prison Zaid suffers the loss of his son Noah, whom he barely knows. When a police agent approaches Zaid and offers him a deal to be released in exchange for infiltrating the Copenhagen underworld, he sees his chance to reclaim the remnants of the family life he left behind. But everything has a price, and Zaid realizes that he has now seriously endangered his son''s life. After all, once you become part of the underworld, is there any way out?', 'Seven years ago, Zaid went to war against the Copenhagen underworld to avenge his dead brother. His identity as a respected doctor of cardiology and life as a family man is but a fading dream, and in prison Zaid suffers the loss of his son Noah, whom he barely knows. When a police agent approaches Zaid and offers him a deal to be released in exchange for infiltrating the Copenhagen underworld, he sees his chance to reclaim the remnants of the family life he left behind. But everything has a price, and Zaid realizes that he has now seriously endangered his son''s life. After all, once you become part of the underworld, is there any way out?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8B4DsVcFVDLVmbpHMHU3RjLNAV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1085218'),
  ('646487509225425100', 'Darklands', 1996, 'Horror', 'Julian Richards, Zoran Đorđević', 'Julian Richards', 'Craig Fairbrass, Jon Finch, Rowena King, Roger Nott, Hubert Rees, Dave Duffy, Ray Gravell, Richard Lynch', null, 'A reporter investigates ritual profanations and finds himself involved with a Druidic cult.', 'A reporter investigates ritual profanations and finds himself involved with a Druidic cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WZoyogPKPcz920wMtcWY0J9udV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73316'),
  ('632239310694837964', 'Darklight', 2004, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Bill Platt, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Bill Platt, Chris Regina', 'Shiri Appleby, Richard Burgi, John de Lancie, David Hewlett, Ross Manarchy, Darin Angelov, Harry Anichkin, Katie Atcheson', null, 'Captured by a secret society known as the Faith and mentally controlled with a powerful spell, ancient demoness Lilith now lives as a young woman with no memory of her agless past. However, the terrifying plague unleashed by a rampaging monster, the Demonicos, forces one human to recruit her mystical power known as the Darklight to fight this terrifying beast...', 'Captured by a secret society known as the Faith and mentally controlled with a powerful spell, ancient demoness Lilith now lives as a young woman with no memory of her agless past. However, the terrifying plague unleashed by a rampaging monster, the Demonicos, forces one human to recruit her mystical power known as the Darklight to fight this terrifying beast...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eG7IlRQyqsE6GAYFVuW6rjlwQlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22080'),
  ('206985506212728330', 'Darkling', 2022, 'Drama, War, Horror', 'Dušan Milić', 'Dušan Milić', 'Miona Ilov, Danica Ćurčić, Flavio Parenti, Slavko Štimac, Nikola Rakočević, Slaviša Čurović, Nikola ''Kole'' Angelovski, Slađana Bukejlović', null, 'In NATO-occupied Kosovo, a little girl writes an essay for the United Nations about her father who has gone missing. Meanwhile, the girl''s grandfather becomes increasingly paranoid of the unseen threats that lurk in the dark.', 'In NATO-occupied Kosovo, a little girl writes an essay for the United Nations about her father who has gone missing. Meanwhile, the girl''s grandfather becomes increasingly paranoid of the unseen threats that lurk in the dark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHIqBn17r4JKG8DXcZUISES0jTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734081'),
  ('710751108590523833', 'Darkman', 1990, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Bill Pope, Sam Raimi, Michael Paul Clausen', 'Chuck Pfarrer, Sam Raimi, Ivan Raimi', 'Liam Neeson, Frances McDormand, Colin Friels, Larry Drake, Nelson Mashita, Jessie Lawrence Ferguson, Rafael H. Robledo, Dan Hicks', 'R', 'Dr. Peyton Westlake is on the verge of realizing a major breakthrough in synthetic skin when his laboratory is destroyed by gangsters. Having been burned beyond recognition and forever altered by an experimental medical procedure, Westlake becomes known as Darkman, assuming alternate identities in his quest for revenge and a new life with a former love.', 'Dr. Peyton Westlake is on the verge of realizing a major breakthrough in synthetic skin when his laboratory is destroyed by gangsters. Having been burned beyond recognition and forever altered by an experimental medical procedure, Westlake becomes known as Darkman, assuming alternate identities in his quest for revenge and a new life with a former love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9fxGRzlINIvfPFhizMgbQaDDrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9556'),
  ('116141703020151262', 'Darkman II: The Return of Durant', 1995, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Bradford May, Bradford May, David Vaughan', null, 'Larry Drake, Arnold Vosloo, Kim Delaney, Renée O''Connor, Lawrence Dane, Jesse Collins, David Ferry, Rod Wilson', 'R', 'Darkman and Durant return and they hate each other as much as ever. This time, Durant has plans to take over the city''s drug trade using high-tech weaponry. Darkman must step in and try to stop Durant once and for all.', 'Darkman and Durant return and they hate each other as much as ever. This time, Durant has plans to take over the city''s drug trade using high-tech weaponry. Darkman must step in and try to stop Durant once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEQ6FWjvDnIl6sK88LCDcTwwjWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18998'),
  ('1055941089421864247', 'Darkman III: Die Darkman Die', 1996, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Bradford May, Bradford May, Roman Buchok', 'Michael Colleary, Mike Werb', 'Jeff Fahey, Arnold Vosloo, Darlanne Fluegel, Roxann Dawson, Nigel Bennett, Alicia Panetta, Ronn Sarosiak, Peter Graham', 'R', 'Darkman, needing money to continue his experiments on synthetic skin, steals a crate of cash from drug lord Peter Rooker...', 'Darkman, needing money to continue his experiments on synthetic skin, steals a crate of cash from drug lord Peter Rooker...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hURMKPp4FRlmbafRlo2iejquT0o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19002'),
  ('830907111796758328', 'Darkness', 1993, 'Horror, Action', 'Leif Jonker', 'Leif Jonker', 'Gary Miller, Michael Gisick, Randall Aviks, Cena Donham, Lisa Franz, Bill Hooper, Veronica Page Dennen, Jake Euker', 'NR', 'A small community is besieged by vampires. After he watches friends ravaged in a convenience store, a lone avenger goes off to do battle with the undead, armed with shotgun, chainsaw, and Holy water. Later he finds other survivors and they try to stay alive long enough to do battle with Liven, king of the vampires.', 'A small community is besieged by vampires. After he watches friends ravaged in a convenience store, a lone avenger goes off to do battle with the undead, armed with shotgun, chainsaw, and Holy water. Later he finds other survivors and they try to stay alive long enough to do battle with Liven, king of the vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwPI0obIxAbF35vUW9ouqtCBsI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89319'),
  ('348413432241383033', 'Darkness', 2002, 'Horror', 'Jaume Balagueró, Xavi Giménez, Anna Rua', 'Jaume Balagueró, Fernando de Felipe', 'Anna Paquin, Lena Olin, Iain Glen, Giancarlo Giannini, Fele Martínez, Fermí Reixach, Stephan Enquist, Francesc Pagès', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl moves into a remote country home with her family, only to discover that the gloomy old house has a horrifying past that threatens to destroy them.', 'A teenage girl moves into a remote country home with her family, only to discover that the gloomy old house has a horrifying past that threatens to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e7Y1syIbxcG5Xb2tByPOIz2NhZL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11056'),
  ('424718391758944851', 'Darkness', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Emanuela Rossi, Marco Graziaplena, Patricia Stocchi', 'Emanuela Rossi, Claudio Corbucci', 'Denise Tantucci, Valerio Binasco, Gaia Bocci, Olimpia Tosatto, Elettra Dallimore-Mallaby, Francesco Genovese, Rebecca Caria, Giulia Falsone', null, 'Three sisters, Stella, Luce and Aria, live in an isolated house, immersed in the shadows, submitted by a violent and authoritarian father, a religious fanatic obsessed with the end of the world, who keeps them prisoners behind locks and closed windows, under the pretext that the Apocalypse has finally arrived.', 'Three sisters, Stella, Luce and Aria, live in an isolated house, immersed in the shadows, submitted by a violent and authoritarian father, a religious fanatic obsessed with the end of the world, who keeps them prisoners behind locks and closed windows, under the pretext that the Apocalypse has finally arrived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2D3QGeKx1VBEQeN9OGYrheuytoO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641849'),
  ('487066448413372222', 'Darkness Falls', 2003, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Dan Laustsen, Jonathan Liebesman, Martin Turner', 'James Vanderbilt, John Fasano, Joe Harris', 'Chaney Kley, Emma Caulfield, Lee Cormie, Sullivan Stapleton, Emily Browning, Angus Sampson, Grant Piro, Steve Mouzakis', 'PG-13', 'A vengeful spirit has taken the form of the Tooth Fairy to exact vengeance on the town that lynched her 150 years earlier. Her only opposition is the only child, now grown up, who has survived her before.', 'A vengeful spirit has taken the form of the Tooth Fairy to exact vengeance on the town that lynched her 150 years earlier. Her only opposition is the only child, now grown up, who has survived her before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoceKsM15yL5Tmyuhkdl7vM5Vi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10727'),
  ('945230525652974158', 'Darkness Falls', 2020, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Shan Liljestrand, Julien Seri, Jessica Sherman', 'Giles Daoust', 'Shawn Ashmore, Lin Shaye, Gary Cole, Vahina Giocante, Sonya Walger, Stefania Spampinato, Daniella Alonso, Richard Harmon', null, 'After his wife''s suicide, Detective Jeff Anderson becomes convinced that she has been murdered. Obsessed with his investigation, he finds out that his wife was the victim of a team of father-and-son serial killers and sets out to stop them.', 'After his wife''s suicide, Detective Jeff Anderson becomes convinced that she has been murdered. Obsessed with his investigation, he finds out that his wife was the victim of a team of father-and-son serial killers and sets out to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lSLYhJkB7ziS0FbQJXW1AFgWtZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534928'),
  ('510042306803518458', 'Darkness of Man', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'James Cullen Bressack, Pascal Combes-Knoke', 'James Cullen Bressack, Alethea Hnatko-Cho', 'Jean-Claude Van Damme, Emerson Min, Kristanna Loken, Peter Jae, Sticky Fingaz, Spencer Breslin, Andrey Ivchenko, Zack Ward', 'R', 'Russell Hatch, an Interpol operative who takes on the role of father figure to Jayden, the son of an informant killed in a routine raid gone wrong. Years later, Hatch finds himself protecting Jayden and his grandfather from a group of merciless gangs in an all-out turf war, stopping at nothing to protect Jayden and fight anyone getting in his way.', 'Russell Hatch, an Interpol operative who takes on the role of father figure to Jayden, the son of an informant killed in a routine raid gone wrong. Years later, Hatch finds himself protecting Jayden and his grandfather from a group of merciless gangs in an all-out turf war, stopping at nothing to protect Jayden and fight anyone getting in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zxsN56sUWKMSguTvKYoWps63jI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1049574'),
  ('770390562532298508', 'Darkness Rising', 2017, 'Horror', 'Adam Biggs, Evan L. Robichaud, Allan Aguilar', 'Vikram Weet', 'Tara Holt, Bryce Johnson, Katrina Law, Christian Ganiere, Heather Mazur, Myk Watford, Ted Raimi, Daisy Sklar', null, 'Nearly murdered as a child by her mother, a woman (Katrina Law) returns to the house where her mom went mad.', 'Nearly murdered as a child by her mother, a woman (Katrina Law) returns to the house where her mom went mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jPUJ0kRIVDiY9E10r9AEcqKtqmC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459068'),
  ('909692512168720870', 'Darkness, Light, Darkness', 1990, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jan Švankmajer, Miloslav Špála', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'A human body gradually reconstructs itself as its various component parts crowd themselves into a small room and eventually, after much experimentation, sort out which part goes where.', 'A human body gradually reconstructs itself as its various component parts crowd themselves into a small room and eventually, after much experimentation, sort out which part goes where.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aa9vuydxlhKIN0bUFifFwwYsw5c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56619'),
  ('477501073275933241', 'Darkroom', 1989, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John Keefer, David A. Makin, Ian McVey', null, 'Aarin Teich, Jill Pierce, Jeff Arbaugh, Sara Lee Wade, Allen Lieberman, Elizabeth Ince, Shannon Absher, Michael Halpin', null, 'Janet has just returned home from college to visit her conservative family at their remote farmhouse, nestled deep in the countryside. What should be a happy reunion is quickly disrupted by the arrival of an unexpected guest: a mystery killer who photographs their unsuspecting victims before murdering them in a variety of brutal ways. As her family and friends are picked off one by one, Janet is forced to fend off the mysterious maniac, all the while uncovering unsettling secrets surrounding her family’s violent and perverse past…', 'Janet has just returned home from college to visit her conservative family at their remote farmhouse, nestled deep in the countryside. What should be a happy reunion is quickly disrupted by the arrival of an unexpected guest: a mystery killer who photographs their unsuspecting victims before murdering them in a variety of brutal ways. As her family and friends are picked off one by one, Janet is forced to fend off the mysterious maniac, all the while uncovering unsettling secrets surrounding her family’s violent and perverse past…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEyp4GSpvaePsRQxmgzmGNb2zFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108877'),
  ('373650319924488960', 'Darkroom', 2013, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Britt Napier', 'Michaelbrent Collings', 'Kaylee DeFer, Elisabeth Röhm, Christian Campbell, Tobias Segal, Natalie Knepp, Geneva Carr, Heléne Yorke, Britne Oldford', null, 'Michelle kills three of her friends in a horrific car accident while driving under the influence. After rehab, Michelle takes a job recommended by her counselor that lands her trapped in a mansion with three psychotic siblings hell bent on physical torture to purge Michelle of her sins.', 'Michelle kills three of her friends in a horrific car accident while driving under the influence. After rehab, Michelle takes a job recommended by her counselor that lands her trapped in a mansion with three psychotic siblings hell bent on physical torture to purge Michelle of her sins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccdHLWv5VSDPtc4nbWloKKr89oq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235046'),
  ('29701409742268634', 'Darkroom', 2019, 'Drama, Crime', 'Rosa von Praunheim, Lorenz Haarmann', 'Rosa von Praunheim', 'Božidar Kocevski, Heiner Bomhard, Katy Karrenbauer, Bardo Böhlefeld, Julia Blankenburg, Oliver Sechting, Janina Elkin, Christiane Ziehl', null, 'Lars, a male nurse from Saarbrücken, moves to Berlin with his lover, Roland. They begin to renovate an apartment and their happiness seems almost complete. What Roland doesn’t know is that, while secretly checking out Berlin’s night life, Lars is also experimenting with a deadly poison.', 'Lars, a male nurse from Saarbrücken, moves to Berlin with his lover, Roland. They begin to renovate an apartment and their happiness seems almost complete. What Roland doesn’t know is that, while secretly checking out Berlin’s night life, Lars is also experimenting with a deadly poison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/estxdEzTiwiPrposkBOaGpYa5qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:573956'),
  ('564917680421156801', 'Darkside Blues', 1994, 'Animation, Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Yoshimichi Furukawa, Yoriyasu Kogawa, Shinya Takahashi', 'Mayori Sekijima', 'Akio Otsuka, Hideyuki Hori, Koichi Yamadera, Kotono Mitsuishi, Masako Katsuki, Maya Okamoto, Nozomu Sasaki, Shin-ichiro Miki', null, 'The Persona Century Corporation has purchased nearly every parcel of land on earth. Dissension is not tolerated within the corporation''s borders and those who oppose Persona are dealt with swiftly. Of those few places not yet under Persona''s control is the free town of Kabuki-cho, also known as "The Dark Side of Tokyo". Within the town, under the leadership of a woman named Mai, is a small resistance group called Messiah. Into this world steps a man who takes the sobriquet of Kabuki-cho: Darkside. Sealed up in another dimension eighteen years ago by Persona Century, Darkside now returns to aid Messiah using his unique mystic power of renewal.', 'The Persona Century Corporation has purchased nearly every parcel of land on earth. Dissension is not tolerated within the corporation''s borders and those who oppose Persona are dealt with swiftly. Of those few places not yet under Persona''s control is the free town of Kabuki-cho, also known as "The Dark Side of Tokyo". Within the town, under the leadership of a woman named Mai, is a small resistance group called Messiah. Into this world steps a man who takes the sobriquet of Kabuki-cho: Darkside. Sealed up in another dimension eighteen years ago by Persona Century, Darkside now returns to aid Messiah using his unique mystic power of renewal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nekQVAI8V9pgKzKa4c50cHmG6SF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51576'),
  ('964292587476004190', 'Darktown Strutters', 1975, 'Action, Comedy', 'William Witney, João Fernandes', 'George Armitage', 'Trina Parks, Edna Richardson, Bettye Sweet, Shirley Washington, Roger E. Mosley, Curtis Price, Christopher Joy, Stan Shaw', 'PG', 'When a prominent abortion clinic owner goes missing along with a string of other black community leaders, her singing daughter and her fellow female biker gang members investigate.', 'When a prominent abortion clinic owner goes missing along with a string of other black community leaders, her singing daughter and her fellow female biker gang members investigate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gS3wYF79fTsrS1cikRGAOWB1yaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84062'),
  ('684348036646701529', 'Darlin''', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Pollyanna McIntosh, Halyna Hutchins, Casey Merrill', 'Pollyanna McIntosh', 'Lauryn Canny, Bryan Batt, Nora-Jane Noone, Cooper Andrews, Pollyanna McIntosh, John McConnell, Geraldine Singer, Maddie Nichols', null, 'Found at a Catholic hospital filthy and ferocious, feral teenager Darlin’ is whisked off to a care home run by The Bishop and his obedient nuns, where she’s to be rehabilitated into a "good girl" as an example of the miraculous work of the church. But Darlin’ holds a secret darker than the "sins" she is threatened with, and she is not traveling alone. The Woman who raised her, equally fierce and feral, is ever present in the shadows of Darlin’s psyche and is determined to come for her no matter who tries to get in her way.', 'Found at a Catholic hospital filthy and ferocious, feral teenager Darlin’ is whisked off to a care home run by The Bishop and his obedient nuns, where she’s to be rehabilitated into a "good girl" as an example of the miraculous work of the church. But Darlin’ holds a secret darker than the "sins" she is threatened with, and she is not traveling alone. The Woman who raised her, equally fierce and feral, is ever present in the shadows of Darlin’s psyche and is determined to come for her no matter who tries to get in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOuEt2m2YpHwQVybfxdSFq6s1Cy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529149'),
  ('688720631221498630', 'Darling', 1965, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Schlesinger, Robert Watts, Stuart A. Black', 'Frederic Raphael', 'Julie Christie, Dirk Bogarde, Laurence Harvey, José Luis de Vilallonga, Roland Curram, Basil Henson, Dante Posani, Umberto Raho', null, 'Diana, a beautiful but shallow and easily distracted model and failed actress, toys with the affections of several men while attempting to gain fame and fortune in Swinging London.', 'Diana, a beautiful but shallow and easily distracted model and failed actress, toys with the affections of several men while attempting to gain fame and fortune in Swinging London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBd5YO9xG7VmRuC8Q27uR3PV9mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24134'),
  ('1072863965347637493', 'Darling', 2007, 'Drama', 'Christine Carrière', 'Pascal Arnold, Christine Carrière', 'Marina Foïs, Guillaume Canet, Océane Decaudain, Anne Benoît, Marc Brunet, Sissi Duparc, Hervé Lassïnce, Eloïse Charretier', null, 'Darling is a woman of today. It seems to always choose the wrong path. Suffers but does not look like a victim. Do not feel sorry for herself. On the contrary, shows a passion for life against all odds. She is struggling to exist. If you fall, get up. Because Darling is naive and fearless, brave and instinctive. Has the life force of a tragic heroine.', 'Darling is a woman of today. It seems to always choose the wrong path. Suffers but does not look like a victim. Do not feel sorry for herself. On the contrary, shows a passion for life against all odds. She is struggling to exist. If you fall, get up. Because Darling is naive and fearless, brave and instinctive. Has the life force of a tragic heroine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wI56k9xKYni8Tan1iq2HCHHFpbX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59346'),
  ('714198543992663325', 'Darling', 2015, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mickey Keating, Mac Fisken', 'Mickey Keating', 'Lauren Ashley Carter, Sean Young, Brian Morvant, Larry Fessenden, John Speredakos, Al-Nisa Petty, Helen Rogers', null, 'A young woman slowly goes crazy after taking a job as the caretaker for an ancient New York home.', 'A young woman slowly goes crazy after taking a job as the caretaker for an ancient New York home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwG616V3jPAZBBxZSqF7cjlyf9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352372'),
