  ('155542587500558338', 'Darling, I Am Going Out for Cigarettes and I Will Be Right Back', 2011, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Gastón Duprat, Mariano Cohn', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Andrés Duprat', 'Emilio Disi, Eusebio Poncela, Darío Lopilato, Alberto Laiseca, Emma Rivera, Daniel Aráoz', null, 'Ernesto, an ordinary man who, after making a deal with a strange character, has the chance to return to the past and live his youth again, tries to recover lost opportunities and avoid certain behaviors to change his gray and insipid present.', 'Ernesto, an ordinary man who, after making a deal with a strange character, has the chance to return to the past and live his youth again, tries to recover lost opportunities and avoid certain behaviors to change his gray and insipid present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8hCNFgELiWd4hMbX6gC9lmIAf0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87389'),
  ('538838109901881441', 'Darling, Let''s Get Naked!', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Yannis Vasileiadis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Stathis Psaltis, Stamatis Gardelis, Kaiti Finou, Efi Pikoula, Spyros Kalogirou, Rena Pagrati, Dimitra Seremeti, Kostas Evripiotis', null, 'Stathis, a naughty young man whose father owns a coffee shop at the island’s central square, picks up attractive tourists. His neighbor Rena, who is in love with him, stands in the middle of his love affairs and does her best to win him. Moreover, his sister Kaiti, a cute and tender girl, falls in love with an young guy who met while traveling, and who stays on the island for her sake. After many humorous events, both couples find happiness.', 'Stathis, a naughty young man whose father owns a coffee shop at the island’s central square, picks up attractive tourists. His neighbor Rena, who is in love with him, stands in the middle of his love affairs and does her best to win him. Moreover, his sister Kaiti, a cute and tender girl, falls in love with an young guy who met while traveling, and who stays on the island for her sake. After many humorous events, both couples find happiness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oi22tG0OsLzJIgFRKYF6FGJOq0U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165701'),
  ('124940534303822295', 'Darlings', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Anil Mehta, Jasmeet K Reen, Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Parveez Shaikh, Jasmeet K Reen', 'Alia Bhatt, Shefali Shah, Vijay Varma, Roshan Mathew, Rajesh Sharma, Vijay Maurya, Santosh Juvekar, Kiran Karmarkar', null, 'Badru hopes her volatile husband will reform if he stops drinking. But when his rage goes too far, she and her mom boldly, albeit clumsily, seek revenge.', 'Badru hopes her volatile husband will reform if he stops drinking. But when his rage goes too far, she and her mom boldly, albeit clumsily, seek revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyA7kXCIAG17hVuvFOxlMmmv31A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:801526'),
