  ('1082561863049195400', 'Darna Mana Hai', 2003, 'Horror', 'Prawaal Raman, Vishal Sinha', 'Abbas Tyrewala, Atul Sabharwal', 'Sameera Reddy, Gaurav Kapur, Peeya Rai Chowdhary, Kiku Sharda, Malavika, Antara Mali, Sohail Khan, Saif Ali Khan', null, 'Stranded in an abandoned building, six friends relate scary stories while a crazed killer lurks in the forest.', 'Stranded in an abandoned building, six friends relate scary stories while a crazed killer lurks in the forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoI022wesHyrQJJKu4mH0bcXuCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74481'),
