  ('439730555412397965', 'Darr', 1993, 'Thriller, Action, Romance', 'Yash Chopra, Ahmed Siddiqui, Manmohan Singh', 'Honey Irani', 'Sunny Deol, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Shah Rukh Khan, Anupam Kher, Dalip Tahil, Tanvi Azmi, Annu Kapoor, Vikas Anand', 'R', 'A woman is caught between one man''s love and another man''s obsession. She fears one and fears for the other. One stands for love and the other for life. Who will she choose?', 'A woman is caught between one man''s love and another man''s obsession. She fears one and fears for the other. One stands for love and the other for life. Who will she choose?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6y601CavDK46ap8uxeoXxpArU8p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35053'),
  ('190492994104388493', 'Darr @ the Mall', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Pavan Kirpalani', null, 'Jimmy Shergill, Nushrratt Bharuccha, Arif Zakaria, Asif Basra, Nivedita Bhattacharya, Shradha Kaul, Neeraj Sood', null, 'A newly constructed mall is suspected to be haunted when a few workers are mysteriously killed during its construction. Vishnu, a security guard, unveils the mystery behind the mall''s dark secret.', 'A newly constructed mall is suspected to be haunted when a few workers are mysteriously killed during its construction. Vishnu, a security guard, unveils the mystery behind the mall''s dark secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ulk36fzSrgK2Lgk7wjJDkhgFRn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256907'),
