  ('966632695272371786', 'Darse cuenta', 1984, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Doria, Miguel Rodriguez', 'Alejandro Doria, Jacobo Langsner', 'Darío Grandinetti, Luis Brandoni, China Zorrilla, Dora Baret, Luisina Brando, Lito Cruz, Oscar Ferrigno, María Vaner', null, 'The relationship between a doctor and a depressed young patient in a public hospital.', 'The relationship between a doctor and a depressed young patient in a public hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwsnIVaXngQLE2X0rE4Te5cj1Vs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123223'),
  ('162302003971051986', 'Darwin''s Nightmare', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Hubert Sauper, Hubert Sauper', 'Hubert Sauper', 'Elizabeth ''Eliza'' Maganga Nsese, Raphael Tukiko Wagara, Dimond Remtulia, Marcus Nyoni, Sergey Samarets, Jonathan Nathanael, Msafiri ''Safiri'' Habat, Dima Rogonov', null, 'Africa in the sixties. The Nile perch, a ravenous predator, is introduced into Lake Victoria as a scientific experiment, causing the extinction of many native species. Its meat is exported everywhere in exchange for weapons, creating a globalized evil alliance on the lake shores. An infernal nightmare in the real world that wipes out Darwin''s Theory of Evolution.', 'Africa in the sixties. The Nile perch, a ravenous predator, is introduced into Lake Victoria as a scientific experiment, causing the extinction of many native species. Its meat is exported everywhere in exchange for weapons, creating a globalized evil alliance on the lake shores. An infernal nightmare in the real world that wipes out Darwin''s Theory of Evolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mcqaRJ8zYIdErzdTrq8rJDBQeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:415253'),
  ('325901993905009717', 'Das Beste kommt noch!', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Til Schweiger, Sebastian Meuschel, René Richter', 'Maggie Peren', 'Til Schweiger, Michael Maertens, Neda Rahmanian, Heino Ferch, Peter Simonischek, Tim Oliver Schultz, Timur Bartels, Lisa Surmann', null, 'The close friendship between Arthur and Felix is put to the test when one lends the other his health insurance card. Arthur finds out that Felix is terminally ill, but Felix doesn''t know it yet. However, because he doesn''t have the courage to break the bad news and bitter truth to his friend, he soon becomes entangled in a web of lies and suddenly the tables are turned: Felix, who is actually terminally ill, believes that the healthy Arthur is actually going to die soon. He selflessly agrees to care for Arthur and give him a good time in the supposedly last days of his life. This actually gives Arthur a new perspective on life and Felix also starts to change: He manages to open his heart and learns to love bit by bit.', 'The close friendship between Arthur and Felix is put to the test when one lends the other his health insurance card. Arthur finds out that Felix is terminally ill, but Felix doesn''t know it yet. However, because he doesn''t have the courage to break the bad news and bitter truth to his friend, he soon becomes entangled in a web of lies and suddenly the tables are turned: Felix, who is actually terminally ill, believes that the healthy Arthur is actually going to die soon. He selflessly agrees to care for Arthur and give him a good time in the supposedly last days of his life. This actually gives Arthur a new perspective on life and Felix also starts to change: He manages to open his heart and learns to love bit by bit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m8DQMk5PvYdq1clEt43oUSUCdUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:973935'),
  ('1032169775478462367', 'Das doppelte Lottchen', 2017, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Lars R. Liebold, Lancelot von Naso', 'Niko Ballestrem', 'Mia Lohmann, Delphine Lohmann, Alwara Höfels, Florian Stetter, Mina Tander, Oliver Wnuk, Margarita Broich, Amelie Plaas-Link', null, 'Lotte and Louise meet at a summer camp. Everyone who sees the two falls open in surprise, the girls look so much alike. It doesn''t take long before they find out that they are actually twins.', 'Lotte and Louise meet at a summer camp. Everyone who sees the two falls open in surprise, the girls look so much alike. It doesn''t take long before they find out that they are actually twins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c9OAs0250F4YHKnFUfRuCv6YxSk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432877'),
  ('69568383812438094', 'Das Ende einer Nacht', 2012, 'Thriller', 'Matti Geschonneck', 'Magnus Vattrodt', 'Barbara Auer, Ina Weisse, Jörg Hartmann, Matthias Brandt, Christoph M. Ohrt, Katharina Lorenz, Alexander Hörbe, Christina Hecke', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12Qmu8TIhcj9ZzI8s5yWdg6Kb3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100980'),
  ('647475909944458748', 'Das Joshua-Profil', 2018, 'Thriller, Adventure', 'Jochen Alexander Freydank', 'Sebastian Fitzek', 'Kristina Klebe, Arnd Klawitter, Franziska Weisz, Armin Rohde, Torsten Michaelis, Inez Bjørg David, Sebastian Fitzek, Katy Karrenbauer', null, 'The unsuccessful writer Max Rhode is a law-abiding citizen. But what Max doesn''t know yet: In a few days he will commit a crime so horrific that it is hard to imagine for a human being.', 'The unsuccessful writer Max Rhode is a law-abiding citizen. But what Max doesn''t know yet: In a few days he will commit a crime so horrific that it is hard to imagine for a human being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tL8xyB44CyHeOMPKzJjNkHxYrWA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493050'),
  ('711287981139873855', 'Das kleine Arschloch und der alte Sack - Sterben ist Scheiße', 2006, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Michael Schaack, Veit Vollmer', 'Walter Moers', 'Helge Schneider, Ilona Schulz, Dirk Bach, Ralph Morgenstern, Henni Nachtsheim, Gerd Knebel, Kathrin Ackermann, Arne Elsholtz', null, 'The little asshole''s grandfather, the old bag, has fallen into the coffin at a funeral and been buried alive. It''s no surprise that instead of going to heaven, the old sack goes straight to hell. The little asshole and his dog Peppi, whom he inherited from Mrs. Mövenpick, try everything in their power to snatch the old bag from the clutches of the devil and do not shy away from dubious cloning techniques and black magic.', 'The little asshole''s grandfather, the old bag, has fallen into the coffin at a funeral and been buried alive. It''s no surprise that instead of going to heaven, the old sack goes straight to hell. The little asshole and his dog Peppi, whom he inherited from Mrs. Mövenpick, try everything in their power to snatch the old bag from the clutches of the devil and do not shy away from dubious cloning techniques and black magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UG6uhke0wsqezWrarJYSicpyqK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8990'),
  ('101107121289703982', 'Das Lächeln der Frauen', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Gregor Schnitzler, Philipp Kirsamer', 'Silke Zertz', 'Melika Foroutan, Benjamin Sadler, Rolf Kanies, Julia Richter, Armin Rohde, Luisa Liebtrau, Stephan Szasz, Hans-Jochen Wagner', null, 'Aurélie, a young restaurant owner, is unhappy because her boyfriend has left her overnight. Desperate with lovesickness, she wanders the streets of Paris trying to forget her pain, but by chance she comes across the novel "The Smile of Women" in a small bookshop, which seems to refer to her restaurant and her life. Intrigued by the book and full of curiosity, she does everything she can to get to know the author Robert Miller. What she doesn''t know is that Robert Miller is actually the Parisian publisher André Chabanais. But André is in a tight spot, and Aurélie is also torn between her growing affection for André and her unconditional desire to finally find the man who understands her in Robert Miller...', 'Aurélie, a young restaurant owner, is unhappy because her boyfriend has left her overnight. Desperate with lovesickness, she wanders the streets of Paris trying to forget her pain, but by chance she comes across the novel "The Smile of Women" in a small bookshop, which seems to refer to her restaurant and her life. Intrigued by the book and full of curiosity, she does everything she can to get to know the author Robert Miller. What she doesn''t know is that Robert Miller is actually the Parisian publisher André Chabanais. But André is in a tight spot, and Aurélie is also torn between her growing affection for André and her unconditional desire to finally find the man who understands her in Robert Miller...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IqzTL1XRWn9I8P3YK866Aj5rSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305639'),
  ('474705710483757312', 'Das Leben Danach', 2017, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Alexander Fischerkoesen, Nicole Weegmann', 'Eva Zahn, Volker A. Zahn', 'Jella Haase, Martin Brambach, Lena Stolze, Carlo Ljubek, Christina Große, Patrick Joswig, Charlotte Bohning, Jakob Diehl', null, 'Tells the story of Antonia(Jella Haase), who survived the 2010 Love Parade tragedy in Duisburg and how she is dealing with her life after the incident in which 21 people lost their life and more than 500 got injured.', 'Tells the story of Antonia(Jella Haase), who survived the 2010 Love Parade tragedy in Duisburg and how she is dealing with her life after the incident in which 21 people lost their life and more than 500 got injured.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFpwmcQn0wlAsI29GsPzVYcbotT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432647'),
  ('744496722155594537', 'Das Mädchen aus dem Bergsee', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Eva Testor, Mirjam Unger', 'Eva Testor', 'Patricia Aulitzky, Dominik Raneburger, Maresi Riegner, Fritz Egger, Anna Thalbach, Fabian Schiffkorn, Harald Windisch, Antonia Moretti', null, 'After the body of an escort girl is found in a mountain lake, the case quickly turns personal for the lead investigator.', 'After the body of an escort girl is found in a mountain lake, the case quickly turns personal for the lead investigator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/G9VyldoMu0wdt7M5IjtEgkooss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:775790'),
  ('838463735022947359', 'Das Millionenschnitzel', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Wolfgang Murnberger', 'Gabriele Graf, Katja Kittendorf', 'Armin Rohde, Ludger Pistor, Therese Hämer, Cristina do Rego, Purnima Grätz', null, 'Eine Samenspende geht schnell, Vaterwerden kann dauern. Jahre nachdem Wolfgang (Ludger Pistor) eine Samenspende gemacht hat, taucht urplötzlich ein junges Mädchen auf, das sich als seine Tochter Ta (Purnima Grätz) entpuppt. Ta will Schweigegeld von ihrem Erzeuger - schnell und viel. Das ausgerechnet jetzt, wo sich die beiden Freunde mit schwierigen Zukunftsvisionen plagen. Um die nicht zu gefährden und den unverhofften Familienzuwachs vor Wolfgangs Frau Karin (Therese Hämer) zu verheimlichen, nimmt Freund Günther (Armin Rohde) die Vaterschaft auf sich. Die Katastrophe scheint unausweichlich. Hätten beide nicht die Idee ihres Lebens: das Millionenschnitzel. Diesmal muss es einfach klappen. Das Drehbuch zur Komödie stammt von Gabriele Graf und Katja Kittendorf. Regie führte Wolfgang Murnberger. Die Kamera übernahmen Peter von Haller und Daniel Eberhard. In weiteren Rollen sind u. a. Cristina do Rego, Ramona Kunze-Libnow, Inga Busch, Stephan Luca, Luise Berndt, Corinna Nilson, Katharina Schmalenberg, Miles Hafeneth und Tanja Schleiff zu sehen. Das ungleiche Duo Günther Kuballa (Armin Rohde) und Wolfgang Krettek (Ludger Pistor) sind zwar beste Freunde, aber selten einer Meinung. Nur eins haben sie gemeinsam: Ihre Taschen sind immer leer und ihre Köpfe voller Träume. Nachdem die beiden Ruhrpott-Originale ihre Schnitzelbude aufgeben mussten, reicht die Rente der beiden Pechvögel hinten und vorne nicht. Doch Günther hat die rettende Idee: Mit ihrem legendären Schnitzelpanaden-Rezept könnten sie endlich reich werden. Wenn das nur so einfach wäre, kontert Wolfgang. Da stürmt die rotzfreche Ta (Purnima Grätz) in ihr Leben, behauptet, Wolfgang sei ihr Vater - Ergebnis einer längst vergessenen Samenspende - und verlangt 5.000 Euro Schweigegeld, sonst erfährt Wolfgangs Frau Karin (Therese Hämer) von ihrer Existenz. Wolfgang bleibt nichts anderes übrig, als Günthers verrückten Plan zu unterstützen, in der TV-Gründer-Show ARENA anzutreten und mit ihrem Panadenrezept Millionen zu verdienen. Der Siegeswille ist da, doch Know-how, Kontakte und Grundkenntnisse in der Lebensmittelbranche fehlen komplett. Die Lösung: Ausgerechnet Ta wird zum rettenden Strohhalm. Günther schleust sich kurzerhand als Tas Schulbegleiter in die Schule ein. Zeit, ein paar Wissenslücken zu füllen und so das Rezept für den großen Erfolg zu sichern - irgendwie.', 'Eine Samenspende geht schnell, Vaterwerden kann dauern. Jahre nachdem Wolfgang (Ludger Pistor) eine Samenspende gemacht hat, taucht urplötzlich ein junges Mädchen auf, das sich als seine Tochter Ta (Purnima Grätz) entpuppt. Ta will Schweigegeld von ihrem Erzeuger - schnell und viel. Das ausgerechnet jetzt, wo sich die beiden Freunde mit schwierigen Zukunftsvisionen plagen. Um die nicht zu gefährden und den unverhofften Familienzuwachs vor Wolfgangs Frau Karin (Therese Hämer) zu verheimlichen, nimmt Freund Günther (Armin Rohde) die Vaterschaft auf sich. Die Katastrophe scheint unausweichlich. Hätten beide nicht die Idee ihres Lebens: das Millionenschnitzel. Diesmal muss es einfach klappen. Das Drehbuch zur Komödie stammt von Gabriele Graf und Katja Kittendorf. Regie führte Wolfgang Murnberger. Die Kamera übernahmen Peter von Haller und Daniel Eberhard. In weiteren Rollen sind u. a. Cristina do Rego, Ramona Kunze-Libnow, Inga Busch, Stephan Luca, Luise Berndt, Corinna Nilson, Katharina Schmalenberg, Miles Hafeneth und Tanja Schleiff zu sehen. Das ungleiche Duo Günther Kuballa (Armin Rohde) und Wolfgang Krettek (Ludger Pistor) sind zwar beste Freunde, aber selten einer Meinung. Nur eins haben sie gemeinsam: Ihre Taschen sind immer leer und ihre Köpfe voller Träume. Nachdem die beiden Ruhrpott-Originale ihre Schnitzelbude aufgeben mussten, reicht die Rente der beiden Pechvögel hinten und vorne nicht. Doch Günther hat die rettende Idee: Mit ihrem legendären Schnitzelpanaden-Rezept könnten sie endlich reich werden. Wenn das nur so einfach wäre, kontert Wolfgang. Da stürmt die rotzfreche Ta (Purnima Grätz) in ihr Leben, behauptet, Wolfgang sei ihr Vater - Ergebnis einer längst vergessenen Samenspende - und verlangt 5.000 Euro Schweigegeld, sonst erfährt Wolfgangs Frau Karin (Therese Hämer) von ihrer Existenz. Wolfgang bleibt nichts anderes übrig, als Günthers verrückten Plan zu unterstützen, in der TV-Gründer-Show ARENA anzutreten und mit ihrem Panadenrezept Millionen zu verdienen. Der Siegeswille ist da, doch Know-how, Kontakte und Grundkenntnisse in der Lebensmittelbranche fehlen komplett. Die Lösung: Ausgerechnet Ta wird zum rettenden Strohhalm. Günther schleust sich kurzerhand als Tas Schulbegleiter in die Schule ein. Zeit, ein paar Wissenslücken zu füllen und so das Rezept für den großen Erfolg zu sichern - irgendwie.', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:das-millionenschnitzel-2026'),
  ('11595233253850866', 'Das Phantom', 2000, 'Thriller', 'Dennis Gansel, Axel Sand', 'Dennis Gansel, Bernd Ohm, Maggie Peren', 'Jürgen Vogel, Nadeshda Brennicke, Mathias Herrmann, Peter Bongartz, Dietrich Hollinderbäumer, Horst Sachtleben, Hilmi Sözer, Ulrich Pleitgen', null, 'After the partner of a policeman is killed he is drawn into a mysterious plot of conspiracy and terrorists.', 'After the partner of a policeman is killed he is drawn into a mysterious plot of conspiracy and terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntkdCX2XLRJo81XiV8pqYdh7T0z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68667'),
  ('138071312531664508', 'Das Verhör in der Nacht', 2020, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Matti Geschonneck, Judith Kaufmann', 'Daniel Kehlmann', 'Sophie von Kessel, Charly Hübner, Michèle Fichtner', null, 'Philosophy professor Judith is on her way to her parents'' house to celebrate Christmas with them. But nothing comes of it, because as she leaves her hotel she is intercepted by a state security officer. A grueling interrogation begins. Thomas knows a lot about Judith''s life, her recent past, her relationships and her political views. Apparently the professor has been spied on for some time. Thomas confronts her with the suspicion that she was planning a bomb attack.', 'Philosophy professor Judith is on her way to her parents'' house to celebrate Christmas with them. But nothing comes of it, because as she leaves her hotel she is intercepted by a state security officer. A grueling interrogation begins. Thomas knows a lot about Judith''s life, her recent past, her relationships and her political views. Apparently the professor has been spied on for some time. Thomas confronts her with the suspicion that she was planning a bomb attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwb6AJkiZ93mQWB7ZzqKgFmZXLp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766751'),
  ('507555768958305977', 'Das Wunder von Berlin', 2008, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Roland Suso Richter', 'Thomas Kirchner', 'Kostja Ullmann, Karoline Herfurth, Veronica Ferres, Heino Ferch, Michael Gwisdek, André Hennicke, Gesine Cukrowski, Tino Mewes', null, 'East Germany, 1988: working as a state security service agent, Jürgen Kaiser is loyal to the party line, but worried about his son Marco, a punk. As he is arrested after a concert, Marco is forced to join the army, where he surprisingly identifies with socialism and believes he has to defend his country against the capitalist enemy. While Jürgen is astonished, his wife Hanna and Marco''s girlfriend Anja, supporting the civil rights movement, don''t like his new attitude...', 'East Germany, 1988: working as a state security service agent, Jürgen Kaiser is loyal to the party line, but worried about his son Marco, a punk. As he is arrested after a concert, Marco is forced to join the army, where he surprisingly identifies with socialism and believes he has to defend his country against the capitalist enemy. While Jürgen is astonished, his wife Hanna and Marco''s girlfriend Anja, supporting the civil rights movement, don''t like his new attitude...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wUwo0m16G5AznYSA00D8xUe5qjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86170'),
  ('526357251738901522', 'Das Zeugenhaus', 2014, 'Drama, History', 'Matti Geschonneck, Judith Kaufmann', 'Magnus Vattrodt', 'Iris Berben, Matthias Brandt, Gisela Schneeberger, Tobias Moretti, Rosalie Thomass, Udo Samel, Vicky Krieps, Jeff Burrell', null, 'Witnesses about to testify at the Nuremberg War Trials needed a safe place to wait. All under one roof, each with their own secrets. And the countess assigned to take care of them. What was her secret?', 'Witnesses about to testify at the Nuremberg War Trials needed a safe place to wait. All under one roof, each with their own secrets. And the countess assigned to take care of them. What was her secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btLt7CWXkJQe8NgtPjQrNgi2B3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305971'),
  ('277535989664504179', 'Dasara', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Vinay Sagar Jonnala, Srikanth Odela, Sathyan Sooryan', 'Vamsee Krishna, Arjuna Paturi, Jella Srinath', 'Nani, Keerthy Suresh, Dheekshith Shetty, Shine Tom Chacko, Sai Kumar, Samuthirakani, Poorna, Ravi Teja Nannimala', null, 'In 1990s, Set in small village Veerlapally, Dharani, Vennela, and Suri are childhood friends. Dharani loves Vennela, but she has Suri in her mind. Knowing Suri’s interest in Vennela, Dharani sacrifices his love and helps get them married. But Local politics between Rajanna, Shivanna and the latter''s son Chinna Nambi threaten to disrupt their lives.', 'In 1990s, Set in small village Veerlapally, Dharani, Vennela, and Suri are childhood friends. Dharani loves Vennela, but she has Suri in her mind. Knowing Suri’s interest in Vennela, Dharani sacrifices his love and helps get them married. But Local politics between Rajanna, Shivanna and the latter''s son Chinna Nambi threaten to disrupt their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OTVoCVXa5aHDZl8opKoIV9Ezr5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:885184'),
  ('1076888293402200011', 'Dasavatharam', 2008, 'Action, Adventure', 'K. S. Ravikumar, Ravi Varman', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Asin Thottumkal, Mallika Sherawat, Jaya Prada, Napoleon, P. Vasu, Raghuram, Nagesh', null, 'Bio-technologist Govind K Somaiyya sets about on a precarious journey to India to retrieve a vial containing a deadly virus and prevent it from reaching the wrong hands of an ex-CIA agent and deadly assassins.', 'Bio-technologist Govind K Somaiyya sets about on a precarious journey to India to retrieve a vial containing a deadly virus and prevent it from reaching the wrong hands of an ex-CIA agent and deadly assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iD6ilUABEPd1hbijxdWCYHSetoi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17888'),
  ('915260480253363332', 'Dasepo Naughty Girls', 2006, 'Romance, Comedy', 'E J-yong, Chung Chung-hoon, Yu Cheol', 'E J-yong, Choi Jin-sung', 'Kim Ok-bin, Park Jin-woo, Lee Kyeon, Park Ye-seul, Nam Ho-jeong, Song Ha-yoon, Lee Yong-joo, Lee Min-hyeok', null, 'Based on the popular Internet novel, the film takes place in a school renowned for its sexual aberrations. The student body is comprised of sexually ambiguous teenagers, and the student president and vice-present flaunt their taste for S&amp;M. Independent study and supplementary classes are done on homosexuality and transgenderism. But amidst this environment, there are some that just can''t adapt.', 'Based on the popular Internet novel, the film takes place in a school renowned for its sexual aberrations. The student body is comprised of sexually ambiguous teenagers, and the student president and vice-present flaunt their taste for S&amp;M. Independent study and supplementary classes are done on homosexuality and transgenderism. But amidst this environment, there are some that just can''t adapt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hBIMrUjtyimVfZiFHpcBKJ0b0i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25764'),
  ('498278535295494454', 'Dash Akol', 1971, 'Drama', 'Masoud Kimiai, Nemat Haghighi', 'Masoud Kimiai', 'Behrouz Vossoughi, Mary Apick, Manoucher Ahmadi, Bahman Mofid, Jahangir Forouhar, Shahrzad, Jalal Pishvaian, Mohammad Taghi Kahnemoui', null, 'Dash Akol is greatly respected in Shiraz as an honorable man who has lost his family''s money through helping his friends. He has an enemy, however, named Kaka Rostam, a mean and spiteful person. Dash Akol, who is in his forties, falls in love with Marjan, daughter of the late Haji Samad, for whose estate he is the executor. But he keeps his love secret. One day a suitor asks for Marjan''s hand, and Dash Akol considers it against his code of honor to refuse. On the night of the wedding, Dash Akol hands over responsibility for the family to the bridegroom. As he is leaving the house, however, Kaka Rostam is waiting for him and a fight ensues. Kaka Rostam stabs him in the back, but Dash Akol succeeds in killing him. On his deathbed, Dash Akol sends his parrot to Marjan with the confession of love he has taught it.', 'Dash Akol is greatly respected in Shiraz as an honorable man who has lost his family''s money through helping his friends. He has an enemy, however, named Kaka Rostam, a mean and spiteful person. Dash Akol, who is in his forties, falls in love with Marjan, daughter of the late Haji Samad, for whose estate he is the executor. But he keeps his love secret. One day a suitor asks for Marjan''s hand, and Dash Akol considers it against his code of honor to refuse. On the night of the wedding, Dash Akol hands over responsibility for the family to the bridegroom. As he is leaving the house, however, Kaka Rostam is waiting for him and a fight ensues. Kaka Rostam stabs him in the back, but Dash Akol succeeds in killing him. On his deathbed, Dash Akol sends his parrot to Marjan with the confession of love he has taught it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgTaQhZDoPbNWFI5QYP9x5Guebj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267953'),
  ('498206341008042366', 'Dasharatham', 1989, 'Family, Drama', 'Sibi Malayil, Venu', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mohanlal, Rekha, Murali, Nedumudi Venu, Sukumaran, Sukumari, Karamana Janardanan Nair, Kaviyoor Ponnamma', null, 'Rajiv, a chronic bachelor and a business tycoon, decides to have a child. Annie, who has financial needs, agrees to help him and give birth to Rajiv''s child through artificial insemination.', 'Rajiv, a chronic bachelor and a business tycoon, decides to have a child. Annie, who has financial needs, agrees to help him and give birth to Rajiv''s child through artificial insemination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1n6WNghYiTCMl8RPflPSohui4QP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249210'),
  ('1060650542282119267', 'Dashcam', 2021, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Dave Brick, Christian Nilsson', 'Christian Nilsson', 'Eric Tabach, Giorgia Whigham, Zachary Booth, Larry Fessenden, Giullian Yao Gioiello, Noa Fisher, Jacob A. Ware, Scott Aiello', null, 'A video editor for a news show in New York City receives government files containing footage from a police car''s dashcam.', 'A video editor for a news show in New York City receives government files containing footage from a police car''s dashcam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aUr8E7iaGTnNbPtVmCPuV1FuKit.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835325'),
  ('769999602520218729', 'Dashcam', 2022, 'Horror', 'Rob Savage, Reece Gibbins, Lina Remeikaite', 'Jed Shepherd, Gemma Hurley, Rob Savage', 'Annie Hardy, Amar Chadha-Patel, Angela Enahoro, Seylan Baxter, James Swanton, Caroline Ward, Jemma Moore, Mogali Masuku', 'R', 'At the start of the pandemic, an indulgent and self-deluded livestreaming improv musician abandons L.A. for London, steals her ex-bandmate''s car, and makes the fateful decision to give a ride to an elderly woman who is not what she seems.', 'At the start of the pandemic, an indulgent and self-deluded livestreaming improv musician abandons L.A. for London, steals her ex-bandmate''s car, and makes the fateful decision to give a ride to an elderly woman who is not what she seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdddNi35jI3u7e8vgXpo5eQVKrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:858015'),
  ('4952650041502354', 'Dashing in December', 2020, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Lars Lindstrom, Jake Helgren', 'Jake Helgren', 'Peter Porte, Juan Pablo Di Pace, Andie MacDowell, Caroline Harris, Carlos Sanz, Katherine Bailess, Nate Bynum, K. Danor Gerald', null, 'When Wyatt returns home for the holidays to try to convince his mom to sell their family ranch, an unexpected romance with handsome ranch hand Heath may throw off his plans.', 'When Wyatt returns home for the holidays to try to convince his mom to sell their family ranch, an unexpected romance with handsome ranch hand Heath may throw off his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dexLJ6rvku5YE9j8Wb5ljRDPNVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764316'),
  ('514388079115510877', 'Dashing Through the Snow', 2023, 'Fantasy, Family, Comedy', 'Tim Story, Christopher Duskin', 'Scott Rosenberg', 'Lil Rel Howery, Ludacris, Madison Skye Validum, Teyonah Parris, Oscar Nuñez, Ravi Patel, Gina Brillon, Marcus Lewis', 'PG', 'Eddie Garrick is a good-hearted man who has lost his belief in the wonder of Christmas. While spending time with his nine-year-old daughter Charlotte on Christmas Eve, he befriends a mysterious man in a red suit named Nick.', 'Eddie Garrick is a good-hearted man who has lost his belief in the wonder of Christmas. While spending time with his nine-year-old daughter Charlotte on Christmas Eve, he befriends a mysterious man in a red suit named Nick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnfXxsoLBS6JDpu65vHsEvEcWSA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001884'),
  ('466358605631123228', 'Dasvi', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kabir Tejpal, Tushar Jalota', 'Ritesh Shah, Suresh Nair, Sandeep Leyzell', 'Abhishek Bachchan, Yami Gautam Dhar, Nimrat Kaur, Manu Rishi Chadha, Chittaranjan Tripathy, Danish Husain, Shivankit Singh Parihar, Arun Kushwah', null, 'Jailed under a tough cop, an uneducated politician decides to spend his time studying for high school while his scheming wife has plans of her own.', 'Jailed under a tough cop, an uneducated politician decides to spend his time studying for high school while his scheming wife has plans of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zL40soH0AYoBD5BVNu9U2B98ejD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799713'),
  ('456162871316606840', 'Dasvidaniya', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shashant Shah, Sakshi Bhatia, Masoom Gandhi', 'Arshad Syed', 'Vinay Pathak, Ranvir Shorey, Rajat Kapoor, Neha Dhupia, Saurabh Shukla, Sarita Joshi, Joy Fernandes, Manoylo Svitlana', null, 'A man who loves to make "to-do lists" makes one last bucket list when he realizes he is about to die.', 'A man who loves to make "to-do lists" makes one last bucket list when he realizes he is about to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3NF5xlUPrHmTWzewhu8u0oLZnu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14751'),
  ('222611527083917793', 'Data Limite segundo Chico Xavier', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Fabio Medeiros', null, 'Alberto Cardoso, Divaldo Pereira Franco, Marcus V. Freitas, Ademar Gevaerd, Saulo Gomes, Paul Hellyer, Geraldo Lemos, Paulo Roberto Uchôa', null, 'UFO experts claim that after the explosion of the bombs on Hiroshima and Nagasaki, there was an increase in the number of sightings of UFO''S (Unidentified Flying Objects) worldwide. Just over two decades later, the Brazilian medium Chico Xavier confided to close friends that when man reached the moon on July 20, 1969, happened a meeting with the celestial beings of our solar system to check the progress of humanity. They decided to grant a period of 50 years for humanity to evolve morally and live in peace, without provoking a third world war. If we live in peace until the Deadline, humanity would be ready to enter a new era of its existence, and magnificent feats would be checked everywhere, including our brothers from other planets would be expressly authorized to present themselves publicly and officially to Earth''s residents.', 'UFO experts claim that after the explosion of the bombs on Hiroshima and Nagasaki, there was an increase in the number of sightings of UFO''S (Unidentified Flying Objects) worldwide. Just over two decades later, the Brazilian medium Chico Xavier confided to close friends that when man reached the moon on July 20, 1969, happened a meeting with the celestial beings of our solar system to check the progress of humanity. They decided to grant a period of 50 years for humanity to evolve morally and live in peace, without provoking a third world war. If we live in peace until the Deadline, humanity would be ready to enter a new era of its existence, and magnificent feats would be checked everywhere, including our brothers from other planets would be expressly authorized to present themselves publicly and officially to Earth''s residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oM9UABUyiTDu5H5FuJwmDsJkk73.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296317'),
  ('454786711407287515', 'Date A Bullet: Dead or Bullet', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Tomokazu Sugimura, Hitoshi Kamata, Reiko Nozaki', 'Yuichirou Higashide', 'Asami Sanada, Saori Onishi, Kaede Hondo, Mariya Ise, Rina Hidaka, Asami Seto, Natsumi Fujiwara', null, 'The first part of Date A Bullet: Hibiki Higoromo, better known as, Empty, is an amnesiac young girl. She wakes up in the neighboring world, where she encounters Tokisaki Kurumi. In order to kill the mysterious girl, Kurumi leads Empty to a school. When arriving at the school, a number of girls, known as semi-spirits, gather together. Now then, a new battle begins.', 'The first part of Date A Bullet: Hibiki Higoromo, better known as, Empty, is an amnesiac young girl. She wakes up in the neighboring world, where she encounters Tokisaki Kurumi. In order to kill the mysterious girl, Kurumi leads Empty to a school. When arriving at the school, a number of girls, known as semi-spirits, gather together. Now then, a new battle begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1M0Guc3Zh5YWQjzsXwy95vxtg9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:685099'),
  ('1077183629349518828', 'Date A Bullet: Nightmare or Queen', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Michiyo Sugawara, Yoshiaki Tsubata, Naoto Nakamura', 'Yuichirou Higashide', 'Asami Sanada, Saori Onishi, Kaede Hondo, Mariya Ise, Rina Hidaka, Asami Seto, Natsumi Fujiwara', null, 'Second part of the "Date A Bullet" films.', 'Second part of the "Date A Bullet" films.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXUGzAVZUN1l5RvKBIhQ9c0z3cm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723343'),
  ('209496742517288108', 'Date A Live II: Encore OVA', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Romance, Comedy, Adventure', null, null, 'Asami Sanada, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Marina Inoue, Iori Nomizu', null, 'The third volume of the Date A Live: Encore short story collection will bundle an unaired episode in a limited edition. The story is set on July 7th. "In the midst of the Tanabata festival celebrations, Shidou meets Kurumi, the worst Spirit. And the couple''s destination is ...a wedding ceremony hall?!"', 'The third volume of the Date A Live: Encore short story collection will bundle an unaired episode in a limited edition. The story is set on July 7th. "In the midst of the Tanabata festival celebrations, Shidou meets Kurumi, the worst Spirit. And the couple''s destination is ...a wedding ceremony hall?!"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1dHgHIGg95mhOTWe8ppkkqiysO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378096'),
  ('341201304585216811', 'Date A Live: Mayuri Judgement', 2015, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Action, Comedy', 'Keitaro Motonaga, Tetsuya Watanabe', null, 'Marina Inoue, Ayana Taketatsu, Misuzu Togashi, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Minori Chihara, Sora Amamiya, Midori Tsukimiya, Saki Ogasawara', null, 'A huge sphere suddenly began to emit a mysterious spiritual wave to the Tengu City that should have regained its peace. A mysterious, beautiful girl showed up at the same time. Silently, what is her purpose to cast her line of sight to Shidou and the others? The real purpose is...?', 'A huge sphere suddenly began to emit a mysterious spiritual wave to the Tengu City that should have regained its peace. A mysterious, beautiful girl showed up at the same time. Silently, what is her purpose to cast her line of sight to Shidou and the others? The real purpose is...?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8tfDHuRhoKw7Tl0EK7gPPFgyw8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331061'),
  ('395022702732826714', 'Date and Switch', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Chris Nelson, David Robert Jones', 'Alan Yang', 'Nicholas Braun, Hunter Cope, Dakota Johnson, Zach Cregger, Nick Offerman, Gary Cole, Megan Mullally, Sarah Hyland', 'R', 'Two guys who make a pact to lose their virginity before prom find their friendship tested when one of them comes out of the closet.', 'Two guys who make a pact to lose their virginity before prom find their friendship tested when one of them comes out of the closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieLOyHzoJKyflqGdfj82S1MMm5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99367'),
  ('32744047176675673', 'Date in Corfu', 1960, 'Comedy', 'Dimis Dadiras', 'Yiorgos Olimbios', 'Jenny Karezi, Alekos Alexandrakis, Eleni Halkousi, Lykourgos Kallergis, Vangelis Ploios, Kaiti Pappa, Marietta Koutsopoulou, Marika Papailiou', null, 'A womanizing lawyer spends his holidays in mother''s hotel in Corfu. What they do not know is that he has set up an entire trap by his mother and Lanitis entrepreneur, to finally learn what true love. The bait is daughter''s trader Diana who plays the role of Mirka.', 'A womanizing lawyer spends his holidays in mother''s hotel in Corfu. What they do not know is that he has set up an entire trap by his mother and Lanitis entrepreneur, to finally learn what true love. The bait is daughter''s trader Diana who plays the role of Mirka.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozEBYShc8glFRzLlkJpEsWLc1LH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454534'),
  ('596609260102132748', 'Date In The Air', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Markos Zervas', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Kostas Voutsas, Martha Karagianni, Andreas Douzos, Hloi Liaskou, Eleni Prokopiou, Giannis Vogiatzis, Giannis Vogiatzis', null, 'A hopeful Miss Europe 1966 and her girlfriends fall for an aircraftman and his friends. To be together, they take advantage of their commander''s adoration for the famous actress, Rena Vlahopoulou. Who says no to a rendezvous with love?', 'A hopeful Miss Europe 1966 and her girlfriends fall for an aircraftman and his friends. To be together, they take advantage of their commander''s adoration for the famous actress, Rena Vlahopoulou. Who says no to a rendezvous with love?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dU3IKoAO4ECVGX2kZBq6Fqz4Qjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410255'),
  ('898308828781757566', 'Date Movie', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Shawn Maurer, Terry Leonard, Aaron Seltzer', 'Jason Friedberg, Aaron Seltzer', 'Alyson Hannigan, Eddie Griffin, Sophie Monk, Jennifer Coolidge, Fred Willard, Carmen Electra, Tony Cox, Marie Matiko', 'PG-13', 'Spoof of romantic comedies which focuses on a man, his crush, his parents, and her father.', 'Spoof of romantic comedies which focuses on a man, his crush, his parents, and her father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjLK0EmD0MAM7B049SRCUQaqkdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10073'),
  ('236608026416961273', 'Date Night', 2010, 'Comedy, Action, Adventure', 'Shawn Levy, Josh McLaglen, Michael Musteric', 'Josh Klausner', 'Steve Carell, Tina Fey, Mark Wahlberg, Taraji P. Henson, Jimmi Simpson, Common, William Fichtner, Leighton Meester', 'PG-13', 'Phil and Claire Foster fear that their mild-mannered relationship may be falling into a stale rut. During their weekly date night, their dinner reservation leads to their being mistaken for a couple of thieves—and now a number of unsavoury characters want Phil and Claire killed.', 'Phil and Claire Foster fear that their mild-mannered relationship may be falling into a stale rut. During their weekly date night, their dinner reservation leads to their being mistaken for a couple of thieves—and now a number of unsavoury characters want Phil and Claire killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ftaHHJW2IrtnGbazdn5SP8V7Cf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35056'),
  ('466177434880174825', 'Date Wine', 1998, 'Drama', 'Mohamed Shaaban, Radwan El Kashef, Tarek El Tilmisany', 'Radwan El Kashef', 'Sherihan, Abla Kamel, Mohamed Nagaty, Manal Afifi, Hamdy Ahmed, Fayza Amasaib, Gamal Ismail, Seif Abdelrahman', null, 'Set in a mythical small Upper-Egyptian village where people live off planting dates and making of Date Wine, a stranger arrives and calls on people to travel to the abroad for job opportunities, all of the village''s grown-up men leave, except for the disabled grandfather and his grandson Ahmed, upon which trouble begins to spread in the village in the absence of men along with his lover Salma. Exploring themes of Rebellion, Desire, Masculinity, Patriarchy, Spirituality and the Ancient Egyptian Mystique.', 'Set in a mythical small Upper-Egyptian village where people live off planting dates and making of Date Wine, a stranger arrives and calls on people to travel to the abroad for job opportunities, all of the village''s grown-up men leave, except for the disabled grandfather and his grandson Ahmed, upon which trouble begins to spread in the village in the absence of men along with his lover Salma. Exploring themes of Rebellion, Desire, Masculinity, Patriarchy, Spirituality and the Ancient Egyptian Mystique.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hTiJQEll6UyqDZTXzY9CiFVpekf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289145'),
  ('175296006484372055', 'Date with a Kidnapper', 1976, 'Romance, Crime, Drama', 'Frederick R. Friedel, Austin McKinney', 'Frederick R. Friedel', 'Jack Canon, Leslie Rivers, Gladys Lavitan, Larry Lambeth, Jim Blankinship, Charles Elledge, Susan McRae, Bob Martin', 'R', 'A woman living in a boarding house is kidnapped by a small-time criminal. Soon others in the gang try to take her away from him so they can get the ransom.', 'A woman living in a boarding house is kidnapped by a small-time criminal. Soon others in the gang try to take her away from him so they can get the ransom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekiGXH3c0r0KRGTDMnBxqYfGSWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89666'),
  ('737860885092506929', 'Date with an Angel', 1987, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Tom McLoughlin, Alex Thomson', 'Tom McLoughlin', 'Michael E. Knight, Phoebe Cates, Emmanuelle Béart, David Dukes, Vinny Argiro, Bibi Besch, Nancy McLoughlin', 'PG', 'Aspiring composer Jim Sanders is engaged to spoiled rich girl Patty. But the morning after his bachelor party, Jim wakes up to discover a beautiful, broken-winged angel in his pool. When everyone finds out about his heavenly houseguest, Jim must cope with a dangerously jealous fiancée, an exploitive future father-in-law and a group of buddies with an outrageous business plan!', 'Aspiring composer Jim Sanders is engaged to spoiled rich girl Patty. But the morning after his bachelor party, Jim wakes up to discover a beautiful, broken-winged angel in his pool. When everyone finds out about his heavenly houseguest, Jim must cope with a dangerously jealous fiancée, an exploitive future father-in-law and a group of buddies with an outrageous business plan!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9CjIIyZdCybuCRkn4Ad8uWBclu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28370'),
  ('528185170242057701', 'Date with Love', 2016, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Romance', 'Ron Oliver, Paul Etherington, David Heimbecker', 'Brook Durham', 'Shenae Grimes-Beech, Andrew W. Walker, Bailee Madison, Quinn Lord, Andrea Brooks, Caroline Cave, Raugi Yu, Milli Wilkinson', 'G', 'When a boy’s video to a female star goes viral, it scores him a date with his celebrity crush to the prom. Complications arise when the famous starlet falls for the boy’s small-town teacher.', 'When a boy’s video to a female star goes viral, it scores him a date with his celebrity crush to the prom. Complications arise when the famous starlet falls for the boy’s small-town teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PNd2Pq40EMcekkcgpQuy1lf7Yc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393656'),
  ('639702463095760729', 'Dater''s Handbook', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'James Head, David Pelletier', 'Rich Tabach, Jennifer Barrow', 'Meghan, Duchess of Sussex, Kristoffer Polaha, Jonathan Scarfe, Teryl Rothery, Willie Aames, Lynda Boyd, Christine Chatelain, Winnie Hung', null, 'A woman changes her personality according to a dating guide book to find a husband but realizes the man she wants is the one who loves her for who she is.', 'A woman changes her personality according to a dating guide book to find a husband but realizes the man she wants is the one who loves her for who she is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5useBW3c1ZaxXZWZXD3Nv0k1vi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374614'),
  ('10242088360966159', 'Dating & New York', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jonah Feingold, Maria Rusche', 'Jonah Feingold', 'Jaboukie Young-White, Francesca Reale, Catherine Cohen, Brian Muller, Jerry Ferrara, Sohina Sidhu, Eva Victor, Arturo Castro', 'PG-13', 'After an electric one-night stand, two New York millennials draw up a friends-with-benefits contract to avoid the pitfalls of their past relationships.', 'After an electric one-night stand, two New York millennials draw up a friends-with-benefits contract to avoid the pitfalls of their past relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lktpcVcrDHH3RWCvY2URYuKN0VC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656609'),
  ('954362127544562124', 'Dating Amber', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'David Freyne, Ruairí O''Brien', 'David Freyne', 'Fionn O''Shea, Lola Petticrew, Sharon Horgan, Barry Ward, Simone Kirby, Evan O''Connor, Ian O''Reilly, Emma Willis', null, 'Eddie and Amber decide to stage a relationship in order to stop everyone speculating about their sexuality. Eddie is keen to follow his dad into the military, while Amber dreams of moving to the liberal hub of London. The plan seems solid, but as their arrangement begins to fall apart, Eddie’s denial gets deeper as Amber realizes that a perilous future awaits her best friend unless she intervenes.', 'Eddie and Amber decide to stage a relationship in order to stop everyone speculating about their sexuality. Eddie is keen to follow his dad into the military, while Amber dreams of moving to the liberal hub of London. The plan seems solid, but as their arrangement begins to fall apart, Eddie’s denial gets deeper as Amber realizes that a perilous future awaits her best friend unless she intervenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9aro2Op31Bjp1DdOT3pfk3t3LR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635918'),
  ('810569176729224489', 'Dating Santa', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Jose Sierra, Erwin Jaquez', 'Fernanda Eguiarte, Lucero Sánchez Novaro', 'Ana Serradilla, David Chocarro, Olivia Duflos', null, 'Lucia is a consummate professional and the single mother of Leo, her beautiful and mischievous 6-year-old daughter, who is obsessed with Christmas and believes her birth was due to a Christmas miracle. Between her two full-time jobs (motherhood and architecture), she has neither the time nor the inclination to fall in love again, but when she reluctantly agrees to go on a blind date with Sergio, a handsome and likeable chef, the spark is undeniable.', 'Lucia is a consummate professional and the single mother of Leo, her beautiful and mischievous 6-year-old daughter, who is obsessed with Christmas and believes her birth was due to a Christmas miracle. Between her two full-time jobs (motherhood and architecture), she has neither the time nor the inclination to fall in love again, but when she reluctantly agrees to go on a blind date with Sergio, a handsome and likeable chef, the spark is undeniable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBwRO19SucUTDRivgg7TBJPYmbg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192330'),
  ('227673085801370776', 'Dating the Delaneys', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Allan Harmon, Dan Dumouchel', 'Jennifer Barrow', 'Rachel Boston, Paul Campbell, Zoë Christie, Riley Davis, Karen Kruper, Barry W. Levy, Brendon Zub, Parmiss Sehat', 'G', 'Three generations of Delaney women explore the highs and lows of modern-day dating, learning that love and romance can be found at any age…and sometimes where you least expect it.', 'Three generations of Delaney women explore the highs and lows of modern-day dating, learning that love and romance can be found at any age…and sometimes where you least expect it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVr5qI9eq9fT687clOPn9bBvbXa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1002370'),
  ('487250173599348676', 'Dating the Enemy', 1996, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Megan Simpson Huberman, Steve Arnold', 'Megan Simpson Huberman', 'Guy Pearce, Claudia Karvan, Matt Day, Lisa Hensley, Pippa Grandison, John Howard, Scott Lowe, Christopher Morsley', 'PG-13', 'Television show host Brett and his laid-back science journalist girlfriend Tash despair that they will ever truly understand each other. On their first anniversary, under a full moon, a frustrated Tash declares her wish that they could swap lives. The next morning, Brett and Tash awaken to find Tash''s wish has come true. Forced to confront the unfamiliar sensations of their "new" bodies, both must navigate strange new experiences with friends and co-workers.', 'Television show host Brett and his laid-back science journalist girlfriend Tash despair that they will ever truly understand each other. On their first anniversary, under a full moon, a frustrated Tash declares her wish that they could swap lives. The next morning, Brett and Tash awaken to find Tash''s wish has come true. Forced to confront the unfamiliar sensations of their "new" bodies, both must navigate strange new experiences with friends and co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MpO8zdZvedfvYIuzHhBMCxqQ0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16197'),
  ('1044794334939050265', 'DAU. Natasha', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jürgen Jürges, Jekaterina Oertel, Ilya Khrzhanovsky', 'Ilya Khrzhanovsky', 'Natalia Berezhnaya, Olga Shkabarnya, Vladimir Azhippo, Alexey Blinov, Luc Bigé, Alexandr Bozhik, Anatoly Sidko, Raisa Voloshchuk', null, 'Natasha runs the canteen at a secret 1950s Soviet research institute. This is the beating heart of the DAU universe, everyone drops in here: the institute''s employees, scientists and visiting foreign guests. Natasha''s world is a small one, split between the demands of the canteen during the day and alcohol fuelled nights with her younger colleague Olga, during which the two confide their hopes of romance and for a different future. At a party one evening Natasha becomes close to a visiting French scientist Luc Bige and the two sleep together. The following day her life takes a dramatic turn when she is summoned to an interrogation by the KGB''s General Vladimir Azhippo who questions the nature of her relationship with the foreign guest.', 'Natasha runs the canteen at a secret 1950s Soviet research institute. This is the beating heart of the DAU universe, everyone drops in here: the institute''s employees, scientists and visiting foreign guests. Natasha''s world is a small one, split between the demands of the canteen during the day and alcohol fuelled nights with her younger colleague Olga, during which the two confide their hopes of romance and for a different future. At a party one evening Natasha becomes close to a visiting French scientist Luc Bige and the two sleep together. The following day her life takes a dramatic turn when she is summoned to an interrogation by the KGB''s General Vladimir Azhippo who questions the nature of her relationship with the foreign guest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4DNYzlDcKcsuA9d9hlhvB1aSE6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667995'),
  ('1083446407457668044', 'Daud', 1997, 'Action, Adventure', 'Ram Gopal Varma, Rasool Ellore', 'Kannan Iyer, Ram Gopal Varma', 'Sanjay Dutt, Urmila Matondkar, Paresh Rawal, Neeraj Vora, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Manoj Bajpayee, Rana Jung Bahadur, Sumukhi Pendsey', null, 'A notorious gangster asks a career thief by the name of Nandu to steal a package worth over one crore rupees for a fee.', 'A notorious gangster asks a career thief by the name of Nandu to steal a package worth over one crore rupees for a fee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ssiQGO414xFBmelUoNWX6lTZl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54969'),
  ('117015279780257014', 'Daughter of Darkness', 1948, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Dicky Leeman, Lance Comfort, Andrew Mazzei', 'Max Catto', 'Siobhán McKenna, Anne Crawford, Maxwell Reed, George Thorpe, Barry Morse, Liam Redmond, Cyril Smith, Honor Blackman', 'NR', 'In Ballyconnen, Emmy Baudine is a beautiful but disturbed young woman who works for the local priest. When the carnival comes to town, she encounters a handsome young boxer called Dan and lays his face open with her fingernails when he expects sexual favors from her. Hurriedly packed off by Father Corcoran to Yorkshire, Emmy is taken in by a farming family and manages to suppress the strange feelings of fascination and repulsion that she experiences in the presence of the opposite sex. Until, that is, the carnival comes to town and brings with it the vengeful Dan...', 'In Ballyconnen, Emmy Baudine is a beautiful but disturbed young woman who works for the local priest. When the carnival comes to town, she encounters a handsome young boxer called Dan and lays his face open with her fingernails when he expects sexual favors from her. Hurriedly packed off by Father Corcoran to Yorkshire, Emmy is taken in by a farming family and manages to suppress the strange feelings of fascination and repulsion that she experiences in the presence of the opposite sex. Until, that is, the carnival comes to town and brings with it the vengeful Dan...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z3uhkmamhzyT7F9oZXTnvJD25qs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93041'),
  ('107055487379954351', 'Daughter of Darkness', 1990, 'TV Movie, Horror', 'Stuart Gordon, Iván Márk', 'Andrew Laskos', 'Anthony Perkins, Mia Sara, Jack Coleman, Robert Reynolds, Dezső Garas, Erika Bodnár, Mari Kiss, Ferenc Némethy', 'R', 'An atmospheric, sub-hallucinogenic venture into the world of the unknown. The enigma facing a young woman is the identity of her father. Unfortunately for her, she becomes drawn into a small Romanian underworld of brooding menace, darkness, torture chambers, and vampires.', 'An atmospheric, sub-hallucinogenic venture into the world of the unknown. The enigma facing a young woman is the identity of her father. Unfortunately for her, she becomes drawn into a small Romanian underworld of brooding menace, darkness, torture chambers, and vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omOtPF8BZKNr4cGgdrqapo5CLHu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39999'),
  ('720347332015002996', 'Daughter of Darkness', 1993, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Ivan Lai Kai-Ming, Chan Shiu-Wa, Alan Chan Kwok-Kuen', 'Book Gwai, Ivan Lai Kai-Ming', 'Lily Chung Suk-Wai, Hugo Ng Doi-Yung, William Ho, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Money Lo Man-Yee, Lo Hung, Chiu Wai, Gam Biu', null, 'The police suspect a young teenager who was horrifically abused by her family and raped by her father of finally snapping and slaughtering them all.', 'The police suspect a young teenager who was horrifically abused by her family and raped by her father of finally snapping and slaughtering them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ggoyYfBIMD3WbHj36Qlr7wgyFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80794'),
  ('492391736147499589', 'Daughter of Darkness 2', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller, Horror', 'Ivan Lai Kai-Ming', 'Book Gwai', 'Julia Cheng Yim-Lai, Ben Ng Ngai-Cheung, Dick Lau Tik-Chi, William Ho, Liu Kai-Chi, Linda Cheung Lan-Ying, Victor Hon Kwan, Lo Hung', null, 'Another gruesome case involving a woman who''s a sole survivor of a brutal massacre. A local constable questions the woman about her whereabouts and what might have happened the night before. As he gets the young woman to talk, she spins a tale of debauchery, madness and people so vile that you wished that they''ll never see daylight again. Why is this woman so reluctant to talk? Who else might be involved in this ghastly murder? How will this bumbling cop get any solid leads or useful clues from this shell shocked woman?', 'Another gruesome case involving a woman who''s a sole survivor of a brutal massacre. A local constable questions the woman about her whereabouts and what might have happened the night before. As he gets the young woman to talk, she spins a tale of debauchery, madness and people so vile that you wished that they''ll never see daylight again. Why is this woman so reluctant to talk? Who else might be involved in this ghastly murder? How will this bumbling cop get any solid leads or useful clues from this shell shocked woman?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXR6FJNfH77B3KfzMU9HgjXRSMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105397'),
  ('189724419968496696', 'Daughter of Deceit', 1951, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luis Buñuel, José Ortiz Ramos, Jesús González Gancy', null, 'Fernando Soler, Alicia Caro, Fernando Soto, Rubén Rojo, Nacho Contla, Amparo Garrido, Lily Aclemar, Álvaro Matute', null, 'In the drama, a father, firmly believing that the baby daughter in his arms is not his own, abandons her upon the doorstep of the town drunk. Many years pass, and the man finds himself continually wracked with guilt about deserting her.', 'In the drama, a father, firmly believing that the baby daughter in his arms is not his own, abandons her upon the doorstep of the town drunk. Many years pass, and the man finds himself continually wracked with guilt about deserting her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8PmWxidIVmcFmLrMM9HkoRTpaEh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48849'),
  ('298214291104999613', 'Daughter of Dr. Jekyll', 1957, 'Horror', 'Edgar G. Ulmer, John F. Warren', 'Jack Pollexfen', 'John Agar, Gloria Talbott, Arthur Shields, John Dierkes, Mollie McCard, Martha Wentworth, Marjorie Stapp, Reita Green', 'NR', 'A young woman discovers she is the daughter of the infamous Dr. Jekyll, and begins to believe that she may also have a split personality, one of whom is a ruthless killer.', 'A young woman discovers she is the daughter of the infamous Dr. Jekyll, and begins to believe that she may also have a split personality, one of whom is a ruthless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qVPonGPzJrxzu7Dnj1AD37qp8a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117026'),
  ('825809524603859054', 'Daughter of Dracula', 1972, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Jesús Franco, José Climent', 'Jesús Franco', 'Carmen Yazalde, Anne Libert, Alberto Dalbés, Howard Vernon, Daniel White, Jesús Franco, Fernando Bilbao, Carmen Carbonell', null, 'Luisa is called to the bed of her dying mother Edith at Karlstein Castle. Before she dies, she tells Luisa that the Karlsteins are a family of vampires and that her ancestor, the original Count Karlstein, lies buried in the crypt. Afterwards, Luisa goes and finds the count''s coffin and discovers that he is undead. As she takes Karine, her cousin as her lover, a police inspector, Ptuschko investigates a series of killings around the town, dismissing the locals who insist these are being caused by vampires.', 'Luisa is called to the bed of her dying mother Edith at Karlstein Castle. Before she dies, she tells Luisa that the Karlsteins are a family of vampires and that her ancestor, the original Count Karlstein, lies buried in the crypt. Afterwards, Luisa goes and finds the count''s coffin and discovers that he is undead. As she takes Karine, her cousin as her lover, a police inspector, Ptuschko investigates a series of killings around the town, dismissing the locals who insist these are being caused by vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4dZBH596G4P81U9DWaMAcaR1wZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176762'),
  ('28682520476510234', 'Daughter of Keltoum', 2001, 'Drama', 'Alain Levent, Mehdi Charef', 'Mehdi Charef', 'Cylia Malki, Baya Belal, Jean-Roger Milo, Fatima Ben Saïdane, Déborah Lamy, Mostefa Zerguine, Lotfi Yahya Jedidi, Samira Draa', null, 'A 19 year-old Swiss woman travels to her birthplace—an isolated, barren Berber settlement in the mountainous desert landscape of Algeria—to find her biological mother, whom she has never met. The perilous journey immerses her in a world virtually untouched by contemporary society, one that still clings to tribal mores and strict religious codes of conduct.', 'A 19 year-old Swiss woman travels to her birthplace—an isolated, barren Berber settlement in the mountainous desert landscape of Algeria—to find her biological mother, whom she has never met. The perilous journey immerses her in a world virtually untouched by contemporary society, one that still clings to tribal mores and strict religious codes of conduct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMC6aoGYwbc2kUJtITUQYmWbcGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50957'),
  ('146108181024626601', 'Daughter of Mine', 2018, 'Drama', 'Laura Bispuri, Vladan Radović', 'Laura Bispuri, Francesca Manieri', 'Valeria Golino, Alba Rohrwacher, Sara Casu, Udo Kier, Michele Carboni', null, 'A daughter torn between two mothers, one who raised her with love and her biological mother, who instinctively claims her back.', 'A daughter torn between two mothers, one who raised her with love and her biological mother, who instinctively claims her back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXjH6WyOx1nuvoqiEFjVOvWYlcR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492344'),
