  ('178821240164801643', 'Daughter of the Bride', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Patrice Lucien Cochet, Annette Haywood-Carter, Kevin Pazmino', null, 'Halston Sage, Marcia Gay Harden, Andrew Richardson, Aidan Quinn, Brenda Currin, Cara Santana, Michael Rosen, Jill Abramovitz', 'PG-13', 'Diane and Kate are not only mother and daughter but also best friends. Their lives are turned upside down, however, when Diane announces her engagement to a man named Bruce, whom she''s been secretly dating.', 'Diane and Kate are not only mother and daughter but also best friends. Their lives are turned upside down, however, when Diane announces her engagement to a man named Bruce, whom she''s been secretly dating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OS6cVd6qYGcBnXz8MaWLxtglUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1081065'),
