  ('966231281230656706', 'Daughter of the Lake', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Ernesto Cabellos, Carlos Sánchez Giraldo', 'Ernesto Cabellos', 'Nélida Ayay Chilón, Bibi van der Velden, Máxima Acuña de Chaupe, Sabina Gutiérrez Ramos, Andrea Martínez Martínez, Marco Arana Zegarra', null, 'At the height of the Peruvian gold rush, Nélida, an Andean woman able to communicate with water spirits, uses her powers to prevent a mining corporation from destroying the body of water she considers her mother. A gold deposit valued at billions of dollars lies just beneath Nélida’s lakes and leads farmers and Latin America’s biggest gold producer into conflict.', 'At the height of the Peruvian gold rush, Nélida, an Andean woman able to communicate with water spirits, uses her powers to prevent a mining corporation from destroying the body of water she considers her mother. A gold deposit valued at billions of dollars lies just beneath Nélida’s lakes and leads farmers and Latin America’s biggest gold producer into conflict.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zph3VXBv3rL77wCiMLbfswmI0sR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349048'),
  ('332717102801070165', 'Daughter of the Nile', 1987, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Hwai-En, Angelika Wang', 'Chu Tien-Wen', 'Yang Lin, Jack Kao, Li Tian-Lu, Tsui Fu-Sheng, Hsin Shu-Fen, Grace Chen, Wu Nien-jen, Lin Ju', null, 'Lin Hsiao-yang tries to keep her family together while working as a waitress at Kentucky Fried Chicken and going to night school. With no mother and her father currently working out of town, it is up to Lin Hsiao-yang to take care of her younger siblings, who are slipping into a life of crime.', 'Lin Hsiao-yang tries to keep her family together while working as a waitress at Kentucky Fried Chicken and going to night school. With no mother and her father currently working out of town, it is up to Lin Hsiao-yang to take care of her younger siblings, who are slipping into a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yyyOWllCPAHhi7PJnigJYmhTb5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99599'),
  ('524858951267046159', 'Daughter of the Wolf', 2019, 'Action, Thriller', 'Daniel Redenbach, Trevor Cunningham, Andrew Bikichky', 'Nika Agiashvili', 'Gina Carano, Brendan Fehr, Anton Gillis-Adelman, Sydelle Noel, Richard Dreyfuss, Stew McLean, Brock Morgan, Joshua Murdoch', 'R', 'Ex-military specialist Clair Hamilton returns home from her tour in the Middle East due to her father''s passing and to claim her inheritance. Her son is then kidnapped and held for ransom by a gang led by a mysterious figure known only as “Father”.', 'Ex-military specialist Clair Hamilton returns home from her tour in the Middle East due to her father''s passing and to claim her inheritance. Her son is then kidnapped and held for ransom by a gang led by a mysterious figure known only as “Father”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghoNQkJX9Hk1m8GxTsBg4Xez1gn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525657'),
  ('585812225986612056', 'Daughter-in-law Who Cheated On Her Father-in-law', 2023, 'Drama', 'Shin Se-gye', null, 'Jin Seo-yool, Cha Myung-Hoon, Ji Won', null, 'Hyeon-joo and Chan-sik became a sexless couple as she had suspicions that her husband was cheating on her. Then one day, she heads to her in-laws'' house to take care of her father-in-law, Man-geun, who lives alone for the time being due to an accident. Without a wife, Chan-sik enjoys an affair with her employee but is caught by his father.', 'Hyeon-joo and Chan-sik became a sexless couple as she had suspicions that her husband was cheating on her. Then one day, she heads to her in-laws'' house to take care of her father-in-law, Man-geun, who lives alone for the time being due to an accident. Without a wife, Chan-sik enjoys an affair with her employee but is caught by his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mS6HAX7pVfSJCDgwFDusEXvazHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1234000'),
  ('991896649169180075', 'Daughters', 2014, 'Drama', 'Maria Speth, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Maria Speth, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Kathleen Morgeneyer, Hiroki Mano, Fabian Hinrichs, Matthias Matschke, Lars Mikkelsen, Irina Potapenko, Dzamilja Anastasia Sjöström, Hermann Beyer', null, 'Agnes, a teacher from the Hessian provinces, has come to Berlin to identify a dead girl who might be Lydia, her runaway daughter. It turns out not to be Lydia, but Agnes stays in the city anyway. Still frantically looking, she comes a young stray called Ines who no longer leaves her side...', 'Agnes, a teacher from the Hessian provinces, has come to Berlin to identify a dead girl who might be Lydia, her runaway daughter. It turns out not to be Lydia, but Agnes stays in the city anyway. Still frantically looking, she comes a young stray called Ines who no longer leaves her side...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8prT5boTSHcZqRQQ38SdNjrt9Vu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255174'),
  ('33176569632602293', 'Daughters', 2020, 'Drama', 'Ryuichi Kitahata, Takashi Matsuo, Hajime Tsuda', 'Hajime Tsuda', 'Ayaka Miyoshi, Junko Abe, Nene Otsuka, Tomoka Kurotani, Shingo Tsurumi, Hisako Ôkata, Yuka Yoshimura, Yuki Ito', null, 'Two women are flat-mates and friends in Tokyo. One is an event manager and the other works in the world of fashion marketing. The result shows that one is pregnant one day. The woman decides to give birth out of wedlock. It is a major decision, which is the harbinger of not just a change in their lives, but also their relationship.', 'Two women are flat-mates and friends in Tokyo. One is an event manager and the other works in the world of fashion marketing. The result shows that one is pregnant one day. The woman decides to give birth out of wedlock. It is a major decision, which is the harbinger of not just a change in their lives, but also their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGpxJMkXl8PxA5HTYhJkqLnxNQb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:739556'),
  ('932632479996210767', 'Daughters', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Michael Cambio Fernandez, Angela Patton, Natalie Rae', null, null, 'PG-13', 'Four young girls prepare for a special Daddy Daughter Dance with their incarcerated fathers, as part of a unique fatherhood program in a Washington, D.C., jail.', 'Four young girls prepare for a special Daddy Daughter Dance with their incarcerated fathers, as part of a unique fatherhood program in a Washington, D.C., jail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPX9mJE3fe3WIRoLNQqJ0uhwUfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1214521'),
  ('884464586506327476', 'Daughters of Darkness', 1971, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Harry Kümel, Eduard van der Enden, Paul Arias', 'Harry Kümel, Jean Ferry, Pierre Drouot', 'Delphine Seyrig, John Karlen, Danielle Ouimet, Andrea Rau, Paul Esser, Georges Jamin, Joris Collet, Fons Rademakers', 'R', 'Ostend, Belgium. In a decadent seaside hotel, Stefan and Valerie, a newlywed couple, meet the mysterious Countess Báthory and Ilona, her secretary.', 'Ostend, Belgium. In a decadent seaside hotel, Stefan and Valerie, a newlywed couple, meet the mysterious Countess Báthory and Ilona, her secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w6669wTC2x3WtBveKEBv04y70fh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46175'),
  ('40579607156511761', 'Daughters of Eve', 1985, 'Horror, Drama, Crime', 'Elwood Perez', 'Ricardo Lee', 'Sarsi Emmanuelle, Maria Isabel Lopez, Myra Manibog, Mark Joseph, Pia Zabale, Michael Locsin, Arwin Rogelio, Jenneelyn Gatbalite', null, 'In the remote countryside of Ilongo, various women are sexually abused by local men. Two sisters meet Simon, the most attractive man in the village, and fight over him - one constantly haunted by Catholic dogma because of the abuse she suffered previously.', 'In the remote countryside of Ilongo, various women are sexually abused by local men. Two sisters meet Simon, the most attractive man in the village, and fight over him - one constantly haunted by Catholic dogma because of the abuse she suffered previously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jmB3Pk8xK3R439xHa7ko7vdx0FH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77321'),
  ('647460154639731325', 'Daughters of Fire', 1978, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Iracema Nogueira Lima, Walter Hugo Khouri, Geraldo Gabriel', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Paola Morra, Karin Rodrigues, Rosina Malbouisson, Maria Rosa, Serafim Gonzalez, Selma Egrei, Maria Husemann, Helmut Hosse', null, 'A young woman living in São Paulo goes to Gramado to visit a friend of hers. Together, they meet an odd woman who engages in strange experiences through parapsychology. From then on, bizarre events are bound to happen.', 'A young woman living in São Paulo goes to Gramado to visit a friend of hers. Together, they meet an odd woman who engages in strange experiences through parapsychology. From then on, bizarre events are bound to happen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/spdAuBg7fEtp0U1mQcTWj1THOaq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195471'),
  ('323097112815882559', 'Daughters of Lesbos', 1968, 'Drama', 'Peter Woodcock, Max Busche', null, 'Geri Miller, Linda Boyce, Jo Sweet, Jackie Richards, Uta Erickson, Sue Akers, Dick White', null, 'Exploitative look at a secret club for women where they can go to be with other women.', 'Exploitative look at a secret club for women where they can go to be with other women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wnawQY6QVfcJhYLtHsK9UfvcgB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162486'),
  ('467481744951293323', 'Daughters of Satan', 1972, 'Horror', 'Hollingsworth Morse, Nonong Rasca', 'John C. Higgins', 'Tom Selleck, Barra Grant, Tani Guthrie, Paraluman, Vic Silayan, Vic Diaz, Gina Laforteza, Ben Rubio', 'R', 'A man buys a painting depicting witches being burned at the stake, one of whom bears an uncanny resemblance to his wife.', 'A man buys a painting depicting witches being burned at the stake, one of whom bears an uncanny resemblance to his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8u8NfIRnVR2PvLSC3wIaUk3FlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46439'),
  ('391683535449083864', 'Daughters of the Dust', 1991, 'Drama, Romance', 'Julie Dash, C.C. Barnes, J. Miller Tobin', 'Julie Dash', 'Cora Lee Day, Alva Rogers, Barbara O. Jones, Trula Hoosier, Umar Abdurrahamn, Adisa Anderson, Kaycee Moore, Bahni Turpin', null, 'In 1902, an African-American family living on a sea island off the coast of South Carolina prepares to move to the North.', 'In 1902, an African-American family living on a sea island off the coast of South Carolina prepares to move to the North.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sk5qednzLeDZMIhto6Oa9QFKOon.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68427'),
  ('378079276968528874', 'Daughters of the Forest', 2026, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'Otilia Portillo Padua', 'Otilia Portillo Padua', 'Eliseete Ramírez Carbajal, Julieta Serafina Amaya Pérez', null, 'Deep in Mexico’s mushroom-rich forests, two women from indigenous communities have become mycologists. This immersive sci-fi documentary follows their unusual, fungi-driven paths as they seek to reconcile the past and present while reimagining the future for themselves and the changing world they inhabit.', 'Deep in Mexico’s mushroom-rich forests, two women from indigenous communities have become mycologists. This immersive sci-fi documentary follows their unusual, fungi-driven paths as they seek to reconcile the past and present while reimagining the future for themselves and the changing world they inhabit.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FzVz7KDiqA3mdOVYWC9vse7c56dw.jpg', 'plex:movie:daughters-of-the-forest-2026-1'),
  ('71815739409072942', 'Dauntless: The Battle of Midway', 2019, 'War, Action, Drama, History, Adventure', 'Mike Phillips', null, 'Judd Nelson, C. Thomas Howell, Mendel Fogelman, Aidan Bristow, James Austin Kerr, Jade Willey, John Enick, Byrne Offutt', 'NR', 'By June 1942, the Japanese Navy has swept across the Pacific. In an effort to change the course of the war, a United States carrier group is positioned off the coast of Midway, tasked with springing a trap on the enemy. During this pivotal battle, the two-man crew of a U.S. Navy dive bomber is forced to ditch in the sea. Set adrift, the men look towards their comrades for rescue; namely, the ragtag crew of a PBY Catalina, who are sent to search for survivors. Amid the vast openness of the Pacific, with days passing and the chance of rescue fading, the men are forced to face their own mortality.', 'By June 1942, the Japanese Navy has swept across the Pacific. In an effort to change the course of the war, a United States carrier group is positioned off the coast of Midway, tasked with springing a trap on the enemy. During this pivotal battle, the two-man crew of a U.S. Navy dive bomber is forced to ditch in the sea. Set adrift, the men look towards their comrades for rescue; namely, the ragtag crew of a PBY Catalina, who are sent to search for survivors. Amid the vast openness of the Pacific, with days passing and the chance of rescue fading, the men are forced to face their own mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udySr2TNzk5W7Q7pvWSwCNLSv2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604837'),
  ('712342568011816453', 'Dauria', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Viktor Tregubovich, Yevgeni Mezentsev, Irina Chernyakhovskaya', 'Yuri Klepikov, Viktor Tregubovich', 'Arkadi Trusov, Petr Shelokhonov, Vera Kuznetsova, Vitali Solomin, Vasiliy Shukshin, Zhenya Malyantsev, Fyodor Odinokov, Lyubov Malinovskaya', null, 'A chronicle of life in a small village in the Baikal Region on the eve of World War I and at the time of the October Revolution. The age-old foundations are crumbling, the process of social stratification is underway and, as a result, some people go to defend the revolution, and others - to fight against it. The main hero is the young Cossack Roman Ulybin. At first, this carefree daredevil is preoccupied only with one problem: whether his sweetheart, Dashutka, is to marry him or a merchant’s son, Alyoshka. Roman is killing time fist-fighting with his rival. But little by little, the young man realizes that the world around him has changed, that people are fighting for equality and social justice, and, being a real Cossack, he can’t remain on the sidelines…', 'A chronicle of life in a small village in the Baikal Region on the eve of World War I and at the time of the October Revolution. The age-old foundations are crumbling, the process of social stratification is underway and, as a result, some people go to defend the revolution, and others - to fight against it. The main hero is the young Cossack Roman Ulybin. At first, this carefree daredevil is preoccupied only with one problem: whether his sweetheart, Dashutka, is to marry him or a merchant’s son, Alyoshka. Roman is killing time fist-fighting with his rival. But little by little, the young man realizes that the world around him has changed, that people are fighting for equality and social justice, and, being a real Cossack, he can’t remain on the sidelines…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGljeS8IWDIrIkCVpy6QzQu4FvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142808'),
  ('904408223918734528', 'Davacı', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Zeki Ökten', 'Umur Bugay', 'Kemal Sunal, Savaş Yurttaş, Gülümser Gülhan, Necati Bilgiç, Güzin Özipek, Serra Yılmaz, Bahri Selin, Demet Akbağ', null, 'It is a comedy of stubborn people who initiate a judicial process which would last 7 years because some sheep ate a few cabbages.', 'It is a comedy of stubborn people who initiate a judicial process which would last 7 years because some sheep ate a few cabbages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYQ8iROTDsIMAYXubrjPgUZfLMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186572'),
  ('356903526484267112', 'Davaro', 1981, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet, Çetin Gürtop', 'Yavuz Turgul, İhsan Yüce, Kartal Tibet', 'Kemal Sunal, Şener Şen, Adile Naşit, Pembe Mutlu, Ayşen Gruda, İhsan Yüce, Sırrı Elitaş, Ahmet Açan', null, 'Memo returns from Germany to get married with his love but his fathers killer Sulo is being released from jail. As a village rule he has to get revenge for his fahter or he can not get married but he doesn''t want to kill so they stage a fake death with Sulo and after that his luck runs out.', 'Memo returns from Germany to get married with his love but his fathers killer Sulo is being released from jail. As a village rule he has to get revenge for his fahter or he can not get married but he doesn''t want to kill so they stage a fake death with Sulo and after that his luck runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ccohyzPylTYLOgaSC067TcPhZx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31607'),
