  ('389520765719994359', 'Dave Made a Maze', 2017, 'Comedy, Adventure, Horror, Fantasy', 'Bill Watterson, Jonathan Boal', 'Steven Sears, Bill Watterson', 'Nick Thune, Meera Rohit Kumbhani, Adam Busch, James Urbaniak, Stephanie Allynne, Kirsten Vangsness, Scott Krinsky, John Hennigan', 'NR', 'Dave, an artist who has yet to complete anything significant in his career, builds a fort in his living room out of pure frustration, only to wind up trapped by the fantastical pitfalls, booby traps, and critters of his own creation. Ignoring his warnings, Dave’s girlfriend Annie leads a band of oddball explorers on a rescue mission. Once inside, they find themselves trapped in an ever-changing supernatural world, threatened by booby traps and pursued by a bloodthirsty Minotaur.', 'Dave, an artist who has yet to complete anything significant in his career, builds a fort in his living room out of pure frustration, only to wind up trapped by the fantastical pitfalls, booby traps, and critters of his own creation. Ignoring his warnings, Dave’s girlfriend Annie leads a band of oddball explorers on a rescue mission. Once inside, they find themselves trapped in an ever-changing supernatural world, threatened by booby traps and pursued by a bloodthirsty Minotaur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2sMi0iBt44E0M5jmSCaOAnGVZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433941'),
  ('41384329087665955', 'David', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'John Erman, Steve Yaconelli', 'Stephanie Liss', 'Bernadette Peters, John Glover, Dan Lauria, George Grizzard, Christopher Allport, Georgann Johnson, Jordan Charney, Matthew Lawrence', 'NR', 'The true story of David Rothenberg whose disturbed father set him on fire.', 'The true story of David Rothenberg whose disturbed father set him on fire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8JSQij0ofKoeW4EvOjAjb2Upyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75208'),
  ('419263885294863914', 'David', 1997, 'Adventure, Drama, TV Movie', 'Raffaele Mertes, Robert Markowitz', 'Larry Gross', 'Nathaniel Parker, Jonathan Pryce, Leonard Nimoy, Sheryl Lee, Ben Daniels, Richard Ashcroft, Gideon Turner, Maurice Roëves', 'NR', 'A distinguished military leader whose reign was touched by great scandal, shocking betrayals and rousing victories. A simple shepherd boy chosen to be king, under the watchful eyes of prophet Samuel.', 'A distinguished military leader whose reign was touched by great scandal, shocking betrayals and rousing victories. A simple shepherd boy chosen to be king, under the watchful eyes of prophet Samuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2g0M8OAAOevrCAPKfBVUBR9Woxx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2734'),
  ('468940362899162293', 'David', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Roberto Fiesco, Alejandro Cantú, Manuel Teil', 'Roberto Fiesco, Julián Hernández', 'Jorge Adrián Espíndola, Javier Escobar, Salvador Álvarez, Pilar Ruiz, Fernando Arroyo', null, 'A young mute student goes to the movies when ditching school, but changes his mind when he meets an unemployed man who tries to communicate with him. Through messages and games, the two will make a discovery they never imagined.', 'A young mute student goes to the movies when ditching school, but changes his mind when he meets an unemployed man who tries to communicate with him. Through messages and games, the two will make a discovery they never imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUkESLIPqhd71N7lu43XRsoUJ20.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113546'),
  ('1102113151597368410', 'David', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Drama, Music', 'Phil Cunningham, Brent Dawes', 'Brent Dawes', 'Brandon Engman, Brian Stivale, Shahar Taboch, Aaron Tavaler, Hector, Miri Mesika, Jack Wagman, Jonathan Shaboo', 'PG', 'From the songs of his mother’s heart to the whispers of a faithful God, David’s story begins in quiet devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation, a young shepherd armed with only a sling, a few stones, and unshakable faith steps forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose, his journey tests the limits of loyalty, love, and courage—culminating in a battle not just for a crown, but for the soul of a kingdom.', 'From the songs of his mother’s heart to the whispers of a faithful God, David’s story begins in quiet devotion. When the giant Goliath rises to terrorize a nation, a young shepherd armed with only a sling, a few stones, and unshakable faith steps forward. Pursued by power and driven by purpose, his journey tests the limits of loyalty, love, and courage—culminating in a battle not just for a crown, but for the soul of a kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bESlrLOrsQ9gKzaGQGHXKOyIUtX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1167307'),
  ('196496091453278761', 'David and Bathsheba', 1951, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Henry King, Leon Shamroy', 'Philip Dunne', 'Gregory Peck, Susan Hayward, Kieron Moore, Raymond Massey, James Robertson Justice, Jayne Meadows, John Sutton, Dennis Hoey', 'PG', 'King David enters into an adulterous affair with the beautiful Bathsheba, which has tragic consequences for his family and Israel.', 'King David enters into an adulterous affair with the beautiful Bathsheba, which has tragic consequences for his family and Israel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gOYwjVzXami9Nko7pfw7qyt3odu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42567'),
  ('532710203382534434', 'David and Goliath', 1960, 'Drama, Action, History', 'Gianfranco Baldanello, Mimmola Girosi, Richard Pottier', 'Umberto Scarpelli, Gino Mangini, Ambrogio Molteni', 'Orson Welles, Ivica Pajer, Hilton Edwards, Massimo Serato, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Giulia Rubini, Pierre Cressoy, Furio Meniconi', 'G', 'When the Philistines attack, the Israelites are hopeless against the fierce giant Goliath and don''t know what to do. King Saul takes the advice of the prophets and sends an adolescent shepherd, David, into battle to conquer the oversized Philistine. David is victorious and becomes the King of Israel.', 'When the Philistines attack, the Israelites are hopeless against the fierce giant Goliath and don''t know what to do. King Saul takes the advice of the prophets and sends an adolescent shepherd, David, into battle to conquer the oversized Philistine. David is victorious and becomes the King of Israel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7VIzu4Z2IFK9EqRRUb6NWhpcRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92750'),
  ('775760993409209949', 'David and Goliath', 2015, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Fantasy', 'Timothy A. Chey, Michael Richard Johnson', 'Timothy A. Chey', 'Miles Sloman, Jerry Sokolosky, Makenna Guyler, Paul Hughes, Joseph Emms, Richard Summers-Calvert, Jared Morgan, Tom Bonington', null, 'The big-budget, epic film on young King David who took on the mighty warrior Goliath against all odds.', 'The big-budget, epic film on young King David who took on the mighty warrior Goliath against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8ZE7AJO1UchOGCLe2nLR61HOpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328739'),
  ('245631796847263699', 'David and Lisa', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Frank Perry, Tony LaMarca, Leonard Hirschfield', 'Eleanor Perry', 'Keir Dullea, Janet Margolin, Howard Da Silva, Neva Patterson, Clifton James, Richard McMurray, Nancy Nutter, Mathew Anden', null, 'Teenager David Clemens develops a hysterical fear that he will die if he comes into physical contact with another person. Perturbed, David''s overbearing mother places him in a home for mentally disturbed young people, but David remains withdrawn from the other patients and his psychiatrist. Over time, however, David grows interested in 15-year-old Lisa, who suffers from multiple personalities – one who can only speak in rhyme, and the other, a mute.', 'Teenager David Clemens develops a hysterical fear that he will die if he comes into physical contact with another person. Perturbed, David''s overbearing mother places him in a home for mentally disturbed young people, but David remains withdrawn from the other patients and his psychiatrist. Over time, however, David grows interested in 15-year-old Lisa, who suffers from multiple personalities – one who can only speak in rhyme, and the other, a mute.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jujTT52xmggRVwdWvSD2DPqUI1O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109667'),
  ('771060383468661799', 'David and Lisa', 1998, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Lloyd Kramer, James D. Cooper, Angela Barnes', 'Eleanor Perry, Lloyd Kramer, Theodore Isaac Rubin', 'Sidney Poitier, Lukas Haas, Brittany Murphy, Debi Mazar, Allison Janney, Kim Murphy, Giuseppe Andrews, Vicellous Shannon', null, 'A psychiatrist tries to treat an emotionally disturbed teenage boy who has a pathological fear of being touched. The only person who can communicate emotionally with the young patient is a girl suffering from split personalities who speaks in rhymes and withdraws from anyone who refuses to do the same.', 'A psychiatrist tries to treat an emotionally disturbed teenage boy who has a pathological fear of being touched. The only person who can communicate emotionally with the young patient is a girl suffering from split personalities who speaks in rhymes and withdraws from anyone who refuses to do the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQFMB6aRYBFGDjfVjIgqLUjwyiV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77246'),
  ('56910843189881193', 'David and the Elves', 2021, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Michał Rogalski, Marek Palka, Maciej Lisiecki', 'Marcin Baczyński, Mariusz Kuczewski', 'Jakub Zając, Cyprian Grabowski, Anna Smołowik, Michał Czernecki, Monika Krzywkowska, Cezary Żak, Piotr Rogucki, Elżbieta Jarosik', null, 'Christmas is drawing near, but it’s not a happy time for David. After moving to a big city, his parents have been bogged down with work and forgotten the meaning of Christmas. David decides to change that. Together with Albert the Elf, who escaped from the land of Santa to figure out what Christmas is all about, David sets off to Tatra Mountains, where his grandparents live, on a journey full of adventures.', 'Christmas is drawing near, but it’s not a happy time for David. After moving to a big city, his parents have been bogged down with work and forgotten the meaning of Christmas. David decides to change that. Together with Albert the Elf, who escaped from the land of Santa to figure out what Christmas is all about, David sets off to Tatra Mountains, where his grandparents live, on a journey full of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdQml1N2kysb1wKAGqTu3ZuQADW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882093'),
  ('1003491067368174340', 'David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet', 2020, 'Documentary, Drama', 'Ellie De Cent, Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill', null, 'David Attenborough, Max Hughes', 'PG', 'The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.', 'The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSKwyUDKDHiFU5syTTvQRDcGBPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664280'),
  ('583998299622695906', 'David Blaine: Real or Magic', 2013, 'TV Movie, Family, Documentary', 'Matthew Akers, Matthew Akers', 'Matthew Akers, David Blaine', 'David Blaine, Moisés Arias, Will Arnett, George W. Bush, Bryan Callen, Bryan Cranston, Robert De Niro, Harrison Ford', null, 'David Blaine''s signature brand of street magic mystifies the most recognisable celebrities in the world, such as Jamie Foxx, Bryan Cranston, Aaron Paul, Ricky Gervais, Katy Perry, Woody Allen, and Robert DeNiro, to name a few. He goes to the homes of Kanye West and Harrison Ford, Will Smith and Olivia Wilde. He pays a visit to Stephen Hawking at his office in Cambridge University. Blaine also travels the world, astonishing people from all walks of life with never-before seen, inconceivable magic.', 'David Blaine''s signature brand of street magic mystifies the most recognisable celebrities in the world, such as Jamie Foxx, Bryan Cranston, Aaron Paul, Ricky Gervais, Katy Perry, Woody Allen, and Robert DeNiro, to name a few. He goes to the homes of Kanye West and Harrison Ford, Will Smith and Olivia Wilde. He pays a visit to Stephen Hawking at his office in Cambridge University. Blaine also travels the world, astonishing people from all walks of life with never-before seen, inconceivable magic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTMYu8oaAu31PW3wPooGLuM5maA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238466'),
  ('837053157144512693', 'David Blaine: Street Magic', 1997, 'TV Movie, Documentary', 'David Blaine', null, 'David Blaine', null, 'On May 19, 1997, Blaine''s first television special, David Blaine: Street Magic aired on the ABC network. According to the New York Daily News, “Blaine can lay claim to his own brand of wizardry. The magic he offers in tonight’s show operates on an uncommonly personal level.” When asked about his performance style, David explained, “I''d like to bring magic back to the place it used to be 100 years ago.”''', 'On May 19, 1997, Blaine''s first television special, David Blaine: Street Magic aired on the ABC network. According to the New York Daily News, “Blaine can lay claim to his own brand of wizardry. The magic he offers in tonight’s show operates on an uncommonly personal level.” When asked about his performance style, David explained, “I''d like to bring magic back to the place it used to be 100 years ago.”''', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DJfzTp5IRCgAuef9ZfmyOk1CKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143678'),
  ('534210654320013537', 'David Bowie: Cracked Actor', 1975, 'Documentary, Music', 'Alan Yentob, David Myers, Michael D. Murphy', 'Alan Yentob', 'David Bowie', null, 'The documentary depicts Bowie on tour in Los Angeles, using a mixture of vérité sequences filmed in limousines and hotels, and concert footage. Most of the concert footage was taken from a show at the Los Angeles Universal Amphitheatre on 2 September 1974 (Also featured are excerpts from D.A. Pennebaker''s concert film shot at London''s Hammersmith Odeon on 3 July 1973). Cracked Actor is notable for being a source for footage of Bowie''s ambitious Diamond Dogs tour, and also for showing Bowie''s fragile mental state during this period.', 'The documentary depicts Bowie on tour in Los Angeles, using a mixture of vérité sequences filmed in limousines and hotels, and concert footage. Most of the concert footage was taken from a show at the Los Angeles Universal Amphitheatre on 2 September 1974 (Also featured are excerpts from D.A. Pennebaker''s concert film shot at London''s Hammersmith Odeon on 3 July 1973). Cracked Actor is notable for being a source for footage of Bowie''s ambitious Diamond Dogs tour, and also for showing Bowie''s fragile mental state during this period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BfacEk5ou0P5JYj0H7noWJWEfV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168400'),
  ('55899312555773303', 'David Bowie: Glass Spider', 1988, 'Music, Documentary', 'David Mallet', null, 'David Bowie, Peter Frampton, Carlos Alomar, Carmine Rojas, Erdal Kızılçay, Alan Childs, Charlie Sexton, Melissa Hurley', null, 'A chronicle of the eight shows held by the British singer David Bowie at the Sydney Entertainment Centre, Australia, in November 1987, during the Glass Spider Tour, in promotion of his album Never Let Me Down.', 'A chronicle of the eight shows held by the British singer David Bowie at the Sydney Entertainment Centre, Australia, in November 1987, during the Glass Spider Tour, in promotion of his album Never Let Me Down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnE8y3lwNVMKfkq4WOsvERZW8Mg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67547'),
  ('149514870752338598', 'David Bowie: Serious Moonlight', 1984, 'Music', 'David Mallet', null, 'David Bowie, Earl Slick, Carlos Alomar, Carmine Rojas, Tony Thompson, Dave Lebolt, Steve Elson, Stan Harrison', null, 'British singer David Bowie performs in Vancouver, Canada, on September 12, 1983, during his Serious Moonlight Tour.', 'British singer David Bowie performs in Vancouver, Canada, on September 12, 1983, during his Serious Moonlight Tour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYtDPLKqjxlZLuyCCOwvOtq5tIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132781'),
  ('144834843951660204', 'David Bowie: The Last Five Years', 2017, 'Music, Documentary, TV Movie', 'Francis Whately, Richard Numeroff, Louis Caulfield', 'Francis Whately', 'David Bowie, Michael C. Hall, Toni Basil, Tony Visconti, Gail Ann Dorsey, Donny McCaslin, Geoff MacCormack, Maria Schneider', 'G', 'In the last five years of his life, David Bowie ended nearly a decade of silence to engage in an extraordinary burst of activity, producing two groundbreaking albums and a musical. David Bowie: The Last Five Years explores this unexpected end to a remarkable career. Made with remarkable access, Francis Whately’s documentary is a revelatory follow-up to his acclaimed 2013 documentary David Bowie: Five Years, which chronicled Bowie’s golden ‘70s and early-‘80s period.', 'In the last five years of his life, David Bowie ended nearly a decade of silence to engage in an extraordinary burst of activity, producing two groundbreaking albums and a musical. David Bowie: The Last Five Years explores this unexpected end to a remarkable career. Made with remarkable access, Francis Whately’s documentary is a revelatory follow-up to his acclaimed 2013 documentary David Bowie: Five Years, which chronicled Bowie’s golden ‘70s and early-‘80s period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wQCTQSY1aNBGfFSy2tmTEqAzxeX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430156'),
  ('670339913423792929', 'David Brent: Life on the Road', 2016, 'Comedy, Music', 'Ricky Gervais, Remi Adefarasin', 'Ricky Gervais', 'Ricky Gervais, Ben Bailey Smith, Rebecca Gethings, Jo Hartley, Andrew Brooke, Tom Bennett, Tom Basden, Mandeep Dhillon', null, 'A camera crew catches up with David Brent, the former star of the fictional British series, "The Office" as he now fancies himself a rockstar on the road.', 'A camera crew catches up with David Brent, the former star of the fictional British series, "The Office" as he now fancies himself a rockstar on the road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhUKeZj7VlWAtavAzTLwClDWSpI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339792'),
  ('1128163717302048660', 'David Byrne''s American Utopia', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Spike Lee, Ellen Kuras', 'David Byrne', 'David Byrne, Chris Giarmo, Tendayi Kuumba, Mauro Refosco, Karl Mansfield, Angie Swan, Bobby Wooten III, Jacqueline Acevedo', null, 'A filmed version of David Byrne''s Broadway show, a unifying musical celebration that inspires audiences to connect to each other and to the global community.', 'A filmed version of David Byrne''s Broadway show, a unifying musical celebration that inspires audiences to connect to each other and to the global community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHVeVCNhlY2asvoGsSMP5HOLbCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:668800'),
  ('144219112628307936', 'David Copperfield', 1935, 'Drama, Romance, Adventure', 'George Cukor, Douglas Shearer, Oliver T. Marsh', 'Howard Estabrook', 'Freddie Bartholomew, Frank Lawton, Edna May Oliver, Jessie Ralph, Madge Evans, Maureen O''Sullivan, Elizabeth Allan, Harry Beresford', 'NR', 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MtgfnOvnUioz04Yp4Km4JGUOCQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43899'),
