  ('1027337028825865236', 'David Copperfield', 2001, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Peter Medak, Elemér Ragályi', null, 'Hugh Dancy, Max Dolbey, Sarah Smart, Sally Field, Murray Melvin, Judy Cornwell, Freddie Jones, Anthony Andrews', null, 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'A young man journeys from a difficult childhood to maturity, exploring social injustice, personal development, and the complexities of human relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zOfg17Les0Bbz5wP7mLLWbhbt3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141640'),
  ('941440929109324918', 'David et Madame Hansen', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandre Astier, Fabrice Moindrot', 'Alexandre Astier', 'Isabelle Adjani, Alexandre Astier, Julie-Anne Roth, Victor Chambon, Jean-Charles Simon, Daphné Bürki, Sébastien Lalanne, Élodie Hesme', null, 'David is an occupational therapist who has recently arrived at a clinic for wealthy patients. One morning, he is entrusted with Madame Hansen-Bergmann, a wealthy woman suffering from transient amnesia and post-traumatic stress , with the mission of taking her to the nearby village to buy a new pair of shoes. Against his will, he embarks with her on a breathtaking chase during which he discovers the past life of his patient and the origins of the illness from which she suffers.', 'David is an occupational therapist who has recently arrived at a clinic for wealthy patients. One morning, he is entrusted with Madame Hansen-Bergmann, a wealthy woman suffering from transient amnesia and post-traumatic stress , with the mission of taking her to the nearby village to buy a new pair of shoes. Against his will, he embarks with her on a breathtaking chase during which he discovers the past life of his patient and the origins of the illness from which she suffers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hgDZ6LA93MI3VqzxePUTMe9t5Hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129966'),
  ('562770608069576400', 'David Golder', 1931, 'Drama', 'Julien Duvivier, Georges Périnal, Armand Thirard', 'Irène Némirovsky, Julien Duvivier', 'Harry Baur, Paule Andral, Jackie Monnier, Jean Bradin, Gaston Jacquet, Jean Coquelin, Camille Bert, Jacques Grétillat', null, 'David is a poor but ambitious Polish Jew who reinvents himself as a powerful New York business magnate. After gaining wealth, he relocates to Paris, only to have his selfish and demanding wife squander his fortune.', 'David is a poor but ambitious Polish Jew who reinvents himself as a powerful New York business magnate. After gaining wealth, he relocates to Paris, only to have his selfish and demanding wife squander his fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0zEWE1TC9fSYsisZ5rP0VSSOhW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153444'),
  ('1100978543077438859', 'David Holmes: The Boy Who Lived', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Chris Openshaw, Kris Vankay, Tim Cragg', null, 'David Holmes, Daniel Radcliffe, Sue Holmes, Andy Holmes, Greg Powell, Tolga Kenan, Marc Mailley, Tommy Wells', 'PG-13', 'As Daniel Radcliffe''s stunt double in the Harry Potter films, David Holmes'' work has been seen worldwide by millions of people. Tragically an on-set accident ended what David calls "the best job in the world," leaving him paralyzed. Like the on-screen character he helped bring to life, David is determined to continue seeking adventure and living life to the fullest despite mounting obstacles.', 'As Daniel Radcliffe''s stunt double in the Harry Potter films, David Holmes'' work has been seen worldwide by millions of people. Tragically an on-set accident ended what David calls "the best job in the world," leaving him paralyzed. Like the on-screen character he helped bring to life, David is determined to continue seeking adventure and living life to the fullest despite mounting obstacles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pL8BuguWW1ZRksHIMwuK9UD4ROd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1190725'),
  ('9513767762375506', 'David Holzman''s Diary', 1967, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim McBride, Michael Wadleigh', 'Jim McBride', 'L.M. Kit Carson, Eileen Dietz, Lorenzo Mans, Louise Levine, Fern McBride, Michel Lévine, Robert Lesser, Jack Baran', null, 'A young filmmaker decides to make a movie about his day-to-day activities in an attempt to understand himself and get his life back in order. A precursor to reality television and vlogs.', 'A young filmmaker decides to make a movie about his day-to-day activities in an attempt to understand himself and get his life back in order. A precursor to reality television and vlogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6CeyRNT2jkVlpzTtQ4SJEicjobL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85535'),
  ('456073809217942775', 'David Loman', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chiu Li-Kwan', 'Chien Shih-Keng', 'Chu Ko-liang, Amber Kuo Tsai-Chieh, Tony Yang, Su Chu, Lin Mei-shiu, Lotus Wang, Miao Ke-li, Chin-Jung Kang', null, 'David Loman, a simple country bumpkin who accidentally becomes a big boss in the criminal underworld. A decade passes, and life seems to go on as usual - solving daily problems for locals and receiving "protection fees" - until one day a deity tells David through a medium that he needs to find a double to avoid a catastrophe. Panicky, the boss seeks help from Old Ho, who agrees to pass as David for a few days, but is assassinated when attending a gathering with fellow gangsters.', 'David Loman, a simple country bumpkin who accidentally becomes a big boss in the criminal underworld. A decade passes, and life seems to go on as usual - solving daily problems for locals and receiving "protection fees" - until one day a deity tells David through a medium that he needs to find a double to avoid a catastrophe. Panicky, the boss seeks help from Old Ho, who agrees to pass as David for a few days, but is assassinated when attending a gathering with fellow gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVOq9l6a4bqIHsHV2eWU80XoAuX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199742'),
  ('7315703295987702', 'David Lynch: The Art Life', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Jon Nguyen, Jason S., Rick Barnes', null, 'David Lynch, Lula Lynch', 'NR', 'An intimate journey through the formative years of David Lynch''s life. From his idyllic upbringing in small town America to the dark streets of Philadelphia, we follow Lynch as he traces the events that have helped to shape one of cinema''s most enigmatic directors.', 'An intimate journey through the formative years of David Lynch''s life. From his idyllic upbringing in small town America to the dark streets of Philadelphia, we follow Lynch as he traces the events that have helped to shape one of cinema''s most enigmatic directors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgtQceTZKylB2B237t18h2pOXpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413765'),
  ('433024174688963035', 'David Spade: Take the Hit', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Keith Truesdell', 'David Spade', 'David Spade', null, 'David Spade focuses on pop-culture bashing in his first solo HBO TV comedy special that aired on April 17, 1998 and was taped in front of a live audience. In this 60 minute show, David Spade uses his everyday life experiences as a platform for his jokes.', 'David Spade focuses on pop-culture bashing in his first solo HBO TV comedy special that aired on April 17, 1998 and was taped in front of a live audience. In this 60 minute show, David Spade uses his everyday life experiences as a platform for his jokes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYfiNPOGLVseQQcZPQwbDQagdqH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73997'),
  ('948955614570264304', 'David''s Birthday', 2009, 'Mystery, Drama, Romance', 'Marco Filiberti, Roberta Allegrini', 'Deborah De Furia, Marco Filiberti', 'Alessandro Gassmann, Maria de Medeiros, Massimo Poggio, Michela Cescon, Christo Jivkov, Piera Degli Esposti, Thyago Alves, Marianna De Rossi', null, 'Two couples are enjoying their summer at the beach, but when the grown son of one couple arrives, it surprisingly stirs something in the husband of the other couple, will the forbidden feelings end badly?', 'Two couples are enjoying their summer at the beach, but when the grown son of one couple arrives, it surprisingly stirs something in the husband of the other couple, will the forbidden feelings end badly?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PhnXpYe0BS2vE0AwpYUUVRsLG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64631'),
  ('1078533097525859470', 'Davy Crockett and the River Pirates', 1956, 'Adventure, Family, Western', 'Norman Foster, Bert Glennon', 'Norman Foster, Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Fess Parker, Buddy Ebsen, Jeff York, Kenneth Tobey, Clem Bevans, Irvin Ashkenazy, Mort Mills, Paul Newlan', 'G', 'Davy Crockett and his sidekick Georgie compete against boastful Mike Fink ("King of the River") in a boat race to New Orleans. Later, Davy and Georgie, allied with Fink, battle a group of river pirates trying to pass themselves off as Native Americans.', 'Davy Crockett and his sidekick Georgie compete against boastful Mike Fink ("King of the River") in a boat race to New Orleans. Later, Davy and Georgie, allied with Fink, battle a group of river pirates trying to pass themselves off as Native Americans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nK43dRSgNYglR37KbcCjsimj5PE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50717'),
  ('160689466011669792', 'Davy Crockett, Indian Scout', 1950, 'Western, Action', 'Lew Landers, John J. Mescall, George E. Diskant', 'Richard Schayer', 'George Montgomery, Ellen Drew, Phillip Reed, Noah Beery Jr., Paul Guilfoyle, Addison Richards, Robert Barrat, Erik Rolf', 'G', 'It''s 1848 and a wagon train with an Army escort is heading west through Indian territory, It''s scout is Davy Crockett, nephew of his more famous namesake. There is spy amongst them informing the Indians. They survive the first Indian attack and then push on. They have a choice of two passes through the mountains. Learing of the pass to be defended by the Indians, they head for the other. But upon ariving, the Indians attack. Somehow they have been informed.', 'It''s 1848 and a wagon train with an Army escort is heading west through Indian territory, It''s scout is Davy Crockett, nephew of his more famous namesake. There is spy amongst them informing the Indians. They survive the first Indian attack and then push on. They have a choice of two passes through the mountains. Learing of the pass to be defended by the Indians, they head for the other. But upon ariving, the Indians attack. Somehow they have been informed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFcvPz0w1QxIDviLy5PVnEMabte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65586'),
  ('605170840807921745', 'Davy Crockett, King of the Wild Frontier', 1955, 'Adventure, Family, Western', 'Norman Foster, Charles P. Boyle', 'Thomas W. Blackburn', 'Fess Parker, Buddy Ebsen, Basil Ruysdael, Hans Conried, William Bakewell, Kenneth Tobey, Pat Hogan, Helene Stanley', 'G', 'Legends (and myths) from the life of famed American frontiersman Davy Crockett are depicted in this feature film edited from television episodes. Crockett and his friend George Russel fight in the Creek Indian War. Then Crockett is elected to Congress and brings his rough-hewn ways to the House of Representatives. Finally, Crockett and Russell journey to Texas and the last stand at the Alamo.', 'Legends (and myths) from the life of famed American frontiersman Davy Crockett are depicted in this feature film edited from television episodes. Crockett and his friend George Russel fight in the Creek Indian War. Then Crockett is elected to Congress and brings his rough-hewn ways to the House of Representatives. Finally, Crockett and Russell journey to Texas and the last stand at the Alamo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7IFRrsQdaaUJaemg2z35fshzswd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35115'),
  ('294613255084220988', 'Dawg', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Victoria Hochberg, Steven Finestone, Barbara M. Ravis', 'Ken Hastings', 'Charlie Stewart, Antoine Maurice, Chandler Riley Hecht, Matt Weinberg, Denis Leary, Kim Pawlik, Pete Trama, Joe Inscoe', null, 'To inherit a million dollars, an egotistical womanizer must find the women he''s betrayed and convince them to forgive him.', 'To inherit a million dollars, an egotistical womanizer must find the women he''s betrayed and convince them to forgive him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5865LCQVdV8AxCX27pBn94Ob2pB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46112'),
  ('734735839747174143', 'Dawn', 1933, 'War, Drama', 'Gustav Ucicky, Carl Hoffmann', 'Gerhard Menzel', 'Rudolf Forster, Fritz Genschow, Paul Westermeier, Camilla Spira, Gerhard Bienert, Adele Sandrock, Hans Leibelt, Eduard von Winterstein', null, 'Released three days after Adolf Hitler became Reichskanzler, it was the first film to have its screening in Nazi Germany. It became a symbol of the new times touted by the Nazi regime. The title (literally "morning-red") is the German term for the reddish coloring of the east sky about a half hour before the sunrise. On patrol Captain Liers and his submarine crew sink an important British ship, but while returning to harbour, they''re lured into a trap by a British vessel disguised as a neutral Danish one. They sink it after it attacks them without warning, but while they prepare to rescue survivors, a British destroyer sinks the sub. On the sea bed 60 feet down, with all but the bridge flooded, the 10 surviving crew have only 8 rescue devices. Liers orders the crew to use them, but they disobey - either all escape or nobody does.', 'Released three days after Adolf Hitler became Reichskanzler, it was the first film to have its screening in Nazi Germany. It became a symbol of the new times touted by the Nazi regime. The title (literally "morning-red") is the German term for the reddish coloring of the east sky about a half hour before the sunrise. On patrol Captain Liers and his submarine crew sink an important British ship, but while returning to harbour, they''re lured into a trap by a British vessel disguised as a neutral Danish one. They sink it after it attacks them without warning, but while they prepare to rescue survivors, a British destroyer sinks the sub. On the sea bed 60 feet down, with all but the bridge flooded, the 10 surviving crew have only 8 rescue devices. Liers orders the crew to use them, but they disobey - either all escape or nobody does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFS7OWzvv9Ns8RsG6RG0OffrvgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258145'),
  ('124586642634669305', 'Dawn at Socorro', 1954, 'Western', 'George Sherman, Ronald R. Rondell, Carl E. Guthrie', 'George Zuckerman', 'Rory Calhoun, Piper Laurie, David Brian, Kathleen Hughes, Alex Nicol, Edgar Buchanan, Mara Corday, Roy Roberts', 'NR', 'Brett Wade, gambler, gunslinger, and classical pianist, is wounded in a gunfight with the Ferris clan; the doctor finds signs of tuberculosis. En route to Colorado for his health, Brett stops in Socorro, New Mexico along with Ferris gunfighter Jimmy Rapp. Sheriff Couthen fears another shootout, but what Brett has in mind is saving waif-with-a-past Rannah Hayes from a life as one of Dick Braden''s saloon girls.', 'Brett Wade, gambler, gunslinger, and classical pianist, is wounded in a gunfight with the Ferris clan; the doctor finds signs of tuberculosis. En route to Colorado for his health, Brett stops in Socorro, New Mexico along with Ferris gunfighter Jimmy Rapp. Sheriff Couthen fears another shootout, but what Brett has in mind is saving waif-with-a-past Rannah Hayes from a life as one of Dick Braden''s saloon girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Q1oyYdFpafGkiF09hJSeuWtmeR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138949'),
  ('884272569408340756', 'Dawn Breaks Behind the Eyes', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Kopacka, Lukas Dolgner, Jens Hecht', 'Lili Villányi, Kevin Kopacka', 'Anna Platen, Jeff Wilbusch, Luisa Taraz, Frederik von Lüttichau, Robert Nickisch, Bill Becker, Elena Gómez Álvarez, Max Cramer', 'NR', 'After inheriting a run-down castle, a dispirited woman and her ill-tempered husband decide to spend the night, as time and reality shift around them.', 'After inheriting a run-down castle, a dispirited woman and her ill-tempered husband decide to spend the night, as time and reality shift around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJYhpx7vIlDhUmaqu7VNE0SNxoD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528594'),
  ('786034152850897346', 'Dawn Breaks, Which Is No Small Thing', 1989, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Cuerda, Carlos Ramón Lluch, Emiliano Otegui', 'José Luis Cuerda', 'Manuel Alexandre, Rafael Alonso, María Ángeles Ariza, Aurora Bautista, Elisa Belmonte, Arturo Bonín, Alberto Bové, Paco Cambres', null, 'Teodoro, a Spanish engineer working as a professor in the United States, returns to Spain to enjoy a sabbatical year.', 'Teodoro, a Spanish engineer working as a professor in the United States, returns to Spain to enjoy a sabbatical year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQX1gTROwLPFVWrXBy2uCHOLyby.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20607'),
  ('722319362327115857', 'Dawn of the Beast', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Bruce Wemple', 'Anna Shields', 'Adrian Burke, Ariella Mastroianni, Anna Shields, LeJon Woods, Chris Cimperman, Grant Schumacher, Willard Morgan, Francesca Anderson', null, 'Aiming to find the Bigfoot, a group of graduate students venture deep into an area of the Northeastern wilderness known for its strange creature sightings. Soon, they learn that there is a much more sinister evil lurking in the woods, the Wendigo, and once the spirit knows you’re there, they will come for you. Who will survive in a battle between the two most notorious monsters of the forest?', 'Aiming to find the Bigfoot, a group of graduate students venture deep into an area of the Northeastern wilderness known for its strange creature sightings. Soon, they learn that there is a much more sinister evil lurking in the woods, the Wendigo, and once the spirit knows you’re there, they will come for you. Who will survive in a battle between the two most notorious monsters of the forest?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZGx57ShJ3IUeZNxEbOMinW4wea.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786584'),
  ('1050805524857527594', 'Dawn of the Dead', 1978, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'George A. Romero, Michael Gornick, Christine Forrest', 'George A. Romero', 'David Emge, Ken Foree, Scott H. Reiniger, Gaylen Ross, David Crawford, David Early, Richard France, Howard Smith', 'NR', 'During an ever-growing epidemic of zombies that have risen from the dead, two Philadelphia SWAT team members, a traffic reporter, and his television-executive girlfriend seek refuge in a secluded shopping mall.', 'During an ever-growing epidemic of zombies that have risen from the dead, two Philadelphia SWAT team members, a traffic reporter, and his television-executive girlfriend seek refuge in a secluded shopping mall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70MY8H0bLMvXf8ED2SgVMPhDVVM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:923'),
  ('1091923257392199013', 'Dawn of the Dead', 2004, 'Horror, Action', 'Zack Snyder, Matthew F. Leonetti, Jordana Lieberman', 'James Gunn, George A. Romero', 'Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, Ty Burrell, Mekhi Phifer, Michael Kelly, Kevin Zegers, Lindy Booth', 'R', 'A group of survivors take refuge in a shopping mall after the world is taken over by aggressive, flesh-eating zombies.', 'A group of survivors take refuge in a shopping mall after the world is taken over by aggressive, flesh-eating zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ttquyxStEEctzghtA2f4PUGprDr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:924'),
  ('1011464954444274970', 'Dawn of the Felines', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Takahiro Haibara', 'Kazuya Shiraishi', 'Juri Ihata, Satsuki Maue, Michié, Takuma Otoo, Kazuko Shirakawa, Kaku Tomohiro, Hideaki Murata, Kazunobu Kubota', null, 'A story of three escort girls living in Ikebukuro, Tokyo. They work at the same escort service while feeling lonely in their urban lives.', 'A story of three escort girls living in Ikebukuro, Tokyo. They work at the same escort service while feeling lonely in their urban lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSsvSApbY65rOhbjAv3gnQ329tE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435802'),
  ('641380361006063834', 'Dawn of the Mummy', 1981, 'Horror', 'Frank Agrama, Sergio Rubini', 'Frank Agrama, Ronald Dobrin, Daria Price', 'Brenda Siemer Scheider, Barry Sattels, George Peck, John Salvo, Ibrahim Khan, Joan Levy, Ellen Faison, Diane Beatty', null, 'A group of fashion models disturb the tomb of a mummy and revive an ancient curse. Along with the mummy rising, slaves who were buried in the desert thousands of years before, also rise, with a craving for human flesh.', 'A group of fashion models disturb the tomb of a mummy and revive an ancient curse. Along with the mummy rising, slaves who were buried in the desert thousands of years before, also rise, with a craving for human flesh.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nL8y7FtSwXI9ZiD5Bh1SQFAuag3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40467'),
  ('459479161360605304', 'Dawn of the Planet of the Apes', 2014, 'Science Fiction, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Harrison Paul, Javiera Varas, Sheila Millar', 'Amanda Silver, Mark Bomback, Rick Jaffa', 'Andy Serkis, Jason Clarke, Toby Kebbell, Gary Oldman, Keri Russell, Kodi Smit-McPhee, Nick Thurston, Karin Konoval', 'PG-13', 'A group of scientists in San Francisco struggle to stay alive in the aftermath of a plague that is wiping out humanity, while Caesar tries to maintain dominance over his community of intelligent apes.', 'A group of scientists in San Francisco struggle to stay alive in the aftermath of a plague that is wiping out humanity, while Caesar tries to maintain dominance over his community of intelligent apes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mSmAc9G25fhOHH45SLEeagR0qi7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119450'),
  ('976836231229076324', 'Dawn Rider', 2012, 'Action, Western', 'Terry Miles, Norm Li', 'Joseph Nasser, Terry Miles, Evan Jacobs', 'Donald Sutherland, Christian Slater, Jill Hennessy, Lochlyn Munro, Adrian Hough, G. Michael Gray, George Canyon, Claude Duhamel', 'R', 'A gripping story of vengeance and passion set in the American West. When the father of gunslinger John Mason is shot to death by masked bandits, Mason sets out with guns blazing to track down those who killed him. During his quest, he finds himself involved in a grim love triangle when he falls for Alice, the determined and beautiful woman also adored by John’s best friend. Based on the timeless John Wayne adventure, Dawn Rider is a riveting saga of retribution, duty and valor in the American West.', 'A gripping story of vengeance and passion set in the American West. When the father of gunslinger John Mason is shot to death by masked bandits, Mason sets out with guns blazing to track down those who killed him. During his quest, he finds himself involved in a grim love triangle when he falls for Alice, the determined and beautiful woman also adored by John’s best friend. Based on the timeless John Wayne adventure, Dawn Rider is a riveting saga of retribution, duty and valor in the American West.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJMC2wBEifL4M6QP2OjSuEBVMyX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109500'),
  ('143979893960309243', 'Dawson City: Frozen Time', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Bill Morrison', 'Bill Morrison', 'Kathy Jones-Gates, Michael Gates, Sam Kula, Bill O''Farrell, Chris ''Mad Dog'' Russo, Bill Morrison', null, 'The true history of a collection of some 500 films dating from 1910s to 1920s, which were lost for over 50 years until being discovered buried in a sub-arctic swimming pool deep in the Yukon Territory, in Dawson City, located about 350 miles south of the Arctic Circle.', 'The true history of a collection of some 500 films dating from 1910s to 1920s, which were lost for over 50 years until being discovered buried in a sub-arctic swimming pool deep in the Yukon Territory, in Dawson City, located about 350 miles south of the Arctic Circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6acUjFJzv6J7IE2h75zVMCkJr4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413580'),
  ('634668024822778985', 'Day & Night', 2010, 'Drama', 'Sabine Derflinger', 'Eva Testor, Sabine Derflinger', 'Anna Rot, Magdalena Kronschläger, Philipp Hochmair, Martina Spitzer, Adrian Topol, Manuel Rubey, Ana Stefanović, Wolfgang S. Zechmayer', null, 'An unreservedly matter-of-fact look at two young women who consider prostitution an adventure until reality catches up with them.', 'An unreservedly matter-of-fact look at two young women who consider prostitution an adventure until reality catches up with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geU3bmEB9N22eMEuLlr3UBMRykH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79571'),
  ('353398179885058739', 'Day 6', 2011, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Mystery', 'Varo Venturi, Daniele Baldacci, Simone Di Carlo', 'Varo Venturi, M. Luisa Fusconi, Giacomo Mondadori', 'Massimo Poggio, Laura Glavan, Varo Venturi, Ludovico Fremont, Marina Kazankova, Pier Giorgio Bellocchio, Nazzareno Bomba, Emilian Cerniceanu', null, 'A brave scientist has been studying thousands of cases related to alien abductions. By placing abductees under hypnosis, he arrives at the unsettling discovery that for thousands of years, a variety of extra-terrestrial races have been installing their active memories in abducted people''s brains. These alien races exploit a powerful source of energy that only humans have: the Soul.', 'A brave scientist has been studying thousands of cases related to alien abductions. By placing abductees under hypnosis, he arrives at the unsettling discovery that for thousands of years, a variety of extra-terrestrial races have been installing their active memories in abducted people''s brains. These alien races exploit a powerful source of energy that only humans have: the Soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAjnmQ45Hl3QfxZjcM11KRGLqqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63833'),
  ('1103131769763365370', 'Day and Night', 1997, 'Drama', 'Bernard-Henri Lévy, Willy Kurant', 'Bernard-Henri Lévy, Jean-Paul Enthoven', 'Alain Delon, Lauren Bacall, Xavier Beauvois, Marianne Denicourt, Arielle Dombasle, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Julie du Page, Francisco Rabal', null, 'Ten years ago, distinguished French author Alexandre (Alain Delon) exchanged his stressful, hectic life in Paris for a more peaceful existence upon a Mexican hacienda with his wife Ariane (Marianne Denicourt). Lucien (Jean-Pierre Kalfon) also accompanies them. There, Alexandre meets the strange lady-oracle Sonia (Lauren Bacall). As the film opens, the melancholy Alexandre is visited by the sensuous actress Laure (Arielle Dombasle) and her producer Raoul Fillipi (Karl Zero) who is going to make a movie of one of Alexandre''s best-loved books. Laure is determined to play the part of the heroine and is willing to resort to seduction to get it. At the same time, Ariane is involved in a passionate affair with French-Mexican seismologist Carlo (Xavier Beauvois). While all of these characters wrangle and tangle with their different agendas, the local residents prepare for a violent revolution. ~ Sandra Brennan, Rovi', 'Ten years ago, distinguished French author Alexandre (Alain Delon) exchanged his stressful, hectic life in Paris for a more peaceful existence upon a Mexican hacienda with his wife Ariane (Marianne Denicourt). Lucien (Jean-Pierre Kalfon) also accompanies them. There, Alexandre meets the strange lady-oracle Sonia (Lauren Bacall). As the film opens, the melancholy Alexandre is visited by the sensuous actress Laure (Arielle Dombasle) and her producer Raoul Fillipi (Karl Zero) who is going to make a movie of one of Alexandre''s best-loved books. Laure is determined to play the part of the heroine and is willing to resort to seduction to get it. At the same time, Ariane is involved in a passionate affair with French-Mexican seismologist Carlo (Xavier Beauvois). While all of these characters wrangle and tangle with their different agendas, the local residents prepare for a violent revolution. ~ Sandra Brennan, Rovi', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zChEZS28CAnWclUddXil575dlOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160989'),
  ('412809622114476356', 'Day and Night', 2005, 'Drama', 'Wang Chao', 'Wang Chao', 'Liu Guancheng, Lan Wang', null, 'Set against the background of unregulated coalmining in northern China, the protagonist Guansheng must deal with an unquiet conscience when his mentor, Zhongmin, dies in a mine explosion. Zhongmin''s ghost returns with a request which motivates Guansheng out of his lethargy but which will try him to the depths of his soul. (Adelaide Film Festival)', 'Set against the background of unregulated coalmining in northern China, the protagonist Guansheng must deal with an unquiet conscience when his mentor, Zhongmin, dies in a mine explosion. Zhongmin''s ghost returns with a request which motivates Guansheng out of his lethargy but which will try him to the depths of his soul. (Adelaide Film Festival)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJ21VmPydQWSIL6CSVHiRcy6OAx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198620'),
  ('402090386493717497', 'Day Dream', 1981, 'Drama, Fantasy, Horror', 'Tetsuji Takechi', 'Tetsuji Takechi', 'Kyōko Aizome, Kei Satō, Takemi Katsushika, Saeda Kawaguchi, Sengoro Shigeyama, Taiji Tonoyama, Chieda Kawaguchi, Yuri Yau', null, 'Loosely based on a 1926 short story by Jun''ichirō Tanizaki, the film opens as an artist and a young woman are in a dentist''s waiting room. Though he is attracted to the woman, he says nothing to her. They are later in the same examining room. When he is given an anesthetic, he begins to imagine a series of scenes in which the woman undergoes various forms of sexual abuse, including rape and torture. When the artist recovers from the anesthetic, he finds clues showing that he may not have been hallucinating.', 'Loosely based on a 1926 short story by Jun''ichirō Tanizaki, the film opens as an artist and a young woman are in a dentist''s waiting room. Though he is attracted to the woman, he says nothing to her. They are later in the same examining room. When he is given an anesthetic, he begins to imagine a series of scenes in which the woman undergoes various forms of sexual abuse, including rape and torture. When the artist recovers from the anesthetic, he finds clues showing that he may not have been hallucinating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6sQ2T548m3MZF3d7ln7kjL6cOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185090'),
  ('125306158584471062', 'Day Dreaming', 2024, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Wang Zichuan, Zhang Heng, Hao Gang', 'Wang Zichuan', 'Yue Hao, Ma Qianyi, Xu Yixuan, Fang Donghai, Kimi, Zhang Hangcheng, Li Qinqin, Guo Yiqian', null, 'Zhu Tong is at the bottom of his class and is mischievous. Ten thousand fantasies appear in his little head every day. However, one day, he found that his head teacher was chasing aliens in the corridor, the flowers in the lawn could talk.', 'Zhu Tong is at the bottom of his class and is mischievous. Ten thousand fantasies appear in his little head every day. However, one day, he found that his head teacher was chasing aliens in the corridor, the flowers in the lawn could talk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRCkkj31Oa5ISxzPi7KiTgeTEnI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1136557'),
  ('649377036317512746', 'Day Dreams', 1922, 'Comedy', 'Buster Keaton, Edward F. Cline', 'Edward F. Cline, Buster Keaton', 'Buster Keaton, Renée Adorée, Joe Roberts, Joe Keaton, Edward F. Cline', null, 'In order to impress the father of a girl he is keen on, a young man goes to the city in search of work. In his letters home he writes of his various jobs which her imagination expands into much nobler ones than those that he is actually attempting.', 'In order to impress the father of a girl he is keen on, a young man goes to the city in search of work. In his letters home he writes of his various jobs which her imagination expands into much nobler ones than those that he is actually attempting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55Sjvx1iZ4Ue7Q3fBMoa8Tnn6JF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38787'),
  ('730167234373108308', 'Day in the Life of Gestapo Officer Schmidt', 1964, 'Documentary, War', 'Jerzy Ziarnik', null, 'Włodzimierz Kmicik', null, 'Constructed from the private photo album of a Gestapo officer, this short documentary juxtaposes his everyday snapshots with the captions he himself wrote. Through these images and notes, the film reveals the chilling banality of Nazi perpetrators’ lives while exposing the brutality they oversaw.', 'Constructed from the private photo album of a Gestapo officer, this short documentary juxtaposes his everyday snapshots with the captions he himself wrote. Through these images and notes, the film reveals the chilling banality of Nazi perpetrators’ lives while exposing the brutality they oversaw.', null, 'tmdb:movie:130025'),
  ('969442607176750077', 'Day Night Day Night', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Julia Loktev, Benoît Debie', 'Julia Loktev', 'Luisa Williams, Josh Philip Weinstein, Gareth Saxe, Nyambi Nyambi, Frank Dattolo, Annemarie Lawless, Teo Yoo', null, 'A 19-year-old girl prepares to become a suicide bomber in Times Square. She speaks with a nondescript American accent, and it’s impossible to pinpoint her ethnicity. We never learn why she made her decision—she has made it already.', 'A 19-year-old girl prepares to become a suicide bomber in Times Square. She speaks with a nondescript American accent, and it’s impossible to pinpoint her ethnicity. We never learn why she made her decision—she has made it already.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94tu7WApWuGtoQ0dhZPz9EE1XyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13979'),
  ('668351878328666461', 'Day of Anger', 1967, 'Western', 'Tonino Valerii, Enzo Serafin', 'Ernesto Gastaldi, Tonino Valerii, Renzo Genta', 'Giuliano Gemma, Lee Van Cleef, Walter Rilla, Ennio Balbo, Lukas Ammann, Andrea Bosic, José Calvo, Giorgio Gargiullo', null, 'A scruffy garbage boy becomes the pupil of famed gunfighter Talby, and the stage for confrontation is set when the gunman overruns the boy''s town through violence and corruption.', 'A scruffy garbage boy becomes the pupil of famed gunfighter Talby, and the stage for confrontation is set when the gunman overruns the boy''s town through violence and corruption.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TYZtE3BXP1LvktbkMb45mbd42G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56373'),
