  ('38652275818054410', 'Day of Freedom', 1935, 'Documentary', 'Leni Riefenstahl', null, 'Adolf Hitler, Rudolf Hess, Werner von Blomberg, Werner von Fritsch, Hermann Göring', null, 'The armed forces of the Third Reich, particularly the German army, are presented as an efficient system of bodies and machines at the seventh Nazi Party Rally that occurred in Nuremberg in 1935.', 'The armed forces of the Third Reich, particularly the German army, are presented as an efficient system of bodies and machines at the seventh Nazi Party Rally that occurred in Nuremberg in 1935.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWy7C8I8VQ8TFdR0aHSaE8n5Lvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99930'),
  ('89503169316522189', 'Day of Love', 1990, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Aleksandr Polynnikov, Arkadi Povzner, Eduard Goncharenko', 'Yury Manusov, Igor Poberezhsky, Grigoriy Elisavetskiy', 'Andrei Boltnev, Anna Nazaryeva, Sergey Gazarov, Andrey Smolyakov, Tatyana Bedova, Sergei Chernov, Lev Perfilov, Yuriy Chernov', null, 'In a small Russian town, a mafia boss is planning a big operation to illegally sell trucks. In order to distract police attention he orders a gang "Motalka" that works for him to commit mass acts of gang rapes in the city. One of the prospective victims is the newly elected beauty queen Christina. After the girl was raped her German father Mathias and new husband of her mother Nicolai decide to take revenge on the gang and their leaders...', 'In a small Russian town, a mafia boss is planning a big operation to illegally sell trucks. In order to distract police attention he orders a gang "Motalka" that works for him to commit mass acts of gang rapes in the city. One of the prospective victims is the newly elected beauty queen Christina. After the girl was raped her German father Mathias and new husband of her mother Nicolai decide to take revenge on the gang and their leaders...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yrkMSJZ0lg6zadYQHwqmPuP4QGu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107062'),
  ('198309781878234823', 'Day of Reckoning', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Action', 'Joel Novoa, Petr Cikhart', 'Gregory Gieras', 'Jackson Hurst, Heather McComb, Hana Hayes, Nick Gomez, Raymond J. Barry, Barbara Crampton, Randy Vasquez, Daz Crawford', null, 'Some years ago, the world experienced a "day of reckoning" when creatures came up from below and purged humanity of evil. Now, it is happening again.', 'Some years ago, the world experienced a "day of reckoning" when creatures came up from below and purged humanity of evil. Now, it is happening again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQOrFfaFTtSSmOtDCSM2EzHguOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418588'),
  ('775662870962363827', 'Day of Reckoning', 2025, 'Western, Action', 'Shaun Silva, Keith J. Leman', 'Travis J. Opgenorth', 'Zach Roerig, Billy Zane, Cara Jade Myers, Scott Adkins, Trace Adkins, Travis Hammer, Yelawolf, Struggle Jennings', 'R', 'Put-upon lawman John Dorsey is on the verge of losing his wife and his job as sheriff, so he posses up with bullish U.S. Marshall Butch Hayden to hold outlaw Emily Rusk hostage. A battle of wills ensues as Emily turns the posse on themselves, but as her marauding husband and his gang approach, Emily and John realize they will need each other to survive.', 'Put-upon lawman John Dorsey is on the verge of losing his wife and his job as sheriff, so he posses up with bullish U.S. Marshall Butch Hayden to hold outlaw Emily Rusk hostage. A battle of wills ensues as Emily turns the posse on themselves, but as her marauding husband and his gang approach, Emily and John realize they will need each other to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cVSjSQryFUERYSdOmdgJ2m0eBte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1414048'),
  ('1016146311595483506', 'Day of the Animals', 1977, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'William Girdler, Robert Sorrentino', 'William W. Norton, Eleanor E. Norton', 'Christopher George, Leslie Nielsen, Lynda Day George, Richard Jaeckel, Michael Ansara, Ruth Roman, Jon Cedar, Paul Mantee', 'PG', 'The depletion of the earth''s ozone layer causes animals above the altitude of 5000 feet to run amok, which is very unfortunate for a group of hikers who get dropped off up there by helicopter just before the quarantine is announced.', 'The depletion of the earth''s ozone layer causes animals above the altitude of 5000 feet to run amok, which is very unfortunate for a group of hikers who get dropped off up there by helicopter just before the quarantine is announced.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exMoNRUifMyFMUBnZrrghlojvHn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64976'),
  ('870383275377322959', 'Day of the Assassin', 1979, 'Drama, Action', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Leopoldo Villaseñor, Fernando Arribas', 'Robin Estridge, Robert Avard Miller', 'Chuck Connors, Susana Dosamantes, Glenn Ford, Henry Silva, Richard Roundtree, Juan Luis Galiardo, Andrés García, Jorge Rivero', 'R', 'Treasure hunters from around the world race to Mexico after a Middle Eastern luxury yacht explodes, sending a Shah''s fortune and mysterious document to the bottom of the ocean.', 'Treasure hunters from around the world race to Mexico after a Middle Eastern luxury yacht explodes, sending a Shah''s fortune and mysterious document to the bottom of the ocean.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9MHAXOlEOu6eBh3joDkNBwEpzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212437'),
  ('341285303635740881', 'Day of the Badman', 1958, 'Western', 'Irving Glassberg, Joseph E. Kenney, Harry Keller', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Fred MacMurray, Joan Weldon, John Ericson, Robert Middleton, Marie Windsor, Edgar Buchanan, Eduard Franz, Skip Homeier', 'NR', 'Judge Jim Scott must contend with the vicious relatives of a murderer he''s about to sentence...and his unfaithful fiancee.', 'Judge Jim Scott must contend with the vicious relatives of a murderer he''s about to sentence...and his unfaithful fiancee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTljeiMXLQMUUG4C8aNNi13JreP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445341'),
  ('427367093397626202', 'Day of the Cobra', 1980, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Giovanni Bergamini', 'Fabio Carpi, Aldo Lado, Tito Carpi', 'Franco Nero, Sybil Danning, Mario Maranzana, Licinia Lentini, Ennio Girolami, Mickey Knox, Massimo Vanni, Sasha D''Arc', null, 'An American narcotics agent is murdered in Italy. The head of the department decides to hire Larry Stanziani, ''The Cobra''. Larry, a former agent and now a third-rate private detective, uses the opportunity to get even with an old enemy, but soon he finds out he''s facing a relentless organization', 'An American narcotics agent is murdered in Italy. The head of the department decides to hire Larry Stanziani, ''The Cobra''. Larry, a former agent and now a third-rate private detective, uses the opportunity to get even with an old enemy, but soon he finds out he''s facing a relentless organization', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKoOABwQajO0bupoytpp3Enhc5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64739'),
  ('364977806073349453', 'Day of the Dead', 1985, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'George A. Romero, Michael Gornick', 'George A. Romero', 'Lori Cardille, Terry Alexander, Joseph Pilato, Jarlath Conroy, Anthony DiLeo Jr., Richard Liberty, Sherman Howard, Gary Klar', 'NR', 'As the world is overrun by zombies, scientists and military personnel in an underground Florida bunker must decide on how they should deal with the undead.', 'As the world is overrun by zombies, scientists and military personnel in an underground Florida bunker must decide on how they should deal with the undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bi7SO5F4VyyGQTlxQirbH1dwKzW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8408'),
  ('1126838544591974857', 'Day of the Dead', 2008, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Steve Miner, Patrick Cady, Todd Amateau', 'George A. Romero', 'Mena Suvari, Stark Sands, Michael Welch, AnnaLynne McCord, Nick Cannon, Matt Rippy, Pat Kilbane, Taylor Hoover', 'R', 'When a small Colorado town is overrun by the flesh hungry dead, a small group of survivors try to escape in a last ditch effort to stay alive.', 'When a small Colorado town is overrun by the flesh hungry dead, a small group of survivors try to escape in a last ditch effort to stay alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlQSg6FXWHzUeqLQrrbe3hyPV4X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13613'),
  ('725042330254912621', 'Day of the Dead 2: Contagium', 2005, 'Horror', 'Ana Clavell, James Glenn Dudelson', 'Ryan Carrassi', 'Laurie Baranyay, Stan Klimecko, John Freedom Henry, Justin Ipock, Julian Thomas, Stephan Wolfert, Joe C. Marino, Andreas van Ray', 'NR', 'In 1968, in the Ravenside Military Hospital in a military facility in Pennsylvania, the army loses control of an experiment of a lethal bacteriologic weapon that changes the DNA and transforms human beings into zombies. A group of soldiers is sent to the hospital to eliminate the infected staff and interns but private DeLuca steals a test tube with the virus and hides it inside a vacuum flask. He is transformed into a zombie and killed but the vacuum flask falls in the grass. In the present days, a group of patients in the mental institution Ravenside Memorial Hospital finds the vacuum flask and later when one of them opens the vessel, the culture tube drops on the floor of a bathroom contaminating the group and their Dr. Donwynn.', 'In 1968, in the Ravenside Military Hospital in a military facility in Pennsylvania, the army loses control of an experiment of a lethal bacteriologic weapon that changes the DNA and transforms human beings into zombies. A group of soldiers is sent to the hospital to eliminate the infected staff and interns but private DeLuca steals a test tube with the virus and hides it inside a vacuum flask. He is transformed into a zombie and killed but the vacuum flask falls in the grass. In the present days, a group of patients in the mental institution Ravenside Memorial Hospital finds the vacuum flask and later when one of them opens the vessel, the culture tube drops on the floor of a bathroom contaminating the group and their Dr. Donwynn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t252aGIBEpofDvQc2Imyom4IS8v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28522'),
  ('694024235882535890', 'Day of the Dead: Bloodline', 2017, 'Action, Horror', 'Hèctor Hernández Vicens, Anton Ognianov', 'Mark Tonderai, Lars Jacobson', 'Sophie Skelton, Johnathon Schaech, Cristina Serafini, Teodora Duhovnikova, Jeff Gum, Lillian Blankenship, Marcus Vanco, Lorina Kamburova', 'R', 'In a world overrun by zombies, military personnel and survivalists live in an underground bunker while they seek a cure.', 'In a world overrun by zombies, military personnel and survivalists live in an underground bunker while they seek a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3jM4C1wJxHLWlF4tcSyyv6fnJPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485415'),
  ('201146153696133863', 'Day of the Evil Gun', 1968, 'Western', 'Jerry Thorpe, W. Wallace Kelley', 'Charles Marquis Warren, Eric Bercovici', 'Glenn Ford, Arthur Kennedy, Dean Jagger, Harry Dean Stanton, John Anderson, Paul Fix, Nico Minardos, Parley Baer', 'G', 'Two men on a desperate search to save a woman only one of them could have!', 'Two men on a desperate search to save a woman only one of them could have!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9SVu8XFPFQHEvuhSrAzf96gCVzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27105'),
  ('989616422491552716', 'Day of the Fight', 1951, 'Documentary', 'Stanley Kubrick, Alexander Singer, Stanley Kubrick', null, 'Vincent Cartier, Walter Cartier, Nat Fleischer, Bobby James, Judy Singer, Stanley Kubrick, Alexander Singer, Douglas Edwards', null, 'Stanley Kubrick’s debut documentary, following Irish-American middleweight boxer Walter Cartier on April 17, 1950—the day of his bout with Bobby James. The film traces Cartier’s quiet morning rituals, training, and anxious hours before the match, culminating in his swift victory that night in Newark. Opening with a brief history of boxing, Kubrick’s tightly crafted short captures the discipline, isolation, and tension behind a fighter’s daily routine.', 'Stanley Kubrick’s debut documentary, following Irish-American middleweight boxer Walter Cartier on April 17, 1950—the day of his bout with Bobby James. The film traces Cartier’s quiet morning rituals, training, and anxious hours before the match, culminating in his swift victory that night in Newark. Opening with a brief history of boxing, Kubrick’s tightly crafted short captures the discipline, isolation, and tension behind a fighter’s daily routine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7OEwDK1Fdz8R7Xo9cDWANjiz7vH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45966'),
  ('263484779294784015', 'Day of the Fight', 2024, 'Drama', 'Peter Simonite, Jack Huston', 'Jack Huston', 'Michael Pitt, Ron Perlman, Nicolette Robinson, Joe Pesci, John Magaro, Steve Buscemi, Kaili Vernoff, Anatol Yusef', 'NR', 'On the day of his first fight since his release from prison, a once-renowned boxer embarks on a redemptive journey through his past and present.', 'On the day of his first fight since his release from prison, a once-renowned boxer embarks on a redemptive journey through his past and present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGiqb2SoM1WD3NQn3TM4CskkArC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1095435'),
  ('78965425081131818', 'Day of the Full Moon', 1998, 'Drama', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Mikhail Blinov, Tatyana Saulkina', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov', 'Anna Germ, Andrei Panin, Yelena Koreneva, Vladimir Ilin, Valeriy Priyomykhov, Valeriy Storozhik, Valery Afanasyev, Galina Anisimova', null, 'Day of the Full Moon, a series of vignettes from Russia past and present, summons the spirit of Ophuls’ La Ronde, Altman’s Nashville and Short Cuts, and the time-shifting strategies of Resnais (Mon Oncle d’Amérique) to tell provocative, connected stories illustrating the waltz of years and whim of memory. In 1948, a young man, a boy, and a waiter are captivated during the full moon by a mysterious woman in a lilac dress. The effects of this event ripple across the years, washing over more than 80 characters, including a disc jockey, a fairy princess, a gangster, Alexander Pushkin, and a nostalgic dog. But which of these are dreams, and which reality? Director Shakhnazarov continues his career-long focus on the intersection of past and present with this mysterious, exhilarating mosaic of humankind, which in the end both seduces and satisfies.', 'Day of the Full Moon, a series of vignettes from Russia past and present, summons the spirit of Ophuls’ La Ronde, Altman’s Nashville and Short Cuts, and the time-shifting strategies of Resnais (Mon Oncle d’Amérique) to tell provocative, connected stories illustrating the waltz of years and whim of memory. In 1948, a young man, a boy, and a waiter are captivated during the full moon by a mysterious woman in a lilac dress. The effects of this event ripple across the years, washing over more than 80 characters, including a disc jockey, a fairy princess, a gangster, Alexander Pushkin, and a nostalgic dog. But which of these are dreams, and which reality? Director Shakhnazarov continues his career-long focus on the intersection of past and present with this mysterious, exhilarating mosaic of humankind, which in the end both seduces and satisfies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/klvY59USdSmXXgrnfR2VWSQou53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47033'),
  ('1018896088980240165', 'Day of the Idiots', 1981, 'Drama', 'Werner Schroeter, Ivan Šlapeta', 'Dana Horaková, Werner Schroeter', 'Carole Bouquet, Ingrid Caven, Christine Kaufmann, Ida Di Benedetto, Carola Regnier, Marie-Luise Marjan, Magdalena Montezuma, Hermann Killmeyer', null, 'A woman experiences psychic disintegration and ends up in a psychiatric hospital.', 'A woman experiences psychic disintegration and ends up in a psychiatric hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDpl8Vb7uZ5nNqiESINMAZvvwys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5728'),
  ('929979951619208397', 'Day of the Outlaw', 1959, 'Western', 'André de Toth, Russell Harlan, Ralph E. Black', 'Philip Yordan', 'Robert Ryan, Burl Ives, Tina Louise, Alan Marshal, Venetia Stevenson, David Nelson, Nehemiah Persoff, Jack Lambert', null, 'Blaise Starrett is a rancher at odds with homesteaders when outlaws hold up the small town. The outlaws are held in check only by their notorious leader, but he is diagnosed with a fatal wound and the town is a powder keg waiting to blow.', 'Blaise Starrett is a rancher at odds with homesteaders when outlaws hold up the small town. The outlaws are held in check only by their notorious leader, but he is diagnosed with a fatal wound and the town is a powder keg waiting to blow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/js4P9y1gyU9bqrzE8s49gSNljQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37481'),
  ('184274070941746540', 'Day of the Panther', 1988, 'Action', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Simon Akkerman', 'Peter West', 'Edward John Stazak, John Stanton, James Richards, Michael Carman, Zale Daniel, Matthew Quartermaine, Paris Jefferson, Linda Megier', null, 'A martial-arts expert goes after a criminal gang and its boss, who were responsible for the death of his partner.', 'A martial-arts expert goes after a criminal gang and its boss, who were responsible for the death of his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTLcZW210SCAZ5fq6QKOknRm6U2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75203'),
  ('5524943713735328', 'Day of the Wacko', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marek Koterski, Jacek Bławut, Małgorzata Adamska', 'Marek Koterski', 'Marek Kondrat, Janina Traczykówna, Andrzej Grabowski, Michał Koterski, Joanna Sienkiewicz, Monika Donner-Trelińska, Aleksander Bednarz, Zbigniew Buczkowski', null, 'It is a bitter story about a middle-aged man, who hates his life and other people, including himself. Adam Miauczynski, the character known from director Marek Koterski''s previous films, is a 44 year-old teacher, who reads poetry during school lessons and later goes home swearing and calling his neighbours'' names. The worst pain for him is the next 5 minutes of living. He doesn''t accept himself and even everyday contacts with others cause his aggression. Though constantly dreaming of a romantic love, he is not bold enough to make his dreams come true. The desperate Miauczynski personalizes our own fears and obsessions, which have become so visible recently.', 'It is a bitter story about a middle-aged man, who hates his life and other people, including himself. Adam Miauczynski, the character known from director Marek Koterski''s previous films, is a 44 year-old teacher, who reads poetry during school lessons and later goes home swearing and calling his neighbours'' names. The worst pain for him is the next 5 minutes of living. He doesn''t accept himself and even everyday contacts with others cause his aggression. Though constantly dreaming of a romantic love, he is not bold enough to make his dreams come true. The desperate Miauczynski personalizes our own fears and obsessions, which have become so visible recently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzoPSY2VAbIChz3uiU6VO8uCmpH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20719'),
  ('794305752396807126', 'Day of the Warrior', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Andy Sidaris, Mark Morris, Rainer Stonus', 'Andy Sidaris', 'Kevin Light, Cristian Letelier, Julie Strain, Julie K. Smith, Shae Marks, Marcus Bagwell, Raye Hollitt, Rodrigo Obregón', 'R', 'The Legion to Ensure Total Harmony and Law (L.E.T.H.A.L.), is tracking a criminal mastermind known only as The Warrior. While investigating his combination diamond smuggling/art theft/porn production industry, the agents discover that he has cracked their secret database and has stolen the files on all of their agents. With the help of their martial arts intructor Fu, agents Tiger, Willow and Cobra take on the case while also taking every opportunity to remove their bikini tops.', 'The Legion to Ensure Total Harmony and Law (L.E.T.H.A.L.), is tracking a criminal mastermind known only as The Warrior. While investigating his combination diamond smuggling/art theft/porn production industry, the agents discover that he has cracked their secret database and has stolen the files on all of their agents. With the help of their martial arts intructor Fu, agents Tiger, Willow and Cobra take on the case while also taking every opportunity to remove their bikini tops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3wE5FmTnXIB77prY6XI0NrhC6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67396'),
  ('502411442616907906', 'Day of Wrath', 1943, 'Drama, History', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer, Karl Andersson', 'Hans Wiers-Jenssen, Paul La Cour, Poul Knudsen', 'Thorkild Roose, Lisbeth Movin, Preben Lerdorff Rye, Sigrid Neiiendam, Anna Svierkier, Albert Høeberg, Olaf Ussing, Preben Neergaard', null, 'In a Danish village in the early 1600s, a young woman named Anne, whose mother was thought to be a witch, develops sympathy toward an old woman, Marte, who is accused of witchcraft. The intervention of Anne''s older but kindly husband, Pastor Absalon saved her mother -- but now, urged on by his overbearing mother, he refuses to help Marte. When Absalon''s son returns home and is attracted to Anne, it''s a matter of time before her family destiny catches up with her.', 'In a Danish village in the early 1600s, a young woman named Anne, whose mother was thought to be a witch, develops sympathy toward an old woman, Marte, who is accused of witchcraft. The intervention of Anne''s older but kindly husband, Pastor Absalon saved her mother -- but now, urged on by his overbearing mother, he refuses to help Marte. When Absalon''s son returns home and is attracted to Anne, it''s a matter of time before her family destiny catches up with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEOqbGLFo8fxHHgYoZVTMVYMoQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41391'),
  ('340351599322513170', 'Day of Wrath', 2006, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Adrian Rudomin, Christopher Landry, Dénes Sajgál', 'Adrian Rudomin', 'Christopher Lambert, Blanca Marsillach, Brian Blessed, Szonja Oroszlán, James Faulkner, Ben O''Brien, Phyllida Law, Lukács Bicskey', 'R', 'At the height of the Spanish Inquisition, high-ranking noblemen begin dropping like flies, with alarming frequency and unexplained violence. But can local 16th-century sheriff Ruy de Mendoza discern who''s responsible when no one wants to cooperate? After all, before Mendoza can even identify the bodies, the crime scenes are mysteriously cleared - and the villagers pretend the murders never happened.', 'At the height of the Spanish Inquisition, high-ranking noblemen begin dropping like flies, with alarming frequency and unexplained violence. But can local 16th-century sheriff Ruy de Mendoza discern who''s responsible when no one wants to cooperate? After all, before Mendoza can even identify the bodies, the crime scenes are mysteriously cleared - and the villagers pretend the murders never happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrLnvAAyFngYN8YmlfI8ZH3hFg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16432'),
  ('182389437116521113', 'Day Off', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pascal Thomas, Olivier Horlait, Joseph Rapp', 'François Caviglioli, Nathalie Lafaurie, Pascal Thomas', 'Vincent Lindon, Alessandra Martines, Victoria Lafaurie, Catherine Frot, Olivier Gourmet, Anne Le Ny, Kelly Acoca, Isabelle Carré', null, 'Wednesday is the day when children are not in school and stay at home. It is also the day when the parents are not there. In Nantes, in the spring, twenty or so carefree and boisterous kids between the ages of three and eleven take advantage of this day to make their parents go crazy. Emma, 9 years old and naturally romantic, decides that Roland, the little boy she met in the street, is unhappy and persuades her friends to adopt him. Victoria spends the day with Martin Socoa, an often distant father whom she learns to love. There are also Muriel, Bruno, Colette and Henri who take off and create panic in their parents'' home, while Marylin lives the founding drama of her childhood with a mother of an unreal sweetness. Throughout these little stories, we realize that the world of children has its own logic, totally different from that of adults.', 'Wednesday is the day when children are not in school and stay at home. It is also the day when the parents are not there. In Nantes, in the spring, twenty or so carefree and boisterous kids between the ages of three and eleven take advantage of this day to make their parents go crazy. Emma, 9 years old and naturally romantic, decides that Roland, the little boy she met in the street, is unhappy and persuades her friends to adopt him. Victoria spends the day with Martin Socoa, an often distant father whom she learns to love. There are also Muriel, Bruno, Colette and Henri who take off and create panic in their parents'' home, while Marylin lives the founding drama of her childhood with a mother of an unreal sweetness. Throughout these little stories, we realize that the world of children has its own logic, totally different from that of adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZk9YrVWDjtDnkAqSsNJBHb61FK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77280'),
  ('619468825663971018', 'Day Off', 2023, 'Drama', 'Fu Tien-yu, Chang Chih-teng, Yu Hui-wen', 'Fu Tien-yu', 'Lu Hsiao-Fen, Fu Meng-po, Shih Ming-shuai, Annie Chen, Beatrice Fang, Hu Jhih-ciang, Chen Bolin, Austin Lin', null, 'A woman who has owned a barbershop for over 40 years determines to embark on a long journey to cut the hair of an old customer who has moved away and is too sick to travel.', 'A woman who has owned a barbershop for over 40 years determines to embark on a long journey to cut the hair of an old customer who has moved away and is too sick to travel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qf5IsBImXCvSiThQUnTv20suJRM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:956288'),
