  ('52729992985366830', 'Daydream of Love', 1980, 'Drama', 'Kōyū Ohara, Seisaku Kimura, Minoru Yoneda', 'Akira Nakano', 'Yoko Hatanaka, Kyoko Aoyama, Yuki Kazamatsuri, Hiroshi Ogasawara, Kenzō Ogiwara, Sumire Noguchi, Anri Nishimoto, Nami Misaki', null, 'Yoko is upset when her father remarries and begins rebelling against her new stepmother. First, this is accomplished by promiscuity and partying but eventually her schemes take a much darker turn...', 'Yoko is upset when her father remarries and begins rebelling against her new stepmother. First, this is accomplished by promiscuity and partying but eventually her schemes take a much darker turn...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ulhJUZknpk7RIt7cKiuyKwxwdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:597456'),
  ('511895452722768', 'Daydreams', 2017, 'Drama', 'Caroline Deruas', 'Caroline Deruas, Victoria Kaario, Maud Ameline', 'Clotilde Hesme, Jenna Thiam, Tchéky Karyo, Bernard Verley, Marilyne Canto, Lolita Chammah, Tanya Lopert, Filippo Timi', null, 'Axèle is a photographer, Camille is a writer. They have been awarded an arts residency at the Villa Medicis in Rome. Camille is accompanied by her husband, the famous writer Marc Landré. When a strange rivalry takes shape between them, Camille bonds with Axèle. But who is Axèle really ? A total artist, who never compromises and confuses herself with her oeuvre ? Or a ghost ? This year at the Villa Medici, where bodies and souls free themselves, no one will come out unscathed.', 'Axèle is a photographer, Camille is a writer. They have been awarded an arts residency at the Villa Medicis in Rome. Camille is accompanied by her husband, the famous writer Marc Landré. When a strange rivalry takes shape between them, Camille bonds with Axèle. But who is Axèle really ? A total artist, who never compromises and confuses herself with her oeuvre ? Or a ghost ? This year at the Villa Medici, where bodies and souls free themselves, no one will come out unscathed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m55L6882NsV2iUqNECdR64lgWUY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406848'),
  ('1065891167666871834', 'Daylight', 1996, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Rob Cohen, David Eggby, Pier Luigi Basile', 'Leslie Bohem', 'Sylvester Stallone, Amy Brenneman, Viggo Mortensen, Stan Shaw, Barry Newman, Dan Hedaya, Jay O. Sanders, Karen Young', 'PG-13', 'A group of armed robbers fleeing the police head for the New Jersey Tunnel and run right into trucks transporting toxic waste. The spectacular explosion that follows results in both ends of the tunnel collapsing and the handful of people who survived the explosion are now in peril. Kit Latura is the only man with the skill and knowledge to lead the band of survivors out of the tunnel before the structure collapses.', 'A group of armed robbers fleeing the police head for the New Jersey Tunnel and run right into trucks transporting toxic waste. The spectacular explosion that follows results in both ends of the tunnel collapsing and the handful of people who survived the explosion are now in peril. Kit Latura is the only man with the skill and knowledge to lead the band of survivors out of the tunnel before the structure collapses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bRWNxtm3q0QvIIM52uQqRIEvpl2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11228'),
  ('1089480599708889059', 'Daylight', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Diederik Van Rooijen', 'Philip Delmaar', 'Angela Schijf, Fedja van Huêt, Monique van de Ven, Derek de Lint, Maartje van de Wetering, Thijs Römer, Jaap Spijkers, Victor Löw', null, 'Young lawyer Iris discovers that she has an older, autistic half-brother Ray, who is in prison for the atrocious murder of his neighbour and her five-year-old daughter. When she meets Ray he reminds her a lot of her own son Aron, who also is autistic, and she starts to believe that he is innocent.', 'Young lawyer Iris discovers that she has an older, autistic half-brother Ray, who is in prison for the atrocious murder of his neighbour and her five-year-old daughter. When she meets Ray he reminds her a lot of her own son Aron, who also is autistic, and she starts to believe that he is innocent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypkewcUUuYerNGmrogQg18hOYQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184323'),
  ('809684406996728399', 'Daylight Robbery', 2008, 'Crime, Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Paris Leonti, Milton Kam, Alex Baily', 'Paris Leonti', 'Geoff Bell, Vas Blackwood, Xavier Anderson, Brodie Bass, Robert Boulter, Max Brown, Clair Elsmore, Antonio Gil', null, 'Alex masterminds an ambitious plan to steal millions of untraceable cash that is stacked in the underground vaults of The London Exchange Bank, waiting for its last journey, Incineration. Lucky, Matty, Terry, Chubby, Norman and Jay make up his unlikely gang of robbers. Setting up their alibi, the gang check in for a flight and join in with thousands of England supporters that are part of a mass exodus to The World Cup Tournament in Germany.', 'Alex masterminds an ambitious plan to steal millions of untraceable cash that is stacked in the underground vaults of The London Exchange Bank, waiting for its last journey, Incineration. Lucky, Matty, Terry, Chubby, Norman and Jay make up his unlikely gang of robbers. Setting up their alibi, the gang check in for a flight and join in with thousands of England supporters that are part of a mass exodus to The World Cup Tournament in Germany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/va1wc0OCPlS4EtKP8DR55hSM46c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17635'),
  ('441963671847476667', 'Daylight''s End', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'William Kaufman, Kelly Riemenschneider', 'Chad Law', 'Johnny Strong, Lance Henriksen, Louis Mandylor, Hakeem Kae-Kazim, Farah White, Gary Cairns, Heather Kafka, Mark Hanson', null, 'Years after a mysterious plague has devastated the planet and turned most of humanity into blood-hungry creatures, a rogue drifter on a vengeful hunt stumbles across a band of survivors in an abandoned police station and reluctantly agrees to try to help them defend themselves and escape to the sanctuary they so desperately need.', 'Years after a mysterious plague has devastated the planet and turned most of humanity into blood-hungry creatures, a rogue drifter on a vengeful hunt stumbles across a band of survivors in an abandoned police station and reluctantly agrees to try to help them defend themselves and escape to the sanctuary they so desperately need.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNDodM6si97uhiPhf5dTM6n6aDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399894'),
  ('483051572101150122', 'Days', 2001, 'Drama', 'Laura Muscardin, Sabrina Varani', 'Laura Muscardin, Monica Rametta, David Lombana Osorio', 'Thomas Trabacchi, Riccardo Salerno, Davide Bechini, Roberta Cartocci, Riccardo De Filippis, Sebastiano Busiri Vici, Monica Rametta, Paola Gassman', null, 'Bank manager Claudio is 35 and gay, and he''s been HIV-positive for a decade. He''s managing the illness, but his strict regimen of medicine has turned him almost robotic. His relationship with partner Dario has also grown stale. When Claudio reunites with the mysterious Andrea, an old flame, the dullness of routine is suddenly broken. But soon, Andrea''s romantic view of life tempts Claudio to engage in dangerous unprotected sex again.', 'Bank manager Claudio is 35 and gay, and he''s been HIV-positive for a decade. He''s managing the illness, but his strict regimen of medicine has turned him almost robotic. His relationship with partner Dario has also grown stale. When Claudio reunites with the mysterious Andrea, an old flame, the dullness of routine is suddenly broken. But soon, Andrea''s romantic view of life tempts Claudio to engage in dangerous unprotected sex again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sR3eedvOtgnDiTkFGnfd494BMBb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172550'),
  ('703564307309135445', 'Days', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tsai Ming-liang, Chang Jhong-yuan', 'Tsai Ming-liang', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Anong Houngheuangsy', null, 'Kang lives alone in a big house, Non in a small apartment in town. They meet, and then part, their days flowing on as before.', 'Kang lives alone in a big house, Non in a small apartment in town. They meet, and then part, their days flowing on as before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xH5M5KOm7FrGAPEqnh4zPkPfTN1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:662400'),
  ('633790194355676603', 'Days and Clouds', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Silvio Soldini, Ramiro Civita, Cinzia Castania', 'Doriana Leondeff, Francesco Piccolo, Federica Pontremoli', 'Margherita Buy, Antonio Albanese, Alba Rohrwacher, Giuseppe Battiston, Fabio Troiano, Carla Signoris, Paolo Sassanelli, Antonio Carlo Francini', null, 'Set in Genoa, the film concerns the financial struggles and emotional strain that occur after Michele loses his job. He and his wife Elsa are forced to give up their affluent lifestyle and cope with the tensions of moving into a smaller home, finding new work, and making sacrifices.', 'Set in Genoa, the film concerns the financial struggles and emotional strain that occur after Michele loses his job. He and his wife Elsa are forced to give up their affluent lifestyle and cope with the tensions of moving into a smaller home, finding new work, and making sacrifices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gMppKd5bHuc68674vJVEod7HQRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12823'),
  ('1146470947918581517', 'Days and Nights in the Forest', 1970, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Satyajit Ray, Soumendu Roy', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Soumitra Chatterjee, Samit Bhanja, Subhendu Chatterjee, Sharmila Tagore, Pahadi Sanyal, Kaberi Bose, Simi Garewal, Rabi Ghosh', null, 'Four friends from Calcutta who have very different personalities make a holiday excursion into the country, to a tiny village in the state of Bihar where they set themselves up in a bungalow. A series of minor events, all connected to their respective reactions to their new environment, reveals their characters more deeply.', 'Four friends from Calcutta who have very different personalities make a holiday excursion into the country, to a tiny village in the state of Bihar where they set themselves up in a bungalow. A series of minor events, all connected to their respective reactions to their new environment, reveals their characters more deeply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJvcIMaFXK77AQ934AZ4PpA19nT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35867'),
  ('483722973430094224', 'Days of ''36', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Giorgos Arvanitis, Vasilis Hristomoglou', 'Theo Angelopoulos, Thanasis Valtinos, Stratis Karras', 'Kostas Pavlou, Thanos Grammenos, Giorgos Kyritsis, Petros Zarkadis, Christoforos Nezer, Toula Stathopoulou, Christos Kalavrouzos, Vasilis Tsaglos', null, 'The assassin of a prominent trade unionist takes a conservative MP hostage, throwing the government into a state of disarray.', 'The assassin of a prominent trade unionist takes a conservative MP hostage, throwing the government into a state of disarray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1lWv7XNnZ2ckqcJyGVmdNcw52p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114645'),
  ('584921888503421540', 'Days of Being Wild', 1990, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Christopher Doyle, Johnnie Kong', 'Wong Kar-Wai, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Leslie Cheung, Maggie Cheung, Andy Lau, Carina Lau, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Rebecca Pan, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Hung Ling-Ling', 'NR', 'Yuddy, a Hong Kong playboy known for breaking girls'' hearts, tries to find solace and truth after discovering the woman who raised him isn''t his mother.', 'Yuddy, a Hong Kong playboy known for breaking girls'' hearts, tries to find solace and truth after discovering the woman who raised him isn''t his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/acfLUO8E61u0ooWS6htbzTHDBcI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18311'),
  ('527388100135633631', 'Days of Darkness', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Denys Arcand, Guy Dufaux, Marc Larose', 'Denys Arcand', 'Marc Labrèche, Sylvie Léonard, Diane Kruger, Caroline Néron, Rufus Wainwright, Macha Grenon, Emma de Caunes, Didier Lucien', null, 'Jean-Marc is a man without qualities living in times that are out of joint. His wife and children ignore him; he''s a mid-level government functionary in Montreal doing his job without care. He has an active imagination of sexual conquest, but his only real feelings come when he visits his aged mother, whose health is failing. When his wife leaves abruptly to work in Toronto, Jean-Marc sets out to reorder things with his daughters, his social life, and at work. In a world that at best is a farce, does he stand a chance?', 'Jean-Marc is a man without qualities living in times that are out of joint. His wife and children ignore him; he''s a mid-level government functionary in Montreal doing his job without care. He has an active imagination of sexual conquest, but his only real feelings come when he visits his aged mother, whose health is failing. When his wife leaves abruptly to work in Toronto, Jean-Marc sets out to reorder things with his daughters, his social life, and at work. In a world that at best is a farce, does he stand a chance?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/syTfHveVRGPre7TT2D60UmQ8L2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24173'),
  ('472418411598925849', 'Days of Eclipse', 1988, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Aleksandr Sokurov, Aleksandr Burov, Sergey Yurizditskiy', 'Yuriy Arabov, Pyotr Kadochnikov', 'Aleksei Ananishnov, Eskender Umarov, Irina Sokolova, Vladimir Zamanskiy, Kirill Dudkin, Aleksey Yankovskiy, Viktor Belovolskiy, Sergei Krylov', null, 'This bleak late soviet-era drama follows the career of Malyanov, a young medical school graduate who has been sent to work in Turkmenia. Here he runs into a hodge-podge of people of differing ethnicities, all of them victims of the government''s earlier mania for relocating and eliminating whole ethnic groups and classes of people. These desperately unhappy people are unable to find any pleasure in this diverse companionship, but instead are antagonistic to it, and often resort to desperate measures in their doomed attempts to ease their pain.', 'This bleak late soviet-era drama follows the career of Malyanov, a young medical school graduate who has been sent to work in Turkmenia. Here he runs into a hodge-podge of people of differing ethnicities, all of them victims of the government''s earlier mania for relocating and eliminating whole ethnic groups and classes of people. These desperately unhappy people are unable to find any pleasure in this diverse companionship, but instead are antagonistic to it, and often resort to desperate measures in their doomed attempts to ease their pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EyzManpOnDf0vK5aXjjrvOVi7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45886'),
