  ('1132231808670273792', 'Days of Hope', 1940, 'Drama, War', 'André Malraux, Louis Page, Boris Peskine', 'Antonio del Amo', 'Andrés Mejuto, Nicolás Rodríguez, José María Lado, Miguel del Castillo, Pedro Codina, Serafín Ferro, Julio Peña, José Sempere', null, 'Spanish Civil War, 1937. A platoon of Republican soldiers plans to stop the advance of the rebel troops by bombing a bridge on the road to Zaragoza, near the city of Linás. With the close collaboration of the peasants of the area, the soldiers try to overcome the continuous bombardments and endure the harsh and tireless opposition of the powerful enemy…', 'Spanish Civil War, 1937. A platoon of Republican soldiers plans to stop the advance of the rebel troops by bombing a bridge on the road to Zaragoza, near the city of Linás. With the close collaboration of the peasants of the area, the soldiers try to overcome the continuous bombardments and endure the harsh and tireless opposition of the powerful enemy…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wedXLgoUdMoni4gwzQcqCgg92Mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219924'),
