  ('721253526915046924', 'Daytime Drinking', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Noh Young-seok', 'Noh Young-seok', 'Song Sam-dong, Sang-yeop Yuk, Kang-hee Kim, Seong-joon Tak, Soo-an Yoon, Yoon Kyung-ho, Lee Do-hee, Ka-on Kim', null, 'Hyuk-jin has just broken up with his girlfriend and decides to take a trip to Jeongseon in the province of Gangwon-do. The next day, his friends are too hung over to get up, so Hyuk-jin makes his way to his destination alone. A trip of opportunity takes a cruel and unexpected turn as misunderstanding and crossed paths occur over and over again.', 'Hyuk-jin has just broken up with his girlfriend and decides to take a trip to Jeongseon in the province of Gangwon-do. The next day, his friends are too hung over to get up, so Hyuk-jin makes his way to his destination alone. A trip of opportunity takes a cruel and unexpected turn as misunderstanding and crossed paths occur over and over again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ujDGE5eP9DOWzg52soheUAQL0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35821'),
  ('211478655343994220', 'Daytime Shooting Star', 2017, 'Romance', 'Takehiko Shinjo, Masashige Nakanishi', 'Naoko Adachi', 'Mei Nagano, Shohei Miura, Alan Shirahama, Maika Yamamoto, Ryuta Sato, Naomi Nishida, Onodera Akira', null, 'Fifteen-year-old country girl Suzume Yosano has to move to Tokyo to live with her uncle due to her father''s transfer. She bumps into a mysterious man who ends up taking her to her uncle''s place after she gets lost. Turns out, Suzume will be seeing him a lot more often once she starts school because... he''s her homeroom teacher?!', 'Fifteen-year-old country girl Suzume Yosano has to move to Tokyo to live with her uncle due to her father''s transfer. She bumps into a mysterious man who ends up taking her to her uncle''s place after she gets lost. Turns out, Suzume will be seeing him a lot more often once she starts school because... he''s her homeroom teacher?!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/laijmNN64UKXnOdtM45cTsm3Bo8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433950'),
  ('350933296619058308', 'Dazed and Confused', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lee Daniel, Richard Linklater, John Cameron', 'Richard Linklater', 'Jason London, Matthew McConaughey, Joey Lauren Adams, Rory Cochrane, Wiley Wiggins, Adam Goldberg, Anthony Rapp, Sasha Jenson', 'R', 'The adventures of a group of Texas teens on their last day of school in 1976, centering on student Randall Floyd, who moves easily among stoners, jocks and geeks. Floyd is a star athlete, but he also likes smoking weed, which presents a conundrum when his football coach demands he sign a "no drugs" pledge.', 'The adventures of a group of Texas teens on their last day of school in 1976, centering on student Randall Floyd, who moves easily among stoners, jocks and geeks. Floyd is a star athlete, but he also likes smoking weed, which presents a conundrum when his football coach demands he sign a "no drugs" pledge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msG9awbLhVZwv1Eh9Ge7SofMexW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9571'),
