  ('161515019046263758', 'DC 9/11: Time of Crisis', 2003, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Brian Trenchard-Smith, Alison Reid, Ousama Rawi', 'Lionel Chetwynd', 'Timothy Bottoms, John Cunningham, David Fonteno, Gregory Itzin, Penny Johnson Jerald, Stephen Macht, Mary Gordon Murray, Lawrence Pressman', null, 'This is the story of the days directly after 9/11, and the president''s whereabouts. Scheduled to air shortly before the second anniversary of the September 11 attacks, DC 9/11 takes an inside look at the Bush Administration, beginning with the day of the attacks, and following the President''s journey to Ground Zero, culminating with his now famous national address nine days after the attacks.', 'This is the story of the days directly after 9/11, and the president''s whereabouts. Scheduled to air shortly before the second anniversary of the September 11 attacks, DC 9/11 takes an inside look at the Bush Administration, beginning with the day of the attacks, and following the President''s journey to Ground Zero, culminating with his now famous national address nine days after the attacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofQ3wDd5D4Xjr3e3WVv2DXcEHFR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207705'),
  ('890265625795697239', 'DC Down', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jay Mattson, Geoff Meed, Jake Jalbert', 'Geoff Meed', 'Jack Pearson, Sean Young, Kayla Fields, Terry Woodberry, Eric Roberts, Geoff Meed, Jesse Tayeh, Alexandra Vaughan', null, 'After an earthquake rocks D.C., the Army Corp races against the clock to rescue the President trapped under the rubble while a sinister plot aims to capitalize on the disaster.', 'After an earthquake rocks D.C., the Army Corp races against the clock to rescue the President trapped under the rubble while a sinister plot aims to capitalize on the disaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DyAgM340pP402ABl1Jt0uQ7tgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1085543'),
