  ('694948623708986078', 'DC League of Super-Pets', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Sam Levine, Jared Stern', 'John Whittington, Jared Stern', 'Dwayne Johnson, Kevin Hart, John Krasinski, Keanu Reeves, Kate McKinnon, Vanessa Bayer, Natasha Lyonne, Diego Luna', 'PG', 'When Superman and the rest of the Justice League are kidnapped, Krypto the Super-Dog must convince a rag-tag shelter pack - Ace the hound, PB the potbellied pig, Merton the turtle and Chip the squirrel - to master their own newfound powers and help him rescue the superheroes.', 'When Superman and the rest of the Justice League are kidnapped, Krypto the Super-Dog must convince a rag-tag shelter pack - Ace the hound, PB the potbellied pig, Merton the turtle and Chip the squirrel - to master their own newfound powers and help him rescue the superheroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qpPMewlugFaejXjz4YNDnpTniFX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539681'),
  ('228178045279020609', 'DC Showcase - Batman: Death in the Family', 2020, 'Animation, Action', 'Brandon Vietti', 'Judd Winick, Brandon Vietti', 'Bruce Greenwood, Vincent Martella, John DiMaggio, Zehra Fazal, Gary Cole, Kimberly Brooks, Nolan North, Nick Carson', 'R', 'Tragedy strikes the Batman''s life again when Robin Jason Todd tracks down his birth mother only to run afoul of the Joker. An adaptation of the 1988 comic book storyline of the same name.', 'Tragedy strikes the Batman''s life again when Robin Jason Todd tracks down his birth mother only to run afoul of the Joker. An adaptation of the 1988 comic book storyline of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k8Q9ulyRE8fkvZMkAM9LPYMKctb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618353'),
  ('391987210785969816', 'DC Showcase - Constantine: The House of Mystery', 2022, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Matt Peters', 'Ernie Altbacker', 'Matt Ryan, Ray Chase, Robin Atkin Downes, Grey DeLisle, Camilla Luddington, Damian O''Hare, Lou Diamond Phillips', 'R', 'John Constantine wakes up in the eerie House of Mystery with no recollection of how he got there. Fortunately, Zatanna and his friends are all there. Unfortunately, they have a bad habit of turning into demons and ripping him to shreds, over and over again!', 'John Constantine wakes up in the eerie House of Mystery with no recollection of how he got there. Fortunately, Zatanna and his friends are all there. Unfortunately, they have a bad habit of turning into demons and ripping him to shreds, over and over again!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3FQYSzptYZJRvp9yGVDxoTfE0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791348'),
  ('999399537590160731', 'DC Showcase: Adam Strange', 2020, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Butch Lukic', 'J. M. DeMatteis', 'Charlie Weber, Roger Cross, Kimberly Brooks, Ray Chase, Fred Tatasciore', 'PG-13', 'On a rugged asteroid mining colony, few of the toiling workers are aware that their town drunk was ever anything but an interplanetary derelict. But when the miners open a fissure into the home of a horde of deadly alien insects, his true identity is exposed. He is space adventurer Adam Strange, whose heroic backstory is played out in flashbacks as he struggles to save the very people who have scorned him for so long.', 'On a rugged asteroid mining colony, few of the toiling workers are aware that their town drunk was ever anything but an interplanetary derelict. But when the miners open a fissure into the home of a horde of deadly alien insects, his true identity is exposed. He is space adventurer Adam Strange, whose heroic backstory is played out in flashbacks as he struggles to save the very people who have scorned him for so long.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUDA8NrPtyV9xP6a0n4ZH4NhVD0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618350'),
