  ('520820715106665687', 'DC Showcase: Kamandi: The Last Boy on Earth!', 2021, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Matt Peters', 'Paul Giacoppo', 'Cameron Monaghan, Steve Blum, Adam Gifford, Armen Taylor', null, 'Kamandi and his friends Prince Tuftan of the Tiger Kingdom and humanoid mutant Ben Boxer are kidnapped by a gorilla cult dedicated to finding the reincarnation of their god, The Mighty One. Golgan, the cult’s leader, puts Kamandi’s team through a series of deadly tests to find if any of them know the secret of … The Mighty One.', 'Kamandi and his friends Prince Tuftan of the Tiger Kingdom and humanoid mutant Ben Boxer are kidnapped by a gorilla cult dedicated to finding the reincarnation of their god, The Mighty One. Golgan, the cult’s leader, puts Kamandi’s team through a series of deadly tests to find if any of them know the secret of … The Mighty One.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDebLQqHbrxN6S6wAchaH0GabZT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791343'),
  ('200673289280019546', 'DC Showcase: Sgt. Rock', 2019, 'Action, War, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Matthew Girardi, Han Cheong Il, Bruce Timm', 'Tim Sheridan, Louise Simonson, Walt Simonson', 'Karl Urban, Keith Ferguson, William Salyers, Audrey Wasilewski', 'PG-13', 'Just after recovering from losing his entire unit in battle, Sgt. Rock leads a special army of commandos against a Nazi secret research base.', 'Just after recovering from losing his entire unit in battle, Sgt. Rock leads a special army of commandos against a Nazi secret research base.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/unKs4vcDibIgRKyveOTwiBX6bBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618346'),
  ('332547842734038219', 'DC Showcase: The Losers', 2021, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Action, Adventure', 'Milo Neuman', 'Tim Sheridan', 'Ming-Na Wen, Eugene Byrd, Dave B. Mitchell, Martin Sensmeier, Dean Winters', null, 'The legendary rag-tag team of World War II outcasts – Captain Storm, Johnny Cloud, “Mile-a Minute” Jones, rookie Gunner and Sarge – find themselves marooned on an uncharted island in the South Pacific that is completely overrun with dinosaurs! Their would-be ally on this deadly mission, the mysterious and beautiful Fan Long of the Chinese Security Agency, tells them their job is to rescue the scientists that have been sent to study the time/space anomaly. Perhaps… but what is her mission?', 'The legendary rag-tag team of World War II outcasts – Captain Storm, Johnny Cloud, “Mile-a Minute” Jones, rookie Gunner and Sarge – find themselves marooned on an uncharted island in the South Pacific that is completely overrun with dinosaurs! Their would-be ally on this deadly mission, the mysterious and beautiful Fan Long of the Chinese Security Agency, tells them their job is to rescue the scientists that have been sent to study the time/space anomaly. Perhaps… but what is her mission?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m63tjpijO5bWXIoAm26YKy5xY6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791344'),
