  ('950358235688664922', 'De forbandede år - Fredens pris', 2026, 'Drama', 'Anders Refn', 'Jesper Christensen, Anders Refn', 'Mads Reuther, Bodil Jørgensen, Sara Viktoria, Jesper Christensen', null, 'After the war, the authorities seek punishment against Karl Skov, and his family is more divided than ever.', 'After the war, the authorities seek punishment against Karl Skov, and his family is more divided than ever.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FvmuTmGg292b8xdijEMO8NwvjzGj.jpg', 'plex:movie:de-forbandede-ar-fredens-pris'),
  ('637657809837045948', 'De Gaulle', 2020, 'History, Drama', 'Jean-Marie Dreujou, Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Valérie Ranson-Enguiale, Gabriel Le Bomin', 'Lambert Wilson, Isabelle Carré, Olivier Gourmet, Laurent Stocker, Gilles Cohen, Philippe Laudenbach, Tim Hudson, Andrew Bicknell', null, 'Paris, June 1940. The de Gaulle couple is confronted with the military and political collapse of France. Charles de Gaulle joins London while Yvonne, his wife, finds herself with her three children on the road of the exodus.', 'Paris, June 1940. The de Gaulle couple is confronted with the military and political collapse of France. Charles de Gaulle joins London while Yvonne, his wife, finds herself with her three children on the road of the exodus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/riglPR73CUgNdnNqZ47LWKmad7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661804'),
  ('549331274923704752', 'De Gaulle, histoire d''un géant', 2020, 'Documentary, History', 'Jean-Pierre Cottet', 'Jean-Pierre Cottet, Éric Roussel, Patrick Duhamel', 'Bernard Farcy, Denis Podalydès', null, '50 years after the death of General De Gaulle, this film retraces his life, from his birth in 1890 to his burial at Colombey-Les-Deux-Eglises in 1970.', '50 years after the death of General De Gaulle, this film retraces his life, from his birth in 1890 to his burial at Colombey-Les-Deux-Eglises in 1970.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JWQBPsnRoFrVruznzStgcxZpsj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760861'),
  ('544664525873833156', 'De guerre lasse', 2014, 'Drama', 'Olivier Panchot, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Olivier Panchot', 'Jalil Lespert, Tchéky Karyo, Hiam Abbass, Mhamed Arezki, Sabrina Ouazani, Jean-Marie Winling, Olivier Rabourdin, Abraham Belaga', 'R', 'Alex, the son of a gang boss from Marseilles, joins the French Foreign Legion to avoid a hit put out on him by the Corsican Mafia. Four years later, Alex deserts and returns to Marseilles to get back together with Katia, his former girlfriend. But in the city, relationships have changed...', 'Alex, the son of a gang boss from Marseilles, joins the French Foreign Legion to avoid a hit put out on him by the Corsican Mafia. Four years later, Alex deserts and returns to Marseilles to get back together with Katia, his former girlfriend. But in the city, relationships have changed...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mWPzdtr9bVCfkYtSpMXo7VKUnHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292218'),
  ('437662903441063820', 'De Humani Corporis Fabrica', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Lucien Castaing-Taylor, Juliette Picollot, Véréna Paravel', 'Lucien Castaing-Taylor, Véréna Paravel', null, null, 'An extraordinary adventure through the interior of the human body; or the discovery of an alien landscape of unprecedented beauty.', 'An extraordinary adventure through the interior of the human body; or the discovery of an alien landscape of unprecedented beauty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRpD1hUR40Z0so0BAw7cSCrbshN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721232'),
  ('762609051803491633', 'De mauvaise foi', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Albéric Saint-Martin', 'Yves Mathonat, Hubert de Torcy', 'Pascal Demolon, Philippe Duquesne, Herrade Von Meier, Gabriella Wright, Jean-Baptiste Lafarge, François-David Cardonnel, Evelyne Buyle, Karine Dubernet', null, 'An old-fashioned notary must save his dilapidated castle and prevent his daughter from marrying a pretentious golden boy. The fortune promised by a dying countess to a young bohemian artist could solve all his problems. Provided that the future heir becomes a good Catholic and falls in love with the pretty fiancée.', 'An old-fashioned notary must save his dilapidated castle and prevent his daughter from marrying a pretentious golden boy. The fortune promised by a dying countess to a young bohemian artist could solve all his problems. Provided that the future heir becomes a good Catholic and falls in love with the pretty fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lyCsaVPE9DpLB2g7xL91pRwfOm5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1355089'),
  ('317478170999998754', 'De miel et de sang', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery, Crime, TV Movie', 'Lou Jeunet, Sylvie Duluc', 'Marc Eisenchteter, Thomas Luntz', 'Nicolas Gob, Léa François, Éva Darlan, Kim Higelin, Selma Kouchy, Sarah Saidi, Baptiste Perais', null, 'After 20 years of absence, Captain Fred Carel returns to the small town of Provence where he grew up. With Sara, his former high school friend who became a lieutenant in the local Gendarmerie, he must investigate Antoine Bernier''s death.', 'After 20 years of absence, Captain Fred Carel returns to the small town of Provence where he grew up. With Sara, his former high school friend who became a lieutenant in the local Gendarmerie, he must investigate Antoine Bernier''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlONMTdc0clnx4gS1XdI9gWX0K0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024409'),
  ('75479490826946599', 'De Nuremberg à Nuremberg', 1989, 'History, Documentary, War', 'Frédéric Rossif', null, 'Philippe Meyer', null, 'Frédéric Rossif and Philippe Meyer draw the terrible fresco of the Second World War of the rise of Hitler and the Nazi party until his ultimate defeat (1933-1945). While carefully describing the sequence of events, they go back to the genesis of fascism, and the picture they draw from this first half of the twentieth century is both lucid and frightening. A page of history illustrated by a large number of unpublished documents.', 'Frédéric Rossif and Philippe Meyer draw the terrible fresco of the Second World War of the rise of Hitler and the Nazi party until his ultimate defeat (1933-1945). While carefully describing the sequence of events, they go back to the genesis of fascism, and the picture they draw from this first half of the twentieth century is both lucid and frightening. A page of history illustrated by a large number of unpublished documents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQMBAEQNq1qhsRCZbOkGG5tTtgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61760'),
  ('830698380371783050', 'De Onde Eu Te Vejo', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Luiz Villaça, Alexandre Ermel', 'Rafael Gomes, Leonardo Moreira, Luiz Villaça', 'Denise Fraga, Domingos Montagner, Manoela Aliperti, Marisa Orth, Fúlvio Stefanini, Marcello Airoldi, Laura Cardoso, Juca de Oliveira', null, 'After 20 years of marriage, Ana Lúcia and her husband Fábio decide to get a divorce. Fábio, however, decides to move to an apartment across the street, in front of the window of his former apartment - where Lúcia still lives. Both will have to learn how to deal with job crisis, problems with their daughter and this whole new situation.', 'After 20 years of marriage, Ana Lúcia and her husband Fábio decide to get a divorce. Fábio, however, decides to move to an apartment across the street, in front of the window of his former apartment - where Lúcia still lives. Both will have to learn how to deal with job crisis, problems with their daughter and this whole new situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3dbErPyvo8D1NSsoQVpvja8sC0l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291211'),
