  ('928367618740279019', 'De sicario a Youtuber', 2018, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Alvaro Perea Chacón', null, 'John Jairo Velásquez', null, 'Pablo Escobar''s former hitman John Jairo Velásquez turns to YouTube to share his story and seek forgiveness for the hundreds of murders he committed.', 'Pablo Escobar''s former hitman John Jairo Velásquez turns to YouTube to share his story and seek forgiveness for the hundreds of murders he committed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RyLW9VR8pf1oRbVHvR9Ky1WGPX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:519771'),
  ('320428002899336318', 'De-Lovely', 2004, 'Drama, Music', 'Irwin Winkler, Andrew Grant, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Jay Cocks', 'Kevin Kline, Ashley Judd, Jonathan Pryce, Kevin McNally, Sandra Nelson, Allan Corduner, Peter Polycarpou, Keith Allen', 'PG-13', 'From Paris to Venice to Broadway to Hollywood, the lives of Cole Porter and his wife, Linda Lee Thomas were never less than glamorous and wildly unconventional. And though Cole''s thirst for life strained their marriage, Linda never stopped being his muse, inspiring some of the greatest songs of the twentieth century.', 'From Paris to Venice to Broadway to Hollywood, the lives of Cole Porter and his wife, Linda Lee Thomas were never less than glamorous and wildly unconventional. And though Cole''s thirst for life strained their marriage, Linda never stopped being his muse, inspiring some of the greatest songs of the twentieth century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/QBqiBQW7MGqlDSyvid4fKzS0Xz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15237'),
  ('679871469550705306', 'Dead', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Hayden J. Weal, Tammy Williams', 'Hayden J. Weal, Tom Sainsbury', 'Michael Hurst, Cameron Rhodes, Tom Sainsbury, Jennifer Ward-Lealand, Jess Sayer, Hayden J. Weal, Tomai Ihaia, Zak Enayat', null, 'Dane ‘Marbles’ Marbeck can see ghosts, thanks to a homemade drug: his late father’s neurological medication mixed with marijuana. Officer Jayson Tagg, a wannabe super-cop on the trail of a serial killer, ends up murdered. So when Marbles’ mum plans to sell the family farm, and the only way of buying the house off her is taking the money offered by Tagg in exchange for his help, Marbles accepts. The unlikely duo of stoner medium and ghost cop struggle to reconcile their differences while they navigate their way through ghouls, perverts, a mysterious hooded figure, and an unexpected shot at love. It becomes clear the only way Marbles and Tagg will solve the case with their souls intact is to confront their deepest regrets and overcome their prejudices.', 'Dane ‘Marbles’ Marbeck can see ghosts, thanks to a homemade drug: his late father’s neurological medication mixed with marijuana. Officer Jayson Tagg, a wannabe super-cop on the trail of a serial killer, ends up murdered. So when Marbles’ mum plans to sell the family farm, and the only way of buying the house off her is taking the money offered by Tagg in exchange for his help, Marbles accepts. The unlikely duo of stoner medium and ghost cop struggle to reconcile their differences while they navigate their way through ghouls, perverts, a mysterious hooded figure, and an unexpected shot at love. It becomes clear the only way Marbles and Tagg will solve the case with their souls intact is to confront their deepest regrets and overcome their prejudices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eu40V59ULl92GIWfRGLAuzu5EYb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726239'),
  ('635834663996232827', 'Dead & Breakfast', 2004, 'Horror, Comedy, Music', 'David Scardina, Matthew Leutwyler', 'Matthew Leutwyler', 'Jeremy Sisto, Erik Palladino, Bianca Lawson, Osgood Perkins, Ever Carradine, Gina Philips, Zach Selwyn, Miranda Bailey', 'R', 'Six friends on a road trip stop for the night at a bed and breakfast in the sleepy town of Lovelock. After a night that leaves both the inn''s owner and chef dead, the gang finds themselves under suspicion by the local sheriff. But that''s only the beginning as nearly all of the town''s quirky residents become possessed by an evil spirit and pin down the friends inside the B&B.', 'Six friends on a road trip stop for the night at a bed and breakfast in the sleepy town of Lovelock. After a night that leaves both the inn''s owner and chef dead, the gang finds themselves under suspicion by the local sheriff. But that''s only the beginning as nearly all of the town''s quirky residents become possessed by an evil spirit and pin down the friends inside the B&B.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A10Ce0fJ4RvVvTGm2mbvG08Nc7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21838'),
  ('735590178144199684', 'Dead & Buried', 1981, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Gary Sherman, Brian E. Frankish, Andrew A. Ackerman', 'Dan O''Bannon, Ronald Shusett', 'James Farentino, Melody Anderson, Jack Albertson, Dennis Redfield, Nancy Locke, Lisa Blount, Robert Englund, Bill Quinn', 'R', 'After a series of gory murders commited by mobs of townspeople against visiting tourists, the corpses appear to be coming back to life and living normally as locals in the small town.', 'After a series of gory murders commited by mobs of townspeople against visiting tourists, the corpses appear to be coming back to life and living normally as locals in the small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMZD57u1M9TQAKf12OYUUcv9hjn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24274'),
  ('920111525655243852', 'Dead 7', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror, Western', 'Danny Roew, Eric Gustavo Petersen, Dylan Vox', 'Sawyer Perry', 'Nick Carter, Carrie Keagan, Joey Fatone, AJ McLean, Howie Dorough, Lauren Kitt Carter, Chris Kirkpatrick, Jeff Timmons', null, 'A ragtag group of gunslingers try to make their way in a post-apocalyptic world. The twist to this world is that it’s just not barren and dangerous, it’s also filled with flesh-eating zombies. The gunslingers will find themselves stranded in a town and forced to make a choice on either to save the citizens of the town or save themselves.', 'A ragtag group of gunslingers try to make their way in a post-apocalyptic world. The twist to this world is that it’s just not barren and dangerous, it’s also filled with flesh-eating zombies. The gunslingers will find themselves stranded in a town and forced to make a choice on either to save the citizens of the town or save themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Lbr89rVnLHfp8zXVKiuM4gia3V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:384450'),
  ('1129974788309367371', 'Dead Again', 1991, 'Mystery, Drama, Crime, Thriller, Romance', 'Kenneth Branagh, Matthew F. Leonetti, Steve Danton', 'Scott Frank', 'Kenneth Branagh, Emma Thompson, Derek Jacobi, Andy Garcia, Wayne Knight, Robin Williams, Richard Easton, Jo Anderson', 'R', 'In 1949, composer Roman Strauss is executed for the murder of his wife. In 1990s Los Angeles, a detective comes across a mute amnesiac woman who is somehow linked to the Strauss murder.', 'In 1949, composer Roman Strauss is executed for the murder of his wife. In 1990s Los Angeles, a detective comes across a mute amnesiac woman who is somehow linked to the Strauss murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irEnDVtxox6gnRJuwtEZuxvl2vZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11498'),
  ('844179984336950956', 'Dead Again', 2025, 'Thriller, Romance, Mystery', 'Son Hyeon-woo, Kim Jin-hyeong', null, 'Kim Tae-jin, Seo Rina, Yoo Mi, Danny Lee, 손동제', null, 'Min-hyeok and Hae-ji, Seon-woong and Mi-mi, who came on a couple''s trip to Vietnam, are very excited. Min-hyeok also enjoys a thrilling secret meeting with his wife Hae-ji as well as Mi-mi, who has been in a long-term relationship, and has a satisfying time. However, Min-hyeok suddenly feels intense pain and stops breathing, and when he opens his eyes thinking he is going to die, it is his first day in Vietnam. Min-hyeok, who is confused about everything, finds out that there is a reason for the vacation that ends in death...', 'Min-hyeok and Hae-ji, Seon-woong and Mi-mi, who came on a couple''s trip to Vietnam, are very excited. Min-hyeok also enjoys a thrilling secret meeting with his wife Hae-ji as well as Mi-mi, who has been in a long-term relationship, and has a satisfying time. However, Min-hyeok suddenly feels intense pain and stops breathing, and when he opens his eyes thinking he is going to die, it is his first day in Vietnam. Min-hyeok, who is confused about everything, finds out that there is a reason for the vacation that ends in death...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqSmb9ugb8xK6avZ3Wglxue39N8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1466120'),
  ('522873056974782669', 'Dead Again in Tombstone', 2017, 'Western, Action, Fantasy, Horror', 'Rolf Dekens, Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné', 'Roel Reiné, Ethan Wiley', 'Danny Trejo, Jake Busey, Elysia Rotaru, Nathaniel Arcand, Dean McDermott, Elizabeth Lavender, Peter Skagen, Joe Norman Shaw', 'R', 'The devil’s outlaw and reluctant servant, Guerrero returns from the dead again in this action-packed western which promises to be one hell of a ride. Guerrero is forced to protect a stolen relic from getting into the hands of Jackson Boomer and his gang of soldiers, but Jackson will stop at nothing to raise his comrades from the dead and bring the wrath of hell upon earth. Guerrero must use all his dark powers in order to defeat Jackson and find redemption…or die again trying.', 'The devil’s outlaw and reluctant servant, Guerrero returns from the dead again in this action-packed western which promises to be one hell of a ride. Guerrero is forced to protect a stolen relic from getting into the hands of Jackson Boomer and his gang of soldiers, but Jackson will stop at nothing to raise his comrades from the dead and bring the wrath of hell upon earth. Guerrero must use all his dark powers in order to defeat Jackson and find redemption…or die again trying.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzwvAzM6TSgIlcD2HdKFVTw8TYO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473165'),
  ('100249463947690236', 'Dead Air', 2009, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Corbin Bernsen, Eric Gustavo Petersen, Dre Hanna', 'Kenny Yakkel', 'Bill Moseley, Patricia Tallman, Navid Negahban, David Moscow, Joshua Feinman, Lakshmi Manchu, Federico Dordei, Susan Ruttan', 'R', 'Logan Burnhardt is the ego-king of the airwaves, but his unflappable persona is put to the test when a terrorist bio-attack unleashes a plague of flesh-ripping maniacs on Los Angeles.', 'Logan Burnhardt is the ego-king of the airwaves, but his unflappable persona is put to the test when a terrorist bio-attack unleashes a plague of flesh-ripping maniacs on Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayDKmDhDTpGeLhsTWWYYkyLEwvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24963'),
  ('783540498067573046', 'Dead and Alive: The Race for Gus Farace', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Peter Markle, Mark Irwin', 'Dick Beebe', 'Tony Danza, Ted Levine, Samuel L. Jackson, Dan Lauria, Frank Vincent, Joe Lisi, James Rebhorn, Nicholas Turturro', null, 'Both sides of the law hunt Costabile ''Gus'' Farace for slaying a federal drug agent in 1989 New York.', 'Both sides of the law hunt Costabile ''Gus'' Farace for slaying a federal drug agent in 1989 New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLr7YOqq3R1LPhyJKhUR7PQafDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124269'),
  ('968642427231518078', 'Dead and Deader', 2006, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Patrick Dinhut', null, 'Dean Cain, Susan Ward, Guy Torry, Natassia Malthe, Armin Shimerman, John Billingsley, Dean Haglund, Ellie Cornell', 'NR', 'Lt. Bobby Quinn is a Special Forces commando killed during a recon mission in the Cambodian jungle. But when Quinn interrupts his own stateside autopsy, he discovers that the rest of his dead squad has been resurrected with a ravenous apetite for human flesh. Now with the help of a wisecracking cook and a sexy film geek, the part-zombie Quinn must stop the plague before it can infect the entire nation. Who holds the shocking secret behind this blood-crazed carnage? And what happens when Quinn stops gnawing on raw steak and starts chomping on the hot chick?', 'Lt. Bobby Quinn is a Special Forces commando killed during a recon mission in the Cambodian jungle. But when Quinn interrupts his own stateside autopsy, he discovers that the rest of his dead squad has been resurrected with a ravenous apetite for human flesh. Now with the help of a wisecracking cook and a sexy film geek, the part-zombie Quinn must stop the plague before it can infect the entire nation. Who holds the shocking secret behind this blood-crazed carnage? And what happens when Quinn stops gnawing on raw steak and starts chomping on the hot chick?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZpdTgpd1teT2J3H9b5SXKuMjFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43085'),
  ('314505053323387097', 'Dead Ant', 2017, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Marc Carter, Ron Carlson', 'Ron Carlson', 'Tom Arnold, Rhys Coiro, Jake Busey, Leisha Hailey, Cameron Richardson, Sydney Sweeney, Danny Woodburn, Joi Liaye', 'NR', 'When the 1989 "one-hit-wonder" glam-metal band "Sonic Grave" embark on a trip to Coachella in hopes of a comeback, their peyote trip pit stop in Joshua Tree incites an "unworldly" vicious attack, and they must "rock" themselves out of harms way.', 'When the 1989 "one-hit-wonder" glam-metal band "Sonic Grave" embark on a trip to Coachella in hopes of a comeback, their peyote trip pit stop in Joshua Tree incites an "unworldly" vicious attack, and they must "rock" themselves out of harms way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NoqvEpApbcnSWFpbHAswOYufSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480923'),
  ('485643808218238165', 'Dead Are Countless', 1969, 'Western', 'Rafael Romero Marchent', 'Giovanni Scolaro, Joaquín Romero Marchent', 'Anthony Steffen, Solvi Stübing, Raf Baldassarre, Frank Braña, José Bódalo, Antonio Molino Rojo, María Salerno, Peter Lee Lawrence', null, 'Johnny was mentally traumatised when he witnessed as a child the killing of his father (a deserter) by a group of soldiers. As an adult he randomly kills every soldier he gets hold of, so that the army sends out the brutish Lieutenant Garringo to stop Johnny.', 'Johnny was mentally traumatised when he witnessed as a child the killing of his father (a deserter) by a group of soldiers. As an adult he randomly kills every soldier he gets hold of, so that the army sends out the brutish Lieutenant Garringo to stop Johnny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsF8GXV1hwsT67M7uHczXflzJ5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147589'),
  ('700579208906529350', 'Dead Awake', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Phillip Guzman, Dominique Martinez, Robin Conly', 'Jeffrey Reddick', 'Jocelin Donahue, Jesse Bradford, Jesse Borrego, Lori Petty, James Eckhouse, Mona Lee Fultz, Brea Grant, A.J. Gutierrez', 'NR', 'Kate Bowman (Jocelin Donahue) is an average social worker who, after the sudden death of her twin sister, is investigating the mysterious deaths of other people who died in their sleep. Shortly before their deaths, the victims all reported a supernatural force that appeared to them while they were suffering from sleep paralysis. When Kate investigates further into the case, she opens herself up to the creature''s wrath and soon finds herself and her family suffering from an ancient evil.', 'Kate Bowman (Jocelin Donahue) is an average social worker who, after the sudden death of her twin sister, is investigating the mysterious deaths of other people who died in their sleep. Shortly before their deaths, the victims all reported a supernatural force that appeared to them while they were suffering from sleep paralysis. When Kate investigates further into the case, she opens herself up to the creature''s wrath and soon finds herself and her family suffering from an ancient evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2962UpmXU2flDWCQj9ImeHfWXRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406107'),
  ('476280649104479852', 'Dead Bang', 1989, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Gerry Fisher, John Frankenheimer, James Dyer', 'Robert Foster, John Frankenheimer', 'Don Johnson, Penelope Ann Miller, William Forsythe, Bob Balaban, Frank Military, Tate Donovan, Mickey Jones, Stephen E. Miller', 'R', 'Los Angeles homicide detective Jerry Beck searches for the murderer who killed a police officer on Christmas Eve. The investigation takes Beck inside the violent world of hate groups and white supremacists, who are hatching a deadly plot to attack even more innocent people. Beck must also confront his own personal demons, including his growing problem with alcohol, if he wants to track down and stop the violent neo-Nazis before it is too late.', 'Los Angeles homicide detective Jerry Beck searches for the murderer who killed a police officer on Christmas Eve. The investigation takes Beck inside the violent world of hate groups and white supremacists, who are hatching a deadly plot to attack even more innocent people. Beck must also confront his own personal demons, including his growing problem with alcohol, if he wants to track down and stop the violent neo-Nazis before it is too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqi8hxYEuPfdVJZ6Kxu3jOKUf8S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4925'),
  ('94914288069721632', 'Dead Before Dawn', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Charles Correll, Jerry G. Callaway', null, 'Cheryl Ladd, Jameson Parker, G.W. Bailey, Kim Coates, Matt Clark, Keone Young, Stanley Anderson, Hope Lange', 'R', 'Based upon a true story. Wife with young family finds life becoming unbearable with her successful, but violent and abusive, husband. After filing for divorce, she quickly learns that her husband, through fear of his personal life embarrassing his clients, has commissioned an assassin to murder her before going to court. Unfortunately, for him, the hired assassin turns out to be an FBI agent. The FBI convince her that she must “pretend” to have been murdered in order to prove her husband’s involvement.', 'Based upon a true story. Wife with young family finds life becoming unbearable with her successful, but violent and abusive, husband. After filing for divorce, she quickly learns that her husband, through fear of his personal life embarrassing his clients, has commissioned an assassin to murder her before going to court. Unfortunately, for him, the hired assassin turns out to be an FBI agent. The FBI convince her that she must “pretend” to have been murdered in order to prove her husband’s involvement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Gbxc4YY67mYYmiYNE0Rw0tScJJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238458'),
  ('899313279202646382', 'Dead Before Dawn', 2012, 'Adventure, Comedy, Horror', 'April Mullen, Daniel Grant', 'Tim Doiron', 'Devon Bostick, Martha MacIsaac, Christopher Lloyd, Brandon Jay McLaren, Brittany Allen, Kyle Schmid, Tim Doiron, April Mullen', 'R', 'A bunch of college kids accidentally unleash an evil curse that causes people to kill themselves and turn into Zombie Demons, aka ZEMONS!', 'A bunch of college kids accidentally unleash an evil curse that causes people to kill themselves and turn into Zombie Demons, aka ZEMONS!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eg33AUKUsnGuX5LCe1OMTSJdIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135579'),
  ('874405376353143462', 'Dead Birds', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Western', 'Steve Yedlin, Nicholas Lee, Lou Chanatry', 'Simon Barrett', 'Henry Thomas, Patrick Fugit, Michael Shannon, Nicki Aycox, Isaiah Washington, Mark Boone Junior, Muse Watson, Donna Biscoe', 'R', 'Towards the end of the Civil War, a group of Confederate soldiers hole up on an abandoned plantation after robbing a bank, and find themselves at the mercy of supernatural forces.', 'Towards the end of the Civil War, a group of Confederate soldiers hole up on an abandoned plantation after robbing a bank, and find themselves at the mercy of supernatural forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xB1qpndocvnS23qIv0F7OqYZLpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19592'),
  ('718590321641931261', 'Dead Bodies', 2003, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Donal Gilligan, Robert Quinn', 'Derek Landy', 'Andrew Scott, Katy Davis, Kelly Reilly, Darren Healy, Eamonn Owens, Jer O''Leary, Des Nealon, Gerard McSorley', null, 'The return of a vengeful ex-girlfriend sets into motion a series of gruesome events for a hapless Irish bachelor in director Robert Quinn''s grim black comedy. Tommy (Andrew Scott) had thought he had seen the last of Jean (Katy Davis) after their recent breakup, but when she returns to stake her claim on Tommy''s apartment, the confrontation that ensues makes their previous quarrels look petty by comparison. After leaving the apartment in the head of the fight to cool his head and gather his thoughts, he returns only to find that Jean has died and enlists the aid of his friend Noel (Darren Healy) in ditching the body and ensuring that no one ever finds out what happened.', 'The return of a vengeful ex-girlfriend sets into motion a series of gruesome events for a hapless Irish bachelor in director Robert Quinn''s grim black comedy. Tommy (Andrew Scott) had thought he had seen the last of Jean (Katy Davis) after their recent breakup, but when she returns to stake her claim on Tommy''s apartment, the confrontation that ensues makes their previous quarrels look petty by comparison. After leaving the apartment in the head of the fight to cool his head and gather his thoughts, he returns only to find that Jean has died and enlists the aid of his friend Noel (Darren Healy) in ditching the body and ensuring that no one ever finds out what happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apGKZgD3eCuMcyg1pLRmEM7W1Tp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64797'),
  ('1016904137434713236', 'Dead by Dawn', 1998, 'Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'James Salisbury, Pierre Chemaly', 'Stephen Downing', 'Shannon Tweed, Bill Ferrell, Ted Prior, Jodie Fisher, Ron Robbins, Cassandra Gava, John Timmons, Robin Joi Brown', null, 'Manipulation and seduction lead to blackmail, deception, and before long, a brutal murder.', 'Manipulation and seduction lead to blackmail, deception, and before long, a brutal murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/byTKO3lowOZ00XjRtHSvLL5Ej7R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28599'),
  ('301590904957622124', 'Dead Calm', 1989, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Phillip Noyce, Dean Semler, Vincent Monton', 'Terry Hayes', 'Nicole Kidman, Sam Neill, Billy Zane, George Shevtsov, Rod Mullinar, Joshua Tilden, Michael Long, Lisa Collins', 'R', 'An Australian couple takes a sailing trip in the Pacific to get over the recent loss of their son. While on the open sea, they come across a sinking ship with one survivor who is not at all what he seems.', 'An Australian couple takes a sailing trip in the Pacific to get over the recent loss of their son. While on the open sea, they come across a sinking ship with one survivor who is not at all what he seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXpav86ZX5N1YIfVfVtzuZLNrjW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10493'),
  ('1132704401988924561', 'Dead Daughters', 2007, 'Drama, Horror', 'Pavel Ruminov, Vitaliy Ershov, Egor Surovtsev', 'Pavel Ruminov', 'Ekaterina Shcheglova, Mikhail Dementyev, Nikita Emshanov, Dasha Charusha, Ravshana Kurkova, Artyom Semakin, Ivan Volkov, Elena Morozova', null, 'In present-day Moscow ghosts of three little girls killed by their insane mother randomly pick a person to watch over for a three days. If during this "probation period" person''s moral standards appear not to be high enough The Daughters then kill him using telekinesis.', 'In present-day Moscow ghosts of three little girls killed by their insane mother randomly pick a person to watch over for a three days. If during this "probation period" person''s moral standards appear not to be high enough The Daughters then kill him using telekinesis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2vhOrSsrqZL5trWUTdku0cPPk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97797'),
  ('890343466740371677', 'Dead Driver', 2019, 'Horror, Action', 'Brahim Achabbakhe, Wych Kaosayananda', 'Steve Poirier', 'Mark Dacascos, Julie Condra, Noelani Dacascos, Jeremy Stutes, Adam Zachary Smith, Charlie Ruedpokanon, Michael S. New, Milena Gorum', 'R', 'After a plague of the undead decimates human life on Earth, a former hit man (Mark Dacascos), his wife, and daughter live quietly in a survivalist compound. But when their base is attacked, a massive explosion summons a swarm of the undead. They escape and must seek out the Haven, a rumored sanctuary up north, while the father teaches his daughter to shoot, drive, and survive before time runs out.', 'After a plague of the undead decimates human life on Earth, a former hit man (Mark Dacascos), his wife, and daughter live quietly in a survivalist compound. But when their base is attacked, a massive explosion summons a swarm of the undead. They escape and must seek out the Haven, a rumored sanctuary up north, while the father teaches his daughter to shoot, drive, and survive before time runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cCO26pPZDnZ4SRuqV2cwyuDKBfs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:648043'),
  ('53137189858583994', 'Dead Earth', 2020, 'Action, Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Wych Kaosayananda, Wych Kaosayananda', 'Steve Poirier', 'Milena Gorum, Alice Tantayanon, Michael S. New, Brian Migliore', 'R', 'Two young women''s plans to try to live a normal life in isolation after a world ending apocalypse go awry when they are discovered.', 'Two young women''s plans to try to live a normal life in isolation after a world ending apocalypse go awry when they are discovered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTEY7mDBVwYnByLJaJKcC4areCG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667177'),
