  ('635754633510868606', 'Dead End Run', 2003, 'Thriller, Action, Music', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Masami Inomoto, Akihiro Onodera', 'Gakuryu Ishii, Junko Uratsuji', 'Tadanobu Asano, Yūsuke Iseya, Masatoshi Nagase, Urara Awata, Mikako Ichikawa, Robert Harris, Jun Kunimura, Yoji Tanaka', null, 'A collection of three short films by Japanese visual genius Sogo Ishii. Each short focuses on the protagonists running away from a threat.', 'A collection of three short films by Japanese visual genius Sogo Ishii. Each short focuses on the protagonists running away from a threat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmbQyXa5LhhKnvLrzIXBikl0tZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104283'),
