  ('13155466504716139', 'Dead Fish', 2005, 'Thriller, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Charley Stadler, Fraser Taggart', 'Adam Kreutner, David Mitchell', 'Gary Oldman, Robert Carlyle, Anouska Bolton Lee, Cassandra Bell, Kevin McNally, Elena Anaya, Andrew-Lee Potts, Iddo Goldberg', 'R', 'Gary Oldman is Lynch, a strangely charming hit man in this explosively funny dark comedy in the tradition of Snatch and Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels. With an all-star cast including Terence Stamp, Elena Anaya, Robert Carlyle and Billy Zane, Dead Fish is a chaotic tale of criminals looking for love, money and revenge that will have you falling out of your chair laughing!', 'Gary Oldman is Lynch, a strangely charming hit man in this explosively funny dark comedy in the tradition of Snatch and Lock, Stock and Two Smoking Barrels. With an all-star cast including Terence Stamp, Elena Anaya, Robert Carlyle and Billy Zane, Dead Fish is a chaotic tale of criminals looking for love, money and revenge that will have you falling out of your chair laughing!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0CV2soSYdDU4h9k2liEKYxXGRq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19059'),
  ('94204727740880146', 'Dead for a Dollar', 2022, 'Western, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Walter Hill, Lloyd Ahern II, Carly James', 'Walter Hill', 'Christoph Waltz, Willem Dafoe, Rachel Brosnahan, Hamish Linklater, Benjamin Bratt, Guy Burnet, Brandon Scott, Scott Peat', 'R', 'In 1897, veteran bounty hunter Max Borlund is deep into Mexico where he encounters professional gambler and outlaw Joe Cribbens — a sworn enemy he sent to prison years before. Max is on a mission to find and return Rachel Kidd, the wife of a wealthy businessman, who as the story is told to Max, has been abducted by Buffalo Soldier Elijah Jones. Max is ultimately faced with a showdown to save honor.', 'In 1897, veteran bounty hunter Max Borlund is deep into Mexico where he encounters professional gambler and outlaw Joe Cribbens — a sworn enemy he sent to prison years before. Max is on a mission to find and return Rachel Kidd, the wife of a wealthy businessman, who as the story is told to Max, has been abducted by Buffalo Soldier Elijah Jones. Max is ultimately faced with a showdown to save honor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1AnXfjxFqMsQmUPSvt9YxUJhfFw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843380'),
  ('836655154061040404', 'Dead Girls', 1990, 'Horror', 'Aaron Schneider, Dennis Devine', 'Steve Jarvis', 'Diana Karanikas, Angela Eads, Kay Schaber, Angela Scaglione, Steven Kyle, Deirdre West, Jeff Herbick, David Chatfield', null, 'A female band, who are exponents of "death rock", retreat to a cabin for the weekend. They soon find themselves being knocked off by a masked killer who uses weapons they have mentioned in their songs.', 'A female band, who are exponents of "death rock", retreat to a cabin for the weekend. They soon find themselves being knocked off by a masked killer who uses weapons they have mentioned in their songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ideRgY1k5bRVKtMjrK8FheRkGxr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119558'),
  ('387605216277357190', 'Dead Heart', 2016, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Mariano Cattaneo, Facundo Nuble', 'Sergio Salgueiro', 'Ariadna Asturzzi, Ana Padilla, Germán Baudino, Leandro Cóccaro, Galit Gurovich, Chucho Fernández, Hernán Márquez, Ana Nieves Ventura', null, 'Two men kidnap the daughter of businesswoman Claudia Villegas. They take her out of the city and keep her locked up, while awaiting further instructions. The boss realizes that Villegas'' daughter was never kidnapped and sends two men to the abandoned factory to clarify what happened. Upon arrival, they find the girl, hooded, and tied to a chair. There''s no clue of the kidnappers either. Slowly, someone appears - they say that the heart can not feel once it''s stopped beating', 'Two men kidnap the daughter of businesswoman Claudia Villegas. They take her out of the city and keep her locked up, while awaiting further instructions. The boss realizes that Villegas'' daughter was never kidnapped and sends two men to the abandoned factory to clarify what happened. Upon arrival, they find the girl, hooded, and tied to a chair. There''s no clue of the kidnappers either. Slowly, someone appears - they say that the heart can not feel once it''s stopped beating', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofIlxxMYI9pCfqrbkzSusWp9Z9n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421888'),
  ('848159415042261685', 'Dead Heat', 1988, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Action, Thriller, Comedy', 'Mark Goldblatt, Robert D. Yeoman, Mike Topoozian', 'Terry Black', 'Treat Williams, Joe Piscopo, Lindsay Frost, Darren McGavin, Vincent Price, Robert Picardo, Martha Quinn, Keye Luke', 'R', 'Detective Roger Mortis is killed in action while investigating a string of mysterious robberies: until he''s brought back from the dead with a chemical company''s secret re-animation technology. Now he has twelve hours to solve the case of his own death before he dies: And stays dead.', 'Detective Roger Mortis is killed in action while investigating a string of mysterious robberies: until he''s brought back from the dead with a chemical company''s secret re-animation technology. Now he has twelve hours to solve the case of his own death before he dies: And stays dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jBtDMQrXpHlyuJImTAs6Oexv7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40095'),
  ('902863460362449033', 'Dead Heat on a Merry-Go-Round', 1966, 'Crime, Thriller, Comedy', 'Bernard Girard, Lionel Lindon', 'Bernard Girard', 'James Coburn, Camilla Sparv, Aldo Ray, Nina Wayne, Robert Webber, Rose Marie, Todd Armstrong, Marian McCargo', null, 'A sophisticated con man mounts an intricate plan to rob an airport bank while the Soviet premier is due to arrive.', 'A sophisticated con man mounts an intricate plan to rob an airport bank while the Soviet premier is due to arrive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeEBscu9u7fFaqp62zhvLUW4JX2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68979'),
  ('927177838137556666', 'Dead Heist', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Matt Malloy, Katarzyna ''Kait'' Malec, Bo Webb', 'Anghus Houvouras, Eric Tomosunas, Bo Webb', 'Big Daddy Kane, E-40, Brandon Xavier, Dominic L. Santana, Thunderbird Dinwiddie, Bone Crusher, Zach Hanner, D.J. Naylor', 'R', 'Four friends plan the perfect small town bank heist, but choose the wrong night. Their plans go horribly wrong when vampiric zombies attack the town and trap them in the bank. Can they escape with the money and their lives?', 'Four friends plan the perfect small town bank heist, but choose the wrong night. Their plans go horribly wrong when vampiric zombies attack the town and trap them in the bank. Can they escape with the money and their lives?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts3Cu8LCeC3HR1jrr22OMOwYZNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47436'),
  ('154825918983053564', 'Dead Hooker in a Trunk', 2009, 'Horror', 'Sylvia Soska, Jen Soska, Loyd Bateman', 'Sylvia Soska, Jen Soska', 'Rikki Gagne, Jen Soska, Sylvia Soska, CJ Wallis, Loyd Bateman, Tasha Moth, Carlos Gallardo, John Tench', null, 'Set in beautiful Vancouver, four friends set out on an everyday errand and end up in a fight for their lives when they discover the body of a dead hooker left in their trunk.', 'Set in beautiful Vancouver, four friends set out on an everyday errand and end up in a fight for their lives when they discover the body of a dead hooker left in their trunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0JZJVkmPWm6ilytwVpAA09h7wA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65214'),
  ('416803443060528123', 'Dead Horizons', 1951, 'Drama', 'Jacques Demy', null, 'Jacques Demy', null, 'Jacques Demy''s first surviving live-action project. A man alone in his crumbling apartment recalls being left by his girl for another man.', 'Jacques Demy''s first surviving live-action project. A man alone in his crumbling apartment recalls being left by his girl for another man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugHD4En27OCdlQW6LSCDmFYqJT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:265023'),
  ('220039282929232958', 'Dead Horse Nebula', 2018, 'Drama', 'Tarık Aktaş, Necmettin Akdeniz', 'Tarık Aktaş', 'Barış Bilgi, Ali Yavuz Ilman, Ömer Bora, Serkan Aydın, Dilara Topuklular', null, 'When Hay was seven years old, he found a dead horse in an open field and watched his father and other adults struggle to get rid of it. Unsure of this memory, he is nonetheless very influenced by this incident and, when he cuts himself during a sacrificial rite, everything comes flashing back. Step by step, Hay goes down an inevitable and spiritual path where he confronts the relationship between human and nature, the unity of matter and the living.', 'When Hay was seven years old, he found a dead horse in an open field and watched his father and other adults struggle to get rid of it. Unsure of this memory, he is nonetheless very influenced by this incident and, when he cuts himself during a sacrificial rite, everything comes flashing back. Step by step, Hay goes down an inevitable and spiritual path where he confronts the relationship between human and nature, the unity of matter and the living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHo9PhtW3gGkQfq0sr2xTE3uD6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537961'),
  ('868701164165694454', 'Dead in 3 Days', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Slama, Andreas Prochaska, Werner Schöttke', 'Andreas Prochaska, Thomas Baum', 'Sabrina Reiter, Michael Steinocher, Laurence Rupp, Nadja Vogel, Karl Fischer, Michou Friesz, Ines Honsel, Amelie Jarolim', null, 'When Nina and her high school friends receive eerie text messages declaring that they will all die within three days, they dismiss it as a hokey prank - until one by one, the pals start turning up dead in the alpine countryside. With the cops stymied, Nina and her remaining friends must scour their past for clues to identify the madman before he kills them all.', 'When Nina and her high school friends receive eerie text messages declaring that they will all die within three days, they dismiss it as a hokey prank - until one by one, the pals start turning up dead in the alpine countryside. With the cops stymied, Nina and her remaining friends must scour their past for clues to identify the madman before he kills them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OqDWRgUDtrkLZ57RwyMz8NzV81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1256'),
  ('354217364581671103', 'Dead in 3 Days 2', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Andreas Prochaska', 'Agnes Pluch', 'Sabrina Reiter, Andreas Kiendl, Anna Rot, Martin Loos, Julia Rosa Peer, Philipp Rudig', null, 'One year ago, Nina survived the attacks of a serial killer. She wants to flee from these memories but one call at night recalls all memories and she is again in the middle of a murder mystery.', 'One year ago, Nina survived the attacks of a serial killer. She wants to flee from these memories but one call at night recalls all memories and she is again in the middle of a murder mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LCpdUNXsakvVz5rHlUseEd6EDt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35060'),
  ('983958663416511317', 'Dead in a Week (Or Your Money Back)', 2018, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Tom Edmunds, Luke Bryant', 'Tom Edmunds', 'Aneurin Barnard, Tom Wilkinson, Freya Mavor, Christopher Eccleston, Marion Bailey, Velibor Topic, Nigel Lindsay, Gethin Anthony', 'R', 'William has failed to kill himself so many times that he outsources his suicide to aging assassin Leslie. But with the contract signed and death assured within a week (or his money back), William suddenly discovers reasons to live... However Leslie is under pressure from his boss to make sure the contract is completed.', 'William has failed to kill himself so many times that he outsources his suicide to aging assassin Leslie. But with the contract signed and death assured within a week (or his money back), William suddenly discovers reasons to live... However Leslie is under pressure from his boss to make sure the contract is completed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4ANVEuEaGy2oP5M0Y2P1dwxUNn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468219'),
  ('742394888224081085', 'Dead in the Water', 2002, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Gustavo Lipsztein, Marcelo Durst', 'Gustavo Lipsztein', 'Henry Thomas, Dominique Swain, Scott Bairstow, Sebastian DeVicente, José Wilker, Renata Fronzi, Lavínia Vlasak', 'R', 'Young, rich, and randy Gloria takes the family motorboat for some fun in the sun off the coast of Brazil. Along with her are her longtime boyfriend Danny, his best friend Jeff, and the son of an important and infinitely influential client, Marcos. It probably wasn''t a good idea to take three gorgeous men the same age out on a boat with a bikini-clad beauty who lately has been questioning her relationship with her main squeeze, but it gets even worse than expected. There''s tragedy, betrayal, and more tragedy as the faulty value systems of the wealthy brats spin out of control.', 'Young, rich, and randy Gloria takes the family motorboat for some fun in the sun off the coast of Brazil. Along with her are her longtime boyfriend Danny, his best friend Jeff, and the son of an important and infinitely influential client, Marcos. It probably wasn''t a good idea to take three gorgeous men the same age out on a boat with a bikini-clad beauty who lately has been questioning her relationship with her main squeeze, but it gets even worse than expected. There''s tragedy, betrayal, and more tragedy as the faulty value systems of the wealthy brats spin out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVlR6kUBuPNikk7AMDv75hmD5YQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127016'),
  ('992095250854963016', 'Dead in the Water', 2018, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Sheldon Wilson', 'Nikohl Boosheri, Christia Visser, Tanya van Graan, Amy Louise Wilson, Brandon Auret, Nicole Fortuin, Skye Russell, Bianca Simone Mannie', 'PG-13', 'The Nereus is a fifty-year-old Ice Breaker, salvaged by an idealistic crew on a mission to catch illegal fisherman. On chase, the crew find themselves well off-course and bearing down on a body mysteriously floating in the middle of the Devil’s Sea. Superstitious or not, the team soon discovers they’ve rescued a deadly creature feeding on the lifeless body. Their new mission—kill or be killed and preferably before they hit land.', 'The Nereus is a fifty-year-old Ice Breaker, salvaged by an idealistic crew on a mission to catch illegal fisherman. On chase, the crew find themselves well off-course and bearing down on a body mysteriously floating in the middle of the Devil’s Sea. Superstitious or not, the team soon discovers they’ve rescued a deadly creature feeding on the lifeless body. Their new mission—kill or be killed and preferably before they hit land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evn7F3Y04GI2NGiQ4L08wYgVBND.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551910'),
  ('287779666769713645', 'Dead in Tombstone', 2013, 'Western, Action, Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Roel Reiné, Roel Reiné, Elena Ioana', 'Brendan Cowles, Shane Kuhn', 'Danny Trejo, Mickey Rourke, Anthony Michael Hall, Dina Meyer, Richard Dillane, Ronan Summers, James Carroll Jordan, Cătălina Grama', 'R', 'An outlaw named Guerrero Hernandez is shot in the back and killed whilst attempting to free his half-brother from a small-town prison. Making a deal with the devil, Hernandez returns from the dead to take his revenge.', 'An outlaw named Guerrero Hernandez is shot in the back and killed whilst attempting to free his half-brother from a small-town prison. Making a deal with the devil, Hernandez returns from the dead to take his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWQfInQkauNbyZRQRxbM7IXm3DF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151933'),
  ('617000106476015556', 'Dead Leaves', 2004, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Crime, Science Fiction', 'Hiroyuki Imaishi, Fusanobu Fujiyama, Hiroyuki Imaishi', 'Takeichi Honda', 'Kappei Yamaguchi, Takako Honda, Mitsuo Iwata, Kiyoyuki Yanada, Nobuo Tobita, Wataru Takagi, Yuko Mizutani, Eiji Takemoto', null, 'Pandy and Retro awaken naked on Earth with no recollection of their past. They embark on a crime spree in search of food and clothing, but are captured by authorities and sent to the infamous lunar penitentiary named Dead Leaves.', 'Pandy and Retro awaken naked on Earth with no recollection of their past. They embark on a crime spree in search of food and clothing, but are captured by authorities and sent to the infamous lunar penitentiary named Dead Leaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jpsqSocm0o978PRChacBoTlTida.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15981'),
  ('153554354301812394', 'Dead Like Me: Life After Death', 2009, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Stephen Herek, Bruce Chun', 'John Masius, Stephen Godchaux', 'Ellen Muth, Jasmine Guy, Callum Blue, Sarah Wynter, Britt McKillip, Christine Willes, Cynthia Stevenson, Henry Ian Cusick', 'R', 'When George and her colleagues get a new boss whose focus is on moving souls quickly and enjoying life without consequences, the team begins to break the strict reaper rules. While her friends fall victim to their desires for money, success, and fame, George breaks another rule by revealing her true identity to her living family.', 'When George and her colleagues get a new boss whose focus is on moving souls quickly and enjoying life without consequences, the team begins to break the strict reaper rules. While her friends fall victim to their desires for money, success, and fame, George breaks another rule by revealing her true identity to her living family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekzGiwleJbx0ei1R3s0ylowFKT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14849'),
  ('898325507960250554', 'Dead Lover', 2026, 'Horror, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Grace Glowicki, Rhayne Vermette, Austin Birtch', 'Grace Glowicki, Ben Petrie', 'Grace Glowicki, Ben Petrie, Leah Doz', null, 'A lonely gravedigger who stinks of corpses finally meets her dream man, but their whirlwind affair is cut short when he tragically drowns at sea. Grief-stricken, she goes to morbid lengths to resurrect him through madcap experiments.', 'A lonely gravedigger who stinks of corpses finally meets her dream man, but their whirlwind affair is cut short when he tragically drowns at sea. Grief-stricken, she goes to morbid lengths to resurrect him through madcap experiments.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FmbvP4f6BU923NGfqjpOJcJih3i6.jpg', 'plex:movie:dead-lover-2026'),
  ('793782094219506723', 'Dead Mail', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Music, Mystery, Horror', 'Kyle McConaghy, Joe DeBoer, Robyn Griffin', 'Joe DeBoer, Kyle McConaghy', 'Sterling Macer Jr., John Fleck, Tomas Boykin, Micki Jackson, Susan Priver, Sean Heyman, Nick Heyman, Micah Fitzgerald', null, 'An ominous help note finds its way to a 1980s post office, connecting a dead letter investigator to a kidnapped keyboard technician.', 'An ominous help note finds its way to a 1980s post office, connecting a dead letter investigator to a kidnapped keyboard technician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZultpdnzuCDAouwDs5ZYdkGGgT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1229915'),
  ('690431919310132825', 'Dead Man', 1995, 'Drama, Fantasy, Western', 'Robby Müller, Jim Jarmusch, Constance L. Hoy', 'Jim Jarmusch', 'Johnny Depp, Gary Farmer, Crispin Glover, Lance Henriksen, Michael Wincott, Eugene Byrd, John Hurt, Robert Mitchum', 'R', 'On the run after committing murder, an accountant encounters a strange Native American man who prepares him for his journey into the spiritual world.', 'On the run after committing murder, an accountant encounters a strange Native American man who prepares him for his journey into the spiritual world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jX3wGBVoYoAY3IixBpwYk1fjT4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922'),
  ('337983178640478495', 'Dead Man', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery', 'Hah Jun-won, Kim Dong-young, Kim Hyeong-yong', 'Hah Jun-won', 'Cho Jin-woong, Kim Hee-ae, Lee Soo-kyung, Park Ho-san, Sooyoung Choi, Jeon Moo-song, Choi Jae-woong, Lee Si-hoon', null, 'Lee Man-jae at his brink of life, even sold his name to survive. In the world of ruthless barge where no one can be trusted, he held out a threadlike-life with a calculation ability. One day, he decides to retire for his soon-to-be-born child and takes on the big final commission. The moment he thought that everything was going smoothly, he was framed for embezzlement of $100M due to his unidentified ‘investor’ and faced his own obituary. A political consultant, Mrs. Shim, appears to Man-jae when he is trapped in a hellish private prison and lives as a ‘dead man’, offering a deal with his life as collateral. Man-jae accepts the offer to regain his name, family, and life.', 'Lee Man-jae at his brink of life, even sold his name to survive. In the world of ruthless barge where no one can be trusted, he held out a threadlike-life with a calculation ability. One day, he decides to retire for his soon-to-be-born child and takes on the big final commission. The moment he thought that everything was going smoothly, he was framed for embezzlement of $100M due to his unidentified ‘investor’ and faced his own obituary. A political consultant, Mrs. Shim, appears to Man-jae when he is trapped in a hellish private prison and lives as a ‘dead man’, offering a deal with his life as collateral. Man-jae accepts the offer to regain his name, family, and life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vT3qs3UILUrS8Y16Dzd5xpCpU60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:865511'),
  ('523448765318512113', 'Dead Man Down', 2013, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Niels Arden Oplev, Paul Cameron', 'J. H. Wyman', 'Colin Farrell, Noomi Rapace, Terrence Howard, Dominic Cooper, Isabelle Huppert, Luis Da Silva, Jr., John Cenatiempo, Stuart Bennett', 'R', 'In New York City, a crime lord''s right-hand man is seduced by a woman seeking retribution.', 'In New York City, a crime lord''s right-hand man is seduced by a woman seeking retribution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xWo2WE36JdBwlCmwvXM4bb5rBg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102362'),
  ('976967732743214683', 'Dead Man on Campus', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Alan Cohn, John Thomas, Linda Montanti', 'Michael Traeger, Mike White', 'Tom Everett Scott, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Poppy Montgomery, Lochlyn Munro, Randy Pearlstein, Corey Page, Alyson Hannigan, Mari Morrow', 'R', 'Two college roommates venture out to identify a fellow student, who is most likely to commit suicide as it will help them pass the semester.', 'Two college roommates venture out to identify a fellow student, who is most likely to commit suicide as it will help them pass the semester.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTr7ARy7lj8ggvg6snLWDo3CnEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14557'),
  ('520319562041500644', 'Dead Man Running', 2009, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Alex De Rakoff, Ali Asad, Fraser Fennell-Ball', 'Alex De Rakoff, John Luton', '50 Cent, Tamer Hassan, Danny Dyer, Blake Ritson, Esmé Bianco, Monet Mazur, Brenda Blethyn, Alan Ford', 'R', 'A loan shark gives ex-con Nick a period of 24 hours in order to pay back the money he owes. Up against it, Nick involves his best mate on a multi-part mission in order to raise the cash before it''s too late for them both', 'A loan shark gives ex-con Nick a period of 24 hours in order to pay back the money he owes. Up against it, Nick involves his best mate on a multi-part mission in order to raise the cash before it''s too late for them both', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kgP6YevcqMzWKFR7FokqtFoO7ZD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32678'),
  ('196847082521284204', 'Dead Man Talking', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Patrick Ridremont, Danny Elsen', 'Jean-Sébastien Lopez, Patrick Ridremont', 'Patrick Ridremont, François Berléand, Virginie Efira, Christian Marin, Jean-Luc Couchard, Olivier Leborgne, Denis Mpunga, Pauline Burlet', null, '8pm in a rundown prison. A prisoner on death row will be executed. He has the right to make a final declaration. But the law doesn''t stipulate how long he can talk. So, as long as he talks the execution is postponed…', '8pm in a rundown prison. A prisoner on death row will be executed. He has the right to make a final declaration. But the law doesn''t stipulate how long he can talk. So, as long as he talks the execution is postponed…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9F9NTDEQPf3bFWlryY7IM9z3rT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150747'),
  ('992325674196732822', 'Dead Man Walking', 1995, 'Drama', 'Tim Robbins, Roger Deakins, Allan F. Nicholls', 'Tim Robbins', 'Susan Sarandon, Sean Penn, Robert Prosky, Raymond J. Barry, R. Lee Ermey, Celia Weston, Lois Smith, Scott Wilson', 'R', 'A death row inmate turns for spiritual guidance to a local nun in the days leading up to his scheduled execution for the murders of a young couple.', 'A death row inmate turns for spiritual guidance to a local nun in the days leading up to his scheduled execution for the murders of a young couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eShxyjhWoFl3BwsuEmVsr4nLaMZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:687'),
  ('74246564979247289', 'Dead Man''s Bluff', 2005, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Aleksei Balabanov, Mikhail Nikolaev, Tatyana Chistova', 'Stas Mokhnachev, Aleksei Balabanov', 'Aleksey Panin, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Nikita Mikhalkov, Sergey Makovetskiy, Anatoli Zhuravlyov, Grigorij Sijatvinda, Viktor Sukhorukov, Garik Sukachyov', null, 'Sergei and Simon have to deliver a suitcase full of heroin to Mikhalych or else they will be killed. There is one minor detail: the only problem-solving technique they are familiar with is a shot in the head.', 'Sergei and Simon have to deliver a suitcase full of heroin to Mikhalych or else they will be killed. There is one minor detail: the only problem-solving technique they are familiar with is a shot in the head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ClCQRb5rh6B7HeEIWdDuU9Y1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20994'),
  ('346151063530912827', 'Dead Man''s Boots', 2025, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Yohann Gloaguen, Thomas Brémond, Augustin Grison', 'Yohann Gloaguen', 'Jean-Pascal Zadi, Jessy Salomée Ugolin, Cindy Bruna, Mamadou Minte, Ralph Amoussou, Makita Samba, Salimata Kamate, Guillaume Duhesme', null, 'One evening, Prosper, a loser Uber driver who still lives with his mother, picks up a dying man who has just been shot. Freaked out, Prosper gets rid of the body but not before stealing his pair of crocodile boots. As he slips them on, Prosper finds himself inhabited by the spirit of the deceased: King - a respected gangster feared by all. Split between these two opposing personalities, Prosper and King, united in one body, investigate to unmask King''s killer.', 'One evening, Prosper, a loser Uber driver who still lives with his mother, picks up a dying man who has just been shot. Freaked out, Prosper gets rid of the body but not before stealing his pair of crocodile boots. As he slips them on, Prosper finds himself inhabited by the spirit of the deceased: King - a respected gangster feared by all. Split between these two opposing personalities, Prosper and King, united in one body, investigate to unmask King''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jh2jVf6L1REXcvvlGdqwFoYGdqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000881'),
  ('689302797146211536', 'Dead Man''s Eyes', 1944, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Reginald Le Borg, Bernard B. Brown, Paul Ivano', 'Dwight V. Babcock', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Jean Parker, Paul Kelly, Thomas Gomez, Jonathan Hale, Edward Fielding, George Meeker, Pierre Watkin', null, 'Artist David Stuart is blinded by a jealous model whose portrait he is painting. His fiance''s father generously offers his eyes for a sight restoring operation. There''s only one hitch: Stuart has to wait until after the man dies. Not surprisingly, when the benefactor dies a very premature death, suspicion falls on the artist.', 'Artist David Stuart is blinded by a jealous model whose portrait he is painting. His fiance''s father generously offers his eyes for a sight restoring operation. There''s only one hitch: Stuart has to wait until after the man dies. Not surprisingly, when the benefactor dies a very premature death, suspicion falls on the artist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRHAMGiNWc0p6sOZJKoHOkRihan.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64075'),
  ('839423446246703669', 'Dead Man''s Folly', 1986, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Clive Donner, Curtis Clark, Michael Stevenson', 'Rod Browning', 'Peter Ustinov, Jean Stapleton, Constance Cummings, Tim Pigott-Smith, Jonathan Cecil, Kenneth Cranham, Susan Wooldridge, Christopher Guard', null, 'During a murder hunt game at a country house, to which Hercule Poirot is invited as an "expert", a real murder occurs.', 'During a murder hunt game at a country house, to which Hercule Poirot is invited as an "expert", a real murder occurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thH5NjvzGInO3rkGlSPE6Ll6pGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6105'),
  ('105607419721621055', 'Dead Man''s Letters', 1986, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Nikolai Pokoptsev', 'Konstantin Lopushansky, Vyacheslav Rybakov, Boris Strugatskiy', 'Rolan Bykov, Iosif Ryklin, Aleksandr Sabinin, Nora Gryakalova, Vadim Lobanov, Viktor Mikhaylov, Vera Mayorova, Svetlana Smirnova', null, 'In a desolate world following the nuclear apocalypse, a scholar helps a small group of adults and children survive in the basement of a former museum of history. In his mind, he writes letters to his only son that will never be read and tries to find shreds of hope in his new reality.', 'In a desolate world following the nuclear apocalypse, a scholar helps a small group of adults and children survive in the basement of a former museum of history. In his mind, he writes letters to his only son that will never be read and tries to find shreds of hope in his new reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uPfG3ZnXCdRdxZ88DqMe0UuIwBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73920'),
  ('512874173868837692', 'Dead Man''s Seat', 1984, 'Drama, Mystery', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, Albano Silva Pereira, Jorge Paixão da Costa', 'António-Pedro Vasconcelos, Carlos Saboga', 'Ana Zanatti, Pedro Oliveira, Teresa Madruga, Luís Lima Barreto, Carlos Coelho, Isabel Mota, Ruy Furtado, Natalina José', null, 'A newspaper reporter comes across a man and woman arguing on the beach, and after obligingly driving the woman around when she seeks him out, he takes her back to discover that the man has been murdered. The woman takes off, but the reporter, after many twists and turns, runs into her on a train. They start a relationship, but he had better pay closer attention to how he got to know her in the first place.', 'A newspaper reporter comes across a man and woman arguing on the beach, and after obligingly driving the woman around when she seeks him out, he takes her back to discover that the man has been murdered. The woman takes off, but the reporter, after many twists and turns, runs into her on a train. They start a relationship, but he had better pay closer attention to how he got to know her in the first place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hiyWqYmjL61CvnA8ZFiDPKOcJPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112810'),
  ('878584217970959084', 'Dead Man''s Shoes', 2004, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Shane Meadows, Danny Cohen, Griffin', 'Paddy Considine, Shane Meadows', 'Paddy Considine, Toby Kebbell, Gary Stretch, Stuart Wolfenden, Neil Bell, Paul Sadot, Seamus O''Neill, George Newton', 'R', 'A soldier returns to his small town and exacts a deadly revenge on the thugs who tormented his disabled brother while he was away.', 'A soldier returns to his small town and exacts a deadly revenge on the thugs who tormented his disabled brother while he was away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCbXlGHmonE3QEOeM7I2PRkG8y6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12877'),
