  ('393471007567362255', 'Dead or Alive 2: Birds', 2000, 'Crime, Drama, Comedy', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Masaru Nakamura', 'Show Aikawa, Riki Takeuchi, Noriko Aota, Edison Chen, Kenichi Endo, Hiroko Isayama, Masato, Yūichi Minato', null, 'Two contract killers cross paths in the middle of the same job and realize they are childhood friends. Together they take a break from killing and visit the small island they once called home. After reflecting on their past lives they decided to team up and use their talents in killing for good... much to the upset of the crime syndicates.', 'Two contract killers cross paths in the middle of the same job and realize they are childhood friends. Together they take a break from killing and visit the small island they once called home. After reflecting on their past lives they decided to team up and use their talents in killing for good... much to the upset of the crime syndicates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEi5PhfgInQPL9Z0r3jijuYN8Im.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13899'),
  ('524011039364820444', 'Dead or Alive: Final', 2002, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Toshiki Kimura, Hitoshi Ishikawa, Yoshinobu Kamo', 'Show Aikawa, Riki Takeuchi, Maria Chen, Richard Chen, Jason Chu Wing-Tong, Josie Ho, Rachel Ngan Wing-Sze, Terence Yin Chi-Wai', null, 'In post-apocalyptic Yokohama, a hard-boiled cop and a mellowed out drifter hook up with a gang of rebels. When the gang kidnap the cop''s son, the wheels are set in motion for an inevitable showdown.', 'In post-apocalyptic Yokohama, a hard-boiled cop and a mellowed out drifter hook up with a gang of rebels. When the gang kidnap the cop''s son, the wheels are set in motion for an inevitable showdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wHsgK1dvFdp6pv3ok3BHDY33Op.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36222'),
  ('1038739176165919232', 'Dead Over Heels: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2017, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Claude M. Pavel, Kevin Speckmaier, Natalie Fiteni', 'Shelley Evans', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Yannick Bisson, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Miranda Frigon, Peter Benson, Bruce Dawson, Jeremy Guilbaut', 'G', 'Librarian and real crime buff Aurora “Roe” Teagarden never liked Detective Sergeant Jack Burns, but she also never wanted to see him dead. When his body is found outside of Aurora’s home, she then becomes the main suspect. Determined to find the killer and clear her name, Aurora can''t help but to get involved once again.', 'Librarian and real crime buff Aurora “Roe” Teagarden never liked Detective Sergeant Jack Burns, but she also never wanted to see him dead. When his body is found outside of Aurora’s home, she then becomes the main suspect. Determined to find the killer and clear her name, Aurora can''t help but to get involved once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6TUrrWS9R2pNGRw7NMw2cyLqkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436398'),
  ('1004062679089656804', 'Dead Pigs', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael E. Wood, Maxine Zhang, Cathy Yan', 'Cathy Yan', 'Vivian Wu, Yang Haoyu, Li Meng, Mason Lee, David Rysdahl, Zazie Beetz, Archibald C. McColl IV, Wang Zhipeng', null, 'A pig farmer, a busboy, a salon owner, an expat architect and a jaded rich girl cross paths as thousands of dead pigs float down the Yangtze River toward Shanghai.', 'A pig farmer, a busboy, a salon owner, an expat architect and a jaded rich girl cross paths as thousands of dead pigs float down the Yangtze River toward Shanghai.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A44qTnjwLIr1MDNvbE7l2T1g3PN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:491305'),
  ('814457777113668815', 'Dead Poets Society', 1989, 'Drama', 'Peter Weir, John Seale, Alan B. Curtiss', 'Tom Schulman', 'Robin Williams, Robert Sean Leonard, Ethan Hawke, Josh Charles, Gale Hansen, Dylan Kussman, Allelon Ruggiero, James Waterston', 'PG', 'At an elite, old-fashioned boarding school in New England, a passionate English teacher inspires his students to rebel against convention and seize the potential of every day, courting the disdain of the stern headmaster.', 'At an elite, old-fashioned boarding school in New England, a passionate English teacher inspires his students to rebel against convention and seize the potential of every day, courting the disdain of the stern headmaster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5NbiHKUmahlAT3Q1ig8Tyl9xrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207'),
  ('1085376414799818066', 'Dead Presidents', 1995, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Albert Hughes, Lisa Rinzler, Allen Hughes', 'Allen Hughes, Albert Hughes', 'Larenz Tate, Keith David, Chris Tucker, Freddy Rodríguez, Rose Jackson, N''Bushe Wright, Clifton Powell, Terrence Howard', 'R', 'On the streets they call cash dead presidents. And that''s just what a Vietnam veteran is after when he returns home from the war only to find himself drawn into a life of crime. With the aid of his fellow vets he plans the ultimate heist -- a daring robbery of an armored car filled with unmarked U.S. currency!', 'On the streets they call cash dead presidents. And that''s just what a Vietnam veteran is after when he returns home from the war only to find himself drawn into a life of crime. With the aid of his fellow vets he plans the ultimate heist -- a daring robbery of an armored car filled with unmarked U.S. currency!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eGfsSXizR11tTHVo0kuOOFPAxZt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11443'),
  ('682297052422745859', 'Dead Reckoning', 1946, 'Crime, Mystery', 'John Cromwell, Seymour Friedman, Morris Stoloff', 'Steve Fisher, Oliver H.P. Garrett', 'Humphrey Bogart, Lizabeth Scott, Morris Carnovsky, Charles Cane, William Prince, Marvin Miller, Wallace Ford, James Bell', 'NR', 'War heroes Rip Murdock and Johnny Drake are sent to Washington, D.C, to receive top honors for their service. Johnny, seemingly terrified by the publicity that awaits him, jumps off the train and later turns up dead. Suspecting foul play, Rip begins digging into his pal''s past. He encounters cover-ups, threats to his own life and deadly femme fatale Coral Chandler.', 'War heroes Rip Murdock and Johnny Drake are sent to Washington, D.C, to receive top honors for their service. Johnny, seemingly terrified by the publicity that awaits him, jumps off the train and later turns up dead. Suspecting foul play, Rip begins digging into his pal''s past. He encounters cover-ups, threats to his own life and deadly femme fatale Coral Chandler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kL1TxvXABa4ibbuctSZsUjDZX74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20663'),
  ('330377413084351926', 'Dead Reckoning', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Vern Nobles', 'Kristin Alexandre, A. Wayne Carter', 'KJ Apa, India Eisley, Sydney Park, Scott Adkins, James Remar, Ellie Cornell, Patrick M. Walsh, Devon Diep', 'R', 'Tillie Gardner has been rocked to her core by the tragic death of her parents in a plane crash. She copes with the help of local cab driver Niko, with whom she began a summer romance on the island of Nantucket. But what she doesn''t know is that Marco, the man who sabotaged her parents'' plane, is on his way to Nantucket to set another terrifying scheme into motion. Can she uncover his dark secret and gather her wits to stop him in time?', 'Tillie Gardner has been rocked to her core by the tragic death of her parents in a plane crash. She copes with the help of local cab driver Niko, with whom she began a summer romance on the island of Nantucket. But what she doesn''t know is that Marco, the man who sabotaged her parents'' plane, is on his way to Nantucket to set another terrifying scheme into motion. Can she uncover his dark secret and gather her wits to stop him in time?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rIHwHM3m0O8escRlRyDoCEaAY7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:463870'),
  ('1034808433060360650', 'Dead Right', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Edgar Wright', 'Edgar Wright', 'Edward Scotland, Martin Curtis, Richard Green, Oliver Evans, Peter Wild, Gavin Elwood, Rob Yarde, Amy Bowles', null, 'This home movie features a cop named Barry Stern who has to hunt down a serial killer. In the style of Dirty Harry meets Airplane.', 'This home movie features a cop named Barry Stern who has to hunt down a serial killer. In the style of Dirty Harry meets Airplane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grnD2ZdD6cjMIMcLF7bgfM3Ao22.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200674'),
  ('933497578178935972', 'Dead Ringer', 1964, 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Paul Henreid, Chuck Hansen, Ernest Haller', 'Albert Beich, Oscar Millard', 'Bette Davis, Karl Malden, Peter Lawford, Philip Carey, Jean Hagen, George Macready, Estelle Winwood, George Chandler', null, 'The working class twin sister of a callous wealthy woman impulsively murders her out of revenge and assumes the identity of the dead woman. But impersonating her dead twin is more complicated and risky than she anticipated.', 'The working class twin sister of a callous wealthy woman impulsively murders her out of revenge and assumes the identity of the dead woman. But impersonating her dead twin is more complicated and risky than she anticipated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3gFIovyx38syFIY6kAl1FcwhWMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22543'),
  ('472912535825375523', 'Dead Ringers', 1988, 'Thriller, Horror', 'David Cronenberg, Peter Suschitzky, Izidore K. Musallam', 'David Cronenberg, Norman Snider', 'Jeremy Irons, Geneviève Bujold, Heidi von Palleske, Barbara Gordon, Shirley Douglas, Stephen Lack, Nick Nichols, Lynne Cormack', 'R', 'Elliot, a successful gynecologist, works at the same practice as his identical twin, Beverly. Elliot is attracted to many of his patients and has affairs with them. When he inevitably loses interest, he will give the woman over to Beverly, the meeker of the two, without the woman knowing the difference. Beverly falls hard for one of the patients, Claire, but when she inadvertently deceives him, he slips into a state of madness.', 'Elliot, a successful gynecologist, works at the same practice as his identical twin, Beverly. Elliot is attracted to many of his patients and has affairs with them. When he inevitably loses interest, he will give the woman over to Beverly, the meeker of the two, without the woman knowing the difference. Beverly falls hard for one of the patients, Claire, but when she inadvertently deceives him, he slips into a state of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofXwDfM8uYAaftD7cBPcIWdCpMn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9540'),
  ('345512850251641534', 'Dead Rising: Endgame', 2016, 'Action, Horror', 'David Pelletier, Pat Williams, Patrick Weir', 'Tim Carter, Michael Ferris', 'Jesse Metcalfe, Keegan Connor Tracy, Marie Avgeropoulos, Jessica Harmon, Dennis Haysbert, Billy Zane, Ian Tracey, Patrick Sabongui', null, 'Investigative reporter Chase Carter must stop a secret government conspiracy in the zombie infested quarantine zone of East Mission City.', 'Investigative reporter Chase Carter must stop a secret government conspiracy in the zombie infested quarantine zone of East Mission City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQZCTiMWnXNTeKtnBAOmGdUT0rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400605'),
  ('770433361789577517', 'Dead Run', 2005, 'Drama', 'SABU, Masao Nakabori', 'SABU', 'Yuya Tegoshi, Hanae Kan, Miki Nakatani, Etsushi Toyokawa, Ren Osugi, Susumu Terajima, Ryo Kase, Shun Sugata', null, 'Classmates Shuji and Eri becomes friends, both young people have family problems. When Eri is taken away to Tokyo by her relatives, Shuji becomes increasingly isolated at school and drifts into criminal activity.', 'Classmates Shuji and Eri becomes friends, both young people have family problems. When Eri is taken away to Tokyo by her relatives, Shuji becomes increasingly isolated at school and drifts into criminal activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8DRn6LUPIAu5oXaSI3JlfsAGsC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105136'),
  ('50937963377688800', 'Dead Sea', 2024, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Phil Volken, Helge Gerull', 'Phil Volken', 'Isabel Gravitt, Alexander Wraith, Dean Cameron, Garrett Wareing, Genneya Walton, Koa Tom, Brian Silverman, Al Burke', null, 'Stranded in the open sea after a fatal accident, a young woman and her two friends are rescued by a fishing vessel''s captain, unaware that the ship harbors a chilling secret.', 'Stranded in the open sea after a fatal accident, a young woman and her two friends are rescued by a fishing vessel''s captain, unaware that the ship harbors a chilling secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohisXa9ArEoV05ajLfX2T5D6NNF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1308757'),
  ('1074900816443021468', 'Dead Season', 2012, 'Horror, Action', 'Jeffrey Peters, Adam Deyoe', 'Joshua Klausner, Loren Semmens, Adam Deyoe', 'Scott Peat, Marissa Merrill, James C. Burns, Corsica Wilson, Marc L. Fusco, Grant Beijon, Todd Pritchett, Greg Weisman', 'NR', 'It has been over one year since the start of the outbreak. Our society has collapsed and the world has descended into chaos. Elvis and Tweeter are two of the last people left alive, and band together to flee the United States for a remote island somewhere in the Caribbean. On the island, they find a new community struggling to hold out against an army of corpses. They can join this band of survivors-- but only if they can do what must be done for the good of the group.', 'It has been over one year since the start of the outbreak. Our society has collapsed and the world has descended into chaos. Elvis and Tweeter are two of the last people left alive, and band together to flee the United States for a remote island somewhere in the Caribbean. On the island, they find a new community struggling to hold out against an army of corpses. They can join this band of survivors-- but only if they can do what must be done for the good of the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0XOzGjk1Z7wdR8u6C2wLORkLHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114789'),
  ('136721016628965253', 'Dead Sexy', 2001, 'Thriller, Mystery, Romance', 'Kazuo Minami, Robert Angelo', 'Elroy Canton, Anthony L. Greene', 'Shannon Tweed, John Enos III, Sam J. Jones, Mary Shannon, Holly Sampson, Katie Lohmann, Maria Mayenzet, Kenneth White', 'R', 'A female detective gets involved with a murder suspect in a series of serial killings.', 'A female detective gets involved with a murder suspect in a series of serial killings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6VClpVIAtgjfGYSwofuHYdTFE2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58495'),
  ('309177258566771012', 'Dead Shack', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'Peter Ricq, Christopher Charles Kempinski', 'Davila LeBlanc, Phil Ivanusic, Peter Ricq', 'Matthew Nelson-Mahood, Lizzie Boys, Gabriel LaBelle, Lauren Holly, Donavon Stinson, Valerie Tian, Taylor St. Pierre, Bryan Demore', null, 'On a weekend getaway at a rundown cabin in the woods, Jason, a cautious teen, his crude best friend Colin and his fearless older sister Summer are forced to work together, grow up and save their hard-partying parents from their predatory neighbor intent on feeding them all to her undead family.', 'On a weekend getaway at a rundown cabin in the woods, Jason, a cautious teen, his crude best friend Colin and his fearless older sister Summer are forced to work together, grow up and save their hard-partying parents from their predatory neighbor intent on feeding them all to her undead family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rKqYBB6ysJW4DQqUwM1DaCIxDM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449535'),
  ('505657914334652668', 'Dead Shadows', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'David Cholewa', 'Vincent Julé', 'Fabian Wolfrom, John Fallon, Blandine Marmigère, Johanna Seror, Baya Rehaz, Rurik Sallé, Franck Penaud, Julien Dunand', null, 'Chris'' neighbors become increasingly violent as they mutate into something from beyond this world after a comet passes the Earth.', 'Chris'' neighbors become increasingly violent as they mutate into something from beyond this world after a comet passes the Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLy35VlOa3h5UGSTUR9umGImby2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176915'),
  ('431367290466216324', 'Dead Shot', 2023, 'Action, Thriller', 'Thomas Guard, Mattias Rudh, Charles Guard', 'Ronan Bennett, Tom Guard, Charles Guard', 'Colin Morgan, Aml Ameen, Mark Strong, Felicity Jones, Sophia Brown, Tom Vaughan-Lawlor, Will Keen, Mairéad Tyers', null, 'In the 1970s, a member of the IRA takes over an Active Service Unit in London after his wife is accidentally shot dead in Ireland. The unit''s mission is to cause chaos and destruction, while his personal aim is to hunt down his wife’s killer — an SAS captain, who is also hunting him.', 'In the 1970s, a member of the IRA takes over an Active Service Unit in London after his wife is accidentally shot dead in Ireland. The unit''s mission is to cause chaos and destruction, while his personal aim is to hunt down his wife’s killer — an SAS captain, who is also hunting him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLMzL9cpBBnkMGF8j4Z5Dbi2Z5u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507250'),
  ('1099131826763424182', 'Dead Silence', 1991, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Peter O''Fallon, Ernest Holzman, Francis J. Conway', 'Linda S. Cormany', 'Renée Estevez, Lisanne Falk, Carrie Mitchum, Steven Brill, Claudette Nevins, Tim Russ, Beau Starr, Bryan Cranston', 'PG', 'Three friends on spring break hit and kill a transient in the California desert. Will they keep silent or turn on each other?', 'Three friends on spring break hit and kill a transient in the California desert. Will they keep silent or turn on each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKJMu1VfywRM16qTRu0Yrrt6oLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370576'),
  ('1128441086408181644', 'Dead Silence', 1997, 'Action, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Daniel Petrie Jr., Thomas Burstyn', 'Donald E. Stewart', 'James Garner, Marlee Matlin, Kim Coates, Lolita Davidovich, Scott Speedman, Barry Pepper, Charles Martin Smith, Kenneth Welsh', 'R', 'Three escaped convicts take a group of deaf students hostage.', 'Three escaped convicts take a group of deaf students hostage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ky3OepQzmrbwBU8ikWVU134cwEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223389'),
  ('933970767479191782', 'Dead Silence', 2007, 'Horror', 'Andrew Shea, Sarah Campbell, Mark Hryma', 'Leigh Whannell', 'Ryan Kwanten, Amber Valletta, Donnie Wahlberg, Bob Gunton, Laura Regan, Michael Fairman, Joan Heney, Dmitry Chepovetsky', 'R', 'Jamie returns to his hometown in search of answers to his wife''s murder, which occurred after receiving a weird package containing a ventriloquist dummy named Billy, which may be linked to the legend of ventriloquist Mary Shaw. Destined to find out the truth, Jamie goes to the town of Raven''s Fair, where Shaw used to perform and is buried. But Jamie is in for more than he expected.', 'Jamie returns to his hometown in search of answers to his wife''s murder, which occurred after receiving a weird package containing a ventriloquist dummy named Billy, which may be linked to the legend of ventriloquist Mary Shaw. Destined to find out the truth, Jamie goes to the town of Raven''s Fair, where Shaw used to perform and is buried. But Jamie is in for more than he expected.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a58epZAujxNO1HkWX3EV6Nesbcz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14001'),
  ('887951402791780645', 'Dead Silent', 1999, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Roger Cardinal, Isabelle Brutus, Jacques LaBerge', 'Paul Koval, Ed Fitzgerald', 'Catherine Mary Stewart, Rob Lowe, Arlen Aguayo-Stewart, Larry Day, Mark Camacho, Sean Devine, Allen Altman, Noel Burton', 'PG-13', 'Julia Kerbridge is working hard to get her doctorate. Suddenly, she finds herself the guardian of her young niece, Amanda, after the 7-year-old witnesses her parents'' murder and is rendered mute. Julia soon discovers that her dead sister and brother-in-law may have held a secret life. Now, she must risk everything as the killers are still hunting Amanda for her parents'' secret.', 'Julia Kerbridge is working hard to get her doctorate. Suddenly, she finds herself the guardian of her young niece, Amanda, after the 7-year-old witnesses her parents'' murder and is rendered mute. Julia soon discovers that her dead sister and brother-in-law may have held a secret life. Now, she must risk everything as the killers are still hunting Amanda for her parents'' secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mZuhL2IksCB9KKg4bYVCrUNn3nx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111014'),
  ('1064954816074602071', 'Dead Snow', 2009, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tommy Wirkola, Mathis Mathisen, Matthew Weston', 'Tommy Wirkola, Stig Frode Henriksen', 'Vegar Hoel, Charlotte Frogner, Stig Frode Henriksen, Lasse Valdal, Evy Kasseth Røsten, Jeppe Beck Laursen, Jenny Skavlan, Ane Dahl Torp', 'NR', 'Eight medical students on a ski trip to Norway discover that Hitler''s horrors live on when they come face to face with a battalion of zombie Nazi soldiers intent on devouring anyone unfortunate enough to wander into the remote mountains where they were once sent to die.', 'Eight medical students on a ski trip to Norway discover that Hitler''s horrors live on when they come face to face with a battalion of zombie Nazi soldiers intent on devouring anyone unfortunate enough to wander into the remote mountains where they were once sent to die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfwVo5cZJtO8VyDWTILDt4f69IT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14451'),
  ('915964854299738917', 'Dead Snow 2: Red vs. Dead', 2014, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Tommy Wirkola, Matthew Weston', 'Stig Frode Henriksen, Vegar Hoel, Tommy Wirkola', 'Vegar Hoel, Ørjan Gamst, Jocelyn DeBoer, Martin Starr, Ingrid Haas, Stig Frode Henriksen, Kristoffer Joner, Hallvard Holmen', 'R', 'The gruesome Nazi Zombies are back to finish their mission, but our hero is not willing to die. He is gathering his own army to give them a final fight.', 'The gruesome Nazi Zombies are back to finish their mission, but our hero is not willing to die. He is gathering his own army to give them a final fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/raKPvj9Jw1f5KuEXa1xi3pa2omW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241842'),
  ('966496619059138177', 'Dead Souls', 2012, 'Horror', 'Erica Joseph Hunter, Jamal Lee Turner, Claudio Rietti', 'John Doolan, Michael Laimo', 'Bill Moseley, Jesse James, Magda Apanowicz, Geraldine Hughes, Noah Fleiss, Jaiden Kaine, J.H. Torrance Downes, Elizabeth Irene', 'R', 'On his 18th birthday, Johnny finds out that he''s come into an inheritance - and his family were a lot stranger than he ever knew...', 'On his 18th birthday, Johnny finds out that he''s come into an inheritance - and his family were a lot stranger than he ever knew...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4HHl7IrFNDxFU4MEAHHfjKbfbbJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183412'),
  ('254352007915582348', 'Dead Souls', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing, Wang Bing, Shan Xiaohui', 'Wang Bing', null, null, 'In Gansu Province, northwest China, lie the remains of countless prisoners abandoned in the Gobi Desert sixty years ago. Designated as ultra-rightists in the Communist Party’s Anti-Rightist campaign of 1957, they starved to death in the reeducation camps. The film invites us to meet the survivors of the camps to find out firsthand who these persons were, the hardships they were forced to endure and what became their destiny.', 'In Gansu Province, northwest China, lie the remains of countless prisoners abandoned in the Gobi Desert sixty years ago. Designated as ultra-rightists in the Communist Party’s Anti-Rightist campaign of 1957, they starved to death in the reeducation camps. The film invites us to meet the survivors of the camps to find out firsthand who these persons were, the hardships they were forced to endure and what became their destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAuBKOYPULBvAXMsOyh6uGxR7Ih.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517772'),
  ('403151192122544926', 'Dead Space', 1991, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Fred Gallo, Chris Beckman, Juan A. Mas', 'Catherine Cyran', 'Marc Singer, Laura Mae Tate, Judith Chapman, Bryan Cranston, Randy Reinholz, Frank Roman, Lori Lively, Rodger Halston', 'R', 'On the planet Phaebon, a controlled research facility had been thought to be safe... until a breach unleashes alien terrors unknown.', 'On the planet Phaebon, a controlled research facility had been thought to be safe... until a breach unleashes alien terrors unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0zd6iubTjBuf8X5UAHeYHwJzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48291'),
  ('1109056989948700899', 'Dead Space: Aftermath', 2011, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Mike Disa, Tae-Ho Han, Jung Eun Kim', 'Brandon Auman', 'Christopher Judge, Peter Woodward, Kari Wahlgren, Ricardo Chavira, Gwendoline Yeo, Curt Cornelius, Graham McTavish, Yorgo Constantine', 'NR', 'The year is 2509 and not only has Earth lost contact with the Ishimura and Isaac Clarke, but now also the USG O''Bannon, the first responder ship sent to rescue them. Four crew members of the O''Bannon have survived. But what happened to the rest of the crew? What were they doing? What secrets are they keeping? All to be revealed...in the Aftermath! --- Dead Space: Aftermath is a fast paced, horrifying thrill ride told through the perspective of the four survivors by several renowned international directors. Dead Space: Aftermath is an animated film that bridges the storyline between the video games Dead Space and Dead Space 2.', 'The year is 2509 and not only has Earth lost contact with the Ishimura and Isaac Clarke, but now also the USG O''Bannon, the first responder ship sent to rescue them. Four crew members of the O''Bannon have survived. But what happened to the rest of the crew? What were they doing? What secrets are they keeping? All to be revealed...in the Aftermath! --- Dead Space: Aftermath is a fast paced, horrifying thrill ride told through the perspective of the four survivors by several renowned international directors. Dead Space: Aftermath is an animated film that bridges the storyline between the video games Dead Space and Dead Space 2.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2WBywtTKlrvV59aUybElvaypZJF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55215'),
  ('206238346905338060', 'Dead Space: Downfall', 2008, 'Animation, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Chuck Patton', 'Justin Gray, Jimmy Palmiotti', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Grey DeLisle, Jeff Bennett, Jim Cummings, Lia Sargent, Nika Futterman, Maurice LaMarche, Kelly Hu', 'NR', 'On a deep space mining mission to a remote planet, an ancient religious relic - thought to be proof of the existence of God - is unearthed and brought aboard. When the unholy artifact unleashes a long-dormant alien race, its glimpse of Heaven transforms the ship into a living Hell. A prequel to the events of the 2008 video game Dead Space.', 'On a deep space mining mission to a remote planet, an ancient religious relic - thought to be proof of the existence of God - is unearthed and brought aboard. When the unholy artifact unleashes a long-dormant alien race, its glimpse of Heaven transforms the ship into a living Hell. A prequel to the events of the 2008 video game Dead Space.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8KNXRQF9UzplokFlDrNMt0FkW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13190'),
  ('109876584628330993', 'Dead Sushi', 2012, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Jun Tsugita, Noboru Iguchi', 'Rina Takeda, Shigeru Matsuzaki, Kentarō Shimazu, Kanji Tsuda, Asami, Takamasa Suga, Toru Tezuka, Takashi Nishina', 'NR', 'A disgruntled researcher injects his former employers'' meal with a serum that turns their sushi into flesh-eating monsters.', 'A disgruntled researcher injects his former employers'' meal with a serum that turns their sushi into flesh-eating monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6OemZ6GIjrq5L4WqCA0nsoIQeYM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110345'),
  ('87967215248817306', 'Dead Talents Society', 2024, 'Horror, Comedy', 'John Hsu, Hsieh Shung-ming, Chou Yi-hsien', 'Kun-Lin Tsai, John Hsu', 'Chen Bolin, Sandrine Pinna, Gingle Wang, Eleven Yao, Bai Jing-yi, Soso Tseng, Lin He-hsuan, Huang Di-yang', 'R', 'When ghosts must compete to survive in the underworld by haunting the living, one unassuming young woman needs help creating a lasting performance while under the tutelage of a passionate agent and a washed-up diva.', 'When ghosts must compete to survive in the underworld by haunting the living, one unassuming young woman needs help creating a lasting performance while under the tutelage of a passionate agent and a washed-up diva.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yDcc3OWNEtzjDtJly1OyZShtTMV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1006724'),
  ('1060807377774496252', 'Dead Times', 1964, 'Animation, Drama', 'René Laloux', 'Roland Topor, René Laloux', 'Roland Dubillard', null, 'What is man? Man makes war, man kills man, man hunts, man is executed. A montage mixing original drawings by Topor, original shots and stock shots that ironically analyze what man is.', 'What is man? Man makes war, man kills man, man hunts, man is executed. A montage mixing original drawings by Topor, original shots and stock shots that ironically analyze what man is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KAIJqPZ2ejxVhPUtE7Xzjah2Xg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69559'),
  ('682466645408339023', 'Dead Tired', 1994, 'Comedy', 'Michel Blanc, Christophe Vassort, Eduardo Serra', 'Jacques Audiard', 'Michel Blanc, Carole Bouquet, Philippe Noiret, Josiane Balasko, Marie-Anne Chazel, Christian Clavier, Guillaume Durand, Charlotte Gainsbourg', null, 'Stressed and overworked, famous French movie star Michel Blanc is beginning to wear down, physically and mentally, from the pressure and demands of fame. Already in a fragile state of mind, strange events start to transpire all around him, and he gradually loses his grip. Taking the advice of a psychiatrist, Blanc retreats to the countryside with his friend Carole Bouquet, but Blanc still has not managed to escape all of his problems.', 'Stressed and overworked, famous French movie star Michel Blanc is beginning to wear down, physically and mentally, from the pressure and demands of fame. Already in a fragile state of mind, strange events start to transpire all around him, and he gradually loses his grip. Taking the advice of a psychiatrist, Blanc retreats to the countryside with his friend Carole Bouquet, but Blanc still has not managed to escape all of his problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tD8zVuSpIfUSjmEZ0UXBeOU9Va8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64567'),
  ('204811355816657279', 'Dead to Rights', 2025, 'Drama, War, History', 'Shen Ao, Wang Tianxing, Rongyun Ge', 'Shen Ao, Zhang Ke, Xu Luyang', 'Liu Haoran, Wang Chuanjun, Gao Ye, Wang Xiao, Zhou You, Yang Enyou, Daichi Harashima, Wang Zhener', 'NR', 'During the 1937 Nanjing Massacre, a postman poses as a photo developer, helping Japanese forces while secretly sheltering Chinese refugees. He later risks his life evacuating them and revealing evidence of the atrocities.', 'During the 1937 Nanjing Massacre, a postman poses as a photo developer, helping Japanese forces while secretly sheltering Chinese refugees. He later risks his life evacuating them and revealing evidence of the atrocities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rx9xTly73NssFHPg9gKrX9tJdDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1500536'),
  ('212200999157260629', 'Dead Tone', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Deon Taylor, Brian Hooks, Philip Lee', 'Vashon Nutt, Brian Hooks, Deon Taylor', 'Rutger Hauer, Wil Horneff, Brian Hooks, Antwon Tanner, Denyce Lawton, Cherie Johnson, Jud Tylor, Gwendoline Yeo', null, 'As another semester draws to a close at the University of Dreyskill, a simple game dreamt to help students avoid studying becomes a bloody battle for survival.', 'As another semester draws to a close at the University of Dreyskill, a simple game dreamt to help students avoid studying becomes a bloody battle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/drIe1vTn7D7o8bANGtY6fDsjFuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15476'),
  ('89515234848756458', 'Dead Trigger', 2017, 'Action, Horror', 'Brandon Menchen, G. Mitchell Johnson, Carissa Bussey', 'Scott Windhauser', 'Dolph Lundgren, Autumn Reeser, Romeo, Isaiah Washington, Chris Galya, Oleg Taktarov, Brooke Johnston, Natali Yura', 'R', '2021 - 5 years after the outbreak of a mysterious virus that turned humans into bloodthirsty, undead beasts much of the world’s population has been decimated. When governments were unable to keep the disease at bay, the Contagion Special Unit was formed with the toughest soldiers and best specialists to fight the infected. Because of the rapidly decreasing number of soldiers, a popular online video game Dead Trigger that mirrors the terrifying events was created. The best efforts of the gamers are monitored by the CSU who recruit the highest rated zombie killers. The young recruits are called “Dead Triggers”. The movie follows a group of young recruits who must travel to the origin of the outbreak to find a missing team of scientists who were searching for a cure.', '2021 - 5 years after the outbreak of a mysterious virus that turned humans into bloodthirsty, undead beasts much of the world’s population has been decimated. When governments were unable to keep the disease at bay, the Contagion Special Unit was formed with the toughest soldiers and best specialists to fight the infected. Because of the rapidly decreasing number of soldiers, a popular online video game Dead Trigger that mirrors the terrifying events was created. The best efforts of the gamers are monitored by the CSU who recruit the highest rated zombie killers. The young recruits are called “Dead Triggers”. The movie follows a group of young recruits who must travel to the origin of the outbreak to find a missing team of scientists who were searching for a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI2c30FyDEeBaa7Ka7tZYH344tC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462115'),
  ('187058492018425687', 'Dead Uncle', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Antonello Emidi, Antonio Manzini', 'Antonio Manzini', 'Libero De Rienzo, Pietro Sermonti, Rocco Ciarmoli, Giselda Volodi, Margherita Vicario, Dario D''Ambrosi, Tullio Sorrentino, Tiziana Schiavarelli', null, 'When an unemployed young man finds himself in dire straits and up to his eyes in gambling debt, he believes the only solution is to become a drug courier.', 'When an unemployed young man finds himself in dire straits and up to his eyes in gambling debt, he believes the only solution is to become a drug courier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKwwrXJeMPzW9MgNQwOoQu5Uq8C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400127'),
  ('837017017351800780', 'Dead Water', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Chris Helton', 'Jason Usry', 'Casper Van Dien, Judd Nelson, Brianne Davis, Griff Furst', null, 'When a relaxing getaway turns deadly, a former Marine must risk his life once again to save his wife and best friend from a modern day pirate; all the while trying to hold himself together as he faces the ghosts of the war he left behind.', 'When a relaxing getaway turns deadly, a former Marine must risk his life once again to save his wife and best friend from a modern day pirate; all the while trying to hold himself together as he faces the ghosts of the war he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/333UycccGJRndunuFXRhQnkIyij.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:618433'),
  ('85479165723793668', 'Dead Weekend', 1995, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Gary Tieche, Amos Poe', 'Joel Rose', 'Stephen Baldwin, David Rasche, Alexis Arquette, Tom Kenny, Bai Ling, Afifi Alaouie, Blair Valk, Jennifer MacDonald', null, 'In the midst of an evacuation effort, True World Forces agent Weed must secure an alien spacecraft suspected to have crashed somewhere in the city. But after Weed meets the ship''s beautiful, shape-shifting pilot, he finds himself falling for her. As the two grow close, Weed struggles to determine where his true loyalties lie.', 'In the midst of an evacuation effort, True World Forces agent Weed must secure an alien spacecraft suspected to have crashed somewhere in the city. But after Weed meets the ship''s beautiful, shape-shifting pilot, he finds himself falling for her. As the two grow close, Weed struggles to determine where his true loyalties lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6BlJQSeqHPBpViVauaADeZzX99y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5546'),
  ('189184863940635510', 'Dead Weight', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Forestier, Alain Berbérian, Christophe Paturange', 'Manuel Delilez, Dominique Mézerette, Thomas Langmann', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Gérard Lanvin, José Garcia, Djimon Hounsou, Rossy de Palma, Jean Benguigui, Gary Tiplady, Gérard Darmon', 'PG-13', 'After winning the lottery, a convict must chase down the warden who has his winning ticket.', 'After winning the lottery, a convict must chase down the warden who has his winning ticket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlbQnAfvGJxKpDqstKsal6tuoDb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18457'),
  ('998375449544743497', 'Dead Zone', 2022, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Hank Braxtan, Marshall Douglis, Rachel DeWeber', 'Michael Klug, Tim Ogletree', 'Michael Jai White, Chad Michael Collins, Jeff Fahey, Whitney Nielsen, Antuone Torbert, Tarkan Dospil, J. Michael Weiss, James Markham Hall Jr.', 'R', 'To stop the collapse of humanity, an elite team of soldiers must descend on a radiation-poisoned town and perform the ultimate stealth mission using high-tech armor and weapons.', 'To stop the collapse of humanity, an elite team of soldiers must descend on a radiation-poisoned town and perform the ultimate stealth mission using high-tech armor and weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hN8w1ftoH7yyfwgE9VBdGRkipbZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945840'),
  ('186377929698999768', 'Deadball', 2011, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yudai Yamaguchi, Yuji Shimomura', 'Yudai Yamaguchi, Keita Tokaji', 'Tak Sakaguchi, Mari Hoshino, Koichi Yamadera, Miho Ninagawa, Takamasa Suga, Jyonmyon Pe, Miho Harita, Mickey Curtis', null, 'Baseball prodigy Jubeh Yakyu is the most feared and dangerous juvenile delinquent in all of Japan. After accidentally causing the death of his father with a super-powered, deadly fireball pitch, Jubeh swore off baseball and became a criminal and now, at 17, has been sent to the Pterodactyl Juvenile Reformatory for hardened criminals. Headmistress Ishihara, the granddaughter of a World War II Nazi collaborator, runs the institution with an iron fist and the enthusiastic help of her sadistic assistant, Ilsa. After arriving at the hellhole, Jubeh soon learns from governor Mifune that his long-lost, younger brother Musashi had also done time there after a murder spree, but had since died mysteriously…', 'Baseball prodigy Jubeh Yakyu is the most feared and dangerous juvenile delinquent in all of Japan. After accidentally causing the death of his father with a super-powered, deadly fireball pitch, Jubeh swore off baseball and became a criminal and now, at 17, has been sent to the Pterodactyl Juvenile Reformatory for hardened criminals. Headmistress Ishihara, the granddaughter of a World War II Nazi collaborator, runs the institution with an iron fist and the enthusiastic help of her sadistic assistant, Ilsa. After arriving at the hellhole, Jubeh soon learns from governor Mifune that his long-lost, younger brother Musashi had also done time there after a murder spree, but had since died mysteriously…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vHF9z3vpr1Xg4h6lMTQdFy9Vhjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83190'),
  ('1110243732289468051', 'Deadbeat at Dawn', 1988, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Horror', 'Jim Van Bebber, Mike King, Mark Gillespie', 'Jim Van Bebber', 'Jim Van Bebber, Megan Murphy, Marc Pitman, Ric Walker, Paul Harper, Maureen Allisse, Tom Burns, John Bradley', 'NR', 'Goose leaves the gang life behind after pleas from his girlfriend. But it isn''t long before he''s pulled back into the world of violence.', 'Goose leaves the gang life behind after pleas from his girlfriend. But it isn''t long before he''s pulled back into the world of violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQZqb2KUXw7bHxh4InWFVLf8Tgm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86252'),
  ('928450733485038833', 'Deadbeat Dad', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Amorim', 'Pedro Amorim, Benjamin Cosgrove', 'Danton Mello, Antonio Tabet, Dani Calabresa, Thogun Teixeira, Erik Min Soo Chung, Lukas Brombini, Monica Iozzi, Juliana Didone', null, 'Diogo''s 20th high school class reunion is coming up, and although he''s married, sees it as an opportunity to hook up with his high school crush who will also be at the reunion. He and his wife have a young son, and everything is lined up so he can go to the reunion alone, hook up with the woman, and go home without his wife suspecting anything. Unfortunately for him, his wife''s mother breaks her arm the night of the reunion and can''t watch their son. Diogo scrambles to find a babysitter, ultimately settling on a nursery in a strange building. He goes to the party, meets up with the crush, but then has to leave. He and his three friends then go back to the nursery and pick up his son, who is wearing his favorite dog mask. While Diogo and his friends are on their way back to the reunion (he still hasn''t hooked up with his former crush) he removes the dog mask and realizes the boy isn''t his.', 'Diogo''s 20th high school class reunion is coming up, and although he''s married, sees it as an opportunity to hook up with his high school crush who will also be at the reunion. He and his wife have a young son, and everything is lined up so he can go to the reunion alone, hook up with the woman, and go home without his wife suspecting anything. Unfortunately for him, his wife''s mother breaks her arm the night of the reunion and can''t watch their son. Diogo scrambles to find a babysitter, ultimately settling on a nursery in a strange building. He goes to the party, meets up with the crush, but then has to leave. He and his three friends then go back to the nursery and pick up his son, who is wearing his favorite dog mask. While Diogo and his friends are on their way back to the reunion (he still hasn''t hooked up with his former crush) he removes the dog mask and realizes the boy isn''t his.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haHwv5RhXJZQIEF3mMQo0Ghuw3W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308674'),
