  ('1046325204685997086', 'Deadfall', 1993, 'Crime, Drama', 'Christopher Coppola, Maryse Alberti, Laurence Barbera', 'Nick Vallelonga, Christopher Coppola', 'Michael Biehn, Sarah Trigger, Nicolas Cage, James Coburn, Peter Fonda, Charlie Sheen, Talia Shire, J. Kenneth Campbell', 'R', 'After he accidentally kills his father Mike during a sting, Joe tries to carry out Mike''s dying wish by recovering valuables that Mike''s twin brother Lou stole from him years earlier. But Uncle Lou is also a confidence artist, and Joe is soon drawn into his increasingly dangerous schemes.', 'After he accidentally kills his father Mike during a sting, Joe tries to carry out Mike''s dying wish by recovering valuables that Mike''s twin brother Lou stole from him years earlier. But Uncle Lou is also a confidence artist, and Joe is soon drawn into his increasingly dangerous schemes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8S1lqwp1RR9z0V05QAVWTSbvtwC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33927'),
