  ('877244561690521723', 'Deadful Melody', 1994, 'Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Ng Min-Kan, Yue Man-San, Lee Chi-Kit', 'Chan Man-Keung, Lee Man-Choi, Johnny Lee Kwing-Kai', 'Brigitte Lin, Yuen Biao, Carina Lau, David Lam Wai, Wu Ma, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong, Peter Chan Lung, Paul Chung Fat', null, 'A young security man must prove himself worthy by defending the one object wanted by all the masters of the Martial Arts world - the Magic Lyre!', 'A young security man must prove himself worthy by defending the one object wanted by all the masters of the Martial Arts world - the Magic Lyre!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKBHivlAz5wehFYbpTLuxYnCgHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18814'),
  ('373942428627735443', 'Deadgirl', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Marcel Sarmiento, Gadi Harel, Harris Charalambous', 'Trent Haaga', 'Shiloh Fernandez, Noah Segan, Michael Bowen, Candice King, Nolan Gerard Funk, Jenny Spain, Susan Marie Keller, Christina Masterson', 'R', 'When high school misfits Rickie and JT decide to ditch school and find themselves lost in the crumbling facility of a nearby abandoned hospital, they come face-to-face with a gruesome discovery: a body of a woman stripped naked, chained to a table and covered in plastic and soon realize she is anything but dead. Quickly the boys find themselves embarking on a twisted yet poignant journey testing the limits of their friendship, and forces both to decide just how far they''re willing to stretch their understanding of right and wrong.', 'When high school misfits Rickie and JT decide to ditch school and find themselves lost in the crumbling facility of a nearby abandoned hospital, they come face-to-face with a gruesome discovery: a body of a woman stripped naked, chained to a table and covered in plastic and soon realize she is anything but dead. Quickly the boys find themselves embarking on a twisted yet poignant journey testing the limits of their friendship, and forces both to decide just how far they''re willing to stretch their understanding of right and wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ff00BtvdnSHO8qoblBhiXmJKvCm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23966'),
