  ('1126066814123210530', 'Deadlier Than the Male', 1956, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Julien Duvivier, Armand Thirard, Antoine Archimbaud', 'Charles Dorat, Pierre-Aristide Bréal', 'Jean Gabin, Danièle Delorme, Gérard Blain, Lucienne Bogaert, Germaine Kerjean, Gabrielle Fontan, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Robert Pizani', 'NR', 'In the heart of Paris, a restaurateur''s mundane life is disrupted by the arrival of his ex-wife''s daughter, who claims to be in need after her mother''s death. After marrying her, tensions rise when she becomes involved with a young student, leading to betrayal and murder. As secrets unfold, he uncovers the truth about her past and her manipulative nature.', 'In the heart of Paris, a restaurateur''s mundane life is disrupted by the arrival of his ex-wife''s daughter, who claims to be in need after her mother''s death. After marrying her, tensions rise when she becomes involved with a young student, leading to betrayal and murder. As secrets unfold, he uncovers the truth about her past and her manipulative nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DE3rBfYoF6HLn9YMpA1156HmDn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76772'),
