  ('699769362928659313', 'Deadline', 1980, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Manfred Guthe, Mario Azzopardi, Robert Appelbe', 'Richard Oleksiak, Mario Azzopardi', 'Stephen Young, Sharon Masters, Marvin Goldhar, Jeannie Elias, Cindy Hinds, Phillip Leonard, Tod Woodcroft, Bev Marsh', null, 'A horror film about a screenwriter who loses the ability to distinguish between his fantasy world and the real world, with disastrous consequences. As he ruminates on his place in any world and loses his grip, he also loses his wife and his children''s respect, and critics tear him apart. The final undoing of this screenwriter is a deadline that must be met at all costs, costs that perhaps are too great.', 'A horror film about a screenwriter who loses the ability to distinguish between his fantasy world and the real world, with disastrous consequences. As he ruminates on his place in any world and loses his grip, he also loses his wife and his children''s respect, and critics tear him apart. The final undoing of this screenwriter is a deadline that must be met at all costs, costs that perhaps are too great.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5RrZraeTUgpIqazLfbm2UxehTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91561'),
  ('719058109162114880', 'Deadline', 1987, 'Drama, Action, War', 'Nathaniel Gutman, Thomas Mauch, Amnon Salomon', 'Hanan Peled', 'Christopher Walken, Hywel Bennett, Marita Marschall, Arnon Zadok, Amos Lavi, Etti Ankri, Martin Umbach, Moshe Ivgy', 'R', 'An American journalist is set up and fed false information after the Lebanon war.', 'An American journalist is set up and fed false information after the Lebanon war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iY5i97Pa64B1nu7FQBowlO8D0d1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56617'),
  ('352834255109597404', 'Deadline', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Colin Nutley, Jens Fischer, Mattias Ohlsson', 'Johanna Hald, Colin Nutley, Anna Fredriksson', 'Helena Bergström, Tomas Pontén, Örjan Ramberg, Reine Brynolfsson, Brasse Brännström, Pernilla August, Ewa Fröling, Gunilla Röör', null, 'The Victoriastadium is totally destroyed in a bomb attack and Christina Furhage, head-responsible for the Olympic Games in Stockholm, dies with it. Why did someone destroy the stadium and why is Christina murdered? The police desperately seek for clues that will lead them to the perpetrator but without any luck. As the Olympic Games draws near the situation becomes more desperate. Annika Bengtzon, a reporter for Kvällsposten, se a connection that no one else sees and without understanding it she starts a carousel that in the end will threaten her own life.', 'The Victoriastadium is totally destroyed in a bomb attack and Christina Furhage, head-responsible for the Olympic Games in Stockholm, dies with it. Why did someone destroy the stadium and why is Christina murdered? The police desperately seek for clues that will lead them to the perpetrator but without any luck. As the Olympic Games draws near the situation becomes more desperate. Annika Bengtzon, a reporter for Kvällsposten, se a connection that no one else sees and without understanding it she starts a carousel that in the end will threaten her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mkz8UT6cQO4baLQytgst2xjgd5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100973'),
