  ('741575902657972227', 'Deadlock', 2021, 'Action, Thriller', 'Brandon Cox, Jared Cohn, Ryan Miningham', 'Jared Cohn, Cam Cannon', 'Patrick Muldoon, Bruce Willis, Matthew Marsden, Michael Devorzon, Kelly Lynn Reiter, Johnny Messner, Stephen C. Sepher, Ava Paloma', 'R', 'Mack is a former soldier who, after the war, moved to a town with a nuclear power plant, where nearly everybody works. Life is peaceful for him there, until a gang of mercenaries led by Ron storm the reactor and take everybody hostage, including a group of children on a school trip. Now Mack is in a race against the clock and must use his military training to defeat Ron before he puts the reactor into meltdown. Along the way he discovers Ron’s motive, which unravels a greater secret Mack’s town is hiding.', 'Mack is a former soldier who, after the war, moved to a town with a nuclear power plant, where nearly everybody works. Life is peaceful for him there, until a gang of mercenaries led by Ron storm the reactor and take everybody hostage, including a group of children on a school trip. Now Mack is in a race against the clock and must use his military training to defeat Ron before he puts the reactor into meltdown. Along the way he discovers Ron’s motive, which unravels a greater secret Mack’s town is hiding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNZOJnWWaCnfst7LIU8dOuB9h8q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718949'),
