  ('974168685439932765', 'Deadly Blessing', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert C. Jessup, Wes Craven, Jerram A. Swartz', 'Glenn M. Benest, Matthew Barr, Wes Craven', 'Maren Jensen, Sharon Stone, Susan Buckner, Jeff East, Colleen Riley, Douglas Barr, Lisa Hartman, Lois Nettleton', 'R', 'When a former member of a religious cult dies in a mysterious accident, Martha, who now lives alone and close to the cult''s church, begins to fear for her life and the lives of her visiting friends.', 'When a former member of a religious cult dies in a mysterious accident, Martha, who now lives alone and close to the cult''s church, begins to fear for her life and the lives of her visiting friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVbllQDWJAglLyXYbWwgEGWpIu9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33016'),
  ('142513581786858221', 'Deadly Cargo', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Pau Freixas', null, 'Silke, Unax Ugalde, Adrià Collado, Andrés Gertrúdix, Diana Lázaro, Lluís Homar', null, 'Journalist Sara joins timid Victor and pregnant wife Thais, instructors Ivan and Edgar, and local kid Drui in Senegal for some underwater exploration. When their craft blows up following a misfired bullet, they float around in the water for a while before seeing a ship. Their initial relief turns to horror as they see a man being tipped into the water from it but the ship is the group''s only option. Hiding on board, things start to unravel for them in a horrific way.', 'Journalist Sara joins timid Victor and pregnant wife Thais, instructors Ivan and Edgar, and local kid Drui in Senegal for some underwater exploration. When their craft blows up following a misfired bullet, they float around in the water for a while before seeing a ship. Their initial relief turns to horror as they see a man being tipped into the water from it but the ship is the group''s only option. Hiding on board, things start to unravel for them in a horrific way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ovZ6TJFILGe1mC2TFFpn8PG96oQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35942'),
  ('522659246441124944', 'Deadly Circuit', 1983, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Claude Miller, Pierre Lhomme, Gilbert Duhalde', 'Michel Audiard, Jacques Audiard', 'Michel Serrault, Isabelle Adjani, Guy Marchand, Stéphane Audran, Macha Méril, Geneviève Page, Sami Frey, Dominique Frot', null, 'A P.I. is obsessed with a cute woman, who seduces and kills rich men around W. Europe.', 'A P.I. is obsessed with a cute woman, who seduces and kills rich men around W. Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oqAvTlI4eQM3om2Z8mWA0o0kSIw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62981'),
  ('808351264974206725', 'Deadly Daphne''s Revenge', 1987, 'Horror, Drama', 'Richard Gardner', 'Richard Gardner, Tim Bennett', 'Anthony Holt, Richard Gardner, Laurie Tait Partridge, Candy Castillo, John Suttle, Alan Levy, James Avery, Jody Jaress', null, 'A young hitchhiker is picked up by four drunken hunters, one of whom rapes her. A tough prosecutor has all four of the men indicted for the crime, which results in a suicide and a murder-for-hire plot.', 'A young hitchhiker is picked up by four drunken hunters, one of whom rapes her. A tough prosecutor has all four of the men indicted for the crime, which results in a suicide and a murder-for-hire plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5oU6FtBlULIjACfbub3cW2a3Cj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88405'),
  ('547770083826513500', 'Deadly Daughter Switch', 2020, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Josh Brown, Jeremy Gerke, Michael Street', 'Lindsay Hartley, Jason-Shane Scott', 'Lindsay Hartley, Hannah Barefoot, Jane Widdop, Tu Morrow, Matthew Pohlkamp, Allison McAtee, Gib Gerard, Eric Callero', 'PG-13', 'When Brooke discovers that her daughter Hailey isn''t actually her biological daughter, their family is thrown into crisis as they realize Hailey was switched at birth with Brooke''s biological daughter Breanne.', 'When Brooke discovers that her daughter Hailey isn''t actually her biological daughter, their family is thrown into crisis as they realize Hailey was switched at birth with Brooke''s biological daughter Breanne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yqSfkm2JjTIpeXeFOqcq611AJoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:689857'),
  ('769852220071904293', 'Deadly Dreams', 1988, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kristine Peterson, David Robert Cobb, Melitta Fitzer', 'Thom Babbes', 'Mitchell Anderson, Juliette Cummins, Xander Berkeley, Thom Babbes, Duane Whitaker, Troy Evans, Geoffrey Forward, Gyl Roland', 'R', 'Alex is caught in a web of distrust between his brother, his best friend, a beautiful stranger and the renewed dreams of the slaughter of his family.', 'Alex is caught in a web of distrust between his brother, his best friend, a beautiful stranger and the renewed dreams of the slaughter of his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loJaXlYSzX2HFcfMPHYFIda6RfY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85162'),
  ('884756790839237441', 'Deadly Embrace', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David DeCoteau, Thomas L. Callaway, Marc Saltarelli', 'Richard Gabai', 'Linnea Quigley, Michelle Bauer, Jan-Michael Vincent, Jack Carter, Ty Randolph, Ruth Collins, Ken Abraham, Kim Darby', null, 'A beautiful but horny and neglected Beverly Hills wife hires a hot young stud as a gardener. It eventually gets through to her husband that some hanky-panky may possibly be going on, and he begins to spy on her.', 'A beautiful but horny and neglected Beverly Hills wife hires a hot young stud as a gardener. It eventually gets through to her husband that some hanky-panky may possibly be going on, and he begins to spy on her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHXoz5flzvGQ9KvogLYHTz3YjFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58984'),
  ('763364312949538469', 'Deadly Encounter', 1982, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'William A. Graham, Frank M. Holgate', null, 'Larry Hagman, Susan Anspach, James Gammon, Michael C. Gwynne, José Chávez, Jack Dunlap, Arnold Jeffers, Hank Hendrick', 'PG', 'A veteran pilot finds himself knee-deep in trouble when his ex-girlfriend shows up at his doorstep in a terrible state. She knows the whereabouts of an immense fortune, and the Mafia is hot on her trail.', 'A veteran pilot finds himself knee-deep in trouble when his ex-girlfriend shows up at his doorstep in a terrible state. She knows the whereabouts of an immense fortune, and the Mafia is hot on her trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9m701MvaQlBHXB2nkekuYWShuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34337'),
  ('856495116582898790', 'Deadly Eyes', 1982, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Clouse, René Verzier', 'Charles H. Eglee', 'Sam Groom, Sara Botsford, Scatman Crothers, Cec Linder, Lisa Langlois, Lesleh Donaldson, James B. Douglas, Lee-Max Walton', 'R', 'Corn grain contaminated with steroids produces large rats the size of small dogs who begin feeding on the residents of Toronto. Paul, a college basketball coach, teams up with Kelly, a local health inspector, to uncover the source of the mysterious rat attacks and they eventually try to prevent the opening of a new subway line as well as find the mutant rats nest quickly, or there will be a huge massacre of the entire city!', 'Corn grain contaminated with steroids produces large rats the size of small dogs who begin feeding on the residents of Toronto. Paul, a college basketball coach, teams up with Kelly, a local health inspector, to uncover the source of the mysterious rat attacks and they eventually try to prevent the opening of a new subway line as well as find the mutant rats nest quickly, or there will be a huge massacre of the entire city!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6lBpTv2bIOZsqxWM4naEqdCMzHH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49332'),
  ('707370695639353390', 'Deadly Force', 1983, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Paul Aaron, Ronald Colby, James Fitzpatrick', 'Barry Schneider, Ken Barnett, Robert Vincent O''Neil', 'Wings Hauser, Joyce Ingalls, Paul Shenar, Al Ruscio, Arlen Dean Snyder, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Bud Ekins, J. Víctor López', 'R', 'Stoney Cooper, a former Los Angeles police officer, is at a low point in his life. Kicked off the force because of his anti-authority attitude, he now ekes out a living as a freelancer in New York. All this changes when the daughter of an old friend is killed by serial killer terrorizing L.A. Although almost nobody in his old home town is happy to see him back, Cooper pledges to bring the killer to justice before any more innocent people die.', 'Stoney Cooper, a former Los Angeles police officer, is at a low point in his life. Kicked off the force because of his anti-authority attitude, he now ekes out a living as a freelancer in New York. All this changes when the daughter of an old friend is killed by serial killer terrorizing L.A. Although almost nobody in his old home town is happy to see him back, Cooper pledges to bring the killer to justice before any more innocent people die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l7DyZn6LN0hQUpqvoaIYpCgolxA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168940'),
  ('212074024139354406', 'Deadly Friend', 1986, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Wes Craven, Peter C. Graupner, Nicholas Batchelor', 'Bruce Joel Rubin', 'Matthew Labyorteaux, Kristy Swanson, Michael Sharrett, Anne Twomey, Anne Ramsey, Richard Marcus, Russ Marin, Lee Paul', 'R', 'When tragedy strikes his remarkable robot and the beautiful girl next door, lonely teenage genius Paul tries to save them by pushing technology beyond its known limits into a terrifying new realm.', 'When tragedy strikes his remarkable robot and the beautiful girl next door, lonely teenage genius Paul tries to save them by pushing technology beyond its known limits into a terrifying new realm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/24X1pdzeU9x2QCVDu957tpUA0kp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33278'),
  ('642519192841853003', 'Deadly Games', 1982, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'R. Michael Stringer, Scott Mansfield', 'Scott Mansfield', 'Jo Ann Harris, Sam Groom, Steve Railsback, Dick Butkus, June Lockhart, Denise Galik, Jere Rae Mansfield, Alexandra Morgan', 'R', 'A masked maniac with a penchant for a monster-themed board game is playing his own twisted game with the women of a small American town. Each time the dice are rolled, another victim meets a grisly end. Returning home to mourn the death of her murdered sister, Keegan befriends local cop Roger and reclusive cinema projectionist Billy — but soon finds herself in the killer''s sights.', 'A masked maniac with a penchant for a monster-themed board game is playing his own twisted game with the women of a small American town. Each time the dice are rolled, another victim meets a grisly end. Returning home to mourn the death of her murdered sister, Keegan befriends local cop Roger and reclusive cinema projectionist Billy — but soon finds herself in the killer''s sights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yYQPpvbFhKDQKBCRVONSsUFwdh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85194'),
  ('1052010056132468531', 'Deadly Hero', 1975, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Andrzej Bartkowiak, Ivan Nagy', 'Don Petersen', 'Don Murray, Diahn Williams, James Earl Jones, Lilia Skala, George S. Irving, Treat Williams, Charles Siebert, Hank Garrett', 'R', 'Officer Lacy is an 18-year veteran of the New York Police Department who finds himself demoted from detective back to patrol duty for his violent tendencies and trigger-happy behavior.', 'Officer Lacy is an 18-year veteran of the New York Police Department who finds himself demoted from detective back to patrol duty for his violent tendencies and trigger-happy behavior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gsaSxUhPUyYqDPr4M4xLj2Z2JO0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83972'),
  ('617541274990152798', 'Deadly Hope', 2012, 'Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Nicolas Monette, Daniel Villeneuve, Gabriel Teller', 'Richard Dumont', 'Alana de la Garza, Sandrine Holt, Dan Jeannotte, Peter Michael Dillon, Vincent Leclerc, Tim Campbell, Judith Baribeau, John Reardon', null, 'Joanne Connors is a successful obstetrician whose life is turned upside down when her partner at their fertility clinic, Dr. Jake Hines, is brutally murdered. Trying to rebuild her life, Joanne attends a lavish charity function, where she meets Michael. But by the end of the evening, Michael is dead - murdered. It quickly becomes apparent that the assassin''s intended victim was actually Joanne. She must now race to find out who wants her dead before the killer can strike at her again.', 'Joanne Connors is a successful obstetrician whose life is turned upside down when her partner at their fertility clinic, Dr. Jake Hines, is brutally murdered. Trying to rebuild her life, Joanne attends a lavish charity function, where she meets Michael. But by the end of the evening, Michael is dead - murdered. It quickly becomes apparent that the assassin''s intended victim was actually Joanne. She must now race to find out who wants her dead before the killer can strike at her again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xGkQoLpd2aQZXJzezV714kjogKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134197'),
  ('6594288359642531', 'Deadly Illusions', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mike McMillin, Anna Elizabeth James', 'Anna Elizabeth James', 'Kristin Davis, Dermot Mulroney, Shanola Hampton, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, Greer Grammer, Grayson Berry, Marie Wagenman, Olivia Taylor', null, 'A bestselling female novelist, suffering from writer''s block, hires an innocent young woman to watch over her twin children. As the novelist dangerously indulges in her new best seller, the line between the life she''s writing and the one she''s living becomes blurred.', 'A bestselling female novelist, suffering from writer''s block, hires an innocent young woman to watch over her twin children. As the novelist dangerously indulges in her new best seller, the line between the life she''s writing and the one she''s living becomes blurred.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wj0PpS8cvXCNB3Wvhe6w5k0Nnke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802443'),
  ('104357049020288587', 'Deadly Infidelity', 2022, 'TV Movie, Thriller, Romance, Mystery', 'Olivia Kuan, Josh Brown, Jeremy Gerke', 'Sandra Bailey, Mark Gantt', 'Kate Watson, Anna Marie Dobbins, Houston Rhines, Emary Simon, Jacob Taylor, Annika Foster, Jesus Ruiz, Roberta Hanlen', null, 'After a violent car accident robs Grace of her memory, a handsome stranger enters her life, insisting that they are lovers. As her memory returns bit by bit, the stranger''s story begins to unravel. Grace is forced to fill in the gaps and uncover the truth, suddenly fearing for her life.', 'After a violent car accident robs Grace of her memory, a handsome stranger enters her life, insisting that they are lovers. As her memory returns bit by bit, the stranger''s story begins to unravel. Grace is forced to fill in the gaps and uncover the truth, suddenly fearing for her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iJwE6cwS3hOp3VjZPSlxwhPnNun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:922539'),
  ('420350976682119637', 'Deadly Inheritance', 1968, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vittorio Sindoni, Ascenzio Rossi', 'Aldo Bruno, Romano Migliorini, Vittorio Sindoni', 'Tom Drake, Femi Benussi, Virgilio Gazzolo, Ivo Garrani, Ernesto Colli, Valeria Ciangottini, Isarco Ravaioli, Giovanna Lenzi', null, 'There are a number of inheritors to a fortune who are getting killed by a mysterious somebody whom we do not see. Each death is novel, but not terribly graphic. Who did it?', 'There are a number of inheritors to a fortune who are getting killed by a mysterious somebody whom we do not see. Each death is novel, but not terribly graphic. Who did it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNi5hVuJcRplaxlOpUC8UkBGGSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29166'),
  ('1036107036190418723', 'Deadly Instincts', 1997, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Paul Matthews, Peter Thornton, Dafydd Arwyn Jones', 'Paul Matthews', 'Todd Jensen, Samantha Womack, Oliver Tobias, Kadamba Simmons, Nigel Harrison, Clifton Lloyd Bryan, Melanie Walters, Katy Lawrence', null, 'It''s an invasion of the most personal and terrifying kind. When a meteorite crash lands onto a Boston college campus and an alien beast is released, only one man understands its mission to mate. From the depths of an all girls college, the grotesque monster stalks his prey in a cat-and-mouse chase until the final conflict where only one species can survive.', 'It''s an invasion of the most personal and terrifying kind. When a meteorite crash lands onto a Boston college campus and an alien beast is released, only one man understands its mission to mate. From the depths of an all girls college, the grotesque monster stalks his prey in a cat-and-mouse chase until the final conflict where only one species can survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZatsWm4crx0sMxlFhniOpl4Y1q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65252'),
  ('733816088378284069', 'Deadly Intentions', 1985, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Noel Black, Reynaldo Villalobos, Robin Holding', null, 'Michael Biehn, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Cloris Leachman, Morgana King, Jack Kruschen, Kevin McCarthy, Cliff DeYoung, Susan Wheeler Duff', null, 'Katherine married Dr. Charles Raynor. She later discovers that Raynor is a sadist who torments her physically and mentally. She divorces him and take their child away. He then decides to kill her but when his plot is discovered he is charged with attempted murder and brought to trial.', 'Katherine married Dr. Charles Raynor. She later discovers that Raynor is a sadist who torments her physically and mentally. She divorces him and take their child away. He then decides to kill her but when his plot is discovered he is charged with attempted murder and brought to trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/apyViz0F1U2ziuJ5y1O5T82dViH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413462'),
  ('864246321254091685', 'Deadly Invasion: The Killer Bee Nightmare', 1995, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Rockne S. O''Bannon, Matthew Williams', 'William Bast, Paul Huson', 'Robert Hays, Nancy Stafford, Ryan Phillippe, Gina Philips, Gregory Gordon, Michael A. Nickles, Danielle von Zerneck, Dennis Christopher', null, 'When bees attack an isolated country house, a family must stick together to survive.', 'When bees attack an isolated country house, a family must stick together to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LYOIUpLfRUCd6jTiq1aTncpw3y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37017'),
  ('790057872216357020', 'Deadly Manor', 1990, 'Horror', 'José Ramón Larraz, Jody O''Neil, Michael Stephen Ferrari', 'José Ramón Larraz, Brian Smedley-Aston, Larry Ganem', 'Jennifer Delora, Kathleen Patane, Jerry Kernion, Clark Tufts, Greg Rhodes, Liz Hitchler, Mark Irish, Claudia Franjul', 'R', 'A group of teenagers take refuge in an old, deserted mansion. Soon the members of the group start turning up dead, and the teenagers realize that they''re not alone in the mansion.', 'A group of teenagers take refuge in an old, deserted mansion. Soon the members of the group start turning up dead, and the teenagers realize that they''re not alone in the mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxHRvcAvwcEAUNyaOD5OyQpIU0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128188'),
  ('836802939206135177', 'Deadly Maria', 1993, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Frank Griebe, Tom Tykwer', 'Christiane Voss, Tom Tykwer', 'Nina Petri, Josef Bierbichler, Peter Franke, Joachim Król, Rolf Peter Kahl, Katja Studt, Jean Maeser, Renate Usko', null, '40-year Maria is living in a monotonous and deadlocked marriage with her husband. In addition, she has to take care of her ill despotic father. One day, she falls in love with her sensitive neighbour Dieter. But her attempt to leave her gloomy everyday life behind leads straight into tragedy.', '40-year Maria is living in a monotonous and deadlocked marriage with her husband. In addition, she has to take care of her ill despotic father. One day, she falls in love with her sensitive neighbour Dieter. But her attempt to leave her gloomy everyday life behind leads straight into tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV4iBNUhIHqOEsnZyO6jKS5JrUq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10931'),
  ('857972892624318652', 'Deadly Messages', 1985, 'Horror, TV Movie, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jack Bender, Scott Maitland, Barbara Gelman', 'William Bleich', 'Kathleen Beller, Michael Brandon, Dennis Franz, Scott Paulin, Elizabeth Huddle, Charles Tyner, George Wyner, Raye Birk', null, 'When Laura unearths an old Ouija board in her closet, her roommate, Cindy, uses it and encounters the spirit of a man that had been murdered in their apartment. After Laura later witnesses Cindy being strangled to death, the authorities arrive to find Cindy missing and no evidence of a crime. Laura sets out to convince everyone that the murder was real while evading the man she feels is Cindy''s killer.', 'When Laura unearths an old Ouija board in her closet, her roommate, Cindy, uses it and encounters the spirit of a man that had been murdered in their apartment. After Laura later witnesses Cindy being strangled to death, the authorities arrive to find Cindy missing and no evidence of a crime. Laura sets out to convince everyone that the murder was real while evading the man she feels is Cindy''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eoGVbzz7lbQrqZvZZkEgDy8wDoM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140820'),
  ('516803418176881411', 'Deadly Outbreak', 1996, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rick Avery', 'Harel Goldstein, Charles Morris Jr.', 'Jeff Speakman, Ron Silver, Jack Adalist, Jonathan Sagall, Idan Alterman, Rochelle Swanson, Bridget Marks, Ami Dayan', 'R', 'Dutton Hatfield, played by Jeff Speakman, is working for the American embassy. He finds himself inside a biochemical weapon laboratory when terrorists headed by Colonel Baron (played by TimeCop villain Ron Silver) take over the place. Baron is looking for a sample of a deadly virus that is being developed inside the facility.', 'Dutton Hatfield, played by Jeff Speakman, is working for the American embassy. He finds himself inside a biochemical weapon laboratory when terrorists headed by Colonel Baron (played by TimeCop villain Ron Silver) take over the place. Baron is looking for a sample of a deadly virus that is being developed inside the facility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkil3wRYoF2z2acsflzoMGteo2o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76197'),
  ('2920696751804479', 'Deadly Outlaw: Rekka', 2002, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Takashi Miike', 'Shigenori Takechi', 'Riki Takeuchi, Sonny Chiba, Tetsuro Tamba, Ryôsuke Miki, Kenichi Endo, Mika Katsumura, Yuya Uchida, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'After Kunisada''s Yakuza leader and father figure is brutally murdered, he and his best friend go on a two-man mission to avenge his death, killing other Yakuza leaders leading to a final confrontation by the old man''s killers.', 'After Kunisada''s Yakuza leader and father figure is brutally murdered, he and his best friend go on a two-man mission to avenge his death, killing other Yakuza leaders leading to a final confrontation by the old man''s killers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2r4WNCpwAQzekbaZwoCcOv1GJuO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36274'),
  ('221052943415032360', 'Deadly Pickup', 2016, 'Thriller', 'Terrance Ryker, Dean McKendrick', 'Dean McKendrick', 'Carter Cruise, Kira Noir, Billy Snow, William F. Bryant, Sarah Hunter, Michael Gaglio, Cody Deal, Jon Fleming', 'NR', 'Breezy isn''t your ordinary hitch-hiker: she''s sexy, fun... and a cold-blooded killer. As deadly as a viper, Breezy murders her victims with a poisonous ring. As she preys on highway pickups, Breezy moves from town to town, finally settling briefly as a boarder in the house of a young couple who have no idea what kind of sexual wolf they''ve just let in the door.', 'Breezy isn''t your ordinary hitch-hiker: she''s sexy, fun... and a cold-blooded killer. As deadly as a viper, Breezy murders her victims with a poisonous ring. As she preys on highway pickups, Breezy moves from town to town, finally settling briefly as a boarder in the house of a young couple who have no idea what kind of sexual wolf they''ve just let in the door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kq0B2DAXRhauo3MACv8MKlliakW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408567'),
  ('382867772875854418', 'Deadly Prey', 1987, 'Action', 'Stephen Ashley Blake, David A. Prior', 'David A. Prior', 'Cameron Mitchell, Troy Donahue, Ted Prior, Fritz Matthews, David James Campbell, Dawn Abraham, William Zipp, Suzanne Tara', 'R', 'A group of sadistic mercenaries led by Col. John Hogan kidnap Michael Danton from his home, and set him loose on the grounds of their secret camp to be used as training for new recruits. Danton has been called the "most perfect killer ever." Now, he''ll have to prove it again. This prey has become DEADLY!', 'A group of sadistic mercenaries led by Col. John Hogan kidnap Michael Danton from his home, and set him loose on the grounds of their secret camp to be used as training for new recruits. Danton has been called the "most perfect killer ever." Now, he''ll have to prove it again. This prey has become DEADLY!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aG4hUQ0vw56B1zx0YJJKhaMR1DT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5753'),
  ('87496024620567060', 'Deadly Revenge', 1983, 'Drama, Action', 'Juan Carlos Desanzo, Juan Carlos Lenardi', 'Eduardo Mignogna, Rubén Tizziani, Juan Carlos Desanzo', 'Rodolfo Ranni, Julio De Grazia, Ricardo Darín, Héctor Bidonde, Silvia Montanari, Max Berliner, Clotilde Borella, Lita Fuentes', null, 'When the new don discovers that sadistic mobsters were responsible for the death of his young son, he wreaks a deadly revenge.', 'When the new don discovers that sadistic mobsters were responsible for the death of his young son, he wreaks a deadly revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A0Y0SXw2IgOPnTifVM6qfyvTpaJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143532'),
  ('607715183978015084', 'Deadly Shores', 2018, 'Drama, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Fred Olen Ray, Thomas L. Callaway', 'Fred Olen Ray', 'Carly Schroeder, Phillip P. Keene, Kristin Minter, Hedley Harlan, Kathryn Schneider, Mark Torres, Kate Konigisor, Henry LeBlanc', null, 'Anna moves to a remote island as the new bride of a famous mystery writer. Once there, she uncovers secrets about her new husband''s dead former wife and fears she may be the next victim.', 'Anna moves to a remote island as the new bride of a famous mystery writer. Once there, she uncovers secrets about her new husband''s dead former wife and fears she may be the next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVLxCyBHLF4ERW3UuI1AYmaRjXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547265'),
  ('847411130800358349', 'Deadly Sins', 1995, 'Mystery, Drama, Horror', 'Michael Robison, Barry Gravelle', 'Malcolm Barbour, John Langley', 'Alyssa Milano, David Keith, Terry David Mulligan, Heidi Lenhart, Peter Hanlon, Jo Bates, Oliver Becker, April Telek', null, 'New area deputy Jack Gales arrives on the island to find that a girl at the local Catholic girls school has been found dead. After investigating, he finds that students have been disappearing regularly for five years, about the time Mother Bernadette passed away. Gales and the Mother Superior''s secretary Cristina work together to try and unravel the mystery.', 'New area deputy Jack Gales arrives on the island to find that a girl at the local Catholic girls school has been found dead. After investigating, he finds that students have been disappearing regularly for five years, about the time Mother Bernadette passed away. Gales and the Mother Superior''s secretary Cristina work together to try and unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g9OmBxhSJpmJmAvHMSJKOtjFN2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22583'),
  ('946961450323950788', 'Deadly Skies', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Sam Irvin, Mahlon Todd Williams, Patricia Dyer Walden', 'Keith Shaw', 'Antonio Sabàto, Jr., Rae Dawn Chong, Michael Boisvert, Dominic Zamprogna, Michael Moriarty, Rob LaBelle', null, 'When scientist Dr Madison Taylor discovers an asteroid the size of Texas is heading for Earth, she sets out to destroy it - with or without the help of the military.', 'When scientist Dr Madison Taylor discovers an asteroid the size of Texas is heading for Earth, she sets out to destroy it - with or without the help of the military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dZrWOv69vSzvJyVEsUPPov5L81A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66736'),
  ('87315791821741335', 'Deadly Still', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Anton Zenkovich, Anton Zenkovich', 'Victor Bondaryuk', 'Irina Temicheva, Stepan Yurpalov, Anastasiya Ukolova, Sanzhar Madi, Garik Petrosyan, Egor Kharlamov, Sofya Zaika, Evgeny Koryakovsky', null, 'A group of friends decide to spend a weekend together at a country house, but an unexpected accident forces them to stop at a strange and remote estate. In this abandoned and eerie place, a rare antique camera is discovered. Slowly the camera draws them into a mystical and tragic chain of events that none of them could have seen coming. Anyone who has their picture taken by the camera sees a photo revealing their death. Many of them lose their lives in excruciating ways, as they race to solve the mystery of the camera.', 'A group of friends decide to spend a weekend together at a country house, but an unexpected accident forces them to stop at a strange and remote estate. In this abandoned and eerie place, a rare antique camera is discovered. Slowly the camera draws them into a mystical and tragic chain of events that none of them could have seen coming. Anyone who has their picture taken by the camera sees a photo revealing their death. Many of them lose their lives in excruciating ways, as they race to solve the mystery of the camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caHVolk6foU5MIqVc78twGbv3Pg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506600'),
  ('895084571567962260', 'Deadly Strangers', 1975, 'Thriller', 'Sidney Hayers, Graham Edgar', null, 'Hayley Mills, Simon Ward, Sterling Hayden, Ken Hutchison, Peter Jeffrey, Hubert Tucker, Nina Francis, George Collis', null, 'After she misses her train, a young woman is forced to hitch a ride back to town. After managing to get away from a lecherous trucker, she is given a ride by a good-looking but somewhat mysterious young man, who she comes to suspect may be a dangerous escapee from a mental asylum.', 'After she misses her train, a young woman is forced to hitch a ride back to town. After managing to get away from a lecherous trucker, she is given a ride by a good-looking but somewhat mysterious young man, who she comes to suspect may be a dangerous escapee from a mental asylum.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kiF0OJnpPGNYj6LaRVaIM4Okhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56384'),
  ('352871286165536573', 'Deadly Strike', 1978, 'Action', 'Huang Fei-Long', 'Huang Fei-Long', 'Ho Tsung-Tao, Chan Sing, Lung Fei, Shih Chung-Tien, David Tang Wei, Chiang Han, Huang Fei-Long', null, 'The new police chief (Bruce Li) arrives in a small provincial town. He''s been charged with bringing a dangerous gang to justice. But within seconds, the chief provokes a showdown with his lazy deputies. Realizing that they are not up to the job, he enlists the help of some of his prisoners, offering pardons to those who survive the encounter with the gang. These include a widower (Wang Yung Sheng), imprisoned for killing the men who murdered his wife, a knife-throwing expert (Lung Fei) also doing time for the murder of a corrupt magistrate, a pickpocket, and a young orphan girl out to avenge her parents'' death. The chief reveals his coldblooded dedication to the mission when he hangs one prisoner for trying to escape. The group - both prisoners and police - ultimately bond together and track down the gang''s headquarters to find the leader (Chen Hsing). After a long and bloody melee, everyone lies dead except the chief.', 'The new police chief (Bruce Li) arrives in a small provincial town. He''s been charged with bringing a dangerous gang to justice. But within seconds, the chief provokes a showdown with his lazy deputies. Realizing that they are not up to the job, he enlists the help of some of his prisoners, offering pardons to those who survive the encounter with the gang. These include a widower (Wang Yung Sheng), imprisoned for killing the men who murdered his wife, a knife-throwing expert (Lung Fei) also doing time for the murder of a corrupt magistrate, a pickpocket, and a young orphan girl out to avenge her parents'' death. The chief reveals his coldblooded dedication to the mission when he hangs one prisoner for trying to escape. The group - both prisoners and police - ultimately bond together and track down the gang''s headquarters to find the leader (Chen Hsing). After a long and bloody melee, everyone lies dead except the chief.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWPgKO3P7agmFf8hz3qYMEZJszT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57109'),
  ('998509000748854387', 'Deadly Target', 1994, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Charla Driver, Richard Pepin, Ken Blakey', 'James Adelstein, Michael January', 'Gary Daniels, Ken McLeod, Byron Mann, Susan Byun, Max Gail, Ron Yuan, Lydia Look, Aki Aleong', null, 'A Chinese gangster in Los Angeles escapes on the eve of his deportation to Hong Kong. A martial-arts master detective and his ragtag team get caught up in the action as they track down this ruthless killer.', 'A Chinese gangster in Los Angeles escapes on the eve of his deportation to Hong Kong. A martial-arts master detective and his ragtag team get caught up in the action as they track down this ruthless killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fjoGOMPV958hC95MaZdbzk5Hx6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29800'),
  ('1056313919641714905', 'Deadly Voyage', 1996, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Mackenzie', 'Nick Davies, Stuart Urban', 'Omar Epps, Joss Ackland, Sean Pertwee, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Andrew Divoff, David Suchet, David Dontoh', 'R', 'When stowaways are found on board a Russian cargo ship, some of the officers and crew decide to dispose of them at sea. The last time they had a stowaway on board, the ship was fined heavily and black marks entered into their records, when he made it off the ship into a foreign port.', 'When stowaways are found on board a Russian cargo ship, some of the officers and crew decide to dispose of them at sea. The last time they had a stowaway on board, the ship was fined heavily and black marks entered into their records, when he made it off the ship into a foreign port.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c8EPIRQPE3aHttkAzvjrBeuU5MU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213842'),
  ('465354973428259875', 'Deadly Weapon', 1989, 'Science Fiction', 'James L. Carter, Michael Miner', 'Michael Miner', 'Rodney Eastman, Kim Walker, Gary Frank, Michael Horse, Gary Kroeger, Barney Martin, Joe Regalbuto, William Sanderson', 'PG-13', 'An experimental gun powered by an atomic reactor is misplaced when the transport carrying it crashes into a river. The weapon soon falls into the hands of a bullied teen named Zeke, who uses it to get even with his persecutors. An army team led by the overzealous Lt. Dalton is sent to recover the weapon before it''s unstable reactor overloads and causes a meltdown.', 'An experimental gun powered by an atomic reactor is misplaced when the transport carrying it crashes into a river. The weapon soon falls into the hands of a bullied teen named Zeke, who uses it to get even with his persecutors. An army team led by the overzealous Lt. Dalton is sent to recover the weapon before it''s unstable reactor overloads and causes a meltdown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n6yudIAO4qpZNZkxm4hdeU4pDwh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116564'),
  ('1002989053060278843', 'Deadly Weapons', 1974, 'Crime, Drama', 'Doris Wishman, João Fernandes', null, 'Chesty Morgan, Harry Reems, Richard Towers, Saul Meth, Phillip Stahl, Mitchell Fredericks, Denise Purcell, John McMohon', 'R', 'After the mob hits a guy with a list, one of the hoods keeps the list to blackmail its inhabitants. When he’s found out to be a double-crosser, they off him, angering his busty girlfriend. She goes after them using the only two weapons she has.', 'After the mob hits a guy with a list, one of the hoods keeps the list to blackmail its inhabitants. When he’s found out to be a double-crosser, they off him, angering his busty girlfriend. She goes after them using the only two weapons she has.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gHTzS5brN1sqcHWeFW5unYIS6jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50958'),
  ('593086493761064363', 'Deadman Inferno', 2015, 'Comedy, Action, Horror', 'Hiroshi Shinagawa', 'Hiroshi Shinagawa', 'Show Aikawa, Shingo Tsurumi, Sawa Suzuki, Miyagawa Daisuke, Red Rice, Kunihiro Kawashima, Yuichi Kimura, DAIGO', null, 'Hiroya Munakata is the leader of the yakuza group Munakata-gumi. After 10 years since the big fight, Hiroya Munakata''s non blood-related younger brother Takashi is released from prison, but Takashi’s daughter, Hyuga says she does not want to meet her father and runs away from home. Hiroya, Takashi and Hiroya’s subordinate Shinya go to Zeni Island where Hyuga is headed to. Something they never expected is waiting for them.', 'Hiroya Munakata is the leader of the yakuza group Munakata-gumi. After 10 years since the big fight, Hiroya Munakata''s non blood-related younger brother Takashi is released from prison, but Takashi’s daughter, Hyuga says she does not want to meet her father and runs away from home. Hiroya, Takashi and Hiroya’s subordinate Shinya go to Zeni Island where Hyuga is headed to. Something they never expected is waiting for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ucOzzJ7mwjfFUFbRgCG17Y7FP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333072'),
  ('387180321665052763', 'Deadman''s Curve', 1978, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Richard Compton, William Cronjager', 'Dalene Young', 'Richard Hatch, Bruce Davison, Pamela Bellwood, Floy Dean, Denise DuBarry, Priscilla Cory, Kelly Ward, Anne-Marie Martin', null, 'Things were cool. Chicks were pretty. Waves were groovy. Cars had muscle. Jan and Dean rode their wave to the top of the pop charts. Then, in 1966, on their way to becoming rock and roll legends, they have to cope with a devastating car crash that leaves Jan brain-damaged and their dreams shattered.', 'Things were cool. Chicks were pretty. Waves were groovy. Cars had muscle. Jan and Dean rode their wave to the top of the pop charts. Then, in 1966, on their way to becoming rock and roll legends, they have to cope with a devastating car crash that leaves Jan brain-damaged and their dreams shattered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4okNAMxbaxjjgl8toSiH3lQ2ZOU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192418'),
  ('433599846589075667', 'Deadpool', 2016, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Roger Vernon, Scott Kukurudz, Rhonda Taylor', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Ryan Reynolds, Morena Baccarin, Ed Skrein, T.J. Miller, Gina Carano, Leslie Uggams, Brianna Hildebrand, Stefan Kapičić', 'R', 'The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.', 'The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3E53WEZJqP6aM84D8CckXx4pIHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293660'),
  ('853448855739154392', 'Deadpool & Wolverine', 2024, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Shawn Levy, Josh McLaglen, Martin Bell', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick, Ryan Reynolds', 'Ryan Reynolds, Hugh Jackman, Emma Corrin, Matthew Macfadyen, Dafne Keen, Jon Favreau, Morena Baccarin, Rob Delaney', 'R', 'A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.', 'A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:533535'),
  ('271729415944486030', 'Deadpool 2', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Adventure', 'Darrin Prescott, Regan Kosior, Matthew D. Smith', 'Paul Wernick, Rhett Reese, Ryan Reynolds', 'Ryan Reynolds, Josh Brolin, Morena Baccarin, Julian Dennison, Zazie Beetz, T.J. Miller, Leslie Uggams, Karan Soni', 'R', 'Wisecracking mercenary Deadpool battles the evil and powerful Cable and other bad guys to save a boy''s life.', 'Wisecracking mercenary Deadpool battles the evil and powerful Cable and other bad guys to save a boy''s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/to0spRl1CMDvyUbOnbb4fTk3VAd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383498'),
  ('33059380398640822', 'Deadpool: No Good Deed', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'David Leitch', 'Paul Wernick, Rhett Reese, Ryan Reynolds', 'Ryan Reynolds, Stan Lee', null, 'Deadpool sees an opportunity to save the day, but it doesn''t go entirely as planned.', 'Deadpool sees an opportunity to save the day, but it doesn''t go entirely as planned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wlKU9yB0Q8nfPMakBcSBT0JGS7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:558144'),
  ('1090413268923289256', 'Deadstream', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jared Cook, Vanessa Winter, Joseph Winter', 'Vanessa Winter, Joseph Winter', 'Joseph Winter, Melanie Stone, Jason K. Wixom, Pat Barnett Carr, Marty Collins, Perla Lacayo, Cylia Austin-Lacayo, Hayden Gariety', 'NR', 'A disgraced internet personality attempts to win back his followers by livestreaming one night alone in a haunted house. But when he accidentally unleashes a vengeful spirit, his big comeback event becomes a real-time fight for his life.', 'A disgraced internet personality attempts to win back his followers by livestreaming one night alone in a haunted house. But when he accidentally unleashes a vengeful spirit, his big comeback event becomes a real-time fight for his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dC38JMmb17geWFIjIBgNoKRMFnL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:886083'),
  ('699128395939696760', 'DeadTectives', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Tony West', 'Tony West', 'Chris Geere, Tina Ivlev, David Newman, José María de Tavira, Martha Higareda, Emilio Savinni, Mark Riley, Valentina Zertuche', 'NR', 'A team of reality TV paranormal investigators go to Mexico''s most haunted house in the pursuit of better ratings. However, when the true dark secrets of the mansion begin to reveal themselves, the hapless team quickly discover that this house is no hoax. With zero genuine ghost-hunting experience, they have to figure out how to stop the ghosts and escape the house with their lives.', 'A team of reality TV paranormal investigators go to Mexico''s most haunted house in the pursuit of better ratings. However, when the true dark secrets of the mansion begin to reveal themselves, the hapless team quickly discover that this house is no hoax. With zero genuine ghost-hunting experience, they have to figure out how to stop the ghosts and escape the house with their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o3Fo0GFHYzNVK5b1KjhyGYE05vy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:541099'),
  ('31213061175595701', 'Deadtime Stories', 1986, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Daniel B. Canton, Jeffrey Delman', 'Jeffrey Delman, J. Edward Kiernan, Charles F. Shelton', 'Scott Valentine, Nicole Picard, Matt Mitler, Cathryn de Prume, Melissa Leo, Kathy Fleig, Phyllis Craig, Michael Mesmer', 'R', 'A babysitting uncle tells his charges three horror stories: about a killer witch; Little Red Riding Hood and a werewolf; and Goldi Lox and the three bears.', 'A babysitting uncle tells his charges three horror stories: about a killer witch; Little Red Riding Hood and a werewolf; and Goldi Lox and the three bears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5SZ3a2OCWd69m9bBe9FZd6HLCF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66194'),
  ('452369727673122636', 'Deadtime Stories', 2009, 'Horror', 'Tom Savini, Michael Fischa, Jeff Monahan', 'Jeff Monahan', 'George A. Romero, Amy Marsalis, Marty Schiff, Antone Pagán, Matt Walsh, Robert Gordon Spencer, Tom Gregg, Paul Keiserling', 'R', 'An anthology of three horror stories presented by George A. Romero. In "Valley of the Shadow," a woman searches for her missing husband in the jungles of South America, only to be in great danger herself. In "Wet," a lonely man finds an empty box on the beach and opens it, with disastrous results. In "House Call," a doctor is called to a rural farm house to diagnose a strange ailment. This segment is a short film directed by Tom Savini in 2004 as a failed television pilot.', 'An anthology of three horror stories presented by George A. Romero. In "Valley of the Shadow," a woman searches for her missing husband in the jungles of South America, only to be in great danger herself. In "Wet," a lonely man finds an empty box on the beach and opens it, with disastrous results. In "House Call," a doctor is called to a rural farm house to diagnose a strange ailment. This segment is a short film directed by Tom Savini in 2004 as a failed television pilot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sXgvqL8pqaLERnuswBTxLxp0lBE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29429'),
  ('120307380381846830', 'Deadware', 2021, 'Horror', 'Isaac Rodriguez', 'Isaac Rodriguez', 'Sarah Froelich, Ali Alkhafaji, Christine Brown', 'PG-13', 'In 1999, two friends use a webcam for the first time and stumble across a mysterious browser game that may be haunted.', 'In 1999, two friends use a webcam for the first time and stumble across a mysterious browser game that may be haunted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xUUIxodUm6VEfvy1WBYtYB5PSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:895814'),
  ('668870570174847930', 'Deadwood: The Movie', 2019, 'Western, Drama, TV Movie', 'Kenneth Roth, Lisa Zugschwerdt, Daniel Minahan', 'David Milch', 'Timothy Olyphant, Ian McShane, Molly Parker, Paula Malcomson, W. Earl Brown, Dayton Callie, Kim Dickens, Brad Dourif', 'R', 'Follow the 10-year reunion of the Deadwood camp to celebrate South Dakota''s statehood. Former rivalries are reignited, alliances are tested and old wounds are reopened, as all are left to navigate the inevitable changes that modernity and time have wrought.', 'Follow the 10-year reunion of the Deadwood camp to celebrate South Dakota''s statehood. Former rivalries are reignited, alliances are tested and old wounds are reopened, as all are left to navigate the inevitable changes that modernity and time have wrought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCQ13cqd02dop7Chkov0fPl4r3t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538225'),
  ('405490075855899041', 'Deaf', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, John Davey', null, null, null, 'The School for the Deaf at the Alabama Institute is organized around a theory of total communication i.e. the use of signs and finger spelling in conjunction with speech, hearing aids, lip reading, gestures and the written word. The film shows sequences dealing with various aspects of this comprehensive training such as teaching students and parents to sign; speech therapy; psychological counseling; regular academic courses; vocational training; disciplinary problems; parents visits; sports and recreational activity; training in living and working independently; and developing skills in home and money management.', 'The School for the Deaf at the Alabama Institute is organized around a theory of total communication i.e. the use of signs and finger spelling in conjunction with speech, hearing aids, lip reading, gestures and the written word. The film shows sequences dealing with various aspects of this comprehensive training such as teaching students and parents to sign; speech therapy; psychological counseling; regular academic courses; vocational training; disciplinary problems; parents visits; sports and recreational activity; training in living and working independently; and developing skills in home and money management.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsQSwNIA04kuVa9ksTOBEndThID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114426'),
  ('226198862790474607', 'Deaf', 2025, 'Drama', 'Eva Libertad, Gina Ferrer, Irene Roqué', 'Eva Libertad, Eva Libertad', 'Miriam Garlo, Álvaro Cervantes, Elena Irureta, Joaquín Notario, Daniela Saura Pérez, Elaia Sánchez, Jade Molina Uroz, Valentina Arrona Fernández', 'PG-13', 'Angela''s deafness raises concerns during her pregnancy regarding connecting with her daughter. Post-delivery, partner Héctor supports her as she learns to mother in a society lacking adequate accommodations for the hearing-impaired.', 'Angela''s deafness raises concerns during her pregnancy regarding connecting with her daughter. Post-delivery, partner Héctor supports her as she learns to mother in a society lacking adequate accommodations for the hearing-impaired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ykB9bwUHT1AV04KjYPLhfgMwYdD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1303613'),
  ('285140512598321488', 'Deaf Smith & Johnny Ears', 1973, 'Western', 'Paolo Cavara, Tonino Delli Colli', 'Harry Essex, Lucia Brudi, Paolo Cavara', 'Franco Nero, Anthony Quinn, Pamela Tiffin, Ira von Fürstenberg, Adolfo Lastretti, Franco Graziosi, Antonino Faà di Bruno, Renato Romano', 'PG', 'Two friends help Sam Houston work for Texas statehood. Johnny Ears and his deaf-mute sidekick Erastus "Deaf" Smith go after a Mexican general under orders from Germany to agitate the populace.', 'Two friends help Sam Houston work for Texas statehood. Johnny Ears and his deaf-mute sidekick Erastus "Deaf" Smith go after a Mexican general under orders from Germany to agitate the populace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UNs12yJwQHJQiyTSK8OfQ3ib0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152787'),
  ('241355777892780203', 'Deal', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gil Cates Jr., Thomas M. Harting, Gregory Kent Simmons', 'Marc Weinstock, Gil Cates Jr.', 'Burt Reynolds, Bret Harrison, Shannon Elizabeth, Maria Mason, Gary Grubbs, Caroline McKinley, Charles Durning, Brandon Ray Olive', 'PG-13', 'As an ex-gambler teaches a hot-shot college kid some things about playing cards, he finds himself pulled into the world series of poker, where his protégé is his toughest competition.', 'As an ex-gambler teaches a hot-shot college kid some things about playing cards, he finds himself pulled into the world series of poker, where his protégé is his toughest competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zm1FN17vlQb3h5RdQfjPzNvDLWe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11115'),
  ('24605695449627604', 'Deal of the Century', 1983, 'Comedy, Crime', 'William Friedkin, Richard H. Kline, Terence A. Donnelly', 'Paul Brickman', 'Chevy Chase, Sigourney Weaver, Gregory Hines, Vince Edwards, William Marquez, Eduardo Ricard, Richard Herd, Graham Jarvis', 'PG', 'Arms dealers from several companies vie to sell the most expensive and highest tech weapons to a South American dictator. There are complications; understanding the exact nature of how ''gifts'' are used to grease the wheels of a sale, a religious conversion from one of the salesman and a romance that begins to grow between two competitors.', 'Arms dealers from several companies vie to sell the most expensive and highest tech weapons to a South American dictator. There are complications; understanding the exact nature of how ''gifts'' are used to grease the wheels of a sale, a religious conversion from one of the salesman and a romance that begins to grow between two competitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/db2rZF0XO0hzH2AT8ZsDgeHlAYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20545'),
  ('1094093899050476028', 'Dealer', 1999, 'Crime, Drama', 'Thomas Arslan, Michael Wiesweg', 'Thomas Arslan', 'Tamer Yiğit, Birol Ünel, İdil Üner, Baki Davrak, Hussi Kutlucan, Marquard Bohm, Bilge Bingul, Erhan Emre', null, 'Can and his girlfriend, Jale, live with their young daughter, Meral, in a tough Turkish neighbourhood of Berlin and barely manage to scrape enough money together for their existence. Can is a small-time dealer and errand-boy for drug boss Hakan, who has to keep his customers supplied within his narrowly staked out territory. Jale, who works in the ware-house of a department store, has been pressing Can to give up this activity. Can, also fed up with his situation, sees a bright new beginning for himself and his family when Hakan offers him the prospective chance to run a bar on his very own. But Can has little control over the pressures that gradually begin to build up around him and soon finds himself floundering in quicksand.', 'Can and his girlfriend, Jale, live with their young daughter, Meral, in a tough Turkish neighbourhood of Berlin and barely manage to scrape enough money together for their existence. Can is a small-time dealer and errand-boy for drug boss Hakan, who has to keep his customers supplied within his narrowly staked out territory. Jale, who works in the ware-house of a department store, has been pressing Can to give up this activity. Can, also fed up with his situation, sees a bright new beginning for himself and his family when Hakan offers him the prospective chance to run a bar on his very own. But Can has little control over the pressures that gradually begin to build up around him and soon finds himself floundering in quicksand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/frgv1RknzDjSIhgBnrofiD7JDj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165180'),
  ('409347406037290935', 'Dealer', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Jean Luc Herbulot', 'Jean Luc Herbulot, Samy Baaroun', 'Dan Bronchinson, Elsa Madeleine, Salem Kali, Bruno Henry, Hervé Babadi, Dimitri Storoge, Fatima Adoum, Didier Mérigou', null, 'After giving up a life of cocaine trafficking, Dan is offered a chance to achieve his dream : moving to Australia with his daughter. He accepts the deal and starts a downward spiral sucking him back into 24 hours of hell.', 'After giving up a life of cocaine trafficking, Dan is offered a chance to achieve his dream : moving to Australia with his daughter. He accepts the deal and starts a downward spiral sucking him back into 24 hours of hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9NUrbiDGpHPZGTzJU88tAkx1l2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335154'),
  ('825623573868829876', 'Dealer', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jeroen Perceval', 'Jeroen Perceval', 'Sverre Rous, Ben Segers, Hannah Macpherson, Ayman Sitiane, Bart Hollanders, Veerle Baetens, Poal Cairo, Muzafer Ipekci', null, 'Fourteen-year-old drug dealer Johnny is in a home for young people. When he learns that he cannot go home at weekends any longer, he asks one of his customers, famous successful actor Antony, to be his weekend guardian.', 'Fourteen-year-old drug dealer Johnny is in a home for young people. When he learns that he cannot go home at weekends any longer, he asks one of his customers, famous successful actor Antony, to be his weekend guardian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG8zoFQMG1VsmAux2ZyvJqrYho7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788920'),
  ('801222959905213412', 'Dealing with Christmas', 2023, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Arthur Sanigou', 'Arthur Sanigou, Pierre Dudan', 'Éric Judor, Lison Daniel, Ragnar Le Breton, Alex Lutz, Laura Felpin, Paul Deby, Kim Higelin, Catherine Hosmalin', null, 'On Christmas Eve, Greg, a solitary and taciturn police officer, doesn''t hesitate to leave his daughter behind to go on a mission. To teach him a lesson, Santa Claus decides to grant his daughter''s wish: that her father looks like Richard Silestone, the good-natured and heavily indebted family man from the beloved Christmas movie she adores. While Greg is sent into this improbable world, Richard accidentally lands in the real world and both men realize they have no choice but to complete each other''s missions to reclaim their respective lives.', 'On Christmas Eve, Greg, a solitary and taciturn police officer, doesn''t hesitate to leave his daughter behind to go on a mission. To teach him a lesson, Santa Claus decides to grant his daughter''s wish: that her father looks like Richard Silestone, the good-natured and heavily indebted family man from the beloved Christmas movie she adores. While Greg is sent into this improbable world, Richard accidentally lands in the real world and both men realize they have no choice but to complete each other''s missions to reclaim their respective lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9kKDdxX0KZ6x2F5FNCUOa4VQEji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1204912'),
  ('1065743363660249014', 'Dean', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Demetri Martin, Mark Schwartzbard', 'Demetri Martin', 'Demetri Martin, Gillian Jacobs, Christine Woods, Mary Steenburgen, Kevin Kline, Briga Heelan, Ginger Gonzaga, Reid Scott', 'PG-13', 'A comedy about loss, grief, and the redemptive power of love. Dean is a NY illustrator who falls hard for an LA woman while trying to prevent his father from selling the family home in the wake of his mother''s death.', 'A comedy about loss, grief, and the redemptive power of love. Dean is a NY illustrator who falls hard for an LA woman while trying to prevent his father from selling the family home in the wake of his mother''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qnGl6lcpZEJ4L9e24FSfcCCTd95.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305342'),
  ('120413382308355728', 'Dean Spanley', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Toa Fraser, Leon Narbey', 'Alan Sharp', 'Jeremy Northam, Sam Neill, Bryan Brown, Peter O''Toole, Judy Parfitt, Art Malik, Ramon Tikaram', null, 'Set in Edwardian England where upper lips are always stiff and men from the Colonies are not entirely to be trusted, Fisk Senior has little time or affection for his son, but when the pair visit an eccentric Indian, they start a strange journey that eventually allows the old man to find his heart.', 'Set in Edwardian England where upper lips are always stiff and men from the Colonies are not entirely to be trusted, Fisk Senior has little time or affection for his son, but when the pair visit an eccentric Indian, they start a strange journey that eventually allows the old man to find his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d27eaUjLc0l1mT2hM8Jwwt7iWMz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18117'),
  ('1045978317365540325', 'DeAndré#DeAndré - Storia di un impiegato', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Martino Pellion Di Persano, Roberta Lena', 'Roberta Lena, Alfredo Covelli', 'Cristiano De Andrè, Dori Ghezzi, Filippo De Andrè', null, 'A tangle of stories in which aspirations and yearnings for freedom on the part of the white-collar worker are intertwined with those of Cristiano''s personal and musical life in a discourse on our contemporary world.', 'A tangle of stories in which aspirations and yearnings for freedom on the part of the white-collar worker are intertwined with those of Cristiano''s personal and musical life in a discourse on our contemporary world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfNPSjIYAAZtpUQlUtkJyeALmt8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854518'),
  ('701843822734908137', 'Dear America: Letters Home from Vietnam', 1987, 'Documentary, War', 'Bill Couturié', 'Richard Dewhurst', 'Ellen Burstyn, Tom Berenger, J. Kenneth Campbell, Richard Chaves, Josh Cruze, Willem Dafoe, Robert De Niro, Brian Dennehy', 'PG', 'Real-life letters written by American soldiers, sailors, airmen, and Marines during the Vietnam War to their families and friends back home. Archive footage of the war and news coverage thereof augment the first-person "narrative" by men and women who were in the war, some of whom did not survive it.', 'Real-life letters written by American soldiers, sailors, airmen, and Marines during the Vietnam War to their families and friends back home. Archive footage of the war and news coverage thereof augment the first-person "narrative" by men and women who were in the war, some of whom did not survive it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxtyyPSPcuCn1aNCzpkGfV4eLi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61777'),
  ('1021262772547075960', 'Dear Basketball', 2017, 'Animation, History', 'Glen Keane', 'Kobe Bryant', 'Kobe Bryant, Mike Breen', 'NR', 'An animated telling of Kobe Bryant''s titular poem, signaling his retirement from the sport that made his name.', 'An animated telling of Kobe Bryant''s titular poem, signaling his retirement from the sport that made his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3NGzWIhzgquYP263ZfAQNsi11Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483306'),
  ('563499586435927478', 'Dear Brigitte', 1965, 'Comedy, Family', 'Henry Koster, Lucien Ballard, Fred R. Simpson', 'Hal Kanter, Nunnally Johnson', 'James Stewart, Fabian, Glynis Johns, Cindy Carol, Bill Mumy, John Williams, Brigitte Bardot, Jack Kruschen', 'NR', 'Professor Leaf, an absent-minded poet with a prejudice against the sciences, is forced to face the fact that his son is a math prodigy with little artistic talent of his own.', 'Professor Leaf, an absent-minded poet with a prejudice against the sciences, is forced to face the fact that his son is a math prodigy with little artistic talent of his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j6e1w0bmoaQpu74QLuYWdsne9dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42734'),
  ('604536201287321422', 'Dear Caroline', 1951, 'Comedy', 'Richard Pottier', 'Jean Anouilh, Michel Audiard', 'Martine Carol, Jacques Baumer, Alfred Adam, Jacques Dacqmine, Marie Déa, Raymond Souplex, Jacques Clancy, Pierre Cressoy', null, 'France, July 1782. During her birthday, the beautiful young Marchioness Caroline meets the attractive soldier Gaston. It''s love at first sight but Gaston does not wish to make a commitment because a military career waits for him. Caroline marries then a politician but the French Revolution bursts and Caroline has to run away to escape the guillotine. By running away she meets Gaston again who decides to help her.', 'France, July 1782. During her birthday, the beautiful young Marchioness Caroline meets the attractive soldier Gaston. It''s love at first sight but Gaston does not wish to make a commitment because a military career waits for him. Caroline marries then a politician but the French Revolution bursts and Caroline has to run away to escape the guillotine. By running away she meets Gaston again who decides to help her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PYLnDckpS5b5h2PGHpGQNZf2vo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79514'),
  ('874182109812014722', 'Dear Christmas', 2020, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Ryan Galvan, Emily Moss Wilson', 'Keith Giglio, Juliet Giglio', 'Melissa Joan Hart, Jason Priestley, Faith Prince, Ed Begley Jr., Robin Givens, Nicky Whelan, Rachelle Carson-Begley, Hilarie Burton', null, 'Natalie Morgan is an author and host of a popular podcast, Holiday Love, which shares true stories of holiday romance with its listeners. While to the outside world and her listeners everywhere see Natalie is an expert on romance, she''s never truly experienced a romance of her own. As Natalie prepares to embark on a promotional tour for her new book, she stops back home to spend Christmas with her family and to celebrate her parent''s 50th anniversary where she unexpectedly begins to experience her own holiday romance as sparks ignite with local firefighter, Jack.', 'Natalie Morgan is an author and host of a popular podcast, Holiday Love, which shares true stories of holiday romance with its listeners. While to the outside world and her listeners everywhere see Natalie is an expert on romance, she''s never truly experienced a romance of her own. As Natalie prepares to embark on a promotional tour for her new book, she stops back home to spend Christmas with her family and to celebrate her parent''s 50th anniversary where she unexpectedly begins to experience her own holiday romance as sparks ignite with local firefighter, Jack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Izo5eJ9aOCd6Ikf0M5sxCzZnNc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744941'),
  ('651409718648839756', 'Dear Comrades!', 2020, 'History, Drama', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Andrey Naydenov, Polina Volynkina', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Elena Kiseleva', 'Yuliya Vysotskaya, Sergei Erlish, Yulia Burova, Andrei Gusev, Vladislav Komarov, Dmitry Kostyaev, Вячеслав Пигарев, Владимир Бабаев', null, 'When the communist government raises food prices in 1962, the rebellious workers from the small industrial town of Novocherkassk go on strike. The massacre which then ensues is seen through the eyes of a devout party activist.', 'When the communist government raises food prices in 1962, the rebellious workers from the small industrial town of Novocherkassk go on strike. The massacre which then ensues is seen through the eyes of a devout party activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ds7T5PEplJQeKzpLWbIvW9xpHX1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587609'),
  ('1004322171698116889', 'Dear Dakanda', 2005, 'Romance, Drama', 'Pramett Chankrasse, Varayu Rukskul, Nontra Khumvong', 'Nitis Napichayasutin', 'Sunny Suwanmethanon, Siraphan Wattanajinda, Maneerat Kam-Uan, Panissara Arayaskul, Achita Sikamana, Thanabordin Yongsuebchat, Isayom Rattanaudomchoke, Naowarat Bansit', null, 'Recovering from an accident, an artist is torn between the nurse who is helping him recover and a college friend for whom he secretly longs.', 'Recovering from an accident, an artist is torn between the nurse who is helping him recover and a college friend for whom he secretly longs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5czBd9YZTE26trqXbhrZtnEcM9z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76430'),
  ('927294097042233678', 'Dear David', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John McPhail, Stephen Chandler Whitehead', 'Mike Van Waes', 'Augustus Prew, Rachel Wilson, Justin Long, Andrea Bang, René Escobar Jr., Cameron Nicoll, Jarrett Siddall, David Tompa', 'R', 'Shortly after comic artist Adam responds to Internet trolls, he begins experiencing sleep paralysis. As he chronicles increasingly malevolent occurrences in a series of tweets, Adam begins to believe he is being haunted by the ghost of a dead child named David.', 'Shortly after comic artist Adam responds to Internet trolls, he begins experiencing sleep paralysis. As he chronicles increasingly malevolent occurrences in a series of tweets, Adam begins to believe he is being haunted by the ghost of a dead child named David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kT5tsoIWnXlLBaeOfkoso11dUgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:609768'),
  ('34830771182306913', 'Dear Dead Delilah', 1972, 'Horror', 'John Farris, Kurt Baker, William R. Johnson', 'John Farris', 'Agnes Moorehead, Will Geer, Michael Ansara, Dennis Patrick, Anne Meacham, Robert Gentry, Patricia Carmichael, Elizabeth Eis', null, 'The stern matriarch of a family that lives in a creepy mansion finds that a killer is hiding in the house, searching for a $600,000 fortune rumored to be hidden there and chopping off the heads of anyone who gets in the way.', 'The stern matriarch of a family that lives in a creepy mansion finds that a killer is hiding in the house, searching for a $600,000 fortune rumored to be hidden there and chopping off the heads of anyone who gets in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2JPnneEqghDY8WTsSc4fyGJdht.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113382'),
  ('287869568120541130', 'Dear Diary', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Riccardo Milani, Nanni Moretti, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Renato Carpentieri, Antonio Neiwiller, Claudia Della Seta, Lorenzo Alessandri, Raffaella Lebboroni, Marco Paolini, Moni Ovadia', null, 'Nanni Moretti recalls in his diary three slice of life stories characterized by a sharply ironic look: in the first one he wanders through a deserted Rome, in the second he visits a reclusive friend on an island, and in the last he has to grapple with an unknown illness.', 'Nanni Moretti recalls in his diary three slice of life stories characterized by a sharply ironic look: in the first one he wanders through a deserted Rome, in the second he visits a reclusive friend on an island, and in the last he has to grapple with an unknown illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAjbgSUvZDoy5jPbC5jD6pWvlyZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25403'),
  ('1050465100712877595', 'Dear Diary', 1996, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'David Frankel, Maryse Alberti', 'David Frankel', 'Bebe Neuwirth, Bruce Altman, Mike Starr, Haviland Morris, Jeff Blumenkrantz, Peter Giles, Brian Kerwin, Peter Vack', null, 'A New York magazine art director, a married mother of two who just turned 40, decides to record the events of her day in a journal. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'A New York magazine art director, a married mother of two who just turned 40, decides to record the events of her day in a journal. The film won an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aO6EEbMgCTl6EXKa93OzQTBzWCu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244901'),
  ('547307862301397957', 'Dear Dictator', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Wyatt Troll, Lisa Addario, Joe Syracuse', 'Joe Syracuse, Lisa Addario', 'Michael Caine, Odeya Rush, Katie Holmes, Seth Green, Jason Biggs, Adrian Voo, Jackson Beard, Fish Myrr', 'NR', 'When political turmoil forces a British-Caribbean dictator to flee his island nation, he seeks refuge and hides with a rebellious teenage girl in suburban America, and ends up teaching the young teen how to start a revolution and overthrow the "mean girls" in her high school.', 'When political turmoil forces a British-Caribbean dictator to flee his island nation, he seeks refuge and hides with a rebellious teenage girl in suburban America, and ends up teaching the young teen how to start a revolution and overthrow the "mean girls" in her high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YFCAAZUUpj66gLAMqRhwpY1U34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418667'),
  ('819563822000446635', 'Dear Doctor', 2009, 'Drama', 'Miwa Nishikawa, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Miwa Nishikawa', 'Eita Nagayama, Tsurube Shofukutei, Kaoru Yachigusa, Kimiko Yo, Haruka Igawa, Teruyuki Kagawa, Ryo Iwamatsu, Yutaka Matsushige', null, 'Osamu Ino is a great doctor who is beloved in his rural village. His knowledge and dedication make an equally strong impression on his reluctant medical intern, Keisuke Soma. But, Soma and the villagers reconsider their opinion when they learn about a shameful incident from Dr. Ino''s past. Now the once-respected doctor must account for his past actions.', 'Osamu Ino is a great doctor who is beloved in his rural village. His knowledge and dedication make an equally strong impression on his reluctant medical intern, Keisuke Soma. But, Soma and the villagers reconsider their opinion when they learn about a shameful incident from Dr. Ino''s past. Now the once-respected doctor must account for his past actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnSBirYfKFivRPFvmwdBaoXWr5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88797'),
  ('20567498680589453', 'Dear Eleanor', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama', 'Kevin Connolly, Steven Fierberg', 'Cecilia Contreras, Amy Garcia', 'Liana Liberato, Isabelle Fuhrman, Josh Lucas, Jessica Alba, Luke Wilson, Joel Courtney, Patrick Schwarzenegger, Ione Skye', null, 'Two teenage girls travel across the U.S. in 1962, during the chaos of the Cuban missile crisis, in search of Eleanor Roosevelt.', 'Two teenage girls travel across the U.S. in 1962, during the chaos of the Cuban missile crisis, in search of Eleanor Roosevelt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMG1e83PHqtjQLgXZhy2IMn3eX0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253343'),
  ('754598036002542442', 'Dear Enemy', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Xu Jinglei', 'Liu Liyang, Xu Jinglei', 'Xu Jinglei, Stanley Huang, Gigi Leung Wing-Kei, Aarif Rahman, Christy Chung Lai-Tai, Michael Wong, Zhao Baogang, Kishore Bhatt', null, 'Hong Kong, the present day. With the lithium market in a dip, UA Capital Investment Banking, led by hotshot managing director Derek Lee (Stanley Huang), brokers a merger offer to Brandon Mining, one of the world''s big three lithium producers along with Anchor Exploration and Clayton Global. Investigative journalist Henry Ma (Aarif Lee), who runs financial blog Golden Touch, gets wind of the plan and makes it public. UA'';s client is believed to be Anchor, and Brandon'';s CEO Owen (Michael Wong) considers it a hostile takeover. His financial advisor is Derek'';s onetime lover, Amy Liang (Xu Jinglei), associate managing director of Global Alliance Investment Banking, who finally split up with Derek', 'Hong Kong, the present day. With the lithium market in a dip, UA Capital Investment Banking, led by hotshot managing director Derek Lee (Stanley Huang), brokers a merger offer to Brandon Mining, one of the world''s big three lithium producers along with Anchor Exploration and Clayton Global. Investigative journalist Henry Ma (Aarif Lee), who runs financial blog Golden Touch, gets wind of the plan and makes it public. UA'';s client is believed to be Anchor, and Brandon'';s CEO Owen (Michael Wong) considers it a hostile takeover. His financial advisor is Derek'';s onetime lover, Amy Liang (Xu Jinglei), associate managing director of Global Alliance Investment Banking, who finally split up with Derek', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o7zgURZoHZvMMRCRlZaxRfmjyb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93898'),
  ('405115374616042992', 'Dear Etranger', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kenjiro So, Yukiko Mishima, Ryo Otsuka', 'Haruhiko Arai', 'Tadanobu Asano, Rena Tanaka, Shinobu Terajima, Kankuro Kudo, Shingo Mizusawa, Narushi Ikeda, Sara Minami, Raiju Kamata', null, 'Makoto Tanaka is 40-years-old and has remarried. His wife is Nanae and they care for 2 daughters from Nanae''s prior marriage. Makoto tries to have an ordinary family. Nanae then becomes pregnant. Afterwards, things begin to change among the family members.', 'Makoto Tanaka is 40-years-old and has remarried. His wife is Nanae and they care for 2 daughters from Nanae''s prior marriage. Makoto tries to have an ordinary family. Nanae then becomes pregnant. Afterwards, things begin to change among the family members.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/485hcPN3WCw82c5O2AVrX2bDjUo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473397'),
  ('385284137614533610', 'Dear Evan Hansen', 2021, 'Drama', 'Brandon Trost, Jonathan McGarry, Stephen Chbosky', 'Steven Levenson', 'Ben Platt, Kaitlyn Dever, Amy Adams, Amandla Stenberg, Nik Dodani, Julianne Moore, Danny Pino, Colton Ryan', 'PG-13', 'Evan Hansen, a high schooler with social anxiety, unintentionally gets caught up in a lie after the family of a classmate who committed suicide mistakes one of Hansen’s letters for their son’s suicide note.', 'Evan Hansen, a high schooler with social anxiety, unintentionally gets caught up in a lie after the family of a classmate who committed suicide mistakes one of Hansen’s letters for their son’s suicide note.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKjBQhsnCMt86kPKpPwV4meeFPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567690'),
  ('160387579077498408', 'Dear Ex', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Mag Hsu, Hsu Chih-yen, Yu Hui-wen', 'Mag Hsu, Lu Shih-yuan', 'Hsieh Ying-shiuan, Roy Chiu, Joseph Huang, Spark Chen, Ai-Lun Kao, One-Fang, Danny Liang, Yang Li-yin', 'NR', 'When Sanlian''s ex-husband passes away, she discovers he has altered his insurance policy, cutting out their son in favor of a stranger named Jay.', 'When Sanlian''s ex-husband passes away, she discovers he has altered his insurance policy, cutting out their son in favor of a stranger named Jay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rRUp4WZdvt4LfdXIWL0qmFv9UI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:524087'),
  ('765693277174363133', 'Dear Father', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Dino Risi, Claudio Risi', 'Bernardino Zapponi, Marco Risi, Dino Risi', 'Vittorio Gassman, Aurore Clément, Andrée Lachapelle, Stefano Madia, Julien Guiomar, Joanne Côté, Piero Del Papa, Pietro Tordi', null, 'In Caro papá, Dino Risi is telling the story of the decadent lifestyle, and dysfunctional family, of a wealthy businessman (played to perfection by Risi''s favorite leading man, Vittorio Gassman). Risi paints his portrait against a backdrop of an Italy where the new permissiveness has run rampant, traditional socio-cultural values have been usurped by consumerism, and the streets have become an open battleground for politically extremist groups (the ''70s were dubbed "The Years of Lead" due to the great number of terrorist acts, and politically motivated assassinations).', 'In Caro papá, Dino Risi is telling the story of the decadent lifestyle, and dysfunctional family, of a wealthy businessman (played to perfection by Risi''s favorite leading man, Vittorio Gassman). Risi paints his portrait against a backdrop of an Italy where the new permissiveness has run rampant, traditional socio-cultural values have been usurped by consumerism, and the streets have become an open battleground for politically extremist groups (the ''70s were dubbed "The Years of Lead" due to the great number of terrorist acts, and politically motivated assassinations).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EMMTQKo8hhftoH23y96xt8mAAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65480'),
  ('261339544420747300', 'Dear Frankie', 2004, 'Drama, Family', 'Shona Auerbach, Shona Auerbach', 'Andrea Gibb', 'Gerard Butler, Emily Mortimer, Jack McElhone, Sharon Small, Katy Murphy, Jayd Johnson, Mary Riggans, Cal MacAninch', null, 'Nine-year-old Frankie and his single mum Lizzie have been on the move ever since Frankie can remember, most recently arriving in a seaside Scottish town. Wanting to protect her deaf son from the truth that they''ve run away from his father, Lizzie has invented a story that he is away at sea on the HMS Accra. Every few weeks, Lizzie writes Frankie a make-believe letter from his father, telling of his adventures in exotic lands. As Frankie tracks the ship''s progress around the globe, he discovers that it is due to dock in his hometown. With the real HMS Accra arriving in only a fortnight, Lizzie must choose between telling Frankie the truth or finding the perfect stranger to play Frankie''s father for just one day...', 'Nine-year-old Frankie and his single mum Lizzie have been on the move ever since Frankie can remember, most recently arriving in a seaside Scottish town. Wanting to protect her deaf son from the truth that they''ve run away from his father, Lizzie has invented a story that he is away at sea on the HMS Accra. Every few weeks, Lizzie writes Frankie a make-believe letter from his father, telling of his adventures in exotic lands. As Frankie tracks the ship''s progress around the globe, he discovers that it is due to dock in his hometown. With the real HMS Accra arriving in only a fortnight, Lizzie must choose between telling Frankie the truth or finding the perfect stranger to play Frankie''s father for just one day...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YRDvaBWBbhTKBYYc7BoOWdW01N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8981'),
  ('432519367442603200', 'Dear Friends', 2007, 'Drama', 'Kazuyuki Morosawa, Shogo Ueno', 'Uiko Miura, Kazuyuki Morosawa', 'Keiko Kitagawa, Yuika Motokariya, Masaya Kikawada, Airi Toriyama, Mao Sasaki, Hatsune Matsushima, Ren Osugi, Yoshiko Miyazaki', null, 'Rina is the it girl. She is thin, has long hair, is flaunting and dresses attractively. Every man wants to be with her and every woman wants to be like her. She also happens to be self-absorbed, mean and nasty.', 'Rina is the it girl. She is thin, has long hair, is flaunting and dresses attractively. Every man wants to be with her and every woman wants to be like her. She also happens to be self-absorbed, mean and nasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pMePPS2FNDFOhdX82CyjjH537wg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58057'),
  ('695626885753538243', 'Dear Galileo', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nithiwat Tharathorn, Nontra Kumwong, Naruphol Chokanapitak', 'Sopana Chaowwiwatkul, Nithiwat Tharathorn', 'Chutima Teepanat, Jarinporn Joonkiat, Ray MacDonald, Thanakorn Chinakul, Wongsakorn Rassamitat, Gunn Junhavat, Chamni Thipmanee, Jirawat Wachirasarunpat', null, 'College friends whose lives are at a crossroads decide to spend a year in Europe, working in Thai restaurants, and trying not to get deported.', 'College friends whose lives are at a crossroads decide to spend a year in Europe, working in Thai restaurants, and trying not to get deported.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/npSxFAFuiXzqG7WmDn4qvgRCswD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43910'),
  ('710619649535540636', 'Dear God', 1996, 'Comedy', 'Garry Marshall, Charles Minsky', 'Warren Leight, Ed Kaplan', 'Greg Kinnear, Laurie Metcalf, Maria Pitillo, Tim Conway, Héctor Elizondo, Jon Seda, Roscoe Lee Browne, Anna Maria Horsford', 'PG', 'A judge gives con-man Tom Turner a choice—a jail sentence, or a year of honest work. But when he gets a job in the U.S. Post Office''s dead letter office, he starts a Good Samaritan con by answering letters written to God. His seemingly virtuous work inspires his co-workers to do the same, but their good deeds are frowned upon by the postmaster general—and the cops.', 'A judge gives con-man Tom Turner a choice—a jail sentence, or a year of honest work. But when he gets a job in the U.S. Post Office''s dead letter office, he starts a Good Samaritan con by answering letters written to God. His seemingly virtuous work inspires his co-workers to do the same, but their good deeds are frowned upon by the postmaster general—and the cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHc6hY6Rv7S7kS50vW2vVdHWG79.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38554'),
  ('675064243503226018', 'Dear Goddamned Friends', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mario Monicelli, Tonino Nardi, Anna Antonelli', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Piero De Bernardi', 'Paolo Villaggio, Paolo Hendel, Eva Grimaldi, Antonella Ponziani, Béatrice Macola, Massimo Ceccherini, Marco Graziani, Giuseppe Oppedisano', null, 'In 1944 Tuscany, a group of boxers struggling through World War II stages rigged matches to earn money and travel, accompanied by a missing black American soldier and a girl resisting marriage, as they navigate the challenges of their war-torn world.', 'In 1944 Tuscany, a group of boxers struggling through World War II stages rigged matches to earn money and travel, accompanied by a missing black American soldier and a girl resisting marriage, as they navigate the challenges of their war-torn world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LlGU2hppgQPo4Oc0CJ8OeLyQ3i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64822'),
  ('373042079820163932', 'Dear Heart', 1965, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Carter DeHaven Jr., Delbert Mann, Russell Harlan', 'Tad Mosel', 'Glenn Ford, Geraldine Page, Angela Lansbury, Michael Anderson Jr., Barbara Nichols, Patricia Barry, Charles Drake, Richard Deacon', 'NR', 'A lonely Ohio spinster hopes to find romance when she travels to New York City for a postmasters'' convention.', 'A lonely Ohio spinster hopes to find romance when she travels to New York City for a postmasters'' convention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8rRzxfPsztNhgac81KJk3tphCME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101226'),
  ('828603412066478021', 'Dear Inspector', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Philippe de Broca', 'Jean-Paul Rouland, Michel Audiard', 'Annie Girardot, Philippe Noiret, Catherine Alric, Hubert Deschamps, Paulette Dubost, Roger Dumas, Raymond Gérôme, Guy Marchand', null, 'When Lise''s car bumps Antoine''s bike, they recognize each other from a brief fling 20 years before while at the Sorbonne. He''s now a professor of Greek; she''s loathe to tell him she''s a police inspector. A call interrupts their first dinner date: a Deputy of the National Assembly has been murdered. She has a suspect, another Deputy, and must track him while deflecting Antoine''s eye from her vocation. All roads in the inquiry lead to Christine Vallier, the dead Deputy''s mistress, a beguiling 22-year-old whose mother ran the Assembly''s snack bar. When more deputies die and Antoine learns Lise''s identity, she must act quickly solve the crime and save her future.', 'When Lise''s car bumps Antoine''s bike, they recognize each other from a brief fling 20 years before while at the Sorbonne. He''s now a professor of Greek; she''s loathe to tell him she''s a police inspector. A call interrupts their first dinner date: a Deputy of the National Assembly has been murdered. She has a suspect, another Deputy, and must track him while deflecting Antoine''s eye from her vocation. All roads in the inquiry lead to Christine Vallier, the dead Deputy''s mistress, a beguiling 22-year-old whose mother ran the Assembly''s snack bar. When more deputies die and Antoine learns Lise''s identity, she must act quickly solve the crime and save her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzHKScCssgA4gJZqNDxcYM4UgrU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33337'),
  ('170903807089936911', 'Dear John', 1964, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lars-Magnus Lindgren, Rune Ericson', 'Lars-Magnus Lindgren', 'Jarl Kulle, Christina Schollin, Erik Hell, Emy Storm, Hans Wigren, Håkan Serner, Morgan Andersson, Synnöve Liljebäck', null, 'Divorced skipper John meets Anita, a single mother, at a port and spends the weekend with her.', 'Divorced skipper John meets Anita, a single mother, at a port and spends the weekend with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iryvgW2uWmsgjgjljkJ51xKpzhw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75653'),
  ('360751171515803117', 'Dear John', 2010, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Lasse Hallström, Terry Stacey, Charles Croughwell', 'Jamie Linden', 'Amanda Seyfried, Channing Tatum, Richard Jenkins, Henry Thomas, D.J. Cotrona, Cullen Moss, Gavin McCulley, Jose Lucena Jr.', 'PG-13', 'While Sergeant John Tyree is home on two weeks leave from Germany, he meets Savannah after he dives into the ocean to retrieve Savannah''s purse that had fallen off a pier. John eventually falls in love with Savannah, who promises to write to him until he returns from overseas.', 'While Sergeant John Tyree is home on two weeks leave from Germany, he meets Savannah after he dives into the ocean to retrieve Savannah''s purse that had fallen off a pier. John eventually falls in love with Savannah, who promises to write to him until he returns from overseas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lAPv2jQ5eh54l4EttA9wjDljED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22971'),
  ('999523583514933614', 'Dear Kurt', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Til Schweiger', null, 'Heiner Lauterbach, Til Schweiger, Franziska Machens, Jasmin Gerat, Nina Proll, Marie Burchard, Steffen Wink, Peter Simonischek', null, 'Kurt (Til Schweiger) and Lena (Franziska Machens) move together into an old house outside the city that is in need of renovation in order to be closer to Kurt''s six-year-old son, little Kurt (Levi Wolter), and ex-wife Jana (Jasmin Gerat). But before their patchwork family happiness can really begin, little Kurt is killed in an accident - leaving behind three adults who don''t know how to live with this tragic loss.', 'Kurt (Til Schweiger) and Lena (Franziska Machens) move together into an old house outside the city that is in need of renovation in order to be closer to Kurt''s six-year-old son, little Kurt (Levi Wolter), and ex-wife Jana (Jasmin Gerat). But before their patchwork family happiness can really begin, little Kurt is killed in an accident - leaving behind three adults who don''t know how to live with this tragic loss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Qrur9Qy1OQ1L9FmkBZt9HEOEZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:915891'),
  ('202070688072067706', 'Dear Lemon Lima', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Suzi Yoonessi, Sarah Levy', 'Suzi Yoonessi', 'Savanah Wiltfong, Shayne Topp, Beth Grant, Melissa Leo, Meaghan Jette Martin, Elaine Hendrix, Vanessa Marano, Eleanor Hutchins', null, 'After being dumped by Philip, her one true love, the infatuated Nessa enrolls at his private school in the hopes of winning him back.', 'After being dumped by Philip, her one true love, the infatuated Nessa enrolls at his private school in the hopes of winning him back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuwv0uJxpYiolFbwoOACgXCEV2X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71394'),
  ('567473999724854464', 'Dear Louise', 1972, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Philippe de Broca, Ricardo Aronovich', 'Jean-Loup Dabadie, Jean-Louis Curtis', 'Jeanne Moreau, Julian Negulesco, Didi Perego, Yves Robert, Pippo Starnazza, Louis Navarre, Luce Fabiole, Jenny Arasse', null, 'Louise lives alone and seems to like it that way. She has been through a divorce and the recent death of her mother. Recently, she has moved to Annecy, a moderate-sized city, to take work as a schoolteacher. She encounters a much younger man, Luigi, an Italian who is down on his luck. Though he moved to France to find work, he was robbed of his money and papers and is stranded. When he helps her bury her dogs, which her neighbour has poisoned for barking, their relationship grows to a new level.', 'Louise lives alone and seems to like it that way. She has been through a divorce and the recent death of her mother. Recently, she has moved to Annecy, a moderate-sized city, to take work as a schoolteacher. She encounters a much younger man, Luigi, an Italian who is down on his luck. Though he moved to France to find work, he was robbed of his money and papers and is stranded. When he helps her bury her dogs, which her neighbour has poisoned for barking, their relationship grows to a new level.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGddRdi3Obr3giogyrpV53nlskt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198645'),
  ('247591329597763728', 'Dear Maya', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sunaina Bhatnagar', null, 'Manisha Koirala, Vikas Kumar, Madiha Imam, Shreya Chaudhary, Sahiba Bali, Naila Grrewal', null, 'Anna and Ira prank a local woman by writing her letters from a secret admirer. The prank takes a more serious turn when the local women goes missing.', 'Anna and Ira prank a local woman by writing her letters from a secret admirer. The prank takes a more serious turn when the local women goes missing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VIhPemMW8ZJOTOWpjGTQh8FXfI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456558'),
  ('1054613930700135591', 'Dear Michele', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tonino Delli Colli, Mario Monicelli, Rinaldo Ricci', 'Suso Cecchi d''Amico, Tonino Guerra', 'Mariangela Melato, Delphine Seyrig, Lou Castel, Aurore Clément, Fabio Carpi, Marcella Michelangeli, Isa Danieli, Alfonso Gatto', null, 'Michael is the younger son of a middle-class family, a strong-willed and free-thinking fellow, who is off in some distant country fighting for a revolutionary cause. Everyone in the family writes to him, describing the events of their lives, as they drift into a kind of conventionality which would perhaps have horrified them earlier. Only Michael’s girlfriend Mara, the mother of his child, retains her independence, even though it is through the help of Michael’s increasingly conventional friends and family that she survives.', 'Michael is the younger son of a middle-class family, a strong-willed and free-thinking fellow, who is off in some distant country fighting for a revolutionary cause. Everyone in the family writes to him, describing the events of their lives, as they drift into a kind of conventionality which would perhaps have horrified them earlier. Only Michael’s girlfriend Mara, the mother of his child, retains her independence, even though it is through the help of Michael’s increasingly conventional friends and family that she survives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPj0QxpiHJdUI83uhUtHEtJq9ov.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67177'),
  ('500011807975495337', 'Dear Mother', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Laurent Lafitte, Axel Cosnefroy, Frédéric Gérard', 'Laurent Lafitte', 'Laurent Lafitte, Karin Viard, Hélène Vincent, Vincent Macaigne, Nicole Garcia, Christine Beauvallet, Juliette Bettencourt, Charlotte Bienenfeld', null, 'One day, Jean-Louis discovers that his heart has stopped. He is not dead, can walk and talk, but his heart is no longer beating. With the help of his wife and a friend, he tries to understand the origin of this mystery.', 'One day, Jean-Louis discovers that his heart has stopped. He is not dead, can walk and talk, but his heart is no longer beating. With the help of his wife and a friend, he tries to understand the origin of this mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9btM1KTckYffLNMGy5x5Qen9noI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615684'),
  ('1024467166594206022', 'Dear Mr. Gacy', 2010, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Svetozar Ristovski, Brett McCord, Bryant Marshall', 'Kellie Madison', 'William Forsythe, Jesse Moss, Emma Lahana, Cole Heppell, Belinda Metz, Michael Ryan, Eric Keenleyside, Daryl Shuttleworth', 'R', 'A chronicle of the interaction between college student Jason Moss and the object of his obsession, serial killer John Wayne Gacy.', 'A chronicle of the interaction between college student Jason Moss and the object of his obsession, serial killer John Wayne Gacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zftYdcc60ixcsQu6a5ndWCUJIQ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51512'),
  ('773851143869466652', 'Dear Murderer', 1947, 'Thriller', 'Arthur Crabtree, Stephen Dade, Bert Batt', 'Muriel Box, Sydney Box, Peter Rogers', 'Eric Portman, Greta Gynt, Dennis Price, Jack Warner, Maxwell Reed, Hazel Court, Jane Hylton, Andrew Crawford', 'NR', 'When a man discovers his wife is having an affair, he commits the perfect crime.', 'When a man discovers his wife is having an affair, he commits the perfect crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR2IuJNEi6SyBYVAIbjY6XyTq5d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36335'),
  ('342607900938216864', 'Dear Paris', 2024, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Maxime Alexandre, Dylan Talleux, Marjane Satrapi', 'Marie Madinier, Marjane Satrapi', 'Monica Bellucci, André Dussollier, Roschdy Zem, Eduardo Noriega, Rossy de Palma, Alex Lutz, Martina García, Gwendal Marimoutou', null, 'What makes life worth living? In a set of interconnected stories, several Paris residents see their lives turned upside down when death knocks at their door: a narcissistic Italian opera singer wakes up at the morgue only to realise her own passing came unnoticed; a British stuntman finds himself questioning his own profession when his son suffers an accident; an eccentric elderly Colombian woman makes a pact with death itself... While each character strives to reconnect with what matters most, the city of light, love and endless possibility shines brighter than ever.', 'What makes life worth living? In a set of interconnected stories, several Paris residents see their lives turned upside down when death knocks at their door: a narcissistic Italian opera singer wakes up at the morgue only to realise her own passing came unnoticed; a British stuntman finds himself questioning his own profession when his son suffers an accident; an eccentric elderly Colombian woman makes a pact with death itself... While each character strives to reconnect with what matters most, the city of light, love and endless possibility shines brighter than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AtlNewzoGpSVk1Udib4XmZjIF3x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119546'),
  ('358686977229002287', 'Dear Phone', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway, Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', 'Peter Greenaway', null, 'A narrator relates a variety of peculiar stories involving characters with the initials HC and their dealings with telephones. These are interspersed with artistic shots of telephone boxes in a variety of locations.', 'A narrator relates a variety of peculiar stories involving characters with the initials HC and their dealings with telephones. These are interspersed with artistic shots of telephone boxes in a variety of locations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zybxn5r81HR9p1IIVR4Fnxxxypc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49459'),
  ('737565819144552904', 'Dear Radhi', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller, Comedy', 'Praveen K Mani', 'Praveen K Mani', 'Saravana Vickram, Rajesh Balachandiran, Hasli, Pasupathy, Sai Dinesh Badram', null, 'Madhan goes on a one-day date with Radhi, a beautiful girl who works at a spa; the day spirals into a dangerous chase as both the police and a gang hunt for Radhi, ending in a shocking truth that reveals their connection.', 'Madhan goes on a one-day date with Radhi, a beautiful girl who works at a spa; the day spirals into a dangerous chase as both the police and a gang hunt for Radhi, ending in a shocking truth that reveals their connection.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F9m7Bq47NxPxbJrkzu3QaDiv1D1W.jpg', 'plex:movie:dear-radhi'),
  ('885021717333815970', 'Dear Santa', 1998, 'Family, Fantasy', 'Fred Olen Ray', null, 'D.L. Green, Harrison Myers, Debra Rich, Robert Quarry, Richard Gabai, Tena Fanning, Ariana McClain, Bennett Curland', null, 'Gordon Covington is a man who tries to make time for his family despite the demands of his job. But sometimes Covington''s boss prevents him from keeping the promises he makes to his kids, and when he misses spending Christmas with the family, an elf named Randy decides to teach Gordon a lesson by turning him into someone else who has to work on Christmas -- Santa Claus.', 'Gordon Covington is a man who tries to make time for his family despite the demands of his job. But sometimes Covington''s boss prevents him from keeping the promises he makes to his kids, and when he misses spending Christmas with the family, an elf named Randy decides to teach Gordon a lesson by turning him into someone else who has to work on Christmas -- Santa Claus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aBU1a2j4uTFkJaHr02d94dzx7PC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150792'),
  ('880209817539212079', 'Dear Santa', 2011, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jason Priestley, David Vernerey', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Amy Acker, David Haydn-Jones, Gina Holden, James Dugan, Patrick Creery, Emma Duke', 'PG', 'Crystal, a rich party girl, finds a little girl''s letter to Santa asking for a new mother, and she vows to win over the father and daughter before the holidays.', 'Crystal, a rich party girl, finds a little girl''s letter to Santa asking for a new mother, and she vows to win over the father and daughter before the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1UDzXg6R7K26aBjMpxk9WbQTrpm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145312'),
  ('474907880800863051', 'Dear Santa', 2024, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Bobby Farrelly, C. Kim Miles', 'Peter Farrelly, Ricky Blitt', 'Jack Black, Robert Timothy Smith, Keegan-Michael Key, Brianne Howey, Hayes MacArthur, P.J. Byrne, Jaden Carson Baker, Kai Cech', 'PG-13', 'Likeable 6th grader Liam writes to Santa asking him to prove that he''s real. But Liam is dyslexic and accidentally sends his letter to Satan instead, who shows up at Liam''s house, excited to have his first fanboy letter and wanting a little of Liam''s soul.', 'Likeable 6th grader Liam writes to Santa asking him to prove that he''s real. But Liam is dyslexic and accidentally sends his letter to Satan instead, who shows up at Liam''s house, excited to have his first fanboy letter and wanting a little of Liam''s soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fRbDHbGBXg6kwQYr3CRYeKPJW5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1097870'),
  ('390319627598145720', 'Dear Tenant', 2020, 'Drama', 'Cheng Yu-chieh, Meteor Cheung, Jill Hu', 'Cheng Yu-chieh', 'Mo Tzu-yi, Grace Chen, Bai Run-yin, Jack Yao, Jay Shih, Cherry Hsieh, Wu Pong-fong, Nelson Shen', null, 'A boy lives with his Grandma and Mr. Lin, the tenant who looks after him and Grandma. But when Grandma passes away, the boy''s uncle returns to Taiwan and discovers that ownership of the apartment was transferred to other people.', 'A boy lives with his Grandma and Mr. Lin, the tenant who looks after him and Grandma. But when Grandma passes away, the boy''s uncle returns to Taiwan and discovers that ownership of the apartment was transferred to other people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf1snn7PSimx4jTjvNF9HKJBhi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:721482'),
  ('999761027427024505', 'Dear Thomas', 2021, 'Drama', 'Andreas Kleinert, Johann Feindt', 'Thomas Wendrich', 'Albrecht Schuch, Jella Haase, Ioana Iacob, Jörg Schüttauf, Anja Schneider, Joel Basman, Emma Bading, Peter Kremer', null, 'Thomas Brasch was born as a German-Jewish emigrant in England in order to move to the young GDR with his family at the beginning of the 1950s. His father Horst is primarily interested in helping to build the new German state. But Thomas prefers to realize himself as a writer and in doing so discovers his potential as a poetic rebel. His very first play was banned and soon afterwards he lost his place at the film school. When the tanks of the Soviet Union roll through the Czech capital Prague in 1968, Brasch and his girlfriend Sanda and other students try to call for protest in the streets of Berlin - and fail. His own father betrays him to the Stasi and allows Thomas to go to prison. After being paroled, he continues to try his hand at poet writing about love, revolt and death. In the GDR, however, you don''t want to have anything to do with someone like him.', 'Thomas Brasch was born as a German-Jewish emigrant in England in order to move to the young GDR with his family at the beginning of the 1950s. His father Horst is primarily interested in helping to build the new German state. But Thomas prefers to realize himself as a writer and in doing so discovers his potential as a poetic rebel. His very first play was banned and soon afterwards he lost his place at the film school. When the tanks of the Soviet Union roll through the Czech capital Prague in 1968, Brasch and his girlfriend Sanda and other students try to call for protest in the streets of Berlin - and fail. His own father betrays him to the Stasi and allows Thomas to go to prison. After being paroled, he continues to try his hand at poet writing about love, revolt and death. In the GDR, however, you don''t want to have anything to do with someone like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SO5X6pnMlOyoaSPGL5WtiixQIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:835355'),
  ('76305010117337855', 'Dear Wendy', 2005, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Thomas Vinterberg, Anthony Dod Mantle', 'Lars von Trier', 'Jamie Bell, Bill Pullman, Michael Angarano, Danso Gordon, Novella Nelson, Chris Owen, Alison Pill, Mark Webber', 'NR', 'In a blue-collar American town, a group of teens bands together to form the Dandies, a gang of gunslingers led by Dick Dandelion. Following a code of strict pacifism at odds with the fact that they all carry guns, the group eventually lets in Sebastian, the grandson of Dick''s childhood nanny, Clarabelle, who fears the other gangs in the area. Dick and company try to protect Clarabelle, but events transpire that push the gang past posturing.', 'In a blue-collar American town, a group of teens bands together to form the Dandies, a gang of gunslingers led by Dick Dandelion. Following a code of strict pacifism at odds with the fact that they all carry guns, the group eventually lets in Sebastian, the grandson of Dick''s childhood nanny, Clarabelle, who fears the other gangs in the area. Dick and company try to protect Clarabelle, but events transpire that push the gang past posturing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IF19Tcx5D9d8iUWa0PxFhO6MYZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10913'),
  ('462301117480079543', 'Dear White People', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Justin Simien, Topher Osborn', 'Justin Simien', 'Tyler James Williams, Tessa Thompson, Kyle Gallner, Teyonah Parris, Brandon P Bell, Brittany Curran, Justin Dobies, Marque Richardson', 'R', 'A campus culture war between Blacks and whites at a predominantly white Ivy League college comes to a head when the staff of a satirical magazine stages an offensive Halloween party.', 'A campus culture war between Blacks and whites at a predominantly white Ivy League college comes to a head when the staff of a satirical magazine stages an offensive Halloween party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jH3851P2DjjnBsrjphbR1CWRzm6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114750'),
  ('331509465418075926', 'Dear Yelena Sergeyevna', 1988, 'Drama', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Leonid Vereshchagin, Vadim Alisov', 'Lyudmila Razumovskaya, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Marina Neyolova, Natalya Shchukina, Dmitriy Maryanov, Fyodor Dunayevsky, Eldar Ryazanov, Andrey Tikhomirnov', null, 'Four school graduates congratulate their teacher of mathematics Yelena Sergeyevna on her birthday and ask her to return them their graduate works on mathematics in order to change them before the marks. Yelena Sergeyevna strongly objects...', 'Four school graduates congratulate their teacher of mathematics Yelena Sergeyevna on her birthday and ask her to return them their graduate works on mathematics in order to change them before the marks. Yelena Sergeyevna strongly objects...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/on32q6VHz188yBBYY6hKQVRBDdJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73281'),
  ('547202201508364592', 'Dear Zachary: A Letter to a Son About His Father', 2008, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Kurt Kuenne, Kurt Kuenne', 'Kurt Kuenne', 'Kurt Kuenne, Andrew Bagby, David Bagby, Kathleen Bagby, Shirley Turner, Zachary Andrew Turner, Heather Arnold, Jon Atkinson', 'NR', 'In 2001, Andrew Bagby, a medical resident, is murdered not long after breaking up with his girlfriend. Soon after, when she announces she''s pregnant, one of Andrew''s many close friends, Kurt Kuenne, begins this film, a gift to the child.', 'In 2001, Andrew Bagby, a medical resident, is murdered not long after breaking up with his girlfriend. Soon after, when she announces she''s pregnant, one of Andrew''s many close friends, Kurt Kuenne, begins this film, a gift to the child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYVHGe7U55Ojx11y5A82phPpCHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15584'),
  ('877106708452210707', 'Dear Zindagi', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Nandini Shrikent, Laxman Utekar, Gauri Shinde', 'Gauri Shinde', 'Alia Bhatt, Shah Rukh Khan, Kunal Kapoor, Angad Bedi, Ali Zafar, Ira Dubey, Rohit Saraf, Yashaswini Dayama', 'PG-13', 'Kaira, a young girl, faces problems in her relationships. She meets Dr Jehangir, who helps her resolve her issues with her parents and get a new perspective on life, which leads to her following her passion and an improvement in her love life.', 'Kaira, a young girl, faces problems in her relationships. She meets Dr Jehangir, who helps her resolve her issues with her parents and get a new perspective on life, which leads to her following her passion and an improvement in her love life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oUg0N2isgZ5rrxdXnsemcKolfKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413543'),
