  ('360093814065101631', 'Death of a Tea Master', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Kei Kumai, Masao Tochizawa, Kazuo Hara', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Eiji Okuda, Toshirō Mifune, Gō Katō, Kinnosuke Nakamura, Shinsuke Ashida, Eijirō Tōno, Taketoshi Naitō, Tsunehiko Kamijô', null, 'Years after the death of legendary tea master Rikyu, his disciple Honkakubo attempts to resolve the mystery of the master''s death.', 'Years after the death of legendary tea master Rikyu, his disciple Honkakubo attempts to resolve the mystery of the master''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJ39fcyht9i4xxORZ5zJUMHWAFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12468'),
