  ('530023907745804488', 'Death of a Unicorn', 2025, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Larry Fong, Alex Scharfman, Joshua Brownwood', 'Alex Scharfman', 'Paul Rudd, Jenna Ortega, Will Poulter, Richard E. Grant, Téa Leoni, Sunita Mani, Steve Park, Anthony Carrigan', 'R', 'A father and daughter accidentally hit and kill a unicorn while en route to a weekend retreat, where his billionaire boss seeks to exploit the creature’s miraculous curative properties.', 'A father and daughter accidentally hit and kill a unicorn while en route to a weekend retreat, where his billionaire boss seeks to exploit the creature’s miraculous curative properties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWlF2i51zUq7BUq4iJte1g9NyIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1153714'),
  ('1139127602565775824', 'Death of an Actor', 2024, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ambroise Rateau, Léo Schrepel', 'Ambroise Rateau', 'Philippe Rebbot, Marc Riso, Afrika Baso Gohier, Finnegan Oldfield, Anne Charrier, Alexandre Steiger, Guillaume Meurice, François Cluzet', null, 'When a man learns that fake news regarding his own death is spreading like wildfire on social media, he''ll be forced to deal with the unintended consequences of this rumor.', 'When a man learns that fake news regarding his own death is spreading like wildfire on social media, he''ll be forced to deal with the unintended consequences of this rumor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NaM3suIfEIZNu2Q4g973kQUrED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1367419'),
  ('978067204911714945', 'Death of Marat', 1897, 'Crime, Drama, History', 'Alexandre Promio, Georges Hatot', null, null, null, 'This early film made by Georges Hatot for the Lumière Company is a brief single shot-scene of the assassination of the French revolutionary writer, Jean-Paul Marat--who has the notorious distinction of having influenced the Reign of Terror.', 'This early film made by Georges Hatot for the Lumière Company is a brief single shot-scene of the assassination of the French revolutionary writer, Jean-Paul Marat--who has the notorious distinction of having influenced the Reign of Terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGZ5KLAdBfSQULxou3m5xdp1vnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195144'),
  ('178647836018572212', 'Death of Me', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, José David Montero, Montakan Ketmala', 'James Morley III, Ariel Margolis, David Tish', 'Maggie Q, Luke Hemsworth, Alex Essoe, Kat Ingkarat, Kelly B. Jones, Caledonia Burr, Chatchawan Kamonsakpitak, Sahapoom Totrungsup', 'R', 'A couple on holiday on a remote South Pacific island awaken one morning with a hang over and no recollection of what transpired. When playing back a video of the previous night, they see they participated in a local ritual that somehow ends with him murdering her.', 'A couple on holiday on a remote South Pacific island awaken one morning with a hang over and no recollection of what transpired. When playing back a video of the previous night, they see they participated in a local ritual that somehow ends with him murdering her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8F9xUvb1JMWUMkFV2Yq3aiueAbq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:595149'),
  ('561871657335037197', 'Death of Yazdgerd', 1982, 'History, Drama', 'Bahram Beyzai, Mehrdad Fakhimi', 'Bahram Beyzai', 'Susan Taslimi, Mehdi Hashemi, Mahmoud Behrouzian, Amin Tarokh, Karim Akbari Mobarakeh, Yasaman Arami, Alireza Khamseh', null, 'Bahram Beyzai''s poetic imagining of the circumstances that led to the death of Yazdgerd III, the last of the Sassanid kings of Iran. His death in 651, during the Arab invasions that brought Islam to this Zoroastrian realm, was mysterious: his corpse was discovered in a mill, but the cause of his death—and the whereabouts of his remains—are unknown.', 'Bahram Beyzai''s poetic imagining of the circumstances that led to the death of Yazdgerd III, the last of the Sassanid kings of Iran. His death in 651, during the Arab invasions that brought Islam to this Zoroastrian realm, was mysterious: his corpse was discovered in a mill, but the cause of his death—and the whereabouts of his remains—are unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CX0iN3bq9Twg2a1kusTe82dEI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266225'),
  ('686451822573048593', 'Death on a Rainy Sunday', 1986, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Joël Santoni, Jean Boffety, Pavel Kořínek', 'Philippe Setbon, Joël Santoni', 'Nicole Garcia, Dominique Lavanant, Jean-Pierre Bacri, Jean-Pierre Bisson, Adrien Nicati, Etienne Chicot, Jean-Pierre Malo, Cerise Leclerc', null, 'Thriller about a psycho looking for revenge. Bronsky is a paraplegic because of an accident at a construction site that was partly due to the head architect, David Briand. Many years after the accident, Bronsky shows up at Briand''s residence with his family and his trailer looking for assistance. He and his wife insinuate themselves into the household without revealing their true identity. They start to work for Briand and his wife Elaine as a gardener and a babysitter with the sole objective of wreaking havoc on their lives and avenging Bronsky''s disabilities.', 'Thriller about a psycho looking for revenge. Bronsky is a paraplegic because of an accident at a construction site that was partly due to the head architect, David Briand. Many years after the accident, Bronsky shows up at Briand''s residence with his family and his trailer looking for assistance. He and his wife insinuate themselves into the household without revealing their true identity. They start to work for Briand and his wife Elaine as a gardener and a babysitter with the sole objective of wreaking havoc on their lives and avenging Bronsky''s disabilities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3rUXuvHhOn119njblvhFzQN29EQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63977'),
  ('430422927695372165', 'Death on the Fourposter', 1964, 'Horror', 'Jean Josipovici, Ambrogio Molteni, Raffaele Masciocchi', 'Jean Josipovici, Giorgio Stegani', 'John Drew Barrymore, Gloria Milland, Luisa Rivelli, Antonella Lualdi, Michel Lemoine, Mario Valdemarin, Joe Atlanta, Massimo Carocci', null, 'A group of friends decide to spend a weekend in a castle belonging to Riccardo, a moody and hyper-sensitive young artist. The only other inhabitants of the castle are a mysterious housekeeper, Caterina, and the demented Aldo. The group are joined by two friends: Serena and a young American medium, Anthony. During a seance Anthony predicts a tragedy, then leaves the castle, shocked by his own visions. An hour later, Serena is found strangled to death in bed. The others become gradually more and more diffident and suspicious, especially when another girl is murdered...', 'A group of friends decide to spend a weekend in a castle belonging to Riccardo, a moody and hyper-sensitive young artist. The only other inhabitants of the castle are a mysterious housekeeper, Caterina, and the demented Aldo. The group are joined by two friends: Serena and a young American medium, Anthony. During a seance Anthony predicts a tragedy, then leaves the castle, shocked by his own visions. An hour later, Serena is found strangled to death in bed. The others become gradually more and more diffident and suspicious, especially when another girl is murdered...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0ynXqNcFG4nSHAnunlBQ6WbhjC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104909'),
  ('1089388238558043580', 'Death on the Nile', 1978, 'Mystery', 'John Guillermin, Jack Cardiff, Chris Carreras', 'Anthony Shaffer', 'Peter Ustinov, Jane Birkin, Lois Chiles, Bette Davis, Mia Farrow, Jon Finch, Olivia Hussey, I.S. Johar', 'PG', 'As Hercule Poirot enjoys a luxurious cruise down the Nile, a newlywed heiress is found murdered on board and every elegant passenger becomes a prime suspect.', 'As Hercule Poirot enjoys a luxurious cruise down the Nile, a newlywed heiress is found murdered on board and every elegant passenger becomes a prime suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qEymSp6wCT19AJxb7T3u6aKpi1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4192'),
  ('358496514633119609', 'Death on the Nile', 2022, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Dominic Masters, Alice Biddle, Richard Hardy', 'Michael Green', 'Kenneth Branagh, Tom Bateman, Annette Bening, Russell Brand, Ali Fazal, Dawn French, Gal Gadot, Armie Hammer', 'PG-13', 'Belgian sleuth Hercule Poirot''s Egyptian vacation aboard a glamorous river steamer turns into a terrifying search for a murderer when a picture-perfect couple''s idyllic honeymoon is tragically cut short.', 'Belgian sleuth Hercule Poirot''s Egyptian vacation aboard a glamorous river steamer turns into a terrifying search for a murderer when a picture-perfect couple''s idyllic honeymoon is tragically cut short.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVr5zIAFSPRQ57Y1zE7KzmhzdMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505026'),
  ('319121631505808239', 'Death Powder', 1986, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Shigeru Izumiya, Kazuo Komizu', 'Shigeru Izumiya', 'Shigeru Izumiya, Rikako Murakami, Mari Natsuki, Kiyoshiro Imawano, Tamio Kageyama, Koichi Sato, Tomoko Ohtsu, Yuki Toyonaga', null, 'Three conspirators steal a secret android. In their warehouse hideout, the android secretes a reality-altering substance, which casts them into a frightening nether-world of interconnected subjectivity.', 'Three conspirators steal a secret android. In their warehouse hideout, the android secretes a reality-altering substance, which casts them into a frightening nether-world of interconnected subjectivity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1ECakVcfhXpqoDaYkPWtZj4t6e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91227'),
  ('384436424873900793', 'Death Promise', 1977, 'Action, Crime', 'Robert Warmflash, Aaron Kleinman, Bill Louie', 'Norbert Albertson Jr.', 'Charles Bonet, Speedy Leacock, Bill Louie, Thompson Kao Kang, Vincent Van Lynn, Thom Kendell, Abe Hendy, Bob O''Connell', 'R', 'An apartment dweller goes on a search-and-destroy mission to kill the ruthless landlords who murdered his father.', 'An apartment dweller goes on a search-and-destroy mission to kill the ruthless landlords who murdered his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aNR9HPcXlC7St3Z8iQl8BVMrDDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85780'),
  ('255675013232286701', 'Death Proof', 2007, 'Action, Thriller', 'Quentin Tarantino, David Rimer, Susan Jasso', 'Quentin Tarantino', 'Kurt Russell, Zoë Bell, Rosario Dawson, Vanessa Ferlito, Sydney Tamiia Poitier, Tracie Thoms, Rose McGowan, Jordan Ladd', 'R', 'Austin''s hottest DJ, Jungle Julia, sets out into the night to unwind with her two friends Shanna and Arlene. Covertly tracking their moves is Stuntman Mike, a scarred rebel leering from behind the wheel of his muscle car, revving just feet away.', 'Austin''s hottest DJ, Jungle Julia, sets out into the night to unwind with her two friends Shanna and Arlene. Covertly tracking their moves is Stuntman Mike, a scarred rebel leering from behind the wheel of his muscle car, revving just feet away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vtu6H4NWnQVqEp3aanUq3hNeeot.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1991'),
  ('649585342717276434', 'Death Race', 2008, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Paul W. S. Anderson, Scott Kevan, Steve Koster', 'Robert Thom, Charles B. Griffith, Ib Melchior', 'Jason Statham, Joan Allen, Ian McShane, Tyrese Gibson, Natalie Martinez, Max Ryan, Jason Clarke, Frederick Koehler', 'R', 'Terminal Island, New York: 2020. Overcrowding in the US penal system has reached a breaking point. Prisons have been turned over to a monolithic Weyland Corporation, which sees jails full of thugs as an opportunity for televised sport. Adrenalized inmates, a global audience hungry for violence and a spectacular, enclosed arena come together to form the ''Death Race'', the biggest, most brutal event.', 'Terminal Island, New York: 2020. Overcrowding in the US penal system has reached a breaking point. Prisons have been turned over to a monolithic Weyland Corporation, which sees jails full of thugs as an opportunity for televised sport. Adrenalized inmates, a global audience hungry for violence and a spectacular, enclosed arena come together to form the ''Death Race'', the biggest, most brutal event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5A79GeOb3uChQ0l0ZDjDyODKQp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10483'),
  ('929150184714282343', 'Death Race 2', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Roel Reiné, John McKay, Gabriel Williams', 'Tony Giglio', 'Luke Goss, Lauren Cohan, Sean Bean, Danny Trejo, Ving Rhames, Tanit Phoenix, Robin Shou, Joe Vaz', 'R', 'In the world''s most dangerous prison, a new game is born: Death Race. The rules of this adrenaline-fueled blood sport are simple, drive or die. When repentant convict Carl Lucas discovers there''s a price on his head, his only hope is to survive a twisted race against an army of hardened criminals and tricked-out cars.', 'In the world''s most dangerous prison, a new game is born: Death Race. The rules of this adrenaline-fueled blood sport are simple, drive or die. When repentant convict Carl Lucas discovers there''s a price on his head, his only hope is to survive a twisted race against an army of hardened criminals and tricked-out cars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80mBFNVvak2bA9TJN1MD0yM7Lfi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51620'),
  ('870119772886923174', 'Death Race 2000', 1975, 'Action, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Paul Bartel, Tak Fujimoto, Charles B. Griffith', 'Charles B. Griffith, Robert Thom', 'David Carradine, Simone Griffeth, Sylvester Stallone, Mary Woronov, Roberta Collins, Martin Kove, Louisa Moritz, Don Steele', 'R', 'In a boorish future, the government sponsors a popular, but bloody, cross-country race in which points are scored by mowing down pedestrians. Five teams, each comprised of a male and female, compete using cars equipped with deadly weapons. Frankenstein, the mysterious returning champion, has become America''s hero, but this time he has a passenger from the underground resistance.', 'In a boorish future, the government sponsors a popular, but bloody, cross-country race in which points are scored by mowing down pedestrians. Five teams, each comprised of a male and female, compete using cars equipped with deadly weapons. Frankenstein, the mysterious returning champion, has become America''s hero, but this time he has a passenger from the underground resistance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kwM8kkNGtv62gfPWVhD6qFxjDzg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13282'),
  ('350593974146491937', 'Death Race 2050', 2017, 'Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Juan Durán, Peter Lara Patiño, G.J. Echternkamp', 'G.J. Echternkamp, Matt Yamashita', 'Manu Bennett, Malcolm McDowell, Marci Miller, Burt Grinstead, Folake Olowofoyeku, Anessa Ramsey, Yancy Butler, Charlie Farrell', 'R', 'The year 2050 the planet has become overpopulated, to help control population the government develops a race. The Death Race. Annually competitors race across the country scoring points for killing people with their vehicles.', 'The year 2050 the planet has become overpopulated, to help control population the government develops a race. The Death Race. Annually competitors race across the country scoring points for killing people with their vehicles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5mI8yqZZBlZpvd0aT5YXbR8oEvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401544'),
  ('1099723986261754417', 'Death Race: Beyond Anarchy', 2018, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Asya Chakarova, Stanimir Stamatov, Ivan Kotsev', 'Tony Giglio, Don Michael Paul', 'Danny Trejo, Zach McGowan, Danny Glover, Frederick Koehler, Christine Marzano, Yennis Cheung, Nicholas Aaron, Lorina Kamburova', 'R', 'Black Ops specialist Connor Gibson infiltrates a maximum security prison to take down legendary driver Frankenstein in a violent and brutal car race.', 'Black Ops specialist Connor Gibson infiltrates a maximum security prison to take down legendary driver Frankenstein in a violent and brutal car race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PrlKvPUbDQAqFQBCyyt68hLLl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:401478'),
  ('95974004953190037', 'Death Race: Inferno', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Wayne Shields, Roel Reiné, Lynne-Anne Vosloo', 'Tony Giglio', 'Luke Goss, Ving Rhames, Danny Trejo, Tanit Phoenix, Dougray Scott, Robin Shou, Langley Kirkwood, Frederick Koehler', 'R', 'Carl Lucas / Frankenstein has won four of his races and needs to win one more to win his freedom. Before his final race, Lucas and his team, car and all, are transferred to another prison where they will compete in a Death Race in the desert. Also, at the same time, Ceaser runs into a marketer who wants to franchise the Death Race program.', 'Carl Lucas / Frankenstein has won four of his races and needs to win one more to win his freedom. Before his final race, Lucas and his team, car and all, are transferred to another prison where they will compete in a Death Race in the desert. Also, at the same time, Ceaser runs into a marketer who wants to franchise the Death Race program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aRV4oC61nmBqypSaXtMXOk99dOM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:156717'),
